{"@context":{"skos":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#","dc":"http://purl.org/dc/terms/","rdfs":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#","xsd":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"},"@graph":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000001","dc:identifier":"homoit0000001","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"5-alpha reductase deficiency"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deficiencia de 5-alfa reductasa"},{"@language":"de","@value":"5α-Reduktase-2-Mangel"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"5-alpha-reductase deficiëntie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"5-α-reduktasbrist"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"5-ARD"},{"@language":"es","@value":"5-ARD"},{"@language":"de","@value":"5-Alpha-Reduktase-Mangel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"5ARD"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"5-alfa-reduktasbrist"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with 5-alpha reductase deficiency, abbreviated as 5-ARD, have XY chromosomes, testes, and typical levels of testosterone, but their bodies do not have the enzyme responsible for converting testosterone to the more powerful androgen dihydrotestosterone (DHT). This affects how an individual's external sex characteristics develop, and people born with 5-ARD often have genital differences that are noticed at birth. In adolescence, people with 5-ARD typically develop some features associated with testosterone puberty, and they may experience genital growth at this point."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con deficiencia de 5-alfa reductasa, abreviada como 5-ARD, tienen cromosomas XY, testículos y niveles típicos de testosterona, pero sus cuerpos no tienen la enzima responsable de convertir la testosterona en el andrógeno más potente dihidrotestosterona (DHT). Esto afecta el desarrollo de las características sexuales externas de la persona, y las personas que nacen con 5-ARD suelen presentar diferencias genitales que se notan al nacer. En la adolescencia, las personas con 5-ARD suelen desarrollar algunos rasgos asociados a la pubertad testosterona, y pueden experimentar crecimiento genital en dicho momento."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit 5-Alpha-Reduktase-Mangel, abgekürzt 5-ARD, haben XY-Chromosomen, Hoden und nach medizinischer Zuschreibung typische Testosteronwerte, aber ihr Körper produziert nicht das Enzym, das für die Umwandlung von Testosteron in das stärkere Androgen Dihydrotestosteron (DHT) verantwortlich ist. Dies wirkt sich auf die Entwicklung der äußeren Geschlechtsmerkmale einer Person aus. Menschen, die mit 5-ARD geboren werden, werden oft schon bei der Geburt Unterschiede zu medizinischen Normvorstellungen von Genitalien zugeschrieben. In der Adoleszenz entwickeln Menschen mit 5-ARD typischerweise einige Merkmale, die mit einer Testosteronpubertät in Verbindung gebracht werden, und es kann sein, dass sie zu diesem Zeitpunkt ein Genitalwachstum erleben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een tekort aan het hormoon dihydrotestosteron (DHT) dat de seksuele ontwikkeling van de man vóór de geboorte beïnvloedt en de vorming van uitwendige geslachtsorganen verstoort. Sommige secundaire geslachtskenmerken kunnen tijdens de puberteit ontstaan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Människor med 5-alfa-reduktasbrist, har XY-kromosomer, testiklar och typiska testosteronnivåer, men deras kroppar saknar enzymet som ansvarar för att omvandla testosteron till den kraftigare androgenen dihydrotestosteron (DHT). Detta påverkar hur individens yttre könskarakteristika utvecklas, och personer födda med 5-alfa-reduktasbrist har ofta könsdifferentieringar som märks vid födseln. Under tonåren utvecklar personer med 5-alfa-reduktasbrist typiskt sett vissa kännetecken förknippade med testosteronpubertet och kan uppleva tillväxt av könsorganen vid denna tidpunkt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/5AlphaReductaseDeficiency"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669","dc:identifier":"homoit0000669","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex variations"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Variationen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Variaciones intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse variaties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexvariationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex conditions"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Intergeschlechtliche Variationen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Condiciones intersexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Condiciones intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Variaciones intersex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to refer to a wide range of variations in sex characteristics. The term \"intersex conditions\" is a pathologizing term used to mean people born with variations in their physical sex characteristics also known as intersex traits."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Begriff, den verwendet wird, um ein breites Spektrum von Variationen der Geschlechtsmerkmale zu beschreiben."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para referirse a una amplia gama de variaciones en las características sexuales. El término \"condiciones intersexuales\" es un término patologizante que se utiliza para referirse a personas que nacen con variaciones en sus características sexuales físicas, también conocidas como rasgos intersex."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar een breed scala aan variaties in geslachtskenmerken. De term \"intersekse-condities\" is een pathologiserende term die wordt gebruikt om mensen aan te duiden die geboren zijn met variaties in hun fysieke geslachtskenmerken, ook wel bekend als intersekse-kenmerken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Paraplyterm som används för att beskriva ett brett spektrum av variationer i könskarakteristika. Termen ”intersextillstånd” är patologiserande och avser personer födda med variationer i sina fysiska könskarakteristika, även kallat intersexdrag."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000001"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000044"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000064"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000283"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000301"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000599"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000657"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000692"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001014"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001020"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001066"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001079"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001134"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001354"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001478"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002818"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002819"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002821"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002822"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002823"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002824"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002826"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002828"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002829"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002831"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002832"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002833"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002836"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002837"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002838"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002839"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002842"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002843"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002861"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002862"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002863"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002864"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002865"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002870"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002871"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002872"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002873"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002875"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002883"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002885"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001268"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001646"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85060401"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intersexConditions"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269","dc:identifier":"homoit0001269","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex (Body)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo (cuerpo)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geslacht (Lichaam)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kön (kropp)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The category assigned to an individual to describe their body and its role in sexual reproduction, usually based on external anatomy, but also including chromosomes, gene expression, hormones, and internal and external reproductive/sexual organs. Although sex is often described as binary, it exists as a spectrum with significant variation in the biological attributes that comprise sex and the way it is defined in different cultural contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La categoría asignada a una persona para describir su cuerpo y su papel en la reproducción sexual, generalmente basada en la anatomía externa, pero que también incluye cromosomas, expresión genética, hormonas y órganos reproductivos/sexuales internos y externos. Aunque el sexo a menudo se describe como binario, existe como un espectro con variaciones significativas en los atributos biológicos que lo componen y la forma en que se define en diferentes contextos culturales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De categorie die aan een persoon wordt toegekend om hun lichaam en de rol ervan in de seksuele voortplanting te beschrijven, meestal gebaseerd op de uitwendige anatomie, maar ook inclusief chromosomen, genexpressie, hormonen en inwendige en uitwendige voortplantings-/geslachtsorganen. Hoewel geslacht vaak als binair wordt beschreven, bestaat het als een spectrum met aanzienlijke variatie in de biologische kenmerken die geslacht omvatten en de manier waarop het in verschillende culturele contexten wordt gedefinieerd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den kategori som tilldelas en individ för att beskriva kroppens roll i reproduktion, vanligen baserat på yttre anatomi men även kromosomer, genuttryck, hormoner och inre samt yttre reproduktiva/sexuella organ. Även om kön ofta beskrivs som binärt existerar det på ett spektrum med stor biologisk variation och kulturellt varierande definitioner."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000266"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000585"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000600"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000651"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001259"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001648"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001896"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85120560"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexBody"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002","dc:identifier":"homoit0000002","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aboriginal Australian LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ aborígenes australianas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Australisch-aboriginale LSBTQ+ Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aboriginal Australische LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aboriginer (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aboriginal people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Aboriginal Australian people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginal Australian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginal Australians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginal people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas aborígenes australianas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas aborígenes (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aborígenes australianos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aborígenes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas aborígenes australianas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aboriginal Personen (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aboriginal Australiische Personen (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginal Australische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginal Australier:innen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginal Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+ Aboriginals"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+ Aboriginal Australiërs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Aboriginals"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who belong to one or more of the various Indigenous peoples of Australia; do not use to refer to the Indigenous people of the Torres Strait Islands, who are considered ethnically and culturally distinct. Only use to describe people who identify as Aboriginal Australian."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que pertenecen a uno o más de los diversos pueblos indígenas de Australia; no para referirse a los pueblos indígenas de las Islas del Estrecho de Torres, que se consideran étnica y culturalmente distintos. Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas que se autoidentifiquen como aborígenes australianos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"LSBTQ+ Personen, die einem oder mehreren der verschiedenen indigenen Völker Australiens angehören; nicht für die indigene Bevölkerung der Torres-Strait-Inseln verwenden, die als ethnisch und kulturell verschieden betrachtet wird. Nur zur Beschreibung von Personen verwenden, die sich als australische Ureinwohner identifizieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die behoren tot een of meer van de verschillende inheemse volkeren van Australië; niet gebruiken om te verwijzen naar de inheemse bevolking van de Torres Strait-eilanden, die als etnisch en cultureel verschillend worden beschouwd. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als Aboriginal Australisch"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som tillhör ett eller flera av de olika ursprungsfolken i Australien. Använd inte begreppet för att hänvisa till ursprungsbefolkningen på Torressundöarna, eftersom de utgör en egen etnisk och kulturell grupp. Det bör endast användas för att beskriva personer som identifierar sig som aboriginer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001974"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001975"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001976"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001977"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001978"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001979"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002892"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003393"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001314"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001809"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001810"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQAboriginalPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886","dc:identifier":"homoit0000886","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ursprungsbefolkningar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+ inheemse personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de esas personas. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die deel uitmaken van een inheemse bevolking, of een cultureel verschillende etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio en tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die mensen behouden. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001101"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000860"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000676"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000898"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000913"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001037"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001809"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001955"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001968"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001969"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001970"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001971"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001972"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001973"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002922"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003232"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003280"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003293"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003333"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001812"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004144"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004153"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004162"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001240"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002377"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQIndigenousPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001974","dc:identifier":"homoit0001974","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aboriginal Australian lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas aborígenes australianas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Australisch-aboriginale Lesben"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aboriginal Australische lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska aboriginer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aboriginal lesbians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian aboriginal Australians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas aborígenes australianas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aborígenes australianas lesbianas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aboriginal Lesben"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbische Aboriginal Australier:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische Aboriginals"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who belong to one or more of the various Indigenous peoples of Australia; do not use to refer to the Indigenous people of the Torres Strait Islands, who are considered ethnically and culturally distinct. Only use to describe people who identify as Aboriginal Australian."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que pertenecen a uno o más de los diversos pueblos indígenas de Australia; no para referirse a los pueblos indígenas de las Islas del Estrecho de Torres, que se consideran étnica y culturalmente distintos. Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas que se autoidentifiquen como aborígenes australianos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesben, die einem oder mehreren der verschiedenen indigenen Völker Australiens angehören; nicht für die indigene Bevölkerung der Torres-Strait-Inseln verwenden, die als ethnisch und kulturell verschieden betrachtet wird. Nur zur Beschreibung von Personen verwenden, die sich als australische Ureinwohner identifizieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die behoren tot een of meer van de verschillende inheemse volkeren van Australië; niet gebruiken om te verwijzen naar de inheemse bevolking van de Torres Strait-eilanden, die als etnisch en cultureel verschillend worden beschouwd. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als Aboriginal Australisch"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som tillhör ett eller flera av de olika ursprungsfolken i Australien. Använd inte begreppet för att hänvisa till ursprungsbefolkningen på Torressundöarna, eftersom de utgör en egen etnisk och kulturell grupp. Det bör endast användas för att beskriva personer som identifierar sig som aboriginer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001975","dc:identifier":"homoit0001975","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aboriginal Australian gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay aborígenes australianos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Australisch-aborigi