ohner identifizieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die tot een of meer van de verschillende inheemse volkeren van Australië behoren; niet gebruiken om te verwijzen naar de inheemse bevolking van de Torres Strait-eilanden, die als etnisch en cultureel verschillend worden beschouwd. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als Aboriginal Australiër."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som tillhör ett eller flera av de olika ursprungsfolken i Australien. Använd inte begreppet för att hänvisa till ursprungsbefolkningen på Torressundöarna, eftersom de utgör en egen etnisk och kulturell grupp. Det bör endast användas för att beskriva personer som identifierar sig som aboriginer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003393","dc:identifier":"homoit0003393","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aboriginal Australian non-binary people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Australisch-aboriginale nichtbinäre Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias aborígenes australianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aboriginal Australische non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära aboriginer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Aboriginal Australian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Aboriginal Australians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Aboriginal Australian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Aboriginal Australians"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nicht-binäre Aboriginal Australische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nicht-binäre Aboriginal Australier*innen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nichtbinäre Aboriginal Australische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nichtbinäre Aboriginal Australier:innen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Non-binäre Aboriginal Australische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nonbinäre Aboriginal Australier*innen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No binarixs aborígenes australianxs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Australianxs aborígenes no binarixs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas aborígenes australianas no binarias"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire Aboriginal Australiërs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Aboriginal Australiërs"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who belong to one or more of the various Indigenous peoples of Australia; do not use to refer to the Indigenous people of the Torres Strait Islands, who are considered ethnically and culturally distinct. Only use to describe people who identify as Aboriginal Australian."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nicht-binäre Personen, die einem oder mehreren der verschiedenen indigenen Völker Australiens angehören; nicht für die indigene Bevölkerung der Torres-Strait-Inseln verwenden, die als ethnisch und kulturell verschieden betrachtet wird. Nur zur Beschreibung von Personen verwenden, die sich als australische Ureinwohner identifizieren."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias que pertenecen a uno o más de los diversos pueblos indígenas de Australia; no para referirse a los pueblos indígenas de las Islas del Estrecho de Torres, que se consideran étnica y culturalmente distintos. Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas que se autoidentifican como aborígenes australianas."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som tillhör ett eller flera av de olika ursprungsfolken i Australien. Använd inte begreppet för att hänvisa till ursprungsbefolkningen på Torressundöarna, eftersom de utgör en egen etnisk och kulturell grupp. Det bör endast användas för att beskriva personer som identifierar sig som aboriginer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001314","dc:identifier":"homoit0001314","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sistergirls"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sistergirls"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sistergirls"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sistergirls"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sistagirls"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sistagirls"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous Australian term for people who transition from male to female."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término indígena australiano para las personas que hacen la transición de hombre a mujer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"aboriginal engels woord dat grofweg overeenkomt met man-naar-vrouw-transgender, maar toch niet helemaal hetzelfde is; sistergirls identificeren zich ofleven vaak als vrouw; sommigen kleden zich niet vrouw, maar velen wel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Australiensisk urfolksterm för personer som genomgår en könsbekräftande transition från man till kvinna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000224"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sistergirls"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001809","dc:identifier":"homoit0001809","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigiqueer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indigequeer"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes indigiqueers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Indigiqueer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Indigiqueer-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Indigiqueer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous queer people who recognize their queer identity as salient to their Indigenous identity and vice versa; some but not all Indigiqueer people also identify as Two-Spirit; only use to describe individuals who self-identify as Indigiqueer."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas queer que reconocen su identidad queer como parte importante de su identidad indígena y viceversa; algunas, pero no todas, las personas indigequeer también se identifican como dos espíritus; utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indigequeer."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes autochtones queers qui reconnaissent que leur identité queer est liée à leur identité autochtone et vice versa; certaines personnes, mais pas toutes, s'identifient également comme bispirituelles; à n'utiliser que pour désigner les personnes qui s'identifient comme Indigiqueers."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse queer personen die hun queer identiteit erkennen als saillant voor hun inheemse identiteit en vice versa; sommige, maar niet alle Indigiqueer-personen identificeren zich ook als Two-Spirit; alleen gebruiken om individuen te beschrijven die zichzelf identificeren als Indigiqueer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som tillhör ett urfolk och som uppfattar sin queera identitet som central för sin urfolksidentitet och vice versa. Vissa, men inte alla, Indigiqueer-personer identifierar sig även som Two-spirit. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som indigiqueer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001195"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000676"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000913"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001037"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001810"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-01-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001810","dc:identifier":"homoit0001810","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigiqueer"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Indigequeer"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité indigiqueer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Indigiqueer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Indigiqueer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the identity of people who are both Indigenous and queer and view those identities as inherently related and interconnected."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la identidad de personas que son tanto indígenas como queer y ven esas identidades como inherentemente relacionadas e interconectadas."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité des personnes qui sont à la fois autochtones et queers et qui considèrent que ces identités sont intrinsèquement liées et interconnectées."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om de identiteit te beschrijven van personen die zowel inheems als queer zijn en die die identiteiten beschouwen als inherent verwant en onderling verbonden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva identiteten hos personer som är både urfolk och queera, och som ser dessa identiteter som djupt sammanlänkade och ömsesidigt beroende."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000002"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000676"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000898"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000913"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001037"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001809"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-01-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915","dc:identifier":"homoit0000915","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"People (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Self-identified lesbians, gay men, bisexual people, transgender people, queer people, and other sexual and gender minorities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se identifican como lesbianas, gay, bisexuales, transgénero, queer y/o otras minorías sexuales y de género."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Lesbiennes, gais, bisexuel·les, trans, queers et autres personnes de la diversité sexuelle et de genre qui s'identifient comme LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen, homomannen, biseksuele personen, transgender personen, queer personen en andere seksuele en genderminderheden, die zichzelf als zodanig identificeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som identifierar sig som lesbiska, bögar, bisexuella, transpersoner, queera samt andra sexuella och könsminoriteter."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000007"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000008"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000070"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000082"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000108"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000170"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000312"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000330"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000379"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000860"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000862"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000879"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000887"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000895"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000902"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000908"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000927"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000961"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001009"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001073"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001195"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001329"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001352"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001482"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001510"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001549"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001550"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001771"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001783"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001815"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001853"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001854"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001879"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001919"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001929"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001989"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002181"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002226"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002227"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002228"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002277"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002278"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002279"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002336"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002349"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002356"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002358"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002360"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002585"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003247"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003263"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003370"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003533"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001101"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003637"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003677"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003696"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003697"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003739"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003740"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003741"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001277"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001723"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003895"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003946"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003965"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003991"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003864"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004360"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004361"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004390"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004391"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004401"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004414"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004429"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004431"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004455"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004487"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2004003385"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000003","dc:identifier":"homoit0000003","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Acault"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Acault"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acault"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Acault"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Acault"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A commonly mistranslated Burmese term for people assigned male at birth who exhibit feminine behaviors while serving as spiritual mediums; there is some question over the legitimacy of term."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein häufig falsch übersetzter burmesischer Begriff für Menschen, die bei der Geburt als männlich eingestuft werden und weibliche Verhaltensweisen zeigen, während sie als spirituelle Medien dienen; die Legitimität des Begriffs ist fraglich."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término birmano, comúnmente mal traducido, para personas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer que exhiben comportamientos femeninos mientras sirven como médiums espirituales; existen dudas sobre la legitimidad del término."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In de Burmese cultuur, mensen die bij de geboorte als man zijn toegewezen en vrouwelijk gedrag vertonen terwijl ze dienen als spirituele mediums; er is enige twijfel over de legitimiteit van de term"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En ofta felöversatt burmesisk term för personer som tilldelats manligt kön vid födseln och som uppvisar feminina beteenden medan de tjänar som andliga medier. Det finns viss tveksamhet om termen är legitim."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/acault"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322","dc:identifier":"homoit0000322","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-Euro-American gender and sexual identities"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidades de género y sexuales no euro-americanas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Niet-Euro-Amerikaanse gender en seksuele identiteiten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke-euroamerikanska köns- och sexualitetsidentiteter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Culturally-specific gender identities"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidades de género culturalmente específicas ||"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsidentiteter och sexuella identiteter som inte existerar i Europa och USA som erkända kategorier"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Broad term describing gender and sexual identities specific to regions outside of North America and Europe."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término amplio que describe identidades sexuales y de género específicas a regiones fuera de Norteamérica y Europa."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Brede term die gender en seksuele identiteiten beschrijft die specifiek zijn voor regio's buiten Noord-Amerika en Europa."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bred term som beskriver könsidentiteter och sexuella identiteter som är specifika för regioner utanför Nordamerika och Europa."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000003"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000023"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000035"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000037"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000039"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000046"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000065"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000072"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000085"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000090"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000091"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000096"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000101"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000113"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000205"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000207"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000224"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000229"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000234"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000235"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000240"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000246"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000340"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000350"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000353"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000413"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000414"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000419"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000441"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000461"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000604"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000616"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000632"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000654"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000678"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000684"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000687"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000688"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000689"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000690"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000693"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000694"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000695"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000697"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000898"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000966"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000979"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000980"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000987"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000996"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001013"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001029"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001034"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001035"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001043"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001044"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001070"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001072"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001147"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001253"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001263"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001264"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001309"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001314"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001316"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001338"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001368"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001370"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001371"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001372"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001373"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001471"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001474"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001475"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001477"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001499"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001501"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001502"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001517"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001518"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001519"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001523"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001810"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001914"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002286"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002653"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003974"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000271"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001008"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/nonEuroAmericanGenderAndSexualIdentities"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560","dc:identifier":"homoit0000560","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Género"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kön"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A socially constructed system that gives meaning to masculinity and femininity and that unevenly distributes power and opportunity according to cultural interpretations of sex. As an element of personal identity, a gender is developed through the interaction of social roles and expectations, one’s response to those expectations, one’s physiology, and one’s internal sense of self. Gender is culturally specific, meaning that different cultures have different understandings of what gender means and how many genders should be recognized."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un sistema socialmente construido que da significado a la masculinidad y la feminidad y que distribuye de manera desigual el poder y las oportunidades según las interpretaciones culturales del sexo. Como elemento de identidad personal, el género se desarrolla a través de la interacción de roles y expectativas sociales, la respuesta de una persona a esas expectativas, la fisiología y el sentido interno de la propia persona. El género es culturalmente específico, lo que significa que diferentes culturas tienen diferentes interpretaciones de lo que significa el género y cuántos géneros deben reconocerse."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een sociaal geconstrueerd systeem dat betekenis geeft aan mannelijkheid en vrouwelijkheid en dat macht en kansen ongelijk verdeelt volgens culturele interpretaties van seks. Als een element van persoonlijke identiteit wordt het gender van een persoon ontwikkeld door de interactie van sociale rollen en verwachtingen, iemands reactie op die verwachtingen, iemands fysiologie en iemands interne zelfgevoel. Gender is cultureel specifiek, wat betekent dat verschillende culturen verschillende opvattingen hebben over wat gender betekent en hoeveel genders er erkend moeten worden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett socialt konstruerat system som ger mening åt maskulinitet och femininitet, och som fördelar makt och möjligheter ojämlikt utifrån kulturella tolkningar av kön. Som en del av den personliga identiteten utvecklas kön genom samspelet mellan sociala roller och förväntningar, individens respons på dessa förväntningar, kroppens fysiologi och den inre känslan av jaget. Kön är kulturellt specifikt, vilket innebär att olika kulturer har olika uppfattningar om vad kön innebär och hur många kön som bör erkännas."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000078"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003824"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000288"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000563"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000565"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000566"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000575"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000578"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000579"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000580"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001090"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001463"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001816"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001899"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gender"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004","dc:identifier":"homoit0000004","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Asexualidad"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexualität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Asexualité"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexualitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ace"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ace"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A sexual orientation generally characterized by a lack of sexual attraction or desire."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Orientación sexual caracterizada generalmente por la falta de atracción o deseo sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine sexuelle Orientierung, die im Allgemein durch einen Mangel an sexueller Anziehung oder sexuellem Verlangen gekennzeichnet ist."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Orientation sexuelle généralement caractérisée par une absence d'attirance ou de désir sexuel."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een seksuele oriëntatie die in het algemeen wordt gekenmerkt door een gebrek aan seksuele aantrekking of verlangen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En sexuell läggning som i allmänhet kännetecknas av avsaknad av sexuell attraktion eller åtrå."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000071"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000807"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000882"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001282"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001493"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001535"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001644"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2016000238"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/asexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298","dc:identifier":"homoit0001298","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual orientation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Orientación sexual"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Orientation sexuelle"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele oriëntatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell läggning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The direction of an individual's sexual attraction towards other individuals of the same, opposite, or multiple sexes; commonly understood to be biologically and physiologically dictated, rather than sociologically determined."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La dirección de la atracción sexual de una persona hacia otras personas del mismo sexo, del sexo opuesto o de múltiples sexos; comúnmente se entiende que está dictaminada por la biología y la fisiología, en lugar de estar determinada sociológicamente."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Désigne l'attirance ou l'absence d'attirance physique et sexuelle que ressent une personne envers d'autres personnes dépendamment ou indépendamment de leur identité de genre."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De richting van iemands seksuele aantrekking tot hetzelfde, tegenovergestelde of meerdere geslachten, algemeen beschouwd als biologisch en fysiologisch gedicteerd, in plaats van sociologisch"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Riktningen för en individs sexuella attraktion mot andra individer av samma, motsatt eller flera olika kön. Brukar förstås som biologiskt och fysiologiskt betingad snarare än sociologiskt formad."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000204"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000343"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000631"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000647"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000799"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001292"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001531"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001558"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001626"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001632"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001926"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000303"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000345"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000559"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001290"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001828"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001915"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh91005179"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualOrientation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067","dc:identifier":"homoit0000067","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas arrománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes aromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantiska"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who do not generally experience romantic attraction or desire."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que generalmente no experimentan atracción o deseo romántico."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die im Allgemeinen keine romantische Anziehung oder Begierde verspüren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui n'éprouvent généralement pas d'attirance ou de désir romantique."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Individer som i allmänhet inte upplever romantisk attraktion eller längtan efter romantiska relationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001829"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001532"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001644"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001757"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001761"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001765"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001824"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001825"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001826"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001827"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002145"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001829"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/aromanticPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000071","dc:identifier":"homoit0000071","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes asexuelles"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aces"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aces"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aces"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ace"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who generally do not experience sexual attraction or desire; do not use to describe individuals practicing celibacy or abstinence for religious or cultural reasons."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que generalmente no experimentan atracción o deseo sexual; no debe utilizarse para describir a personas que practican el celibato o la abstinencia por razones religiosas o culturales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die im Allgemeinen keine sexuelle Anziehung oder kein sexuelles Verlangen verspüren; wird nicht verwendet, um Personen zu beschreiben, die aus religiösen oder kulturellen Gründen Zölibat oder Abstinenz praktizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui n'éprouvent généralement pas d'attirance ou de désir sexuel; ne pas utiliser pour décrire les personnes qui pratiquent le célibat ou l'abstinence pour des raisons religieuses ou culturelles."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die over het algemeen geen seksuele aantrekkingskracht of verlangen ervaren; niet gebruiken om personen te beschrijven die celibaat of onthouding beoefenen om religieuze of culturele redenen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som generellt inte upplever sexuell attraktion eller lust. Används inte för att beskriva personer som praktiserar celibat eller avhållsamhet av religiösa eller kulturella skäl."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002292"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002761"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002905"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003034"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004637"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004642"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000244"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001535"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001633"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001758"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001762"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001766"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002146"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002912"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2016000237"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/asexualPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000807","dc:identifier":"homoit0000807","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Acronym used to describe lesbians, gay men, bisexual people, transgender people, queer people, and any other sexual and gender minorities as a group."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acrónimo utilizado para describir a lesbianas, hombres gay, personas bisexuales, personas transgénero, personas queer y cualquier otra minoría sexual y de género como grupo."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"レズビアン、ゲイ、バイセクシュアル、トランスジェンダー、クィア、およびその他の性的・ジェンダーのマイノリティを総称して指す略語。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Acroniem gebruikt om lesbische vrouwen, homomannen, biseksuele personen, transgender personen en queer personen als groep te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Akronym som används för att beskriva homosexuella, bisexuella, transpersoner, queera personer och andra sexuella och könsminoriteter som grupp."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001789"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000804"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000806"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000143"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000485"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000672"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000733"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001170"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001290"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001403"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001789"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQ+"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000882","dc:identifier":"homoit0000882","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQIA"},{"@language":"es","@value":"LGBTQIA"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQIA"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtqia"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Acronym used to describe describe lesbians, gay people, bisexuals, transgender people, queer people, intersex people, and asexual people as a group."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acrónimo utilizado para describir a lesbianas, hombres gay, personas bisexuales, personas transgénero, personas queer, personas intersexuales y personas asexuales como grupo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Alleen gebruikt om lesbische vrouwen, homomannen, biseksuelen, transgender personen, queer personen, intersekse personen en aseksuele personen als een groep te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Akronym som används för att beskriva homosexuella, bisexuella, transpersoner, queera personer, intersexpersoner och asexuella som grupp."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000804"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000806"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000143"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000485"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000672"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000733"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001170"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001403"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000882"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQIA"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001282","dc:identifier":"homoit0001282","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual abstinence"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abstinencia sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele onthouding"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell avhållsamhet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Celibat"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Practice of abstaining or not participating in some or all forms of sexual activity, whether for medical, psychological, social, moral, or religious reasons. Sexual abstinence may be voluntary or involuntary. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Práctica de abstenerse o no participar en algunas o todas las formas de actividad sexual, ya sea por razones médicas, psicológicas, sociales, morales o religiosas. La abstinencia sexual puede ser voluntaria o involuntaria."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Praktijk van het zich onthouden of niet deelnemen aan sommige of alle vormen van seksuele activiteit, om medische, psychologische, sociale, morele of religieuze redenen. Seksuele onthouding kan vrijwillig of onvrijwillig zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Praktiken att avstå från eller inte delta i vissa eller alla former av sexuell aktivitet, oavsett om det sker av medicinska, psykologiska, sociala, moraliska eller religiösa skäl. Sexuell avhållsamhet kan vara frivillig eller ofrivillig."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001493"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000244"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85120718"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualAbstinence"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001493","dc:identifier":"homoit0001493","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Virginity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Virginidad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Maagdelijkheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Oskuld"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mödom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svendom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the sexual status of people who have never engaged in sexual activity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir el estado sexual de personas que nunca han tenido actividad sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die nog nooit seksuele activiteit heeft verricht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver sexuell status hos personer som aldrig har haft sex."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001282"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85143788"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/virginity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001535","dc:identifier":"homoit0001535","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Compulsory sexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexualidad obligatoria"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zwangssexualität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dwangmatige seksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tvingande sexualitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The belief that everyone should be either sexually available or in a sexual relationship."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La creencia de que todo el mundo debería estar disponible sexualmente o en una relación sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Überzeugung, dass jeder entweder sexuell verfügbar sein oder in einer sexuellen Beziehung leben sollte."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De overtuiging dat iedereen seksueel beschikbaar moet zijn of een seksuele relatie moet hebben"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Övertygelsen att alla bör vara sexuellt tillgängliga eller befinna sig i en sexuell relation."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000071"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000343"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000344"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000356"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001531"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001650"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001917"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/compulsorySexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001644","dc:identifier":"homoit0001644","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromanticism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arromanticismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantik"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Aromantisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromanticisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arromántico"},{"@language":"de","@value":"aromantisch"},{"@language":"de","@value":"aro"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A romantic orientation generally characterized by a lack of romantic attraction or desire."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Orientación arromántica caracterizada generalmente por la falta de atracción o deseo romántico."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine romantische Orientierung, die im Allgemeinen durch wenig oder keine romantische Anziehung gekennzeichnet ist."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Orientation romantique caractérisée par l'absence d'attirance ou de désir romantique."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een romantische oriëntatie die over het algemeen wordt gekenmerkt door een gebrek aan romantische aantrekkingskracht of verlangen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En romantisk läggning som generellt kännetecknas av avsaknad av romantisk attraktion och romantiska begär."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001828"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001791"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001828"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/aromanticism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-03-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005","dc:identifier":"homoit0000005","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV/AIDS"},{"@language":"es","@value":"VIH/SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HIV/Aids"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"HIV/AIDS"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv/aids"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Acquired immune deficiency syndrome"},{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Acquired immunodeficiency syndrome"},{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Human immunodeficiency virus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"SIDA"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de inmunodeficiencia adquirida"},{"@language":"es","@value":"VIH"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Virus de inmunodeficiencia humana"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HIV/AIDS"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Acquired immunodeficiency syndrome"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"HIV"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Human immunodeficiency virus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Abbreviation for human immunodeficiency virus (HIV) and acquired immunodeficiency syndrome (AIDS)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abreviación para el virus de inmunodeficiencia humana (VIH) y síndrome de inmunodeficiencia adquirida (SIDA)."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Abkürzung für Humanes Immundefizienz-Virus (HIV) und erworbenes Immundefizienzsyndrom (Aids)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förkortning för hiv (humant immunbristvirus) och aids (förvärvat immunbristsyndrom)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001308"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000033"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001980"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000024"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000025"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000026"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000027"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000028"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000029"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000030"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000031"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000032"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000034"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000226"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000634"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000637"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000639"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000640"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000686"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001091"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001981"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003129"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003909"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004615"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004616"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh86004391"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001308"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/HIVAIDS"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001308","dc:identifier":"homoit0001308","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"STDs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"ETS"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"SOA's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könssjukdomar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexually transmitted diseases"},{"@language":"en","@value":"VD"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Venereal diseases"},{"@language":"en","@value":"STIs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexually transmitted infections"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Enfermedades de transmisión sexual"},{"@language":"es","@value":"ITS"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Infecciones de transmisión sexual"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Enfermedades venéreas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksueel overdraagbare aandoeningen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"STDs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"STIs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuellt överförbara infektioner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuellt överförbara sjukdomar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Veneriska sjukdomar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könisar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Diseases or infections that are transmitted via sexual contact or activity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Enfermedades o infecciones que se transmiten por contacto o actividad sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afkorting voor seksueel overdraagbare aandoeningen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sjukdomar eller infektioner som överförs genom sexuell kontakt eller aktivitet."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001080"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85142634"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001308"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/STDs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000033","dc:identifier":"homoit0000033","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"ARC (AIDS-Related Complex)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"CRA (Complejo relacionado al SIDA)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"ARC (AIDS-Related Complex)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"ARC (AIDS-Related Complex)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"ARC (AIDS-relaterat komplex)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS Related Complex"},{"@language":"en","@value":"ARC"},{"@language":"es","@value":"CRA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Related Complex"},{"@language":"de","@value":"ARC"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"ARC"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Abbreviation for AIDS-related complex, a term used early in the AIDS epidemic to describe people with symptomatic HIV infections who have not been formally diagnosed with AIDS. Since 2000, clinical use of the term has been largely discontinued."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abreviatura del complejo relacionado al SIDA, término utilizado a principios de la epidemia del SIDA para describir a personas con infecciones sintomáticas de VIH que no fueron diagnosticadas formalmente con SIDA. Desde 2000, en gran medida, el uso clínico del término fue abandonado."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Abkürzung für AIDS-related complex, ein Begriff, der zu Beginn der AIDS-Epidemie verwendet wurde, um Menschen mit symptomatischen HIV-Infektionen zu beschreiben, bei denen AIDS noch nicht offiziell diagnostiziert wurde. Seit 2000 wird der Begriff im klinischen Bereich weitgehend nicht mehr verwendet."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afkorting voor AIDS-gerelateerd complex, een term die in het begin van de AIDS-epidemie werd gebruikt om mensen met symptomatische HIV-infecties te beschrijven bij wie niet formeel de diagnose AIDS is gesteld. Sinds 2000 is het klinische gebruik van de term grotendeels stopgezet."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förkortning för AIDS-related complex, en term som användes tidigt under aids-epidemin för att beskriva personer med symtomatiska hiv-infektioner som ännu inte fått en formell aids-diagnos. Sedan år 2000 har termen till största delen övergivits i klinisk användning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000686"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh86002565"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001308"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ARC"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001980","dc:identifier":"homoit0001980","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"GRID (Gay-Related Immune Deficiency)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"GRID (Inmunodeficiencia Asociada a la Homosexualidad)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"GRID (Gay-Related Immune Deficiency)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"GRID (Gay-Related Immune Deficiency)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"GRID"},{"@language":"en","@value":"GRIDS"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Related Immune Deficiency"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay-Related Immune Deficiency"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Gay-Related Immune Deficiency"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gay-Related Immune Deficiency"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"GRID"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"GRIDS"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"GRIDS"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The original name for AIDS, proposed after public health scientists noticed clusters of Kaposi's sarcoma and Pneumocystis pneumonia among gay men in California and New York City. Should only be used in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nombre original del SIDA, propuesto después de que científicos de salud pública observaran grupos de sarcoma de Kaposi y neumonía por Pneumocystis entre hombres gay de California y Nueva York. Utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De oorspronkelijke naam voor AIDS, voorgesteld nadat wetenschappers op het gebied van de volksgezondheid clusters van Kaposi-sarcoom en Pneumocystis-pneumonie opmerkten bij homomannen in Californië en New York City; alleen gebruiken in historische context"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Det ursprungliga namnet för aids, som föreslogs efter att folkhälsovetare upptäckte kluster av Kaposis sarkom och Pneumocystis pneumoni bland bögar i Kalifornien och New York. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000686"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001308"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000024","dc:identifier":"homoit0000024","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS activists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activistas contra el SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Aktivist:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-activisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv- och aidsaktivister"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Activistas del SIDA"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who campaign for social and political change for people affected by HIV/AIDS."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que hacen campaña por el cambio social y político para las personas afectadas por el VIH/SIDA."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die sich für soziale und politische Veränderungen zugunsten der von HIV/AIDS betroffenen Menschen einsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die campagne voeren voor sociale en politieke verandering voor mensen die getroffen zijn door hiv/aids."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som kampanjar för social och politisk förändring för personer som påverkas av hiv och aids."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000007"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000030"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93005197"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSActivists"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000025","dc:identifier":"homoit0000025","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS awareness"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Conciencia sobre el SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Sensibilisierung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-bewustzijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medvetenhet om hiv/aids"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Sensibilisierung zu AIDS"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Informationen über AIDS"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Beratung zu AIDS"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Activism and other efforts to bring attention to the AIDS epidemic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo y otros esfuerzos para generar atención sobre la epidemia del SIDA."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aktivismus und andere Bemühungen, die Aufmerksamkeit auf die AIDS-Epidemie zu lenken."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Activisme en andere inspanningen om de aids-epidemie onder de aandacht te brengen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aktivism, informationsinsatser och utbildning som syftar till att förebygga hiv/aids och motverka missuppfattningar om hiv och aids."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000034"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000025"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSAwareness"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000026","dc:identifier":"homoit0000026","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"AIDS information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información sobre el SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Informationszentren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscenter för hiv och aids"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"AIDS information centres"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Informationszentren zu AIDS"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum om hiv/aids"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions dedicated to education, prevention, and treatment of HIV/AIDS; AIDS information centers often provide services like HIV counseling and testing services."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones dedicadas a la educación, la prevención y el tratamiento del VIH/SIDA; los centros de información sobre el SIDA suelen ofrecer servicios como asesoramiento y pruebas de VIH."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Einrichtungen, die sich der Aufklärung, Vorbeugung und Behandlung von HIV/AIDS widmen; AIDS-Informationszentren bieten oft Dienste wie HIV-Beratung und -Tests an."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die zich toeleggen op voorlichting, preventie en behandeling van hiv/aids; AIDS-informatiecentra bieden vaak diensten aan zoals hiv-counseling en testdiensten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organisationer som arbetar med utbildning, förebyggande åtgärder och behandling av hiv och aids. Informationscenter för hiv och aids kan erbjuda rådgivning och hiv-testning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2021005736"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSInformationCentres"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000027","dc:identifier":"homoit0000027","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS education"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Educación sobre el SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Aufklärung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-voorlichting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv- och aidsupplysning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Aufklärung zu AIDS"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Informationen über AIDS"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Beratung zu AIDS"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Instruction about HIV/AIDS, including topics like the history of the AIDS epidemic, contraction, prevention, and treatment."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instrucción sobre el VIH/SIDA, incluyendo temas como la historia de la epidemia del SIDA, cómo se contrae, su prevención y tratamiento."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Unterrichtung über HIV/AIDS, einschließlich Themen wie die Geschichte der AIDS-Epidemie, Ansteckung, Prävention und Behandlung."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instructie over hiv/aids, inclusief onderwerpen als de geschiedenis van de aids-epidemie, hoe je het oploopt, preventie en behandeling."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Undervisning om hiv och aids, inklusive ämnen som aids-epidemins historia, smittspridning, förebyggande och behandling."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000661"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001251"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001271"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001294"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2009114510"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000661"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSEducation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000028","dc:identifier":"homoit0000028","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS memorial quilts"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Memorial-Quilts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Colchas conmemorativas del SIDA"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-quilts"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aidsminneslapptäcken"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Gedenktücher"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Erinnerungstücher"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gedenktücher für an den Folgen von AIDS Verstorbene"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Quilts für an den Folgen von AIDS Verstorbene"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Memorial Quilts für an den Folgen von AIDS Verstorbene"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erinnerungstücher für an den Folgen von AIDS Verstorbene"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gedenktücher für an den Folgen von AIDS-Verstorbene"},{"@language":"es","@value":"AIDS quilts"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Quilts created to celebrate the lives of people who have died of AIDS-related causes, bring awareness to the AIDS epidemic, and provide support and healing for those affected. The term is often used to refer to the NAMES Project AIDS Memorial Quilt started by Cleve Jones in 1985."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Quilts zum Gedenken an Menschen, die an den Folgen von AIDS gestorben sind, um auf die AIDS-Epidemie aufmerksam zu machen und den Betroffenen Unterstützung und Heilung zu bieten. Der Begriff wird häufig im Zusammenhang mit dem 1985 von Cleve Jones ins Leben gerufenen NAMES Project AIDS Memorial Quilt verwendet."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Colchas creadas para celebrar las vidas de las personas que han muerto por causas relacionadas con el SIDA, generar conciencia sobre la epidemia del SIDA y brindar apoyo y sanación a las personas afectadas. El término se utiliza a menudo para referirse a la colcha conmemorativa del SIDA del proyecto NAMES iniciada por Cleve Jones en 1985."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Quilts (doorstikte dekens) die zijn gemaakt om het leven te vieren van mensen die zijn gestorven aan AIDS-gerelateerde oorzaken, bewustzijn te creëren voor de AIDS-epidemie en ondersteuning en genezing te bieden aan de getroffenen. De term wordt vaak gebruikt om te verwijzen naar het NAMES Project AIDS Memorial Quilt, gestart door Cleve Jones in 1985."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Täcken skapade för att hedra personer som dött av aids-relaterade orsaker, sprida medvetenhet om aids-epidemin och erbjuda stöd och helande för de drabbade. Termen används ofta för att hänvisa till NAMES Project AIDS Memorial Quilt, startad av Cleve Jones 1985."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000029"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000901"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90005342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSMemorialQuilts"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000029","dc:identifier":"homoit0000029","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS memorials"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Memorials"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Memoriales sobre el SIDA"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-gedenktekens"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aids-minnesmärken"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Gedenkfeier"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Denkmäler"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Conmemoraciones del SIDA"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Minneshögtider för hiv och aids"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Projects and events celebrating the lives of people who have died of AIDS-related causes."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Projekte und Veranstaltungen zum Gedenken an Menschen, die an den Folgen von AIDS gestorben sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Proyectos y eventos que celebran las vidas de personas que han muerto por causas relacionadas al SIDA."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Projecten en evenementen ter ere van het leven van mensen die zijn overleden aan AIDS-gerelateerde oorzaken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Projekt och evenemang som hyllar personer som dött av aids-relaterade orsaker."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000028"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000901"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSMemorials"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000030","dc:identifier":"homoit0000030","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"AIDS organizations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones contra SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Organisationen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-organisaties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv- och aidsorganisationer"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"AIDS organisations"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Community-based groups or institutions that provide support and advocacy for people affected by HIV/AIDS."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos o instituciones comunitarias que brindan apoyo y defensa a las personas afectadas por el VIH/SIDA."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Community-basierte Gruppen oder Einrichtungen, die Menschen mit HIV/AIDS unterstützen und sich für sie einsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vanuit de gemeenschap gevestigde groepen of instellingen die ondersteuning en belangenbehartiging bieden aan mensen die getroffen zijn door hiv/aids."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gemenskapsbaserade organisationer som erbjuder stöd och arbetar för att stärka rättigheterna för personer som lever med eller påverkas av hiv och aids."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000024"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000031"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000030"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSOrganisations"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000031","dc:identifier":"homoit0000031","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS periodicals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Revistas sobre SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Publikationen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-bladen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv- occh aidstidskrifter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones periódicas contra el SIDA"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones periódicas sobre el SIDA ||"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Zeitschriften"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Print or digital publications published periodically and created by or for people with AIDS."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones impresas o digitales publicadas periódicamente y creadas por o para personas con SIDA."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Regelmäßig erscheinende gedruckte oder digitale Publikationen, die von oder für Menschen mit AIDS erstellt werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukte of digitale publicaties die periodiek verschijnen en gemaakt zijn door of voor mensen met aids."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckta eller digitala publikationer som publiceras regelbundet och är skapade av eller för personer med aids."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001830"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000030"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007100929"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001830"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSPeriodicals"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000032","dc:identifier":"homoit0000032","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS phobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Serofobia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Phobie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS-angst"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv- och aidsfobi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDSphobia"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Fear of AIDS"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fobia al SIDA"},{"@language":"es","@value":"AIDSfobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Miedo al SIDA"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sidafobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sidofobia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Angst vor AIDS"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Antagonism or disgust directed toward individuals with HIV/AIDS or behaviors perceived as putting oneself at risk for contracting HIV/AIDS. AIDS phobia may include isolation, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Antagonismo o disgusto dirigido hacia personas con VIH/SIDA o hacia comportamientos percibidos como riesgosos en relación a la contracción de VIH/SIDA. La fobia al SIDA puede incluir el aislamiento, los estereotipos, el acoso verbal y la violencia física."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Starke Ablehnung oder Abscheu gegenüber Personen mit HIV/AIDS oder Verhaltensweisen, von denen man annimmt, dass sie das Risiko einer Ansteckung mit HIV/AIDS mit sich bringen. AIDS-Phobie kann Isolation, Stereotypen, verbale Belästigung und physische Gewalt beinhalten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Antagonisme of afkeer gericht op personen met HIV/AIDS of gedrag waarvan wordt aangenomen dat men zichzelf in gevaar brengt om HIV/AIDS op te lopen. AIDS-angst kan isolatie, stereotypen, verbale intimidatie en fysiek geweld omvatten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antagonism eller avsmak riktad mot individer med hiv och aids eller beteenden som uppfattas sätta en själv i riskzonen för att få hiv. Aidsfobi kan inkludera isolering, stereotyper, verbala trakasserier och fysisk våld."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004616"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh88004490"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000032"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/AIDSPhobia"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000034","dc:identifier":"homoit0000034","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Red ribbons (AIDS)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cintas rojas (SIDA)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aids-lintjes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Röda bandet (aids/hiv)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS ribbons"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Red ribbons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lazos rojos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lazos rojos (SIDA)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cintas por el SIDA"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Red ribbons"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Red ribbon that acts as an international symbol for HIV and AIDS awareness; first adopted in the early 1990s for the Red Ribbon Project."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cinta roja que actúa como símbolo internacional para la concientización sobre el VIH y el SIDA; adoptado por primera vez a principios de la década de 1990 para el Proyecto Cinta Roja."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een internationaal symbool voor HIV- en AIDS-bewustzijn, voor het eerst gebruikt in het begin van de jaren negentig voor het Red Ribbon-project."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rött band som fungerar som en internationell symbol för medvetenhet om hiv och aids. Antogs först på 1990-talet inom Red Ribbon-projektet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000954"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000025"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000954"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/redRibbons"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000226","dc:identifier":"homoit0000226","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ peer support"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado de pares LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+-Peer-Unterstützung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Buddyzorg voor LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kamratstöd (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Buddy care for LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ buddy care"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Peer support for LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pares"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado entre pares LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Peer-to-Peer-Unterstützung für LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-peer support"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Peer support voor LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Buddy care (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kompisvård (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kompisstöd (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A peer-to-peer form of healthcare support for LGBTQ+ people in which volunteers (sometimes called buddies) attend clinical visits with patients to provide emotional and logistical support."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de apoyo entre pares para cuidados de salud para personas LGBTQ+ en la que voluntarios (amigos) asisten a visitas clínicas con pacientes para brindarles apoyo emocional y logístico."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Peer-to-Peer-Form der Gesundheitsfürsorge für LGBTQ+-Personen, bei der Freiwillige (manchmal auch „Buddies” genannt) Menschen zu Arztterminen begleiten, um ihnen emotionale und logistische Unterstützung zu bieten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een informele directe vorm van gezondheidszorgondersteuning voor LHBTQ+-personen, waarbij vrijwilligers (soms ook wel buddy's genoemd) klinische bezoeken afleggen aan patiënten om emotionele en logistieke ondersteuning te bieden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av hbtq+-hälso- och sjukvårdsstöd där volontärer (buddies) följer med patienter till vårdbesök för att ge emotionellt och logistiskt stöd."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004486"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/buddyCareForLGBTQPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000634","dc:identifier":"homoit0000634","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV tests"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pruebas de VIH"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HIV-Tests"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"HIV-tests"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv-tester"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Exámenes de VIH"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Medical tests used to determine the presence of HIV antibodies or antigens in an individual's blood, saliva, or urine."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pruebas médicas utilizadas para determinar la presencia de anticuerpos o antígenos del VIH en la sangre, la saliva o la orina de una persona."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Medizinische Tests, mit denen das Vorhandensein von HIV-Antikörpern oder -Antigenen im Blut, Speichel oder Urin einer Person nachgewiesen wird."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Medische tests die worden gebruikt om de aanwezigheid van HIV-antilichamen of -antigenen in het bloed, het speeksel of de urine van een persoon te bepalen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinska tester som används för att påvisa förekomst av hiv-antikroppar eller antigener i blod, saliv eller urin."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000634"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/HIVTests"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635","dc:identifier":"homoit0000635","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-negative people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas negativas al VIH"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HIV-negative Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seronegatieven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hivnegativa personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-seronegative people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas seronegativas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HIV-seronegative Personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who have not contracted HIV."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que no han contraído el VIH."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die sich nicht mit HIV infiziert haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die geen HIV hebben opgelopen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som inte har hiv."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000638"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000639"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000640"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004615"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/HIV-negativePeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636","dc:identifier":"homoit0000636","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-positive people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas positivas al VIH"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HIV-positive Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seropositieven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som lever med hiv"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-seropositive people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HIV-seropositive Personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hivpositiva personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Poz"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pos"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who have contracted HIV."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que han contraído el VIH."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die sich mit HIV infiziert haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die HIV hebben"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har hiv."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000640"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000226"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000638"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000639"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004615"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95001199"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/HIV-positivePeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000637","dc:identifier":"homoit0000637","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Seroconversion"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Seroconversión"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seroconversie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Serokonversion"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-seroconversion"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Seroconversión-VIH"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the period of time between exposure to a virus and when antibodies for the virus are detectable; often used in reference to HIV testing when a test changes from HIV negative to HIV positive."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir el período de tiempo entre la exposición a un virus y el momento en que los anticuerpos contra el virus son detectables; a menudo se utiliza en referencia a la prueba del VIH cuando una prueba cambia de VIH negativa a VIH positiva."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een algemene term voor de tijdsperiode tussen blootstelling aan een virus en het moment waarop antilichamen tegen het virus aantoonbaar zijn; vaak gebruikt met betrekking tot hiv-testen wanneer een test verandert van hiv-negatief in hiv-positief."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver perioden mellan exponering för ett virus och det att antikroppar kan upptäckas. Används ofta vid hiv-testning för att ange när ett testresultat förändras från negativt till positivt."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000637"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/seroconversion"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000639","dc:identifier":"homoit0000639","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Serostatus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Seroestatus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Serostatus"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Serostatus"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-serostatus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Serostatus-VIH"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Serostatus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The presence (seropositivity) or absence (seronegativity) of antibodies in blood serum; commonly used in in reference to HIV testing."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La presencia (seropositividad) o ausencia (seronegatividad) de anticuerpos en el suero sanguíneo; comúnmente utilizado en referencia a las pruebas de VIH."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De aanwezigheid (seropositiviteit) of afwezigheid (seronegativiteit) van antilichamen in bloedserum; vaak gebruikt in verwijzing naar HIV-testen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förekomsten (seropositivitet) eller frånvaron (seronegativitet) av antikroppar i blodets serum. Används ofta i samband med hiv-testning."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000640"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000639"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/serostatus"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000640","dc:identifier":"homoit0000640","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-undetectable people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas con VIH indetectable"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met ondetecteerbare HIV"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som lever med välbehandlad hiv"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who have contracted HIV and received treatment to reduce their HIV antibodies to an amount that can no longer be detected by standard HIV tests."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que contrajeron el VIH y recibieron tratamiento para reducir sus anticuerpos contra el VIH a una cantidad que no se puede detectar mediante pruebas estándar de VIH."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die HIV hebben opgelopen en zijn behandeld om hun HIV-antistoffen te verminderen tot een hoeveelheid die niet meer kan worden opgespoord met standaard HIV-tests."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har hiv och som genom behandling fått virusnivåerna så låga att de inte längre kan upptäckas med vanliga hiv-tester."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000639"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004615"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/HIVUndetectablePeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000686","dc:identifier":"homoit0000686","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kaposi's sarcoma"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sarcoma de Kaposi"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kaposi's sarcoma"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sarkom, Kaposis"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A type of cancer that causes lesions to grow in the skin, lymph nodes, internal organs, and mucous membranes; often affects people with immune deficiencies, such as AIDS."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tipo de cáncer que provoca lesiones en la piel, los ganglios linfáticos, los órganos internos y las mucosas; suele afectar a personas con deficiencias inmunitarias, como el SIDA."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een type kanker dat laesies veroorzaakt in de huid, lymfeklieren, inwendige organen en slijmvliezen; treft vaak mensen met immuundeficiënties, zoals AIDS."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av cancer som orsakar lesioner i hud, lymfkörtlar, inre organ och slemhinnor. Drabbar ofta personer med nedsatt immunförsvar, såsom vid aids."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000033"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001980"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85071562"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000686"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/kaposisSarcoma"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001091","dc:identifier":"homoit0001091","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Passive immune therapy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inmunoterapia pasiva"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Passieve immuuntherapie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Immunisering, passiv"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A medical treatment in which a person receives laboratory-made antibodies to help fight an infection or disease."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un tratamiento médico en el que una persona recibe anticuerpos fabricados en laboratorio para ayudar a combatir una infección o enfermedad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een medische behandeling waarbij een persoon in het laboratorium gemaakte antilichamen krijgt om een infectie of ziekte te helpen bestrijden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinsk behandling där en person får laboratorieframställda antikroppar för att bekämpa infektion eller sjukdom."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001007"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/passiveImmuneTherapy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001981","dc:identifier":"homoit0001981","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HAART (Highly Active Antiretroviral Therapy)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"TARGA (Terapia Antirretroviral de Gran Actividad)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Antiretrovirale Terapie (ART)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"HAART (Highly Active Antiretroviral Therapy)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antiretroviral läkemedelsterapi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Combination Anti-Retroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Combination Antiretroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"HAART"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Highly Active Anti-Retroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Highly Active Antiretroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"cART"},{"@language":"de","@value":"ART"},{"@language":"de","@value":"cArt"},{"@language":"de","@value":"HAART"},{"@language":"de","@value":"hochaktive antiretrovirale Therapie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Combination Anti-Retroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Combination Antiretroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"HAART"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Highly Active Anti-Retroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Highly Active Antiretroviral Therapy"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antiretroviral läkemedelsbehandling"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Treatment that involves the use of three or more drugs in combination to treat HIV infection by preventing the virus from making copies of itself in the body; can lessen the damage to the immune system caused by HIV, slow down the development of AIDS, and prevent the transmission of HIV to others."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tratamiento que implica el uso de tres o más medicamentos en combinación para tratar la infección por VIH evitando que el virus se replique en el cuerpo; puede disminuir el daño al sistema inmunológico causado por el VIH, retardar el desarrollo del SIDA y prevenir la transmisión del VIH a otras personas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Therapie, bei der drei oder mehr Medikamente kombiniert eingesetzt werden, um eine HIV-Infektion zu behandeln, indem verhindert wird, dass sich das Virus im Körper vermehrt; sie kann die durch HIV verursachten Schäden am Immunsystem verringern, das Fortschreiten von AIDS verlangsamen und die Übertragung von HIV auf andere verhindern."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Behandeling waarbij drie of meer geneesmiddelen in combinatie worden gebruikt om een Hiv-infectie te behandelen door te voorkomen dat het virus kopieën van zichzelf in het lichaam maakt; kan de schade aan het immuunsysteem veroorzaakt door HIV verminderen, de ontwikkeling van AIDS vertragen en de overdracht van HIV op anderen voorkomen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Behandling som kombinerar tre eller fler läkemedel för att behandla hiv genom att förhindra att viruset kopierar sig i kroppen. Kan minska skador på immunförsvaret, bromsa utvecklingen av aids och förhindra smittöverföring."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001007"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008003832"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003129","dc:identifier":"homoit0003129","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bugchasing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bugchasing"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bug-Chasing"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bugchasing"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bugchasing"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Caza del bicho"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pozzen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pozzing"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Absichtliche HIV-Ansteckung"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The act or fantasy of engaging in sex with the intent to contract HIV/AIDS."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El acto o la fantasía de tener relaciones sexuales con la intención de contraer VIH/SIDA."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Handlung oder Fantasie, Sex mit der Absicht zu haben, sich mit HIV/AIDS zu infizieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De daad of fantasie om seks te hebben met de intentie om hiv/aids te krijgen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handlingen eller fantasin om att ha sex i syfte att medvetet smittas med hiv/aids."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001239"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001239"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003909","dc:identifier":"homoit0003909","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"PEP (HIV)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"PEP (HIV)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"PEP (hiv)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Post-exposure prophylaxis (HIV)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV PEP"},{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV post-exposure prophylaxis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"HIV post-exposure prophylaxis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Post-exposure prophylaxis (HIV)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hiv – postexpositionsprofylax"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Medication taken after a possible exposure to HIV to prevent infection."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Medicatie die wordt ingenomen na mogelijke blootstelling aan HIV om infectie te voorkomen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicin som tas efter eventuell hiv-exponering för att förhindra infektion."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001007"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004615","dc:identifier":"homoit0004615","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV disclosure"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Sharing one's HIV status with other people, such as partners, family members, and healthcare providers."},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000640"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004615"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004616","dc:identifier":"homoit0004616","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Criminalization of HIV transmission"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Laws which criminalize the transmission of HIV, or perceived exposure to HIV."},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000005"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000032"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004616"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006","dc:identifier":"homoit0000006","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の活動"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activisme LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-aktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Activism (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"活動（LGBTQ）"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Militantisme LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr cambio político o social y la aceptación de las personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々に対する社会的受容と、政治的・社会的な変革を実現するための直接行動や組織活動。"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Action directe et mobilisation visant à obtenir des changements politiques ou sociaux et à faire accepter les personnes LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of maatschappelijke verandering en acceptatie voor LHBTQ+-personen te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion och organisering för att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och acceptans för hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000122"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000462"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000713"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001150"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001383"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002751"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002758"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004330"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000007"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000534"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001319"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002396"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002656"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003195"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003695"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/activismLGBTQ"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000122","dc:identifier":"homoit0000122","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo bisexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexueller Aktivismus"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activisme bisexuel"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksueel activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuell aktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuellen-Aktivismus"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelles Engagement"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuellen-Engagement"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Militantisme bisexuel"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for bisexuality."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr el cambio político o social y la aceptación de la bisexualidad."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Direktes Handeln und Organisieren, um politische oder gesellchaftliche Veränderungen und die Akzeptanz von Bisexualität zu erreichen."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Action directe et mobilisation visant à obtenir des changements politiques ou sociaux et à faire accepter les personnes bisexuelles."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of sociale verandering en acceptatie voor biseksualiteit te bereiken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion och organisering för att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och acceptans för bisexuella personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000147"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000162"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000175"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000183"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/bisexualActivism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000462","dc:identifier":"homoit0000462","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwuler Aktivismus"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activisme gai"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögaktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulen-Aktivismus"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Engagement"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulen-Engagement"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay-Aktivismus"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Militantisme gai"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig aktivism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr el cambio político o social y la aceptación de los hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Direktes Handeln und Organisieren, um politische oder gesellschaftliche Veränderungen und die Akzeptanz von Schwulen zu erreichen."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Action directe et mobilisation visant à obtenir des changements politiques ou sociaux et à faire accepter les personnes gaies."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of maatschappelijke verandering en acceptatie voor homomannen te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion och organisering för att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och acceptans för bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000518"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayActivism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000713","dc:identifier":"homoit0000713","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo lésbico"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbischer Aktivismus"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activisme lesbien"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbisch activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk aktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":""},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbenaktivismus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for lesbians."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr cambio político o social y la aceptación de las lesbianas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Direktes Handeln und Organisieren, um politische oder gesellschaftliche Veränderungen und die Akzeptanz von Lesben zu erreichen."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Action directe et mobilisation visant à obtenir des changements politiques ou sociaux et à faire accepter les personnes lesbiennes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of maatschappelijke verandering en acceptatie voor lesbische vrouwen te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion och organisering för att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och acceptans för lesbiska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000763"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianActivism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853","dc:identifier":"homoit0000853","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ direct action"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+による直接行動"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-directe actie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ direct action"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQによる直接行動"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Direct action LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Use to describe a group of LGBTQ+ people taking action that is intended to reveal an existing problem, highlight an alternative, or demonstrate a possible solution to a social issue."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"社会問題の現状を明らかにしたり、別の選択肢を提示したり、あるいは解決策を示したりすることを目的として行動を起こすLGBTQ+の人々のグループを指す。"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Utilícese para describir a un grupo de personas LGBTQ+ que toman medidas destinadas a revelar un problema existente, resaltar una alternativa o demostrar una posible solución a un problema social."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Doet zich voor wanneer een groep mensen een actie onderneemt die bedoeld is om een bestaand probleem aan het licht te brengen, een alternatief te benadrukken of een mogelijke oplossing voor een maatschappelijk probleem aan te tonen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Används för att beskriva grupper av hbtq+-personer som vidtar åtgärder för att synliggöra ett samhällsproblem, lyfta ett alternativ eller visa på en möjlig lösning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000808"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000835"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000844"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000893"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000910"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000919"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000935"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001065"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQDirectAction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001150","dc:identifier":"homoit0001150","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo queer"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activisme queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queeraktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Militantisme queer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queer aktivism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for queer people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr el cambio político o social y la aceptación de las personas queer."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Action directe et mobilisation visant à obtenir des changements politiques ou sociaux et à faire accepter les personnes queers."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of maatschappelijke verandering en acceptatie voor queer personen te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion och organisering i syfte att åstadkomma politisk eller social förändring och acceptans för queera personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001198"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerActivism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001383","dc:identifier":"homoit0001383","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo transgénero"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activisme trans"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transaktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Militantisme transgenre"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Militantisme trans"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activisme transgenre"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for transgender people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr cambio político o social y la aceptación de las personas transgénero."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Action directe et mobilisation visant à obtenir des changements politiques ou sociaux et à faire accepter les personnes trans."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of maatschappelijke verandering en acceptatie voor transgender personen te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direktaktion och organisering i syfte att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och ökad acceptans för transpersoner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001434"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderActivism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002751","dc:identifier":"homoit0002751","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo intersex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexaktivism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change, bodily autonomy, and acceptance for intersex people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr cambios políticos o sociales, autonomía corporal y aceptación de las personas intersex."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of sociale verandering, lichamelijke autonomie en acceptatie voor intersekse personen te bereiken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change, bodily autonomy, and acceptance for intersex people."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002933"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002758","dc:identifier":"homoit0002758","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo asexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexueller Aktivismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksueel activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuell aktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Aktivismus"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ace-aktivism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for asexual people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr el cambio político o social y la aceptación de las personas asexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Direktes Handeln und Organisieren, um politische oder gesellchaftliche Veränderungen und die Akzeptanz von Asexualität zu erreichen.."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of maatschappelijke verandering en acceptatie voor aseksuele personen te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion och organisering för att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och acceptans för asexuella personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002803"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004330","dc:identifier":"homoit0004330","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary political activism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binair activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär politisk aktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary political activism"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for non-binary people."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of sociale verandering en acceptatie voor non-binaire personen te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direkt aktion och organisering för att uppnå politisk eller social förändring, kroppslig autonomi och acceptans för ickebinära personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004329"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000007","dc:identifier":"homoit0000007","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ political activists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activistas políticos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-activisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-aktivister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Political activists (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Activists (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ activists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activistas políticos (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people working to bring about political or social change through public organizing."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que se organizan o hacen campaña por objetivos y cambios sociales, culturales, políticos o económicos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lhbtq+-personen die zich inzetten voor politieke of sociale verandering door middel van publieke acties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som organiserar sig eller driver kampanjer för sociala, kulturella, politiska eller ekonomiska mål och förändringar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000024"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000175"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000518"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000763"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001198"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001434"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002803"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002933"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004329"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001905"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002657"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/activistsLGBTQ"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000038","dc:identifier":"homoit0000038","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Allies"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aliados"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Verbündete"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bondgenoten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Allierade"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Unterstützer:innen"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals of a privileged social identity who support, stand in solidarity with, and work to advance the interests of marginalized groups they do not belong to."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de una identidad social privilegiada que apoyan, se solidarizan con y trabajan para promover los intereses de grupos marginados a los que no pertenecen."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen einer privilegierten sozialen Identität, die Randgruppen, denen sie nicht angehören, unterstützen, sich mit ihnen solidarisieren und sich für eine Verbesserung derer Interessen einsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met een bevoorrechte sociale identiteit die de belangen van gemarginaliseerde groepen waartoe ze niet behoren ondersteunen, solidair zijn met en werken aan de belangen van gemarginaliseerde groepen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer i en privilegierad social position som stöttar, visar solidaritet med och verkar för att stärka marginaliserade grupper som de själva inte tillhör."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000538"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000873"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003195"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003693"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/allies"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000534","dc:identifier":"homoit0000534","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay shame"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vergüenza gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay-Shame-Bewegung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gay shame"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Shame-rörelsen"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay shame"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Movement within queer communities that is described as a radical alternative to gay culture being brought into the mainstream; directly posits an alternative view of gay pride events and activities that rejects increasing commercialization, corporate sponsors, and \"safer\" agendas to avoid offending heterosexual supporters and sponsors."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento dentro de comunidades queer que se describe como una alternativa radical a la incorporación de la cultura gay a la corriente principal; postula directamente una visión alternativa a los eventos y actividades del orgullo gay que rechaza su creciente comercialización, los patrocinadores corporativos y las agendas \"más seguras\" que evitan ofender a partidarios y patrocinadores heterosexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Bewegung innerhalb queerer Gemeinschaften, die als radikale Alternative zur Mainstreamisierung der Schwulenkultur beschrieben wird; vertritt eine alternative Sichtweise auf Gay-Pride-Veranstaltungen und -Aktivitäten, die eine zunehmende Kommerzialisierung, Firmensponsoring und „sicherere“ Zielsetzungen ablehnt, um heterosexuelle Unterstützer und Sponsoren nicht zu verärgern."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Beweging vanuit queer gemeenschappen die kan worden beschreven als een radicaal alternatief voor homo-mainstreaming met een alternatieve kijk op gay pride-evenementen en -activiteiten die steeds meer gecommercialiseerd zijn met bedrijfssponsors en \"veiligere\" agenda's om te voorkomen dat supporters en sponsors worden beledigd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rörelse inom queera gemenskaper som beskrivs som ett radikalt alternativ till att homokultur förs in i mainstream. Rörelsen formulerar en alternativ syn på prideevenemang och relaterade aktiviteter och tar avstånd från ökad kommersialisering, företags­sponsring och så kallade ”säkrare” agendor som syftar till att undvika att stöta sig med heterosexuella allierade och sponsorer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001561"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000534"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayShame"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001319","dc:identifier":"homoit0001319","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Leather and kink activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo leather y kink"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Leder- und Kink-Aktivismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Leer en kink activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läder- och kinkaktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läderaktivism"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kinkaktivism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organizing and activism focused on increasing awareness and acceptance of kinks, fetishes, sadomasochism, leather and related subcultures, closely associated with LGBTQ+ activism and the sex-positive feminist movement."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organización y activismo centrados en aumentar la concienciación y la aceptación de las subculturas kinks, fetichistas, sadomasoquistas, de cuero y afines, estrechamente relacionadas con el activismo LGBTQ+ y el movimiento feminista del sexo positivo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Organisationsarbeit und Aktivismus, die darauf abzielen, das Bewusstsein und die Akzeptanz für Kinks, Fetische, Sadomasochismus, Leder und verwandte Subkulturen zu stärken, in enger Verbindung mit dem LGBTQ+-Aktivismus und der sexpositiven feministischen Bewegung."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Organisatie en activisme gericht op het vergroten van het bewustzijn en de acceptatie van kinks, fetisjen, sadomasochisme, leer en aanverwante subculturen, nauw verbonden met LHBTQ+-activisme en de sekspositieve feministische beweging."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organisering och aktivism för att öka medvetenhet och acceptans kring den normbrytande sexualitet som förekommer i kink- och läderkultur samt i närliggande subkulturer. Nära förknippat med hbtq+-aktivism och den sexpositiva feministiska rörelsen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000036"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003101"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/SMMovement"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002396","dc:identifier":"homoit0002396","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Performative LGBTQ+ activism by police"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo performativo LGBTQ+ de la policía"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Performatief LHBTQ+-activisme door de politie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Performativ hbtq+-aktivism hos polisen"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay copaganda"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ copaganda"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pinkwashing by police officers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pride patches on police uniforms"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rainbow colored patrol cars"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rainbow hate crime cars"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rainbow-hued police cars"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rainbow-painted police cars"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rainbow-washing by police officers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Copaganda gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Copaganda LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pinkwashing hos polisen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ activism undertaken by police organizations and institutions which intends to increase the social capital of such institutions, rather than to actually serve LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo LGBTQ+ emprendido por organizaciones e instituciones policiales que pretende aumentar el capital social de dichas instituciones, en lugar de servir realmente a las comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-activisme ondernomen door politieorganisaties en instellingen met als doel het sociale draagvlak van dergelijke instellingen te vergroten, in plaats van LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen daadwerkelijk te dienen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-aktivism som utförs av polismyndigheter och närliggande institutioner i syfte att förbättra sitt rykte snarare än att faktiskt stödja hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002656","dc:identifier":"homoit0002656","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit activism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activismo dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-aktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S activism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit activism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spiritied activism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited activism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for Two-Spirit people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acción directa y organización para lograr cambio político o social y la aceptación de las personas dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of sociale verandering en acceptatie voor Two-Spirit people te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direktaktion och organisering i syfte att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och ökad acceptans för Two-spirit-personer."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003939"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002657"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003531"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002656"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-26"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003195","dc:identifier":"homoit0003195","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ solidarity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solidaridad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-solidariteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-solidaritet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Solidarity (LGBTQ+)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solidaridad (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A sense of fellowship and overall unity of purpose, political interest, and/or community sympathies based on shared experiences as LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un sentido de compañerismo y unidad general de propósito, interés político y/o simpatías comunitarias basadas en experiencias compartidas como personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een gevoel van saamhorigheid en algehele eenheid van doel, politieke interesse en/of sympathie voor de gemeenschap, gebaseerd op gedeelde ervaringen als LGBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En känsla av samhörighet och gemensamt syfte, politiskt engagemang och/eller gemenskap baserad på delade erfarenheter som hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003196"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003197"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003198"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003199"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003200"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003201"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003202"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003203"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003204"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003205"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003206"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003207"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003208"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003209"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003195"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-04-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003695","dc:identifier":"homoit0003695","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ philanthropy"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-filantropie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Filantropi (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Philanthropy (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ charity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Charity (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-liefdadigheid"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Liefdadigheid (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Efforts to improve the welfare of LGBTQ+ people and communities, especially by the donation of money or resources to charitable causes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inspanningen om het welzijn van LHBTQ+-personen en -gemeenschappen te verbeteren, met name door het doneren van geld of middelen aan goede doelen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Insatser för att förbättra välfärden för hbtq+-personer och gemenskaper, särskilt genom donationer av pengar eller resurser till välgörande ändamål."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003696"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003695"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000175","dc:identifier":"homoit0000175","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual political activists"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle politische Aktivist:innen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activistas políticos bisexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele activisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella politiska aktivister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle politisch aktivistische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Politisch akivistische Bisexuelle"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual individuals working to bring about political or social change through public organizing."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Personen, die sich durch öffentliche Organisation für politische oder soziale Veränderungen einsetzen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales que trabajan para lograr cambios políticos o sociales a través de la organización pública."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele personen die politieke of sociale verandering proberen te bewerkstelligen door middel van publieke acties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer som verkar för politisk eller social förändring genom offentlig organisering och mobilisering."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000007"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000122"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/bisexualPoliticalActivists"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000518","dc:identifier":"homoit0000518","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay political activists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Activistas políticos gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Aktivisten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-activisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är politiska aktivister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Aktivistische Schwule"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män som är politiska aktivister"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men working to bring about political or social change through public organizing."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que trabajan para lograr cambios políticos o sociales a través de la organización pública."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die sich durch öffentliche Organisation für politische oder soziale Veränderungen einsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die politieke of sociale verandering proberen te bewerkstelligen door middel van publieke acties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som verkar för politisk eller social förändring genom offentlig organisering och mobilisering."}],"skos:broader":