bst als afrokanadisch bezeichnen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen van Afrikaanse afkomst geboren in Canada of intersekse personen geboren in Afrikaanse landen die wonen in of een sterke band hebben met Canada. Gebruik voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Afro-Canadees."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner av afrikansk härkomst födda i Kanada eller intersexpersoner födda i afrikanska länder som bor i eller har en stark anknytning till Kanada. Används för individer som identifierar sig som afrokanadensare."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000016"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002764"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-09-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000017","dc:identifier":"homoit0000017","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Afro-Caribbean LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Afrokaribische LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ afrocaribeñas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afro-Caribische LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Afrokaribiska hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Afro-Caribbean people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Afro-Caribbeans (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Afro-Caribbean people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Afro-Caribbeans"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+-afrokaribische Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afrocaribeños LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas afrocaribeñas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afrocaribeños (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afrocaribeñas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afrocaribeñas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ afrocaribeñxs"},{"@languag