ilie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Knismolagnia"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tickling is the act of touching a part of a body in a way that causes involuntary twitching movements and/or laughter."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cosquillear es el acto de tocar una parte del cuerpo de una manera que provoca movimientos espasmódicos involuntarios y/o risa."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kittling är att röra vid en kroppsdel på ett sätt som framkallar ofrivilliga ryckningar och/eller skratt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000036"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003141","dc:identifier":"homoit0003141","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-sadomasochism"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Anti-Sadomasochismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anti-sadomasochisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Anti-sadomasochism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Antisadomasochism"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sadomasochism-fientlighet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Opposition to various practices or fantasies involving sadomasochism or power exchange."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ablehnung verschiedener Praktiken oder Fantasien, die Sadomasochismus oder Machtaustausch beinhalten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bezwaar tegen verschillende praktijken of fantasieën die te maken hebben met sadomasochisme of machtsuitwisseling."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Motstånd mot olika praktiker eller fantasier som involverar sadomasochism eller maktutbyte."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003140"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000036"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003140"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404","dc:identifier":"homoit0000404","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Eroticism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erotismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erotismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotiek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Eroticism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Erotizismus"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The quality of being erotic, or causing sexual attraction, arousal, or desire. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"La cualidad de ser erótico, o causar atracción, excitación o deseo sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Eigenschaft, erotisch zu sein oder sexuelle Anziehung, Erregung oder Begierde hervorzurufen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De kwaliteit van het erotisch zijn, of seksuele aantrekking, opwinding of verlangen veroorzaken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Egenskapen att vara erotisk, eller att framkalla sexuell attraktion, upphetsning eller begär."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001806"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001112"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001284"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/eroticism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000037","dc:identifier":"homoit0000037","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"ta","@value":"Ali"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ali"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ali"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ali"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ali"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tamil slur for effeminate gay man; directly translates to hermaphrodite."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Insulto tamil para un hombre gay afeminado; se traduce como hermafrodita."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Tamilische Beleidigung für einen femininen schwulen Mann; lässt sich direkt mit Hermaphrodit übersetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tamil scheldwoord voor verwijfde homoseksuele man; kan vertaald worden als hermafrodiet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tamilsk nedlåtande term för feminina bögar, kan översättas till hermafrodit."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001560"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ali"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627","dc:identifier":"homoit0000627","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexuals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Heterosexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexuelle"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes hétérosexuelles"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksuelen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas heterosexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas hétero"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexuelle Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hétéros"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hétérosexuelles"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hétérosexuels"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who are romantically and sexually attracted to members of the opposite sex or gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se sienten atraídas romántica y sexualmente por miembros del sexo o género opuesto."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die sich romantisch und sexuell zu Angehörigen des anderen biologischen oder sozialen Geschlechts hingezogen fühlen."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui sont attirées romantiquement et sexuellement par des personnes du sexe ou du genre opposé."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zich romantisch en seksueel aangetrokken voelen tot leden van het andere geslacht of gender."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som är romantiskt och sexuellt attraherade av personer av motsatt kön."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000626"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000629"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000630"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002285"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000624"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000631"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001531"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001915"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93003546"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexuals"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000538","dc:identifier":"homoit0000538","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay-straight alliances"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alianzas Gay-Heterosexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gay-straight allianties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay-straight alliances"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"GSAs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alianza de Género y Sexualidad"},{"@language":"es","@value":"AGS"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Alliances to make schools, sports clubs, etc. safe and welcoming to all people regardless of sexual orientation or gender identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alianzas para hacer que las escuelas, clubes deportivos, etc. sean seguros y acogedores para todas las personas sin importar su orientación sexual o identidad de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"allianties om scholen, sportclubs, etc. veilig en gastvrij te maken voor iedereen, ongeacht seksueleorientatie of genderidentiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Allianser som arbetar för att skolor, idrottsklubbar m.m. ska vara trygga och välkomnande för alla oavsett sexuell läggning eller könsidentitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000873"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003693"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95009772"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gay-straightAlliances"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000873","dc:identifier":"homoit0000873","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ friendliness"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amabilidad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-vriendelijkheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-vänlighet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ friendliness"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-vänligt"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Places, policies, people, or institutions that are open and welcoming to LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lugares, políticas, personas o instituciones abiertas y acogedoras para las personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Plaatsen, beleid, mensen of instellingen die open en gastvrij zijn voor LGBTQ+-mensen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Platser, policies, personer eller institutioner som är öppna och välkomnande för hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000538"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001117"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003693"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000873"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQFriendliness"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003693","dc:identifier":"homoit0003693","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ safe spaces"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-veilige ruimtes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trygga platser (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Safe spaces (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Safe places (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ safe places"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ safe zones"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Safe zones (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-veilige plekken"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-veilige zones"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Veilige plekken (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Veilige ruimtes (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Veilige zones (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Safe spaces (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public spaces designated as safe for, or accepting and affirming of, LGBTQ+ people, often by allies. LGBTQ+ safe spaces are sometimes identified through the display of stickers or placards."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Openbare ruimtes die zijn aangewezen als veilig voor, of accepterend en bevestigend voor LHBTQ+-personen, vaak door bondgenoten. LHBTQ+-veilige ruimtes worden soms aangegeven door middel van stickers of bordjes."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentliga platser som utsetts till trygga för eller bekräftande av hbtq+-personer, ofta genom allierades stöd. Ofta märkta med dekaler eller skyltar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003699"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000538"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000873"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2023000011"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000900"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000039","dc:identifier":"homoit0000039","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"mov","@value":"Alyha"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alyha"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Alyha"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Alyha"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alyha"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"In Native American Mohave tribes, people assigned male at birth who exhibit feminine traits and could become socially female, often serving as healers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"En las tribus nativas americanas mohave, las personas asignadas al sexo masculino al nacer que exhiben rasgos femeninos y pueden convertirse socialmente en mujeres, a menudo sirviendo como curanderos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen uramerikansicher Mohave-Stämme, die bei der Geburt männlich eingestuft wurden, aber weibliche Züge aufweisen, in der Gesellschaft als Frauen leben und oft als Heilerinnen arbeiten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In Native American Mohave-stammen mensen die bij de geboorte als man zijn toegewezen en die vrouwelijke eigenschappen vertonen en sociaal vrouwelijk zijn, vaak als genezers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer inom Mohavefolket i Nordamerika som tilldelats manligt kön vid födseln, uppvisar feminina drag och har möjlighet att leva som kvinnor i samhället, ofta med rollen som helare."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000654"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/alyha"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000654","dc:identifier":"homoit0000654","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"mov","@value":"Hwame"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hwame"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hwame"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hwame"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"In Native American Mohave tribes, hwame are people assigned female at birth who exhibit masculine traits and are socially male."},{"@language":"es","@value":"En las tribus nativas americanas mohave, los hwame son personas asignadas al sexo femenino al nacer que exhiben rasgos masculinos y son socialmente masculinos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In Native American Mohave-stammen, mensen bij de geboorte als vrouw toegewezen en mannelijke eigenschappen vertoonden, die in sociaal opzicht man konden worden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inom Mohave-folket i Nordamerika avser hwame personer som tilldelats kvinnligt kön vid födseln men som uppvisar maskulina drag och har en socialt manlig position."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000039"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hwame"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480","dc:identifier":"homoit0001480","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited people"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous people in North America who self-identify as Two-Spirit to reconnect with the multiple gender and sexual roles in Native cultures."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas de Norteamérica que se autoidentifican como dos espíritus para reconectar con los múltiples roles sexuales y de género en las culturas nativas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"term die gebruikt wordt door de inheemse bevolking in noord-amerika om de vele oorspronkelijke gender- en seksuele rollen in de inheemse culturen weer te geven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer från urfolk i Nordamerika som identifierar sig som Two-spirit för att återknyta till de många könsroller och sexuella roller i som finns i nordamerikanska urfolkskulturer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001750"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001760"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001764"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001778"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001787"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001936"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001997"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002035"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002666"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002678"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002682"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002709"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002717"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002734"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002817"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003046"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003230"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003244"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003261"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003276"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003546"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003619"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003646"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003686"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003748"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003761"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003903"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003954"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003999"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004225"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004228"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004231"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004232"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004233"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003926"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004355"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004368"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004369"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004388"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004399"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004410"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004421"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004438"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004451"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004462"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004483"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004494"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004504"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004640"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004645"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000039"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000098"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000353"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000654"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000966"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001035"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001037"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001043"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001044"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001147"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001372"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001809"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001810"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001811"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002213"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002689"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95004103"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/two-spiritPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000040","dc:identifier":"homoit0000040","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Amazons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amazonas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Amazonen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Amazones"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Amazonen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Amasoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nation of all-female warriors in Greek mythology and Classical antiquity; from the Early Modern period, their name has become a term for woman warriors in general as well as a cultural symbol invoked in lesbian communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nación de guerreras exclusivamente mujeres en la mitología griega y la antigüedad clásica. Desde el período moderno temprano, su nombre se ha convertido en un término para las mujeres guerreras en general, así como en un símbolo cultural invocado en las comunidades lesbianas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Volk rein weiblicher Kriegerinnen in der griechischen Mythologie und der klassischen Antike; seit der frühen Neuzeit ist ihr Name zu einer Bezeichnung für Kriegerinnen im Allgemeinen geworden sowie zu einem kulturellen Symbol, das in lesbischen Gemeinschaften verwendet wird."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Peuple légendaire de femmes guerrières et indépendantes qui vivaient sans hommes dans la mythologie grecque et l'antiquité classique; depuis le début de la période moderne, leur nom est devenu un terme désignant les femmes douées de qualités guerrières ainsi qu'un symbole culturel invoqué dans les communautés lesbiennes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"naam die de grieken gaven aan een mythisch volk van vrouwelijke strijders; in de westerse moderniteit, vooral in de populaire cultuur, wordt het begrip amazonen ook gebruikt voor vrouwelijke strijders in het algemeen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rike av kvinnliga krigare från grekisk mytologi och den klassiska antiken. Från tidigmodern tid har deras namn blivit en beteckning för kvinnliga krigare i allmänhet samt en kulturell symbol inom lesbiska gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85004138"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/amazons"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509","dc:identifier":"homoit0001509","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Frauen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hembras"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are women. "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erwachsene, die sich selbst als Frauen identifizieren und ihr Geschlecht im Sinne westlicher Vorstellungen von Weiblichkeit, weiblichen Eigenschaften und/oder Feminität verstehen. Der Begriff wird in der Regel als erwachsene weibliche Menschen definiert, obwohl sich nicht alle Frauen mit dem Begriff „weiblich” identifizieren, je nachdem, in welchem Kontext er verwendet wird."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas adultas que se autoidentifican como mujeres y entienden su género en términos de las concepciones occidentales del ser mujer, lo femenino y/o la feminidad. El término normalmente se ha definido como humanas adultas femeninas, aunque no todas las mujeres se autoidentifican con el término \"femenino\" según el contexto en el que se utiliza."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Volwassenen die zichzelf als vrouw identificeren en hun gender zien in termen van westerse opvattingen over vrouwelijkheid. De term is meestal gedefinieerd als volwassen vrouwelijke personen, hoewel niet alle vrouwen zich identificeren met de term \"vrouwelijk\", afhankelijk van de context waarin het wordt gebruikt"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vuxna personer som identifierar sig som kvinnor och som förstår sitt kön i relation till västerländska föreställningar om kvinnlighet, feminitet och/eller könskategorin kvinna. Termen har vanligtvis definierats som vuxna människor av kvinnligt kön, men alla kvinnor identifierar sig inte med termen ”kvinna” beroende på sammanhanget där den används."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000040"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000202"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000272"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000629"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001510"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001642"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002279"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003224"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004637"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004638"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004639"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001227"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000271"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000322"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000563"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001008"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001505"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001516"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002216"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004640"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85147274"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/women"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556","dc:identifier":"homoit0000556","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Lesbiennes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay women"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian women"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas lesbianas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who self-identify as lesbian and belong to lesbian communities. The term has been predominately used to describe women who are exclusively or primarily romantically and/or sexually attracted to other women. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se identifican como lesbianas y pertenecen a comunidades lesbianas. El término se ha utilizado predominantemente para describir a mujeres que se sienten exclusiva o principalmente atraídas romántica y/o sexualmente por otras mujeres. Sin embargo, no todas las lesbianas son mujeres, y las personas disidentes de género que pertenecen a comunidades lésbicas a menudo se han identificado como lesbianas."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui s'identifient comme lesbiennes et appartiennent à des communautés lesbiennes. Le terme a été principalement utilisé pour décrire les femmes qui sont exclusivement ou principalement attirées romantiquement eou sexuellement par d'autres femmes. Cependant, toutes les lesbiennes ne sont pas des femmes, et les personnes non conformes au genre qui appartiennent à des communautés lesbiennes se sont souvent identifiées comme lesbiennes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zichzelf als lesbische vrouw identificeren en tot lesbische gemeenschappen behoren. De term is voornamelijk gebruikt om vrouwen te beschrijven die zich uitsluitend of voornamelijk romantisch en/of seksueel aangetrokken voelen tot andere vrouwen. Niet alle lesbische vrouwen zijn echter vrouwen, en niet-genderconformerende personen die tot een lesbische gemeenschappen behoren, hebben zich vaak als lesbisch geïdentificeerd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som identifierar sig som lesbiska och tillhör lesbiska gemenskaper. Termen används framför allt för att beskriva kvinnor som uteslutande eller huvudsakligen är romantiskt och/eller sexuellt attraherade av andra kvinnor. Alla som identifierar sig som lesbiska är dock inte kvinnor."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000088"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000287"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000786"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000971"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001056"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003040"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003932"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004641"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000040"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000058"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000231"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000384"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000454"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000499"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000647"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000729"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000744"},{"@id":"https://h