s o más personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Voortdurende verbintenissen (romantisch, seksueel of platonisch) tussen twee of meer LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pågående relationer, romantiska, sexuella eller platoniska, mellan två eller flera hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000182"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000230"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000310"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000315"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000455"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000529"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000628"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000663"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000773"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001205"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001302"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002514"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002807"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002939"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003592"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003821"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004631"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000362"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000937"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001083"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001311"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002189"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002722"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004646"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/relationshipsLGBTQ"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001532","dc:identifier":"homoit0001532","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Amatonormativity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amatonormatividad"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Amatonormativität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Amatonormativiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Amatonormativitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The assumption that all people share a desire for romantic relationships and that this is a preferential life goal."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La suposición de que todas las personas comparten el deseo de tener relaciones románticas y que este es un objetivo de vida preferencial."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Annahme, dass alle Personen den Wunsch nach romantischen Beziehungen haben und eine solche ein bevorzugtes Lebensziel ist."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De veronderstelling dat alle mensen een verlangen naar romantische relaties delen en dat dit een te prefereren levensdoel is"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antagandet att alla människor har en önskan om romantiska relationer och att detta är ett föredraget livsmål."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000356"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001650"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/amatonormativity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001757","dc:identifier":"homoit0001757","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic families"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias arrománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Familien"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Familles aromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische gezinnen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantiska familjer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aro families"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias aro"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aro-Familien"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Families, whether biological, adoptive, or chosen, in which one or more individuals identify as aromantic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias, ya sean biológicas, adoptivas o elegidas, en las que una o más personas se autoidentifican como arrománticas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Familien, ob biologische, Adoptiv- oder Wahlfamilien, in denen sich eine oder mehrere Personen als aromantisch identifizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Familles biologiques, adoptives ou choisies, dans lesquelles une ou plusieurs personnes s'identifient comme aromantiques."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gezinnen, biologisch, adoptief of gekozen, waarin een of meer individuen zich identificeren als aromantisch."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjer – biologiska, adoptiva eller valda – där en eller flera personer identifierar sig som aromantiska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001761"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001765"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-11-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001761","dc:identifier":"homoit0001761","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres y padres arrománticos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Eltern"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Parents aromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische ouders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantiska föräldrar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aro parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres aro"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres aro"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres arrománticos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres arrománticos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aro-Eltern"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Parents who are aromantic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres y/o madres que son arrománticos. "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eltern, die aromantisch sind."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Parents qui sont aromantiques."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ouders die aromantisch zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Föräldrar som är aromantiska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001075"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001757"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001765"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-11-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001765","dc:identifier":"homoit0001765","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Children of aromantic people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kinder von aromantischen Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijxs de personas aromáticas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Enfants de personnes aromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kinderen van aromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Barn till aromantiska personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Children of aro people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kinder von Aro-Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijos de personas arro"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de personas aromáticas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de personas arro"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijos e hijas de personas aromáticas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Children who have one or more aromantic parent."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kinder, die einen oder mehrere aromantische Elternteile haben."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijos o hijas que tienen uno o más padres arománticos."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Enfants dont un ou plusieurs parents sont aromantiques."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kinderen die een of meer aromantische ouders hebben"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Barn som har en eller flera aromantiska föräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000260"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001757"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001761"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-11-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823","dc:identifier":"homoit0001823","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Alloromantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas alorrománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Alloromantische Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes alloromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Alloromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alloromantiska"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"fr","@value":"Alloromantiques"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who experience romantic attraction or desire in a frequent and consistent manner, often alongside sexual attraction."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que experimentan atracción o deseo romántico de manera frecuente y constante, a menudo junto con la atracción sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die regelmäßig und in beständiger Weise romantische Anziehung und Begierde erleben, oft einhergehend mit sexueller Anziehung."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui éprouvent une attirance ou un désir romantique de manière fréquente et constante, souvent en même temps qu'une attirance sexuelle."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die op een frequente en consistente manier romantische aantrekkingskracht of romantisch verlangen ervaren, vaak naast seksuele aantrekking"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Individer som ofta och konsekvent upplever romantisk attraktion eller begär, ofta tillsammans med sexuell attraktion."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001824"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001825"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001826"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001827"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001791"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001824","dc:identifier":"homoit0001824","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Biromantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas birrománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Biromantische Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes biromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Biromantiska personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who experience romantic attraction or desire in a frequent and consistent manner toward people of more than one sex or gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que experimentan atracción o deseo romántico de forma frecuente y constante hacia personas de más de un sexo o género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die häufig und beständig romantische Anziehung oder romantisches Verlangen für Menschen verschiedener biologischer oder sozialer Geschlechter empfinden."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui éprouvent des sentiments romantiques envers plus d'un genre."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen die op een frequente en consistente manier romantische aantrekkingskracht of romantisch verlangen ervaren jegens mensen van meer dan één gender"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som upplever romantisk attraktion eller längtan efter romantiska relationer regelbundet och återkommande gentemot mer än ett kön eller en könsidentitet."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001829"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001792"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001825"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001826"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001827"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001825","dc:identifier":"homoit0001825","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Homoromantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas homorománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homoromantische Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes homoromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homoromantiska personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"fr","@value":"Homoromantiques"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who experience romantic attraction or desire in a frequent and consistent manner toward members of the same sex or gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que experimentan atracción o deseo romántico de manera frecuente y constante hacia miembros del mismo sexo o género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die häufig und beständig romantische Anziehung oder Begehren gegenüber Personen desselben biologischen oder sozialen Geschlechts empfinden."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui éprouvent une attirance ou un désir romantique de manière fréquente et constante à l'égard de personnes du même sexe ou du même genre."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen die op een frequente en consistente manier romantische aantrekkingskracht of romantisch verlangen ervaren jegens leden van hetzelfde gender of hetzelfde geslacht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som ofta och konsekvent upplever romantisk attraktion eller längtan gentemot personer av samma kön."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001829"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001793"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001824"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001826"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001827"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001826","dc:identifier":"homoit0001826","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heteroromantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas heterorománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heteroromantische Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes hétéroromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heteroromantiska personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes hétéro-romantiques"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who experience romantic attraction or romantic desire in a frequent and consistent manner toward members of the opposite sex or gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que experimentan atracción romántica o deseo romántico de manera frecuente y consistente hacia miembros del sexo o género opuesto."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die häufig und beständig romantische Anziehung oder romantisches Verlangen gegenüber Angehörigen des anderen Geschlechts empfinden."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui éprouvent une attirance romantique ou un désir romantique de manière fréquente et constante envers des personnes de sexe opposé ou de genre opposé."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen die op een frequente en consistente manier romantische aantrekkingskracht of romantisch verlangen ervaren jegens leden van het andere geslacht of geslacht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som ofta och konsekvent upplever romantisk attraktion eller romantisk längtan efter personer av motsatt kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001794"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001824"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001825"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001827"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001827","dc:identifier":"homoit0001827","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Panromantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas panrománticas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes panromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Panromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Panromantiska personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who experience romantic attraction or romantic desire toward others in a frequent and consistent manner irrespective of sex or gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que experimentan atracción romántica o deseo romántico hacia otras personas de manera frecuente y consistente, independientemente de su sexo o género."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui éprouvent une attirance romantique ou un désir romantique à l'égard d'autres personnes, indépendamment du sexe ou du genre."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen die op een frequente en consistente manier romantische aantrekkingskracht of romantisch verlangen naar anderen ervaren, ongeacht gender of geslacht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som upplever romantisk attraktion eller längtan på ett frekvent och konsekvent sätt, oavsett kön eller könsidentitet hos andra."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001829"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001795"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001824"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001825"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001826"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001823"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002145","dc:identifier":"homoit0002145","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic people in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas arrománticas en fandom"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Personen im Fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische personen in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantiska personer inom fandom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantics in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arrománticos en fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arrománticas en fandom"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Personen im Fantum"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The participation and inclusion of aromantic people in fan communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La participación e inclusion de personas arrománticas en comunidades de fans."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Teilnahme und Einbeziehung aromantischer Menschen in Fan-Communitys."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De participatie en inclusie van aromantische personen in fan-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantiska personers deltagande och inkludering i fangemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002181"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001748"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001753"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000068","dc:identifier":"homoit0000068","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arrests of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Detenciones de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Festnahmen von LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Arrestaties van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arresteringar av hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arrests of LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Detenciones de personas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arrestos de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arrestos de personas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Verhaftungen von LGPTQ+-Personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Apprehension and detention of LGBTQ+ people by an institution or authority in order to deprive them of their freedom of movement."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aprehensión y detención de personas LGBTQ+ por parte de una institución o autoridad con el fin de privarlas de su libertad de movimiento."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Festnahme und Inhaftierung von LGBTQ+-Personen durch eine Institution oder Behörde, um ihnen ihre Bewegungsfreiheit zu entziehen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aanhouding en detentie van LHBTQ+-personen door een instelling of autoriteit om hen hun bewegingsvrijheid te ontnemen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioners eller myndigheters gripande och frihetsberövande av hbtq+-personer för att inskränka deras rörelsefrihet."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000835"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001120"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/arrestsOfLGBTQPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348","dc:identifier":"homoit0000348","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Detention of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Detención de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Freiheitsentzug von LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Detentie van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frihetsberövande av hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Detention of LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Detención de personas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Festnahme von LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inhaftierung von LGBTQ+-Personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Temporary physical and legal confinement of LGBTQ+ people by an institution or authority, typically pending criminal charges or deportation. Can also be used to describe individuals held in custody for political purposes or within the context of war."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Confinamiento físico y legal temporal de personas LGBTQ+ por parte de una institución o autoridad, generalmente en espera de cargos penales o deportación. También se puede utilizar para describir a personas detenidas por motivos políticos o en contexto de guerra."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Vorübergehende physische und rechtliche Freiheitsentziehung von LGBTQ+-Personen durch eine Institution oder Behörde, in der Regel bis zur strafrechtlichen Verfolgung oder Abschiebung. Kann auch verwendet werden, um Personen zu beschreiben, die aus politischen Gründen oder im Rahmen eines Krieges in Haft gehalten werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tijdelijke fysieke en juridische opsluiting van LHBTQ+-personen door een instelling of autoriteit, meestal in afwachting van strafrechtelijke vervolging of deportatie. Kan ook worden gebruikt om personen te beschrijven die in hechtenis worden gehouden voor politieke doeleinden of in de context van oorlog."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillfälligt fysiskt frihetsberövande av hbtq+-personer av en institution eller myndighet, vanligtvis i väntan på åtal eller deportation. Kan även användas för att beskriva personer som hålls frihetsberövade av politiska skäl eller inom en krigskontext."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000068"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000349"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000884"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000712"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000883"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000887"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/detentionOfLGBTQPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373","dc:identifier":"homoit0002373","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police interactions with LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Interacciones policiales con personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-interacties met LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisens interaktioner med hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police treatment of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Policing and the LGBTQ+ community"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tratamiento policial de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vigilancia y la comunidad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie en de LHBTQ+-gemeenschap"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term including any of various forms of interactions between police and LGBTQ+ individuals or communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general que incluye cualquiera de las diversas formas de interacción entre la policía y personas o comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term die elke vorm van interactie tussen de politie en LHBTQ+-personen of -gemeenschappen omvat."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Paraplyterm för olika typer av interaktion mellan polis och hbtq+-personer eller hbtq+-gemenskaper."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000068"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002374"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002375"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002392"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002394"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002396"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001289"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001326"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001349"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000835","dc:identifier":"homoit0000835","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ civil disobedience"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Desobediencia civil LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+による市民的不服従"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-burgerlijke ongehoorzaamheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Civil olydnad (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ civil disobedience"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Desobediencia civil (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQによる市民的不服従"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The active, professed refusal of LGBTQ+ people to obey certain laws or governmental orders as a form of activism and resistance."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La negación activa y declarada de personas LGBTQ+ a obedecer ciertas leyes u órdenes gubernamentales como forma de activismo y resistencia."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々が、活動や抵抗の一形態として、特定の法律や政府の命令に従うことを積極的に公然と拒否すること。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De actieve, uitgesproken weigering van LHBTQ+-personen om bepaalde wetten of overheidsbevelen te gehoorzamen als een vorm van activisme en verzet."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aktiv och uttalad vägran från hbtq+-personer att lyda vissa lagar eller statliga beslut som en form av aktivism och motstånd."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000068"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQCivilDisobedience"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001120","dc:identifier":"homoit0001120","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police entrapment"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aprisionamiento policial"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Uitlokking door politie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Brottsprovokationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Agentes encubiertos"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stingoperationer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A practice in which law enforcement agents or agents of the state coerce an individual to commit a \"crime\" they would have otherwise been unlikely or unwilling to commit. Legal definitions of entrapment vary widely depending on the jurisdiction, but the term is often used colloquially to refer to police acting dishonestly or in bad faith, as well as policing focused on anticipating and inducing crime, rather than responding to reports of crime."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Práctica en la que los agentes de las fuerzas de seguridad o los agentes del Estado fuerzan a una persona a cometer un \"delito\" que, de otro modo, probablemente no cometería o no estaría dispuesta a cometer. Las definiciones jurídicas de la trampa varían mucho en función de la jurisdicción, pero el término se utiliza a menudo coloquialmente para referirse a la policía que actúa de forma deshonesta o de mala fe, así como a la actuación policial centrada en anticipar e inducir el delito, en lugar de responder a las denuncias de delitos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een praktijk waarbij wetshandhavers of politieagenten staat een individu dwingen een \"misdaad\" te plegen die hij anders waarschijnlijk niet zou hebben gepleegd of niet zou hebben willen plegen. Juridische definities van \"uitlokking\" variëren sterk, afhankelijk van het rechtsgebied, maar de term wordt vaak in de volksmond gebruikt om te verwijzen naar politie die oneerlijk of te kwader trouw handelt, evenals politiewerk dat zich richt op het anticiperen op en veroorzaken van criminaliteit, in plaats van te reageren op meldingen van criminaliteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En metod där polisen eller andra statliga aktörer förmår en person att begå ett brott som hen annars inte skulle ha begått. Juridiska definitioner av ”provokation” varierar mellan jurisdiktioner, men i vardagsspråk används termen ofta för att beskriva situationer där polis agerar oärligt, i ond tro eller med syfte att framkalla snarare än att reagera på anmälda brott."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001121"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002374"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000068"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85044146"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/policeEntrapment"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000069","dc:identifier":"homoit0000069","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Insemination"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inseminación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inseminatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Insemination"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fertilisation"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Fertilization"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fertilización"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The act of using sperm to induce pregnancy by natural or artificial means, especially in the context of LGBTQ+ family planning with sperm donors."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El acto de utilizar esperma para inducir el embarazo por medios naturales o artificiales, especialmente en el contexto de la planificación familiar LGBTQ+ con donantes de esperma."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het gebruik van sperma om op natuurlijke of kunstmatige wijze zwangerschap te induceren, met name in de context van LGBTQ+-gezinsplanning met spermadonoren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Användning av spermier för att åstadkomma graviditet genom naturliga eller artificiella metoder, särskilt i samband med familjebildning för hbtq+-personer med spermiedonatorer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000843"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001265"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002617"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002620"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001336"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85008176"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/insemination"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000843","dc:identifier":"homoit0000843","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Conception by LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Concepción por personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Reproduktion bei LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Conceptie door LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skaffa barn (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Conception by LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Concepción por parte de personas LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term used to describe the processes by which LGBTQ+ people conceive children, including an LGBTQ+ person, their partner, or a third party becoming pregnant with a child that will be raised by an LGBTQ+ person, as well as LGBTQ+ people conceiving children that will be raised by other parents."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general utilizado para describir los procesos mediante los cuales las personas LGBTQ+ conciben niños, incluyendo a una persona LGBTQ+, su pareja o una tercera persona que queda embarazada con un niño que será criado por una persona LGBTQ+, así como personas LGBTQ+ que conciben niños que serán criados por otros padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Überbegriff für die Prozesse, durch die LGBTQ+-Personen Kinder bekommen, einschliesslich Situationen, in denen eine LGBTQ+-Person, ihre Partnerperson oder eine Drittperson mit einem Kind schwanger wird, das von einer LGBTQ+-Person aufgezogen wird, sowie Situationen, in denen LGBTQ+-Personen Kinder bekommen, die von anderen Eltern grossgezogen werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term die wordt gebruikt om de processen te beschrijven waarmee LHBTQ+-personen kinderen verwekken, inclusief een LHBTQ+-persoon, hun partner of een derde die zwanger wordt van een kind dat zal worden opgevoed door een LHBTQ+-persoon, evenals LHBTQ+-personen die kinderen verwekken die zullen worden opgevoed door andere ouders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Paraplyterm som används för att beskriva de processer genom vilka hbtq+-personer får barn, inklusive att en hbtq+-person, deras partner eller en tredje part blir gravid med ett barn som ska uppfostras av en hbtq+-person, samt att hbtq+-personer får barn som uppfostras av andra föräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000069"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000659"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001265"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001347"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000121"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000347"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001075"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ConceptionByLGBTQPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001265","dc:identifier":"homoit0001265","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Self-insemination"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Autoinseminación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zelfinseminatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självinsemination"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självinseminering"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The practice of using collected sperm to induce one's own pregnancy outside of a clinical environment."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La práctica de utilizar esperma recolectado para inducir el propio embarazo fuera de un entorno clínico."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gebruik van sperma om zwangerschap op te wekken buiten een klinische omgeving."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Praktiken att använda insamlad sperma för att själv framkalla graviditet utanför en klinisk miljö."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000069"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000843"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh97001526"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/self-insemination"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002617","dc:identifier":"homoit0002617","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Artificial insemination "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Künstliche Besamung"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inseminación artificial"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kunstmatige inseminatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Konstgjord befrukning"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Fertilización artificial"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The introduction of semen into the cervical opening, uterus, or fallopian tube using assistance from reproductive technology. Some choose not to use this term due to the implications of the word \"artificial.\""},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Einführung von Sperma in die Gebärmutterhalsöffnung, die Gebärmutter oder den Eileiter mithilfe von Reproduktionstechnologie. Einige vermeiden diesen Begriff aufgrund der Implikationen des Wortes „künstlich“."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La introducción de semen en la apertura cervical, el útero o las trompas de Falopio con la ayuda de tecnología reproductiva. Algunos optan por no utilizar este término por las implicaciones de la palabra \"artificial\"."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De injectie van sperma in de baarmoederhalsopening, baarmoeder of eileider met behulp van voortplantingstechnologie. Sommigen kiezen ervoor om deze term niet te gebruiken vanwege de implicaties van het woord \"kunstmatig\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Införande av sädesvätska i livmodermunnen, livmodern eller äggledaren med hjälp av assisterad reproduktionsteknik. Vissa väljer att inte använda denna term på grund av ordet ”konstgjord” och dess implikationer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000069"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001336"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003501"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85008176"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002620","dc:identifier":"homoit0002620","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Donor insemination "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Befruchtung mit gespendetem Sperma"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inseminación de donante"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Donorinseminatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inseminering med donerade spermier"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Spendespermabefruchtung"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Spender-Befruchtung"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fertilización de donante"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The process by which donated sperm is placed inside a person with a uterus to induce pregnancy."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Der Vorgang, bei dem gespendetes Sperma in eine Gebärmutter eingebracht wird, um eine Schwangerschaft herbeizuführen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El proceso mediante el cual se coloca esperma donado dentro de una persona con útero para inducir el embarazo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het proces waarbij gedoneerd sperma in een persoon met een baarmoeder wordt geplaatst om zwangerschap te veroorzaken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Processen där donerade spermier förs in i en person med livmoder för att framkalla graviditet."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000069"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001336"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002626"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85008176"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001336","dc:identifier":"homoit0001336","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sperm donors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes de esperma"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Spermadonoren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Spermadonatorer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals of any gender who donate their own sperm for the purpose of inducing pregnancy."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de cualquier género que donan su propio esperma con el fin de inducir el embarazo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die sperma doneren om een zwangerschap op te wekken; kan worden gebruikt met betrekking tot LGBTQ+-spermadonors en LGBTQ+-ers die gebruik maken van de diensten van spermadonors"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer av alla kön som donerar sin egen sperma i syfte att framkalla graviditet."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002620"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000069"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002617"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002626"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2012000148"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/spermDonors"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618","dc:identifier":"homoit0002618","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Assisted reproduction "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Reproducción asistida"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Künstliche Befruchtung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geassisteerde reproductie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Assisterad befruktning"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Assistierte Reproduktion"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The process by which a fetus is conceived through donor insemination, egg donation, surrogacy, IVF, and/or other reproductive technologies."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Proceso por el que se concibe un feto mediante ila nseminación de un donante, la donación de óvulos, la gestación subrogada, la FIV y/u otras tecnologías reproductivas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Der Prozess, durch den ein Fötus durch Spenderbefruchtung, Eizellspende, Leihmutterschaft, IVF und/oder andere Reproduktionstechnologien gezeugt wird."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het proces waarbij een foetus wordt verwekt door middel van donorinseminatie, eiceldonatie, draagmoederschap, IVF en/of andere reproductieve technologieën."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Processen där ett foster blir till genom donatorinsemination, äggdonation, surrogatmoderskap, IVF och/eller andra reproduktionstekniker."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002619"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000659"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001265"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001347"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002617"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002620"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002622"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002626"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000069"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002616"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh88005587"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002619"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864","dc:identifier":"homoit0000864","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ family planning"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Planificación familiar LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ の家族計画"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-gezinsplanning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjeplanering (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ family planning"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ の家族計画"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The practice of determining the shape of a family by LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La práctica de determinar la forma de una familia por parte de personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々が自らの家族の在り方を決定するという取り組み。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De praktijk van het bepalen van de vorm van een gezin door LGBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Praktiken att hbtq+-personer själva definierar och planerar hur en familj ska se ut."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000809"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000843"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000347"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000390"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000811"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000819"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000871"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit