tress/submissive dynamic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres transgénero que forman parte de la escena BDSM y asumen el rol de amas en relaciones sexuales con una dinámica ama/esclava."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transvrouwen die deel uitmaken van de BDSM-scene en de rol van meesteres op zich nemen in seksuele relaties met een meesteres/onderdanige dynamiek."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transkvinnor som intar en härskarinne-roll i kinkaktiviteter och/eller i maktutbytesrelationer med en härskarinna/undergiven-dynamik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001018"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000161"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000751"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001186"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderMistresses"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000177","dc:identifier":"homoit0000177","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual press"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Presse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa bisexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele pers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuell press"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Medien"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diarios bisexuales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at bisexual audiences and/or operated by bisexual people."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zeitungen, Zeitschriften oder andere Publikationsorgane, die sich an ein bisexuelles Publikum richten und/oder von bisexuellen Personen betrieben werden."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos, revistas u otros medios editoriales dirigidos a audiencias bisexuales y/o operados por personas bisexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kranten, tijdschriften of andere publicaties die gericht zijn op biseksuele personen en/of worden gerund door biseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar, magasin eller andra publikationer som riktar sig till bisexuella och/eller drivs av bisexuella personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000166"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000167"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000162"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004625"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/bisexualPress"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003936","dc:identifier":"homoit0003936","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual demonstrations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella demonstrationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual protests"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele protestmarsen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against bisexual people and advocate for bisexual visibility, rights, and issues."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"171 / 5,000 Protestmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten om te protesteren tegen discriminatie tegen biseksuele personen en om op te komen voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. kwesties van biseksuele personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher, demonstrationer och andra stora, offentliga sammankomster organiserade för att protestera mot diskriminering av bisexuella och förespråka bisexuellas synlighet, bisexuellas rättigheter och frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000162"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-17"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322","dc:identifier":"homoit0001322","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Social movements"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimientos sociales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sociale bewegingen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sociala rörelser"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized efforts by groups of people to achieve certain political, social, economic, or cultural goals. Social movements are often intended to carry out, resist, or undo social changes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Esfuerzos organizados por grupos de personas para lograr ciertos objetivos políticos, sociales, económicos o culturales. Los movimientos sociales a menudo tienen como objetivo llevar a cabo, resistir o deshacer cambios sociales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde inspanningen van groepen personen om bepaalde politieke, sociale, economische of culturele doelen te bereiken. Sociale bewegingen zijn vaak bedoeld om sociale veranderingen te bereiken, tegen te gaan of ongedaan te maken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade insatser av grupper av människor som syftar till att uppnå vissa politiska, sociala, ekonomiska eller kulturella mål. Sociala rörelser syftar ofta till att genomföra, motverka eller förändra samhälleliga förändringar."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000411"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000438"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001010"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001319"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002390"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002391"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002398"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003737"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000672"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85123979"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/socialMovements"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000163","dc:identifier":"homoit0000163","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual museums"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Museen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Museos bisexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele musea"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella museer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Bi-Museen"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions dedicated to the storage, exhibition, conservation, and preservation of materials relating to bisexuality, bisexual people, or bisexual history."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Einrichtungen, die sich der Aufbewahrung, Ausstellung, Konservierung und Erhaltung von Materialien über bisexuelle Menschen und die bisexuelle Geschichte widmen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones dedicadas al almacenamiento, la exposición, la conservación y la preservación de materiales relacionados con las personas bisexuales y la historia bisexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die zich toeleggen op de opslag, tentoonstelling, conservering en bewaring van materialen met betrekking tot biseksuele personen en biseksuele geschiedenis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som ägnar sig åt insamling, utställning, bevarande och konservering av material som rör bisexualitet, bisexuella personer eller bisexuell historia."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001030"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001755"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/bisexualMuseums"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001030","dc:identifier":"homoit0001030","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ museums"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Museos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-musea"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-museum"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Museums (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Museos (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Museum (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions dedicated to the storage, exhibition, conservation, and preservation of materials relating to LGBTQ+ people, LGBTQ+ communities, and LGBTQ+ history."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones dedicadas al almacenamiento, la exhibición, la conservación y la preservación de materiales relacionados con las personas LGBTQ+, las comunidades LGBTQ+ y la historia LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die zich toeleggen op de opslag, tentoonstelling, conservering en bewaring van materialen met betrekking tot LHBTQ+-personen of LHBTQ+-geschiedenis."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som ägnar sig åt insamling, utställning, bevarande och konservering av material som rör hbtq+-personer, hbtq+-gemenskaper och hbtq+-historia."}],"skos:broader":{"@i