:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002578","dc:identifier":"homoit0002578","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"69ing "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hacer el 69"},{"@language":"de","@value":"69ern"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"69-en"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"69:an"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"69'ing"},{"@language":"en","@value":"69-ing"},{"@language":"en","@value":"69"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sixty-Nining"},{"@language":"es","@value":"69"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Posición 69"},{"@language":"de","@value":"69"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Neunundsechzig"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Soixante-neuf"},{"@language":"de","@value":"69nen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"69en"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Negenenzestigen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"69ing refers to an act of shared oral sex between two people simultaneously giving and receiving oral sex, said to look similar to the number 69."},{"@language":"es","@value":"69ing se refiere a un acto de sexo oral compartido entre dos personas, una encima de la otra, que dan y reciben sexo oral simultáneamente. Se dice que la posición se parece al número 69."},{"@language":"de","@value":"69ern bezieht sich auf den gemeinsamen Oralsex zwischen zwei Personen, die gleichzeitig Oralsex geben und empfangen, und soll der Zahl 69 ähneln."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"69-en verwijst naar wederzijdse orale seks tussen twee personen, hetgeen lijkt op het getal 69."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"69:an avser en akt av delat oralsex där två personer samtidigt ger och tar emot oralsex, vilket sägs likna siffran 69."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000593"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000212"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000239"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85095239"},"skos:hasTopC