ing (erotik)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inflatables"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Opblaasbare materialen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inflation (erotik), Distension (erotik)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inflation of the body, parts of the body, clothing, or inflatable objects with air or other substances for sexual arousal or erotic play."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inflar el cuerpo, partes del cuerpo, ropa u objetos inflables con aire u otras sustancias para excitación sexual o juegos eróticos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het opblazen van het lichaam, lichaamsdelen, kleding of opblaasbare voorwerpen met lucht of andere stoffen voor seksuele opwinding of erotisch spel."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell upphetsning genom att blåsa upp kroppen, kroppsdelar, kläder eller uppblåsbara objekt med luft eller andra ämnen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000213"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001246"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003098"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-18"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214","dc:identifier":"homoit0000214","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Body adornment"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adornamentos del cuerpo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Körperverzierung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lichaamsversiering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroppsutsmyckning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Body decoration"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Body alteration"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Body modification"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alteraciones corporales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Decoración corporal"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modificaciones corporales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adornos corporales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ornamentación corporal"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Körperschmuck"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Körpergestaltung"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Decoration or alteration of the human body for aesthetic or cultural purposes; includes body paint, tattooing, piercing, and scarification."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Decoración o alteración del cuerpo humano con fines estéticos o culturales; incluye la pintura corporal, los tatuajes, las perforaciones y las escarificaciones."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Verzierung oder Schmücken des menschlichen Körpers aus ästhetischen oder kulturellen Gründen; umfasst Schmuck, Make-up, Körperbemalung und temporäre Tattoos. Für Massnahmen, die den Körper verändern, den Begriff „Körpermodifikation“ verwenden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Versiering of wijziging van het menselijk lichaam voor esthetische of culturele doeleinden; omvat bodypaint, tatoeage, piercing en scarificatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dekoration eller förändring av människokroppen för estetiska eller kulturella syften. Inkluderar kroppsmålning, tatuering, piercing och scarification."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001114"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001356"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000294"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003076"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/bodyAdornments"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001114","dc:identifier":"homoit0001114","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Piercings"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Piercings"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Piercings"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Piercingar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Perforación"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Perforaciones"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Piercings"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Small holes or openings made in parts of the body to insert jewelry or implants, whether for aesthetic purposes, spiritual or religious reasons, or sexual pleasure."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pequeños agujeros o aperturas realizadas en partes del cuerpo para insertar joyas o implantes, ya sea con fines estéticos, espirituales o religiosos, o por placer sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kleine gaatjes of openingen in delen van het lichaam om sieraden of implantaten in te brengen, hetzij voor esthetische doeleinden, spirituele of religieuze redenen, of seksueel genot."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Små hål eller öppningar i kroppen där smycken eller implantat kan placeras, antingen av estetiska, andliga, religiösa eller sexuella skäl."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003076"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003077"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93005224"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/piercings"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001356","dc:identifier":"homoit0001356","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tattoos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tatuajes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tatoeages"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tatueringar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Body modifications in which permanent ink is inserted into the skin to form a design."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modificaciones corporales en las que se inserta tinta permanente en la piel para formar un diseño."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van lichaamsmodificatie waarbij permanente inkt in de huid wordt ingebracht om een ontwerp te vormen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroppsmodifieringar där permanent bläck förs in i huden för att skapa ett motiv."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003076"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85132770"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/tattoos"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000294","dc:identifier":"homoit0000294","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Collars"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Halsband"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Collares"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Halsbanden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Halsband (BDSM)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Collars"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Collar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Straps or bands of material worn around the neck. May be worn as a fashion statement, to signal \"ownership\" by a dominant partner within the context of a BDSM relationship, or during sex to restrict the wearer's movement and breath control."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Um den Hals getragene Riemen oder Bänder aus Stoff. Sie können als modisches Accessoire getragen werden, um im Rahmen einer BDSM-Beziehung die „Besitzansprüche” eines:einer dominanten Partner:in zu signalisieren, oder beim Sex, um die Bewegungsfreiheit und die Atemkontrolle des Tragenden einzuschränken."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Correas o bandas de tela que se llevan alrededor del cuello. Pueden llevarse como adorno de moda, como señal de «propiedad» por parte de una pareja dominante en el contexto de una relación BDSM, o durante las relaciones sexuales para restringir el movimiento y el control de la respiración de quien las lleva."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bandjes of banden van materiaal die om de nek worden gedragen. Kunnen worden gedragen als een mode-statement, om \"eigendom\" te signaleren door een dominante partner binnen de context van een BDSM-relatie, of tijdens seks om de beweging en ademhaling van de drager te beperken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Remmar eller band av material som bärs runt halsen. Kan bäras som en modaccessoar, för att signalera ”ägande” av en dominant partner i en BDSM-relation eller under sex för att begränsa rörelse och andningskontroll."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85027979"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/collars"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003076","dc:identifier":"homoit0003076","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Body modification"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modificación corporal"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Körpermodifikation"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lichaamsmodificatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroppsmodifiering"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Körperveränderung"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Body modification"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Modification of the body, such as tattooing, piercing, branding, or cutting."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modificación del cuerpo como tatuajes, perforaciones, marcas o cortes."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Massnahmen oder Eingriffe, die den Körper aus ästhetischen oder kulturellen Gründen verändern, oft dauerhaft oder semi-permanent; umfasst Tattoos, Piercings, Branding, Skarifizierung (Einbringen von Ziernarben in die Haut) sowie plastische Eingriffe. Für das temporäre Verzieren oder Schmücken des Körpers den Begriff \"Körperverzierung\" verwenden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Modificatie van het lichaam, zoals tatoeëren, piercen, brandmerken of snijden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Modifikation av kroppen, såsom piercing eller märkning av huden genom att tatuera, bränna eller skära."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001114"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001356"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000214"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000307"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003076"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-18"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215","dc:identifier":"homoit0000215","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bois"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bois"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Boi"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bois"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bois"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang for young masculine or transmasculine people. The term is commonly used in lesbian communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jerga para jóvenes masculinos o transmasculinos. El término se utiliza comúnmente en comunidades lesbianas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Slang für junge männliche oder transmaskuline Menschen. Der Begriff wird häufig in lesbischen Communitys verwendet."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slang för unga maskulina eller transmaskulina personer. Termen används ofta inom amerikanska lesbiska gemenskaper."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000231"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000432"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000779"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001466"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002061"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/bois"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000231","dc:identifier":"homoit0000231","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Butches"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Butches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Butches"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Butches"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Butchar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Butch"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bucha"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A masculine person of any gender, though this term is most commonly used in lesbian communities."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine maskulin geprägte Person jeglichen Geschlechts, wobei dieser Begriff am häufigsten in lesbischen Gemeinschaften verwendet wird."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Termino en ingles para una persona masculina de cualquier género, aunque este término se usa más comúnmente en comunidades de lesbianas."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En maskulin person av vilket kön som helst, även om termen oftast används inom lesbiska gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001304"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000230"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000384"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000432"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000440"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000995"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001327"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001340"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001374"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001499"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002061"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001241"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/butches"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000432","dc:identifier":"homoit0000432","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female masculinity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Masculinidad femenina"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke masculiniteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnors maskulinitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Form of masculinity enacted by people with a female or feminine gender identity, often by performing masculine roles, characteristics, and styles of dress."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Forma de masculinidad representada por personas con una identidad de género femenina, a menudo, por medio de la actuación de roles, características y estilos de vestir masculinos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vorm van masculiniteit door personen met een vrouwelijke of feminiene genderidentiteit, vaak gekenmerkt door masculiene rollen, kenmerken en kledingstijlen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Form av maskulinitet som uttrycks av personer med kvinnlig eller feminin könsidentitet, ofta genom att gestalta maskulina roller, egenskaper och klädstilar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000995"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000231"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/femaleMasculinity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000779","dc:identifier":"homoit0000779","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian slang"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jerga lésbica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbotaal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk slang"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Argot lésbico"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modismos lésbicos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Habla lésbica"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Colloquial or informal language related to lesbians or used by lesbians."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lenguaje coloquial o informal relacionado con lesbianas o utilizado por lesbianas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Omgangstaal of informele taal met betrekking tot of gebruikt door lesbische vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vardagligt eller informellt språkbruk relaterat till lesbiska eller som används av lesbiska."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001317"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002288"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianSlang"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001466","dc:identifier":"homoit0001466","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transmasculine people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transmasculinas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes transmasculines"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transmasculine personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmaskulina personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transmasc"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Homme trans"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans people assigned female at birth who identify partially or fully with a masculine gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas trans asignadas al sexo femenino al nacer que se autoidentifican parcial o totalmente con un género masculino."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui s'identifient partiellement ou totalement à une identité de genre masculine et qui ont généralement (mais pas toujours) été assignées de sexe féminin à la naissance."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transpersonen die zijn toegewezen als vrouw bij geboorte en die zich gedeeltelijk of volledig identificeren met een mannelijk gender."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som tilldelats kvinnligt kön vid födseln och som helt eller delvis identifierar sig med en maskulin könsidentitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000995"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001653"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001820"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002061"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transmasculinePeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002061","dc:identifier":"homoit0002061","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Masculine of center"},{"@language":"es","@value":"De centro masculino"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Masculine of center"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Masculine of center"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"MOC"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Masc of center"},{"@language":"es","@value":"De centro masc"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Masculine of center"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Masculino de centro"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"MOC"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe individuals whose gender expression is more masculine than androgynous. Generally used as a self-descriptor within LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir a las personas cuya expresión de género es más masculina que andrógina. Generalmente, se utiliza como autodescriptor en las comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om personen te beschrijven wiens genderexpressie meer mannelijk dan androgyn is. Over het algemeen gebruikt als zelfbeschrijving binnen LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva personer vars könsuttryck är mer maskulint än androgynt. Används i regel som en självbeskrivning inom vissa hbtq+-gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000995"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000215"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000231"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001327"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001374"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001466"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001643"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001653"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002043"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000478","dc:identifier":"homoit0000478","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay bookshops"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Buchhandlungen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoboekhandels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögbokaffärer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bookshops that sell materials intended for use by gay men or addressing topics related to gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías que venden materiales destinados a hombres gay o que abordan temas relacionados con hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Buchhandlungen, die Materialien verkaufen, die für schwule Männer bestimmt sind oder sich mit Themen befassen, die mit schwulen Erfahrungen zusammenhängen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Boekwinkels die materialen verkopen die bedoeld zijn voor gebruik door homomannen of die onderwerpen behandelen die verband houden met homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bokhandlar som säljer material riktat till bögar eller som behandlar ämnen relaterade till bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000216"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000216"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayBookshops"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000727","dc:identifier":"homoit0000727","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian bookshops"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbische Buchhandlungen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías lésbicas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische boekhandels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska bokaffärer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Tiendas de libros lésbicas"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bookshops that sell materials intended for use by lesbians or addressing topics related to lesbian communities."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Buchhandlungen, die Materialien verkaufen, die für Lesben bestimmt sind oder sich mit Themen befassen, die mit lesbischen Erfahrungen zusammenhängen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías que venden materiales destinados a ser usado por lesbianas o que abordan temas relacionados con las comunidades lésbicas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Boekwinkels die materialen verkopen die bedoeld zijn voor gebruik door lesbische vrouwen of die onderwerpen behandelen die verband houden met lesbische gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bokhandlar som säljer material riktat till lesbiska eller som behandlar ämnen relaterade till lesbiska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000216"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001511"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000216"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianBookshops"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001164","dc:identifier":"homoit0001164","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer bookshops"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer boekhandels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera bokaffärer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Tiendas de libros queer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bookshops that sell materials intended for use by queer people or addressing topics related to queerness."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías que venden materiales destinados a personas queer o que abordan temas relacionados con lo queer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Boekwinkels die materialen verkopen die bedoeld zijn voor gebruik door queer personen of die onderwerpen behandelen die verband houden met queerheid."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bokhandlar som säljer material riktat till queera personer eller som behandlar ämnen relaterade till queer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000216"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000216"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerBookshops"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001397","dc:identifier":"homoit0001397","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender bookshops"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender boekhandels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans-bokaffärer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Tiendas de libros transgénero"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bookshops that sell materials intended for use by transgender people or addressing topics related to transgender experiences."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Librerías que venden materiales destinados a personas transgénero o que abordan temas relacionados con experiencias transgénero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Boekwinkels die materialen verkopen die bedoeld zijn voor gebruik door transgender personen of die onderwerpen behandelen die verband houden met transgender-ervaringen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bokhandlar som säljer material riktat till transpersoner eller som behandlar ämnen relaterade till transpersoner."}],"skos:broader":