ejaculating on one person, typically on the face."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un acto sexual en el que varias personas eyaculan sobre una persona, normalmente en la cara."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein sexueller Akt, bei dem mehrere Personen auf eine Person ejakulieren, typischerweise auf das Gesicht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een seksuele handeling waarbij meerdere mensen klaarkomen op één persoon, meestal in het gezicht."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En sexuell handling där flera personer ejakulerar på en person, vanligtvis i ansiktet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000603"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000323"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000683"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001128"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000324","dc:identifier":"homoit0000324","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ victims of cyberbullying"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Cybermobbing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas LGBTQ+ de ciberacoso"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-slachtoffers van cyberpesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nätmobbning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Victims of cyberbullying (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ cyberbullying victims"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cyberbullying victims (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Internetmobbing"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have experienced and may or may not have survived cyberbullying, a form of bullying or harassment that takes place online. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Mobbing oder Belästigung, die online stattfindet."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que han sufrido ciberacoso y pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die cyberpesten, een vorm van pesten of intimidatie die online plaatsvindt, hebben meegemaakt en mogelijk al dan niet hebben overleefd. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van de persoon voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mobbning eller trakasserier som sker online."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001989"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003880"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/cyberbullying"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003880","dc:identifier":"homoit0003880","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ survivors of cyberbullying"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-overlevenden van cyberpesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Överlevare av nätmobbning (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Survivors of cyberbullying (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ cyberbullying survivors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cyberbullying survivors (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som överlevt nätmobbning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have experienced and survived cyberbullying, a form of bullying or harassment that takes place online. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die cyberpesten, een vorm van pesten of intimidatie die online plaatsvindt, hebben meegemaakt en overleefd. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van de persoon voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har upplevt och överlevt nätmobbning, en form av mobbning eller trakasserier på internet. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000324"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000325","dc:identifier":"homoit0000325","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cybersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cibersexo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Cybersex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Cyberseks"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cybersex"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Internet sex"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Online sex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo online"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo por Internet"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo virtual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Cyber-Sex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Online seks"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotic or sexual communication and activity between two or more people that takes place online or using technology (e.g., texting, video chatting)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Comunicación y actividad erótica o sexual entre dos o más personas que se lleva a cabo en línea o utilizando tecnología (por ejemplo, mensajes de texto, video chat)."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erotische oder sexuelle Kommunikation und Aktivitäten zwischen zwei oder mehr Personen, die online oder mithilfe von Technologie (z. B. SMS, Video-Chats) stattfinden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotische of seksuele communicatie en activiteit tussen twee of meer personen die wordt gefaciliteerd door technologie zoals tekst-, audio- of videoberichten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotisk eller sexuell kommunikation och aktivitet mellan två eller flera personer som sker online eller med hjälp av teknik (t.ex. sms, videosamtal)."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh96001657"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000325"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/cybersex"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000326","dc:identifier":"homoit0000326","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dandies"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dandis"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dandies"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dandy's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dandyer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Men who place particular importance upon physical appearance, refined language, and leisurely hobbies."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres que dan especial importancia a la apariencia física, al lenguaje refinado y a las aficiones ociosas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Männer, die besonderen Wert auf ihr Aussehen, eine gepflegte Sprache und kultivierte Hobbys legen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Män som lägger särskild vikt vid sitt utseende, har ett förfinat språk och fritidsintressen av estetisk karaktär."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000327"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85035698"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001241"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dandies"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000327","dc:identifier":"homoit0000327","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dandyism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dandismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dandyismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dandyisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dandyism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The style or conduct of a dandy."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El estilo o la conducta de un dandi."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Der Stil oder das Auftreten eines Dandys."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En stil eller ett beteende som kännetecknar en dandy."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000326"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008004501"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dandyism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002351","dc:identifier":"homoit0002351","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are daughters."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que son hijas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Weiblich gelesene Kinder von Eltern."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som är döttrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000330"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002352"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000736","dc:identifier":"homoit0000736","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian daughters"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas lesbianas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Filles lesbiennes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische dochters"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska döttar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters who identify as lesbians."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas que se identifican como lesbianas."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Filles (lien de parenté) qui s'identifient comme lesbiennes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters die zich identificeren als lesbisch."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar som identifierar sig som lesbiska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000330"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianDaughters"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001173","dc:identifier":"homoit0001173","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer daughters"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas queer"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Filles queers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer dochters"},{"@lan