st LGBTQ+ sind, wird der Begriff LGBTQ+-Töchter verwendet."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters die één of meerdere LHBTQ+-ouders hebben. Voor dochters die zelf LHBTQ+ zijn, gebruik je de term 'LHBTQ+-dochters'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar som har en eller flera hbtq+-föräldrar. För döttrar som själva är hbtq+, använd termen ”Döttrar (hbtq+)”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002351"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000331"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000332"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000333"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000334"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000335"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002765"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002906"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003404"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000332","dc:identifier":"homoit0000332","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters of gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de hombres gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter von schwulen Männern."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters van homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar till bögar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters who have one or more gay parent."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas que tienen uno o más padres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter, die mindestens einen schwulen Elternteil haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters die één of meer homo-ouders hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar som har en eller flera bögföräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002352"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/daughtersOfGayMen"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000333","dc:identifier":"homoit0000333","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters of lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de lesbianas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter von Lesben"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters van lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar till lesbiska"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters who have one or more lesbian parent."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas que tienen uno o más padres lesbianas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter, die mindestens einen lesbischen Elternteil haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters die een of meer lesbische ouders hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar som har en eller flera lesbiska föräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002352"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/daughtersOfLesbians"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000334","dc:identifier":"homoit0000334","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters of transgender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de personas transgénero"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter von trans Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters van transgender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar till transpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters who have one or more transgender parent."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas que tienen uno o más padres transgénero."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter, die mindestens einen trans Elternteil haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters die een of meer transgender ouders hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar som har en eller flera transföräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002352"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/daughtersOfTransgenderPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000335","dc:identifier":"homoit0000335","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters of queer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de personas queer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter von queeren Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters van queer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar till queera personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters who have one or more queer parent."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas que tienen uno o más padres queer."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter, die mindestens einen queeren Elternteil haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters die een of meer queer ouders hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar som har en eller flera queera föräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002352"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/daughtersOfQueerPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001016","dc:identifier":"homoit0001016","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Misgendering"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tratar por el género equivocado"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Mégenrage"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Misgendering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Felköna"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Referirse por el género equivocado"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Referirse por el género incorrecto"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tratar por el género incorrecto"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The act of referring to a person's gender incorrectly, often by using pronouns they do not identify with."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El acto de referirse incorrectamente al género de una persona, a menudo mediante el uso de pronombres con los que no se identifica."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Fait d'attribuer à une personne un genre qui ne correspond pas à son identité de genre, volontairement ou non."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Onjuist verwijzen naar het gender van een persoon, vaak door voornaamwoorden (pronouns) te gebruiken waarmee ze zich niet identificeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Att benämna en persons kön felaktigt, ofta genom att använda pronomen som personen inte identifierar sig med."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000336"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001135"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002259"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001016"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/misgendering"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000338","dc:identifier":"homoit0000338","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Decadence"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Decadencia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dekadenz"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Decadentie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dekadens"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A way of life characterized by mannerisms and affectations marked by excess."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de vida caracterizada por manierismos y afectaciones marcadas por el exceso."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Lebensweise, die durch Übertreibungen und Affektiertheit gekennzeichnet ist."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"levenshouding die wordt gekenmerkt door oververfijning en artistieke sensibiliteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En livsstil som kännetecknas av manér och tillgjorda uttryck präglade av överdrift och excess."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/decadence"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003774","dc:identifier":"homoit0003774","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Decriminalization of sex work"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Decriminalisering van sekswerk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avkriminalisering av sexarbete och prostitution"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Decriminalisation of sex work"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work decriminalization"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Decriminalization of prostitution"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Prostitution decriminalization"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerk decriminalisering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dekriminalisering av sexarbete"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avkriminalisering av sexarbete"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avkriminalisering av prostitution"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The process of lessening or removing laws, regulations, and/or criminal penalties targeting the practice, solicitation, and/or facilitation of sex work. Decriminalization efforts may variously address the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het proces van het verminderen of verwijderen van wetten, regels en/of strafrechtelijke sancties die gericht zijn op de praktijk, werving en/of facilitering van sekswerk. Pogingen tot decriminalisering kunnen op verschillende manieren gericht zijn op de acties van sekswerkers, hun cliënten, derden en/of andere personen die in de buurt van sekswerkers werken of sekswerkers willen helpen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Processen att minska eller avskaffa lagar, regler och eller straffrättsliga påföljder som riktar sig mot utövande av, erbjudande om och eller underlättande av sexarbete och prostitution. Avkriminaliseringsinsatser kan i varierande grad omfatta sexarbetare och/eller personer i prostitution, deras kunder, tredje parter och eller andra personer som arbetar i nära anslutning till eller söker stödja sexarbetare och personer i prostitution."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000339"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003772"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003773"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003775"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003776"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003777"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000850","dc:identifier":"homoit0000850","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ defamation campaigns"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Campañas de difamación LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+に対する中傷キャンペーン"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-lastercampagnes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förtalskampanjer (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ smear campaigns"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ defamation campaigns"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQに対する中傷キャンペーン"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Publication and dissemination of false statements about LGBTQ+ people, groups, or communities in order to harm their reputations."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicación y difusión de declaraciones falsas sobre personas, grupos o comunidades LGBTQ+ con el fin de dañar su reputación."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々、団体、またはコミュニティの評判を傷つける目的で、これらに関する虚偽の情報を公表・拡散すること。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Publicatie en verspreiding van valse verklaringen over LHBTQ+-personen, -groepen of -gemeenschappen om hun reputatie te schaden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Spridning av falska påståenden om hbtq+-personer, grupper eller gemenskaper i syfte att skada deras rykte."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000341"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQDefamationCampaigns"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000342","dc:identifier":"homoit0000342","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demigender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas demigénero"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demigender"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes demigenre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demigender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demigenderpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Demigender-Personen"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who have a partial connection to a certain gender or concept of gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que tienen una conexión parcial con un determinado género o concepto de género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine teilweise Verbindung zu einem bestimmten Geschlecht oder zu einem Geschlechtskonzept haben."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui s'identifient partiellement, mais pas totalement, à un genre donné."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die een gedeeltelijke band hebben met een bepaald geslacht/gender of het concept gender"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har en delvis koppling till ett visst kön eller till begreppet kön."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001652"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001653"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001923"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/demigenderPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001923","dc:identifier":"homoit0001923","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demigender identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad demigénero"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demigender-Identität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demigender identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demigender-identitet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Demigender"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term for gender identities that emphasize a partial connection to a certain gender or concept of gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general para identidades de género que enfatizan una conexión parcial con un determinado género o concepto de género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Überbegriff für Geschlechtsidentitäten, die eine teilweise Verbindung zu einem bestimmten Geschlecht oder zu einem Konzept von Geschlecht betonen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor genderidentiteiten die een gedeeltelijk verband met een bepaald gender of concept van gender benadrukken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samlingsbegrepp för könsidentiteter som betonar en delvis anknytning till ett visst kön eller till begreppet kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000342"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000343"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001652"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001653"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000343","dc:identifier":"homoit0000343","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Demisexualidad"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexualität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Demisexualité"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexualitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A sexual orientation generally characterized by the lack of sexual attraction to other people unless or until emotional connections have been formed."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una orientación sexual generalmente caracterizada por la falta de atracción sexual hacia otras personas a menos o hasta que se hayan formado conexiones emocionales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine sexuelle Orientierung, die im Allgemeinen durch das Fehlen sexueller Anziehung zu anderen Menschen gekennzeichnet ist, bis eine emotionale Bindung entstanden ist."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Orientation sexuelle caractérisée par l'absence d'attirance sexuelle pour d'autres personnes, à moins ou jusqu'à ce que des liens émotionnels aient été établis."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een seksuele oriëntatie die over het algemeen wordt gekenmerkt door een gebrek aan seksuele aantrekking tot een andere persoon, tenzij of totdat ze een emotionele band met die persoon hebben gevormd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell orientering som generellt kännetecknas av avsaknad av sexuell attraktion till andra, om inte eller förrän emotionella band har etablerats."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000344"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001535"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001923"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001986"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/demisexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000344","dc:identifier":"homoit0000344","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas demisexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes demisexuelles"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuella personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who do not experience sexual attraction unless they have first formed a strong emotional connection with a person."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que no experimentan atracción sexual a menos que primero hayan formado una fuerte conexión emocional con una persona."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen, die keine sexuelle Anziehung empfinden, bevor sie eine starke emotionale Bindung zu einer Person aufgebaut haben."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui n'éprouvent pas d'attirance sexuelle à moins d'avoir d'abord établi un lien émotionnel fort avec une personne."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die geen seksuele aantrekking ervaren, tenzij ze een sterke emotionele band met iemand vormen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som inte upplever sexuell attraktion till andra om de inte först har etablerat en stark emotionell anknytning till en person."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003036"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000343"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001302"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001535"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001985"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/demisexualPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001986","dc:identifier":"homoit0001986","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demiromanticism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Demirromanticismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demiromantik"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Demiromantisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiromanticisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demiromantik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demi-romantic"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Demiromantic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Demi-romántico"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Demirrománticos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Demi-romántica"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Demirrománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demi-Romantik"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiromantisch"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Romantic orientation in which romantic attraction to other people is only experienced after forming emotional bonds."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Orientación romántica en la que la atracción romántica hacia otras personas solo se experimenta después de formar vínculos emocionales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Romantische Orientierung, bei der romantische Anziehung zu anderen Menschen erst nach dem Aufbau emotionaler Bindungen empfunden wird."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Orientation romantique dans laquelle l'attirance romantique n'est ressentie qu'après avoir établi des liens affectifs."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Romantische oriëntatie waarbij romantische aantrekking tot andere mensen alleen wordt gevoeld wanneer bestaande emotionele banden reeds aanwezig zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romantisk orientering där romantisk attraktion till andra endast upplevs efter att emotionella band har etablerats."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001828"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000343"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001985"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001828"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003036","dc:identifier":"homoit0003036","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual college students"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Studierende"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudiantes universitarios demisexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele studenten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuella collegestudenter"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Universitarios demisexuales"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual people who are attending college."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Personen, die eine Hochschule besuchen. Achtung: Das US-amerikanische College entspricht nicht exakt der Hochschule im deutschen Sprachraum, wird aber häufig als Hochschule übersetzt."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas demisexuales que asisten a la universidad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele personen die naar de universiteit gaan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuella personer som studerar vid college."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000344"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003041"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003032"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-05"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001985","dc:identifier":"homoit0001985","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demiromantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas demirrománticas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demiromantische Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes demiromantiques"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demiromantiska personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demi-romantic people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas demi-románticas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who experience romantic attraction to other people only after forming emotional bonds."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que experimentan atracción romántica hacia otras personas únicamente después de formar vínculos emocionales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die erst nach dem Aufbau emotionaler Bindungen romantische Anziehung zu anderen Menschen empfinden."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui éprouvent une attirance romantique qu'une fois qu'un lien émotionnel est établi."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen die romantische aantrekking tot andere mensen ervaren alleen wanneer reeds bestaande emotionele banden aanwezig zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som upplever romantisk attraktion till andra först efter att ha etablerat emotionella band."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001829"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000344"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001986"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001829"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000345","dc:identifier":"homoit0000345","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Denial of sexual orientation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Negación de la orientación sexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Leugnung der sexuellen Orientierung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ontkenning van seksuele oriëntatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förnekande av sexuell läggning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Refusal to acknowledge or affirm one's own sexual identity, or the sexual identity of another individual."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Negarse a reconocer o afirmar la identidad sexual propia o la identidad sexual de otra persona."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Verweigerung, die eigene sexuelle Identität oder die sexuelle Identität einer anderen Person anzuerkennen oder zu bestätigen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Weigering om iemands seksuele identiteit of de seksuele identiteit van een ander persoon te erkennen of te bevestigen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägran att erkänna eller bejaka sin egen sexuella identitet, eller en annan persons sexuella identitet."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000391"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000699"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000936"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002590"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/denialOfSexualOrientation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000391","dc:identifier":"homoit0000391","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Internalized homophobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homofobia internalizada"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geïnternaliseerde homofobie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Internaliserad homofobi"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Internalised homophobia"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Ego-dystonic homophobia"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"This term is often used to describe internalized oppression held by and about LGBTQ+ people in general. It can also describe the more specific phenomenon in which gay men internalize or adopt homophobic beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward gay men and homosexuality) as a result of being raised or socialized within a homophobic environment or culture. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Este término se utiliza a menudo para describir la opresión internalizada sostenida por y sobre las personas LGBTQ+ en general. También puede describir el fenómeno más específico a través del cual los hombres gay internalizan o adoptan creencias homofóbicas (es decir, percepciones negativas e intolerancia hacia los hombres gay y la homosexualidad) como resultado de haber sido criados o socializados dentro de un entorno o una cultura homofóbica."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"verwijst naar de vermeende onzekerheid over deseksuele identiteit van een persoon en mogelijke onbewuste homoseksuele verlangens, die bij diepersoon tot grote angst en onzekerheid kan leiden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Termen används ofta för att beskriva internaliserat förtryck hos hbtq+-personer generellt. Den kan också avse den specifika företeelsen att bögar internaliserar eller anammar homofoba föreställningar – det vill säga negativa uppfattningar om bögar och homosexualitet – till följd av att ha vuxit upp eller socialiserats i en homofobisk miljö eller kultur."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000646"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002590"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003093"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000345"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000392"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000699"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000936"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2005020575"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/internalisedHomophobia"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000699","dc:identifier":"homoit0000699","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Latent homosexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homosexualidad latente"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Latente Homosexualität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Latente homoseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Latent homosexualitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term coined by Sigmund Freud to describe erotic attraction towards members of the same sex or gender that is not (and may never be) consciously experienced or expressed openly."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término acuñado por Sigmund Freud para describir la atracción erótica hacia miembros del mismo sexo o género que no se experimenta (y puede que nunca se experimente) conscientemente ni se expresa abiertamente."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein von Sigmund Freud geprägter Begriff, der die erotische Anziehung zu Personen desselben Geschlechts beschreibt, die nicht bewusst wahrgenommen oder offen zum Ausdruck gebracht wird (und dies möglicherweise auch nie sein wird)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term bedacht door Sigmund Freud om de erotische aantrekkingskracht van een individu op leden van hetzelfde gender of geslacht te beschrijven die niet (en misschien nooit) bewust wordt ervaren of openlijk wordt uitgedrukt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Begrepp myntat av Sigmund Freud för att beskriva erotisk attraktion till personer av samma kön som inte är (och kanske aldrig blir) medvetet upplevd eller uttryckt öppet."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000345"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000391"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000699"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/latentHomosexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000936","dc:identifier":"homoit0000936","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ self-repression"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Auto represión LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-zelfonderdrukking"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självförtryck (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ self-repression"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Auto represión LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Restraint or denial of one’s own thoughts, wishes, feelings or identity, as experienced by LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Restricción o negación de los pensamientos, deseos, sentimientos o identidad propia, tal como lo experimentan las personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Terughoudendheid of ontkenning van de eigen gedachten, wensen, gevoelens of identiteit, zoals ervaren door LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självförnekelse eller undertryckande av tankar, önskningar, känslor eller identitet, så som det kan upplevas av hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000345"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000391"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002590"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000936"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSelfRepression"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002590","dc:identifier":"homoit0002590","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Internalized oppression"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Opresión internalizada"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geïnternaliseerde onderdrukking"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Internaliserat förtryck"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The phenomenon in which someone in a marginalized group internalizes or adopts oppressive beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward any marginalized identities they hold) as a result of being raised or socialized within an oppressive environment or culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El fenómeno a través del cual una persona de un grupo marginado internaliza o adopta creencias opresivas (es decir, percepciones negativas e intolerancia hacia cualquier identidad marginada que habite) como resultado de haber sido criada o socializada dentro de un entorno o una cultura opresiva."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het fenomeen waarbij iemand in een gemarginaliseerde groep onderdrukkende overtuigingen internaliseert of overneemt (d.w.z. negatieve percepties van en intolerantie jegens gemarginaliseerde identiteiten die die persoon heeft) als resultaat van opvoeding of socialisatie binnen een onderdrukkende omgeving of cultuur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Företeelsen att en person som tillhör en marginaliserad grupp internaliserar eller anammar förtryckande föreställningar – det vill säga negativa uppfattningar om och intolerans mot marginaliserade identiteter som personen själv har – till följd av att ha vuxit upp eller socialiserats i en förtryckande miljö eller kultur."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000391"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002591"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002592"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002593"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002594"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002595"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000345"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000936"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003091"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002590"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000346","dc:identifier":"homoit0000346","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dental dams"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Presas dentales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lecktuch"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Digues dentaires"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Beflapjes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slicklappar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Latex barriers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Barreras de látex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diques dentales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diques de goma"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Barreras bucales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kofferdam"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dental Dam"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kofferdam"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A square sheet of latex or polyurethane used to create a barrier between the mouth and the vagina or anus during oral sex."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una lámina cuadrada de látex o poliuretano utilizada para crear una barrera entre la boca y la vagina o el ano durante el sexo oral."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein quadratisches Tuch aus Latex oder Polyurethan, das verwendet wird, um beim Oralsex eine Barriere zwischen Mund und Vagina oder Anus zu schaffen."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Feuille carrée de latex ou de polyuréthane utilisée pour créer une barrière entre la bouche et la vulve, le vagin ou l'anus pendant les rapports sexuels oraux."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vierkant stuk latex of polyurethaan dat wordt gebruikt om een barrière te creëren tussen de mond en de vagina of anus tijdens orale seks."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett fyrkantigt ark av latex eller polyuretan som används som barriär mellan mun och vagina eller anus vid oralsex."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001251"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85035617"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dentalDams"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000349","dc:identifier":"homoit0000349","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Detention of LGBTQ+ people under a hospital order"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Detención de personas LGBTQ+ por orden de un hospital"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Freiheitsentzug von LGBTQ+-Personen aufgrund einer ärztlichen Anordnung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"TBS van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tvångsvård av hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Detention of LGBTQ people under a hospital order"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Detención de personas LGBTQ por orden de un hospital"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Freiheitsentziehung von LGBTQ+-Personen aufgrund einer Krankenhausanordnung"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Physical and legal confinement of LGBTQ+ people in hospitals or medical institutions, typically to receive evaluation and treatment ordered by a court or other such authority. Can be used to describe both short-term or long-term institutionalization."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Confinamiento físico y legal de personas LGBTQ+ en hospitales o instituciones médicas, generalmente para recibir evaluación y tratamiento, ordenado por un tribunal u otra autoridad similar. Puede usarse para describir el internamiento en instituciones tanto a corto como a largo plazo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Physische und rechtliche Unterbringung von LGBTQ+-Personen in Krankenhäusern oder medizinischen Einrichtungen, in der Regel zur Durchführung einer von einem Gericht oder einer anderen Behörde angeordneten Untersuchung und Behandlung. Kann sowohl für kurzfristige als für langfristige Unterbringung in einer Einrichtung verwendet werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fysieke en juridische opsluiting van LHBTQ+-personen in ziekenhuizen of medische instellingen, meestal om evaluatie en behandeling te ondergaan die door een rechtbank of een andere dergelijke autoriteit zijn bevolen. Kan worden gebruikt om zowel de korte als de lange termijn opname te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fysiskt frihetsberövande av hbtq+-personer på sjukhus eller inom medicinska institutioner, vanligtvis för att genomgå utredning eller behandling på uppdrag av domstol eller annan myndighet. Kan avse både kortvarig och långvarig institutionsvistelse."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000394"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001012"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/detentionOfLGBTQPeopleUnderAHospital"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000884","dc:identifier":"homoit0000884","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ incarceration"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Encarcelamiento LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-opsluiting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fängelsestraff (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ imprisonment"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Incarceration (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Imprisonment (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Encarcelamiento LGBTQ"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-gevangenschap"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Opsluiting (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The restraint of an LGBTQ+ person's liberty against their will, with or without legal process, whether by a government authority, institution, or extrajudicial actors. Generally, this refers to physical and/or legal confinement within a jail, prison, detention center, etc. It may also include the forced confinement of LGBTQ+ people within hospitals and other healthcare facilities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Confinamiento, incluida la restricción física y/o legal, de personas LGBTQ+ por parte de una institución o autoridad. Típicamente se utiliza para describir el confinamiento en una prisión pública o privada sentenciado por un tribunal dentro de un sistema penal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De vrijheidsbeperking van een LHBTQ+-persoon tegen zijn, haar of hun wil, met of zonder juridische procedure, door een overheidsinstantie, instelling of buitengerechtelijke instanties. In het algemeen verwijst dit naar fysieke en/of juridische opsluiting in een gevangenis, huis van bewaring, detentiecentrum, enz. Het kan ook de gedwongen opsluiting van LHBTQ+-personen in ziekenhuizen en andere zorginstellingen omvatten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frihetsberövande av hbtq+-personer, inklusive fysisk och/eller rättslig begränsning, genomfört av en institution eller myndighet. Används vanligtvis för att beskriva frihetsberövande i statliga eller privata anstalter, beslutat av domstol inom ramen för ett straffrättsligt system."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000887"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQImprisonment"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000883","dc:identifier":"homoit0000883","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ immigration rights"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Derechos de inmigracion LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-immigratierechten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Migrationsrätt (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ immigration rights"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Derechos de inmigración LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Derechos migratorios LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asylrätt (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Legal and social entitlement to freedom, equality, and protection held by LGBTQ+ immigrants."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Derecho legal y social a la libertad, la igualdad y la protección que tienen los inmigrantes LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Juridische en sociale aanspraak op vrijheid, gelijkheid en bescherming van LHBTQ+-immigranten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Juridiska, sociala eller etiska principer om frihet eller rättigheter för hbtq+-personer som immigranter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000712"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000927"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001053"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001092"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001482"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001815"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001853"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000712"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQImmigrationRights"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000887","dc:identifier":"homoit0000887","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ incarcerated people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prisioneros LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-opgesloten personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fångar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Prisoners (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ inmates"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ prisoners"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Incarcerated people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Incarcerated LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ imprisoned people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Imprisoned people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Imprisoned LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prisioneros (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-gevangenen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Opgesloten LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Opgesloten personen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fängslade hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-fångar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intagna hbtq+-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people whose liberty is restrained against their will, with or without legal process, whether by a government authority, institution, or extrajudicial actors. Generally, this refers to individuals subject to physical and/or legal confinement within a jail, prison, detention center, etc. It may also include LGBTQ+ people forcibly confined within hospitals and other healthcare facilities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son privadas de su libertad contra su voluntad por una institución o autoridad. Normalmente se utiliza para describir a personas condenadas a confinamiento en una prisión pública o privada por un tribunal dentro de un sistema penal, pero también puede incluir a personas confinadas por la fuerza en hospitales y otras instituciones."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen van wie de vrijheid tegen hun wil wordt beperkt, met of zonder juridische procedure, door een overheidsinstantie, instelling of buitengerechtelijke instanties. In het algemeen verwijst dit naar personen die onderworpen zijn aan fysieke en/of juridische opsluiting in een gevangenis, detentiecentrum, enz. Het kan ook LHBTQ+-personen omvatten die gedwongen worden opgesloten in ziekenhuizen en andere zorginstellingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som mot sin vilja fråntagits friheten av en myndighet eller institution. Avser vanligtvis fängslande genom domstolsbeslut, men kan även inkludera tvångsvård på sjukhus eller annan institution."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000924"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000348"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000884"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPrisoners"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000394","dc:identifier":"homoit0000394","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electroshock therapy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terapia de electroshock"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Elektroschocktherapie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elektroshocktherapie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elbehandling"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electric shock therapy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Electroconvulsive therapy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terapia de electro shock"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terapia electroconvulsiva"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Elektrokrampftherapie"},{"@language":"de","@value":"EKT"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Elektroschocktherapie"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Elektrokonvulsionstherapie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of psychiatric treatment for major depression, bipolar depression, and other mental health conditions that usually consists of brief electrical pulses to the brain through electrodes on the head that induce controlled seizures. Electroshock therapy has historically been used as an attempt to \"cure\" homosexuality and other non-normative sexualities and sexual practices."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de tratamiento psiquiátrico para la depresión mayor, la depresión bipolar y otras condiciones de salud mental que generalmente consiste de breves pulsos eléctricos al cerebro a través de electrodos en la cabeza que inducen convulsiones controladas. Históricamente, la terapia de electroshock se ha utilizado como un intento para \"curar\" la homosexualidad y otras sexualidades y prácticas sexuales no normativas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Form der psychiatrischen Behandlung von schweren Depressionen, bipolaren Depressionen, und anderen psychischen Erkrankungen, bestehend aus kurzen elektrischen Impulsen an das Gehirn, die durch Elektroden am Kopf ausgegeben werden, um kontrollierte Anfälle auszulösen. Elektrokonvulsionstherapie wurde in der Vergangenheit als ein „Heilmittel“ für Homosexualität und andere nicht-normative Sexualitäten und sexuelle Praktiken eingesetzt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van psychiatrische behandeling voor ernstige depressie, bipolaire depressie en andere psychische aandoeningen die gewoonlijk bestaat uit korte elektrische pulsen naar de hersenen via elektroden op het hoofd die een gecontroleerde aanval veroorzaken. Elektroshocktherapie is van oudsher gebruikt als een poging om homoseksualiteit en andere waargenomen seksuele afwijkingen te \"genezen\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av psykiatrisk behandling för svår depression, bipolär depression och andra psykiska tillstånd som vanligtvis består av korta elektriska impulser till hjärnan via elektroder på huvudet för att framkalla kontrollerade anfall. Elbehandling har historiskt använts i försök att ”bota” homosexualitet och andra icke-normativa sexualiteter och sexuella praktiker. Syftet med elbehandlingen var att skapa negativt betingade reflexer kopplade till sexuellt avvikande beteende genom exponering för stimuli eller fantasi och samtidig exponering för el."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001366"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000349"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85041999"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/electroshockTherapy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001012","dc:identifier":"homoit0001012","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mental health care for LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidados de salud mental para las personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geestelijke gezondheidszorg voor LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Psykiatrisk vård (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mental health care for LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Salud mental para personas LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized measures taken for the diagnosis, maintenance, treatment, or improvement of mental health or psychological well being; use in reference to mental health care addressing the particular needs of LGBTQ+ individuals or communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Medidas organizadas tomadas para el diagnóstico, el mantenimiento, el tratamiento o la mejora de la salud mental o el bienestar psicológico; utilícese en referencia a los cuidados de salud mental que abordan las necesidades particulares de personas o comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde maatregelen genomen voor de diagnose, het onderhoud, de behandeling of de verbetering van de geestelijke gezondheid of het psychisch welzijn; gebruik voor geestelijke gezondheidszorg die inspeelt op de specifieke behoeften van LHBTQ+-personen of gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade insatser för att diagnostisera, upprätthålla, behandla eller förbättra psykisk hälsa eller psykiskt välbefinnande. Används för att beskriva psykiatrisk vård som tar hänsyn till hbtq+-personers särskilda behov."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000953"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001551"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000349"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000351"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000952"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001366"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003990"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004443"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/mentalHealthCareForLGBTQPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000351","dc:identifier":"homoit0000351","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DSM (Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"MDE (Manual diagnóstico y estadístico de los trastornos mentales)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"DSM (Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"DSM"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"DSM (Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"DSM"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders"},{"@language":"es","@value":"DSM"},{"@language":"de","@value":"DSM"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Diagnostischer und statistischer Leitfaden psychischer Störungen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, produced by the American Psychiatric Association; can be used in reference to the DSM's historical or present day descriptions of LGBTQ+ identities and practices."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El Manual Diagnóstico y Estadístico de los Trastornos Mentales, elaborado por la Asociación Estadounidense de Psiquiatría; se puede utilizar en referencia a las descripciones históricas o actuales del MDE de las identidades y prácticas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Das Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM; auf Deutsch: „diagnostischer und statistischer Leitfaden psychischer Störungen“), das von der American Psychiatric Association herausgegeben wird. Kann in Bezug auf historische oder aktuelle Beschreibungen von LGBTQ+-Identitäten und -Praktiken im DSM verwendet werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, opgesteld door de American Psychiatric Association; kan worden gebruikt met verwijzing naar de historische of huidige beschrijvingen van de DSM van LHBTQ+-identiteiten en -praktijken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, utgiven av American Psychiatric Association. Termen kan användas i referens till DSM:s historiska eller aktuella beskrivningar av hbtq+-identiteter och praktiker."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001012"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000351"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/DSM"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352","dc:identifier":"homoit0000352","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intersexual"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Intersexe"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersex"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Differences in sex development"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Divergences in sex development"},{"@language":"en","@value":"DSDs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hermaphroditism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersexuality"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Variations in sex development"},{"@language":"en","@value":"VSDs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intersex"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Intersexuée"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Intersexué"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Intersexuel"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hermaphrodite"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hermafroditisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Interseksualiteit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Variaties in geslachtsontwikkeling"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verschillen in geslachtsontwikkeling"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"An umbrella term used to refer to people born with variations in their physical sex characteristics--including genitals, gonads, chromosomes, and hormonal factors--that do not fit typical definitions of male or female bodies."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término general utilizado para referirse a personas que nacen con variaciones en sus características sexuales físicas (incluidos genitales, gónadas, cromosomas y factores hormonales) que no se ajustan a las definiciones típicas de cuerpos masculinos o femeninos."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personne qui est née avec des caractéristiques sexuelles biologiques (génitales, hormonales, gonadiques ou chromosomiques) qui ne sont pas toutes exclusivement « masculines » ou « féminine » selon les normes médicales en vigueur."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een overkoepelende term voor verschillen in geslachtskenmerken of reproductieve anatomie. De term weerspiegelt het feit dat er veel mogelijke verschillen zijn in genitaliën, hormonen, interne anatomie en/of chromosomen die niet worden weerspiegeld door de westerse binaire factor van mannelijk en vrouwelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett paraplybegrepp som används för att beskriva personer som är födda med variationer i sina fysiska könskarakteristika – såsom genitalier, könskörtlar, kromosomer och hormonella faktorer – som inte passar in i typiska definitioner av manliga eller kvinnliga kroppar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000357"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002835"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002841"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000666"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000670"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000671"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000672"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001822"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intersex"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000357","dc:identifier":"homoit0000357","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Disorders of sexual development"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trastornos del desarrollo sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Stoornissen in de seksuele ontwikkeling"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rubbningar i könsutvecklingen"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":" Disorders of sex development"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Desórdenes del desarrollo sexual"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used within medical contexts to refer to a wide range of variations in sex characteristics. Many people with intersex variations consider these terms to be stigmatizing and pathologizing, though they often still encounter them in their medical records."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado en contextos médicos para referirse a una amplia gama de variaciones en las características sexuales. Muchas personas con variaciones intersex consideran que estos términos son estigmatizantes y patologizantes, aunque a menudo todavía los encuentran en sus registros médicos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een gemedicaliseerde categorie voor het beschrijven van seksuele ontwikkeling die varieert van man of vrouw"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används i medicinska sammanhang för att beskriva en mängd olika variationer i könskarakteristika, som atypiska kromosomala, gonadala eller anatomiskt könkarakteristika. Många personer med intersexvariationer uppfattar dessa termer som stigmatiserande och patologiserande, även om de ofta förekommer i deras patientjournaler."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85120728"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/disordersOfSexualDevelopment"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002835","dc:identifier":"homoit0002835","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Early genital surgery model"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modelo de cirugía genital temprana"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Model voor vroege genitale chirurgie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidig genitalkirurgi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"John Money model"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Early genital surgery model"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Patient care model developed by John Money, a New Zealand psychologist who theorized that gender was completely dependent on \"nurture.\" This model advocates for performing genital surgery on intersex infants and raising them as girls. Money's theories have resulted in many surgically misgendered children who have had to deal with life-long gender dysphoria, depression, sexual dysfunction, bowel and urinary incontinence, and nerve pain. A patient-centered model, in which the intersex child is allowed to grow up and make their own choices regarding their gender and surgical option, is now preferred."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modelo de atención al paciente desarrollado por John Money, un psicólogo neozelandés que teorizó que el género dependía completamente de la \"crianza\". Este modelo aboga por realizar cirugía genital a bebés intersexuales y criarlos como niñas. Las teorías de Money han dado lugar a que muchos niños sometidos a cirugías sean malgenerizados y hayan tenido que lidiar con disforia de género, depresión, disfunción sexual, incontinencia intestinal y urinaria, y dolor nervioso durante toda su vida. Ahora se prefiere un modelo centrado en el paciente, donde al niño intersexual se le permite crecer y tomar sus propias decisiones con respecto a su género y opción quirúrgica."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Model voor patiëntenzorg ontwikkeld door John Money, een Nieuw-Zeelandse psycholoog die theoretiseerde dat gender volledig afhankelijk was van 'nurture'. Dit model pleit voor het uitvoeren van genitale chirurgie bij intersekse kinderen en het opvoeden ervan als meisje. De theorieën van Money hebben geresulteerd in veel chirurgisch misgenderde kinderen die te maken hebben gehad met levenslange genderdysforie, depressie, seksuele disfunctie, darm- en urine-incontinentie en zenuwpijn. Een patiëntgericht model, waarin het intersekse kind de kans krijgt om op te groeien en zijn eigen keuzes te maken met betrekking tot zijn gender en chirurgische optie, heeft nu de voorkeur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Modell för patientvård utvecklad av John Money, en nyzeeländsk psykolog som menade att kön enbart beror på ”miljö”. Modellen förespråkar att intersexbarn ska genomgå genital kirurgi i spädbarnsåldern och uppfostras som flickor. Moneys teorier har lett till att många barn har blivit kirurgiskt felkönade och fått leva med livslång könsdysfori, depression, sexuell dysfunktion, tarm- och urininkontinens samt nervsmärtor. Idag föredras en patientcentrerad modell där ett barn med intersexvariation får växa upp och själv fatta beslut om könstillhörighet och eventuell kirurgi."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002841","dc:identifier":"homoit0002841","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hopkins model"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hopkins-Modell"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modelo Hopkins"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hopkins model"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hopkins modell"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Concealment centered model"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geheimhaltungsorientiertes Modell"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Verschleierungszentriertes Modell"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hopkins model"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Concealment centered model"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A patient care model that gained popular usage in the 1950s. In this model, parents are used to quickly decide on a gender assignment for their intersex baby, under the assumption that the child would identify with whichever gender their parents raised them as. If a child later deviated from the assigned gender, parents were encouraged to verbally and physically \"correct\" the child and enforce gender norms. In practice, this resulted in life-altering, unnecessary genital surgeries, irreversible hormone treatments, and dishonesty on the parent's part. A patient-centered model, in which the intersex child is allowed to grow up and make their own choices regarding their gender and surgical option, is now preferred. "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Behandlungsmodell, das in den 1950er-Jahren breite Anwendung fand. In diesem Modell wurden Eltern dazu angehalten, rasch ein soziales Geschlecht für ihr inter* Kind zu bestimmen, in der Annahme, dass sich das Kind mit dem sozialen Geschlecht identifizieren würde, in dem es erzogen wird. Wenn ein Kind später vom zugewiesenen sozialen Geschlecht abwich, wurden Eltern ermutigt, das Kind verbal und körperlich zu „korrigieren“ und Geschlechternormen durchzusetzen. In der Praxis führte dies zu lebensverändernden, unnötigen Genitaloperationen, irreversiblen Hormonbehandlungen und mangelnder Offenheit seitens der Eltern. Heute wird ein patient:innenzentriertes Modell bevorzugt, bei dem inter Kinder aufwachsen und selbst Entscheidungen über ihre Geschlechtsidentität und mögliche medizinische Eingriffe treffen können."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modelo de atención al paciente que se popularizó en la década de los 1950. En este modelo, se utiliza a los padres para decidir rápidamente una asignación de género para su bebé intersexual, bajo el supuesto de que el niño se identificaría con el género con el que le criaran sus padres. Si más tarde el niño se desviaba del género asignado, se animaba a los padres a «corregir» verbal y físicamente al niño y hacer cumplir las normas de género. En la práctica, esto se plasmaba en cirugías genitales innecesarias, tratamientos hormonales irreversibles y deshonestidad por parte de los padres. Ahora se prefiere un modelo centrado en el paciente, en el que se permite al niño intersexual crecer y tomar sus propias decisiones en cuanto a su género y opción quirúrgica."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een patiëntenzorgmodel dat in de jaren vijftig populair werd. In dit model zijn ouders gewend om snel te beslissen over de gendertoewijzing voor hun intersekse baby, in de veronderstelling dat kinderen zich zouden identificeren met het gender waarmee de ouders hun hebben opgevoed. Als een kind later afweek van het toegewezen gender, werden ouders aangemoedigd om het kind verbaal en fysiek te ‘corrigeren’ en gendernormen af te dwingen. In de praktijk resulteerde dit in levensveranderende, onnodige genitale operaties, onomkeerbare hormoonbehandelingen en oneerlijkheid van de kant van de ouders. Een patiëntgericht model, waarin het intersekse kind de kans krijgt om op te groeien en eigen keuzes te maken met betrekking tot gender en chirurgische optie, heeft nu de voorkeur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En vårdmodell som fick spridning på 1950-talet. I denna modell uppmuntrades föräldrar att snabbt välja ett kön för sitt intersexbarn i tron att barnet skulle identifiera sig med det kön det uppfostrades som. Om barnet senare avvek från det tilldelade könet uppmanades föräldrar att korrigera barnet med både ord och handlingar. I praktiken ledde modellen till livsavgörande, onödiga könskirurgiska ingrepp, oåterkalleliga hormonbehandlingar, könsdysfori och bristande ärlighet från föräldrarnas sida. I dag förespråkas en patientcentrerad modell där det intersexbarnet får växa upp och själv fatta beslut om kön och kirurgiska ingrepp."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000666","dc:identifier":"homoit0000666","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersexphobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intersexfobia"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Interseksefobie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexfobi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Interphobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Interfobia"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Antagonism or disgust directed toward intersex people or intersex variations. Intersexphobia can include the denial of the existence of intersex people, insistence that intersex variations should be forcibly \"corrected,\" stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Antagonismo o disgusto dirigido hacia personas intersex o variaciones intersex. La intersexfobia puede incluir la negación de la existencia de personas intersex, la insistencia en que las variaciones intersex deben \"corregirse\" a la fuerza, estereotipos, acoso verbal y violencia física."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Antagonisme of walging gericht op intersekse personen of identiteiten. Interseksfobie kan bestaan uit ontkenning van het bestaan van intersekse-identiteiten, stereotypen, verbale intimidatie en fysiek geweld."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fientlighet eller avsky riktad mot intersexpersoner eller intersexvariationer. Intersexfobi kan innefatta förnekelse av intersexpersoners existens, krav på att intersexvariationer ska ”korrigeras”, stereotyper, verbala trakasserier och fysiskt våld."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002595"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000619"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000670"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001770"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001893"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intersexphobia"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000671","dc:identifier":"homoit0000671","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad intersex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexidentitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Used to describe the experience of selfhood of intersex people. Intersex identity is not gender identity, sexual identity, nor sexual orientation. For the subject of intersex variations, use \"intersex variations\" or \"intersex\". For the subject of intersex people, use \"intersex people\". Do not use in place of gender-identity-related terms such as non-binary identity or genderfluid identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Se utiliza para describir la experiencia de identidad de las personas intersex. La identidad intersex no es una identidad de género, identidad sexual ni orientación sexual. Para el tema de las variaciones intersex, utilice \"variaciones intersex\" o \"intersex\". Para el tema de las personas intersex, utilice \"personas intersex\". No lo utilice en lugar de términos relacionados con la identidad de género, como identidad no binaria o identidad de género fluido."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Används för att beskriva erfarenheten av att vara intersex. Intersexidentitet är inte samma sak som könsidentitet, sexuell identitet eller sexuell läggning. För att beskriva intersexvariationer, använd ”intersexvariationer” eller ”intersex”. För att beskriva personer, använd ”intersexpersoner”. Använd inte denna term i stället för könsidentitetsrelaterade begrepp som ickebinär eller genderfluid."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007005480"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000671"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intersexIdentity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000672","dc:identifier":"homoit0000672","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento intersexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse beweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexrörelser"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento intersex"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term for activism focused on the rights of intersex people and issues faced by intersex communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general para el activismo centrado en los derechos de las personas intersex y los problemas que enfrentan las comunidades intersex."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor activisme gericht op de rechten van intersekse mensen en problemen waarmee intersekse gemeenschappen worden geconfronteerd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samlingsterm för aktivism med fokus på intersexpersoners rättigheter och frågor som påverkar intersexpersoners gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000805"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000807"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000882"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003938"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intersexMovement"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001822","dc:identifier":"homoit0001822","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hermaphrodites"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hermafroditas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hermaphroditen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hermafrodieten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hermafroditer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term originating from Greek mythology that refers to beings that are both fully female and fully male. The term was once adopted in the medical realm to describe people with intersex variations generally (and later to describe someone with both ovarian and testicular tissue specifically), but it is now recognized to be stigmatizing, imprecise, and misleading. Many people in the intersex community consider the use of this term to be pathologizing and deeply offensive, while other intersex people have chosen to reclaim the term to describe themselves and their bodies. Do not use this term to describe an individual unless they explicitly identify with it and have chosen to use it."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término originado en la mitología griega que se refiere a seres que son tanto completamente femeninos como completamente masculinos. El término fue adoptado alguna vez en el ámbito médico para describir a personas con variaciones intersex en general (y más tarde para describir a alguien con tejido tanto ovárico como testicular específicamente), pero ahora se reconoce como estigmatizante, impreciso y engañoso. Muchas personas de la comunidad intersex consideran que el uso de este término es patologizante y profundamente ofensivo, mientras que otras personas intersex han optado por reclamar el término para describirse a sí mismas y a sus cuerpos. No utilice este término para describir a una persona a menos que se identifique explícitamente con él y haya elegido utilizarlo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Begriff aus der griechischen Mythologie, der sich auf Wesen bezieht, die zugleich vollständig weiblich und vollständig männlich sind. Der Begriff wurde früher im medizinischen Bereich übernommen, um Menschen mit inter* Variationen allgemein zu beschreiben (und später, um spezifisch eine Person mit sowohl Eierstock- als auch Hodengewebe zu bezeichnen), wird heute jedoch als stigmatisierend, ungenau und irreführend anerkannt. Viele Menschen in der inter* Gemeinschaft betrachten die Verwendung dieses Begriffs als pathologisierend und zutiefst beleidigend, während andere inter* Personen sich entschieden haben, den Begriff wieder zu verwenden, um sich selbst und ihre Körper zu beschreiben. Den Begriff nicht verwenden, um eine Einzelperson zu beschreiben, es sei denn, diese identifiziert sich ausdrücklich damit und hat sich entschieden, ihn selbst zu verwenden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Historische term voor intersekse personen die vaak als denigrerend wordt beschouwd; alleen gebruiken in historische context of wanneer een persoon zichzelf identificeert met de term als een geuzennaam"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En term med ursprung i grekisk mytologi som avser varelser som är både helt kvinnliga och helt manliga. Termen togs historiskt i bruk inom medicinen för att beskriva personer med intersexvariationer i allmänhet (och senare för att beskriva personer med både äggstocks- och testikelvävnad), men anses idag vara stigmatiserande, otydlig och missvisande. Många inom intersexgemenskapen anser termen vara patologiserande och djupt kränkande, medan andra har valt att återta den för att beskriva sig själva och sina kroppar. Använd inte termen för att beskriva en individ om de inte själva identifierar sig med den och uttryckligen har valt att använda den."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000352"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000354","dc:identifier":"homoit0000354","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dildo harnesses"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dildo-Harness"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arneses para consoladores"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dildogordels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dildoharness"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Strap-ons"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Strap-on-Dildos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Strap-ons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arneses para dildos"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Devices worn to attach a dildo to a person's body, typically so they can penetrate a partner's vagina or anus."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hilfsmittel, die am Körper einer Person befestigt werden, um einen Dildo anzubringen, um damit in die Vagina oder den Anus des/der Partner:in einzudringen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dispositivos que se utilizan para sujetar un consolador al cuerpo de una persona, generalmente para que pueda penetrar la vagina o el ano de una pareja."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Apparaten die worden gedragen om een dildo aan het lichaam van een persoon te bevestigen, meestal zodat ze de vagina of anus van een partner kunnen penetreren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Redskap som bärs för att fästa en dildo på kroppen, vanligtvis för att kunna penetrera en partners vagina eller anus."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000612"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000355"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001342"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001367"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dildoHarnesses"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000355","dc:identifier":"homoit0000355","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dildos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dildos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Consoladores"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dildo's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dildoar"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Dildos"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A sex toy, often explicitly (although not necessarily) phallic in appearance, intended for sexual penetration or other sexual activity during masturbation or with sex partners."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Sexspielzeug, oft explizit (aber nicht immer) phallisch in seiner Erscheinung, das für die sexuelle Penetration oder andere sexuelle Aktivitäten während der Masturbation oder mit Sexualpartner:innen bestimmt ist."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instrumentos con forma fálica utilizados para la estimulación sexual, generalmente mediante la penetración del ano o la vagina."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fallusvormige objecten die worden gebruikt voor seksuele stimulatie, meestal door penetratie van de anus of vagina."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En sexleksak, ofta men inte nödvändigtvis fallisk till utseendet, avsedd för sexuell penetration eller annan sexuell aktivitet vid onani eller tillsammans med sexpartner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000354"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001342"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001491"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007007162"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dildos"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001067","dc:identifier":"homoit0001067","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Packing (Phallus)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Packing"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verpakking (Fallus)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Packing (fallos)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Abultar"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The act of wearing padding or a phallic object in the front of the pants or underwear to give the appearance of having a bulge."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El acto de llevar acolchado o un objeto fálico en la parte delantera de los pantalones o la ropa interior de una persona para dar la apariencia de tener un protuberancia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het dragen van een opvulling of een fallisch voorwerp aan de voorkant van de broek of ondergoed om de indruk te wekken een penis en bobbel te hebben"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Att bära stoppning eller ett fallosformat föremål framtill i byxor eller underkläder för att skapa intryck av en utbuktning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000354"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001790"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/packingPhallus"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001342","dc:identifier":"homoit0001342","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Strap-on sex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo con arnés"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seks met kunstpenissen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Strap-on-sex"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Straponsex"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sex med strap-on"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Strap on-sex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual intercourse in which a dildo attached to a harness is used for either vaginal or anal penetration."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Relaciones sexuales en las que se utiliza un consolador sujeto a un arnés para la penetración vaginal o anal."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samlag där en dildo fäst i ett harness används för vaginal eller anal penetration."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000354"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000355"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000662"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001510"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007007163"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/strapOnSex"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001367","dc:identifier":"homoit0001367","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Thigh harnesses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arnés para el muslo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dijgordels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lårhölster"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Devices worn to attach a dildo to a person's thigh, typically so they can penetrate a partner's vagina or anus."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dispositivos que se utilizan para sujetar un consolador al muslo de una persona, generalmente para que pueda penetrar la vagina o el ano de su pareja."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hulpmiddelen die worden gedragen om een dildo aan de dij van een persoon te bevestigen, meestal opdat ze de vagina of anus van een partner kunnen binnendringen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Redskap som bärs på låret för att fästa en dildo, vanligtvis för att kunna penetrera en partners vagina eller anus."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000612"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000354"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/thighHarnesses"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001491","dc:identifier":"homoit0001491","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Vibrators"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vibradores"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vibrators"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vibratorer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Electric-powered sex toys that produce different levels of vibrations or pulses to aid in sexual stimulation and pleasure."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juguetes sexuales eléctricos que producen diferentes niveles de vibraciones o pulsos para ayudar en la estimulación y el placer sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elektrisch aangedreven seksspeeltjes die verschillende niveaus van trillingen of pulsen produceren om te helpen bij seksuele stimulatie en plezier."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexleksaker som drivs med elektricitet och som genererar olika nivåer av vibrationer eller pulser för att främja sexuell stimulans och njutning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000355"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2002004287"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/vibrators"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000701","dc:identifier":"homoit0000701","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lavender Scare"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lavender Scare"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pánico lavanda"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lavender Scare"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lavender scare"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Lavender scare"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terror lavanda"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terror lila"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the mid-20th century purge of lesbians and gay men in the U.S. government as a result of moral panic incited by Joseph McCarthy and others."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bezeichnung für die Säuberungsaktion gegen Lesben und Schwule in der US-Regierung Mitte des 20. Jahrhunderts, die auf eine von Joseph McCarthy und anderen geschürte moralische Panik zurückzuführen war"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la purga de lesbianas y hombres gay en el gobierno estadounidense a mediados del siglo XX como resultado del pánico moral incitado por Joseph McCarthy y otras personas."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva utrensningen av lesbiska och bögar från USA:s regering under 1950-talet, som ett resultat av moralpanik som bland annat Joseph McCarthy låg bakom."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000356"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000701"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lavenderScare"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001555","dc:identifier":"homoit0001555","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mononormativity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mononormatividad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mononormativiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tvåsamhetsnorm"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anti-semitisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mononormativitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Monogaminorm"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The belief that all people share a desire for monogamous relationships and that this is a preferential life goal."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La creencia de que todas las personas comparten el deseo de tener relaciones monógamas y que este es un objetivo preferencial en la vida."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De overtuiging dat alle mensen een verlangen naar monogame relaties delen en dat dit een preferentieel levensdoel is"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Föreställningen att alla människor strävar efter monogama relationer och att detta är ett önskvärt livsmål."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000356"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001019"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001916"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/mononormativity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003691","dc:identifier":"homoit0003691","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gentrification"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gentrificatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gentrifiering"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A process of economic and demographic change within a historically disinvested neighborhood by means of real estate investment and an influx of new, higher-income residents, typically resulting in the displacement of long-time, lower-income residents."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een proces van economische en demografische verandering in een historisch achtergestelde buurt door middel van investeringen in onroerend goed en een instroom van nieuwe bewoners met een hoger inkomen, wat doorgaans resulteert in de verdringing van bewoners die er al langere tijd wonen en een lager inkomen hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En process av ekonomisk och demografisk förändring i ett område som tidigare varit ekonomiskt nedprioriterat, där fastighetsinvesteringar och inflyttning av mer välbärgade personer ofta leder till att långvariga boende med låg inkomst trängs bort."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000356"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002257"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003140"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003692"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85053952"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003691"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004335","dc:identifier":"homoit0004335","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Libraries and LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bibliotheken en LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bibliotek och hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Libraries and LGBTQ people"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The relationship between libraries and LGBTQ+ people. Includes discussions of the treatment of LGBTQ+ people by library organizations, the inclusion and representation of LGBTQ+ people in libraries, and LGBTQ+ people's experiences in libraries (as patrons, employees, volunteers, etc.)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De relatie tussen bibliotheken en LHBTQ+-personen. Dit omvat discussies over de behandeling van LHBTQ+-personen door bibliotheekorganisaties, de inclusie en representatie van LHBTQ+-personen in bibliotheken, en de ervaringen van LHBTQ+-personen in bibliotheken (als bezoekers, medewerkers, vrijwilligers, enz.)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Relationen mellan bibliotek och hbtq+-personer. Inkluderar diskussioner om bibliotekens behandling av hbtq+-personer, inkludering och representation av hbtq+-personer i bibliotek och hbtq+-personers upplevelse av bibliotek (som användare, anställda, volontärer m.m.)."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000968"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000356"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002291"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004335"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000358","dc:identifier":"homoit0000358","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Diversity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diversidad"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Diversität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Diversiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mångfald"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Diversity in characteristics of people in age, gender, religion, ethnicity, sexual orientation, lifestyle, etc."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diversidad en las características de las personas en cuanto a edad, género, religión, etnicidad, orientación sexual, estilo de vida, etc."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Diversität in Bezug auf Merkmale wie Alter, Geschlecht, Religion, ethnische Zugehörigkeit, sexuelle Orientierung, Lebensstil usw."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"verscheidenheid in kenmerken van mensen in leeftijd, gender, levensbeschouwing, etniciteit, seksuele oriëntatie,en/of leefstijl enz."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mångfald i människors egenskaper vad gäller ålder, kön, religion, etnicitet, sexuell läggning, livsstil med mera."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000566"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001290"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000667"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85103571"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000358"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/diversity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000566","dc:identifier":"homoit0000566","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender diversity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diversidad de género"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtervielfalt"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Diversité de genre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderdiversiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsmångfald"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Pluralité des genres"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Pluralité de genre"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Minorités de genre"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsdiversitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"An umbrella term encompassing a range of gender identities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término general que abarca una variedad de identidades de género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Oberbegriff, der eine Reihe von Geschlechtsidentitäten umfasst."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Ensemble des identités de genre qui sont minoritaires et ne correspondent pas aux normes de genre dominantes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een overkoepelende term die een reeks genderidentiteiten omvat."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En samlingsterm som omfattar en rad olika könsidentiteter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000358"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001048"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000358"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderDiversity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001290","dc:identifier":"homoit0001290","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual diversity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diversidad sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele diversiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell mångfald"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Diversity of sexual orientation or sexuality among members of a group or within a given society."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diversidad de orientación sexual o sexualidad entre miembros de un grupo o dentro de una sociedad determinada."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"verscheidenheid in seksuele oriëntatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mångfald av sexuell läggning eller sexualitet inom en grupp eller i ett samhälle."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000358"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001558"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000807"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001292"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001556"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000358"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualDiversity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000667","dc:identifier":"homoit0000667","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersectionality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Interseccionalidad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersectionaliteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersektionalitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A theoretical framework first conceptualized by Kimberlé Crenshaw to describe how different facets of social identity (such as gender, race, ethnicity, disability, socioeconomic class, religion, and sexual identity) overlap and intersect, often compounding the individual's experiences with inequality and discrimination."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un marco teórico conceptualizado y acuñado por Kimberlé Crenshaw para describir cómo las diferentes facetas de la identidad social (como el género, la raza, el origen étnico, la discapacidad, la clase socioeconómica, la religión y la identidad sexual) se superponen y entrecruzan, a menudo agravando las experiencias de la persona con la desigualdad y la discriminación."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een theoretisch kader bedacht door Kimberlé Crenshaw om te begrijpen hoe verschillende facetten van sociale identiteit (zoals geslacht, ras, etniciteit, handicap, sociaaleconomische klasse, religie en seksuele identiteit) elkaar overlappen en elkaar kruisen, wat vaak de ervaringen van het individu met ongelijkheid en discriminatie verergert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett teoretiskt ramverk som först formulerades av Kimberlé Crenshaw för att beskriva hur olika delar av social identitet – såsom kön, ras, etnicitet, funktionsnivå, klasstillhörighet, religion och sexuell identitet – överlappar och samverkar, vilket ofta förstärker individens erfarenheter av ojämlikhet och diskriminering."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000358"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000860"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002270"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002271"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002272"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002274"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2017003056"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000667"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intersectionality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000359","dc:identifier":"homoit0000359","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Divorced people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas divorciadas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschiedene Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gescheiden personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skilda personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschiedene"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People whose marriages have been legally dissolved. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas cuyos matrimonios han sido legalmente disueltos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, deren Ehen rechtlich aufgelöst wurden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen van wie het huwelijk van rechtswege is ontbonden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer vars äktenskap juridiskt har upplösts genom skilsmässa."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000989"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000854"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001312"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85038648"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/divorcedPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000989","dc:identifier":"homoit0000989","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marital status"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estado civil"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"État civil"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Huwelijkse staat"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Civilstånd"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"fr","@value":"État matrimonial"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person's state of being single, married, separated, divorced, or widowed, as defined by a government or legal authority."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El estado de una persona de estar soltera, casada, separada, divorciada o viuda, según lo define un gobierno o una autoridad legal."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"L'état d'une personne célibataire, mariée, séparée, divorcée ou veuve, tel que défini par un gouvernement ou une autorité légale."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De staat van een persoon of deze ongehuwd, getrouwd, gescheiden, gescheiden of weduwnaar is, zoals gedefinieerd door een regering of wettelijke autoriteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En persons civilstånd – exempelvis ogift, gift, separerad, frånskild eller änka/änkling – så som det definieras av myndighet eller juridisk instans."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000990"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000359"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000994"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001312"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001483"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001504"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000712"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000937"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000992"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85081304"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/maritalStatus"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001312","dc:identifier":"homoit0001312","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Single people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas solteras"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Alleenstaanden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Singlar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Singles"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solteros"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solteras"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Enpersonshushåll"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ensamstående"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are not involved in any committed sexual or romantic relationships, including marriages, civil unions, or other established partnerships."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que no están involucradas en ninguna relación sexual o romántica comprometida, incluidos matrimonios, uniones civiles u otras relaciones establecidas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen zonder enige toegewijde seksuele of romantische relaties, inclusief huwelijken, burgerlijke verbintenissen of andere gevestigde partnerschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som inte är involverade i någon fast sexuell eller romantisk relation inklusive äktenskap, registrerade partnerskap eller andra etablerade förhållanden."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000989"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000944"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000359"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85122849"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/singlePeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000360","dc:identifier":"homoit0000360","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Domestic partnership contracts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Contratos de parejas de hecho"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lebenspartnerschaftsverträge"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Samenlevingscontracten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samboavtal"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Contratos de uniones de hecho"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lebenspartnerschafts-Verträge"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Agreements, legal or otherwise, between two unmarried people in a domestic partnership that define property rights and support obligations if the relationship ends or if one partner dies."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acuerdos, legales o de otro tipo, entre dos personas no casadas en una pareja de hecho que definen los derechos de propiedad y respaldan las obligaciones si la relación termina o si una de las parejas muere."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Vereinbarungen, rechtlicher oder anderer Art, zwischen zwei unverheirateten Personen in einer Lebenspartnerschaft, die Eigentumsrechte und Unterhaltspflichten definieren, wenn die Beziehung endet oder ein Partner stirbt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overeenkomsten, wettelijk of anderszins, tussen twee ongehuwde personen die samenleven waarin eigendomsrechten en ondersteuningsverplichtingen worden vastgelegd als de relatie eindigt of als iemand overlijdt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Överenskommelser, juridiska eller informella, mellan två ogifta personer i ett samboförhållande som definierar egendomsrätt och försörjningsansvar vid separation eller dödsfall."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001053"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000361"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000362"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000918"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000963"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000990"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000712"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/domesticPartnershipContracts"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000361","dc:identifier":"homoit0000361","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Domestic partnership retirement benefits"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Beneficios de jubilación de parejas de hecho"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Altersvorsorge für Lebenspartnerschaften"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Partnerpensioenen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pensionsförmåner för sambor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Same-sex pension benefits"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Beneficios de jubilación de uniones de hecho"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Beneficios de jubilación de parejas del mismo sexo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Rentenleistung für Lebenspartnerschaften"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gleichgeschlechtliche Rentenleistungen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gleischgeschlechtliche Altersvorsorge"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Employee benefit plans for people in domestic partnerships that can be accessed upon retirement."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Planes de beneficios para empleados para personas en parejas de hecho a los que se puede acceder al jubilarse."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Arbeitnehmer-Vorsorgepläne für Personen in Lebenspartnerschaften, auf die nach der Pensionierung zugegriffen werden kann."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pensioenen voor partners na pensionering."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arbetsgivarbaserade pensionsförmåner som omfattar personer i samboskap och som kan tas i anspråk vid pensionering."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000360"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000918"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh97004494"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000361"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/domesticPartnershipRetirementBenefits"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000963","dc:identifier":"homoit0000963","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ weddings"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bodas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-huwelijksvoltrekkingen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-bröllop"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ weddings"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Weddings (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bodas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Matrimonios LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casamientos LGBTQ"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bröllop (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marriage ceremonies and the accompanying festivities; use to describe weddings in which both partners are LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ceremonias matrimoniales y las festividades que las acompañan; utilícese para describir bodas en las que ambas personas son LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Huwelijksvoltrekkingen en de bijbehorende festiviteiten; gebruiken om huwelijksvoltrekkingen te beschrijven waarbij beide partners LHBTQ+ zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bröllopsceremonier och tillhörande festligheter. Används för vigslar där båda parter är hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004338"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004339"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004340"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004342"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004343"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004344"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004345"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004412"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000360"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000990"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004341"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004360"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004361"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000963"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQWeddings"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001311","dc:identifier":"homoit0001311","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Significant others"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parejas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Relatiepartners"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Significant others"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Viktiga andra"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"An individual's partner or partners in an established, ongoing romantic or sexual relationship."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La pareja o las parejas de una persona en una relación romántica o sexual establecida y en curso."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De partner of partners van een persoon in een gevestigde, voortdurende romantische of seksuele relatie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Amerikanskt begrepp för en individs partner/partners i en etablerad pågående romantisk eller sexuell relation."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000362"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000675"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000855"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000895"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001080"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001081"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001082"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002365"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001311"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/significantOthers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002990","dc:identifier":"homoit0002990","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual dominatrices"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dominatrices asexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Domina"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele dominatrices"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella dominatrixer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Domina"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella dominor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women who take a dominant role in BDSM activities; use for dominatrices who identify as asexual."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres que desempeñan un papel dominante en actividades de BDSM; utilícese para dominatrices que se autoidentifiquen como asexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Frauen, die eine dominante Rolle in BDSM-Aktivitäten übernehmen; Verwendung für Dominas, die sich als asexuell identifizieren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som intar en dominant roll inom BDSM och/eller i maktutbytesrelationer med en dominant/underordnad dynamik. Termen används främst av feminint identifierade personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000363"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001637"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-10-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000390","dc:identifier":"homoit0000390","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Egg donors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes de óvulos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eizellspender:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Eiceldonoren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Äggdonatorer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Eizellspender"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eizellspenderinnen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals of any gender who donate their own eggs for the purpose of inducing pregnancy."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de cualquier género que donan sus propios óvulos con el fin de inducir el embarazo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen jeden Geschlechts, die ihre eigenen Eizellen zum Zweck einer Schwangerschaft spenden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die vrouwelijke voortplantingscellen (eieren) produceren en aanbieden om een ander in staat te stellen zwanger te worden als onderdeel van een geassisteerde voortplantingsbehandeling of voor biomedisch onderzoek."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som donerar sina egna ägg i syfte att möjliggöra graviditet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000583"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001347"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002627"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2005007904"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/eggDonors"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000824","dc:identifier":"homoit0000824","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ blood donors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes de sangre LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の献血者"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-bloeddonoren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Blodgivare (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ blood donors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes de sangre LGBTQ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQの献血者"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who give blood for transfusion and medical purposes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que donan sangre para transfusiones y con fines médicos."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"輸血や医療目的で献血を行うLGBTQ+の人々。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die bloed geven voor transfusie en medische doeleinden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som ger blod för transfusion och medicinska ändamål."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQBloodDonors"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002616","dc:identifier":"homoit0002616","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anonymous donors (Reproduction) "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes anónimos (reproducción)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Anonyme Spender:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anonieme donoren (Reproductie)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Anonyma donatorer (reproduktion)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Anonyme Samenspender:innen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Anonyme Eizellenspender:innen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who donated their gametes with the understanding that their identity would remain unknown by any potential offspring."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que donaron sus gametos con el entendimiento de que su identidad permanecería oculta de cualquier posible descendiente."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen, die ihre Gameten (Geschlechtszellen) in dem Wissen gespendet haben, dass ihre Identität für alle potenziellen Nachkommen unbekannt bleiben würde."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die hun gameten doneerden in de wetenschap dat hun identiteit onbekend zou blijven voor potentiële nakomelingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som donerat sina könsceller med vilkoret att deras identitet skulle förbli okänd för eventuella barn som tillkommit genom donation."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002624","dc:identifier":"homoit0002624","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Known donors (Reproduction) "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes conocidos (reproducción)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bekende donoren (Reproductie)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kända donatorer (reproduktion)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Donors whose identities are known by the people to whom they donated gametes and/or the offspring born of that donation."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes cuyas identidades son conocidas por las personas a quienes donaron gametos y/o por la descendencia nacida de esa donación."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Donoren wier identiteit bekend is bij de mensen aan wie zij gameten hebben gedoneerd en/of de nakomelingen die uit die donatie zijn geboren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Donatorer vars identitet är känd för de personer som de har donerat könsceller till och/eller för de barn som fötts till följd av donationen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002625","dc:identifier":"homoit0002625","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Open identity donors (Reproduction) "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes de identidad abierta (Reproducción)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Open identiteit donoren (Reproductie)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kända donatorer (reproduktion)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Identity release donors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Willing-to-be-known donors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes con identidad revelada"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Donors who donated their gametes with the understanding that their identity and/or contact information would be released to any offspring born of that donation. The age at which the offspring receives this information varies, following the donor's preference."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Donantes que donaron sus gametos con el entendimiento de que su identidad y/o información de contacto se divulgarían a cualquier descendiente nacido de esa donación. La edad a la que el descendiente recibe esta información varía según la preferencia del donante."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Donoren die hun gameten hebben gedoneerd met dien verstande dat hun identiteit en/of contactgegevens worden vrijgegeven aan alle nakomelingen die uit die donatie zijn geboren. De leeftijd waarop het nageslacht deze informatie ontvangt, varieert afhankelijk van de voorkeur van de donor."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Donatorer som donerat könsceller med villkoret att deras identitet och/eller kontaktuppgifter ska lämnas ut till barn som tillkommit genom donationen. Åldern då barnet får tillgång till informationen varierar beroende på nationell lagstiftning och/eller donatorns önskemål."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000364"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001788","dc:identifier":"homoit0001788","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Beards (Gay culture)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Beard"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Barbas (cultura gay)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Beards"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skägg (bögkultur)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Beards"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Alibi-Partner:in"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Beards"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who pose as the date or partner of someone they are not in a relationship with, typically to prevent that person's sexuality from becoming public knowledge; most commonly used to refer to a woman pretending to be dating a gay man."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die sich als Date oder Partner:in von jemandem ausgeben, mit dem:der sie nicht in einer Beziehung sind, in der Regel um zu verhindern, dass die Sexualität dieser Person öffentlich bekannt wird; am häufigsten wird damit eine Frau bezeichnet, die vorgibt, mit einem schwulen Mann auszugehen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se hacen pasar por la pareja de alguien con quien no mantienen una relación, normalmente para evitar que la sexualidad de esa persona se haga pública. Más comúnmente utilizado para referirse a una mujer que finge estar saliendo con un hombre gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die zich voordoet als de date of partner van iemand met wie ze geen relatie hebben, meestal om te voorkomen dat de seksualiteit van die persoon algemeen bekend wordt; meestal gebruikt om te verwijzen naar een vrouw die doet alsof ze met een homoseksuele man uitgaat"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som låtsas dejta eller vara partner till någon de inte har en relation med, vanligtvis för att hindra att den personens sexualitet blir offentlig. Termen används oftast för att beskriva en kvinna som låtsas ha en romantisk relation med en homosexuell man."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000365"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000381"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000416"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000598"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001261"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001783"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-12-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002278","dc:identifier":"homoit0002278","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"MLM (Men Loving Men)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"MLM (Men Loving Men)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"MLM (Mannen die mannen liefhebben)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"MLM (Men Loving Men)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Man loving man"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Men loving men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres que aman hombres"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Men loving men"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannen die mannen liefhebben"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Men loving men"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang term used to describe men who have romantic and/or sexual relationships with other men; often used as an alternative to the term \"Men who have sex with men.\" Can be used to describe men who are exclusively or primarily interested in men, as well as men who are also interested in people of other or all genders. Only use to describe people who self-identify as MLM."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga utilizado para describir a hombres que tienen relaciones románticas y/o sexuales con otros hombres; a menudo se utiliza como alternativa al término \"Hombres que tienen sexo con hombres\". Puede utilizarse para describir a hombres que están interesados ​​exclusiva o principalmente en hombres, así como a hombres que también están interesados ​​en personas de otros o todos los géneros. Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas que se autoidentifiquen como MLM."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Jargonterm die wordt gebruikt om mannen te beschrijven die romantische en/of seksuele relaties hebben met andere mannen; vaak gebruikt als alternatief voor de term 'mannen die seks hebben met mannen'. Kan worden gebruikt om mannen te beschrijven die uitsluitend of voornamelijk geïnteresseerd zijn in mannen, evenals mannen die ook geïnteresseerd zijn in personen van andere of alle genders. Alleen gebruiken om personen te beschrijven die zichzelf identificeren als MLM."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Amerikansk slangterm som används för att beskriva män som har romantiska och/eller sexuella relationer med andra män. Används ofta som alternativ till ”män som har sex med män”. Kan avse män som enbart eller främst attraheras av män, men också män med intresse för andra kön. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig med termen MLM."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001008"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000365"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001254"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003245","dc:identifier":"homoit0003245","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag television programs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Fernsehsendungen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Programas televisivos drag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag televisieprogramma's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Drag-tv"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag TV programmes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag TV programs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag TV shows"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag television programmes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag television shows"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag television"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Fernsehprogramme"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Sendungen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Programas de televisión drag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag televisieshows"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag tv programma's"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag tv shows"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Drag TV-program"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Television programs that feature drag queens and/or drag kings and drag performances."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fernsehsendungen, in denen Dragqueens und/oder Dragkings und Drag-Aufritte zu sehen sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Programas de televisión donde aparecen drag queens y/o drag kings y actuaciones de drag."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Televisieprogramma's waarin dragqueens en/of dragkings en dragoptredens voorkomen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tv-program som visar dragqueens och/eller dragkings och dragframträdanden."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000367"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001359"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2021001448"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001906","dc:identifier":"homoit0001906","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag performers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Künstler:innen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intérpretes de drag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag performers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dragartister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Künstler"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Künstlerinnen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Darsteller:innen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Performer:innen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Artistas drag"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Performers who dress and/or use makeup to produce, emphasize, and/or exaggerate traits associated with a certain gender, which may or may not be the gender the performer primarily identifies with."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Künstler:innen, die sich verkleiden und/oder schminken, um Merkmale verbunden mit einem bestimmten Geschlecht zu schaffen, zu betonen oder zu übertreiben, mit dem sich die Künstler:in identifizieren können oder nicht."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Artistas que se visten y/o utilizan maquillaje para producir, enfatizar y/o exagerar rasgos asociados con un determinado género, que puede o no ser el género con el que el artista se identifica principalmente."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Performers die zich kleden en/of make-up gebruiken om eigenschappen die verband houden met een bepaald gender te produceren, te benadrukken en/of te overdrijven, wat al dan niet het gender kan zijn waarmee de performer zich in de eerste plaats identificeert"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Artister som klär sig och/eller använder smink för att skapa, framhäva och/eller överdriva drag som förknippas med ett visst kön, vilket kan vara eller inte vara det kön som utövaren i första hand identifierar sig med."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000367"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000370"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000373"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000375"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003359"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003360"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001906"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003359","dc:identifier":"homoit0003359","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag shows"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag Shows"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Shows drag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag shows"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dragshower"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag performances"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Auftritte"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Performances"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Drag shows"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Performances by a single drag performer or a group of drag performers, which often include singing or lip syncing, dance routines, and comedy skits."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Auftritte einer einzelnen Drag-Künstler:in oder einer Gruppe Drag-Künstler:innen, oft mit Gesang oder Lippensynchronisation, Tanznummern oder komödiantischen Sketchen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actuaciones de una artista drag o de un grupo de artistas drag, que suelen incluir canto o sincronización labial (playback), rutinas de baile y sketches cómicos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Optredens van één enkele drag-artiest of een groep drag-artiesten, waarbij vaak zang of playbacken, dansroutines en komische sketches voorkomen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Framträdanden av en eller flera dragartister som ofta innehåller sång eller mimande till sång, dansnummer och komiska sketcher."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000367"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000369"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001906"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003816"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003817"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006003334"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003360","dc:identifier":"homoit0003360","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag pageants"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Wettbewerbe"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Concursos de belleza drag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dragwedstrijden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Drag-skönhetstävlingar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Pageants"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pageants"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Drag pageants"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Events styled after traditional beauty pageants or contests in which contestants, typically drag queens, female impersonators, and trans women, compete in a range of categories to win a prize or title."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Veranstaltungen im Stil traditioneller Schönheitswettbewerbe, bei denen die Teilnehmer:innen, in der Regel Dragqueens, weibliche Imitator:innen und trans Frauen, in verschiedenen Katagorien gegeneinander antreten, um einen Preis oder Titel zu gewinnen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Eventos inspirados en concursos o certámenes de belleza tradicionales donde las concursantes, normalmente drag queens, imitadoras femeninas y mujeres trans, compiten en diversas categorías para ganar un premio o un título."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Evenementen die zijn gebaseerd op traditionele schoonheidswedstrijden waarbij deelnemers, meestal dragqueens, vrouwelijke impersonators en transvrouwen, in verschillende categorieën strijden om een ​​prijs of titel te winnen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Evenemang utformade efter traditionella skönhetstävlingar eller tävlingsformat där deltagare, vanligtvis dragqueens, damimitatörer och transkvinnor, tävlar i olika kategorier för att vinna ett pris eller en titel."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000367"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000369"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001906"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861","dc:identifier":"homoit0000861","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ events"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Eventos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ のイベント"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-evenementen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-evenemang"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ events"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ のイベント"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized public or social occasions for LGBTQ+ people and communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ocasiones públicas o sociales organizadas para personas y comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々やコミュニティを対象として企画した、公式または社交的なイベント。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde openbare of sociale bijeenkomsten voor LHBTQ+-personen en gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade offentliga eller sociala tillställningar för hbtq+-personer och hbtq+-gemenskaper."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000368"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000607"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000949"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003080"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003106"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003359"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003360"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003594"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003595"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003596"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003597"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003598"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003599"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003600"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003602"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003603"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003604"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003605"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003606"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003651"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003656"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003734"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003735"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000900"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002157"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002166"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002202"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003601"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003607"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQEvents"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000372","dc:identifier":"homoit0000372","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag fathers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Väter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres drag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag vaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dragpappor"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás drag"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"More experienced drag kings who support less experienced drag kings as they enter the drag scene as performers."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erfahrenere Dragkings, die weniger erfahrene Dragkings bei ihrem Einstieg in die Drag-Szene als Künstler:innen unterstützen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Drag kings con más experiencia que apoyan a drag kings con menos experiencia cuando ingresan a la escena drag como artistas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Meer ervaren drag kings die minder ervaren drag kings ondersteunen als ze de drag scene betreden als performers."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mer erfarna dragkings som stöttar mindre erfarna dragkings när de etablerar sig som artister inom dragscenen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000371"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000373"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000374"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000375"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000297"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dragFathers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000374","dc:identifier":"homoit0000374","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drag mothers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres drag"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Drag-Mütter"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drag moeders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dragmammor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"More experienced drag queens who support less experienced drag queens as they enter the drag scene as performers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Drag queens con más experiencia que apoyan a drag queens con menos experiencia cuando ingresan a la escena drag como artistas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erfahrenere Dragqueens, die weniger erfahrene Dragqueens bei ihrem Einsteig in die Drag-Szene als Künstler:innen unterstützen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Meer ervaren dragqueens die minder ervaren dragqueens ondersteunen bij het betreden van de dragscene als performers."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mer erfarna dragqueens som stöttar mindre erfarna dragqueens när de etablerar sig som artister inom dragscenen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000371"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000372"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000373"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000375"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000297"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dragMothers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000983","dc:identifier":"homoit0000983","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Male impersonators"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Imitadores masculinos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannelijke impersonators"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Herrimitatörer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannelijke impersonatoren"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Historical term used to describe performers, often female-identified people, who enact male personas for the purpose of entertainment, typically for straight audiences. Only use in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término histórico utilizado para describir a los artistas, a menudo personas identificadas como mujeres, que representan personajes masculinos con fines de entretenimiento, generalmente para audiencias heterosexuales. Utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Historische term die een artiest beschrijft, vaak iemand die zich als vrouw identificeert, die een mannelijke persona vertolkt voor amusementsdoeleinden, meestal voor een heteropubliek; alleen gebruiken in historische context"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historisk term för artister, ofta kvinnor, som uppträdde i manliga roller för underhållning, vanligtvis för en heterosexuell publik. Används endast i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000373"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003817"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85064636"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/maleImpersonators"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001148","dc:identifier":"homoit0001148","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queens (Gay culture)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Queens (Cultura gay)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queens (Homocultuur)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queens (bögkultur)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queens"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Reinas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Queens"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Reinas (cultura gay)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang term for effeminate gay men; predominantly used in the United States."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga para hombres gay afeminados; utilizado predominantemente en los Estados Unidos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Argot-term voor \"verwijfde\" homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slangterm för feminina bögar, främst använd i USA."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000375"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001313"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queens"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000431","dc:identifier":"homoit0000431","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female impersonators"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Imitadores femeninos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Damenimitatoren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke impersonators"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Damimitatörer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Imitador femenino"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke impersonatoren"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Historical term describing performers, often male-identified people, who enact female personas for the purpose of entertainment, often for straight audiences. Eclipsed by other terms (such as drag queen) in the late 20th century."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término histórico para describir a artistas, a menudo, personas que se identificaban como masculinas, que encarnan personajes femeninos con fines de entretenimiento, a menudo, para audiencias heterosexuales. Fue por otros términos (como \"drag queen\") a finales del siglo XX."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Historischer Begriff, der darstellende Künstler, häufig sich als männlich identifizierende Personen, beschreibt, die weibliche Rollen zum Zwecke der Unterhaltung spielen, oft für ein heterosexuelles Publikum. Wurde Ende des 20. Jahrhunderts von anderen Begriffen (wie z.B. Drag Queen) verdrängt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Historische term die een artiest beschrijft, vaak een als man geïdentificeerde persoon, die een vrouwelijke persona vertolkt voor amusementsdoeleinden, vaak voor een heteroseksueel publiek. Overschaduwd door andere termen (zoals drag queen) in de late 20e eeuw."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historisk term som beskriver artister, ofta personer som identifierar sig som män, som gestaltar kvinnliga personas i underhållningssyfte, ofta för heterosexuell publik. Begreppet trängdes undan av andra termer (såsom dragqueen) under slutet av 1900-talet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000375"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003816"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85064634"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/femaleImpersonators"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000489","dc:identifier":"homoit0000489","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay drama"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Drama gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Drama"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homodrama"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögdramatik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay plays"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögscenkonst"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig dramatik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works to be performed on stage. Use for drama focusing on gay characters and themes. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras de ficción escritas para ser puestas en escena; utilícese en referencia a obras dramáticas que se centran en personajes o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fiktionale Werke, die für die Aufführung geschrieben wurden; Verwendung in Bezug auf dramatische Werke, die sich auf schwule Charaktere oder Themen konzentrieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fictieve werken die zijn geschreven om uitgevoerd te worden; gebruiken met betrekking tot dramatische werken gericht op homopersonages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fiktion avsedd för sceniskt framförande med homosexuella manliga gestalter eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000376"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001725"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008105061"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayDrama"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000739","dc:identifier":"homoit0000739","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian drama"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Drama lésbico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbisch drama"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk dramatik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian plays"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk scenkonst"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works to be performed on stage. Use for drama focusing on lesbian characters and themes. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras de ficción escritas para ser puestas en escena; utilícese en referencia a obras dramáticas que se centran en personajes o temas lésbicos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fictieve werken die zijn geschreven om uitgevoerd te worden; gebruiken met betrekking tot dramatische wer