","@value":"Fictie geschreven om uitgevoerd te worden op een podium; Gebruik om te verwijzen naar dramatische werken die zich richten op Two-Spirit-personages of -thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fiktion avsedd för sceniskt framförande med Two-spirit-gestalter eller teman."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000376"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002691"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-26"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000379","dc:identifier":"homoit0000379","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who use substances"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die middelen gebruiken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som använder substanser"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drug users (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who drink"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who use drugs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Substance users (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die drinken"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die drugs gebruiken"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Middelengebruikers (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Droganvändning hos hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som använder droger"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som knarkar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som använder substanser"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term for LGBTQ+ people who use substances (that are typically deemed harmful or are subject to legal restriction, such as drugs or alcohol) for any reason. Apply more specific terms if possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general para las personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias (que suelen ser consideradas nocivas o están sujetas a restricciones legales, como las drogas o el alcohol) por cualquier motivo. Aplique términos más específicos de ser posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor LHBTQ+-personen die om welke reden dan ook middelen gebruiken (die doorgaans als schadelijk worden beschouwd of die onderhevig zijn aan wettelijke beperkingen, zoals drugs of alcohol). Ken indien mogelijk meer specifieke termen toe"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Paraplyterm för hbtq+-personer som använder substanser (ofta sådana som betraktas som skadliga eller är juridiskt reglerade, som alkohol eller droger), oavsett syfte. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001235"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001540"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001550"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002229"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004225"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/drugUsers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001235","dc:identifier":"homoit0001235","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who use substances recreationally"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias con fines recreativos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die middelen recreatief gebruiken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som använder substanser i rekreationssyfte"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The use of substances (that are typically deemed harmful or are subject to legal restriction, such as drugs or alcohol) by LGBTQ+ people for recreational or social purposes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El uso de sustancias (que suelen considerarse nocivas o que están sujetas a restricciones legales, como las drogas o el alcohol) por parte de personas LGBTQ+ con fines recreativos o sociales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het gebruik van middelen (die doorgaans schadelijk worden geacht of onderhevig zijn aan wettelijke beperkingen, zoals drugs of alcohol) door LHBTQ+-personen voor recreatieve of sociale doeleinden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Användning av substanser (som alkohol eller droger) av hbtq+-personer i rekreationellt eller socialt syfte."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000379"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002289"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004227"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/recreationalDrugUse"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001540","dc:identifier":"homoit0001540","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people with alcohol use disorders"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ con trastornos por consumo de alcohol"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met een stoornis in alcoholgebruik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer med alkoholbrukssyndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Alcoholics (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ alcoholics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alcohólicos (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alcohólicos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"LGBTQ+ alcohólicos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+ alcoholisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkoholberoende hos hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkoholmissbruk hos hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkoholmissbrukande hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer med alkoholberoende"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer med alkoholmissbruk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som lever i alkoholberoende"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som lever i alkoholmissbruk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som missbrukar alkohol"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är beroende av alkohol"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkoholism (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have been diagnosed with or regard themselves as having an alcohol use disorder, a medical condition that involves a pattern of alcohol use that is difficult to control, negatively impacts the individual's life, and results in withdrawal symptoms upon cessation. Only use to refer to individuals who describe themselves as having an alcohol use disorder. Follow the individual's preference for \"use disorder\" or \"addiction\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que han sido diagnosticadas o que reconocen que tienen un trastorno por consumo de alcohol, una condición médica que implica un patrón de consumo de alcohol difícil de controlar, que afecta negativamente la vida de la persona y que provoca síntomas de abstinencia al dejar de consumirlo. Utilícese únicamente para referirse a personas que se describen a sí mismas como padeciendo de un trastorno por consumo de alcohol. Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"trastorno por consumo\" o \"adicción\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen bij wie de diagnose stoornis in het gebruik van alcohol is vastgesteld of die zichzelf als zodanig beschouwen; een medische aandoening die gepaard gaat met een moeilijk te beheersen patroon van alcoholgebruik, een negatieve invloed heeft op het leven van de persoon en leidt tot ontwenningsverschijnselen bij het stoppen. Alleen gebruiken om te verwijzen naar personen die zichzelf beschrijven als iemand met een alcoholverslaving. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"gebruiksstoornis\" of \"verslaving\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har diagnostiserats med eller själva uppfattar sig ha ett alkoholbrukssyndrom, ett medicinskt tillstånd som innebär ett alkoholanvändande som är svårt att kontrollera, påverkar individens liv negativt och kan leda till abstinenssymtom vid avbrott. Används endast för personer som själva beskriver sig som att de har ett alkoholbrukssyndrom. Följ individens eget språkbruk när det gäller om de föredrar att använda termen alkoholbrukssyndrom eller beroende."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000379"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001550"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001549"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004229"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQAlcoholics"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001550","dc:identifier":"homoit0001550","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people with addictions"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ con adicciones"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met een verslaving"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer med beroende"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ people with addictions"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ con adicciones"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term for LGBTQ+ people experiencing addictions, dependencies, or use disorders of some kind. Only use to refer to individuals who describe themselves as having addictions. Apply more specific terms if possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general para las personas LGBTQ+ que sufren de adicciones, dependencias o trastornos por consumo de algún tipo. Utilícese únicamente para referirse a personas que se describen a sí mismas como adictas. Aplique términos más específicos de ser posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor LHBTQ+-personen die verslavingen, afhankelijkheid of een of andere soort gebruiksstoornissen ervaren. Alleen gebruiken om te verwijzen naar personen die zichzelf beschrijven als verslaafden. Pas indien mogelijk meer specifieke termen toe"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Paraplybegrepp för hbtq+-personer som upplever beroendeproblematik, beroende eller substansbrukssyndrom av något slag. Används endast för personer som själva beskriver sig som att de har ett beroende. Mer specifika termer bör användas när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000379"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001283"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001540"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002226"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004228"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPeopleWithAddictions"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002229","dc:identifier":"homoit0002229","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who use substances for medical purposes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias con fines médicos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die middelen gebruiken voor medische doeleinden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som använder substanser i medicinskt syfte"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who use substances for medical purposes (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que utilizan sustancias con fines médicos (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who use substances (that are typically deemed harmful or are subject to legal restriction, such as drugs or alcohol) in order to manage pain and other symptoms related to a medical condition or disability."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que utilizan sustancias (que suelen ser consideradas nocivas o están sujetas a restricciones legales, como las drogas o el alcohol) para controlar el dolor y otros síntomas relacionados con una enfermedad o discapacidad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die middelen gebruiken (die doorgaans als schadelijk worden beschouwd of die onderhevig zijn aan wettelijke beperkingen, zoals drugs of alcohol) om pijn en andere symptomen die verband houden met een medische aandoening of handicap te beheersen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som använder substanser (såsom alkohol eller droger) för att hantera smärta och andra symtom kopplade till en sjukdom eller funktionsnedsättning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000379"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001854"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001879"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004226"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004225","dc:identifier":"homoit0004225","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who use substances"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people die middelen gebruiken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som använder substanser"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit substance users"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit drug users"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit drinkers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit people who use substances"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited people who use substances"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited people who use substances"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S people who use substances"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit middelengebruikers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people die drinken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Droganvändning hos two-spirit-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som använder droger"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som knarkar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som använder substanser"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term for Two-Spirit people who use substances (that are typically deemed harmful or are subject to legal restriction, such as drugs and alcohol) for any reason. Apply more specific terms if possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor Two-Spirit people die om welke reden dan ook middelen gebruiken (die doorgaans als schadelijk worden beschouwd of waarvoor wettelijke beperkingen gelden, zoals drugs en alcohol). Gebruik indien mogelijk specifiekere termen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Paraplyterm för two-spirit-personer som använder substanser (ofta sådana som betraktas som skadliga eller är juridiskt reglerade, som alkohol eller droger), oavsett syfte. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004226"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004227"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004228"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004229"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004230"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000379"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380","dc:identifier":"homoit0000380","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Substance use in LGBTQ+ communities"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uso de substancias en la comunidad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Middelengebruik in LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Droganvändning (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Alcohol use (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Alcohol use in LGBTQ+ communities"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Drug use (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Drug use in LGBTQ+ communities"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ substance use"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Substance use (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Consumo de substancias en la comunidad LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uso de alcohol (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Consumo de alcohol (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uso de drogas en la comunidad LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uso de drogas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Consumo de drogas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uso de substancias (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Alcoholgebruik in LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Druggebruik (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Druggebruik in LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-middelengebruik"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Middelengebruik (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Droganvändning hos hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som använder droger"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som knarkar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The use of substances (that are typically deemed harmful or are subject to legal restriction, such as drugs or alcohol) and discussions surrounding the particular impact of substance use within LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El uso de sustancias (que normalmente se consideran dañinas o están sujetas a restricciones legales, como drogas o alcohol) y debates sobre el impacto particular del uso de sustancias dentro de las comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Middelengebruik (die doorgaans als schadelijk worden beschouwd of onderworpen zijn aan wettelijke beperkingen, zoals drugs of alcohol) en discussies over de specifieke impact van middelengebruik binnen LGBTQ+-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Användning av substanser (som ofta betraktas som skadliga eller är juridiskt reglerade, såsom droger eller alkohol) samt diskussioner om hur detta påverkar hbtq+-gemenskaper."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001550"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001007"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001125"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001235"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001549"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002226"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002229"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/drugs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001125","dc:identifier":"homoit0001125","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Poppers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poppers"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Poppers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Poppers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Poppers"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tape head cleaner"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Popers"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Vasodilatateurs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkylnitrit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Amylnitrit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Butylnitrit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Isobutylnitrit"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A slang term commonly used in LGBTQ+ subcultures to describe alkyl nitrites, a class of drug that produces a high when inhaled. Poppers are often associated with gay nightlife because they can be used to facilitate anal sex by relaxing the anal muscles."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término de jerga comúnmente utilizado en subculturas LGBTQ+ para describir los nitritos de alquilo, una clase de droga que produce un efecto estimulador cuando se inhala. Los poppers a menudo se asocian con la vida nocturna gay porque pueden utilizarse para facilitar el sexo anal al relajar los músculos anales."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Terme familier utilisé pour désigner le nitrite d'alkyle, substances qui procurent un effet euphorisant et aphrodisiaque lorsqu'elles sont inhalées. Les « poppers » sont souvent associés à la vie nocturne gaie, parce qu'ils peuvent être utilisés lors de rapports sexuels pour faciliter les relations sexuelles anales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Argot term voor alkylnitriet, een drug die een high gevoel veroorzaakt bij inademing; soms gebruikt om anale seks te vergemakkelijken door de anale spieren te ontspannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slangterm som ofta används i hbtq+-subkulturer för att beskriva alkylnitriter, en typ av drog som ger ett rus vid inandning. Poppers är särskilt associerade med bögars uteliv eftersom de kan underlätta analsex genom att slappna av musklerna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001317"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001317"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/poppers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001549","dc:identifier":"homoit0001549","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people in recovery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ en recuperación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen in herstel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer i återhämtning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ people in recovery"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer i 12-stegsprogram"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer i avvänjning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people currently in recovery from use disorders, conditions, or addictions. Follow the individual's preference for \"recovery\" or \"sobriety\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ actualmente en recuperación de trastornos, condiciones o adicciones por consumo. Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"recuperación\" o \"sobriedad\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die momenteel herstellen van gebruiksstoornissen, aandoeningen of verslavingen. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van personen voor \"herstel\" of \"nuchterheid\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som befinner sig i återhämtning från substansbrukssyndrom, skadligt bruk eller beroendeproblematik. Följ individens eget språkbruk när det gäller om de föredrar att beskriva sin situation som återhämtning eller nykterhet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001540"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004232"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPeopleInRecovery"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002226","dc:identifier":"homoit0002226","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people with substance use disorders"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ con trastornos por uso de sustancias"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met een stoornis in middelengebruik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer med substansbrukssyndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drug addicts (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ drug addicts"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people with drug addictions"},{"@language":"en","@value":"People with substance abuse disorders (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-drugsverslaafden"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met een drugsverslaving"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met een stoornis in het middelengebruik (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Substansmissbruk (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have been diagnosed with or regard themselves as having a substance use disorder, a medical condition that involves a pattern of substance use that is difficult to control, negatively impacts the individual's life, and results in withdrawal symptoms upon cessation. Only use to refer to individuals who describe themselves as having a substance use disorder. Follow the individual's preference for \"use disorder\" or \"addiction\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que han sido diagnosticadas o que ellas mismas consideran que padecen de un trastorno por uso de sustancias, una condición médica que implica un patrón de uso de sustancias que es difícil de controlar, afecta negativamente la vida de la persona y provoca síntomas de abstinencia al dejar de usarlas. Utilícese únicamente para referirse a personas que se describen a sí mismas como padeciendo de un trastorno por uso de sustancias. Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"trastorno por consumo\" o \"adicción\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen bij wie een stoornis in het middelengebruik is vastgesteld of dit bij zichzelf hebben vastgesteld, een medische aandoening die gepaard gaat met een patroon van middelengebruik dat moeilijk onder controle te houden is, een negatieve invloed heeft op het leven van het individu en resulteert in ontwenningsverschijnselen bij het stoppen. Alleen gebruiken om te verwijzen naar personen die zichzelf beschrijven als iemand met een stoornis in het middelengebruik. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"stoornis in het gebruik\" of \"verslaving\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har diagnostiserats med eller själva uppfattar sig ha ett substansbrukssyndrom, ett medicinskt tillstånd som innebär ett substansbruk som är svårt att kontrollera, påverkar individens liv negativt och kan leda till abstinenssymtom vid avbrott. Används endast för personer som själva beskriver sig som att de har ett substansbrukssyndrom. Följ individens eget språkbruk när det gäller om de föredrar termen substansbrukssyndrom eller beroende."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001550"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004230"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000381","dc:identifier":"homoit0000381","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dutch boys"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dutch Boys"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dutch boys"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dutch boys"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dutch boys"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbros"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dutch boys"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbros"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang for heterosexual men who are friends with lesbians and socialize in lesbian spaces."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Umgangssprachliche Bezeichnung für heterosexuelle Männer, die mit Lesben befreundet sind und sich in lesbischen Kreisen bewegen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jerga para hombres heterosexuales que son amigos de lesbianas y socializan en espacios lésbicos."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slang för heterosexuella män som är vänner med lesbiska och umgås i lesbiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000626"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000416"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000455"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000598"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001788"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dutchBoys"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000626","dc:identifier":"homoit0000626","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres heterosexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteromannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella män"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres hétero"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Men who identify as heterosexual, or straight."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres que se autoidentifican como heterosexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannen die zich identificeren als heteroseksueel of hetero."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Män som identifierar sig som heterosexuella."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001008"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000381"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000417"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93003542"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexualMen"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000416","dc:identifier":"homoit0000416","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fag hags"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mariliendre (Spain)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenmutti"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nichtenmoeders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Faghags"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Mariliendra (Spain)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mosca de la fruta"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fag Hags"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang for heterosexual women who are friends with gay men and socialize in gay spaces."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jerga para mujeres heterosexuales que son amigas de hombres gay y socializan en espacios gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Slang für heterosexuelle Frauen, die mit schwulen Männern befreundet sind und sich in schwulen Kreisen bewegen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slang för heterosexuella kvinnor som är vänner med bögar och umgås i gaymiljöer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000629"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000381"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000455"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000598"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001788"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fagHags"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001831","dc:identifier":"homoit0001831","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ culture"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ のカルチャー"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ の文化"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+-Kultur"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cultura LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-cultuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-kultur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Cultura LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cultura (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cultural experiences shared by members of LGBTQ+ communities or products of LGBTQ+ culture (e.g., art and media created by and for LGBTQ+ culture, activism focused on LGBTQ+ issues, slang commonly used in LGBTQ+ communities, etc.). Use a more specific term if possible."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+コミュニティのメンバーが共有する文化的体験、またはLGBTQ+文化の産物（例：LGBTQ+文化によって制作された、またはLGBTQ+文化のために制作された芸術作品やメディア、LGBTQ+問題に焦点を当てた活動、LGBTQ+コミュニティで一般的に使用されるスラングなど）。可能であれば、より具体的な用語を使用してください。"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bezieht sich auf kulturelle Erfahrungen, die Mitglieder der LGBTQ+-Gemeinschaft teilen, oder auf Produkte der LGBTQ+-Kultur (z. B. Kunst und Medien, die von und für LGBTQ+-Personen geschaffen wurden, Aktivismus mit Schwerpunkt auf LGBTQ+-Themen, in LGBTQ+-Gemeinschaften gebräuchliche Slangausdrücke usw.)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Experiencias culturales compartidas por miembros de comunidades LGBTQ+ o productos de la cultura LGBTQ+ (por ejemplo, arte y medios creados por y para la cultura LGBTQ+, activismo centrado en cuestiones LGBTQ+, jerga comúnmente utilizada en comunidades LGBTQ+, etc.). Utilícese un término más específico de ser posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wordt gebruikt om culturele ervaringen te beschrijven die worden gedeeld door leden van LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen of producten van de LHBTQ+-cultuur (bijv. kunst en media gecreëerd door en voor de LHBTQ+-cultuur, activisme gericht op LHBTQ+-kwesties, jargon dat vaak wordt gebruikt in LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen, enz.). Gebruik indien mogelijk een specifiekere term"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturella erfarenheter som delas av medlemmar i hbtq+-gemensaker eller produkter av hbtq+-kultur, till exempel konst och medier skapade av och för hbtq+-personer, aktivism med fokus på hbtq+-frågor eller slang som används inom hbtq+-gemenskaper. Använd mer specifik term om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000816"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000972"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001406"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001832"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001833"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002788"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002970"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001755"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003698"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000385","dc:identifier":"homoit0000385","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dykes on bikes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dykes on Bikes"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dykes on Bikes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dykes on bikes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dykes on bikes"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A chartered motorcycle club with many loosely affiliated chapters that are comprised of lesbian members who identify as dykes; known for their participation in gay pride events."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un club de motociclistas autorizado con muchas secciones libremente afiliadas que están compuestas por miembros lesbianas que se autoidentifican como bolleras; conocido por su participación en eventos del orgullo gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein zugelassener Motorradclub mit vielen lose verbundenen Ortsgruppen, bestehend aus lesbischen Mitglieder:innen, die sich als Dykes identifizieren. Bekannt für ihre Teilnahme an Pride-Verstaltungen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Motorclub met veel losse afdelingen die bestaan uit lesbische leden die zich identificeren als \"dykes\"; bekend om hun deelname aan gay pride-evenementen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En motorcykelklubb med många löst organiserade lokala grupper som består av lesbiska medlemmar som identifierar sig som flator. Kända för sitt deltagande i pride-evenemang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000382"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000906"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003104"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dykesOnBikes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000730","dc:identifier":"homoit0000730","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian choruses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Coros lésbicos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische koren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska körer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian choirs"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups of lesbians who sing together."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados de lesbianas que cantan juntas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen lesbische vrouwen die samen zingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper av lesbiska som sjunger tillsammans."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000833"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000482"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianChoruses"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000755","dc:identifier":"homoit0000755","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women's music"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Música para mujeres"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwenmuziek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnomusik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian music"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Wimmin's music"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Women-identified music"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Womyn's music"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Música lesbica"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Música de mujeres ||"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnoidentifierad musik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk musik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Qvinnomusik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of music by women, for women, and about women that emerged in the 1960s and 1970s as a form of musical expression of the second-wave feminist movement."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Género de música hecha por mujeres, para mujeres y sobre mujeres que surgió en las décadas de 1960 y 1970 como forma de expresión musical del movimiento feminista de la segunda ola."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Muziekgenre van vrouwen, voor vrouwen en over vrouwen dat in de jaren zestig en zeventig opkwam als een vorm van muzikale expressie van de tweede feministische tweede golf."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Musikgenre skapad av kvinnor, för kvinnor och om kvinnor som växte fram under 1960- och 1970-talen som ett musikaliskt uttryck för den andra feministiska vågen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000382"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001515"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003166"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93005222"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/womensMusic"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001832","dc:identifier":"homoit0001832","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer culture"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cultura queer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Queere Kultur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer cultuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queerkultur"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cultural experiences shared by members of queer communities or products of queer culture (e.g., art and media created by and for queer people, activism focused on queer issues, slang commonly used in queer communities, etc.)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Experiencias culturales compartidas por miembros de comunidades queer o productos de la cultura queer (por ejemplo, arte y medios creados por y para personas queer, activismo centrado en cuestiones queer, jerga comúnmente utilizada en comunidades queer, etc.)."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bezieht sich auf kulturelle Erfahrungen, die Mitglieder der queeren Gemeinschaft teilen, oder auf Produkte der queeren Kultur (z. B. Kunst und Medien, die von und für queere Personen geschaffen wurden, Aktivismus mit Schwerpunkt auf queeren Themen, in queeren Gemeinschaften gebräuchliche Slangausdrücke usw.)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gebruik om culturele ervaringen te beschrijven die worden gedeeld door leden van queergemeenschappen of producten van queercultuur (bijv. kunst en media gemaakt door en voor queer personen, activisme gericht op queerkwesties, jargon dat veel wordt gebruikt in queergemeenschappen, enz.)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturella erfarenheter som delas av medlemmar i queera gemenskaper eller produkter av queer kultur, till exempel konst och medier skapade av och för queera personer, aktivism med fokus på transfrågor eller slang som används inom queera gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001831"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002588"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001406"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001833"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001833","dc:identifier":"homoit0001833","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual culture"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cultura bisexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Kultur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele cultuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuell kultur"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Use to describe cultural experiences shared by members of bisexual communities or products of bisexual culture (e.g., art and media created by and for bisexual people, activism focused on bisexual issues, slang commonly used in bisexual communities, etc.)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Utilícese para describir experiencias culturales compartidas por miembros de comunidades bisexuales o productos de la cultura bisexual (p. ej., arte y medios creados por y para personas bisexuales, activismo centrado en cuestiones bisexuales, jerga comúnmente utilizada en comunidades bisexuales, etc.)."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kulturelle Erfahrungen, die von Mitgliedern bisexueller Gemeinschaften geteilt werden, oder Produkte der bisexuellen Kultur (z. B. Kunst und Medien, die von und für bisexuelle Menschen geschaffen wurden, Aktivismus, der sich auf bisexuelle Themen konzentriert, Slang, der in bisexuellen Gemeinschaften häufig verwendet wird, usw.)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gebruik om culturele ervaringen te beschrijven die worden gedeeld door leden van biseksuele gemeenschappen of producten van de biseksuele cultuur (bijv. kunst en media gemaakt door en voor biseksuele personen, activisme gericht op biseksuele kwesties, jargon dat vaak wordt gebruikt in biseksuele gemeenschappen, enz.)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturella erfarenheter som delas av medlemmar i bisexuella gemenskaper eller produkter av bisexuell kultur, till exempel konst och media skapade av och för bisexuella personer, aktivism fokuserad på bisexuella frågor och slang som används i bisexuella gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001831"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001406"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001832"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000383","dc:identifier":"homoit0000383","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dyke demonstrations"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dyke-Märsche"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Manifestaciones bolleras"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dyke demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dyke march"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dyke marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Dyke rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Dyke protests"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dyke-Demonstrationen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dyke Marches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marchas dyke"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marchas de lesbianas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marcha de las bolleras"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dyke protestmarsen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against dykes and advocate for dyke visibility, rights, and issues. This term should only be used to describe demonstrations explicitly for lesbians who identify as dykes or that are centered on the dyke identity and politics. Otherwise, use the more general term \"Lesbian demonstrations.\""},{"@language":"de","@value":"Märsche, Kundgebungen, und andere öffentliche Versammlungen, die sich auf die Sichtbarkeit, Rechten, und Themen von Lesben konzentrieren. Dieser Begriff sollte nur verwendet werden, um Märsche zu beschreiben, die für selbstidentifizierte Dykes oder mit Schwerpunkt auf die Identität und Politik von selbstidentifizierten Dykes sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marchas, protestas y otros encuentros centrados en la visibilidad, los asuntos y los derechos de las lesbianas. Utilícese únicamente para describir marchas explícitamente a favor de las bolleras o centradas en la identidad y la política de las bolleras. De lo contrario, utilícese el término más general \"marchas de lesbianas\"."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Protestmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten om te protesteren tegen discriminatie van \"dykes\" en om te pleiten voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. van \"dykes\". Deze term dient alleen gebruikt te worden voor demonstraties die specifiek gericht zijn op lesbische vrouwen die zich als \"dyke\" identificeren of die zich richten op de identiteit en politiek van \"dykes\". Gebruik anders de algemenere term 'lesbische demonstraties'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher, demonstrationer och andra sammankomster med fokus på synlighet, frågor och rättigheter för flator. Används endast för evenemang som uttryckligen gäller flator eller som har en tydlig politisk förankring i flatidentitet. För övriga fall, använd den mer generella termen ”Lesbisk pride”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003934"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003206"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/dykeMarches"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003934","dc:identifier":"homoit0003934","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian demonstrations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska demonstrationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian protests"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische protestmarsen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against lesbians and advocate for lesbian visibility, rights, and issues."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Protestmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten, georganiseerd om te protesteren tegen discriminatie van lesbische vrouwen en om op te komen voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. van lesbische vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher, demonstrationer och andra stora, offentliga sammankomster organiserade för att protestera mot diskriminering av lesbiska och förespråka lesbisk synlighet, lesbiskas rättigheter och frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000383"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-17"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003206","dc:identifier":"homoit0003206","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dyke solidarity"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dyke-Solidarität"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solidaridad marimacha"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dyke solidariteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flatsolidaritet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Dyke solidarity"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A sense of fellowship and overall unity of purpose, political interest, and/or community sympathies based on shared experiences as self-identifying dykes."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Gefühl der Gemeinschaft und allgemeinen Einigkeit in Bezug auf Ziele, politische Interesse, und/oder gemeinschaftliche Sympathien, die auf gemeinsamen Erfahrungen als selbstidentifizierten Dykes beruhen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un sentido de compañerismo y unidad general de propósito, interés político y/o simpatías comunitarias basadas en experiencias compartidas como marimachas autoidentificadas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een gevoel van saamhorigheid en algehele eenheid van doel, politieke interesse en/of sympathie voor de gemeenschap, gebaseerd op gedeelde ervaringen als zichzelf identificerende dykes."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En känsla av samhörighet och gemensamt syfte, politiskt engagemang och/eller gemenskap baserad på delade erfarenheter som självidentifierade flator."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003195"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000383"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003195"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-04-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001559","dc:identifier":"homoit0001559","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Reclaimed terms"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palabras reclamadas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Herwonnen termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Återvunna termer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Términos recuperados"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lenguaje reapropiado"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Återvunna begrepp"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Återvunna ord"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Terms that have been or are currently used in derogatory ways but have been reclaimed by certain groups or in certain circumstances."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Términos que se han utilizado o se utilizan actualmente de manera despectiva pero que han sido reclamados por ciertos grupos o en determinadas circunstancias."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Termen die op een denigrerende manier zijn of worden gebruikt, maar die door bepaalde groepen of onder bepaalde omstandigheden zijn herwonnen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ord eller uttryck som har använts nedsättande men som har återtagits och används i vissa sammanhang eller av vissa grupper i stärkande syfte."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001317"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000384"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000418"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001195"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001891"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002230"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002577"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001208"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001560"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001317"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/reclaimedTerms"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003719","dc:identifier":"homoit0003719","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dyke bars"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pottenbars"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flatbarer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flatklubbar"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Drinking establishments that primarily cater to dykes. For establishments that cater to lesbians more broadly, use \"Lesbian bars.\""},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Drinkgelegenheden die zich voornamelijk richten op potten/dykes. Voor gelegenheden die zich breder richten op lesbische vrouwen, gebruik \"Lesbische bars.\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Barer eller uteställen som främst riktar sig till flator. För uteställen som riktar sig bredare till lesbiska, använd ”Lesbiska barer”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000724"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000384"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004651"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000900"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000906","dc:identifier":"homoit0000906","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ motorcycle clubs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs de Motociclistas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-motorclubs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Motorcykelklubbar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ motorcycle clubs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Moto Clubs LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs de Moteros LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs de motoreros LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups of LGBTQ+ people formed around shared interest in and activities related to motorcycles."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados de personas LGBTQ+ que se forman en torno a intereses compartidos y actividades relacionadas con las motocicletas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen van LHBTQ+-personen rond gedeelde interesse in en activiteiten met motorfietsen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper av hbtq+-personer med gemensamt intresse för motorcyklar och relaterade aktiviteter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000385"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000705"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003104"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQMotorcycleClubs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003104","dc:identifier":"homoit0003104","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Leather and kink clubs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubes leather y kink"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Leder- und Kink-Clubs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Leer en kinkclubs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kinkklubbar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kink clubs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"SM clubs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs leather y kink"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubes kink"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs kink"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kink-Clubs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"SM-Clubs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kink- och läderklubbar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läderklubbar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"BDSM-klubbar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Social clubs and other types of membership organizations in the leather, kink, and related communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubes sociales y otros tipos de organizaciones en comunidades de cuero, kink y afines."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Vereine und andere Arten von Mitgliederorganisationen in der Leder-, Kink- und verwandten Communities."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sociale clubs en andere soorten verenigingen in de leer-, kink- en verwante gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sociala klubbar och andra typer av medlemsorganisationer inom läder-, kink- och närliggande gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000385"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000705"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000906"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000387","dc:identifier":"homoit0000387","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ecofeminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ecofeminismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ökofeminismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ecofeminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ekofeminism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Öko-Feminismus"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Political and philosophical movement that views feminism and concerns for the environment as inherently related."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento político y filosófico que considera que el feminismo y la preocupación por el medio ambiente están intrínsecamente relacionados."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine politische und philosophische Bewegung, die Feminismus und Umweltbelange als untrennbar miteinander verbunden betrachtet."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"sociale en politieke stroming die ecologisme en feminisme met elkaar verbindt"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Politisk och filosofisk rörelse som betraktar feminism och miljöfrågor som nära sammanlänkade."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003171"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh91001601"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ecofeminism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003171","dc:identifier":"homoit0003171","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Eco-feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ecofeministas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ökofeminist:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ecofeministen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ekofeminister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ecofeminsts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Eco-feministas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ökofeministinnen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Öko-Feminist:innen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who subscribes to the political and philosophical movement that views feminism and concerns for the environment as inherently related. Use when resources are about eco-feminists or when an individual identifies as such."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que se posiciona bajo el movimiento político y filosófico que entiende el feminismo y las preocupaciones por el medio ambiente como intrínsecamente relacionados. Utilícese cuando los recursos son sobre ecofeministas o cuando una persona se identifique como tal."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Person, die sich der politischen und philosophischen Bewegung anschließt, die Feminismus und Umweltbelange als untrennbar miteinander verbunden betrachtet. Verwenden, wenn es um Ökofeminist:innen geht oder wenn sich eine Person als solche identifiziert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die de politieke en filosofische beweging steunt die feminisme en milieubewustzijn als inherent verbonden beschouwt. Te gebruiken wanneer bronnen over eco-feministen gaan of wanneer een persoon zich als eco-feminist identificeert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som stödjer den politiska och filosofiska rörelse som ser feminism och miljöengagemang som nära sammankopplade. Används för resurser om ekofeminister eller för individer som identifierar sig som sådana."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000387"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001821","dc:identifier":"homoit0001821","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transfemininity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transfeminidad"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Transféminité"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transfemininiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transfemininitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminine-aligned identities or practices of trans people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidades o prácticas alineadas con lo femenino de personas trans."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identités ou pratiques féminines des personnes transgenres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feminieme identiteiten of praktijken van trans personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Feminint kodade identiteter eller praktiker bland transpersoner."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000389"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001642"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001652"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002043","dc:identifier":"homoit0002043","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminine of center"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Feminine of center"},{"@language":"es","@value":"De centro femenino"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feminine of center"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Feminine of center"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FOC"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Fem of center"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Femme of center"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminine of center"},{"@language":"es","@value":"De centro femme"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Femme of center"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Femenina de centro"},{"@language":"es","@value":"De centro fem"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Femme de centro"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Femme of center"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"FOC"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe individuals whose gender expression is more feminine than androgynous. Generally used as a self-descriptor within LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Begriff, der verwendet wird, um Personen zu beschreiben, deren Gender Expression eher feminin als androgyn ist. Wird im Allgemeinen als Selbstbezeichnung innerhalb der LGBTQ+-Community verwendet."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir a las personas cuya expresión de género es más femenina que andrógina. Generalmente se utiliza como autodescriptor en las comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen van wie de genderexpressie meer vrouwelijk dan androgyn is. Over het algemeen gebruikt als een zelfbeschrijving binnen queer gemeenschappen dan een beschrijving van een andere persoon"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nordamerikansk term som används för att beskriva individer vars könsuttryck är mer feminint än androgynt. Används i regel som en självbeskrivande term inom hbtq+-gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000389"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000440"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001642"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001652"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002061"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001382","dc:identifier":"homoit0001382","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transfeminine people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transfemeninas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes transféminines"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transfeminine personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transfeminina personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transfem"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Femme trans"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who identify partially or fully with a feminine gender identity and who were typically (but not always) assigned male at birth."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se identifican parcial o totalmente con una identidad de género femenina y a quienes normalmente (pero no siempre) se les asignó al sexo masculino al nacer."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui s'identifient partiellement ou totalement à une identité de genre féminine et qui ont généralement (mais pas toujours) été assignées de sexe masculin à la naissance."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die zich gedeeltelijk of volledig identificeren met een vrouwelijke genderidentiteit en die bij de geboorte typisch (maar niet altijd) als man zijn aangewezen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som helt eller delvis identifierar sig med en feminin könsidentitet och som oftast, men inte alltid, tilldelades manligt kön vid födseln."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000389"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001652"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001821"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002043"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transfemininePeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001347","dc:identifier":"homoit0001347","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surrogacy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Gestación subrogada"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Draagouderschap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Surrogatskap"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Vientre de alquiler"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A method or agreement whereby a person consents to carry a pregnancy for another person or people who will become the child's parent(s) after birth."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un método o acuerdo mediante el cual una persona consiente a llevar a cabo un embarazo para otra persona o personas que se convertirán en los padres del niño después del nacimiento."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een methode of overeenkomst waarbij een persoon instemt met het dragen van een zwangerschap voor een andere persoon of personen die na de geboorte de ouder(s) van het kind worden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En metod eller överenskommelse där en person samtycker till att bära en graviditet åt en annan person eller andra personer som blir barnets förälder eller föräldrar efter födseln."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000587"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000843"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002627"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000390"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh88004707"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/surrogacy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002627","dc:identifier":"homoit0002627","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gestational surrogacy "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Subrogación gestacional"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gestationale Leihmutterschaft"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Draagmoederschap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gestationellt surrogatskap"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Subrogancia gestacional"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwangerschaft-Leihmutterschaft"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The process by which a person becomes pregnant using a donated egg."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El proceso por el cual una persona queda embarazada a partir de un óvulo donado."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Vorgang, bei dem eine Person ein Kind für andere austrägt, ohne genetisch mit dem Kind verwandt zu sein."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het proces waarbij een persoon zwanger wordt met behulp van een gedoneerd eicel."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Processen där en person blir gravid genom användning av ett donerat ägg."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001347"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000390"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000587"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002622"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002628"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003093","dc:identifier":"homoit0003093","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lateral homophobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homofobia lateral"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Laterale Homophobie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Laterale homofobie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lateral homofobi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"This term is often used to describe lateral homophobia carried out by LGBTQ+ people in general. Lateral homophobia refers to the phenomenon in which gay men displace violence or oppression onto other gay men, often by acting on internalized homophobic beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward gay men and homosexuality) adopted as a result of being raised or socialized within a homophobic environment or culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Este término se utiliza a menudo para describir la homofobia lateral llevada a cabo por personas LGBTQ+ en general. La homofobia lateral se refiere al fenómeno a través del cual los hombres gay desplazan la violencia u opresión hacia otros hombres gay, a menudo, actuando sobre la base de creencias homofóbicas internalizadas (es decir, percepciones negativas e intolerancia hacia los hombres gay y la homosexualidad), adoptadas como resultado de haber sido criados o socializados dentro de un ambiente o una cultura homofóbica."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Häufig verwendet, um laterale Homophobie zu beschreiben, die von LGBTQ+-Personen im Allgemeinen ausgeübt wird. Laterale Homophobie bezeichnet das Phänomen, bei dem schwule Männer Gewalt oder Unterdrückung auf andere schwule Männer übertragen, oft indem sie verinnerlichte homophobe Überzeugungen (d. h. negative Vorstellungen von und Intoleranz gegenüber schwulen Männern und Homosexualität) ausleben, die sie aufgrund ihrer Erziehung oder Sozialisation in einem homophoben Umfeld oder einer homophoben Kultur übernommen haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Deze term wordt vaak gebruikt om laterale homofobie door lhbtq+'ers in het algemeen aan te duiden. Het verschijnsel waarbij homomannen geweld of onderdrukking toepassen op andere homomannen, vaak door te handelen op basis van geïnternaliseerde homofobe overtuigingen (d.w.z. negatieve percepties van en intolerantie ten opzichte van homomannen en homoseksualiteit) die zij hebben aangenomen als gevolg van opvoeding of socialisatie in een homofobe omgeving of cultuur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Termen används ofta för att beskriva lateral homofobi bland hbtq+-personer i allmänhet. Lateral homofobi syftar på företeelsen att bögar riktar våld eller förtryck mot andra bögar, ofta genom att agera utifrån internaliserade homofobiska föreställningar – det vill säga negativa uppfattningar om och intolerans mot homosexualitet – som de tagit till sig genom uppväxt eller socialisering i en homofob miljö."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000391"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003091"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-18"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000392","dc:identifier":"homoit0000392","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ego-dystonic sexual orientation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Orientación sexual egodistónica"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ichdystonische sexuelle Orientierung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Egodystone seksuele oriëntatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Missnöje med egen sexuell läggning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ego-dystonic homosexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homosexualidad egodistónica"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ego-dystonische sexuelle Orientierung"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ich-dystonische Homosexualität"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Internal conflict caused by having a sexual identity or attraction that is at odds with one’s idealized self-image."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Conflicto interno causado por tener una identidad o atracción sexual que está en desacuerdo con la autoimagen idealizada."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Innerer Konflikt, verurusacht durch eine sexuelle Identität oder sexuelle Anziehung einer Person, die im Widerspruch zum idealisierten Selbstbild steht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intern conflict veroorzaakt door het hebben van een seksuele identiteit of aantrekkingskracht die op gespannen voet staat met het geïdealiseerde zelfbeeld."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inre konflikt som uppstår när en persons sexuella identitet eller attraktion står i konflikt med den idealiserade självbilden."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001011"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000303"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000391"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001011"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ego-dystonicSexualOrientation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001011","dc:identifier":"homoit0001011","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mental disorders"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Desórdenes mentales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Psychische stoornissen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Psykiska sjukdomar och syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mental illnesses"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Psychiatric disorders"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Enfermedades mentales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Desórdenes psiquiátricos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trastornos mentales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Medical conditions defined by changes or disturbances in an individual's thinking, feeling, mood, and behavior."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Condiciones médicas definidas por cambios o alteraciones en el pensamiento, los sentimientos, el estado de ánimo y el comportamiento de una persona."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Medische aandoeningen gedefinieerd door veranderingen of stoornissen in het denken, voelen, humeur en gedrag van een persoon."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinska tillstånd som definieras av förändringar eller störningar i en individs tankemönster, känsloliv, stämningsläge och beteende."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000392"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004443"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85083643"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001011"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/mentalDisorders"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393","dc:identifier":"homoit0000393","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ older people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ en su tercera edad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-ouderen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Äldre hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Elderly (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Senior citizens (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Seniors (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Older people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas envejecientes (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de tercera edad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas en su tercera edad (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Viejos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Gente mayor LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are advanced in age, typically defined as older than 60 years of age."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ de edad avanzada, normalmente definidas como mayores de 60 años."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met een hogere leeftijd, meestal ouder dan 60 jaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är i högre ålder, vanligtvis definierat som 60 år och äldre."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001054"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001055"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001056"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001057"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001058"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000856"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000931"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2004011614"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/olderPeopleLGBTQ"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001055","dc:identifier":"homoit0001055","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Older gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay mayores"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-ouderen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Äldre bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay ancianos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres en su tercera edad gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres de tercera edad gay"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are advanced in age, typically over 60 years of age."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay de edad avanzada, normalmente mayores de 60 años."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen met een hogere leeftijd, meestal ouder dan 60 jaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är äldre, vanligtvis över 60 års ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90005240"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/olderGayMen"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001056","dc:identifier":"homoit0001056","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Older lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas mayores"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische ouderen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Äldre lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas ancianas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas en su tercera edad"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lebianas de tercera edad"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who are advanced in age, typically over 60 years of age."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas de edad avanzada, normalmente mayores de 60 años."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen met een hogere leeftijd, meestal ouder dan 60 jaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som är äldre, vanligtvis över 60 års ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh86004768"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/olderLesbians"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001057","dc:identifier":"homoit0001057","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Older queer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas mayores queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer ouderen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Äldre queera personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas ancianas queer"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas en su tercera edad queer"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de tercera edad queer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who are advanced in age, typically over 60 years of age."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer de edad avanzada, normalmente mayores de 60 años."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen met een hogere leeftijd, meestal ouder dan 60 jaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som är äldre, vanligtvis över 60 års ålder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/olderQueerPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001058","dc:identifier":"homoit0001058","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Older transgender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas mayores transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender ouderen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Äldre transpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas ancianas transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas en su tercera edad transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de tercera edad transgénero"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender people who are advanced in age, typically over 60 years of age."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero de edad avanzada, normalmente mayores de 60 años."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen met een hogere leeftijd, meestal ouder dan 60 jaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som är äldre, vanligtvis över 60 års ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2018003006"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/olderTransgenderPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000856","dc:identifier":"homoit0000856","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"LGBTQ+ older people's organizations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones para personas LGBTQ+ en su tercera edad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-ouderenorganisaties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organisationer för äldre hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"LGBTQ+ older people's organisations"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones para personas envejecientes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones para personas LGBTQ+ de tercera edad"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones para personas en su tercera edad (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups that serve the needs and interests of older LGBTQ+ people, typically those 60 years and older."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados que atienden las necesidades y los intereses de personas mayores LGBTQ+, generalmente aquellas de 60 años o más."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen die de behoeften en belangen dienen van oudere LHBTQ+-personen, meestal 60 jaar en ouder."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper som tillgodoser behov och intressen hos äldre hbtq+-personer, vanligtvis definierat som personer 60 år och äldre."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQOlderPeoplesOrganisations"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000931","dc:identifier":"homoit0000931","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ retirement homes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casas de retiro LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-verzorgingshuizen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-äldreboende"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ retirement homes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casas de retiro (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hogares de retiro LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casas de reposo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hogares de retiro (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casas de reposo (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Residencias de gente mayor LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Residencias de gente mayor (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Seniorboende (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Multi-residence facilities that provide assisted living services to elderly people; use in reference to retirement homes that primarily cater to LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instalaciones multiresidencia que brindan servicios de vida asistida a personas mayores; utilícese en referencia a casas de retiro que atienden principalmente a personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Voorzieningen met meerdere woningen die begeleid wonen bieden aan ouderen; gebruik met betrekking tot verzorgingshuizen die zich voornamelijk richten op LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Boendeformer med flera bostäder som erbjuder omsorgs- och stödinsatser för äldre personer. Används för boenden som i första hand riktar sig till hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000393"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000931"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQRetirementHomes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001296","dc:identifier":"homoit0001296","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual inversion"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inversión sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele inversie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell inversion"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Historical term for homosexuality used by sexologists to refer to an inborn reversal of gender traits or roles. Only use in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término histórico para la homosexualidad utilizado por sexólogos para referirse a una inversión innata de rasgos o roles de género. Utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Historische term voor homoseksualiteit die door seksuologen wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar een aangeboren omkering van geslachtskenmerken of -rollen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historisk term för homosexualitet som användes av sexologer för att beskriva en medfödd omkastning av könsuttryck eller könsroller. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000395"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000677"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001564"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualInversion"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001463","dc:identifier":"homoit0001463","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgenderism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transgenerismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgenderisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transgenderism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pathologizing term often used in the medicalization of transgender people; use only in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término patologizante a menudo utilizado en la medicalización de personas transgénero; utilícese sólo en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pathologiserende term die vaak wordt gebruikt bij de medicalisering van transgenders; alleen gebruiken in historische context"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Patologiserande term som ofta användes i medicinsk beskrivning av transpersoner. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001468"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000395"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000805"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001409"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001423"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001447"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001563"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001468","dc:identifier":"homoit0001468","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transsexualism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transexualismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transseksualisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transsexualism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"An individual's identification with a gender inconsistent with or not culturally associated with their assigned sex."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La identificación de una persona con un género inconsistente o no asociado culturalmente con su sexo asignado."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"identificatie van een persoon met een geslacht dat niet in overeenstemming is of niet cultureel geassocieerd wordt met het bij de geboorte toegewezen geslacht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En individs identifikation med ett kön som inte stämmer överens med eller kulturellt förknippas med det kön de tilldelades vid födseln."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001463"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000395"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001380"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001496"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001563"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh94005829"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transsexualism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000398","dc:identifier":"homoit0000398","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erectile dysfunction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disfunción eréctil"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erektile Dysfunktion"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erectiestoornissen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erektil dysfunktion"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Impotence"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Impotencia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erektionsstörung"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Impotenz"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Persistent difficulties in achieving or maintaining erections, typically for sexual activities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dificultades persistentes para lograr o mantener erecciones, típicamente para actividades sexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Anhaltende Schwierigkeiten beim Erreichen oder Aufrechterhalten einer Erektion, typischerweise für sexuelle Aktivitäten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aanhoudende problemen bij het bereiken of behouden van een erectie, meestal voor seksuele activiteiten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Återkommande svårigheter att få eller behålla erektion, vanligtvis i sexuella sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001291"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000399"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000400"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003058"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85064658"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001291"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/erectileDysfunction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001291","dc:identifier":"homoit0001291","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual dysfunction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disfunción sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele stoornissen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell dysfunktion"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual malfunction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disfuncionalidad sexual"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Recurring problems or difficulties with sexual response, desire, or pleasure. Includes dysfunction occurring at any time in the sexual response cycle that causes distress or prevents one’s typical sexual function."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Problemas o dificultades recurrentes con la respuesta, el deseo o el placer sexual. Incluye la disfunción que ocurre en cualquier momento del ciclo de respuesta sexual y que causa angustia o impide la función sexual típica."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Terugkerende problemen of moeilijkheden met seksuele respons, verlangen of plezier. Omvat disfunctie die op enig moment in de seksuele responscyclus optreedt en die leed veroorzaakt of iemands normale seksuele functie verhindert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Återkommande problem eller svårigheter med sexuell respons, lust eller njutning. Inkluderar dysfunktion som uppstår i någon del av den sexuella responscykeln och som orsakar lidande eller hindrar personens normala sexuella funktion."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000398"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001489"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001274"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001284"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001292"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001294"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001291"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualDysfunction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000399","dc:identifier":"homoit0000399","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erection pills"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pastillas para la erección"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Potenzpillen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erectiepillen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läkemedel vid erektil dysfunktion"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Potenzmittel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erektionshilfen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läkemedel mot impotens"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erektionsläkemedel"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Medications used to relax muscles in the penis, increasing blood flow to allow for an erection in response to sexual stimuli."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Medicamentos utilizados para relajar los músculos del pene, aumentando el flujo sanguíneo para permitir una erección en respuesta a los estímulos sexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Medikamente, die zur Entspannung der Muskeln im Penis eingesetzt werden und die Durchblutung erhöhen, um eine Erektion als Reaktion auf sexuelle Reize zu ermöglichen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Medicatie die wordt gebruikt om de spieren in de penis te ontspannen, waardoor de bloedstroom wordt verhoogd om een erectie mogelijk te maken als reactie op seksuele prikkels."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läkemedel som får musklerna i penis att slappna av och ökar blodflödet för att möjliggöra erektion vid sexuell stimulans."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001007"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000398"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000400"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002289"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/erectionPills"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000400","dc:identifier":"homoit0000400","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erections"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erecciones"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erektion"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erecties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erektion"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Enlargement of the erectile tissue of the penis or clitoris due to increased blood flow; typically associated with sexual arousal. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Agrandamiento del tejido eréctil del pene o del clítoris debido al aumento del flujo sanguíneo; típicamente asociado con la excitación sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Vergrößerung des erektilen Gewebes des Penis oder der Klitoris aufgrund einer erhöhten Durchblutung; typischerweise verbunden mit sexueller Erregung."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vergroting van het erectiele weefsel van de penis of clitoris door een verhoogde bloedstroom; meestal geassocieerd met seksuele opwinding."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svällning av erektil vävnad i penis eller klitoris på grund av ökat blodflöde. Förknippas vanligtvis med sexuell upphetsning."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000398"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000399"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007006549"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000400"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/erections"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003058","dc:identifier":"homoit0003058","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Vacuum pumps"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dispositivo de vacío"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vacuümpompen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vakuumpumpar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Clitoral pump"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nipple pump"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Penis pump"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Suckers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bomba de clítoris"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Succionador de pezón"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Succionador de clítoris"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Succionador de pene"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vacuum pumps"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Penispompen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tepelzuigers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuigers"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A sexual aid or accessory that is placed over and around genitalia. The device creates a suction that engorges and enlarges genitalia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una ayuda o accesorio sexual que se coloca sobre y alrededor de los genitales. El dispositivo crea una succión que hincha y agranda los genitales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een seksueel hulpmiddel of accessoire dat over en rond de genitaliën wordt geplaatst. Het apparaat creëert een zuigkracht die de genitaliën opslokt en vergroot."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett sexuellt hjälpmedel eller tillbehör som placeras över och runt könsorganen. Redskapet skapar ett sug som gör att könsorganen sväller och förstoras."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003059"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000398"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002289","dc:identifier":"homoit0002289","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chemsex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexdopaje"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chemsex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chemseks"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kemsex"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Chemsex"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Chemsex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual activities that include the use of drugs, typically to trigger sexual arousal, increase sexual pleasure, and/or facilitate sexual encounters that last several hours or days."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actividades sexuales que incluyen el uso de drogas, generalmente para desencadenar la excitación sexual, aumentar el placer sexual y/o facilitar encuentros sexuales que duran varias horas o días."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Sexuelle Aktivitäten, die den Gebrauch von Drogen beinhalten, typischerweise um sexuelle Erregung auszulösen, sexuelles Vergnügen zu steigern und/oder sexuelle Begegnungen zu erleichtern, die mehrere Stunden oder Tage dauern."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele activiteiten waarbij drugs worden gebruikt, meestal om seksuele opwinding op te wekken, seksueel genot te vergroten en/of seksuele ontmoetingen mogelijk te maken die enkele uren of dagen duren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuella aktiviteter som inkluderar användning av droger, vanligtvis för att framkalla sexuell upphetsning, öka sexuell njutning och/eller möjliggöra sexuella möten som varar i flera timmar eller dagar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000399"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001235"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004227"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001361","dc:identifier":"homoit0001361","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Testicle"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Testículo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zaadbal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Testiklar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Testicles"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Balls"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nuts"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Testes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Testis"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bola"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pelota"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cojón"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Huevo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Canica"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Coco"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hueva"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Testes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Testikels"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Testis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zaadballen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Reproductive gland or gonad that produces sperm and androgens, primarily testosterone."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Gónada o glándula reproductiva que produce espermatozoides y andrógenos, principalmente testosterona."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Voortplantingsklier of geslachtsklier die sperma en androgenen produceert, voornamelijk testosteron."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Reproduktiv körtel eller könskörtel som producerar spermier och androgener, främst testosteron."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000401"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000585"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000600"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001847"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85134157"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000401"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/testes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001984","dc:identifier":"homoit0001984","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nipple"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pezón"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tepel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bröstvårtor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nipples"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pezones"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tetilla"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tetillas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The small protuberance of a mammary gland."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La pequeña protuberancia de una glándula mamaria."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het kleine uitsteeksel van een borstklier"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den yttre delen av bröstet som ofta är känslig och kan reagera på beröring. Sitter centralt på vårtgården."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000401"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001045"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001046"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003131"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2009007031"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000401"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003137","dc:identifier":"homoit0003137","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Armpits"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Achselhöhle"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Oksels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Armhålor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Axilla"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Achsel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Axilla"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The hollow area underneath the upper arm where the shoulder connects, known to be ticklish and/or sexually stimulative."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Der hohle Bereich unter dem Oberarm, an dem die Schulter ansetzt, dafür bekannt, kitzlig und/oder sexuell stimulierend zu sein."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De holle zone onder de bovenarm waar de schouder aansluit, staat bekend als kietelend en/of seksueel stimulerend."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Det ihåliga området under överarmen där axeln möter kroppen, känt för att vara kittligt och/eller sexuellt stimulerande."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000401"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000401"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001634","dc:identifier":"homoit0001634","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Body part fetishes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parcialismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Körperteilfetisch"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fetisjen voor lichaamsdelen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Partialism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Body part fetish"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Body part fetishism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Partialism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Partialisms"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fetiche de partes del cuerpo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fetichismo de partes del cuerpo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parcialismos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parcialismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Partialismus"},{"@language":"de","@value":"sexuelle Vorliebe für ein bestimmtes Körperteil"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lichaamsdeelfetisjisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Partialisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Partialismen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroppsdelsfetischismer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various fetishes regarding a specific part of the body."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de los diversos fetiches relacionados con una parte específica del cuerpo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fetische, die sich auf einen bestimmten Körperteil beziehen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elk van de verschillende fetisjen met betrekking tot een specifiek deel van het lichaam."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Attraktioner kopplade till en specifik kroppsdel."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001621"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003051"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003064"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000401"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/partialism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000402","dc:identifier":"homoit0000402","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotic massage"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Masaje erótico"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erotische Massagen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotische massage"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotisk massage"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Massage intended to enhance sexual arousal. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Masaje destinado a potenciar la excitación sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Massage zur Steigerung der sexuellen Erregung."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het gebruik van massage om seksuele opwinding te bereiken of te versterken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Massage med syfte att öka sexuell upphetsning."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000998"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000610"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000988"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003796"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000998"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/eroticMassage"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000998","dc:identifier":"homoit0000998","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Massage"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Masaje"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Massage"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Massage"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Massage"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Manipulation of the body through techniques like rubbing and kneading muscles and joints with the hands, typically to relieve tension and pain or to provide erotic stimulation."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Manipulación del cuerpo con las manos mediante técnicas como frotar y masajear músculos y articulaciones, generalmente para aliviar la tensión y el dolor o proporcionar estimulación erótica."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Manipulation du corps par des techniques telles que le frottement et le pétrissage des muscles et des articulations avec les mains, généralement pour soulager la tension et la douleur ou pour fournir une stimulation érotique."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Manipulatie van het lichaam door middel van technieken zoals het wrijven en kneden van spieren en gewrichten met de handen, meestal om spanning en pijn te verlichten of om erotische stimulatie te geven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroppsbehandling genom tekniker som att knåda eller trycka på muskler och leder med händerna, vanligtvis för att lindra spänningar och smärta eller för att skapa erotisk stimulans."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000402"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001112"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85081957"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000998"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/massage"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000988","dc:identifier":"homoit0000988","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Manual sex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo manual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Manuele seks"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sex med händerna"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handsex"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual activity involving manual stimulation of erogenous zones using the hands."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actividad sexual que implica la estimulación manual de zonas erógenas mediante el uso de las manos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele activiteit met handmatige stimulatie van de erogene zones (met de handen)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell aktivitet som innebär manuell stimulans av erogena zoner med händerna."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000446"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001498"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001500"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000402"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001000"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/manualSex"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000403","dc:identifier":"homoit0000403","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotica"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erótica"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erotika"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotica"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotica"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Erotica"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The portrayal of sexuality with high-art aspirations, typically also focusing on feelings and emotions."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La representación de la sexualidad con aspiraciones de alto nivel artístico, que normalmente también se centra en sentimientos y emociones."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Darstellung von Sexualität mit hohen künstlerischen Ansprüchen, die sich in der Regel auch auf Gefühle und Emotionen konzentriert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"weergave van seksualiteit op kunstzinnige wijze, wsaarbij ook aandacht gegeven wordt aan gevoelens en emoties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Framställning av sexualitet med konstnärliga ambitioner, ofta med fokus på känslor och emotionella upplevelser."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000859"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000816"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001128"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85044718"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000403"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/erotica"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000859","dc:identifier":"homoit0000859","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ erotic literature"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura erótica LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のエロティック文学"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-erotische literatuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-erotisk litteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotic literature (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura erótica (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"エロティック文学 (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotisk litteratur (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary works that have erotic or sexual elements; use in reference to erotic literature focusing on LGBTQ+ characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias que tengan elementos eróticos o sexuales; utilícese en referencia a literatura erótica centrada en personajes o temas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"エロティックな要素や性的な要素を含む文学作品。LGBTQ+の登場人物やテーマに焦点を当てたエロティック文学を指して用いられる。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literaire werken met erotische of seksuele elementen; gebruik in verwijzing naar erotische literatuur gericht op LHBTQ+-personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk med erotiska eller sexuella inslag. Används för erotisk litteratur med hbtq+-karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000403"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000443"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001597"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001598"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001599"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001600"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001601"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002413"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002415"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002416"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002451"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002494"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002515"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002572"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002172"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002184"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002188"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002205"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002644"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000403"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/eroticLiteratureLGBTQ"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001806","dc:identifier":"homoit0001806","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Homoeroticism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homoerotismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homoerotik"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-erotiek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homoerotik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Homoerotic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homoerótico"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual attraction or erotic desire between members of the same sex or gender; typically used to describe temporary, latent, or unfulfilled desire rather than a more permanent sexual identity or orientation."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atracción sexual o deseo erótico entre miembros del mismo sexo o género; normalmente se utiliza para describir un deseo temporal, latente o insatisfecho en lugar de una identidad u orientación sexual más permanente."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Sexuelle Anziehung oder erotisches Verlangen zwischen Personen desselben biologischen oder sozialen Geschlechts; wird in der Regel verwendet, um vorübergehendes, latentes oder unerfülltes Verlangen zu beschreiben, und nicht im Sinne einer dauerhaften sexuellen Identität oder Orientierung."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele aantrekkingskracht of erotisch verlangen tussen leden van hetzelfde geslacht of gender; meestal gebruikt om een tijdelijk, latent of onvervuld verlangen te beschrijven in plaats van een meer permanente seksuele identiteit of oriëntatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell attraktion eller erotisk längtan mellan personer av samma kön. Termen används ofta för att beskriva tillfällig, latent eller ouppfylld attraktion snarare än en fast sexuell läggning eller identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001112"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001284"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002142"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002147"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002177"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-01-18"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001112","dc:identifier":"homoit0001112","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Physical affection"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afecto físico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lichamelijkheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroppslig närhet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Cariño físico"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Touch between two or more people intended to arouse or convey feelings of closeness; can be used to express sexual or non-sexual intimacy and includes actions such as kissing, cuddling, embracing, and holding hands."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tacto entre dos o más personas destinado a despertar o transmitir sentimientos de cercanía; se puede utilizar para expresar intimidad sexual o no sexual e incluye acciones como besar, abrazar, sostener y tomar de la mano."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aanraking tussen twee of meer mensen bedoeld om gevoelens van verbondenheid op te wekken of over te brengen; kan worden gebruikt om seksuele of niet-seksuele intimiteit uit te drukken en omvat acties zoals kussen, knuffelen, omhelzen en handen vasthouden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Beröring mellan två eller flera personer i syfte att väcka eller förmedla känslor av närhet. Kan uttrycka sexuell och/eller icke-sexuell intimitet och omfattar handlingar som kyssar, gosande, kramar och att hålla hand."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000691"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000998"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001806"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001112"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/physicalAffection"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000405","dc:identifier":"homoit0000405","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Escort services"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Servicios de acompañantes"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Escortservice"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Escortdiensten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Eskortservice"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Escortdienst"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Escortagentur"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Begleitagentur"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Agencies that serve to connect paying clients with escorts offering services by appointment. Escort services may be less stigmatized than other forms of sex work, in part because it tends to be safer for escorts and because some escorts offer a broader range of services, including accompaniment or entertainment without the promise of sexual contact. However, the tendency to frame escorting as separate from or superior to other forms of sex work obscures the labor undertaken by escorts and perpetuates discrimination against the most marginalized and vulnerable sex workers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Agencias que ponen en contacto a clientes de pago con acompañantes que ofrecen servicios con cita previa. Los servicios de acompañantes pueden estar menos estigmatizados que otras formas de trabajo sexual, en parte porque tienden a ser más seguros para los acompañantes y porque algunos de ellos ofrecen una gama más amplia de servicios, incluido el acompañamiento o el entretenimiento sin la promesa de contacto sexual. Sin embargo, la tendencia a considerar el acompañamiento como algo distinto o superior a otras formas de trabajo sexual oculta el trabajo que realizan los acompañantes y perpetúa la discriminación contra los trabajadores sexuales más marginados y vulnerables."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Agenturen, die zahlende Kund:innen mit Escorts zusammenbringen, die ihre Dienste nach Vereinbarung anbieten. Escortservices sind möglicherweise weniger stigmatisiert als andere Formen der Sexarbeit, zum Teil weil sie für Escorts tendenziell sicherer sind und weil einige Escorts ein breiteres Spektrum an Dienstleistungen anbieten, darunter Begleitung oder Unterhaltung ohne das Versprechen sexueller Kontakte. Die Tendenz, Escortservices als von anderen Formen der Sexarbeit getrennt oder diesen überlegen darzustellen, verschleiert jedoch die von Escorts geleistete Arbeit und perpetuiert die Diskriminierung der am stärksten marginalisierten und schutzbedürftigen Sexarbeiter:innen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bureaus die betalende klanten in contact brengen met escorts die diensten op afspraak aanbieden. Escortdiensten zijn mogelijk minder gestigmatiseerd dan andere vormen van sekswerk, deels omdat het veiliger is voor escorts en omdat sommige escorts een breder scala aan diensten aanbieden, waaronder begeleiding of entertainment zonder de belofte van seksueel contact. De neiging om escortwerk echter te framen als losstaand van of superieur aan andere vormen van sekswerk, verhult de arbeid die escorts verrichten en bestendigt discriminatie tegen de meest gemarginaliseerde en kwetsbare sekswerkers."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förmedlingar som kopplar samman kunder med eskorter som erbjuder tjänster enligt tidsbokning. Eskortservice kan uppfattas som mindre stigmatiserat än andra former av sexarbete, delvis för att det ofta är säkrare för eskorterna och för att vissa eskorter erbjuder ett bredare utbud av tjänster, inklusive sällskap eller underhållning utan löfte om sexuellt umgänge. Tendensen att framställa eskortverksamhet som något separat från eller överordnat andra former av sexarbete riskerar dock att osynliggöra eskorters arbete och förstärka diskriminering mot de mest marginaliserade och utsatta sexarbetarna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001276"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000406"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85044807"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/escortServices"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000406","dc:identifier":"homoit0000406","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Escorts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acompañantes"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Escorts"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Escorts"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Eskorter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Call boys"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Call girls"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acompañante"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Escorts"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Callboy"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Callgirl"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Edelprostituierte"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Escort-Boy"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex workers whose clients are required to make appointments for their services. Unlike sex workers who solicit clients on the street or in institutions like brothels, escorts typically advertise their services online, whether independently or through agencies. Escorting may be less stigmatized than other forms of sex work, in part because it tends to be safer for escorts and because some escorts offer a broader range of services, including accompaniment or entertainment without the promise of sexual contact. However, the tendency to frame escorting as separate from or superior to other forms of sex work obscures the labor undertaken by escorts and perpetuates discrimination against the most marginalized and vulnerable sex workers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trabajadores sexuales cuyos clientes deben tener una cita previa por servicios. A diferencia de los trabajadores sexuales que solicitan clientes en la calle o en instituciones como burdeles, los acompañantes suelen anunciar sus servicios en Internet, ya sea de forma independiente o a través de agencias. El acompañamiento puede estar menos estigmatizado que otras formas de trabajo sexual, en parte porque tiende a ser más seguro para los acompañantes y porque algunos de ellos ofrecen una gama más amplia de servicios, incluido el acompañamiento o el entretenimiento sin la promesa de contacto sexual. Sin embargo, la tendencia a considerar el acompañamiento como algo distinto o superior a otras formas de trabajo sexual oculta el trabajo que realizan los acompañantes y perpetúa la discriminación contra los trabajadores sexuales más marginados y vulnerables."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Sexarbeiter:innen, deren Kundschaft für ihre Dienste Termine vereinbaren muss. Im Gegensatz zu Sexarbeiter:innen, die auf der Straße oder in Einrichtungen wie Bordellen Kund:innen anwerben, bewerben Escorts ihre Dienste in der Regel online, entweder unabhängig oder über Agenturen. Escortservices sind möglicherweise weniger stigmatisiert als andere Formen der Sexarbeit, zum Teil weil sie für Escorts tendenziell sicherer sind und weil einige Escorts ein breiteres Spektrum an Dienstleistungen anbieten, darunter Begleitung oder Unterhaltung ohne das Versprechen sexueller Kontakte. Die Tendenz, Escortservices als von anderen Formen der Sexarbeit getrennt oder diesen überlegen darzustellen, verschleiert jedoch die von Escorts geleistete Arbeit und perpetuiert die Diskriminierung der am stärksten marginalisierten und schutzbedürftigen Sexarbeiter:innen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexarbetare vars kunder bokar tid i förväg för att få deras tjänster. Till skillnad från sexarbetare som söker kunder på gatan eller inom inrättningar som bordeller annonserar eskorter vanligtvis sina tjänster online, antingen på egen hand eller genom förmedling. Eskortverksamhet kan uppfattas som mindre stigmatiserat än andra former av sexarbete, delvis eftersom det ofta är säkrare för eskorterna och eftersom vissa erbjuder ett bredare utbud av tjänster, inklusive sällskap eller underhållning utan löfte om sexuellt umgänge. Tendensen att framställa eskortverksamhet som något separat från eller överordnat andra former av sexarbete riskerar dock att osynliggöra eskorters arbete och förstärka diskriminering mot de mest marginaliserade och utsatta sexarbetarna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000405"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/escorts"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000651","dc:identifier":"homoit0000651","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hormones"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hormonas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hormone"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hormonen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hormoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Regulatory substances produced in organisms and transported throughout the body to stimulate specific cells or tissues into action. Though hormones regulate digestion, respiration, sleep, and many other bodily functions, the term is most commonly used by the general public to describe the \"sex hormones,\" or the hormones involved in puberty and sexual development, reproduction, and sexual desire."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sustancias reguladoras producidas en organismos y transportadas por todo el cuerpo para estimular la acción de células o tejidos específicos. Aunque las hormonas regulan la digestión, la respiración, el sueño y muchas otras funciones corporales, el público en general utiliza el término con mayor frecuencia para describir las \"hormonas sexuales\", o las hormonas involucradas en la pubertad y el desarrollo sexual, la reproducción y el deseo sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Regulierungsstoffe, die in Organismen gebildet und durch den Körper transportiert werden, um bestimmte Zellen oder Gewebe zur Aktivität anzuregen. Obwohl Hormone die Verdauung, die Atmung, den Schlaf und viele andere Körperfunktionen regulieren, wird der Begriff in der Öffentlichkeit meist zur Beschreibung der „Geschlechtshormone“ verwendet, also der Hormone, die an der Pubertät und der sexuellen Entwicklung, der Fortpflanzung sowie dem sexuellen Verlangen beteiligt sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Regulerende stoffen die in een organisme worden geproduceerd en door het lichaam worden getransporteerd om specifieke cellen of weefsels tot actie te stimuleren. Hoewel hormonen de spijsvertering, ademhaling, slaap en vele andere lichaamsfuncties reguleren, wordt de term door het grote publiek het meest gebruikt om de 'geslachtshormonen' te beschrijven, of de hormonen die betrokken zijn bij de puberteit en seksuele ontwikkeling, voortplanting en seksueel verlangen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Reglerande signalsubstanser som produceras i kroppen och transporteras genom blodet för att stimulera specifika celler eller vävnader. Även om hormoner reglerar matsmältning, andning, sömn och många andra funktioner i kroppen, används termen allmänspråkligt oftast för att beskriva könshormoner – det vill säga hormoner som påverkar pubertet, sexuell utveckling, reproduktion och sexuell lust."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000407"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001362"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002820"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002876"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85061980"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hormones"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000986","dc:identifier":"homoit0000986","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"MtFs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"MTFs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"MtFs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"MtF"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Males transitioning to females"},{"@language":"en","@value":"MtF transsexuals"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Male-to-female"},{"@language":"en","@value":"M2Fs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Transsexual women"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Man naar vrouw"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"MtF transseksuelen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transseksuele vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"M2F"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"M2Fs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Male-to-female"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transkvinnor"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Man-till-kvinna"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"MtFs"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"MtF (male-to-female) is a mostly historical term that has been largely replaced by \"trans women.\" This is due in part to the term’s connection to the medicalisation of transgender people and its assumption that trans women are \"born\" male and become female (typically through hormones and/or surgery)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"MtF (del inglés \"male-to-female\", traducido como \"de hombre a mujer\") es un término mayoritariamente histórico que ha sido reemplazado en gran medida por \"mujeres trans\". Esto se debe en parte a la conexión del término con la medicalización de las personas transgénero y su suposición de que las mujeres trans \"nacen\" hombres y se vuelven mujeres (generalmente a través de hormonas y/o cirugía)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"MtF (man-naar-vrouw) is een historische term die grotendeels is vervangen door 'transvrouwen'. Dit is gedeeltelijk te wijten aan het verband tussen de term en de medicalisering van transgenders en de veronderstelling dat transvrouwen als man worden \"geboren\" en vrouwelijk worden (meestal door hormonen en/of chirurgie)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"MtF (male-to-female) är en huvudsakligen historisk term som i dag i stor utsträckning ersatts av ”transkvinna”. Det beror delvis på att termen är kopplad till en medicinsk syn på transpersoner och antyder att transkvinnor är ”födda som” män och blir kvinnor (vanligtvis genom hormoner och/eller kirurgi)."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001642"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000407"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000436"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000457"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001027"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006002132"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/MtFs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000408","dc:identifier":"homoit0000408","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Etiology"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Etiología"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ätiologie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Etiologie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Etiologi (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Aitiologie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förklaringsmodeller (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inquiries and speculations regarding the causes of sexual behaviors or diseases."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Investigaciones y especulaciones sobre las causas de las conductas o enfermedades sexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fragen und Spekulationen über die Ursachen sexuellen Verhaltens oder sexueller Krankheiten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"onderzoek en speculaties naar de oorzaken van seksueel gedrag of ziekten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frågeställningar och spekulationer om orsakerna till sexuella beteenden eller sjukdomar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh00005666"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/etiology"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000411","dc:identifier":"homoit0000411","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ex-gay movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento ex-gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ex-Gay-Bewegung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ex-gay-beweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ex-gayrörelser"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People and organizations that encourage people to resist entering or pursuing same-sex relationships, to eliminate homosexual desires, to develop heterosexual desires, and/or to enter into heterosexual relationships."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas y organizaciones que alientan a las personas a resistirse a entablar o mantener relaciones con personas del mismo sexo, a eliminar los deseos homosexuales, a desarrollar deseos heterosexuales y/o a entablar relaciones heterosexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen und Organisationen, die Menschen dazu ermutigen, sich gegen gleichgeschlechtliche Beziehungen zu entscheiden oder diese nicht weiter zu verfolgen, homosexuelle Wünsche zu unterdrücken, heterosexuelle Wünsche zu entwickeln und/oder heterosexuelle Beziehungen einzugehen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"mensen en organisaties die proberen mensen met homogevoelens ervan te overtuigen niet toe te geven aan deze gevoelens en een heterorelatie aan te gaan in plaats van een homorelatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer och organisationer som uppmanar andra att avstå från att inleda eller fortsätta samkönade relationer, att eliminera samkönade begär, att utveckla heterosexuella begär och/eller att ingå heterosexuella relationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000303"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000619"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2005005425"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ex-gayMovement"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000412","dc:identifier":"homoit0000412","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Exhibitionism"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Exhibitionismus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Exhibicionismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Exhibitionisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Exhibitionism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Blottare"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Blottning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A kink characterized by the sexual desire to display one's body or engage in sexual activities in public."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Vorliebe, die durch das sexuelle Verlangen gekennzeichnet ist, den eigenen Körper in der Öffentlichkeit zu zeigen oder sexuelle Handlungen in der Öffentlichkeit auszuüben."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Kink caracterizado por el deseo sexual de exhibir el propio cuerpo o realizar actividades sexuales en público."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een \"kink\" die gekenmerkt wordt door de seksuele behoefte om het eigen lichaam te tonen of om seksuele handelingen in het openbaar te verrichten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kink som kännetecknas av sexuell upphetsning kopplad till att visa upp kroppen eller ha sex offentligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001142"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001257"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001283"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85046353"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/exhibitionism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001257","dc:identifier":"homoit0001257","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Voyeurism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Voyerismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Voyeurisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Voyerurism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Scopophilia"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Scoptophilia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Voyeurismo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Escopofilia"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Scoptofilie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skopofili"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skoptofili"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Practice of watching or listening to others, typically without their awareness or consent. In consensual sexual encounters, voyeurism involves watching or listening to someone undress or engage in sexual activity without actively participating."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Práctica de observar o escuchar a otras personas, generalmente sin su conocimiento o consentimiento. En los encuentros sexuales consensuales, el voyeurismo implica mirar o escuchar a alguien desvestirse o participar de una actividad sexual sin participar activamente."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Praktijk van het kijken naar of luisteren naar anderen, meestal zonder hun medeweten of toestemming. Bij consensuele seksuele ontmoetingen houdt voyeurisme in dat je kijkt of luistert naar iemand die zich uitkleedt of seksuele activiteit verricht zonder actief deel te nemen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Praktik som innebär att man tittar eller lyssnar på andra, vanligtvis utan deras vetskap eller samtycke. Inom samtyckta sexuella sammanhang innebär voyeurism att titta eller lyssna på någon som klär av sig eller har sex utan att själv delta."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000412"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001142"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85118773"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/voyeurism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001283","dc:identifier":"homoit0001283","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people with sexual addictions"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ con adicciones sexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met een seksverslaving"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexmissbruk (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people with sex addictions"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people experiencing addiction to or dependency upon sexual activities. Only use to refer to individuals who describe themselves as having sexual addictions, not individuals whose sexual practices are perceived as promiscuous or unsafe by others."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que experimentan una adicción o dependencia a actividades sexuales. Utilícese únicamente para referirse a personas que se describen a sí mismas como adictas sexuales, no a personas cuyas prácticas sexuales son percibidas como promiscuas o inseguras por otras personas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die verslaafd zijn aan of afhankelijk zijn van seksuele activiteiten. Alleen gebruiken om te verwijzen naar personen die zichzelf beschrijven als iemand met seksuele een verslaving, niet personen wiens seksuele praktijken door anderen als promiscue of onveilig worden beschouwd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som upplever beroende eller beroendeproblematik kopplad till sexuella aktiviteter. Används endast för personer som själva beskriver sig som att de har ett sexberoende och inte för personer vars sexuella praktiker uppfattas som promiskuösa eller riskfyllda av andra."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001550"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001539"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000412"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000656"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001538"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualAddiction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000415","dc:identifier":"homoit0000415","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Faeries (LGBTQ+ culture)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Faeries"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Faeries (Cultura LGBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Faeries (LHBTQ+-cultuur)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Faeries"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radical Faeries"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Faes (LGBTQ+ culture)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Radical Faeries"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hadas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hadas radicales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Faes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Radical Faeries"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who are involved with or identify with the countercultural movement seeking to redefine queer consciousness through secular spirituality. Often but not always associated with the Radical Faeries, a loosely affiliated worldwide network that formed in the 1970s."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Queere Menschen, die sich in der Gegenkulturbewegung engagieren oder sich mit ihr identifizieren und die queere Identität durch säkulare Spiritualität neu definieren wollen. Oft, aber nicht immer, mit den Radical Faeries in Verbindung gebracht; einem losen weltweiten Netzwerk, das in den 1970er Jahren gegründet wurde."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que están involucradas o se autoidentifican con el movimiento contracultural que busca redefinir la conciencia queer a través de la espiritualidad secular. A menudo, pero no siempre, se asocia con Radical Faeries, una red mundial libremente afiliada que se formó en la década de 1970."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die betrokken zijn bij of zich identificeren met de tegencultuurbeweging die het queere bewustzijn wil herdefiniëren door middel van seculiere spiritualiteit. Vaak, maar niet altijd, geassocieerd met Radical Faeries, het losjes verwante wereldwijde netwerk dat in de jaren zeventig ontstond."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som är engagerade i eller identifierar sig med en motkulturell rörelse som syftar till att omdefiniera queermedvetenhet genom sekulär andlighet. Ofta, men inte alltid, kopplat till Radical Faeries, ett löst sammanhållet nätverk som uppstod på 1970-talet."}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh98004651"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000415"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/faeries"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000629","dc:identifier":"homoit0000629","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual women"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres heterosexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heterovrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella kvinnor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight women"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres hétero"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women who identify as heterosexual, or straight."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres que se autoidentifican como heterosexuales."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnor som identifierar sig som heterosexuella."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000416"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000598"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93003545"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexualWomen"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000417","dc:identifier":"homoit0000417","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fag stags"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fag stags"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fag stag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nichtenvaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fag stags"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Mosca de la fruta"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fruit fly"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang for heterosexual men who enjoy the company of gay men."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Englischer Slang für heterosexuelle Männer, die die Gesellschaft von schwulen Männern genießen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jerga para hombres heterosexuales que disfrutan de la compañía de hombres gay."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slang för heterosexuella män som uppskattar bögars sällskap."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000626"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000455"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fagStags"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000418","dc:identifier":"homoit0000418","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Faggots"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"Okama"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"おかま"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Faggots"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Faggots"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Faggots"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Faggots"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fags"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fags"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fags"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slur used chiefly in North America to refer to gay men (or, in some cases, LGBTQ+ people in general). Some gay men have reclaimed this term and use it to describe themselves."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"主に北米でゲイ男性（あるいは場合によってはLGBTQ+の人々全般）を指す蔑称として使われる。一部のゲイ男性はこの言葉を肯定的に捉え直し、自らを表現する言葉として用いている。日本語では「おかま」と表現する。"},{"@language":"de","@value":"In Nordamerika vor allem verwendete Beleidigung für schwule Männer (oder in manchen Fällen für LGBTQ+-Personen im Allgemeinen). Einige schwule Männer haben diesen Begriff wieder für sich beansprucht und verwenden ihn, um sich selbst zu beschreiben."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Insulto utilizado principalmente en Norteamérica para referirse a hombres gay (o, en algunos casos, a personas LGBTQ+ en general). Algunos hombres gay han recuperado este término y lo utilizan para describirse a sí mismos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Scheldnaam die voornamelijk in Noord-Amerika wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar homomannen (of, in sommige gevallen, LHBTQ+-mensen in het algemeen). Sommige homomannen hebben deze term weer opgeëist en gebruiken hem als geuzennaam."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nedsättande engelsk term som främst används för att beskriva bögar (eller ibland hbtq+-personer i allmänhet). Vissa bögar har återtagit termen och använder den för att beskriva sig själva."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001559"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001560"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/faggots"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000810","dc:identifier":"homoit0000810","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ adoptive families"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias adoptivas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の養子縁組した家庭"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-adoptiegezinnen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adoptivfamiljer (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ adoptive families"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias adoptivas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQの養子縁組した家庭"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Families including adopted children in which one or more individuals identify as LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias que incluyen niños adoptados en las que una o más personas se autoidentifican como LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"養子を含む家族で、その中に1人以上がLGBTQ+であると自認している場合。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gezinnen inclusief geadopteerde kinderen waarin een of meer personen zich identificeren als LHBTQ+."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjer med adopterade barn där en eller flera personer identifierar sig som hbtq+."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000811"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000866"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000905"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000809"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000812"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQAdoptiveFamilies"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000872","dc:identifier":"homoit0000872","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ foster parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres y padres de acogida LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-pleegouders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fosterföräldrar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ foster parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres de acogida LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de acogida LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Foster parents who are LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres y/o madres adoptivos que sean personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pleegouders die LHBTQ+-personen zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fosterföräldrar som är hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000870"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001075"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000812"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQFosterParents"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001759","dc:identifier":"homoit0001759","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex families"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias intersex"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Familles intersexes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse gezinnen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexfamiljer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"fr","@value":"Familles de personnes intersexes"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Families, whether biological, adoptive, or chosen, in which one or more individuals are intersex."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias, ya sean biológicas, adoptivas o elegidas, en las que una o más personas son intersex."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Familles biologiques, adoptives ou choisies, dans lesquelles une ou plusieurs personnes s'identifient comme intersexes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gezinnen, biologisch, adoptief of gekozen, waarin een of meer individuen zich identificeren als intersekse."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjer – biologiska, adoptiva eller valda – där en eller flera personer är intersex."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001763"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001767"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-11-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000811","dc:identifier":"homoit0000811","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ adoptive parenthood"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maternidad y paternidad adoptiva LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の養親となること"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-adoptie-ouderschap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adoptivföräldraskap (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ adoptive parenthood"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maternidad y paternidad adoptiva LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maternidad adoptiva LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Paternidad adoptiva LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQの養親となること"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The experiences involved in adoptive parenting, as experienced by LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las experiencias involucradas en la crianza adoptiva, tal como las viven las personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々が経験する養子縁組に伴う体験。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De ervaringen met adoptieouderschap, zoals ervaren door LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erfarenheter av adoptivföräldraskap, som de upplevs av hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000809"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000810"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000914"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000870"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000871"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000918"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000945"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001001"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001075"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001093"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQAdoptiveParenthood"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd: