un hermano; una alternativa a \"sobrinos\" o \"sobrinas\"."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderneutrale term die wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar de kinderen van iemands broer of zus; een alternatief voor 'neefjes' of 'nichtjes'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsneutral term för barn till ens syskon. Ett alternativ till ”brorsbarn” eller ”systersbarn”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002353","dc:identifier":"homoit0002353","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zonen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Söner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are sons."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que son hijos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zoon zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som är söner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001329"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002355"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003244"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002360","dc:identifier":"homoit0002360","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ family members"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familiares LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"家族の中のLGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-familieleden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjemedlemmar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Family members (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"家族 (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Family members who are LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Miembros de la familia que son LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+である家族の構成メンバー"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Familieleden die LHBTQ+ zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjemedlemmar som är hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002361","dc:identifier":"homoit0002361","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Family members of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Miembros de familia de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Familienmitglieder von LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Familieleden van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjemedlemmar till hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Familares de personas LGBTQ+"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who have one or more LGBTQ+ family member. For family members who are themselves LGBTQ+, use the term \"LGBTQ+ family members.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que tienen uno o más familiares LGBTQ+. Para miembros de la familia que son LGBTQ+, utilícese el término \"miembros LGBTQ+ de la familia\"."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die ein oder mehrere LGBTQ+-Familienmitglieder haben. Für Familienmitglieder, die selbst LGBTQ+ sind, den Begriff „LGBTQ+-Familienmitglieder” verwenden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die één of meer LHBTQ+-familieleden hebben. Gebruik voor familieleden die zelf LHBTQ+ zijn de term 'LHBTQ+-familieleden'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har en eller flera hbtq+-familjemedlemmar. För familjemedlemmar som själva är hbtq+, använd termen ”Familjemedlemmar (hbtq+)”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000422","dc:identifier":"homoit0000422","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fat distribution"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Distribución de grasa"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fettverteilung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vetverdeling"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fettfördelning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Location and arrangement of fat on the body, typically increasing during puberty as a secondary sex characteristic. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ubicación y disposición de la grasa en el cuerpo, que generalmente aumenta durante la pubertad como característica sexual secundaria."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lage und Verteilung von Fett im Körper, das in der Regel während der Pubertät als sekundäres Geschlechtsmerkmal zunimmt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Locatie en rangschikking van vet op het lichaam, meestal toenemend tijdens de puberteit als secundair geslachtskenmerk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fettets placering och fördelning i kroppen, vilket ofta förändras under puberteten och vid hormonbehandling som en sekundär könskarakteristika."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001259"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fatDistribution"},"d