y use to describe individuals who identify as fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que asumen el rol de padre de personas bisexuales. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine Vaterrolle für bisexuelle Personen einnehmen. Zur Verwendung nur für Personen, die sich als Vater identifizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui jouent le rôle de père auprès d'une personne bisexuelle; à utiliser seulement pour les personnes qui s'identifient comme pères."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die de rol van vader op zich neemt van een biseksueel; alleen gebruiken voor personen die zich identificeren als vaders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har rollen som pappa till bisexuella personer. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fathersOfBisexualPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000425","dc:identifier":"homoit0000425","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fathers of gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de hombres gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von schwulen Männern"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Pères d'hommes gais"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaders van homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pappor till bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás de hombres gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fäder till bögar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who assume the role of father to gay men. Only use to describe individuals who identify as fathers."},{"@l