lícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine Vaterrolle für Lesben einnehmen. Zur Verwendung nur für Personen, die sich als Vater identifizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui jouent le rôle de père auprès de personnes lesbiennes; à utiliser uniquement pour décrire les personnes qui s'identifient comme des pères."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die de rol van vader op zich neemt van een lesbische vrouw; alleen gebruiken voor personen die zich identificeren als vaders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har rollen som pappa till lesbiska. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fathersOfLesbians"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000427","dc:identifier":"homoit0000427","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fathers of queer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de personas queer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von queeren Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Pères de personnes queers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaders van queer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pappor till queera personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás de personas queer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fäder till queera personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who assume the role of father to queer people. Only use to describe individuals who identify as fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que asumen el rol de padre de personas queer. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine Vaterrolle für queere Personen einnehmen. Zur Verwendung nur für Personen, die sich als Vater identifizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui jouent le rôle de père auprès d'une personne queer; à utiliser uniquement pour décrire les personnes qui s'identifient comme des pères."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die de rol van vader op zich neemt van een queer persoon; alleen gebruiken voor personen die zich identificeren als vaders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har rollen som pappa till queera personer. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fathersOfQueerPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000428","dc:identifier":"homoit0000428","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fathers of transgender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de personas transgénero"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von trans Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Pères de personnes trans"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaders van transgender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pappor till transpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás de personas transgénero"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fäder till transpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who assume the role of father to transgender people. Only use to describe individuals who identify as fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que asumen el rol de padre de personas transgénero. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine Vaterrolle für trans Personen einnehmen. Zur Verwendung nur für Personen, die sich als Vater identifizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui jouent le rôle de père auprès d'une personne trans; à utiliser uniquement pour décrire les personnes qui s'identifient comme des pères."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die de rol van vader op zich nemen van een transgender persoon; alleen gebruiken voor personen die zich identificeren als vader."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har rollen som pappa till transpersoner. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fathersOfTransgenderPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000429","dc:identifier":"homoit0000429","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women's friendships"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistades entre mujeres"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Frauenfreundschaften"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwenvriendschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnors vänskap"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female friendships"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistades femininas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistades de mujeres"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Connections based on affection and trust between two or more women."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Conexiones basadas en el afecto y la confianza entre dos o más mujeres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Beziehungen, die auf Zuneigung und Vertrauen zwischen zwei oder mehr Frauen basieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Banden gebaseerd op genegenheid en vertrouwen tussen twee of meer vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Relationer baserade på tillit och ömhet mellan två eller flera kvinnor."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000455"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000649"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh96004236"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/womensFriendships"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000653","dc:identifier":"homoit0000653","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Sexual sterilization"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Esterilización sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele sterilisatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sterilisering"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Sexual sterilisation"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Refers to any type of medical treatment that intentionally leaves an individual sterile or unable to reproduce. This term encompasses both voluntary and involuntary sterilization."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Se refiere a cualquier tipo de tratamiento médico que intencionalmente deja a una persona estéril o incapaz de reproducirse. Este término abarca tanto la esterilización voluntaria como la involuntaria."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verwijst naar elke vorm van medische behandeling die een persoon opzettelijk onvruchtbaar maakt of niet in staat stelt zich voort te planten. Deze term omvat zowel vrijwillige als onvrijwillige sterilisatie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avser all typ av medicinsk behandling som avsiktligt gör en person steril eller oförmögen att reproducera sig. Innefattar både frivillig och ofrivillig sterilisering."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000430"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85128029"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000653"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualSterilisation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003816","dc:identifier":"homoit0003816","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female impersonation shows"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke impersonator shows"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Damimitatörs-föreställningar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female impersonator shows"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Female impersonators' shows"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke impersonatie shows"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Theater or stage shows featuring female impersonators, a historical term used to describe performers, often male-identified people, who enact female personas for the purpose of entertainment, typically for straight audiences. Only use in historical contexts."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Theater- of toneelshows met vrouwelijke imitators, een historische term die wordt gebruikt om artiesten te beschrijven, vaak als mannen geïdentificeerde personen, die vrouwelijke persona's naspelen voor entertainmentdoeleinden, meestal voor hetero publiek. Alleen gebruiken in historische context."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teater- eller scenföreställningar med kvinnoimitatörer, en historisk benämning för artister (ofta personer som identifierar sig som män) som gestaltar kvinnliga personas i underhållningssyfte, vanligtvis för heterosexuell publik. Ska endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000431"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003359"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-11-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000433","dc:identifier":"homoit0000433","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women sex workers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trabajadoras sexuales mujeres"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke sekswerkers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnliga sexarbetare"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female prostitutes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Female prostitution"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Women prostitutes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Women prostitution"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Working girls"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Women sex work"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Female sex work"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Female sex workers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prostitutas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prostitución femenina"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trabajo sexual femenino"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Prostituées"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerk door vrouwen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke prostitutie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke prostituées"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwenprostitutie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe women working across the broad spectrum of sex work."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas lesbianas que reciben dinero o bienes a cambio de servicios o actuaciones sexuales. Se utiliza para describir a las personas lesbianas que trabajan en el amplio espectro del trabajo sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwen die geld of goederen ontvangen in ruil voor seksuele diensten, optredens of gezelschap. Wordt gebruikt om vrouwen te beschrijven die werkzaam zijn in het brede spectrum van sekswerk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnor som tar emot pengar eller varor i utbyte mot sexuella handlingar, uppträdanden eller sällskap. Används för att beskriva kvinnor som arbetar inom ett brett spektrum av sexarbete. Vissa anser termen sexarbetare som kränkade och politiserad, medan andra identifierar sig med den. Se även \"Kvinnor i prostitution\"."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85107622"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/femaleProstitutes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000457","dc:identifier":"homoit0000457","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FtXs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"FTXs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"FtX's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FtX"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who transition from female to unknown or not female."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que transicionan de mujer a un género desconocido o a no mujer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die transitioneren van vrouwelijk naar onbekend of niet vrouwelijk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som genomgår könstransition från kvinna till okänt kön eller till något annat än kvinna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000436"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000986"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001027"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001518"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ftxs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001027","dc:identifier":"homoit0001027","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"MtXs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"MTXs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"MtX's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"MtX"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"M2X"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"M2Xs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Male-2-X"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Male-to-X"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Man-till-annat"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"MtXs"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who transition from male to unknown or not male."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que hacen transición de hombre a un género desconocido o a no-hombre."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die transitioneren van mannelijk naar onbekend of niet mannelijk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som genomgår könsbekräftande transition från man till okänt kön eller till ett kön som inte är man."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000436"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000457"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000986"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001518"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/mtxs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000444","dc:identifier":"homoit0000444","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"First-wave feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Primera ola del feminismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erste Welle des Feminismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Eerste feministische golf"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Första vågens feminism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"First wave feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo de la primera ola"},{"@language":"de","@value":"First-wave feminism"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erste Welle der Frauenbewegung"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Period of women's rights activism in the 19th and early 20th centuries that was primarily focused on legal rights such as women's right to vote."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Período de activismo por los derechos de las mujeres en el siglo XIX y principios del XX que se centró principalmente en derechos legales como el derecho de las mujeres al voto."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Phase des Frauenrechtsaktivismus im 19. und frühen 20. Jahrhundert, die sich in erster Linie auf gesetzliche Rechte wie das Wahlrecht für Frauen konzentrierte."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Periode van vrouwenrechtenactivisme in de 19e en vroege 20e eeuw die vooral gericht was op wettelijke rechten zoals het stemrecht voor vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Period inom kvinnorättsrörelsen under 1800-talet och början av 1900-talet som främst fokuserade på juridiska rättigheter, såsom kvinnors rösträtt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003172"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008001557"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/firstWaveFeminism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000622","dc:identifier":"homoit0000622","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo heterosexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexueller Feminismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heterofeminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuell feminism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of feminism that prioritizes the experiences of heterosexual women and focuses on securing equitable economic, political, and social rights for heterosexual women. Often discussed in juxtaposition to political lesbianism."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de feminismo que prioriza las experiencias de las mujeres heterosexuales y se centra en garantizar derechos económicos, políticos y sociales equitativos para las mujeres heterosexuales. A menudo se discute en yuxtaposición al lesbianismo político."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Form des Feminismus, die die Erfahrungen heterosexueller Frauen priorisiert und sich auf die Sicherung gleichberechtigter wirtschaftlicher, politischer und sozialer Rechte für heterosexuelle Frauen konzentriert. Wird oft im Gegensatz zum politischen Lesbismus diskutiert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van feminisme die prioriteit geeft aan de ervaringen van heteroseksuele vrouwen en zich richt op het waarborgen van billijke economische, politieke en sociale rechten voor heteroseksuele vrouwen. Vaak gezien als tegenstelling tot politiek lesbianisme."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av feminism som lyfter heterosexuella kvinnors erfarenheter och fokuserar på att uppnå jämlika ekonomiska, politiska och sociala rättigheter för heterosexuella kvinnor. Diskuteras ofta i kontrast till politisk lesbiskhet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000741"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexualFeminism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000741","dc:identifier":"homoit0000741","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo lésbico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbisch feminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk feminism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A cultural movement and critical perspective that arose in the 1970s and 1980s primarily in North America and Western Europe as a result of dissatisfaction with the women's liberation movement and the gay liberation movement. Lesbian feminism encourages women to focus their efforts, activities, and relationships toward other women rather than men, often advocating for lesbianism as the logical result of feminism."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un movimiento cultural y una perspectiva crítica que surgió en las décadas de 1970 y 1980, principalmente en Norteamérica y Europa Occidental, como resultado de la insatisfacción con el movimiento de liberación de la mujer y el movimiento de liberación gay. El feminismo lésbico anima a las mujeres a centrar sus esfuerzos, actividades y relaciones en otras mujeres en lugar de en los hombres, a menudo, defendiendo el lesbianismo como el resultado lógico del feminismo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een culturele beweging en kritische blik die in de jaren zeventig en tachtig vooral in Noord-Amerika en West-Europa ontstond als gevolg van onvrede met de vrouwenbevrijdingsbeweging en de homobevrijdingsbeweging. Lesbisch feminisme moedigt vrouwen aan om hun inspanningen, activiteiten en relaties te richten op andere vrouwen in plaats van mannen, waarbij ze vaak pleiten voor lesbianisme als het logische gevolg van feminisme."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En kulturell rörelse och ett kritiskt perspektiv som växte fram under 1970- och 1980-talen, främst i Nordamerika och Västeuropa, som ett resultat av missnöje med kvinnorörelsen och gayrörelsen. Lesbisk feminism uppmuntrar kvinnor att fokusera sitt politiska engagemang, sitt sociala liv och sina relationer på andra kvinnor snarare än män och framhåller ofta lesbiskhet som en logisk följd av feminism."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000622"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003169"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93000705"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianFeminism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001230","dc:identifier":"homoit0001230","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radical feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo radical"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Radicaal feminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Radikalfeminism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Perspective within feminism that calls for a radical reordering of society in which male supremacy is eliminated in all social and economic contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Perspectiva dentro del feminismo que exige un reordenamiento radical de la sociedad en la que se elimine la supremacía masculina en todos los contextos sociales y económicos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"heeft als uitgangspunt dat seksualiteit en (mannelijk) geweld aan de basis liggen van vrouwen-onderdrukking en dus niet wettelijke of economische ongelijkheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inriktning inom feminismen som förespråkar en radikal omstrukturering av samhället för att avskaffa manlig dominans i alla sociala och ekonomiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001516"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003177"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/radicalFeminism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001260","dc:identifier":"homoit0001260","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Second-wave feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo de segunda ola"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tweede feministische golf"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Andra vågens feminism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Second wave feminism"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Period of feminist political activity (also referred to as women’s liberation) beginning in the early 1960s that critiqued male-dominated institutions and cultural practices in society."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Período de actividad política feminista (también conocido como liberación de la mujer) que comenzó a principios de la década de 1960 y que criticó las instituciones y prácticas culturales dominadas por los hombres en la sociedad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Periode van feministische politieke activiteit (ook wel vrouwenbevrijding genoemd) die begon in de vroege jaren zestig van de 20e eeuw en die kritiek had op door mannen gedomineerde instellingen en culturele praktijken in de samenleving."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En period av feministisk politisk aktivitet (även kallad kvinnors frigörelse) som inleddes i början av 1960-talet och kritiserade mansdominerade institutioner och kulturella normer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003158"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003173"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008001560"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/secondWaveFeminism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002270","dc:identifier":"homoit0002270","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Black feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo negro"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwarzer Feminismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zwart feminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svart feminism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Afro feminism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Afro-feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afro feminismo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afro-feminismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afro-feminisme"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of feminism that developed in response to the failures of mainstream feminist and civil rights efforts to acknowledge the ways white supremacy and the patriarchy interact to inform the particular experiences of Black women."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de feminismo que se desarrolló en respuesta a los fracasos de los esfuerzos feministas y de derechos civiles dominantes para reconocer las formas en que la supremacía blanca y el patriarcado interactúan para informar las experiencias particulares de las mujeres negras."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Form des Feminismus, die als Reaktion auf das Versagen der Mainstream-Feminist:innen und Bürgerrechtsbewegungen entstanden ist, die Wechselwirkungen zwischen weißer Vorherrschaft und Patriarchat anzuerkennen, die die besonderen Erfahrungen schwarzer Frauen prägen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van feminisme die zich ontwikkelde als reactie op het falen van reguliere feministische en burgerrechteninspanningen om de wijze te onderkennen waarop blanke suprematie en het patriarchaat op elkaar inwerken en om over de specifieke ervaringen van zwarte vrouwen te informeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av feminism som utvecklades som en reaktion på att mainstreamfeminism och medborgarrättsrörelsen misslyckades med att erkänna hur vit överhöghet och patriarkatet samverkar och påverkar svarta kvinnors särskilda livserfarenheter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000667"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002272"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003170"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002271","dc:identifier":"homoit0002271","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"White feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo blanco"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wit feminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vit feminism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe (and criticize) forms of feminism that focus on the needs of white women at the expense of women of color."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir (y criticar) formas de feminismo que se centran en las necesidades de las mujeres blancas a expensas de las mujeres de color."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om vormen van feminisme te beschrijven (en te bekritiseren) die zich richten op de behoeften van witte vrouwen ten koste van vrouwen van kleur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva (och kritisera) former av feminism som fokuserar på vita kvinnors behov på bekostnad av kvinnor som rasifieras som icke-vita."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000667"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002272"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2021008248"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002274","dc:identifier":"homoit0002274","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transfeminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transfeminismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transfeminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transfeminism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trans feminismo"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"As defined by Emi Koyama, transfeminism is a movement by and for trans woman who view the liberation of trans women as essential to the liberation of all women."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Como lo define Emi Koyama, el transfeminismo es un movimiento por y para mujeres trans que ven la liberación de las mujeres trans como esencial para la liberación de todas las mujeres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zoals gedefinieerd door Emi Koyama, is transfeminisme een beweging van en voor transvrouwen die de bevrijding van transvrouwen als essentieel beschouwen voor de bevrijding van alle vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Enligt Emi Koyamas definition är transfeminism en rörelse av och för transkvinnor som ser transkvinnors frigörelse som avgörande för alla kvinnors frigörelse."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000667"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001642"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001892"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002275","dc:identifier":"homoit0002275","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Third-wave feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo de la tercera ola"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Derde feministische golf"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tredje vågen-feminism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Third wave feminism"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Period of feminist political activity beginning in the early 1990s that embraced diversity and individualism in women and sought to redefine what it meant to be a feminist. The third wave is characterized by the emergence of new feminist movements and theories such as intersectionality, sex positivity, ecofeminism, transfeminism, and postmodern feminism."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periodo de actividad política feminista que comenzó a principios de la década de 1990 y que abrazó la diversidad y el individualismo de las mujeres y buscó redefinir lo que significaba ser feminista. La tercera ola se caracteriza por el surgimiento de nuevos movimientos y teorías feministas como la interseccionalidad, la positividad sexual, el ecofeminismo, el transfeminismo y el feminismo posmoderno."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Periode van feministische politieke activiteit die begon in de vroege jaren 1990 die diversiteit en individualisme bij vrouwen omarmde en probeerde te herdefiniëren wat het betekende om feministe te zijn. De derde golf wordt gekenmerkt door de opkomst van nieuwe feministische bewegingen en theorieën zoals intersectionaliteit, sekspositiviteit, ecofeminisme, transfeminisme en postmodern feminisme."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En period av feministisk politisk aktivism som inleddes i början av 1990-talet och som betonade mångfald och individualism bland kvinnor samt ville omdefiniera vad det innebär att vara feminist. Den tredje vågen kännetecknas av framväxten av nya feministiska rörelser och teorier såsom intersektionalitet, sexpositivism, ekofeminism, transfeminism och postmodern feminism."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003174"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008001561"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003101","dc:identifier":"homoit0003101","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex-positive feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo prosexo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seks-positief feminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexpositiv feminism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex-positive movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo pro-sexo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo sexo positivo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo sexo afirmativo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feminismo de positividad sexual"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A broad feminist movement, usually compared against the anti-sex or anti-pornography feminist movement, that supports sexual liberation, sex workers, pornography, and freedom of sexual and gender expression."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un movimiento feminista amplio, generalmente contrastado con el movimiento feminista antisexo o antipornografía, que apoya la liberación sexual, a quienes realizan trabajo sexual, la pornografía y la libertad de expresión sexual y de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een brede feministische beweging, die seksuele bevrijding, sekswerkers, pornografie en vrijheid van seksuele en genderexpressie steunt. Dit in tegenstelling tot de antiseks- of antipornografiebeweging,"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En bred feministisk rörelse, ofta kontrasterad mot anti-sex- eller antipornografiska feministiska rörelser, som stödjer sexuell frigörelse, sexarbetare, pornografi och friheten att uttrycka sexuell och könsöverskridande identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001319"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003765","dc:identifier":"homoit0003765","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-sex work feminism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anti-sekswerk feminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexarbeteskritisk feminism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti sex work feminism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-sex-work feminism"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Prostitutionskritisk feminism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of feminism that alleges that sex work is inherently coercive and exploitative. Although not all sex workers are women and not all clients are men, anti-sex work feminism largely centers this gender dynamic, viewing sex work as a result and reinforcement of the patriarchy."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van feminisme die beweert dat sekswerk inherent dwingend en uitbuitend is. Hoewel niet alle sekswerkers vrouwen zijn en niet alle klanten mannen, richt anti-sekswerkfeminisme zich grotendeels op deze genderdynamiek, en ziet sekswerk als een resultaat en versterking van het patriarchaat."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av feminism som hävdar att sexarbete och prostitution per definition är tvingande och exploaterande. Även om inte alla sexarbetare/personer i prostitution är kvinnor och inte alla kunder är män, fokuserar sexarbetskritisk feminism i stor utsträckning på denna könsdynamik och ser sexarbete och prostitution som en följd av och något som förstärker och reproducerar patriarkatet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003766"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003777"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003767","dc:identifier":"homoit0003767","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-pornography feminism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anti-pornografie feminisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antipornografisk feminism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-porn feminism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti pornography feminism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti porn feminism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of feminism that alleges that pornography is a result and reinforcement of the patriarchy and is thus inherently violent and exploitative."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van feminisme die stelt dat pornografie een gevolg is van het patriarchaat en deze versterkt, en daarom inherent gewelddadig en uitbuitend is."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av feminism som hävdar att pornografi är en följd av och förstärker patriarkatet och därför är per definition våldsam och exploaterande."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000438","dc:identifier":"homoit0000438","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women's movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento de mujeres"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Frauenbewegung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwenbeweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnorörelser"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminist movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Women's movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento feminista"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Feministische Bewegung"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnorörelsen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Social and political movement originating in the 1800s for reforms on women’s issues stemming from social, cultural, political, and economic inequality between men and women. Feminist issues include reproductive rights, women’s liberation, and equal pay. This term encompasses the women’s movement in its entirety, including different waves of feminist thought and activism."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento social y político que se originó en el siglo XIX para reformar asuntos de las mujeres derivados de la desigualdad social, cultural, política y económica entre hombres y mujeres. Los asuntos feministas incluyen los derechos reproductivos, la liberación de la mujer y la igualdad salarial. Este término abarca el movimiento de mujeres en su totalidad, incluidas diferentes olas de pensamiento y activismo feminista."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Soziale und politische Bewegung, die im 19. Jahrhundert entstand und sich für Reformen in Frauenfragen einsetzte, die aus der sozialen, kulturellen, politischen und wirtschaftlichen Ungleichheit zwischen Männern und Frauen resultierten. Zu den feministischen Themen gehören reproduktive Rechte, Frauenbefreiung und gleiche Bezahlung. Dieser Begriff umfasst die gesamte Frauenbewegung, einschließlich verschiedener Wellen feministischer Gedanken und Aktivismus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sociale en politieke beweging, oorspronkelijk uit 19e eeuw, voor hervormingen op het gebied van vrouwenkwesties, voortkomend uit de sociale, culturele, politieke en economische ongelijkheid tussen mannen en vrouwen, waaronder onderwerpen als reproductieve rechten, vrouwenemancipatie en gelijke beloning. Beschrijft de vrouwenbeweging in haar geheel, inclusief verschillende golven van feministisch denken en activisme."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Social och politisk rörelse med ursprung på 1800-talet som verkade för reformer i frågor som rör kvinnor, med utgångspunkt i den sociala, kulturella, politiska och ekonomiska ojämlikheten mellan kvinnor och män. Feministiska frågor inkluderar bland annat reproduktiva rättigheter, kvinnors frigörelse och lika lön. Termen omfattar hela kvinnorörelsen, inklusive olika vågor av feministiskt tänkande och aktivism."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002290"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85047741"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/womensMovement"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001505","dc:identifier":"homoit0001505","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Wimmin"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Wimmin"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wimmin"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Wimmin"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A way of spelling \"women\" that is used in certain feminist circles. First used by George P. Krapp (1872-1934) and then appeared in 19th century Black American English renderings before being used by feminists in the 20th century.\r\n"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de deletrear \"women\" (mujeres en inglés) que se utiliza en ciertos círculos feministas. Utilizado por primera vez por George P. Krapp (1872-1934) y luego apareció en representaciones del inglés afroamericano del siglo XIX antes de ser utilizado por feministas en el siglo XX."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een spelling in de USA van \"vrouwen\" die in bepaalde feministische kringen wordt gebruikt; voor het eerst gebruikt door George P. Krapp (1872-1934) en vervolgens verschenen in 19e-eeuwse Black American English, voordat ze in de 20e eeuw door feministen werden gebruikt"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett sätt att stava ”women” som används i vissa feministiska sammanhang. Formen användes först av George P. Krapp (1872–1934) och förekom i 1800-talets svart amerikansk engelska innan den togs upp av feminister under 1900-talet."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001516"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001505"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/wimmin"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002039","dc:identifier":"homoit0002039","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminist theory"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Teoría feminista"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Feministische Theorie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feministische theorie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Feministisk teori"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminist philosophy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Theory of feminism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Filosofía feminista"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Teoría del feminismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Feminist Theory"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Theorie van het feminisme"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The extension of feminism into theoretical, fictional, or philosophical discourse, often seeking to understand the nature of gender inequity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La extensión del feminismo al discurso teórico, ficticio o filosófico, que a menudo trata de comprender la naturaleza de la desigualdad de género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Ausweitung des Feminismus auf theoretische, fiktionale oder philosophische Diskurse, oft mit dem Ziel, die Natur der Ungleichheit der Geschlechter zu verstehen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De uitbreiding van het feminisme naar een theoretisch, fictief of filosofisch discours, vaak op zoek naar de aard van genderongelijkheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utvidgning av feminismen till teoretiska, skönlitterära eller filosofiska diskurser, ofta med syftet att förstå könsrelaterad ojämlikhet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002040"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002041"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003444"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003706"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000579"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001210"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90002282"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002290","dc:identifier":"homoit0002290","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender equality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Igualdad de género"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtergleichstellung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender equality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Jämställdhet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Gleichstellung der Geschlechter"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The state of equal ease of access to resources and opportunities regardless of gender, including economic participation and decision-making, as well as the state of valuing different behaviors, aspirations, and needs equally, regardless of gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El estado de igualdad en facilidad de acceso a recursos y oportunidades independientemente del género, incluida la participación económica y la toma de decisiones, así como el estado de valorar diferentes comportamientos, aspiraciones y necesidades por igual, independientemente del género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Der Zustand des gleichberechtigten Zugangs zu Ressourcen und Chancen unabhängig vom Geschlecht, einschließlich der wirtschaftlichen Teilhabe und Entscheidungsfindung, sowie der Zustand der gleichberechtigten Wertschätzung unterschiedlicher Verhaltensweisen, Bestrebungen und Bedürfnisse unabhängig vom Geschlecht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het hebben van gelijke gemakkelijke toegang tot middelen en kansen ongeacht gender, inclusief economische participatie en besluitvorming, evenals het hebben van gelijkwaardige waardering van verschillend gedrag, ambities en behoeften, ongeacht gender."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett tillstånd där alla har lika god tillgång till resurser och möjligheter oavsett kön, inklusive ekonomiskt deltagande och beslutsfattande, samt ett erkännande av att olika beteenden, ambitioner och behov är lika mycket värda oavsett kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000652"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000438"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000652"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003157","dc:identifier":"homoit0003157","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans-exclusionary radical feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas radicales trans-excluyentes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trans-uitsluitende radicale feministen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transexkluderande radikalfeminister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender critical feminists"},{"@language":"en","@value":"TERFs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans-exclusionary feminist"},{"@language":"es","@value":"TERFs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terfas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas críticas de género"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas trans-excluyentes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"TERF's"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trans-uitsluitende feministen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who subscribes to a transphobic and transantagonistic ideology that rejects trans and gender diverse identities and rights, and believes that recognition of these identities and rights constitutes discrimination and oppression towards cisgender women. Though originally considered a fringe offshoot of feminism, trans-exclusionary radical feminist groups have formed alliances with right-wing, far-right extremists, and anti-feminist organizations in order to spread misinformation and further anti-trans sentiment and legislation. Use when resources are about trans-exclusionary radical feminists or when an individual identifies as such. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que se suscribe a una ideología transfóbica y transantagonista que rechaza las identidades y los derechos trans y de género diverso, y cree que el reconocimiento de estas identidades y estos derechos constituye discriminación y opresión hacia las mujeres cisgénero. Aunque originalmente se les consideró una rama marginal del feminismo, los grupos feministas radicales trans-excluyentes han formado alianzas con organizaciones antifeministas, de derecha y de extrema derecha para difundir información errónea y promover el sentimiento y la legislación anti-trans. Utilícese cuando los recursos traten sobre feministas radicales trans-excluyentes o cuando una persona se identifique como tal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die aanhanger is van een transfobische en transantagonistische ideologie die trans- en genderdiverse identiteiten en rechten verwerpt, en gelooft dat erkenning van deze identiteiten en rechten discriminatie en onderdrukking van cisgender vrouwen inhoudt. Hoewel oorspronkelijk beschouwd als een marginale uitloper van het feminisme, hebben trans-uitsluitende radicale feministische groepen allianties gevormd met rechtse, radicaalrechtse extremisten en antifeministische organisaties om misinformatie te verspreiden en anti-trans sentiment en wetgeving te bevorderen. Gebruik wanneer bronnen gaan over trans-uitsluitende radicale feministen of wanneer een persoon zich als zodanig identificeert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som förespråkar en transfobisk och transfientlig ideologi som förnekar transpersoners och könsöverskridande individers existens och rättigheter samt hävdar att erkännandet av dessa innebär diskriminering och förtryck av ciskvinnor. Rörelsen har historiskt förknippats med radikalfeminism men har knutit band till högerextrema och antifeministiska grupper. Används när material handlar om sådana personer eller om en individ identifierar sig som sådan."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000437"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003158"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003157"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753","dc:identifier":"homoit0000753","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento lésbico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische beweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska rörelser"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian organisations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian organizations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones lesbianas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones lésbicas||"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska organisationer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term for activism focused on the rights of lesbians and issues faced by lesbian communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general para el activismo centrado en los derechos de las lesbianas y los problemas que enfrentan las comunidades de lesbianas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor activisme gericht op de rechten van lesbische vrouwen en problemen waarmee lesbische gemeenschappen worden geconfronteerd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samlingsterm för aktivism med fokus på lesbiska personers rättigheter och frågor som påverkar lesbiskas gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000791"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000438"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000500"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000734"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000737"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000741"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000746"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000757"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000766"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000772"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000787"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003169"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003934"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianMovement"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439","dc:identifier":"homoit0000439","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Feminist:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feministen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Feminister"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who support and advocate for defining, establishing, and defending equal political, economic, and social rights and opportunities for women. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que apoyan y defienden la definición, el establecimiento y la defensa de la igualdad de derechos y oportunidades políticas, económicas y sociales para las mujeres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die sich für die Formulierung, Festlegung und Verteidigung gleicher politischer, wirtschaftlicher und sozialer Rechte und Chancen für Frauen einsetzen und diese unterstützen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die ondersteuning bieden en pleiten voor het definiëren, vestigen en verdedigen van gelijke politieke, economische en sociale rechten en kansen voor vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som stödjer och förespråkar att kvinnors politiska, ekonomiska och sociala rättigheter och möjligheter ska definieras, etableras och försvaras."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001346"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003169"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003170"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003171"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003172"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003173"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003174"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003177"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85047761"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/feminists"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001346","dc:identifier":"homoit0001346","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Suffragettes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sufragistas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Suffragettes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Suffragetter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Suffragettes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnorösträttskämpar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rösträttskvinnor"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Suffragister"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women who seek the right to vote, often through organized protest; typically used to describe members of political movements in the late 1800s and early 1900s focusing on women’s right to vote in the U.S. and Britain."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres que buscan el derecho al voto, a menudo mediante protestas organizadas; normalmente se utiliza para describir a miembros de movimientos políticos de finales del siglo XIX y principios del XX que se centraban en el derecho de las mujeres al voto en Estados Unidos y Gran Bretaña."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwen die kiesrecht nastreefden, vaak via georganiseerd protest; het gaat hierbij vooral om leden van politieke bewegingen eind 19e, begin 20e eeuw die zich richtten op het stemrecht van vrouwen in de VS en Groot-Brittannië, maar ook elders in de wereld"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnor som kämpar för rösträtt, ofta genom organiserad protest. Termen används typiskt för medlemmar i politiska rörelser i slutet av 1800-talet och början av 1900-talet med fokus på kvinnors rösträtt i USA och Storbritannien."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85129648"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/suffragettes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003169","dc:identifier":"homoit0003169","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische feministen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska feminister"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas feministas"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who subscribes to lesbian feminism, an ideology that encourages women to focus their efforts, activities, and relationships toward other women rather than men, often advocating for lesbianism as the logical result of feminism. Use when resources are about lesbian feminists or when an individual identifies as such."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Persona que se suscribe el feminismo lésbico, una ideología que anima a las mujeres a centrar sus esfuerzos, actividades y relaciones en otras mujeres en lugar de en los hombres, a menudo, defendiendo el lesbianismo como el resultado lógico del feminismo. Utilícese cuando los recursos sean sobre feministas lesbianas o cuando una persona se identifique como tal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die het lesbisch feminisme onderschrijft, een ideologie die vrouwen aanmoedigt om hun inspanningen, activiteiten en relaties op andere vrouwen te richten in plaats van op mannen, en vaak pleit voor lesbianisme als het logische resultaat van feminisme. Gebruik deze term als bronnen over lesbische feministen gaan of als een persoon zich als zodanig identificeert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som ansluter sig till lesbisk feminism, en ideologi som uppmuntrar kvinnor att fokusera sitt politiska engagemang, sitt sociala liv och sina relationer på andra kvinnor snarare än män och som ofta framhåller lesbiskhet som en logisk följd av feminism. Används när resurser handlar om lesbiska feminister eller när en individ identifierar sig som sådan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000741"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93000705"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003170","dc:identifier":"homoit0003170","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Black feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas negras"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwarze Feminist:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zwarte feministen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svarta feminister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Afro feminists"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Afro-feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afro feministas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afro-feministas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Afrofeminist:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afro-feministen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who subscribes to a form of feminism that developed in response to the failures of mainstream feminist and civil rights efforts to acknowledge the ways white supremacy and the patriarchy interact to inform the particular experiences of Black women. Use when resources are about Black feminists or when an individual identifies as such."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que se suscribe a una forma de feminismo que se desarrolló en respuesta a los fracasos de los esfuerzos feministas y de derechos civiles dominantes para reconocer las formas en que la supremacía blanca y el patriarcado interactúan para informar las experiencias particulares de las mujeres negras. Utilícese cuando los recursos sean sobre feministas negras o cuando una persona se autoidentifique como tal."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Person, die sich einer Form des Feminismus verschrieben hat, die als Reaktion auf das Versagen der Mainstream-Feminismus- und Bürgerrechtsbewegung entstanden ist, die Wechselwirkungen zwischen weißer Vorherrschaft und Patriarchat anzuerkennen, die die besonderen Erfahrungen schwarzer Frauen prägen. Zu verwenden, wenn es um schwarze Feminist:innen geht oder wenn sich eine Person als solche identifiziert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die een vorm van feminisme steunt dat is ontstaan als reactie op het falen van mainstream feministische en burgerrechteninitiatieven om te erkennen dat witte suprematie en het patriarchaat de specifieke ervaringen van zwarte vrouwen beïnvloeden. Gebruik wanneer bronnen over zwarte feministen gaan of wanneer een persoon zich als zodanig identificeert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som stödjer en form av feminism som utvecklades som en reaktion på att mainstreamfeminism och medborgarrättsrörelsen misslyckades med att erkänna hur vit överhöghet och patriarkatet samverkar och påverkar svarta kvinnors särskilda livserfarenheter. Används när resurser handlar om svarta feminister eller när en individ identifierar sig som sådan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002270"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003176"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003172","dc:identifier":"homoit0003172","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"First-wave feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas la de primera ola"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Feminist:innen der Ersten Welle"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feministen van de eerste golf"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Första vågen-feminister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"First wave feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas de la primera ola"},{"@language":"de","@value":"First wave feminists"},{"@language":"de","@value":"First-Wave-Feminist:innen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Frauenrechtler:innen der ersten Welle"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who was part of a period of women's rights activism in the 19th and early 20th centuries that was primarily focused on legal rights such as women's right to vote. Use when resources are about first-wave feminists."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Persona que formó parte de un período de activismo por los derechos de las mujeres en el siglo XIX y principios del XX que se centró principalmente en derechos legales como el derecho de las mujeres al voto. Utilícese cuando los recursos sean sobre feministas de la primera ola."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Person, die Teil einer Frauenrechtsbewegung im 19. und frühen 20. Jahrhundert war, deren Schwerpunkt vor allem auf gesetzlichen Rechten wie dem Wahlrecht für Frauen lag. Verwenden, wenn es um Quellen über Feminist:innen der ersten Welle geht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die deel uitmaakte van een periode van vrouwenrechtenactivisme in de 19e en begin 20e eeuw die vooral gericht was op wettelijke rechten zoals het vrouwenkiesrecht. Te gebruiken wanneer bronnen over feministen van de eerste golf gaan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som var verksam inom kvinnorättsrörelsen under 1800-talet och början av 1900-talet, med främst fokus på juridiska rättigheter såsom kvinnors rösträtt. Används när resurser handlar om första vågens feminister."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000444"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003173","dc:identifier":"homoit0003173","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Second-wave feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas de segunda ola"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feministen van de tweede golf"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Andra vågen-feminister"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Second wave feminists"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who was part of or subscribes to beliefs developed during a period of feminist political activity (also referred to as women’s liberation) beginning in the early 1960s that critiqued male-dominated institutions and cultural practices in society. Use when resources are about second-wave feminists or when an individual identifies as such."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que formó parte o se suscribe a creencias desarrolladas durante un período de actividad política feminista (también conocido como liberación de la mujer) que comenzó a principios de la década de 1960 y que criticaba las instituciones y prácticas culturales dominadas por los hombres en la sociedad. Utilícese cuando los recursos sean sobre feministas de segunda ola o cuando una persona se identifique como tal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die deel uitmaakte van overtuigingen, of deze ondersteunde, die zijn ontwikkeld tijdens de periode van feministische politieke activiteit (ook wel vrouwenbevrijding genoemd) die begon in de vroege jaren 60 en die kritiek leverde op door mannen gedomineerde instellingen en culturele praktijken in de maatschappij. Gebruik wanneer bronnen gaan over feministen van de tweede golf of wanneer een persoon zich als zodanig identificeert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som deltog i eller identifierar sig med idéer som utvecklades under den andra feministiska vågen, en period av politisk aktivitet som inleddes på 1960-talet och som kritiserade patriarkala strukturer i samhället. Används för resurser om andra vågens feminister eller individer som själva identifierar sig som sådana."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001260"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003174","dc:identifier":"homoit0003174","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Third-wave feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas de la tercera ola"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feministen van de derde golf"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tredje vågen-feminister"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Third wave feminists"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who was part of or subscribes to beliefs developed during a period of feminist political activity beginning in the early 1990s that embraced diversity and individualism in women and sought to redefine what it meant to be a feminist. The third-wave is characterized by the emergence of new feminist movements and theories such as intersectionality, sex positivity, ecofeminism, transfeminism, and postmodern feminism. Use when resources are about third-wave feminists or when an individual identifies as such."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que formaba parte de o se suscribía a creencias desarrolladas durante un período de actividad política feminista que comenzó a principios de la década de 1990 y que abrazó la diversidad y el individualismo de las mujeres y buscó redefinir lo que significaba ser feminista. La tercera ola se caracteriza por el surgimiento de nuevos movimientos y teorías feministas como la interseccionalidad, la positividad sexual, el ecofeminismo, el transfeminismo y el feminismo posmoderno. Utilícese cuando los recursos sean sobre feministas de la tercera ola o cuando una persona se identifique como tal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die deel uitmaakte van overtuigingen, of deze ondersteunde, die zijn ontwikkeld tijdens de periode van feministische politieke activiteit die begon in de vroege jaren 1990, die diversiteit en individualisme bij vrouwen omarmde en probeerde te herdefiniëren wat het betekende om een ​​feminist te zijn. De derde golf wordt gekenmerkt door de opkomst van nieuwe feministische bewegingen en theorieën zoals intersectionaliteit, sekspositiviteit, ecofeminisme, transfeminisme en postmodern feminisme. Gebruik wanneer bronnen gaan over feministen van de derde golf of wanneer een persoon zich als zodanig identificeert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som deltog i eller identifierar sig med idéer från en period av feministisk politisk aktivism som inleddes i början av 1990-talet och betonade mångfald och individualism bland kvinnor samt ville omdefiniera vad det innebär att vara feminist. Den tredje vågen kännetecknas av nya feministiska rörelser och teorier såsom intersektionalitet, sexpositivism, ekofeminism, transfeminism och postmodern feminism. Använd när material handlar om tredje vågens feminister eller när en individ identifierar sig som sådan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002275"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003177","dc:identifier":"homoit0003177","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radical feminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Feministas radicales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Radicale feministen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Radikalfeminister"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who subscribes to a perspective within feminism that calls for a radical reordering of society in which male supremacy is eliminated in all social and economic contexts. Distinct from and not to be confused with trans-exclusionary radical feminists. Use for resources about radical feminists or for individuals who identify as such, unless trans-exclusionary radical feminists is a more appropriate term."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que se suscribe a una perspectiva dentro del feminismo que exige un reordenamiento radical de la sociedad en el que se elimine la supremacía masculina en todos los contextos sociales y económicos. Es distinto a y no debe confundirse con feministas radicales transexcluyentes. Utilícese para recursos sobre feministas radicales o para personas que se autoidentifican como tales, a menos que \"feministas radicales transexcluyentes\" sea un término más apropiado."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die een stroming binnen het feminisme aanhangt dat oproept tot een radicale herordening van de maatschappij waarin mannelijke suprematie in alle sociale en economische contexten wordt geëlimineerd. Onderscheidend van en niet te verwarren met trans-uitsluitende radicale feministen. Gebruik voor bronnen over radicale feministen of voor personen die zich als zodanig identificeren, tenzij trans-uitsluitende radicale feministen een toepasselijkere term is."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som företräder en feministisk inriktning som eftersträvar en radikal omstrukturering av samhället där manlig överordning avskaffas i alla sociala och ekonomiska sammanhang. Ska inte förväxlas med transexkluderande radikalfeminister. Används för material om radikalfeminister eller för personer som identifierar sig som det, om inte termen transexkluderande radikalfeminister är mer relevant."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003766"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001230"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000971","dc:identifier":"homoit0000971","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lipstick lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbiana lipstick"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lipstick lesbians"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lipstick lesbians"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians whose appearance or mannerisms are more traditionally feminine."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas cuya apariencia o gestos son más tradicionalmente femeninos."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska vars utseende eller uppträdande uppfattas som mer traditionellt feminint."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000440"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lipstickLesbians"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001246","dc:identifier":"homoit0001246","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Rubber and latex fetish"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fetiche de goma y látex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rubber en latex fetisj"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gummi- och latexfetischism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Rubber and latex sex"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rubber sex"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rubbersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fetiche de goma"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo de goma y látex|"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rubber seks"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rubberseks"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Eroticization of rubber, latex, and related materials."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erotización de la goma, el látex y materiales afines."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotisering van rubber, latex en aanverwante materialen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotisering av gummi, latex och relaterade material."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001247"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003066"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003126"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/rubberSex"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001814","dc:identifier":"homoit0001814","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chasers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Perseguidores"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chaser"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chasers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Chasers"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Cazadores"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chasers"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who express fetishistic interest in and pursue sexual encounters with others based solely on their affiliation with a (typically marginalized) group that the chaser does not belong to. Often coupled with other terms to identify the type of chaser."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que expresan interés fetichista y buscan encuentros sexuales con otros basándose únicamente en su afiliación con un grupo (normalmente marginado) al que el perseguidor no pertenece. A menudo se combina con otros términos para identificar el tipo de perseguidor."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die ein Fetisch-Interesse an anderen Menschen bekunden und sexuelle Begegnungen mit ihnen anstreben, die ausschließlich auf deren Zugehörigkeit zu einer (in der Regel marginalisierten) Gruppe beruhen, der der Chaser nicht angehört. Wird oft mit anderen Begriffen kombiniert, um die Spezifizierung des Chasers zu definieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die fetisjistische interesse tonen in en seksuele ontmoetingen met anderen nastreven uitsluitend op basis van hun band met een (meestal gemarginaliseerde) groep waartoe de chaser niet behoort. Vaak gekoppeld aan andere termen om het type chaser te identificeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Individer som objektifierar, exotiserar, uttrycker intresse för och söker sexuella möten med andra enbart baserat på deras tillhörighet till en (vanligtvis marginaliserad) grupp som individen själv inte tillhör. Används ofta tillsammans med andra termer för att specificera typen av chaser."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000442"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-01-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003047","dc:identifier":"homoit0003047","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Wrestling"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Wrestling"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lucha (deporte)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Wrestling"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Luchar"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lucha"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A competitive, social, or erotic activity involving two or more people engaging in grappling with each other trying throw or force the other(s) to the ground."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Wettkampf-, Sozial- oder Erotikaktivität, bei der zwei oder mehr Personen miteinander