elijke impactspel-objecten op het lichaam."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Användning av piskor, floggers eller liknande reskap för smärtlek på kroppen under samtycke"}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003053"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000447"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001503"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003120"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001503","dc:identifier":"homoit0001503","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Whips"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Látigos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zwepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Piskor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sticks, cords, or straps, usually with stiff handles, that are used for striking individuals. Often used in BDSM circles to enhance sexual arousal."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palos, cuerdas o correas, generalmente con mangos rígidos, que se utilizan para golpear a personas. A menudo se utilizan en círculos de BDSM para mejorar la excitación sexual."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pinnar, rep eller remmar, vanligtvis med stela handtag, som används för att slå personer. Används ofta inom BDSM-sammanhang för att förstärka sexuell upphetsning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000447"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003048"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85146436"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/whips"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modi