@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000982","dc:identifier":"homoit0000982","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Men's friendships"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistades entre hombres"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannenvriendschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mäns vänskap"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Male friendships"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistades masculinas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistades de hombres"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Connections based on affection and trust between two or more men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Conexiones basadas en el afecto y la confianza entre dos o más hombres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Banden gebaseerd op genegenheid en vertrouwen tussen twee of meer mannen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Relationer som bygger på tillgivenhet och förtroende mellan två eller flera män."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000455"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000649"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000981"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93005650"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/mensFriendships"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001245","dc:identifier":"homoit0001245","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Romantic friendships"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistades románticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Romantische vriendschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romantisk vänskap"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Svärmisk vänskap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kärleksvänskap"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Very close but non-sexual relationships between friends, often involving a degree of physical closeness beyond that which is common in modern Western societies; this may include, for example, friends holding hands, cuddling, kissing, and/or sharing a bed."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Relaciones muy estrechas pero no sexuales entre amigos, que a menudo implican un grado de cercanía física más allá de lo que es común en las sociedades occidentales modernas; esto puede incluir, por ejemplo, amigos tomados de la mano, abrazándose, besándose y/o compartiendo cama."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"nauwe niet-seksuele relaties en soms ook fysiekerelaties tussen vrienden, vaak met een zekere matevan fysieke nabijheid die verder gaat dan wat gebruikelijk is in westerse samenlevingen, zoals handin hand lopen, knuffelen, kussen en een bed delen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mycket nära men icke-sexuella vänskapsrelationer som ofta innefattar fysisk närhet i högre grad än vad som är vanligt i västerländska samhällen, till exempel att hålla hand, kramas, pussas eller dela säng."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000455"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/romanticFriendships"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000456","dc:identifier":"homoit0000456","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Frottage"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Frottage"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Frottage"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Frottage"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frottage"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-penetrative sex act in which individuals rub parts of their body (usually the genitals) against another person's body. Not to be confused with \"frotteurism\" (nonconsensual frottage), though both are often abbreviated as \"frot.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acto sexual sin penetración en el que las personas frotan partes de su cuerpo (generalmente los genitales) contra el cuerpo de otra persona. No debe confundirse con el \"frotteurismo\" (frottage no consensual), aunque ambos términos suelen abreviarse como \"frot\"."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nicht-penetrativer Sexualakt, bei dem Personen Körperteile (in der Regel die Genitalien) am Körper einer anderen Person reiben. Nicht zu verwechseln mit „Frotteurismus“ (Frottage ohne Einwilligung), obwohl beide Begriffe oft mit „Frot“ abgekürzt werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Niet-penetrerende seks waarbij lichaamsdelen (meestal de geslachtsdelen) tegen elkaar worden gewreven. Niet te verwarren met \"frotteurisme\" (niet-consensuele frottage), beide kunnen worden afgekort als \"frot\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke-penetrativ sexuell handling där individer gnider delar av sin kropp (vanligtvis genitalierna) mot en annan persons kropp. Ska inte förväxlas med ”frotteurism” (icke-samtyckt frottage)."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001667"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh97004942"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/frottage"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001667","dc:identifier":"homoit0001667","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Scissoring"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tribadismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Scharen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Saxande"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Frotar"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Scissoring"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Golpearse las almejas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hacer la tijera"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Typically, a sexual activity in which two women rub their genitalia against one \r\nanother while intertwining their legs."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una actividad sexual en la que, normalmente, dos mujeres frotan sus genitales una contra la otra mientras entrelazan sus piernas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een seksuele activiteit waarbij twee vrouwen hun geslachtsdelen tegen elkaar wrijven terwijl ze hun benen verstrengelen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En sexuell praktik där två kvinnor gnider sina kön mot varandra medan de flätar samman sina ben."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000456"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/scissoring"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000458","dc:identifier":"homoit0000458","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fuck buddies"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Follamigos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fuck Buddies"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Neukmaatjes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Knullkompisar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Compañeros de sexo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Compañeras de sexo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fickfreunde"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"KK"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two friends who regularly have sex with one another but are not committed to a romantic relationship."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dos amigos que tienen relaciones sexuales regularmente pero que no están comprometidos en una relación romántica."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zwei Freunde, die regelmäßig Sex miteinander haben, aber keine romantische Beziehung eingehen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Två vänner som har regelbundet sex med varandra men inte har en romantisk relation."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000895"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001302"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000458"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/fuckBuddies"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000895","dc:identifier":"homoit0000895","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ lovers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amantes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-minnaars"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Älskande (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lovers (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ lovers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amantes LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amantes (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Älskarinnor (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Älskare (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people engaging in sexual or romantic relationships with other people; typically used to describe people who are not married."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que mantienen relaciones sexuales o románticas con otras personas; normalmente se utiliza para describir a personas que no están casadas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verwijst naar een persoon die een seksuele of romantische relatie met iemand heeft, vaak buiten het huwelijk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har romantiska eller sexuella relationer med andra personer. Används ofta för personer som inte är gifta."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000458"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001083"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001302"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001311"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQLovers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000588","dc:identifier":"homoit0000588","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Getting laid"},{"@language":"de","@value":"flachlegen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acostarse (con alguien)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seks hebben"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Få ligga"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Sex haben"},{"@language":"de","@value":"mit jemandem schlafen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Echar un polvo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Follar"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chingar"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chichar"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Coger"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Singar"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cachar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang term for the act of having sex, typically with another person."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Umgangssprachlicher Ausdruck für den Geschlechtsverkehr, in der Regel mit einer anderen Person."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga para referirse al acto de tener relaciones sexuales, normalmente con otra persona."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term voor seks, meestal in verwijzing naar seksuele handelingen met een andere persoon."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slangterm för att ha sex, vanligtvis med en annan person."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000459"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000662"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gettingLaid"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000662","dc:identifier":"homoit0000662","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual intercourse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Relaciones sexuales (actividad)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geslachtsgemeenschap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samlag"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Coito"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actividad sexual"},{"@language":"es","@value":"El acto sexual"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe sexual activity between two or more people, typically involving penetration. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la actividad sexual entre dos o más personas, que normalmente implica penetración."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om seksuele activiteit tussen twee of meer personen te beschrijven, meestal met penetratie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva sexuell aktivitet mellan två eller flera personer, vanligtvis med penetration."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000459"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000588"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001342"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85120739"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualIntercourse"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000488","dc:identifier":"homoit0000488","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay clubs (Nightlife)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Discotecas gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulendisco"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homodisco's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayklubbar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay nightclubs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay discos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Discos gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homosexuellendisco"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homonachtclubs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay-discon"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay-diskotek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay-nattklubbar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nightlife entertainment venues or clubs where people dance to recorded music; use in reference to venues that primarily cater to gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lugares o clubes de entretenimiento nocturno donde se baila con música grabada; utilícese en referencia a discotecas que principalmente atienden a hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nachtlokale oder Clubs, in denen zu Musik aus der Konserve getanzt wird; Verwendung in Bezug auf Diskotheken, die sich in erster Linie an schwule Männer richten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Uitgaansgelegenheden of clubs waar mensen dansen op opgenomen muziek; gebruiken met betrekking tot disco's die zich voornamelijk richten op homomannen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nattklubbar eller underhållningslokaler där man dansar till inspelad musik. Används för att beskriva diskotek som främst vänder sig till bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000909"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000474"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2005020372"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000909"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayDiscos"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002382","dc:identifier":"homoit0002382","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police raids on LGBTQ+ bathhouses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en casas de baño LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-invallen in LHBTQ+-badhuizen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisräder mot bastuklubbar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en saunas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en baños LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisrazzior mot bastuklubbar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of bathouses, saunas, or spas owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en baños, saunas, spas, etc. afiliados o relacionados con comunidades o identidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-invallen in LHBTQ+-gelieerde of -gerelateerde badhuizen, sauna's, spa's, etc."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Oannonserade och oväntade intrång i och genomsökningar av badhus, bastur eller spa som ägs av eller frekventeras av hbtq+-personer, genomförda av poliser i syfte att överraska för att beslagta bevis eller gripa misstänkta. Polisräder kan genomföras lagligt med stöd av husrannsakan eller genom påstådda brådskande omständigheter, till exempel sannolika skäl, vilket är subjektivt och ofta ger begränsade möjligheter för civila att överklaga olagliga räder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002381"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000475"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000544","dc:identifier":"homoit0000544","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Jugendliche"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homojongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay teens"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo teenagers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo tieners"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay people between the ages of childhood and adulthood."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay entre las edades de la niñez y la edad adulta."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Personen im Alter zwischen Kindheit und Erwachsensein."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo's in de leeftijd van kindertijd tot volwassenheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar mellan barndom och vuxen ålder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000479"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000481"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000496"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000557"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh88007920"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayYouth"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000496","dc:identifier":"homoit0000496","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Identität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité gaie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögidentitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité gay"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité homosexuelle"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayidentitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig identitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the sexual identity of men and mascs who are sexually and/or romantically attracted to other men and mascs. Do not use as a broader term for LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la identidad sexual de hombres y personas masc que se sienten atraídos sexual y/o románticamente a otros hombres y personas masc. No debe utilizarse como un término más amplio para las personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Begriff für die Beschreibung der sexuellen Identität von Männern und maskulinen Personen, die sich sexuell und/oder romantisch zu anderen Männern und maskulinen Personen hingezogen fühlen. Nicht als Oberbegriff für LGBTQ+-Personen zu verwenden."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité sexuelle des hommes et des personnes masculines qui sont attirés sexuellement ou romantiquement par d'autres hommes et personnes masculines. Ne pas l'utiliser comme terme plus large pour désigner les personnes LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om de seksuele identiteit te beschrijven van mannen en masculienen die zich seksueel en/of romantisch aangetrokken voelen tot andere mannen en masculienen. Gebruik dit niet als een bredere term voor LGBTQ+-mensen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva sexuell identitet hos män och maskulina personer som är sexuellt och/eller romantiskt attraherade av andra män och maskulina personer. Använd inte som en övergripande term för hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000479"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000544"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh99003153"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayIdentity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000482","dc:identifier":"homoit0000482","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay choruses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Coros gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Chöre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homokoren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögkörer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay choirs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga körer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups of gay men who sing together."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados de hombres gay que cantan juntos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Organisierte Gruppen von schwulen Männern, die zusammen singen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen homomannen die samen zingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper av bögar som sjunger tillsammans."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000833"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000730"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2010003068"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000833"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayChoruses"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000833","dc:identifier":"homoit0000833","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ choruses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Coros LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+合唱団"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のコーラス"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-zangkoren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-körer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ choirs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ choruses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Coros LGBTQ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ合唱団"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQのコーラス"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups of LGBTQ+ people who sing together."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados de personas LGBTQ+ que cantan juntas."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々が集まって一緒に歌う団体。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen LHBTQ+-personen die samen zingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper av hbtq+-personer som sjunger tillsammans."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000482"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000730"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000816"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000908"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000833"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQChoruses"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000524","dc:identifier":"homoit0000524","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay priests"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Priester"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sacerdotes gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögpräster"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Pfarrer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Pastoren"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clero gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaypräster"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga präster"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are ordained as priests in different denominations of the Christian Church."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die in verschiedenen Konfessionen der christlichen Kirche zu Priestern geweiht sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son ordenados sacerdotes en diferentes denominaciones de la Iglesia cristiana."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är präster i olika kristna samfund."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000484"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001624"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPriests"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510","dc:identifier":"homoit0000510","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay movement"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenbewegung"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homobeweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögrörelser"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay organisations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay organizations"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homosexuellenbewegung"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Organizaciones gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögorganisationer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organisationer för bögar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organisationer för homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term for activism focused on the rights of gay men and issues faced by gay communities."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Oberbegriff für Aktivismus, der sich auf die Rechte von Schwulen und die Probleme von schwulen Communities konzentriert."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general para el activismo centrado en los derechos de los hombres gay y los problemas que enfrentan las comunidades gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor activisme gericht op de rechten van homomannen en problemen waarmee homogemeenschappen worden geconfronteerd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samlingsterm för aktivism med fokus på bögars rättigheter och frågor som påverkar bögars gemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000549"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000486"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000490"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000500"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000528"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000545"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003935"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayMovement"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000535","dc:identifier":"homoit0000535","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay slang"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jerga gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwuler Slang"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homotaal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögslang"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay speak"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Habla gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Modismos gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Argot gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayslang"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig slang"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Colloquial or informal language related to gay men or used by gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lenguaje coloquial o informal relacionado con hombres gay o utilizado por hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Umgangssprachliche oder informelle Sprache, die sich auf schwule Männer bezieht oder von schwulen Männern verwendet wird."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Omgangstaal of informele taal met betrekking tot of gebruikt door homomannen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vardagligt eller informellt språkbruk relaterat till bögar eller som används av bögar."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001317"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002230"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaySlang"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001479","dc:identifier":"homoit0001479","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Twinks (Gay culture)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Twinks (Cultura gay)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Twinks (Homocultuur)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Twinkar (bögkultur)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Twinkies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Twinks"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Twinks"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Yogurín"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Twinks"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"U.S. slang term for young gay men who are typically small in stature, hairless, and considered effeminate."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga estadounidense para referirse a hombres gay jóvenes que suelen ser de baja estatura, lampiños y considerados afeminados."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Amerikaanse argot-term voor jonge homomannen die doorgaans klein van gestalte zijn, haarloos en als feminiem worden beschouwd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slangterm för unga bögar som ofta är finlemmade, hårlösa och uppfattas som feminina."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/twinks"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001654","dc:identifier":"homoit0001654","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gym subculture"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Subcultura del gimnasio"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fitnesssubkultur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gym subcultuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gymsubkultur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Subcultura de gimnasio"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Subcultura gym"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gym-Subkultur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gym subculture"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay subculture popularized in the 1970s via homoerotic bodybuilder magazines. Often includes aesthetics modeled after ancient Greek gymnasiums. Especially popular in San Francisco, West Hollywood, and New York City."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Subcultura gay que se popularizó en la década de 1970 a través de revistas fisicoculturistas homoeróticas. A menudo, incluye una estética inspirada en los antiguos gimnasios griegos. Particularmente popular en San Francisco, West Hollywood y la ciudad de Nueva York."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine schwule Subkultur, die in den 1970er-Jahren durch homoerotische Bodybuilder-Magazine populär wurde. Oftmals umfasst sie eine Ästhetik, die sich an antiken griechischen Sportstätten orientiert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-subcultuur populair in de jaren 70 via homo-erotische bodybuildertijdschriften. Bevat vaak esthetiek gemodelleerd naar oude Griekse gymzalen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En subkultur bland bögar som populariserades på 1970-talet genom homoerotiska bodybuilder-magasin. Innefattar ofta estetik inspirerad av antikens grekiska gymnasium. Särskilt populär i San Francisco, West Hollywood och New York."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002148"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002149"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003051"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003072"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gymSubculture"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002230","dc:identifier":"homoit0002230","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fairies (Gay culture)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fairies (schwuler Kontext)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fairies (cultura gay)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fairies (Homocultuur)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fairies (bögkultur)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fairy (Gay culture)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hadas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pejorative term used chiefly in North America to describe gay men (or men assumed to be gay) and insult their perceived femininity. Some gay men have reclaimed this term and use it to describe themselves. Not to be confused with Faeries, the queer spiritual group."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Abwertender Begriff, der vor allem in Nordamerika verwendet wird, um schwule Männer (oder Männer, die als schwul angesehen werden) zu beschreiben und ihre vermeintliche Weiblichkeit zu beleidigen. Einige schwule Männer haben diesen Begriff wieder für sich beansprucht und verwenden ihn, um sich selbst zu beschreiben. Nicht zu verwechseln mit Faeries, der queeren spirituellen Gruppe."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término peyorativo utilizado principalmente en Norteamérica para describir a los hombres gay (o a los hombres que se asume que son gay) e insultar su feminidad percibida. Algunos hombres gay han recuperado este término y lo utilizan para describirse a sí mismos. No debe confundirse con \"Faeries\", el grupo espiritual queer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kleinerende en beledigende term die voornamelijk in Noord-Amerika wordt gebruikt om homomannen te beschrijven (of mannen waarvan wordt aangenomen dat ze homo zijn) en hun vermeende vrouwelijkheid. Sommige homomannen hebben deze term teruggewonnen en gebruiken het om zichzelf te beschrijven. Niet te verwarren met Faeries, de queer spirituele groep"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nedsättande term som främst används i Nordamerika för att förlöjliga bögar (eller män som antas vara homosexuella) och deras upplevda femininitet. Vissa bögar har återtagit termen och använder den för att beskriva sig själva. Ska inte förväxlas med Faeries, den queera andliga rörelsen."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001559"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001560"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000535"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001725","dc:identifier":"homoit0001725","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay authors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Autores gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Autoren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-auteurs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögförfattare"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga författare"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay creators of written works."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Creadores de obras escritas conocidos por ser gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Verfasser schriftlicher Werke."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomakers van geschreven werken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella skapare av skrivna verk."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001723"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000489"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000502"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000517"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001604"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001731"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002170"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003868"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2003005955"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-11-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000490","dc:identifier":"homoit0000490","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Gay information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Informationszentren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för bögar"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Gay information centres"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Infozentren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bög-informationscentrum"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions providing education, support, and information about gay men and gay communities to gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan educación, apoyo e información sobre hombres gay y comunidades gay a hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Einrichtungen, die schwulen Männern Bildung, Unterstützung und Informationen über schwule Männer und schwule Gemeinschaften bieten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die educatie, ondersteuning en informatie verstrekken over homomannen en homogemeenschappen aan homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som erbjuder utbildning, stöd och information om manlig homosexualitet och böggemenskaper till bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayInformationCentres"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004300","dc:identifier":"homoit0004300","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay historical fiction"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homohistorische literatuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historiska skildringar om bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historiska skildringar om homosexuella män"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historiska romaner om bögar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historiska romaner om homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts events set during particular real historical events. Use for historical fiction focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven fictieve werken waarin het verhaal zich afspeelt tegen de achtergrond van specifieke, waargebeurde historische gebeurtenissen; gebruik in verwijzing naar historische fictie met homopersonages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk som utspelar sig i historisk tid, med verkliga händelser och miljöer. Används för historiska skildringar med fokus på bögkaraktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004295"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001582","dc:identifier":"homoit0001582","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay horror fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción de horror gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Horror-Fiction"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-horrorverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay skräcklitteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skräcklitteratur med bögkaraktärer och/eller tema"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skräcklitteratur med homosexuella manliga karaktärer och/eller tema"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that intend to frighten, scare, or disgust. Use for horror fiction focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras de ficción escritas con la intención de asustar, atemorizar o provocar disgusto; utilícese en referencia a la ficción de horror centrada en personajes o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fiktionale Werke, die erschrecken, ängstigen oder abstoßen sollen; Verwendung in Bezug auf fiktionale Werke, die sich auf schwule Charaktere oder Themen konzentrieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven fictie bedoeld om angst aan te jagen, bang te maken of te walgen; gebruik in verwijzing naar horrorfictie gericht op homopersonages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk skrivna för att skrämma, oroa eller äckla. Används för skräcklitteratur med homosexuella manliga karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001580"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayHorrorFiction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001566","dc:identifier":"homoit0001566","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay fantasy fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción fantástica gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Fantasyliteratur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homofantasy"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bög-fantasy"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig fantasy"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts magical, fantastical, and/or supernatural elements. Use for fantasy fiction focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras escritas que incluyen elementos mágicos o fantásticos; utilícese en referencia a la ficción fantástica que se centra en personajes o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Genre, das Magie und andere übernatürliche Phänomene als primäres Element der Handlung, des Themas und/oder des Schauplatzes verwendet; Verwendung für Fantasyliteratur, die sich auf schwule Figuren oder Themen konzentriert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven werken met magische of fantastische elementen; gebruik in verwijzing naar fantasy gericht op homopersonages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genre som använder magi och andra övernaturliga fenomen som centrala inslag i handling, tema och/eller miljö. Används för fantasy med homosexuella manliga karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000865"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayFantasyFiction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001571","dc:identifier":"homoit0001571","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay science fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ciencia ficción gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Science-Fiction"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bög-science fiction"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bög-sci fi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bög-sf"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts imaginative or futuristic concepts incorporating science, technology, space, time travel, and other speculative elements. Use for science fiction focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre conceptos imaginativos o futuristas que incorporan la ciencia, la tecnología, el espacio, los viajes en el tiempo y otros elementos especulativos; utilícese en referencia a la ciencia ficción centrada en personajes o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Werk über phantasievolle oder futuristische Konzepte, die Wissenschaft, Technologie, Raumfahrt, Zeitreisen und andere spekulative Elemente beinhalten; Verwendung in Bezug auf Science Fiction mit einem Schwerpunkt auf schwulen Charakteren oder Themen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literair werk over fantasierijke of futuristische concepten waarin wetenschap, technologie, ruimte, tijdreizen en andere speculatieve elementen zijn verwerkt; gebruik in verwijzing naar science fiction gericht op homopersonages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk om fantasifulla eller futuristiska idéer som rör vetenskap, teknologi, rymden, tidsresor och andra spekulativa element; används för science fiction med bögar som karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000934"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayScienceFiction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001593","dc:identifier":"homoit0001593","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay romance fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción romántica gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Liebesromane"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoliefdesverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögkärleksromaner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaykärleksromaner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga kärleksromaner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts romantic and/or sexual relationships between the main characters. Use for romance fiction focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas centradas en las relaciones románticas y el amor entre personas; utilícese en referencia a la ficción romántica centrada en personajes o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Werke der Belletristik, die sich um romantische und/oder sexuelle Beziehungen zwischen den Hauptfiguren drehen; Verwendung in Bezug auf Liebesromane, die sich auf schwule Figuren konzentrieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literair werk gericht op romantische relaties en liefde tussen mensen; gebruik in verwijzing naar romantische fictie gericht op homopersonages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk som kretsar kring romantiska och/eller sexuella relationer mellan huvudkaraktärerna. Används för kärleksromaner med homosexuella manliga karaktärer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001586"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayRomanceFiction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001576","dc:identifier":"homoit0001576","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay mystery and detective fiction"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Krimis und Detektivgeschichten"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción gay de misterio y de detectives"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-detectiveverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögdeckare"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Krimis und Detektivromane"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga deckare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts the investigation of crime or the work of detectives. Use for mystery and detective fiction focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Literarische Werke über die Aufklärung von Verbrechen oder die Arbeit von Detektiven; Verwendung in Bezug auf Krimis und Detektivromane, die sich auf schwule Charaktere oder Themen konzentrieren."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre la investigación de crímenes o el trabajo de detectives; utilícese en referencia a la ficción de misterio y de detectives centrada en personajes y temas gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken over misdaadonderzoek of het werk van rechercheurs; gebruik in verwijzing naar mysterie en detective fictie gericht op homopersonages en thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk om brottsutredningar eller detektivarbete. Används för deckare och mysterielitteratur med homosexuella manliga karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000852"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayMysteryAndDetectiveFiction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002170","dc:identifier":"homoit0002170","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men in fandom"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer im Fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres en fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar inom fandom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule im Fantum"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule im Fandom"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer im Fantum"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män inom fandom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The participation and inclusion of gay men in fan communities."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Teilnahme und Einbeziehung schwuler Männer in Fan-Communitys."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La participación e inclusión de los hombres en las comunidades de fans."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De participatie en inclusie van homomannen in fan-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögars deltagande och inkludering i fangemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002181"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002182"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001725"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002149"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002217","dc:identifier":"homoit0002217","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"ja","@value":"Yaoi"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Yaoi"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Yaoi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Yaoi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Japanese word used by English-speaking anime and manga fans to describe explicit or pornographic works featuring male-male couples that are typically created by heterosexual female authors for heterosexual female readers. Note that the Japanese meaning and usage of \"yaoi\" and related terms differ considerably."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palabra japonesa utilizada por los fanáticos del anime y el manga de habla inglesa para describir obras explícitas o pornográficas que presentan parejas de hombres y que generalmente son creadas por autoras heterosexuales para lectoras heterosexuales. Tenga en cuenta que el significado y el uso japonés de \"yaoi\" y términos relacionados difieren considerablemente."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"アニメ・マンガファンが、主に異性愛者の女性作家によって異性愛者の女性読者を対象に制作された、男性同士のカップルを題材とした露骨な描写やポルノ的な作品を表すために用いる日本語の用語。作品の物語のクライマックス（ヤマ山）、結末（オチ落ち）、意味（イミ）が無いことを表現する。なお、「ヤオイ」や関連用語の日本語における意味や用法は、Homosaurusの定義とはかなり異なる点に留意が必要である。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Japans woord dat door Engelssprekende anime- en mangafans wordt gebruikt om expliciete of pornografische werken met man-man-koppels te beschrijven, doorgaans door heteroseksuele vrouwelijke auteurs gemaakt voor heteroseksuele vrouwelijke lezers. De Japanse betekenis en het gebruik van \"yaoi\" en verwante termen verschillen aanzienlijk!"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Japanskt ord som används av engelsktalande anime- och mangafans för att beskriva explicita eller pornografiska verk med man/man-par som vanligtvis skapas av heterosexuella kvinnliga författare för en heterosexuell kvinnlig läsekrets. Observera att den japanska betydelsen och användningen av ”yaoi” och relaterade termer skiljer sig avsevärt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002218"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002197"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002214"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000493"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001598"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002172"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002188"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002204"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000494","dc:identifier":"homoit0000494","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay for pay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Gay por paga"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay-for-Pay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo tegen betaling"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay for pay"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex workers who identify as heterosexual but are paid to perform as if they are gay or lesbian."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actores o actrices, estrellas pornográficas o trabajadores sexuales que se autoidentifican como heterosexuales pero a quienes se les paga por actuar como si fueran gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Sexarbeiter:innen, die sich als heterosexuell identifizieren, aber dafür bezahlt werden, sich so zu verhalten, als wären sie lesbisch oder schwul."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerkers, waaronder pornosterren, die zich identificeren als heteroseksueel, maar betaald worden om zich voor te doen alsof ze homoseksueel zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Manliga eller kvinnliga skådespelare, porrskådespelare eller sexarbetare som identifierar sig som heterosexuella men som får betalt för att agera eller uppträda som homosexuella."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001276"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001127"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayForPay"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001127","dc:identifier":"homoit0001127","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Porn stars"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estrellas porno"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pornosterren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Porrstjärnor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pornographic actors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pornstars"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Porn actresses"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Adult entertainers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Porn actors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pornographic stars"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pornographic actresses"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Adult actors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actores pornográficos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actores porno"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actrices porno"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actrices pornográficas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estrellas del porno"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actorxs porno"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Porno-actrices"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pornografiska skådespelare"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Porrskådisar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Porrskådespelare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Actors in erotic or sexually explicit films."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actores y actrices en películas eróticas o sexualmente explícitas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Acteurs in erotische of seksueel expliciete films."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skådespelare i erotiska eller sexuellt explicita filmer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003798"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000494"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001128"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/pornStars"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000497","dc:identifier":"homoit0000497","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Jewish gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay judíos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Joodse homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Judiska bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Jews"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Jewish gay people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Jewish gays"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Judíos gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas judías gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Judiska homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are Jewish."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son judíos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die joods zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är judar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000682"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2003011466"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayJews"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000499","dc:identifier":"homoit0000499","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian-gay relations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Relaciones lésbicas-gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verhoudingen tussen lesbische vrouwen en homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Relationer mellan lesbiska och bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay-lesbian relations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Relaciones gay-lésbicas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Connections between individuals and communities of lesbians and gay men, including historic and ongoing solidarity, advocacy, and activism."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Conexiones entre personas y comunidades de lesbianas y hombres gay, incluida la solidaridad, la incidencia política y el activismo histórico y continuo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Connecties tussen individuen en gemeenschappen van lesbische vrouwen en homomannen, met inbegrip van historische en voortdurende solidariteit, belangenbehartiging en activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Relationer och samarbete mellan lesbiska och bögar, inklusive historisk och pågående solidaritet, aktivism och opinionsbildning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000575"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95007084"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbian-gayRelations"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000575","dc:identifier":"homoit0000575","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender relations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Relaciones de género"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechterverhältnisse"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderrelaties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsförhållanden"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechterbeziehungen"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The culturally specific rights, responsibilities, and connections afforded to individuals or communities of one gender by individuals or communities of another gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Los derechos, responsabilidades y las conexiones culturalmente específicas otorgados a personas o comunidades de un género por personas o comunidades de otro género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die kulturspezifischen Rechte, Pflichten und Beziehungen, die Einzelpersonen oder Gemeinschaften eines Geschlechts von Einzelpersonen oder Gemeinschaften des anderen Geschlechts zugeschrieben werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De cultureel specifieke rechten, verantwoordelijkheden en connecties die aan personen of gemeenschappen van het een gender worden toegekend door personen of gemeenschappen van een ander gender."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rättigheter, ansvar och relationer som, inom en viss kultur, ges till personer eller grupper med ett kön av personer eller grupper med ett annat kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000499"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000578"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000778"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002589"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderRelations"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000500","dc:identifier":"homoit0000500","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay liberation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Liberación gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulen- und Lesbenbewegung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homobevrijding"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell frigörelse"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay liberation movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento de liberación gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenbefreiung"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homosexuellenbewegung"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Movement of the late 1960s and early to mid 1970s that urged lesbians and gay men to “come out\" and publicly reveal their sexuality to family, friends, and colleagues as a form of activism and as a means of countering shame with pride."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento de finales de la década de 1960 y principios y mediados de la década de 1970 que instaba a lesbianas y hombres gay a “salir del clóset” y revelar públicamente su sexualidad a familiares, amistades y colegas como una forma de activismo y como un medio para contrarrestar la vergüenza con orgullo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bewegung der späten 1960er- und frühen bis mittleren 1970er-Jahre, die Lesben und Schwule dazu aufforderte, sich zu „outen“ und ihre Sexualität gegenüber Familie, Freunden und Kollegen öffentlich zu bekennen, als eine Form des Aktivismus und als Mittel, Scham mit Stolz zu bekämpfen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"beweging van 1968-1975 die homomannen en lesbische vrouwen aanmoedigde om uit de kast te komen, openlijk hun seksuele voorkeur kenbaar te maken aan familie, vrienden en collega's als een vorm van activisme, en homotrots uit te dragen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En rörelse från slutet av 1960-talet till mitten av 1970-talet som uppmanade lesbiska och bögar att ”komma ut” och offentligt visa sin sexualitet för familj, vänner och kollegor som en form av aktivism och som ett sätt att ersätta skam med stolthet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000748"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000857"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001341"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004427"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayLiberation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000748","dc:identifier":"homoit0000748","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian liberation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Liberación lesbiana"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische bevrijding"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk frigörelse"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Liberación lésbica"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Liberation movement that began in the 1970s to direct more attention to lesbian and feminist issues within the larger gay liberation movement and in national discourse."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento de liberación que comenzó en la década de 1970 para dirigir más atención hacia las cuestiones lésbicas y feministas dentro del movimiento de liberación gay más amplio y en el discurso nacional."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bevrijdingsbeweging die in de jaren zeventig begon om meer aandacht te krijgen voor lesbische en feministische kwesties binnen de grotere homobevrijdingsbeweging en in het nationale discours."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En befrielserörelse som uppstod på 1970-talet för att rikta mer uppmärksamhet mot lesbiska och feministiska frågor inom den bredare gayrörelsen och i offentlig debatt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000500"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianLiberation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000857","dc:identifier":"homoit0000857","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ emancipation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Emancipación LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の解放"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-emancipatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-frigörelse"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ emancipation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Emancipación LGBTQ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQの解放"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frigörelse (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe efforts to obtain LGBTQ+ political rights or equality."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir los esfuerzos para obtener igualdad o derechos políticos LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の政治的権利や平等を獲得するための取り組みを指す用語。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om inspanningen te beschrijven om LHBTQ+-rechten of -gelijkheid te verkrijgen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva insatser för att uppnå hbtq+-personers politiska rättigheter eller jämlikhet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000500"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQEmancipation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001341","dc:identifier":"homoit0001341","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Stonewall riots"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Revueltas de Stonewall"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Stonewall-rellen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stonewallupproret"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Stonewall uprising"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disturbios de Stonewall"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stonewallkravallerna"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stonewallupploppen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The series of spontaneous demonstrations and protests against the police raid that took place on June 28, 1969 at the Stonewall Inn in the Greenwich Village neighborhood of New York City."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La serie de manifestaciones y protestas espontáneas contra la redada policial que tuvo lugar el 28 de junio de 1969 en el Stonewall Inn en el barrio de Greenwich Village de la ciudad de Nueva York."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"serie van spontane, gewelddadige demonstraties tegen een politie-inval op 28 juni 1969 in de stonewall inn in greenwich village in new york city"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En serie spontana demonstrationer och protester mot polisens razzia den 28 juni 1969 på Stonewall Inn i Greenwich Village i New York."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000932"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000500"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh92005716"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000932"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/stonewallRiots"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004427","dc:identifier":"homoit0004427","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Homophile movement"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homofiele beweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homofilrörelsen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A collective term used to describe the philosophy and activities of many North American and European gay and lesbian publications and organizations of the 1950s and 1960s. The term \"homophile,\" which was coined in 1924, emphasized the romantic rather than sexual aspect of same-gender relationships. The earliest organization in the Homophile Movement was the COC Netherlands, founded in 1946. Other examples include the RFSL (Sweden), Campaign for Homosexual Equality (UK), the Mattachine Society (US), ONE (US), and the Daughters of Bilitis (US)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een verzamelterm die gebruikt wordt om de filosofie en activiteiten te beschrijven van veel Noord-Amerikaanse en Europese homo- en lesbische publicaties en organisaties uit de jaren 50 en 60. De term \"homofiel\", die in 1924 werd bedacht, benadrukte het romantische in plaats van het seksuele aspect van relaties tussen mensen van hetzelfde geslacht. Vroege organisaties binnen de homofiele beweging waren het COC in Nederland, opgericht in 1946, RFSL (Zweden), Campaign for Homosexual Equality (VK), Mattachine Society (VS), ONE (VS) en Daughters of Bilitis (VS)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En samlingsterm som används för att beskriva filosofin och aktiviteterna hos många nordamerikanska och europeiska publikationer och organisationer för homosexuella och lesbiska på 1950- och 1960-talet. Termen ”homofil”, som myntades 1924, betonade den romantiska snarare än den sexuella aspekten av samkönade relationer. Den tidigaste organisationen inom homofilrörelsen var COC Nederländerna, grundad 1946. Andra exempel inkluderar RFSL (Sverige), Campaign for Homosexual Equality (Storbritannien), Mattachine Society (USA), ONE (USA) och Daughters of Bilitis (USA)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001026"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000645"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000766"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000500"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000501","dc:identifier":"homoit0000501","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay libraries"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bibliotecas gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Bibliotheken"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homobibliotheken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögbibliotek"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Bibliotheken für Schwule"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bibliotheken für schwule Männer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenbibliotheken"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Libraries that hold materials primarily pertaining to gay men or intended for use by gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bibliotecas que contienen materiales principalmente relacionados con hombres gay o destinados a ser utilizados por hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bibliotheken, die in erster Linie Materialien zu schwulen Männern und Themen oder für die Nutzung durch schwule Männer bereithalten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bibliotheken met materiaal dat voornamelijk betrekking heeft op homomannen of bedoeld is voor gebruik door homomannen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bibliotek som samlar material som främst rör bögar eller är avsett att användas av bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000968"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh89000080"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001755"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayLibraries"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000502","dc:identifier":"homoit0000502","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay literature"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Literatur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoliteratuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Böglitteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenliteratur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaylitteratur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig litteratur"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Written literary works about gay men, gay characters, or gay themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre hombres gay, personajes gay o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Literarische Werke über schwule Männer, schwule Charaktere oder schwule Themen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken over homopersonages of thema's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skrivna litterära verk om bögar, manliga homosexuella karaktärer eller homosexuella manliga teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000972"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001725"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004020"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayLiterature"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004020","dc:identifier":"homoit0004020","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men in literature"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen in de literatuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar i litteraturen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The depiction of gay men in literature."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het weergeven van homomannen in de literatuur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skildringen av lesbiska i litteraturen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004018"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000502"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95004286"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000504","dc:identifier":"homoit0000504","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Same-sex marriage"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Matrimonio entre personas del mismo sexo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homohuwelijk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samkönade äktenskap"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay marriage"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian marriage"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Matrimonio gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Matrimonio lesbiana"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casamiento entre personas del mismo sexo"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Legal union between two people of the same sex who are in a partnership. In the United States, same-sex marriage differs from civil unions in that the former is recognized at the federal level, whereas the latter is only recognized at the state level and may not be recognized by other states."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Unión jurídica entre dos personas del mismo sexo que forman una pareja. En los Estados Unidos, el matrimonio entre personas del mismo sexo se diferencia de las uniones civiles en que el primero se reconoce a nivel federal, mientras que el segundo sólo se reconoce a nivel estatal y puede no ser reconocido por otros estados."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wettelijk huwelijk tussen twee personen van hetzelfde geslacht die een relatie hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Juridiskt erkänd förening mellan två personer av samma kön som lever i partnerskap. I Sverige är samkönade och olikakönade äktenskap likvärdiga juridiskt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000990"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000844"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001514"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh92003901"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/same-sexMarriage"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000844","dc:identifier":"homoit0000844","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ conscientious objection"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Objeción de conciencia LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の良心的拒否"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-gewetensbezwaren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samvetsvägran (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ conscientious objection"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Objeción de conciencia LGBTQ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQの良心的拒否"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samvetsfrihet (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people exercising their right to refuse to perform military service or participate in same-sex marriages on the grounds of freedom of thought, conscience, and/or religion."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que ejercen su derecho a negarse a realizar el servicio militar o participar de matrimonios entre personas del mismo sexo por motivos de libertad de pensamiento, conciencia y/o religión."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々が、思想、良心、宗教の自由を理由として、兵役の拒否や同性婚への参加を拒否する権利を行使すること。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gebruik om LGBTQ+-mensen te beschrijven die hun recht uitoefenen om militaire dienst te weigeren of deel te nemen aan het homohuwelijk op grond van vrijheid van gedachte, geweten en/of godsdienst"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som utövar sin rätt att vägra militärtjänst eller att delta i samkönade äktenskap utifrån tankefrihet, samvetsfrihet och/eller religionsfrihet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000504"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQConscientiousObjection"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001514","dc:identifier":"homoit0001514","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women's marriages"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casamientos entre mujeres"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gynaegamie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwenhuwelijken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Women's marriages"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Matrimonios entre mujeres"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Same-gender marriage tradition between two women in Africa conducted according to African culture and traditions."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tradición matrimonial entre personas del mismo sexo entre dos mujeres en África realizada de acuerdo con la cultura y las tradiciones africanas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Tradition der gleichgeschlechtlichen Ehe zwischen zwei Frauen in Afrika, die gemäß der afrikanischen Kultur und Traditionen durchgeführt wird."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"huwelijk tussen twee vrouwen in afrika, volgens de afrikaanse cultuur en traditie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tradition för samkönade äktenskap mellan två kvinnor i Afrika, genomförd enligt afrikanska kulturella och traditionella sedvänjor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000990"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000504"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/womensMarriages"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000505","dc:identifier":"homoit0000505","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay dominants"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwuler Dom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dominantes gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homodominanten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dominanta bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Homosexueller Dom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amos gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dominanta homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are part of the BDSM scene and assume the dominant role in sexual relationships with a dominant/submissive dynamic."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Teil der BDSM-Szene sind und die dominante Rolle in sexuellen Beziehungen mit einer Master/Sklaven-Dynamik übernehmen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que forman parte de la escena BDSM y asumen el rol dominante en las relaciones sexuales con una dinámica dominante/sumisa."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die deel uitmaken van de BDSM-scene en de hoofdrol spelen in seksuele relaties met een meester/slaaf-dynamiek."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som intar en dominant roll inom BDSM och/eller i maktutbytesrelationer med en dominant/underordnad dynamik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000999"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004603"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayMasters"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004603","dc:identifier":"homoit0004603","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay submissives"},"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay subs"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are part of the BDSM scene and assume the submissive role in sexual relationships with a dominant/submissive dynamic."},"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001318"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000505"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003037","dc:identifier":"homoit0003037","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay college students"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Hochschulstudierende"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudiantes universitarios gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homostudenten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är collegestudenter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Homosexuelle Hochschulstudierende"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Universitarios gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män som är collegestudenter"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are attending college."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die eine Hochschule besuchen. Achtung: Das US-amerikanische College entspricht nicht exakt der Hochschule im deutschen Sprachraum, wird aber häufig als Hochschule übersetzt."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que asisten a la universidad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die naar de universiteit gaan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som studerar vid college."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003041"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003032"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh91002947"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-05"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000509","dc:identifier":"homoit0000509","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Parents of gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres y padres de hombres gay"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Parents d'hommes gais"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ouders van homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Föräldrar till bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men's parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres de hombres gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de hombres gay"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who act as parents to one or more gay man. For parents who are themselves gay, use the term \"Gay parents.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que actúan como padres de uno o más hombres gay. Para padres que son gay, utilice el término \"madres y padres gay\"."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui assument le rôle de parent auprès d'un homme gai."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som fungerar som föräldrar till en eller flera bögar. För föräldrar som själva är bögar, använd termen ”Bögföräldrar”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002224"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90005864"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/parentsOfGayMen"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001104","dc:identifier":"homoit0001104","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Persecution of gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Persecución de hombres gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vervolging van homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förföljelse av bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förföljelse av homosexuella män"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Systematic mistreatment of gay men on the basis of their sexual identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maltrato sistemático a hombres gay por su identidad sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Systematische mishandeling van homomannen op basis van hun seksuele identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Systematisk förföljelse av bögar på grund av deras sexuella identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/persecutionOfGayMen"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001258","dc:identifier":"homoit0001258","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sea queens"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sea queens"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sea queens"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sjöfolk (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Reinas del mar"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used before the 1960s to describe gay men who worked aboard ships, mainly merchant vessels."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado antes de la década de 1960 para describir a los hombres gay que trabajaban a bordo de barcos, principalmente buques mercantes."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som arbetar till sjöss."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000506"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/seaQueens"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000507","dc:identifier":"homoit0000507","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men in the military"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Armeeangehörige"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay en el ejército"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-militair personeel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar inom militären"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Militärangehörige"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay en las fuerzas armadas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män inom militären"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men serving in state and national armed forces."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homosexuelle Männer, die in den Streitkräften dienen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que sirven en las fuerzas armadas estatales y nacionales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die dienen in staats- en nationale strijdkrachten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som tjänstgör inom nationella försvarsstyrkor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001100"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006000714"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000712"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayMenInTheMilitary"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000508","dc:identifier":"homoit0000508","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Gay men of color"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer of Color"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay de color"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen van kleur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke-vita bögar"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Gay men of colour"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"POC-bögar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är people of color"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke-vita homosexuella män"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män som är people of color"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Primarily used in the United States, this term refers to gay men who are not white and who identify as people of color."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Dieser Begriff wird vor allem in den USA verwendet und bezieht sich auf schwule Männer, die nicht weiß sind und sich als People of Color identifizieren."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que no son blancos y que se autoidentifican como personas de color."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die niet wit zijn en die zich identificeren als personen van kleur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som inte är vita och som identifierar sig som icke-vita/people of color."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001101"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayMenOfColour"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000549","dc:identifier":"homoit0000549","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay trade union groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos sindicales gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Gewerkschaftsgruppen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homovakbondsgroepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fackföreningsgrupper för bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Berufsverbände"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Gewerkschaften"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fackliga grupper för bögar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fackföreningsgrupper för homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups of gay workers who are united to make decisions relating to the conditions affecting their labor."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados de trabajadores gay que se unen para tomar decisiones relacionadas con las condiciones que afectan su trabajo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Organisierte Gruppen schwuler Arbeitnehmer, die sich zusammengeschlossen haben, um Entscheidungen zu treffen, die ihre Arbeitsbedingungen betreffen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen homoseksuele werknemers die verenigd zijn om beslissingen te beïnvloeden met betrekking tot hun werkomstandigheden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper av homosexuella manliga arbetstagare som tillsammans fattar beslut om villkor som påverkar deras arbete."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000791"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh99004034"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayTradeUnionGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000521","dc:identifier":"homoit0000521","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay press"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Presse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homopers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögpress"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Medien"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diarios gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig press"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at gay audiences and/or operated by gay men."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zeitungen, Zeitschriften oder andere Publikationsorgane, die sich an ein schwules Publikum richten und/oder von schwulen Medien betrieben werden."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos, revistas u otros medios editoriales dirigidos a audiencias gay y/o operados por hombres gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kranten, tijdschriften of andere publicaties die gericht zijn op homomannen en/of worden gerund door homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar, tidskrifter eller andra publikationer riktade till bögar och/eller drivna av bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000514"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000515"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003156"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004427"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004622"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh94008923"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPress"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000528","dc:identifier":"homoit0000528","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay radio"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Radio gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Radio"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoradio"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögradio"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig radio"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Auditory content broadcast on the radio (analog or digital) about gay men and gay issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Contenido auditivo emitido por radio (analógica o digital) sobre hombres gay y asuntos gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Im Radio ausgestrahlte hörbare Inhalte (analog oder digital) über schwule Männer und schwule Themen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Auditieve inhoud uitgezonden op de radio (analoog of digitaal) over homomannen en homokwesties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ljudinnehåll som sänds i radio, analog eller digital, och som handlar om bögar eller frågor som rör bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001231"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004319"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001231"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayRadio"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000545","dc:identifier":"homoit0000545","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay television"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Televisión gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Fernsehen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homotelevisie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bög-tv"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay-TV"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Television shows featuring gay men or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Programas de televisión que presentan temas u hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fernsehsendungen, in denen schwule Charaktere oder Themen vorkommen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Televisieprogramma's met homomannen of homo-thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tv-program med bögar eller teman som rör bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001359"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh92006178"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001359"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayTelevision"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003935","dc:identifier":"homoit0003935","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay demonstrations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögdemonstrationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay protests"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-protestmarsen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demonstrationer för homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against gay men and advocate for gay visibility, rights, and issues."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Protestmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten, georganiseerd om te protesteren tegen discriminatie van homomannen en om op te komen voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. van homomannen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher, demonstrationer och andra stora, offentliga sammankomster organiserade för att protestera mot diskriminering av bögar och förespråka bögar synlighet, bögar rättigheter och frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000510"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-17"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000511","dc:identifier":"homoit0000511","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay museums"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Museen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Museos gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomusea"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögmuseum"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenmuseen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaymuseum"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions dedicated to the storage, exhibition, conservation, and preservation of materials relating to gay men or gay history."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Institutionen, die sich der Aufbewahrung, Ausstellung, Konservierung und Erhaltung von Materialien widmen, die sich auf schwule Männer oder die schwule Geschichte beziehen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones dedicadas al almacenamiento, la exhibición, la conservación y la preservación de materiales relacionados con hombres gay o la historia gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die zich toeleggen op de opslag, tentoonstelling, conservering en bewaring van materialen met betrekking tot homomannen en homogeschiedenis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som ägnar sig åt insamling, utställning, bevarande och konservering av material som rör manlig homosexualitet, bögar eller bögars historia."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001030"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001755"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayMuseums"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000512","dc:identifier":"homoit0000512","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Muslims"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Muslime"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Musulmanes gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomoslims"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Muslimska bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Muslimische Schwule"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögmuslimer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaymuslimer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Muslimska homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are Muslim."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die muslimischen Glaubens sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son musulmanes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die moslim zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är muslimer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001032"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2009009639"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayMuslims"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000513","dc:identifier":"homoit0000513","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Native American gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay nativoamericanos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Indiaans-Amerikaanse homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är ursprungsamerikaner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"American Indian gay men"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay American Indians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Native Americans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres nativoamericanos gay"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are part of the Native peoples of the continental United States and Canada (excluding Inuit people) and self-identity as gay men. Use more specific terms when available."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son nativoamericanos o parte de los pueblos indígenas de Norteamérica; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como nativoamericanas y hombres gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die Native American zijn, of deel uitmaken van de inheemse volkeren van Noord-Amerika; alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Native American en homoman."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som tillhör ursprungsfolken i det kontinentala USA och Kanada (exklusive inuiter) och som identifierar sig som bögar. Använd mer specifika termer där det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001037"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayNativeAmericans"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000514","dc:identifier":"homoit0000514","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay newsletters"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Newsletter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Boletines gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-nieuwsbrieven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bög-nyhetsbrev"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaynyhetsbrev"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nyhetsbrev för homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Serialized print or digital periodicals created by or for gay men, often with the purpose of sharing news and information related to gay communities and issues."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Serienweise erscheinende Print- oder Digitalzeitschriften, die von oder für schwule Männer erstellt werden, mit dem Ziel, Nachrichten und Informationen über schwule Gemeinschaften und Themen auszutauschen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones periódicas impresas o digitales serializadas creadas por o para hombres gay, a menudo con el propósito de compartir noticias e información relacionadas con comunidades y temas gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Periodieke gedrukte of digitale tijdschriften gemaakt door of voor homomannen, vaak met als doel het delen van nieuws en informatie met betrekking tot homogemeenschappen en homo-kwesties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Seriella tryckta eller digitala tidskrifter skapade av eller för bögar, ofta med syftet att dela nyheter och information relaterad till böggemenskaper och frågor."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001041"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000515"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayNewsletters"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000515","dc:identifier":"homoit0000515","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay newspapers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Zeitungen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homobladen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögtidningar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenzeitung"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diarios gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaytidningar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar för homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Serialized print or digital publications about gay men or gay issues (and typically produced by gay men or gay organizations) that contain news, articles, columns, correspondence, and advertisements."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fortlaufende gedruckte oder digitale Zeitungen über schwule Männer oder schwule Themen (die in der Regel von schwulen Männern oder schwulen Organisationen herausgegeben werden), die Nachrichten, Artikel, Kolumnen, Korrespondenz und Anzeigen enthalten."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones impresas o digitales serializadas sobre hombres gay o temas gay (y generalmente producidas por hombres gay u organizaciones gay) que contienen noticias, artículos, columnas, correspondencia y anuncios."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Periodieke gedrukte of digitale publicaties over homomannen en homo-kwesties (meestal geproduceerd door homomannen of homo organisaties) die nieuws, artikelen, columns, correspondentie en advertenties bevatten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Seriella tryckta eller digitala publikationer om manlig homosexualitet eller frågor rörande bögar (vanligtvis producerade av bögar eller organisationer) som innehåller nyheter, artiklar, krönikor, korrespondens och annonser."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001042"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000514"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh94008545"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayNewspapers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000516","dc:identifier":"homoit0000516","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Pagans"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Heiden"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Paganos gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homopaganisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hedniska bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule heidnische Personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nyhedniska bögar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hedniska homosexuella män"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nyhedniska homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are members of polytheistic religions or other religions outside of the dominant culture that typically incorporate nature worship and/or the sacred feminine, such as Wicca, Druidry, Heathenry, etc. Use to describe gay men who self-identify as Pagan."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Mitglieder polytheistischer Religionen oder anderer Religionen außerhalb der vorherrschenden Kultur sind, die typischerweise Naturverehrung und/oder das \"Heilige Weibliche\" beinhalten, wie Wicca, Druidentum, Heidentum usw. Wird verwendet, um homosexuelle Männer zu beschreiben, die sich selbst als Heiden identifizieren."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son miembros de religiones politeístas u otras religiones fuera de la cultura dominante que típicamente incorporan el culto a la naturaleza y/o lo sagrado femenino, como la Wicca, el druidismo, el paganismo, etc. Utilícese para describir a los hombres gay que se autoidentifiquen como paganos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die lid zijn van polytheïstische religies of andere religies buiten de dominante cultuur die natuuraanbidding en/of het heilige vrouwelijke incorporeren, zoals Wicca, Druidendom, Heidendom, enz. Gebruik om homomannen te beschrijven die zichzelf identificeren als Paganistisch."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som tillhör polyteistiska religioner, eller andra religioner utanför den dominerande kulturen, som ofta innefattar naturdyrkan och/eller det heliga feminina, såsom wicca, druidism, hednisk tro m.m. Används för bögar som själva identifierar sig som hedningar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001069"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001909"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPagans"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001909","dc:identifier":"homoit0001909","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay witches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujos gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Hexer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoheksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Böghäxor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Wiccans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Wicca"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Wicca-Anhänger"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayhäxor"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga häxor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who practice Wicca or other Pagan religions and self-identify as witches."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que practican Wicca u otras religiones paganas y que se autoidentifican como brujos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Anhänger von Wicca oder anderen heidnischen Religionen, die sich selbst als Hexer bezeichnen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-beoefenaars van Wicca of andere paganistische religies die zichzelf identificeren als heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som utövar wicca eller andra hedniska religioner och som identifierar sig som häxor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001907"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000516"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000517","dc:identifier":"homoit0000517","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay poetry"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poesía gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Dichtung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homopoëzie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögpoesi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Lyrik"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Poesie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaypoesi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Böglyrik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaylyrik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig poesi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig lyrik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary work, typically written in verse, that focuses on gay characters, themes, or identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias, normalmente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o identidades gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Literarisches Werk, typischerweise in Versform verfasst, das sich auf schwule Charaktere, Themen oder Identität konzentriert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literair werk, meestal in verzen geschreven, dat zich richt op homo-personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på homosexuella manliga karaktärer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001725"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008105069"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPoetry"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000519","dc:identifier":"homoit0000519","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay political groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos políticos gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule politische Gruppen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homopolitieke groepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Politiska böggrupper"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Politische Schwulengruppen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Politiska gaygrupper"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Politiska grupper för homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups centered on political change and action for gay rights that may or may not be aligned with major political parties."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados centrados en el cambio y la acción política por los derechos de los hombres gay, que pueden o no estar alineados con los principales partidos políticos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Organisierte Gruppen, die sich auf politischen Wandel und Maßnahmen für die Rechte von Schwulen konzentrieren und die mit den großen politischen Parteien übereinstimmen können oder auch nicht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen gericht op politieke verandering en actie voor homorechten, al dan niet verbonden met grote politieke partijen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper med fokus på politisk förändring och aktivism för bögars rättigheter, kan vara oberoende eller knutna till politiska partier."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003521"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003521"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPoliticalGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003521","dc:identifier":"homoit0003521","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ political groups"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-politieke groepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Politiska hbtq+-grupper"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Political groups (LGBTQ)"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups centered on political change and action for LGBTQ+ rights that may or may not be aligned with major political parties."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen die zich richten op politieke verandering en actie voor LHBTQ+-rechten, die al dan niet gelieerd zijn aan grote politieke partijen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper med fokus på politisk förändring och aktivism för hbtq+-personers rättigheter. Kan vara oberoende eller knutna till politiska partier."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003522"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003523"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003524"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003525"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003526"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003527"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003528"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003529"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003530"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003532"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000764"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003531"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003521"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-09-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002331","dc:identifier":"homoit0002331","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay films"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Películas gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Filme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homofilms"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögfilmer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay movies"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenfilme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayfilmer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga filmer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Motion pictures, or movies, created by gay directors, depicting gay men, or that are regarded as important within gay culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Películas creadas por directores gay, que representan a hombres gay o a personas consideradas importantes dentro de la cultura gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Filme, die von schwulen Regisseuren gedreht wurden, schwule Männer zeigen oder innerhalb der schwulen Kultur als wichtig angesehen werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bewegende beelden, of films, gemaakt door homoregisseurs, waarin homoseksuele mannen worden afgebeeld, of die als belangrijk worden beschouwd binnen de homocultuur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Filmer skapade av homosexuella manliga regissörer, med bögar eller som betraktas som viktiga inom bögkultur."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000869"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002330"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000520"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2005008640"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002608","dc:identifier":"homoit0002608","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay erotic art"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arte erótico gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-erotische kunst"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay erotisk konst"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig erotisk konst"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotic art, created by gay artists, depicting gay people, or that are regarded as important within gay culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Arte erótico, creado por artistas gay, que representa a hombres gay o a personas consideradas importantes dentro de la cultura gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotische kunst, gemaakt door homokunstenaars, waarin homomannen worden afgebeeld, of die binnen de homocultuur als belangrijk worden beschouwd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotisk konst skapad av konstnärer som är bögar, som avbildar bögar eller som anses betydelsefull inom bögkulturen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002579"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000520"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002547"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002598"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93002536"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002547","dc:identifier":"homoit0002547","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay erotic films "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Películas eróticas gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-erotische films"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay erotisk film"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig erotisk film"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotic films or movies, created by gay directors, depicting gay people, or that are regarded as important within gay culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Filmes o películas eróticas, creadas por directores gay, que representan a hombres gay o a personas consideradas importantes dentro de la cultura gay."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotische films of films, gemaakt door homoregisseurs, waarin homomannen worden afgebeeld, of die binnen de homocultuur als belangrijk worden beschouwd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotiska filmer skapade av homosexuella manliga regissörer, med bögar eller som betraktas som viktiga inom bögkultur."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002544"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002608"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000520"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006001636"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003156","dc:identifier":"homoit0003156","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay zines"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Zines gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Zines"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-zines"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögfanzines"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögfansin"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögzines"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Independent, small-circulation publications usually reproduced via photocopier; use for zines created by gay people and/or focusing on gay identity, issues, or culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones independientes de pequeña tirada generalmente reproducidas mediante fotocopiadora; utilícese para revistas creadas por hombres gay y/o centradas en la identidad gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Unabhängige Publikationen mit geringer Auflage, die in der Regel mit einem Fotokopierer vervielfältigt werden; wird für Zines (von englisch magazine) verwendet, die von schwulen Männern erstellt werden und/oder sich auf schwule Identität, Themen oder Kultur konzentrieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Onafhankelijke publicaties in kleine oplage, meestal gereproduceerd via een kopieerapparaat; te gebruiken voor zines gemaakt door homomannen en/of gericht op homo-identiteit, -onderwerpen of -cultuur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Små, självpublicerade tidskrifter med begränsad upplaga, ofta kopierade med kopiator. Används för fanzines skapade av bögar och/eller med fokus på bögars identitet, kultur eller frågor."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000965"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004622","dc:identifier":"homoit0004622","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay personals"},"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay personal ads"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay personal advertisements"}],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of classified advertising for gay men interested in seeking connections around sex, romance, and/or community. The content of these ads focus largely on the type of arrangement sought and details or criteria about the writer and the type of person they are looking for (e.g. personality traits, physical looks, etc.). While gay personals are most commonly thought of as existing in print media, they also have existed online in spaces such as Craigslist."},"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004621"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000529"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000521"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004621"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000522","dc:identifier":"homoit0000522","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay pride"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Orgullo gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay Pride"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gay pride"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pride"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenparade"},{"@language":"de","@value":"CSD"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Christopher Street Day"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay-Pride"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay pride"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The recognition and celebration of gay people and culture, thereby affirming the visibility, dignity, and diversity of gay communities. This term can be used to refer to gay men specifically, but it is often used as an umbrella term for LGBTQ+ pride as a whole, particularly in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La celebración y el reconocimiento de las identidades LGBTQ+, que afirma la visibilidad, dignidad y diversidad de las comunidades LGBTQ+. Si bien \"orgullo gay\" puede referirse específicamente a hombres gay, se usa más comúnmente como un término abarcador para el orgullo LGBTQ+ en general."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Anerkennung und Würdigung von schwulen Männern und der schwulen Kultur, wodurch die Sichtbarkeit, Würde und Vielfalt schwuler Gemeinschaften bekräftigt wird. Dieser Begriff kann sich speziell auf schwule Männer beziehen, wird jedoch häufig als Oberbegriff für die LGBTQ+-Pride insgesamt verwendet, insbesondere in historischen Zusammenhängen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De erkenning en viering van homoseksuele personen en cultuur, en daarmee de zichtbaarheid, waardigheid en diversiteit van homoseksuele gemeenschappen bevestigen. Deze term kan specifiek worden gebruikt om te verwijzen naar homomannen, maar wordt vaak gebruikt als een overkoepelende term voor LHBTQ+-pride als geheel, met name in historische context."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Firande och erkännande av hbtq+-identiteter som bekräftar hbtq+-gemenskapers synlighet, värdighet och mångfald. Termen har ursprungligen främst använts för bögar men idag vanligtvis om pridefirande generellt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPride"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653","dc:identifier":"homoit0003653","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ pride"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-pride"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-stolthet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Pride (LGBTQ)"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The recognition and celebration of LGBTQ+ people and culture, thereby affirming the visibility, dignity, and diversity of LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De erkenning en viering van LHBTQ+-personen en -cultuur, waarmee de zichtbaarheid, waardigheid en diversiteit van LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen wordt bevestigd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Synliggörande och firande av hbtq+-personer och hbtq+-kultur, som bekräftar gemenskapens värdighet, mångfald och existens."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000522"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000767"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003654"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003655"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003940"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003941"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003942"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003943"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003944"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003246"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002386"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003945"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000523","dc:identifier":"homoit0000523","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Pride Week"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pride-Woche"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Semana del orgullo gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gay pride week"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pridefestivaler"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pink Saturday"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pink Week"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pride Week"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pride Woche"},{"@language":"de","@value":"CSD-Woche"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay-Pride-Woche"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sábado rosado"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sábado rosa"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Semana rosa"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Semana rosada"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Semana del orgullo"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Europride"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pride-arrangemang"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Prideveckan"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Worldpride"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A period of public recognition and celebration of LGBTQ+ people and culture, usually organized over the course of a week with local events, parades, marches, and rallies. Gay pride week occurs at different times during the year in different places but is typically held in June in the United States to commemorate the Stonewall uprising."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Zeitraum, in dem Personen und Kultur der LGBTQ+-Gemeinschaft öffentlich gewürdigt und gefeiert werden. In der Regel werden im Rahmen einer Woche lokale Veranstaltungen, Paraden, Umzüge und Kundgebungen organisiert. Die Pride-Woche findet an verschiedenen Orten zu unterschiedlichen Zeiten im Jahr statt, häufig im Juni, um an den Stonewall-Aufstand zu erinnern."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Eventos que celebran la autoaceptación y la aceptación social, los logros y los derechos LGBTQ+, generalmente organizados en el transcurso de una semana con eventos locales, desfiles, marchas y concentraciones. Ocurre en diferentes momentos del año en diferentes lugares, pero normalmente se lleva a cabo en junio para conmemorar las revueltas de Stonewall."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een periode van publieke erkenning en viering van LHBTQ+-personen en -cultuur, meestal georganiseerd in de loop van een week met lokale evenementen, parades, marsen en bijeenkomsten. Gay pride week vindt plaats op verschillende tijdstippen gedurende het jaar op verschillende plaatsen, maar wordt doorgaans in juni gehouden om de Stonewall-opstand te herdenken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En period av offentligt uppmärksammande och firande av hbtq+-personer och hbtq+-kultur, vanligtvis organiserad över en vecka med lokala evenemang, parader, marscher och manifestationer. Prideveckor hålls vid olika tidpunkter under året på olika platser, men infaller ofta i juni i USA för att uppmärksamma Stonewallupproret."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003654"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93000860"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPrideWeek"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003654","dc:identifier":"homoit0003654","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pride Month"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pride maand"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pride-månad"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Pride Month"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A period of public recognition and celebration of LGBTQ+ people and culture, usually organized over the course of a month with local events, parades, marches, and rallies. Pride occurs at different times during the year in different places but is typically held in June in the United States to commemorate the Stonewall uprising."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een periode van publieke erkenning en viering van LHBTQ+-personen en -cultuur, meestal georganiseerd in de loop van een maand met lokale evenementen, parades, marsen en bijeenkomsten. Pride vindt plaats op verschillende momenten in het jaar op verschillende plaatsen, maar wordt vaak in juni gehouden om de Stonewall-rellen in New York te herdenken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En period av offentlig uppmärksamhet och firande av hbtq+-personer och hbtq+-kultur, vanligtvis organiserad under en månad med lokala evenemang, parader, marscher och demonstrationer. Pride äger rum vid olika tidpunkter under året i olika delar av världen, men hålls oftast i juni i USA till minne av Stonewallupproret."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003651"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000523"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003656"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000525","dc:identifier":"homoit0000525","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sex workers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Sexarbeiter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trabajadores sexuales gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-sekswerkers"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay prostitutes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay prostitution"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sex work"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Prostituierte"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Stricher"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Prostitution"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Sexarbeit"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prostitutos gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trabajadores sexuales gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoprostitutie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homosekswerk"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who receive money or goods in exchange for sexual services, performances, or companionship. Use to describe gay men working across the broad spectrum of sex work."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Geld oder Waren als Gegenleistung für sexuelle Dienstleistungen, Darbietungen oder Gesellschaft erhalten. Wird verwendet, um Männer zu beschreiben, die im breiten Spektrum der Sexarbeit tätig sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que reciben dinero o bienes a cambio de servicios o actuaciones sexuales. Se debe utilizar para describir a los hombres gay que trabajan en el amplio espectro del trabajo sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die geld of goederen ontvangen in ruil voor seksuele diensten, optredens of gezelschap. Wordt gebruikt om homomannen te beschrijven die in het brede spectrum van sekswerk werken."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001277"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayProstitutes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000526","dc:identifier":"homoit0000526","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Protestants"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Protestantes gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Protestanten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Protestantse homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Protestantiska bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule evangelische Männer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Evangelische schwule Männer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Protestantische schwule Männer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayprotestanter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögprotestanter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga protestanter"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are members of the Protestant Church."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son miembros de la Iglesia protestante."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Mitglieder der protestantischen bzw. evangelischen Kirche sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die lid zijn van een Protestantse Kerk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är medlemmar i protestantiska kyrkor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001137"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007008279"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayProtestants"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000527","dc:identifier":"homoit0000527","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay publishers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Editoriales gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Verleger"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-uitgeverijen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögförlag"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga förlag"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Companies and organizations that publish materials for gay communities or addressing gay issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Empresas y organizaciones que publican materiales para comunidades gay o que abordan asuntos gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Unternehmen und Organisationen, die Materialien für schwule Gemeinschaften veröffentlichen oder sich mit schwulen Themen befassen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bedrijven en organisaties die materiaal publiceren voor homo-gemeenschappen of homo-thema's aanspreken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Företag och organisationer som publicerar material för bögar eller som behandlar frågor som rör bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001144"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001144"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPublishers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004319","dc:identifier":"homoit0004319","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay podcasts"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-podcasts"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögpoddar"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögpodcaster"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A recorded series (primarily in audio, but sometimes with a video component) with recurring hosts that feature content about gay men and/or gay men's issues and that are available digitally for streaming or download. Podcasts are typically episodic and may feature different guests."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een opgenomen serie (voornamelijk audio, maar soms met een video-onderdeel) met terugkerende presentatoren die content presenteren over homomannen en/of homothema's en die digitaal beschikbaar zijn om te streamen of te downloaden. Podcasts bestaan ​​doorgaans uit afleveringen en kunnen verschillende gasten hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inspelade radioprogram (inslag av video kan förekomma) med återkommande programledare och innehåll om/för bögar och/eller bögfrågor som är digitalt tillgängliga genom streaming eller nedladdning. Poddar är vanligen uppdelade i episoder och kan ha olika gäster."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004317"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000528"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004317"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000530","dc:identifier":"homoit0000530","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+-affirming religious groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos religiosos que afirman las identidades LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-religieuze groepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+inkluderande religiösa grupper"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay religious groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian religious groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ affirming religious groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ inclusive religious groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+-inclusive religious groups"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Religieuze homogroepen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Religieuze lesbische groepen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Groups of people united by a religion or religious practices that are accepting and supportive of LGBTQ+ people and their identities. Includes large-scale organized groups, such as denominations or sects, as well as small-scale groups, such as specific churches, mosques, temples, or congregations."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de personas unidas por una religión o prácticas religiosas que aceptan y apoyan a las personas LGBTQ+ y sus identidades. Incluye a grupos organizados a gran escala, como denominaciones o sectas, así como grupos de pequeña escala, como iglesias, mezquitas, templos o congregaciones específicas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Groepen personen verenigd door een religie of religieuze praktijken die LHBTQ+-personen en hun identiteit accepteren en ondersteunen. Omvat grootschalige georganiseerde groepen, zoals denominaties of sekten, maar ook kleinschalige groepen, zoals specifieke kerken, moskeeën, tempels of congregaties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Religiösa grupper som är inkluderande och bekräftande av hbtq+-personer och deras identiteter. Omfattar både större samfund som samfund eller sekter och mindre grupper som specifika kyrkor, moskéer, tempel eller församlingar."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003609"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004348"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000530"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayReligiousGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003609","dc:identifier":"homoit0003609","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+-affirming religious services"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-religieuze diensten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+inkluderande religiösa sammankomster"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ affirming religious services"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ religious services"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Religious services (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Religious services, or gatherings of people belonging to the same religious group or belief system, that are accepting and supportive of LGBTQ+ people and their identities. Includes services specifically intended for LGBTQ+ people within a denomination or sect that is otherwise not LGBTQ+-affirming."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Religieuze diensten, of bijeenkomsten van personen die tot dezelfde religieuze groep of geloofssysteem behoren, die LHBTQ+-personen en hun identiteiten accepteren en ondersteunen. Omvat diensten die specifiek bedoeld zijn voor LHBTQ+-personen binnen een denominatie of sekte die anderszins niet LHBTQ+-bevestigend is."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gudstjänster eller sammankomster för personer inom samma religiösa grupp eller trossystem som är inkluderande och bekräftande av hbtq+-personer och deras identiteter. Inkluderar även specifika sammankomster för hbtq+-personer inom samfund som annars inte är hbtq+-bekräftande."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000530"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004348"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003609"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004348","dc:identifier":"homoit0004348","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Religious views on LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Religieuze opvattingen over LHBTQ+ personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Religiösa synsätt på hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Religiösa perspektiv på hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Religiösa förhållningssätt gentemot hbtq+-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Beliefs, practices, and values held by individuals or groups regarding LGBTQ+ people, originating from people united by a religion or religious practices. This can include large-scale organized groups, such as denominations or sects, as well as small-scale groups, such as specific churches, mosques, temples, or congregations."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overtuigingen, gebruiken en waarden die individuen of groepen aanhangen met betrekking tot LHBTQ+-personen, voortkomend uit personen die verenigd zijn door een religie of religieuze gebruiken. Dit kan zowel grootschalige georganiseerde groepen omvatten, zoals denominaties of sekten, als kleinschalige groepen, zoals specifieke kerken, moskeeën, tempels of gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Övertygelser, seder och värderingar som individer eller grupper har gällande hbtq+-personer, och som härrör från gemensam religion eller religiösa sedvänjor. Detta kan inkludera storskaliga organiserade grupper, såsom samfund eller sekter, såväl som småskaliga grupper, såsom specifika kyrkor, moskéer, tempel eller församlingar."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000530"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003609"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004348"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000532","dc:identifier":"homoit0000532","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Roman Catholics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas católico romanas gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Katholiken"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Roomskatholieke homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romersk-katolska bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Católico Romanos gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Katholische schwule Männer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Römisch-katholische schwule Männer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule römisch-katholische Männer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romersk-katolska homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are members of the Roman Catholic Church."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son miembros de la Iglesia católica romana."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Mitglieder der römisch-katholischen Kirche sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die lid zijn van de rooms-katholieke kerk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är medlemmar i den romersk-katolska kyrkan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001244"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2005004587"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayRomanCatholics"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000533","dc:identifier":"homoit0000533","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sensibility"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sensibilidad gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Sensibilität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homosensibiliteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögläsningar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay Sensibility"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga läsningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A way of reading and looking at cultural texts (books, movies, television, magazines, etc.) through a gay lens, often including the appropriation of texts otherwise thought of as heterosexual."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de leer y mirar textos culturales (libros, películas, televisión, revistas, etc.) a través de un lente gay, a menudo incluyendo la apropiación de textos que, de lo contrario, se considerarían heterosexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Methode, kulturelle Texte (Bücher, Filme, Fernsehen, Zeitschriften usw.) aus einer schwulen Perspektive zu lesen und zu betrachten, wobei oft auch Texte einbezogen werden, die ansonsten als heterosexuell gelten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"specifieke homomanier van lezen en kijken naar culturele teksten (boeken, films, televisie, tijdschriften, etc.) en de toe-eigening van teksten die gezien kunnen worden als zuiver heteroseksueel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett sätt att läsa och tolka kulturella uttryck (böcker, filmer, tv-program, tidskrifter etc.) genom ett bögperspektiv, ofta genom att appropriera verk som annars ses som heterosexuella."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000777"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000533"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaySensibility"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000777","dc:identifier":"homoit0000777","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian sensibility"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sensibilidad lésbica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische sensibiliteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska läsningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A way of reading and looking at cultural texts (books, movies, television, magazines, etc.) through a lesbian lens, often including the appropriation of texts otherwise thought of as heterosexual."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de leer y mirar textos culturales (libros, películas, televisión, revistas, etc.) a través de un lente lésbico, lo cual a menudo incluye la apropiación de textos considerados heterosexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"specifiek lesbische manier van lezen en kijken naar culturele teksten (boeken, films, televisie, tijdschriften, etc.) en de toe-eigening van teksten die gezien kunnen worden als zuiver heteroseksueel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett sätt att läsa och tolka kulturella uttryck (böcker, filmer, tv, tidskrifter etc.) med ett lesbiskt perspektiv, ofta inklusive appropriering av texter som traditionellt uppfattats som heterosexuella."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000533"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000777"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianSensibility"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000536","dc:identifier":"homoit0000536","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijos gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Söhne"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Fils gais"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homozonen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögsöner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Fils gays"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Fils homosexuels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaysöner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella söner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sons who identify as gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijos que se autoidentifican como hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Söhne, die sich als schwule Männer identifizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Fils qui s'identifient comme gais."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zonen die zich identificeren als homoman."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Söner som identifierar sig som bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001329"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaySons"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000537","dc:identifier":"homoit0000537","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sports clubs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Sportvereine"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs de deporte gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homosportclubs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottsklubbar för bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubes atléticos gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Manliga homosexuella idrottsklubbar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Groups of gay men formed for the purpose of playing sports; includes professional and amateur sports clubs."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gruppen von schwulen Männern, die sich zum Ausüben von Sport gegründet haben; umfasst professionelle und Amateursportvereine."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de hombres gay formados con el fin de practicar deportes; incluye clubes deportivos profesionales y amateurs."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Groepen homomannen gevormd om te sporten; omvat professionele en amateursportclubs."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottsklubbar för bögar, både professionella och amatörbaserade."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000950"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001931"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaySportsClubs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000950","dc:identifier":"homoit0000950","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ sports clubs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs deportivos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-sportclubs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottsklubbar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ sports clubs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs de deporte LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubs deportivos LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Clubes atléticos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottsklubbar (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottssällskap (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sportklubbar (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottsföreningar (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups of LGBTQ+ people formed for the purpose of playing sports; includes professional and amateur sports clubs."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados de personas LGBTQ+ formados para el propósito de jugar deportes; incluye clubs deportivos profesionales y aficionados."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen LHBTQ+-personen om te sporten; omvat professionele en amateursportclubs."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottsklubbar för hbtq+-personer, både professionella och amatörbaserade."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000537"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000780"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001929"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSportsClubs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001931","dc:identifier":"homoit0001931","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay athletes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atletas gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Sportler"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homosportbeoefenaars"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella idrottsmän"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sports players"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sportsmen"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sportspeople"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay sportspersons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jugadores deportivos gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deportistas gay||"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Athleten"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Professional or amateur/recreational sports players who self-identify as gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jugadores de deportes profesionales o aficionados/recreativos que se autoidentifican como hombres gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Profi- oder Amateur-/Freizeitsportler, die sich selbst als schwul identifizieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Professionele of amateur/recreatieve sporters die zichzelf identificeren als homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som ägnar sig åt professionell eller rekreationell idrott."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001929"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004468"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004510"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004522"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004532"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004542"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004552"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004562"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004572"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004582"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004592"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000537"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90002119"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000540","dc:identifier":"homoit0000540","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay survivors of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes gay de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Überlebende von Hasskriminalität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais survivants de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-overlevenden van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som överlevt hatbrott"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Überlebende von Hassdelikten"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Überlebende von Hassverbrechen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gays survivants de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Homosexuels survivants de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män som överlevt hatbrott"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who have experienced and survived hate crimes; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que han sufrido y sobrevivido a crímenes de odio; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Hasskriminalität erlebt und überlebt haben; wenn möglich die Präferenz der Person für „Opfer“ oder „Überlebende“ beachten."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais qui ont été victimes de crimes haineux et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivants » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die haatmisdrijven hebben meegemaakt en overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som har upplevt och överlevt hatbrott. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000551"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001349"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaySurvivorsOfHateCrimes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000551","dc:identifier":"homoit0000551","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas gay de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Opfer von Hasskriminalität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais victimes de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoslachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är hatbrottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Opfer von Hassverbrechen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Opfer von Hassdelikten"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gays victimes de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Homosexuels victimes de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är offer för hatbrott"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga hatbrottsoffer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que han sufrido crímenes de odio y pueden haber sobrevivido o no; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Opfer von Hassverbrechen geworden sind und überlebt haben oder nicht; wenn möglich die Präferenz der Person für „Opfer“ oder „Überlebende“ beachten."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais qui ont été victimes de crimes haineux et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die haatmisdrijven hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som har utsatts för hatbrott och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000613"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000540"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayVictimsOfHateCrimes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inSc