"Bögar som har utsatts för sexuella övergrepp och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000959"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000542"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayVictimsOfSexualAbuse"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000543","dc:identifier":"homoit0000543","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay survivors of war"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes gay de guerra"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Kriegsüberlebende"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais survivants de guerre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-oorlogsoverlevenden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är krigsöverlevare"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Überlebende eines Krieges"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gays survivants de guerre"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Homosexuels survivants de guerre"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män som är krigsöverlevare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who have experienced and survived war; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que han sufrido y sobrevivido a la guerra; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Krieg erlebt und überlebt haben; wenn möglich die Präferenz der Person für „Opfer“ oder „Überlebende“ beachten."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais ayant vécu et survécu à la guerre; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die oorlog hebben meegemaakt en overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som har upplevt och överlevt krig. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000553"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001352"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaySurvivorsOfWar"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000553","dc:identifier":"homoit0000553","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay victims of war"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas gay de guerra"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Kriegsopfer"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais victimes de guerre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-oorlogsslachtoffers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är krigsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gays victimes de guerre"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Homosexuels victimes de guerre"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män som är krigsoffer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who have experienced war and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que han sufrido la guerra y que pueden haber sobrevivido o no; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die einen Krieg erlebt und überlebt haben oder nicht; wenn möglich, die Präferenz der Person für „Opfer“ oder „Überlebende“ beachten."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hommes gais ayant vécu la guerre et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die oorlog hebben meegemaakt en al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som har upplevt krig och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000961"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000543"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayVictimsOfWar"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000557","dc:identifier":"homoit0000557","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay youth literature"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura juvenil gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Jugendliteratur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-jeugdliteratuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay ungdomslitteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ungdomslitteratur med unga bögar som karaktärer och/eller tema"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Written literary works for an audience of readers from 12-18 years of age, also known as young adult literature or YA; use in reference to youth literature focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas para una audiencia de lectores de 12 a 18 años de edad, también conocidas como literatura para adultos jóvenes o YA; utilícese en referencia a la literatura juvenil que se centra en personajes o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Literarische Werke, die für eine Leserschaft im Alter von 12 bis 18 Jahren geschrieben werden, auch bekannt als YA (Young Adult); verwenden in Bezug auf Jugendliteratur, die sich auf schwule Charaktere oder Themen konzentriert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken voor een lezerspubliek van 12-18 jaar, ook wel young adult literatuur of YA genoemd; gebruik in verwijzing naar jeugdliteratuur gericht op homopersonages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk för läsare mellan 12 och 18 år, även kallat YA. Används för ungdomslitteratur med fokus på bögar eller pojkar som karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001522"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000544"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002152"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayYouthLiterature"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000546","dc:identifier":"homoit0000546","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Gay theater"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Teatro gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Theater"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homotheater"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögteater"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Gay theatre"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gay-teater"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig teater"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Works in the performance arts that focus on gay characters, communities, or issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trabajos en las artes escénicas que se centran en personajes, comunidades o temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Werke der darstellenden Kunst, die sich mit schwulen Charakteren, Gemeinschaften oder Themen befassen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Uitvoeringen in de podiumkunsten die zich richten op homo-personages, gemeenschappen of kwesties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Scenkonstverk som fokuserar på homosexuella manliga karaktärer, gemenskaper eller frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000547"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93000719"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayTheatre"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000547","dc:identifier":"homoit0000547","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Gay theater groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de teatro gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Theatergruppen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homotheatergroepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögteatergrupper"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Gay theatre groups"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayteatergrupper"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga teatergrupper"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Groups of theatrical performers comprised of gay men; may focus on performing works written by gay men or about gay issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de artistas teatrales compuestos por hombres gay; pueden centrarse en la interpretación de obras escritas por hombres gay o sobre temas gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Theatergruppen, bestehend aus schwulen Männern; kann sich auf die Aufführung von Werken konzentrieren, die von schwulen Männern geschrieben wurden oder sich mit schwulen Themen befassen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Groepen theaterartiesten bestaande uit homomannen; kan zich richten op het uitvoeren van werken geschreven door homomannen of over homokwesties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teatergrupper bestående av bögar. Kan vara inriktade på att framföra verk skrivna av bögar eller som handlar om bögfrågor."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000546"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000789"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001031"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000547"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayTheatreGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000789","dc:identifier":"homoit0000789","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Lesbian theater groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de teatro lésbicos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische theatergroepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska teatergrupper"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Lesbian theatre groups"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Groups of theatrical performers comprised of lesbians; may focus on performing works by lesbians or about lesbian issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de artistas teatrales compuestos por lesbianas; pueden centrarse en la interpretación de obras de lesbianas o sobre cuestiones lésbicas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Groepen theaterartiesten bestaande uit lesbische vrouwen; kan zich richten op het uitvoeren van werken geschreven door lesbische vrouwen of over lesbische kwesties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teatergrupper bestående av lesbiska. Kan fokusera på att framföra verk skrivna av lesbiska eller om lesbiska frågor."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000547"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000788"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001031"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000789"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianTheatreGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001031","dc:identifier":"homoit0001031","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ musicals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Musicales LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-musicals"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-musikaler"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Musicals (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Musicales (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Musikaler (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Films or theatrical productions in which singing and/or dancing are essential elements. Use for musicals created by LGBTQ+ directors, depicting LGBTQ+ people, or that are regarded as important within LGBTQ+ culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Películas o producciones teatrales en las que el canto y/o el baile son elementos imprescindibles. Utilícese para musicales creados por directores LGBTQ+ o que son considerados importantes dentro de la cultura LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Film- of theaterproducties waarin zang en/of dans essentiële elementen zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Filmer eller scenproduktioner där sång och/eller dans är centrala element. Används för musikaler skapade av hbtq+-regissörer, som skildrar hbtq+-personer eller som betraktas som viktiga inom hbtq+-kultur."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000816"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003161"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003162"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003163"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003164"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003165"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003228"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000547"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000789"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/musicals"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000791","dc:identifier":"homoit0000791","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian trade union groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos sindicales lésbicos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vakbondsgroepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fackföreningsgrupper för lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fackliga grupper för lesbiska"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized groups of lesbian workers who are united to make decisions relating to the conditions affecting their labor."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos organizados de trabajadoras lesbianas que se unen para tomar decisiones relacionadas con las condiciones que afectan su trabajo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde groepen lesbische werknemers die verenigd zijn om beslissingen te beïnvloeden met betrekking tot hun werkomstandigheden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade grupper av lesbiska arbetstagare som tillsammans fattar beslut om villkor som påverkar deras arbete."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000549"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianTradeUnionGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000554","dc:identifier":"homoit0000554","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay victims' rights"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Derechos de víctimas gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Opferrechte"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Slachtofferrechten voor homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögars rättigheter som brottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella mäns rättigheter som brottsoffer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men's legal rights to be informed, present, and heard within the criminal justice system after having been harmed or injured as the result of of a crime, accident, or other event."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Los derechos legales de los hombres gay a estar informados, estar presentes y a ser escuchados dentro del sistema de justicia penal después de haber sido perjudicados o lesionados como resultado de un delito, accidente u otro evento."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Das Recht schwuler Männer auf Information, Anwesenheit und Anhörung im Rahmen des Strafrechtssystems, wenn sie infolge eines Verbrechens, eines Unfalls oder eines anderen Ereignisses geschädigt oder verletzt worden sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De wettelijke rechten van homomannen om te worden geïnformeerd, aanwezig te zijn en gehoord te worden binnen het strafrechtsysteem nadat ze zijn geschaad of gewond zijn geraakt als gevolg van een misdrijf, ongeval of andere gebeurtenis."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögars juridiska rättigheter som brottsoffer att få information, närvara och komma till tals inom rättsväsendet efter att ha utsatts för brott, olycka eller annan händelse som orsakat skada."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001492"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000702"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayVictimsRights"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000786","dc:identifier":"homoit0000786","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud lésbica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian teens"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische teenagers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische tieners"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who are between the ages of childhood and adulthood."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que se encuentran entre las edades de la niñez y la edad adulta."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen in de leeftijd tussen kinderjaren en volwassenheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska mellan barndom och vuxen ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000743"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000729"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000744"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000798"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95001078"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianYouth"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003040","dc:identifier":"homoit0003040","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian college students"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbische Hochschulstudierende"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudiantes universitarias lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische studenten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska collegestudenter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Universitarias lesbianas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas universitarias"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who are attending college."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbische Personen, die eine Hochschule besuchen. Achtung: Das US-amerikanische College entspricht nicht exakt der Hochschule im deutschen Sprachraum, wird aber häufig als Hochschule übersetzt."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que asisten a la universidad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die naar de universiteit gaan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som studerar vid college."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003041"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003032"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95007508"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-05"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003932","dc:identifier":"homoit0003932","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians with breast cancer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen met borstkanker"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska med bröstcancer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian breast cancer patients"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who have been diagnosed with breast cancer, whether or not they are currently undergoing treatment. This term can also be used to refer to the particular challenges lesbians and/or their partners face in obtaining cancer treatment due to discrimination."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen bij wie borstkanker is vastgesteld, ongeacht of ze momenteel een behandeling ondergaan. Deze term kan ook worden gebruikt om te verwijzen naar de specifieke uitdagingen waarmee lesbische vrouwen en/of hun partners te maken krijgen bij het verkrijgen van een behandeling van kanker vanwege discriminatie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som har fått diagnosen bröstcancer, oavsett om de för närvarande genomgår behandling eller inte. Denna term kan även användas för de särskilda utmaningar som lesbiska och/eller deras partners möter när de får cancerbehandling på grund av diskriminering."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-26"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004641","dc:identifier":"homoit0004641","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian men"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Men who are lesbians."},"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001008"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000744","dc:identifier":"homoit0000744","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad lesbiana"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité lesbienne"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk identitet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad lésbica"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the sexual identity of women and femmes who are romantically and/or sexually attracted to other women and femmes. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la identidad sexual de mujeres y femmes que se sienten atraídas romántica y/o sexualmente por otras mujeres y femmes. Sin embargo, no todas las lesbianas son mujeres, y las personas disidentes de género que pertenecen a comunidades lésbicas a menudo se han identificado como lesbianas."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité sexuelle des femmes qui sont attirées romantiquement ou sexuellement par d'autres femmes. Cependant, toutes les lesbiennes ne sont pas des femmes, et les personnes non conformes au genre qui appartiennent à des communautés lesbiennes se sont souvent identifiées comme lesbiennes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om de seksuele identiteit te beschrijven van vrouwen en femmes die zich romantisch en/of seksueel aangetrokken voelen tot andere vrouwen en femmes. Niet alle lesbische vrouwen zijn echter vrouwen, en gender-niet-conforme personen die tot lesbische gemeenschappen behoren, worden vaak als lesbische vrouw geïdentificeerd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver sexuell identitet hos kvinnor och feminina personer som är romantiskt och/eller sexuellt attraherade av andra kvinnor och feminina personer. Alla som identifierar sig som lesbiska är dock inte kvinnor, och könsöverskridande personer har ofta identifierat sig som lesbiska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000786"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh94004083"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianIdentity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000802","dc:identifier":"homoit0000802","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Parents of lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres y padres de lesbianas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Parents de personnes lesbiennes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ouders van lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Föräldrar till lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians' parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres de lesbianas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de lesbianas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who act as parents to one or more lesbian. For parents who are themselves lesbians, use the term \"Lesbian parents.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que actúan como padres de una o más lesbianas. Para padres que son lesbianas, utilice el término \"madres y padres lesbianas\"."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui assument le rôle de parent auprès d'une personne lesbienne."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som fungerar som föräldrar till en eller flera lesbiska. För föräldrar som själva är lesbiska, använd termen ”Lesbiska föräldrar”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002224"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/parentsOfLesbians"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001105","dc:identifier":"homoit0001105","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Persecution of lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Persecución de lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vervolging van lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förföljelse av lesbiska"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Systematic mistreatment of lesbians on the basis of their sexual identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maltrato sistemático a lesbianas por su identidad sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Systematische mishandeling van lesbische vrouwen op basis van hun seksuele identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Systematisk förföljelse av lesbiska på grund av deras sexuella identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/persecutionOfLesbians"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001227","dc:identifier":"homoit0001227","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer women"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres queer"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Femmes queers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera kvinnor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women who are queer. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres que se identifican como queer."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Femmes qui s'identifient comme queers."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwen die zich identificeren als queer."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnor som identifierar sig som queera."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001195"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerWomen"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001472","dc:identifier":"homoit0001472","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tribades"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tribadas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tribaden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tribader"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Tribades"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Historical term for individuals who engage in the sexual practice of tribadism; use only in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término histórico para personas que ejercen la práctica sexual del tribadismo; utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historisk term för personer som utövar sexuell praktik kallad tribadism. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001669"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/tribades"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002178","dc:identifier":"homoit0002178","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas en fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska inom fandom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians in fan communities"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas en comunidades fan"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The participation and inclusion of lesbians in fan communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La participación e inclusión de lesbianas en las comunidades de fans."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De participatie en inclusie van lesbische vrouwen in fan-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiskas deltagande och inkludering i fangemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002181"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000556"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000742"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001724"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002152","dc:identifier":"homoit0002152","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Boys' Love (Genre)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Boy's love"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Boys Love (Genre)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"ボーイズラブ"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Jongensliefde (Genre)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Boys' love (genre)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"BL"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Boys Love"},{"@language":"es","@value":"BL"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Boys love"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amor de chicos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"BL"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Boys Love"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Shōnen Ai"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Yaoi"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Boys love"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The manga and anime genre of fictional male-male romance created for a primarily female audience; sometimes used interchangeably with \"Yaoi\" in English (but not in Japanese)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El género de manga y anime de romance ficticio entre hombres creado para una audiencia principalmente femenina; a veces se utiliza indistintamente con \"Yaoi\" en inglés (pero no en japonés)."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Das Manga- und Anime-Genre fiktionaler Boy-Boy-Romanzen, in erster Linie für ein weibliches Publikum geschaffen; wird im Englischen manchmal synonym mit „Yaoi“ verwendet (im Japanischen jedoch nicht)."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"主に女性読者を対象として制作された、男性同士の恋愛を描いたフィクションの漫画・アニメのジャンル。英語では「ヤオイ」と混同して使われることもある（ただし、日本語ではボーイズラブは作品のジャンルであり、やおいはファンである）。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het manga- en anime-genre van fictieve romantiek tussen mannen, gemaakt voor een voornamelijk vrouwelijk publiek; soms door elkaar gebruikt met \"Yaoi\" (maar niet in het Japans)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Manga- och animegenre med fiktiva manliga kärleksrelationer skapad för en primärt kvinnlig publik. I engelska sammanhang används termen ibland synonymt med ”yaoi”, men detta gäller inte på japanska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002144"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002218"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003500"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000557"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004618","dc:identifier":"homoit0004618","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay neighborhoods"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Districts or portions of towns or cities that are (typically unofficial) social and/or residential centers for gay men and communities."},"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000558"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000558"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004619","dc:identifier":"homoit0004619","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian neighborhoods"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Districts or portions of towns or cities that are (typically unofficial) social and/or residential centers for lesbians and communities."},{"@language":"en","@value":"Districts or portions of towns or cities that are (typically unofficial) social and/or residential centers for lesbians and lesbian communities."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000558"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000558"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000559","dc:identifier":"homoit0000559","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gaydar"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Radar gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwulenradar"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gaydar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaydar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Gaydar"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gaydar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term describing a person's intuitive ability to identify others' sexual orientations."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término que describe la capacidad intuitiva de una persona para identificar las orientaciones sexuales de las demás personas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Begriff, der die intuitive Fähigkeit einer Person beschreibt, die sexuellen Orientierungen anderer zu erkennen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"intuïtieve vaardigheid om homoseksuelen, lesbiennes en biseksuelen te herkennen zonder objectieve informatie over hun seksuele geaardheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver en persons intuitiva förmåga att identifiera andras sexuella läggning."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000559"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gaydar"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003824","dc:identifier":"homoit0003824","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Neurogender"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Neurogender"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Neurogender"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the identity of neurodivergent people whose neurodivergence(s) greatly affect and cannot be unlinked from their gender. Only use to describe neurodivergent people who describe themselves as neurogender."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om de identiteit van neurodivergente personen te beschrijven, wiens neurodivergentie(s) hun gender sterk beïnvloeden en niet losgekoppeld kunnen worden van hun gender. Gebruik alleen voor neurodivergente personen die zichzelf als neurogender beschrijven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver identiteten hos neurodivergenta personer vars neurodivergens påverkar könsidentiteten i sådan grad att de inte kan särskiljas från varandra. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som neurogender."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003825"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004336"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002658"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004337"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561","dc:identifier":"homoit0000561","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender-affirming surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía de afirmación de género"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtsbestätigende Operation"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderbevestigende chirurgie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsbekräftande kirugi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender affirmation surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender confirmation surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender realignment surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender reassignment surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex reassignment surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"SRS"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender confirming surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender-confirming surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender affirming surgery"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtsangleichende Operation"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtsbejahende Operation"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geslachtsaanpassende chirurgie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various surgeries undertaken to affirm an individual's gender. Most often applied to transgender people, but may also refer to certain procedures undergone by cisgender and intersex people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de las diversas cirugías realizadas para afirmar el género de una persona. Se aplica con mayor frecuencia a personas transgénero, pero también puede referirse a ciertos procedimientos a los que se someten personas cisgénero e intersex."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Jede Art von Operation, die durchgeführt wird, um das Geschlecht einer Person zu bestätigen. Wird meist bei trans Personen angewendet, kann sich aber auch auf bestimmte Eingriffe beziehen, denen sich cis und inter* Menschen unterziehen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elk van de verschillende operaties die worden ondernomen om de gender van een persoon te bevestigen. Meestal toegepast op transgender personen, maar kan ook verwijzen naar bepaalde procedures die cisgender- en interseksuele personen ondergaan"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Olika typer av kirurgiska ingrepp som genomförs för att bekräfta en persons könsidentitet. Används oftast för att beskriva ingrepp som transpersoner genomgår, men kan även avse vissa ingrepp hos cispersoner och intersexpersoner."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003657"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001040"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001837"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001840"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001842"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001843"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001894"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001049"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001129"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001131"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001464"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003504"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2020000651"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderConfirmingSurgery"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000565","dc:identifier":"homoit0000565","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genderism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Generismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tvåkönsnorm"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender discrimination"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Discriminación de género"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genderism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The systematic belief that there are only two genders (men and women) and that individuals must conform to the gender they were assigned at or shortly after birth."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La creencia sistemática de que solo existen dos géneros (hombres y mujeres) y que las personas deben adaptarse al género que les fue asignado al nacer o poco después."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De systematische overtuiging dat er slechts twee genders zijn (mannen en vrouwen) en dat individuen zich moeten conformeren aan het gender dat hen bij of kort na de geboorte is toegewezen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En systematisk föreställning om att det endast finns två kön (man och kvinna) och att individer måste leva enligt det kön de tilldelades vid eller kort efter födseln."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003158"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001278"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003519"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000578","dc:identifier":"homoit0000578","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender segregation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Segregación por género"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gendersegregatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könssegregation"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Physical, legal, cultural, or rhetorical separation of people according to their gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Separación física, jurídica, cultural o retórica de las personas según su género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fysieke, juridische, culturele of retorische scheiding van mensen op basis van hun gender."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fysisk, juridisk, kulturell eller diskursiv åtskillnad av personer utifrån deras kön."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000563"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000575"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000578"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderSegregation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000580","dc:identifier":"homoit0000580","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gendercide"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Generocidio"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Genderzid"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gendercide"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsbaserat folkmord"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Gendercide"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gendercide"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The systematic killing of members of a specific gender for their gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El asesinato sistemático de miembros de un género específico debido a su género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die systematische Tötung von Angehörigen eines bestimmten Geschlechts aufgrund ihres Geschlechts."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Systematiskt dödande av personer av ett visst kön, enbart på grund av deras kön."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000580"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gendercide"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001816","dc:identifier":"homoit0001816","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender transgression"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transgresión de género"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Transgression de genre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender transgressie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsöverskridande"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Transgression du genre"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Transgression des genres"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Behaviors, acts, or forms of expression that contradict or do not conform to a given culture's norms surrounding gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Comportamientos, actos o formas de expresión que contradicen o no se conforman a las normas de una cultura determinada en torno al género."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Comportements, actes ou formes d'expression qui s'opposent ou ne sont pas conformes aux normes d'une culture en matière de genre."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handlingar, uttryck eller beteenden som bryter mot eller inte överensstämmer med en kulturs normer kring kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000562"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000581"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003066"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001899","dc:identifier":"homoit0001899","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender ambiguity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ambigüedad de género"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Ambiguïté de genre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"gender ambiguïteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsambivalens"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Ambiguïté du genre"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Transgression de genre"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender expression that does not conform to a single, distinct gender identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Expresión de género que no se ajusta a una identidad de género única e inconfundible."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Expression de genre qui ne correspond pas à une identité de genre unique et distincte."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderexpressie die niet overeenkomt met een enkele, duidelijke genderidentiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsuttryck som inte överensstämmer med en enda, tydlig könsidentitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003657","dc:identifier":"homoit0003657","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender-affirming care"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderbevestigende zorg"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsbekräftande vård"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender affirming care"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Social, psychological, behavioral, and medical interventions designed to support and affirm an individual's gender identity. Gender-affirming care includes but is not limited to equal access to health care facilities, counseling, puberty blockers, hormone therapy, and gender-affirming surgeries. It can also include resources to aid in social transition, such as affirming policies regarding name and pronoun changes, access to non-gendered restrooms and facilities, etc."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sociale, psychologische, gedragsmatige en medische interventies die zijn ontworpen om de genderidentiteit van een individu te ondersteunen en te bevestigen. Genderbevestigende zorg omvat, maar is niet beperkt tot, gelijke toegang tot gezondheidszorgfaciliteiten, counseling, puberteitsremmers, hormoontherapie en genderbevestigende operaties. Het kan ook middelen omvatten om te helpen bij de sociale transitie, zoals het bevestigen van beleid met betrekking tot naam- en voornaamwoordveranderingen, toegang tot niet-gendergebonden toiletten en faciliteiten, enz."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sociala, psykologiska, beteendemässiga och medicinska insatser som syftar till att stödja och bekräfta en individs könsidentitet. Könsbekräftande vård kan omfatta tillgång till hälso- och sjukvård, samtalsterapi, pubertetsblockerare, hormonterapi och könsbekräftande kirurgi. Det kan också inkludera stöd för social transition, såsom policies för namn- och pronomenbyte, tillgång till könsneutrala toaletter och andra anpassade utrymmen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003658"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003659"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004347"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2023000451"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584","dc:identifier":"homoit0000584","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bottom surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Reconstrucción genital"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bottom-Surgery"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bottom chirurgie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Underlivskirurgi (transpersoner)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genital reconstruction surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía de reconstrucción genital"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Genitalrekonstruktionschirurgie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Colloquial term for gender-affirming surgical alterations of the genitalia and/or reproductive organs."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término coloquial para las alteraciones quirúrgicas de los genitales y/o los órganos reproductivos que afirman el género."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Umgangssprachlicher Begriff für geschlechtsangleichende chirurgische Veränderungen der Genitalien und/oder Fortpflanzungsorgane."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Informele term voor genderbevestigende chirurgische veranderingen van de genitaliën en/of voortplantingsorganen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term term för könsbekräftande kirurgiska ingrepp av genitalier och/eller reproduktionsorgan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000658"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001060"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001097"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001844"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001845"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001847"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001850"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001851"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002840"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001840"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002847"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genitalReconstructionSurgery"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001040","dc:identifier":"homoit0001040","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Neovagina"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Neovagina"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Neovagina"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Neovaginor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvad vagina"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Neofitta"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A surgically constructed vagina; typically made using tissue grafted from other parts of the body."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una vagina construida quirúrgicamente; por lo general, se elabora con tejido injertado de otras partes del cuerpo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een chirurgisch geconstrueerde vagina, meestal gemaakt met weefsel uit andere delen van het lichaam"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgiskt konstruerad vagina, vanligtvis skapad med vävnadstransplantat från andra delar av kroppen."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001488"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001844"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001845"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001851"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/neovagina"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001837","dc:identifier":"homoit0001837","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Facial gender affirming surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía facial de afirmación de género"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtsbejahende Operationd es Gesichts"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderbevestigende gelaatschirurgie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsbekräftande ansiktskirurgi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Facial gender affirmation surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Facial gender confirmation surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Facial gender confirming surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía facial de confirmación de género"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderbevestigende chirurgie van het gezicht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsbekräftande ansiktsplastik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various surgeries that involve modifying the face or facial features to affirm the patient's gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de las diversas cirugías que implican modificar el rostro o los rasgos faciales para afirmar el género del paciente."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine von verschiedenen Operationen zur Feminisierung des Gesichts oder der Gesichtszüge, um bei den Betroffenen geschechtsbejahende Effekte zu erzielen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elk van de verschillende operaties waarbij het gezicht of de gelaatstrekken worden aangepast om het gender van de patiënt te bevestigen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgiska ingrepp som förändrar ansiktsdrag eller ansiktets struktur i syfte att bekräfta individens könsidentitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001838"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001839"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001464"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001849"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001842","dc:identifier":"homoit0001842","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminizing vocal surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía vocal feminizante"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Operative Stimmfeminisierung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feminiserende vocale chirurgie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Feminiserande röstkirurgi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"VFS"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Vocal feminization surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Voice feminization surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía de feminización vocal"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Glottoplastik"},{"@language":"de","@value":"VFS"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Stemfeminisatie chirugie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vocale feminisatie chirurgie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various surgical procedures undertaken to feminize the voice."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de los diversos procedimientos quirúrgicos realizados para feminizar la voz."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Jegliche chirurgischen Eingriffe, die zur Feminisierung der Stimme durchgeführt werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elk van de verschillende chirurgische ingrepen die zijn uitgevoerd om de stem te feminiseren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgiska ingrepp som syftar till att feminisera rösten."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001495"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001496"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001843"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001843","dc:identifier":"homoit0001843","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Masculinizing vocal surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía de masculinización de la voz"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Masculiniserende vocale chirurgie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Maskuliniserande röstkirurgi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Masculinization laryngoplasty"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Vocal masculinization surgery"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Voice masculinization surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía vocal masculinizante"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Stemmasculinisatie chirugie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vocale masculinisatie chirurgie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various surgical procedures undertaken to masculinize the voice."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de los diversos procedimientos quirúrgicos realizados para masculinizar la voz."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elk van de verschillende chirurgische ingrepen die zijn uitgevoerd om de stem te masculiniseren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Olika kirurgiska ingrepp som syftar till att maskulinisera rösten."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001495"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001496"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001842"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001894","dc:identifier":"homoit0001894","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Neophallus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Neofalo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Neofallus"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Neofallos"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Neopenis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förvärvad penis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Neokuk"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A surgically constructed penis; typically made using tissue grafts from other parts of the body."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un pene construido quirúrgicamente; por lo general, se elabora con tejido injertado de otras partes del cuerpo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een chirurgisch geconstrueerde penis, meestal gemaakt met weefseltransplantaten uit andere delen van het lichaam"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgiskt konstruerad penis, vanligtvis skapad med vävnadstransplantat från andra delar av kroppen."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001847"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001850"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001852"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001049","dc:identifier":"homoit0001049","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-operative"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No quirúrgico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-operatief"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke-opererad"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Oskuret"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Non-op"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The medical status of individuals who do not plan to undertake a surgical procedure. Commonly used to describe trans people who have not and do not plan to undertake gender affirming surgery."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El estado médico de las personas que no planean someterse a un procedimiento quirúrgico. Se utiliza comúnmente para describir a personas trans que no se han sometido ni planean someterse a una cirugía de afirmación de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De medische status van personen die niet van plan zijn een chirurgische ingreep uit te laten voeren. Vaak gebruikt om transgender personen te beschrijven die geen genderbevestigende operatie hebben ondergaan en dit ook niet van plan zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinsk status för personer som inte planerar att genomgå kirurgiska ingrepp. Används ofta för att beskriva transpersoner som inte har och inte planerar att genomgå könsbekräftande kirurgi."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001464"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000617"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001047"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/nonOperative"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001129","dc:identifier":"homoit0001129","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Post-operative"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Post-quirúrgico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Post-operatief"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Postoperativa"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Post-operatorio"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Post quirúrgico"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Post-op"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who have recently undergone a surgical operation; commonly used to describe trans people who have undergone gender affirming surgery."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que recientemente hayan atravesado una operación quirúrgica; se utiliza comúnmente para describir a personas trans que han atravesado una cirugía de afirmación de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die onlangs een chirurgische ingreep hebben ondergaan; vaak gebruikt om trans personen te beschrijven die een genderbevestigende operatie hebben ondergaan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har genomgått ett kirurgiskt ingrepp. Används ofta om transpersoner som genomgått könsbekräftande kirurgi."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001464"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85105563"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/postOperative"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001131","dc:identifier":"homoit0001131","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pre-operative"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pre-quirúrgico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pre-operatief"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Preoperativa"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Pre-operatorio"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pre quirúrgico"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pre-op"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The medical status of individuals who plan to undertake a surgical procedure but have not yet done so. Commonly used to describe trans people who have not yet undergone gender affirming surgery but plan to do so."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El estado médico de las personas que planean someterse a un procedimiento quirúrgico pero aún no lo han hecho. Se utiliza comúnmente para describir a personas trans que aún no se han sometido a una cirugía de afirmación de género pero que planean hacerlo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De medische status van personen die van plan zijn een chirurgische ingreep te ondergaan, maar dit nog niet hebben gedaan. Vaak gebruikt om transgender personen te beschrijven die nog geen genderbevestigende operatie hebben ondergaan, maar wel van plan zijn dit te doen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinsk status hos personer som planerar att genomgå ett kirurgiskt ingrepp men ännu inte gjort det. Används ofta om transpersoner som planerar könsbekräftande kirurgi."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001464"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85106377"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/preOperative"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001464","dc:identifier":"homoit0001464","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transitioning status"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estado de transición"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transitiestatus"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transitionsstatus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe a person’s current status in their gender transition."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir el estado actual de una persona en su transición de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om de huidige status van een persoon in zijn gender transitie te beschrijven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver en persons nuvarande status i sin könstransition."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001047"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001049"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001129"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001131"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001834"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001835"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001836"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001837"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001838"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001839"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004327"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transitioningStatus"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003504","dc:identifier":"homoit0003504","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender health care bans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prohibiciones de asistencia médica transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verboden op transgender gezondheidszorg"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förbud mot könsbekräftande vård"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Prohibiciones de asistencia médica trans"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Laws or policies instituted to prevent trans and non-binary individuals from seeking medical treatment or gender-affirming care, including but not limited to surgery, hormone treatment, and mental health care. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Leyes o políticas instituidas para impedir que las personas trans y no binarixs busquen tratamiento o atención médica para la afirmación de su género, incluidos, entre otros, la cirugía, el tratamiento hormonal y la atención de salud mental."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wetten of beleidsmaatregelen die zijn ingesteld om te voorkomen dat transgender- en non-binaire personen medische behandeling of genderbevestigende zorg zoeken, waaronder maar niet beperkt tot operaties, hormoonbehandelingen en geestelijke gezondheidszorg."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lagar eller policys som begränsar transpersoners och ickebinära personers möjligheter att ta del av medicinsk behandling och könsbekräftande vård, däribland kirurgi, hormonbehandling och insatser för psykisk hälsa."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003499"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004327"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004347"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002589","dc:identifier":"homoit0002589","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender role stereotypes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estereotipos de rol de género"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Stereotypen van genderrollen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stereotypa könsroller"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender stereotypes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estereotipos de género"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Widely held but oversimplified and often offensive ideas regarding gender roles, which are socially-determined rules or standards for gendered behaviors. Use the term \"Gender roles\" to describe gender roles as a whole, rather than stereotypes related to them."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ideas generalizadas pero demasiado simplificadas y a menudo ofensivas sobre los roles de género, que son reglas o estándares socialmente determinados para comportamientos de género. Utilice el término \"Roles de género\" para describir los roles de género como un todo, en lugar de estereotipos relacionados a ellos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wijdverbreide, maar te simpele en vaak aanstootgevende ideeën over genderrollen, die sociaal bepaalde regels of standaarden zijn voor gendergerelateerd gedrag. Gebruik de term 'genderrollen' om genderrollen als geheel te beschrijven, in plaats van de stereotypen die daaraan gerelateerd zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Allmänt spridda men förenklade och ofta kränkande föreställningar om könsroller – det vill säga socialt definierade regler eller normer för könskodade beteenden. Använd termen ”könsroller” för att beskriva könsroller generellt, snarare än stereotyper kring dem."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000563"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000575"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001241"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000564","dc:identifier":"homoit0000564","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender blending"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mezcla de género"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender blending"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gender blending"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Gender blending"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender expression that involves blending dress and behaviors associated with different genders. Do not use to describe the identities of genderqueer or non-binary people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Expresión de género que implica mezclar vestimenta y comportamientos asociados a diferentes géneros. No debe utilizarse para describir las identidades de personas queer o no binarias."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderexpressie waarbij kleding en gedrag dat met verschillende genders wordt geassocieerd, wordt gemengd. Niet gebruiken om de identiteit van genderqueer of niet-binaire personen te beschrijven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsuttryck som innebär att man blandar klädstil och beteenden förknippade med olika kön. Används inte för att beskriva identiteter som är genderqueer eller ickebinära."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderBlending"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001278","dc:identifier":"homoit0001278","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Discrimination, prejudice, or bias directed against a particular sex or gender based on the assumption that this sex or gender is intrinsically inferior to another."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Discriminación, prejuicio o predisposición dirigida contra un sexo o género en particular basado en el supuesto de que ese sexo o género es intrínsecamente inferior a otro."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Discriminatie, vooroordelen of vooringenomenheid gericht tegen een bepaald geslacht of gender op basis van de veronderstelling dat dit geslacht of gender intrinsiek inferieur is aan een ander."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Diskriminering, fördomar eller partiskhet riktad mot ett visst kön eller en viss könsidentitet baserat på antagandet att detta kön är underlägset ett annat."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000565"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000619"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001293"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002183"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002259"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003519"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85120678"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001278"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002700","dc:identifier":"homoit0002700","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender dysphoria in youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disforia de género en jóvenes"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtsdysphorie bei Jugendlichen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderdysforie bij jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsdysfori hos unga"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender dysphoria in adolescence"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender dysphoria in adolescents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disforia de género en la adolescencia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disforia de género en los adolescentes"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gender-Dysphorie bei Jugendlichen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechts-Dysphorie bei Jugendlichen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderdysforie tijdens adolescentie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A psychological diagnosis (replacing the outdated and offensive \"gender identity disorder\") used to describe the sense of unease or dissatisfaction an individual feels as a result of incongruence between their gender identity and their assigned gender, gender expression, and/or the way their gender is perceived by others. This term is also used colloquially by individuals to describe the discomfort and distress they experience as a result of this incongruence. Though gender dysphoria is often associated with trans people, people of any identity may experience gender dysphoria when they do not feel \"right\" in their body or the way their gender is being expressed. Use this particular term for works about adolescents (people between the ages of childhood and adulthood) who experience or have experience gender dysphoria."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un diagnóstico psicológico (que reemplaza al término anticuado y ofensivo de \"trastorno de identidad de género\") utilizado para describir la sensación de malestar o insatisfacción que siente una persona como resultado de la incongruencia entre su identidad de género y su género asignado, su expresión de género y/o la forma en que su género es percibido por otras personas. Este término también se utiliza coloquialmente por personas para describir el malestar y la angustia que experimentan como resultado de esta incongruencia. Aunque la disforia de género a menudo se asocia con las personas trans, las personas de cualquier identidad pueden experimentar disforia de género cuando no se sienten \"bien\" con su cuerpo o con la forma en que se expresan su género. Utilícese este término particular para trabajos sobre adolescentes (personas entre la niñez y la edad adulta) que experimentan o han experimentado disforia de género"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine psychologische Diagnose (die den veralteten und beleidigenden Begriff „Geschlechtsidentitätsstörung” ersetzt), die verwendet wird, um das Gefühl des Unbehagens oder der Unzufriedenheit zu beschreiben, das eine Person aufgrund der Diskrepanz zwischen ihrer Geschlechtsidentität und ihrem zugewiesenen Geschlecht, ihrem Geschlechtsausdruck und/oder der Art und Weise, wie ihr Geschlecht von anderen wahrgenommen wird, empfindet. Dieser Begriff wird auch umgangssprachlich von Personen verwendet, um das Unbehagen und die Belastung zu beschreiben, die sie aufgrund dieser Diskrepanz empfinden. Obwohl Geschlechtsdysphorie oft mit trans Personen in Verbindung gebracht wird, können Menschen jeder Identität Geschlechtsdysphorie empfinden, wenn sie sich in ihrem Körper oder in der Art und Weise, wie ihr Geschlecht ausgedrückt wird, nicht „richtig“ fühlen. Dieser spezifische Begriff wird für Werke über Jugendliche verwendet, die Geschlechtsdysphorie erleben oder erlebt haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een psychologische diagnose (ter vervanging van de verouderde en aanstootgevende ‘genderidentiteitsstoornis’) die wordt gebruikt om het gevoel van onbehagen of ontevredenheid te beschrijven dat een individu voelt als gevolg van de incongruentie tussen hun genderidentiteit en hun toegewezen gender, genderexpressie en/of de manier waarop hun gender door anderen wordt waargenomen. Deze term wordt ook in de volksmond door personen gebruikt om het ongemak en de angst te beschrijven die zij ervaren als gevolg van deze incongruentie. Hoewel genderdysforie vaak wordt geassocieerd met transgender personen, kunnen personen van welke identiteit dan ook genderdysforie ervaren als ze zich niet 'goed' voelen in hun lichaam of in de manier waarop hun gender wordt uitgedrukt. Gebruik deze specifieke term voor werken over adolescenten (mensen tussen de kindertijd en de volwassenheid) die genderdysforie ervaren of hebben ervaren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En psykologisk diagnos (som ersätter den föråldrade och stigmatiserande ”könsidentitetsstörning”) som beskriver den obehagskänsla eller otillfredsställelse en ungdom (person i åldern mellan barndom och vuxenliv) upplever på grund av att könsidentiteten inte stämmer överens med det tilldelade könet, könsuttrycket och/eller hur omgivningen uppfattar könet. Termen används också informellt av ungdomar för att beskriva det obehag och den stress som uppstår i detta glapp."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000567"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002256"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000567"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000572","dc:identifier":"homoit0000572","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender identity disorder"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trastorno de identidad de género"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtsidentitätsstörung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderidentiteitsstoornis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsidentitetsstörning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"An obsolete psychological diagnosis that medicalizes trans identities and practices; only use in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un diagnóstico psicológico obsoleto que medicaliza las identidades y prácticas trans; utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine veraltete psychologische Diagnose, die trans Identitäten und Praktiken medizinisiert; nur in historischen Zusammenhängen verwenden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En föråldrad psykologisk diagnos som medikaliserade transidentiteter och transpraktiker. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000567"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001381"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85053731"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderIdentityDisorder"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003910","dc:identifier":"homoit0003910","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transmedicalism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transmedicalisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmedikalism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Transmedicalization"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The belief that being transgender is primarily a medical issue and that gender dysphoria and the desire to medically transition are both necessary to be considered \"truly\" transgender."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De overtuiging dat transgender-zijn in de eerste plaats een medisch probleem is en dat genderdysforie en de wens om medisch te transformeren beide noodzakelijk zijn om als 'echt' transgender beschouwd te worden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Övertygelsen att det att vara transperson främst är ett medicinskt problem och att både könsdysfori och önskan att genomgå en medicinsk övergång är nödvändiga för att betraktas som ”en riktig” transperson."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001006"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000567"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003984"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003984","dc:identifier":"homoit0003984","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transmedicalists"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transmedicalisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmedikalister"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Truscum"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who believe that being transgender is primarily a medical issue and that gender dysphoria and the desire to medically transition are both necessary to be considered \"truly\" transgender."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die ervan overtuigd zijn dat transgender-zijn in de eerste plaats een medisch probleem is en dat genderdysforie en de wens om medisch te transformeren beide noodzakelijk zijn om als 'echt' transgender beschouwd te worden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som anser att trans främst är ett medicinskt problem och att både könsdysfori och önskan att genomgå en medicinsk övergång är nödvändiga för att betraktas som ”en riktig” transperson."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003910"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000567"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003984"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000576","dc:identifier":"homoit0000576","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender swapping"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtertausch"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juego de roles de género"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender swapping"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsväxlingar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender roleplay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechterwechsel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gender-Roleplay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechterrollenspiel"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intercambio de género"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Genderswap"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A media trope (commonly used in fanfiction and fanart) in which one or more characters switch binary sexes (e.g., a cisgender man transforms into a cisgender woman), often temporarily."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Erzählmodus (häufig in Fanfiction und Fanart verwendet), bei dem eine oder mehrere Figuren das binäre Geschlecht wechseln (z. B. verwandelt sich ein cis Mann in eine cis Frau), oft vorübergehend."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un tropo mediático (comúnmente utilizado en fanfiction y fanart) en el que uno o más personajes cambian de sexo binario (por ejemplo, un hombre cisgénero se transforma en una mujer cisgénero), a menudo de forma temporal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"genderverwisseling, gebruikt in relatie tot rollenspel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En medietrop (vanligt i fanfiction och fanart) där en eller flera karaktärer byter binärt kön (t.ex. att en ciskönad man förvandlas till en ciskönad kvinna), ofta tillfälligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001242"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002160"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002162"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002171"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002184"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002210"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderSwapping"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000606","dc:identifier":"homoit0000606","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hair removal"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Depilación"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Haarentfernung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ontharing"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hårborttagning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Shaving"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Waxing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Eliminación del vello"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Afeitarse"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Rasieren"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Waxing"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The process of removing hair from the body through shaving, waxing, depilatories, laser hair removal, etc. May have a social component related to gender identity and/or have an erotic component."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El proceso de eliminación del vello del cuerpo mediante afeitado, depilación, productos depilatorios, depilación láser, etc. Puede tener un componente social relacionado con la identidad de género y/o tener un componente erótico."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Der Prozess der Entfernung von Körperbehaarung durch Rasieren, Wachsen, Enthaarungsmittel, Laser-Haarentfernung usw. Kann eine soziale Komponente in Bezug auf die Genderidentität und/oder eine erotische Komponente haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het proces van het verwijderen van haar van het lichaam door middel van scheren, harsen, ontharingsmiddelen, laserontharing, enz. Kan een sociale component hebben die verband houdt met genderidentiteit en/of een erotische component"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Processen att avlägsna kroppshår genom rakning, vaxning, depilatoriska medel, laser med mera. Kan ha en social koppling till könsidentitet och/eller en erotisk komponent."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003049"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85058312"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hairRemoval"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001476","dc:identifier":"homoit0001476","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tucking (Phallus)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Remetimiento (Falo)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tucking (Fallus)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tuckning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tucking"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tucking"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Remetido"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ocultar y pegar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tucking"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tuckande"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang term describing various methods used to visually conceal the penis to give a flatter appearance in clothing."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga que describe varios métodos utilizados para ocultar visualmente el pene y dar una apariencia más plana a la ropa."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Argot term die verschillende methoden beschrijft die worden gebruikt om de penis visueel te verbergen om een platter uiterlijk in kleding te geven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slangterm för tekniker som syftar till att på olika sätt visuellt dölja penis med syfte och ge plattare uttryck under kläder"}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/tucking"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001496","dc:identifier":"homoit0001496","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Voice therapy (Gender)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terapia vocal (género)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Stemtherapie (Gender)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Röstträning (transpersoner)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Voice therapy (Transgender)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Voice therapy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terapia vocal (Transgénero)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Terapia vocal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Röstterapi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any non-surgical technique used to make the human voice sound either more feminine or masculine."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquier técnica no quirúrgica utilizada para hacer que la voz humana suene más femenina o masculina."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"iedere niet-chirurgische techniek om de menselijke stem mannelijker of vrouwelijker te doen klinken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke-kirurgisk metod för att få rösten att låta mer feminin eller mer maskulin."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001366"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001468"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001842"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001843"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/voiceTherapyTransgender"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001790","dc:identifier":"homoit0001790","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Packers (Phallus)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Packers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verpakkers (Fallus)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Packer (fallos)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Prótesis de pene"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pack n' play"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Packers (fallos)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Padding or phallic objects designed to be worn in the front of an individual's pants or underwear to give the appearance of having a bulge."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Objetos acolchados o fálicos diseñados para usarse en la parte delantera de los pantalones o la ropa interior de una persona para dar la apariencia de tener un protuberancia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vulling of fallische voorwerpen die zijn ontworpen om voor in de broek of het ondergoed van een persoon te worden gedragen om de indruk te wekken dat hij een bobbel heeft"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stoppning eller fallosformade föremål som bärs framtill i byxor eller underkläder bland annat för att ge intryck av en utbuktning. Vissa packers fungerar även som STP och pack n' play, det vill säga packers som går att kissa och/eller ha sex med."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001067"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-12-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001820","dc:identifier":"homoit0001820","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transmasculinity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transmasculinidad"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Transmasculinité"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transmasculiniteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmaskulinitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Masculine-aligned identities or practices of trans people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidades o prácticas masculinas de personas trans."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identités ou pratiques masculines des personnes transgenres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannelijke identiteiten of praktijken van transgender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Maskulint orienterade identiteter eller uttryck bland transpersoner."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000995"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001466"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001643"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001653"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000581","dc:identifier":"homoit0000581","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genderfuck"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Genderfuck"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Genderfuck"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Genderfuck"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderfuck"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genderfuck"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Genre non conforme"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Subversion des genres"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of gender expression that seeks to subvert the gender binary or gender roles by mixing and messing with (or \"fucking with\") traditionally masculine and feminine components. Typically used to describe gender practices and presentation, though some people identify as \"genderfuck\" or as \"genderfuckers.\" Only use to describe people and the practices of people who self-identify with genderfuck."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de expresión de género que busca subvertir el binario de género o los roles de género mezclando y jugando (o \"jodiendo\") con componentes tradicionalmente masculinos y femeninos. Normalmente se utiliza para describir prácticas y presentaciones de género, aunque algunas personas se identifican como \"genderfuck\" o \"genderfuckers\". Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas y las prácticas de las personas que se autoidentifiquen con genderfuck."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Form des Geschlechtsausdrucks, die darauf abzielt, die Geschlechterbinarität oder Geschlechterrollen zu unterlaufen, indem traditionell männliche und weibliche Elemente miteinander vermischt und bewusst durcheinandergebracht werden (oder mit ihnen „gespielt“ wird). Wird typischerweise verwendet, um geschlechtliche Praktiken und Präsentationsformen zu beschreiben, wobei sich einige Personen auch selbst als „Genderfuck“ oder als „Genderfucker“ identifizieren. Nur verwenden, um Personen und Praktiken von Personen zu beschreiben, die sich selbst mit Genderfuck identifizieren."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Forme d'expression de genre qui vise à subvertir la binarité de genre ou les rôles de genre en mixant et en brouillant (ou en « jouant avec ») les caractéristiques traditionnellement masculines et féminines. Ce terme est généralement utilisé pour décrire les pratiques et la présentation de genre, bien que certaines personnes s'identifient comme « genderfuck » ou comme des « genderfuckers ». À n'utiliser que pour décrire les personnes et les pratiques de celles qui s'identifient elles-mêmes au « genderfuck »."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van genderexpressie die de genderbinaire of genderrollen probeert te ondermijnen door te mixen en rommelen met traditioneel mannelijke en vrouwelijke componenten. Meestal gebruikt om genderpraktijken en -presentatie te beschrijven, hoewel sommige mensen zich identificeren als 'genderfuck' of 'genderfuckers'. Alleen gebruiken om personen en de praktijken van mensen te beschrijven die zichzelf identificeren met genderfuck."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av könsuttryck som syftar till att utmana könsbinaritet och könsroller genom att blanda och störa (eller ”fucka med”) traditionellt maskulina och feminina uttryck. Används oftast för att beskriva könspresentation och praktik, men vissa identifierar sig även som ”genderfuck” eller ”genderfucker”. Används endast för att beskriva personer och praktiker hos personer som själva identifierar sig med begreppet."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000568"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001816"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000581"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderfuck"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001071","dc:identifier":"homoit0001071","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pangender identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad pangénero"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité pangenre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pangender identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pangender-identitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender identity that encompasses multiple or all genders."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género que abarca múltiples o todos los géneros."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité de genre qui englobe plusieurs ou tous les genres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderidentiteit inclusief meerdere of alle genders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsidentitet som omfattar flera eller alla kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001072"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/pangenderIdentity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001415","dc:identifier":"homoit0001415","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transidentitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Identity term used to describe people who cross or transgress the  gender they were assigned at birth."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término identitario utilizado para describir a las personas que traspasan o transgreden el género que les fue asignado al nacer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Identiteitsterm die wordt gebruikt om personen te beschrijven die zich niet houden aan het gender dat hen bij de geboorte is toegewezen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Identitetsterm som används för att beskriva personer som överskrider eller bryter mot det kön de tilldelades vid födseln."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001400"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001563"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007005095"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderIdentity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001473","dc:identifier":"homoit0001473","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trigender identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad trigénero"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité trigenre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trigender identeit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trigenderidentitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender identity including three genders, typically male, female, and a third (often non-binary) gender."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género que incluye tres géneros, típicamente masculino, femenino y un tercer género (a menudo no binario)."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité de genre comprenant trois genres, typiquement masculin, féminin et un troisième genre (souvent non-binaire)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderidentiteit met drie geslachten, meestal mannelijk, vrouwelijk en een derde (vaak niet-binair) geslacht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsidentitet som omfattar tre kön, vanligtvis man, kvinna och ett tredje (ofta ickebinärt) kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001474"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/trigenderIdentity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001670","dc:identifier":"homoit0001670","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Xenogender identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad xenogénero"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Xénogenre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Xenogender identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Xenogenderidentitet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"fr","@value":"Maverique"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary gender identity that is not defined in relation to human understandings of gender (i.e., female or male, woman or man), but instead in relation to animals, plants, or other things"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género no binaria que no se define en relación a la interpretación humana del género (es decir, femenino o masculino, mujer u hombre), sino en relación a animales, plantas u otras cosas."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité de genre non-binaire qui n'est pas définie par rapport à la compréhension humaine du genre (c'est-à-dire femelle ou mâle, femme ou homme), mais plutôt par rapport aux animaux, aux plantes ou autres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Niet-binaire genderidentiteit die niet wordt gedefinieerd in relatie tot menselijke opvattingen over gender (d.w.z. vrouwelijk of mannelijk), maar in plaats daarvan in relatie tot dieren, planten of andere dingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär könsidentitet som inte definieras i relation till mänskliga könsförståelser (t.ex. kvinna eller man), utan i relation till djur, växter eller andra fenomen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001048"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001671"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/xenogender"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001918","dc:identifier":"homoit0001918","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgenderqueer identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad transgenderqueer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgenderqueer identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transgenderqueer-identitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgenderqueerness"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transgéneroqueer"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transgenderqueerness"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Identity term used to describe the intersection of trans identity and genderqueer identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término identitario utilizado para describir la intersección de la identidad trans y la identidad genderqueer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Identiteitsterm die wordt gebruikt om de intersectie van transidentiteit en genderqueer-identiteit te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Identitetsterm som beskriver skärningspunkten mellan transidentitet och genderqueer-identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001668"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001920","dc:identifier":"homoit0001920","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad no binaria"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité non-binaire"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär identitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad no-binaria"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender identity that exists outside of the gender binary; may be used as a specific gender identity or as an umbrella term in the Euro-American gender system for gender identities outside of the gender binary."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género que existe fuera del binario de género; puede utilizarse como una identidad de género específica o como un término general en el sistema de género euroamericano para identidades de género fuera del binario de género."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité de genre qui existe en dehors de la binarité; peut être utilisée comme une identité de genre spécifique ou comme un terme générique pour les identités de genre en dehors de la binarité."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderidentiteit die zich buiten het genderbinaire bevindt; kan worden gebruikt als een specifieke genderidentiteit of als een overkoepelende term voor genderidentiteiten buiten het genderbinaire"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsidentitet som ligger utanför det binära könssystemet och som antingen kan avse en enskild könsidentitet eller fungera som samlingsterm för könsidentiteter utanför könsbinariteten inom det euro-amerikanska könssystemet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001048"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001921","dc:identifier":"homoit0001921","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genderqueer identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad genderqueer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Genderqueere Identität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité genderqueer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderqueer identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genderqueer-identitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genderqueerness"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Variante de género"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Género de amplia gama"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Genderqueerness"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gender-Queerness"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité de genre queer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"GQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender identity that does not conform to the gender binary and emphasizes alignment with queer politics."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género que no se conforma al binario de género y enfatiza la alineación con la política queer."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Geschlechtsidentität, die nicht dem binären Geschlechtermodell entspricht und die Identifikation mit der queeren Politik betont."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité de genre qui ne se conforme pas à la binarité des genres et qui met l'accent sur un alignement avec la politique queer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderidentiteit die niet in overeenstemming is met de genderbinariteit en de nadruk legt op afstemming met queer-politiek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsidentitet som inte följer könsbinariteten och som betonar en koppling till queera politiska perspektiv."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000582"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001195"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001668"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001922","dc:identifier":"homoit0001922","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender non-conforming identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género no conformista"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender niet-conforme identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsöverskridande identitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender nonconforming identity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender-nonconforming identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género no conforme"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender identity that does not conform to the gender binary, not to be confused with gender non-conforming practices engaged in by cisgender people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad de género que no se conforma al binario de género, que no debe confundirse con las prácticas no conformes con el género que practican las personas cisgénero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderidentiteit die niet in overeenstemming is met de genderbinariteit, niet te verwarren met niet-conforme genderpraktijken van cisgender-mensen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsidentitet som inte följer könsbinariteten. Ska inte förväxlas med könsuttryck hos cispersoner som inte följer traditionella könsnormer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000574"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001756"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002388"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007003716"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001563","dc:identifier":"homoit0001563","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trans"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Trans"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trans"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans*"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trans*"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Umbrella term used to describe individuals who \"trans\" gender regardless of their identification; sometimes used as a way to historicize non-binary identities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general utilizado para describir a las personas de género \"trans\" independientemente de su identificación; a veces, se utiliza como una forma de historizar identidades no binarias."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Terme parapluie servant à désigner les personnes dont l'identité de genre ne correspond pas au sexe qui leur a été assigné à la naissance; parfois utilisé comme un moyen d'historiciser les identités non-binaires."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term die wordt gebruikt om personen te beschrijven die transgender zijn, ongeacht identificatie of als een manier om niet-binaire identiteit te historiseren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samlingsterm som används för att beskriva personer som överskrider eller förändrar kön, oavsett hur de identifierar sig. Används ibland för att historisera ickebinära identiteter."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001415"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001463"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001468"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001469"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001563"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/trans"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001671","dc:identifier":"homoit0001671","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Xenogender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas xenogénero"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes xénogenres"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Xenogender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Xenogenderpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who identifies their gender in relation to non-human understandings of gender and relates to animals, plants, or other things."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que identifica su género en relación a interpretaciones no humanas del género y se relaciona a animales, plantas u otras cosas."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui identifient leur genre par rapport aux conceptions non humaines du genre et se rapportant aux animaux, aux plantes ou autres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die hun gender identificeert met betrekking tot niet-menselijke opvattingen over gender en betrekking heeft op dieren, planten of andere dingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som definierar sitt kön i relation till icke-mänskliga förståelser av kön och som identifierar sig med djur, växter eller andra ting."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001048"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001670"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001671"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/xenogenderPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002884","dc:identifier":"homoit0002884","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"X gender markers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marcadores de género X"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"X gender-aanduidingen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"X-könsmarkörer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender markers that indicate a person is NOT cisgender. X gender markers may be assigned to or adopted by intersex people or transgender people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marcadores de género que indican que una persona NO es cisgénero. Los marcadores de género X pueden ser asignados a o adoptados por personas intersex o transgénero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender-aanduidingen die aangeven dat een persoon NIET cisgender is. X-geslachtsmarkeringen kunnen worden toegekend aan of overgenomen door intersekse personen of transgender personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsmarkörer som indikerar att en person inte är cis. X-markörer kan tilldelas eller användas av intersexpersoner eller transpersoner. Används inte i Sverige."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000573"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001646"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000712"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000574","dc:identifier":"homoit0000574","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender non-conforming people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de género no conformistas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender niet-conforme personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könsöverskridande personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas de género no conforme"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who identify outside, transgress, or do not conform to a given culture's gender roles or expectations. Only use in reference to people who self-identity as gender non-conforming. Do not use to describe cisgender people whose dress or behaviors do not conform to gender roles or expectations."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se autoidentifican fuera de, transgreden o no se conforman con los roles o expectativas de género de una determinada cultura. Utilícese únicamente en referencia a personas que se autoidentifiquen como no conformes con su género. No se debe utilizar para describir a personas cisgénero cuya vestimenta o comportamiento no se conforma a los roles o expectativas de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zich buiten de genderrollen of -verwachtingen van een bepaalde cultuur identificeren, deze overtreden of zich hieraan niet conformeren. Alleen gebruiken om te verwijzen naar personen die zichzelf identificeren als gender niet-conform. Niet gebruiken om personen te beschrijven waarvan kleding of gedrag niet in overeenstemming is met genderrollen of -verwachtingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som identifierar sig utanför, bryter mot eller inte följer könsroller eller förväntningar i en viss kultur. Används endast för att beskriva personer som själva identifierar sig som könsöverskridande. Ska inte användas för att beskriva cispersoner som klär sig eller beter sig på sätt som inte följer könsnormer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001756"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001922"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2017004882"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderNonConformingPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000778","dc:identifier":"homoit0000778","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian separatism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Separatismo lesbiana"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbisch separatisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk separatism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ideological, social, cultural, and physical separation between men and women or between lesbians and heterosexual women."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Separación ideológica, social, cultural y física entre hombres y mujeres o entre lesbianas y mujeres heterosexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"ideologische, sociale, culturele en soms fysieke scheiding tussen mannen en vrouwen of tussen lesbische en heteroseksuele vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ideologisk, social, kulturell och fysisk åtskillnad mellan män och kvinnor, eller mellan lesbiska och heterosexuella kvinnor."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000746"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000757"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000575"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2009003403"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000778"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianSeparatism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002160","dc:identifier":"homoit0002160","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fanfiction tropes and genres"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tropos y géneros del fanficcion"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fanfiction-Tropen und -Genres"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fanfictie tropen en genres"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fanfiction troper och genrer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fanfic tropes and genres"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tropos y géneros de fanfic"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fanfiction-Motive und -Genres"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Tropes and genres commonly used in fanfiction. Examples include \"there was only one bed\" and \"enemies to lovers\" romance plots."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tropos y géneros comúnmente utilizados en el fanfiction. Los ejemplos incluyen tramas románticas de \"solo había una cama\" y de \"enemigos a amantes\"."},{"@language":"de","@value":"In Fanfiction häufig verwendete Tropen und Genres. Beispiele hierfür sind Liebesgeschichten mit Handlungen wie „Es gab nur ein Bett“ und „Von Feinden zu Liebenden“."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tropen en genres die vaak worden gebruikt in fanfictie. Voorbeelden zijn \"er was maar één bed\" en \"vijanden van geliefden\" romantische plots"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Berättelsetroper och genrer som ofta förekommer i fanfiction. Exempel är ”det fanns bara en säng” och ”fiender blir älskare”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002159"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002143"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002153"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002176"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000576"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002187"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002162","dc:identifier":"homoit0002162","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Femslash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Femslash"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Femslash"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Femslash"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Femslash"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Altfic"},{"@language":"en","@value":"F/F slash"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Femmeslash"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Girlslash"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Ladyslash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Altfic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"F/F slash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Femmeslash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Girlslash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ladyslash"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Altfic"},{"@language":"de","@value":"F/F slash"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Femmeslash"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Girlslash"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ladyslash"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"F/F slash"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Femmeslash"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Girlslash"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ladyslash"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A genre of fanworks in which two or more women are placed in a sexual or romantic situation with one another. Works of femslash are commonly erotic or pornographic. In recognition of the fact that the term \"slash\" has recently been broadened to include LGBTQ+ relationships other than those between two men, slash terms (e.g., Slash art, Slash roleplay, Slash vidding) should be used to describe specific types of femslash."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Género de fanworks en el que dos o más mujeres se encuentran en una situación sexual o romántica. Las obras de femslash suelen ser eróticas o pornográficas. En reconocimiento del hecho de que el término \"slash\" se ha ampliado recientemente para incluir relaciones LGBTQ+ más allá de las relaciones entre dos hombres, los términos \"slash\" (por ejemplo, \"slash art\", \"slash roleplay\", \"slash vidding\") deben utilizarse para describir tipos específicos de femslash."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Genre der Fanfiction, in denen zwei oder mehrere Frauen in einer sexuellen oder romantischen Situation miteinander dargestellt werden. Femslash-Werke sind in der Regel erotisch oder pornografisch."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een genre van fanwerken waarin twee of meer vrouwen in een seksuele of romantische situatie met elkaar worden geplaatst. Werken van femslash zijn vaak erotisch of pornografisch. Gezien het feit dat de term 'slash' recentelijk is uitgebreid tot andere LHBTQ+-relaties dan die tussen twee mannen, moeten slash-termen (bijv. Slash art, Slash roleplay, Slash vidding) worden gebruikt om specifieke soorten femslash te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En genre av fanverk där två eller flera kvinnor placeras i en sexuell eller romantisk relation med varandra. Femslash-verk är ofta erotiska eller pornografiska. Med tanke på att termen ”slash” numera även omfattar andra hbtq+-relationer än de mellan män, bör slash-termer (t.ex. Slash-konst, Slash-rollspel, Slash-vidding) användas även för att beskriva specifika former av femslash."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002200"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000742"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001597"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000576"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002220"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002221"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002171","dc:identifier":"homoit0002171","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gender in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Género en el fandom"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlecht im Fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gender in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kön och genus inom fandom"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Gender im Fandom"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Issues and discussions about gender in fan spaces and works."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuestiones y discusiones sobre el género en espacios y obras de fans."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Themen und Diskussionen über Geschlecht in Fanszenen und Fanwerken."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kwesties en discussies over gender in fanruimtes en werken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frågor och diskussioner om kön i fangemenskaper och fanverk."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002156"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002174"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002175"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002182"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002183"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002185"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002211"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002212"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002213"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002216"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000576"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002184","dc:identifier":"homoit0002184","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mpreg"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mpreg"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mpreg"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mpreg"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"M-preg"},{"@language":"es","@value":"M-preg"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The fandom trope in which cisgender men can become pregnant. This term should not be used to describe pregnant trans men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El tropo del fandom en el que los hombres cisgénero pueden quedar embarazados. Este término no debe utilizarse para describir a hombres trans embarazados."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De fandom-troop waarin cisgender-mannen zwanger kunnen worden. Deze term mag niet worden gebruikt om zwangere transmannen te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En fanfiction-trop där cismän kan bli gravida. Termen ska inte användas för att beskriva gravida transmän."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002186"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000576"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000859"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002210","dc:identifier":"homoit0002210","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transfic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transfic"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transfic"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transfic"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe fanfiction about trans characters, typically characters who are not stated to be transgender, transsexual, or gender diverse in the canon text"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir fanfiction sobre personajes trans, generalmente personajes que no se declaran como transgénero, transexual o de género diverso en el texto canónico."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om fanfictie over transpersonages te beschrijven, meestal personages waarvan in de canontekst niet wordt vermeld dat ze transgender, transseksueel of genderdivers zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver fanfiction om transkaraktärer, vanligtvis karaktärer som i originaltexten inte beskrivs som transpersoner, transsexuella eller könsöverskridande."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002159"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000576"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001414"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002143"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000655","dc:identifier":"homoit0000655","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Machismo"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Machismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Machismo"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Machismo"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term originating in the early 1930s and 40s to describe a man's responsibility and pride in providing for, protecting, and defending his family. It is unclear whether the term originates in Spain or Portugal. Though there are positive sides of machismo and it remains an important part of Iberian and Latin American cultures, the concept has also been criticized for its perceived role in perpetuating misogyny, harmful gender roles, and domestic and sexual violence."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término que se originó a principios de los años 1930 y 1940 para describir la responsabilidad y el orgullo de un hombre por mantener, proteger y defender a su familia. No está claro si el término se origina en España o Portugal. Aunque el machismo tiene aspectos positivos y sigue siendo una parte importante de las culturas ibéricas y latinoamericanas, el concepto también ha sido criticado por su papel percibido en la perpetuación de la misoginia, los roles de género dañinos y la violencia doméstica y sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term uit het begin van de jaren '30 en '40 om de verantwoordelijkheid en trots van een man te beschrijven bij het zorgen voor, het beschermen en verdedigen van zijn gezin. Het is onduidelijk of de term zijn oorsprong vindt in Spanje of Portugal. Hoewel er positieve kanten zijn aan machismo en het een belangrijk onderdeel blijft van de Iberische en Latijns-Amerikaanse culturen, is het concept ook bekritiseerd vanwege de rol bij het in stand houden van vrouwenhaat, schadelijke rolpatronen en huiselijk en seksueel geweld."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett begrepp från 1930–40-talet som beskriver en mans ansvar och stolthet i att försörja, skydda och försvara sin familj. Ursprunget är osäkert, men tros komma från Spanien eller Portugal. Machismo är fortfarande en viktig del av iberisk och latinamerikansk kultur men har kritiserats för att förstärka misogyni, könsroller samt våld i nära relationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000978"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000995"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001377"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh88006590"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001241"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/machismo"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003506","dc:identifier":"homoit0003506","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ky-ky (Gender role)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ky-ky (rol de género)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ky-ky (Genderrol)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ky-ky (identitet)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kiki (Gender role)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Kyky (Gender role)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ky-ky"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kyky (Genderrol)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A slang term that emerged in the 1940s to describe lesbians who do not identify as butch or femme. Do not conflate with the term \"Kiki (Social gathering), which refers to a gathering of friends."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga que surgió en la década de 1940 para describir a las lesbianas que no se identifican como marimacha o femme. No confundir con el término «Kiki (Reunión social), que se refiere a una reunión de amigos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die in de jaren 1940 ontstond om lesbische vrouwen te beschrijven die zich niet identificeren als butch of femme. Verwar niet met de term \"Kiki (Sociaal samenzijn), wat verwijst naar een bijeenkomst van vrienden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Amerikansk slangterm som uppstod på 1940-talet för att beskriva lesbiska som inte identifierar sig som butch eller femme. Ska inte förväxlas med Kiki, som syftar på en vänskaplig träff."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001304"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001241"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003706","dc:identifier":"homoit0003706","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminist film criticism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feministische filmkritiek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Feministisk filmkritik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminist film critique"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminist film analysis"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The analysis and evaluation of feminist films and film history, or film criticism from a feminist perspective."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De analyse en evaluatie van feministische films en filmgeschiedenis, of filmkritiek vanuit een feministisch perspectief."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Analys och tolkning av feministisk film och filmhistoria, eller filmkritik ur ett feministiskt perspektiv."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000579"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002039"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003700"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001602"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90004315"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000579"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001149","dc:identifier":"homoit0001149","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer (Verb)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer (woord)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera (verb)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuir"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term commonly used in academic disciplines to describe actions that address sexual and gender normativity, expose systems of oppression, and attempt to undermine those systems."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término comúnmente utilizado en disciplinas académicas para describir acciones que abordan la normatividad sexual y de género, exponen sistemas de opresión e intentan socavar esos sistemas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaak gebruikt in academische disciplines om acties te beschrijven die seksuele en gendernormativiteit aanpakken, systemen van onderdrukking blootleggen en proberen die systemen te ondermijnen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som ofta används inom akademin för att beskriva handlingar som ifrågasätter sexual- och könsnormer, synliggör förtryckande strukturer och försöker undergräva dessa system."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002180"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000579"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000972"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001156"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001219"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001891"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002042"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002577"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001149"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerVerb"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002725","dc:identifier":"homoit0002725","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit studies"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudios dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit studies"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-studier"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S studies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit studies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited studies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited studies"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Academic field of research and study about Two-Spirit people, Two-Spirit identity, and Two-Spirit communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Campo académico de investigación y estudio sobre las personas dos espíritus, la identidad dos espíritus y las comunidades dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Academisch onderzoeks- en studiegebied over Two-Spirit-people, Two-Spirit-identiteit en Two-Spirit-gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Akademiskt forskningsfält som studerar Two-spirit-personer, Two-spirit-identitet och Two-spirit-gemenskaper."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000579"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001210"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004430"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002725"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002934","dc:identifier":"homoit0002934","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex studies"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Intersex Studies"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudios intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse studies"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexstudier"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Intersex Studien"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Intersex Forschung"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Studien"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Forschung"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudios intersex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Academic field of research and study about intersex people, intersex identity, and intersex communities."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Akademischer Forschungs- und Studienbereich über inter* Personen, inter* Identität und inter* Gemeinschaften."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Campo académico de investigación y estudio sobre personas intersex, la identidad intersex y comunidades intersex."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Academisch onderzoeks- en studiegebied over intersekse personen, intersekse identiteit en intersekse gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Akademiskt forskningsfält om intersexpersoner, intersexidentitet och intersexgemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004430"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000579"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001210"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004430"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000582","dc:identifier":"homoit0000582","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genderqueer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas genderqueer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Genderqueere Personen"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes genderqueers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Genderqueer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genderqueer-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes de genre queer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who self-identify as genderqueer, an umbrella term for queer or non-normative gender identities and gender expressions."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se autoidentifican como genderqueer, un término general para identidades y expresiones de género queer o no normativas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die sich selbst als genderqueer identifizieren, ein Sammelbegriff für queere oder nichtnormative Geschlechtsidentitäten und Geschlechtsausdrücke."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui s'identifient comme genderqueer, identité et expression de genre non conforme à la vision binaire normative du genre."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen die zichzelf identificeren als genderqueer, een overkoepelende term voor queer of niet-normatieve genderidentiteiten en genderexpressies."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som identifierar sig som genderqueer – ett paraplybegrepp för queera eller icke-normativa könsidentiteter och könsuttryck."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001195"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001668"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001921"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/genderqueerPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001668","dc:identifier":"homoit0001668","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgenderqueer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgenderqueer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgenderqueer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transgenderqueer-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Someone who is both trans and genderqueer and who identifies as transgenderqueer.\r\n"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Alguien que es transgénero y genderqueer y que se identifica como transgénero queer.\n"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Iemand die zowel trans als genderqueer is en zich identificeert als transgenderqueer."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Person som är både trans och genderqueer och som identifierar sig som transgenderqueer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000582"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001817"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001918"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001921"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderqueerPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000658","dc:identifier":"homoit0000658","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hysterectomy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Histerectomía"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hysterectomie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hysterektomi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surgical procedure to remove the uterus."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Procedimiento quirúrgico para extirpar el útero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chirurgische ingreep om de baarmoeder te verwijderen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgiskt ingrepp för att avlägsna livmodern."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85063844"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hysterectomy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001845","dc:identifier":"homoit0001845","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Labiaplasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Labioplastia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Labioplastik"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Labiaplastie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Labiaplastik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Labioplasty"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schamlippenplastik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Blygdläppsplastik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surgical construction of the labia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Construcción quirúrgica de la labia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chirurgische Korrektur der Schamlippen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chirurgische constructie van de schaamlippen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgisk rekonstruktion eller formning av blygdläpparna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001040"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001488"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001497"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001844"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001851"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001846","dc:identifier":"homoit0001846","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Metoidioplasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Metoidioplastia"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Metoidioplastie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Metoidioplastik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Meta"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Metaoidioplasty"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Meto"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Meta"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Meto||"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Meto"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Metaplastik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Meta"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surgical procedure in which the urethra is elongated and placed along a neophallus, typically to allow for standing urination."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Procedimiento quirúrgico en el que la uretra se alarga y se coloca a lo largo de un neofalo, generalmente para permitir orinar de pie."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chirurgische procedure waarbij de urethra langwerpig wordt en langs een neophallus wordt geplaatst, meestal om staand urineren mogelijk te maken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könkorrigerande kirurgiskt ingrepp där urinröret förlängs och placeras längs en neopenis, vanligtvis för att möjliggöra stående urinering."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001361"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001847"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001850"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001852"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001894"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001847","dc:identifier":"homoit0001847","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Scrotoplasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Escrotoplastia"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Scrotoplastie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skrotalplastik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Oscheoplasty"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pungplastisk"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surgical construction of the scrotum."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Construcción quirúrgica del escroto."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chirurgische constructie van het scrotum"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgisk konstruktion av pungen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001361"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001850"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001894"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001850","dc:identifier":"homoit0001850","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Phalloplasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Faloplastia"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Falloplastie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Falloplastik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Phallo"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Vagina-preserving phalloplasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Flaplatia preservando la vagina"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaginabehoudende falloplastie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surgical construction of the penis."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Construcción quirúrgica del pene."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chirurgische constructie van de penis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgisk konstruktion av en penis."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001099"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001847"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001894"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93000114"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001851","dc:identifier":"homoit0001851","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Vaginoplasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vaginoplastia"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vaginoplastik"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intestinal vaginoplasty"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Penile inversion vaginoplasty"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Phallus-preserving vaginoplasty"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Zero depth vaginoplasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ginetoplastia feminizante"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surgical construction of the vagina."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Construcción quirúrgica de la vagina."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgisk konstruktion av en slida."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001040"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001488"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001497"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001844"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001845"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002840","dc:identifier":"homoit0002840","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gonadectomy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Gonadectomía"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gonadektomie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gonadectomie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gonadektomi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Kastration"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Orchiektomie"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ovarektomie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Surgical procedure to remove the gonads, including testes and ovaries."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Procedimiento quirúrgico para extirpar las gónadas, incluidos los testículos y los ovarios."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chirurgischer Eingriff zur Entfernung der Keimdrüsen, einschließlich Hoden und Eierstöcke."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chirurgische procedure om de geslachtsklieren te verwijderen, inclusief testikels en eierstokken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirurgiskt ingrepp för att avlägsna könskörtlarna, inklusive testiklar och äggstockar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85020752"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002847","dc:identifier":"homoit0002847","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex surgery"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cirugía intersex"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Operationen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse chirurgie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexkirurgi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Normangleichende Operationen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexplastik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-lifesaving cosmetic procedures intended to change and \"normalize\" natural variations in genital appearance and/or reproductive anatomy. Intersex surgery was first developed in the early 20th century, with doctors making unresearched claims about an \"urgent need\" for these operations."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Procedimientos cosméticos que no salvan vidas destinados a cambiar y \"normalizar\" las variaciones naturales en la apariencia genital y/o la anatomía reproductiva. La cirugía intersex se desarrolló por primera vez a principios del siglo XX, cuando los médicos afirmaban sin fundamento investigativo la supuesta \"necesidad urgente\" para estas operaciones."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nicht lebensrettende kosmetische Operationen, die darauf abzielen, natürliche Abweichungen im Aussehen der Genitalien und in der reproduktiven Anatomie zu verändern und zu „normalisieren“. Normangleichende Operationen entstanden erstmals zu Beginn des 20. Jahrhunderts, wobei Ärzte unbelegte Behauptungen über den „dringende Bedarf“ an diesen aufstellten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Niet-levensreddende cosmetische ingrepen bedoeld om natuurlijke variaties in het genitale uiterlijk en/of de reproductieve anatomie te veranderen en te ‘normaliseren’. Intersekse-chirurgie werd voor het eerst ontwikkeld in het begin van de 20e eeuw, waarbij artsen niet-onderzochte beweringen deden over een \"dringende noodzaak\" voor deze operaties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke livsnödvändiga kosmetiska ingrepp som syftar till att förändra och ”normalisera” naturliga variationer i genitaliers utseende och/eller reproduktiv anatomi. Intersexkirurgi utvecklades i början av 1900-talet, då läkare utan forskningsstöd påstod att dessa operationer var akuta."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000670"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000584"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000670"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001497","dc:identifier":"homoit0001497","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Vulva"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vulva"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vulva"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vulva"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"External genitalia surrounding the vagina."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Genitales externos que rodean la vagina."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Extern geslachtsdeel rond de vagina."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Yttre könsorgan som omger slidan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000585"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001845"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001851"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85144473"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/vulva"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000623","dc:identifier":"homoit0000623","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual girls"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexuelle Mädchen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas heterosexuales"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Filles hétérosexuelles"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteromeiden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella flickor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight girls"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hetero-Mädchen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas hetero"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella tjejer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Girls (typically children or youth younger than 18) who are heterosexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Mädchen (in der Regel unter 18 Jahre), die heterosexuell sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas menores de 18 años que se autoidentifican como heterosexuales."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Filles (enfants ou des jeunes de moins de 18 ans) qui sont hétérosexuelles."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Meiden (meestal kinderen of jongeren jonger dan 18 jaar) die heteroseksueel zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flickor (vanligtvis barn eller unga under 18 år) som är heterosexuella."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000590"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000630"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002285"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexualGirls"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000743","dc:identifier":"homoit0000743","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian girls"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas lesbianas"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Filles lesbiennes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische meiden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska flickor"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska tjejer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Girls (typically children younger than 18) who are lesbians."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas menores de 18 años que se autoidentifican como lesbianas."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Filles (enfants de moins de 18 ans) qui sont lesbiennes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Meisjes (meestal kinderen jonger dan 18) die lesbisch zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flickor (vanligtvis barn eller ungdomar under 18 år) som är lesbiska."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000590"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000786"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002362"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianGirls"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002284","dc:identifier":"homoit0002284","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cisgender girls"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Cis Mädchen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas cisgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Cisgender meiden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cisflickor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cis girls"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas cis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cistjejer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Girls (typically children or youth younger than 18) who are cisgender."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Mädchen (in der Regel Kinder oder Jugendliche unter 18 Jahren), die cis sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Niñas menores de 18 años que se autoidentifican como cisgénero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Meiden (meestal kinderen of jongeren jonger dan 18 jaar) die cisgender zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flickor (vanligtvis barn eller ungdomar under 18 år) som är cis-personer."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000590"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002281"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002282"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000592","dc:identifier":"homoit0000592","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Given names"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nombre de pila"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Vorname"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gegeven namen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tilldelat namn"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Birth names"},{"@language":"en","@value":"First names"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nombre de nacimiento"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Primer nombre"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Rufname"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förnamn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Födelsenamn"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Personal names ascribed to individuals at birth, typically by their parents. Sometimes referred to as \"birth names\" or, in cultures where the given name precedes the family name, \"first names.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nombres personales adscritos a las personas al nacer, normalmente por sus padres. A veces se les denomina \"nombres de nacimiento\" o, en culturas donde el nombre de pila precede al apellido, \"primer nombre\""},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personennamen, die Personen bei der Geburt, in der Regel von ihren Eltern, gegeben werden. Manchmal auch als „Geburtsnamen“ oder, in Kulturen, in denen der Vorname vor dem Familiennamen steht, als „Vornamen“ bezeichnet."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De persoonlijke naam die bij de geboorte aan een persoon wordt toegekend, meestal door de ouders. Soms aangeduid als de \"geboortenaam\" of, in culturen waar de voornaam voorafgaat aan de familienaam, de \"voornaam\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personnamn som ges till en individ vid födseln, vanligtvis av föräldrarna. Kallas ibland ”födelsenamn” eller, i kulturer där förnamnet kommer före efternamnet, ”förnamn”."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000592"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/givenName"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000691","dc:identifier":"homoit0000691","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kissing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Besar"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Küssen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zoenen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kyssa"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Besarse"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Touching or pressing one's lips to another person or an object to communicate a greeting, affection, reverence, love, or sexual desire."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tocar o presionar los labios contra otra persona o un objeto para comunicar un saludo, afecto, reverencia, amor o deseo sexual."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Lippen an eine anderen Person oder einen Gegenstand zu pressen oder zu berühren, um Begrüßung, Zuneigung, Ehrfurcht, Liebe oder sexuelle Verlangen auszudrücken."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het aanraken of drukken van de lippen op een andere persoon of een object om een begroeting, genegenheid, eerbied, liefde of seksueel verlangen over te brengen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Att vidröra eller trycka sina läppar mot en annan person eller ett objekt som uttryck för hälsning, tillgivenhet, vördnad, kärlek eller sexuell åtrå."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000593"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001112"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85072549"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/kissing"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000703","dc:identifier":"homoit0000703","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LBT"},{"@language":"es","@value":"LBT"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LBT"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LBT"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LBT"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"LBT"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Acronym used to describe lesbians, bisexuals, and transgender people as a group."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acrónimo utilizado para describir a lesbianas, personas bisexuales y personas transgénero como grupo."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"レズビアン、バイセクシュアル、トランスジェンダーの人々を総称して指す略語。"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Abkürzung zur Bezeichnung von Lesben, Bisexuellen und trans Personen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Alleen gebruikt om lesbische vrouwen, biseksuelen en transgender personen als een groep te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Akronym som används för att beskriva lesbiska, bisexuella och transpersoner som grupp."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000594"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000805"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LBT"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596","dc:identifier":"homoit0000596","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Goddess movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento Goddess"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Godinnenbeweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gudinnerörelser"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Goddess movement (Lesbians)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Goddess religion"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A spiritual movement that emerged in North America, Western Europe, Australia, and New Zealand in 1970s in response to male-dominated organized religion; involves worshiping the Goddess (or several goddesses), as well as a focus on women, femininity, and feminism; often associated with lesbian communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un movimiento espiritual que surgió en Norteamérica, Europa Occidental, Australia y Nueva Zelanda en la década de 1970 en respuesta a la religión organizada dominada por los hombres; implica adorar a la Diosa (o varias diosas), así como la centralidad de las mujeres, la feminidad y el feminismo; a menudo asociado con comunidades lésbicas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een spirituele beweging die in de jaren zeventig in Noord-Amerika, West-Europa, Australië en Nieuw-Zeeland ontstond als reactie op de door mannen gedomineerde georganiseerde religie; omvat het aanbidden van de Godin (of meerdere godinnen), evenals een focus op vrouwen, vrouwelijkheid en feminisme; vaak geassocieerd met lesbische gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En andlig rörelse som växte fram i Nordamerika, Västeuropa, Australien och Nya Zeeland under 1970-talet som en reaktion mot mansdominerad organiserad religion. Innefattar dyrkan av Gudinnan eller flera gudinnor samt fokus på kvinnor, femininitet och feminism. Ofta förknippad med lesbiska gemenskaper."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001069"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001907"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001908"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001909"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001910"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001911"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001912"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001913"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh89003267"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/goddessMovementLesbian"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001907","dc:identifier":"homoit0001907","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ witches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Häxor (hbtq)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Wiccans"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ practitioners of Wicca or other Pagan religions who self-identify as witches."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Practicantes LGBTQ+ de Wicca u otras religiones paganas que se autoidentifican como brujas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-beoefenaars van Wicca of andere paganistische religies die zichzelf identificeren als heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som utövar wicca eller andra hedniska religioner och som identifierar sig som häxor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001069"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001908"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001909"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001910"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001911"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001912"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001913"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002985"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001908","dc:identifier":"homoit0001908","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian witches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska häxor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Wiccans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Witches (Lesbians)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas (lesbianas)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische Wicca's"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who practice Wicca or other Pagan religions and self-identify as witches."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que practican Wicca u otras religiones paganas y se autoidentifican como brujas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die Wicca of andere paganistische religies beoefenen en zichzelf identificeren als heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som utövar wicca eller andra hedniska religioner och som identifierar sig som häxor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001907"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000761"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001911","dc:identifier":"homoit0001911","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender witches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transhäxor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender Wiccans"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Häxor som är transpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender practitioners of Wicca or other Pagan religions who self-identify as witches."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Practicantes transgénero de Wicca u otras religiones paganas que se autoidentifican como brujas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender beoefenaars van Wicca of andere paganistische religies die zichzelf identificeren als heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som utövar wicca eller andra hedniska religioner och som identifierar sig som häxor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001907"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001429"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001912","dc:identifier":"homoit0001912","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer witches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera häxor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer Wiccans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Wiccanos queer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer practitioners of Wicca or other Pagan religions who self-identify as witches."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Practicantes queer de Wicca u otras religiones paganas que se autoidentifican como brujas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer beoefenaars van Wicca of andere paganistische religies die zichzelf identificeren als heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som utövar wicca eller andra hedniska religioner och som identifierar sig som häxor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001907"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001193"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001913","dc:identifier":"homoit0001913","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex witches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujxs intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexhäxor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex Wiccans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujxs intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujos intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujas intersexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brujos intersexuales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex practitioners of Wicca or other Pagan religions who self-identify as witches."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Practicantes intersex de Wicca u otras religiones paganas que se autoidentifican como brujas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse beoefenaars van Wicca of andere paganistische religies die zichzelf identificeren als heksen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som utövar wicca eller andra hedniska religioner och som identifierar sig som häxor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001907"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000596"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000599","dc:identifier":"homoit0000599","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gonadal dysgenesis"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disgenesia gonadal"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gonadendysgenesie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gonadale dysgenesie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gonaddysgenesi"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Swyer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term that refers to a group of different variations that affect the development of the gonads before birth."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término que hace referencia a un grupo de diferentes variaciones que afectan el desarrollo de las gónadas antes del nacimiento."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Begriff für eine Gruppe verschiedener Variationen, die die Entwicklung der Keimdrüsen vor der Geburt beeinflussen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overkoepelende term voor aandoeningen die een atypische ontwikkeling van de geslachtsklieren in een embryo veroorzaken, resulterend in onvruchtbaarheid, onvermogen om de puberteit te ervaren en een gebrek aan secundaire geslachtskenmerken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En term som avser en grupp av olika variationer som påverkar könskörtelns utveckling före födseln. Gonaddysgenesi delas in i komplett (CGD) med strimgonader, partiell (PGD) delvis utvecklade gonader och mixad gonaddysgenesi (MGD) med en strimgonad och en gonad."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002867"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85138930"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gonadalDysgenesis"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002867","dc:identifier":"homoit0002867","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mixed gonadal dysgenesis"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disgenesia gonadal mixta"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gemengde gonadale dysgenesie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gonaddysgenesi, blandad"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Partial gonadal dysgenesis"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disgenesia gonadal parcial"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mixad gonaddysgenesi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"MGD"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with mixed gonadal dysgenesis are born with a mosaic (usually 45X/46XY) chromosome pattern and may develop some gonadal streak tissue and testicular tissue. They may be born with a vulva or penis, or with visible genital variations. They usually have a partially or completely developed uterus, and they may have combinations of internal reproductive structures such as a fallopian tube and a vas deferens on opposite sides of the body. In adolescence, people with mixed gonadal dysgenesis may develop some secondary sex characteristics associated with a typical testosterone puberty, depending on the amount of hormone-producing testicular tissue they have."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con disgenesia gonadal mixta nacen con un patrón cromosómico a modo de mosaico (generalmente 45X/46XY) y pueden desarrollar algo de tejido de estriado gonadal y tejido testicular. Pueden nacer con vulva o pene, o con variaciones genitales visibles. Por lo general, tienen un útero parcial o completamente desarrollado y pueden tener combinaciones de estructuras reproductivas internas como una trompa de Falopio y un conducto deferente en lados opuestos del cuerpo. En la adolescencia, las personas con disgenesia gonadal mixta pueden desarrollar algunas características sexuales secundarias asociadas con una pubertad típica de testosterona, dependiendo de la cantidad de tejido testicular productor de hormonas que tengan."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met gemengde gonadale dysgenesie worden geboren met een mozaïesche (meestal 45X/46XY) chromosoompatroon en kunnen wat gonadaal streepweefsel en testisweefsel ontwikkelen. Ze kunnen geboren worden met een vulva of penis, of met zichtbare genitale variaties. Ze hebben meestal een gedeeltelijk of volledig ontwikkelde baarmoeder en kunnen combinaties van interne voortplantingsstructuren hebben, zoals een eileider en een zaadleider aan weerszijden van het lichaam. In de adolescentie kunnen personen met gemengde gonadale dysgenesie enkele secundaire geslachtskenmerken ontwikkelen die verband houden met een typische testosteron-puberteit, afhankelijk van de hoeveelheid hormoonproducerend testisweefsel dat ze hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med blandad gonaddysgenesi har en kromosomuppsättning i mosaikform (vanligtvis har vissa celler 45X och andra celler 46XY trots samma genetiska ursprung) och kan utveckla både strimformig gonadvävnad och testikelvävnad. De kan födas med vulva, penis eller synliga genitala variationer. De har vanligtvis en delvis eller fullständigt utvecklad livmoder, och kan ha kombinationer av inre reproduktiva strukturer som äggledare på ena sidan och sädesledare på den andra. Under puberteten kan de utveckla viss mängd testosteronbaserade sekundära könskarakteristika, beroende på mängden testikelvävnad."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000599"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000600","dc:identifier":"homoit0000600","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gonads"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Gónadas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gonaden"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geslachtsklieren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gonader"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Keimdrüsen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Geschlechtsdrüsen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könskörtlar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A general term used to describe testes, ovaries, or ovotestes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término general utilizado para describir los testículos, los ovarios o los ovotestículos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein allgemeiner Begriff, verwendet zur Beschreibung von Hoden, Eierstöcken oder Ovotestes verwendet."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Klieren die de gameten (geslachtscellen) en geslachtshormonen (protestogenen, androgenen, oestrogenen) reproduceren, inclusief teelballen en eierstokken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En allmän term som används för att beskriva testiklar, äggstockar eller ovotestis."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001361"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002877"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001268"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85055840"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/gonads"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002877","dc:identifier":"homoit0002877","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Streak gonads"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Streak geslachtsklieren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Strimgonader"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Streak gonads"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stränggonader"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Minimally developed gonadal tissue that is present in place of either testes or ovaries. Streak gonads are more common in certain intersex variations such as Swyer syndrome."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Minimaal ontwikkeld gonadaal weefsel dat aanwezig is in de plaats van testikels of eierstokken. Streak-geslachtsklieren komen vaker voor bij bepaalde interseksevariaties, zoals het Swyer-syndroom."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Minimalt utvecklad könskörtelvävnad som finns i stället för testiklar eller äggstockar. Strimgonaders är vanligare vid vissa intersexvariationer såsom Swyers syndrom."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000600"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002356","dc:identifier":"homoit0002356","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ grandchildren"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nietas y nietos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-kleinkinderen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-barnbarn"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Grandchildren (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nietas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nietos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Barnbarn (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are grandchildren."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son nietos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die kleinkind zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är barnbarn."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000601"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002357","dc:identifier":"homoit0002357","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Grandchildren of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Nietos de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Enkel von LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kleinkinderen van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Barnbarn till hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Enkelkinder von LGBTQ+-Personen"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who have one or more LGBTQ+ grandparent. For grandchildren who are themselves LGBTQ+, use the term \"LGBTQ+ grandchildren.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que tienen uno o más abuelos LGBTQ+. Para los nietos que son LGBTQ+, utilice el término \"nietos LGBTQ+\"."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die einen oder mehrere LGBTQ+-Großelternteile haben. Für Enkelkinder, die selbst LGBTQ+ sind, den Begriff „LGBTQ+-Enkelkinder” verwenden ."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die één of meer LHBTQ+-grootouders hebben. Voor kleinkinderen die zelf LHBTQ+ zijn, gebruik je de term 'LHBTQ+-kleinkinderen'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har en eller flera hbtq+-personer som mor- eller farförälder. För barnbarn som själva är hbtq+, använd termen ”Hbtq+-barnbarn”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000601"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002358","dc:identifier":"homoit0002358","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ grandparents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abuelas y abuelos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-grootouders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mor- och farföräldrar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Grandparents (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abuelas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abuelos LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are grandparents."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son abuelos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die grootouder zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är mor- eller farföräldrar."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000602"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002586"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002359","dc:identifier":"homoit0002359","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Grandparents of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Großeltern von LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abuelas y abuelos de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Grootouders van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mor- och farföräldrar till hbtq+-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who have one or more LGBTQ+ grandchild. For grandparents who are themselves LGBTQ+, use the term \"LGBTQ+ grandparents.\""},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die ein oder mehrere LGBTQ+-Enkelkinder haben. Für Großeltern, die selbst LGBTQ+ sind, den Begriff „LGBTQ+-Großeltern“ verwenden."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que tienen uno o más nietos LGBTQ+. Para los abuelos que son LGBTQ+, utilice el término \"Abuelas y abuelos LGBTQ+\"."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die één of meer LHBTQ+-kleinkinderen hebben. Voor grootouders die zelf LHBTQ+ zijn, gebruik de term 'LHBTQ+-grootouders'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har ett eller flera barnbarn som är hbtq+. För mor- och farföräldrar som själva är hbtq+, använd termen ”Mor- och farföräldrar (hbtq+)”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000602"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000605","dc:identifier":"homoit0000605","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hair"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pelo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Haar"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Haar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hår"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Cabello"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vello"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Threadlike strands of keratin growing out of the skin on the body. Use in reference to hair as a secondary sex characteristic or as a form of self expression."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hilos de queratina que crecen de la piel en el cuerpo. Utilícese en referencia al cabello como característica sexual secundaria o como forma de autoexpresión."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fadenförmige Keratinstränge, die aus der Haut des Körpers herauswachsen. Verwendung in Bezug auf Haare als sekundäres Geschlechtsmerkmal oder als Form des Selbstausdrucks."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Draadachtige strengen keratine die uit de huid op het lichaam groeien. Gebruik om te verwijzen naar haar als secundair geslachtskenmerk of als een vorm van zelfexpressie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trådliknande strån av keratin som växer ut ur huden. Används för att beskriva hår som sekundär könskarakteristika eller som form av självuttryck."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001259"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002287"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85058305"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hair"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002287","dc:identifier":"homoit0002287","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Mustaches"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bigotes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Snorren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mustacher"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Moustaches"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Facial hair on the upper lip. Includes false or drag mustaches as well as naturally grown hair."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vello facial en el labio superior. Incluye bigotes postizos o de drag, así como vello crecido de forma natural."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gezichtshaar op de bovenlip. Inclusief valse of drag snorren en natuurlijk gegroeid haar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ansiktsbehåring på överläppen. Inkluderar både naturlig mustasch och lös- eller dragmustascher."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000605"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002288"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85089102"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003049","dc:identifier":"homoit0003049","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Wax play"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juego con cera"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kaarsvet-spel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vaxlekar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Wax play"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juego con velas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Wax play"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Application of liquid wax to the body for erotic or sensual play."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aplicación de cera líquida en el cuerpo para juegos eróticos o sensuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aanbrengen van kaarsvet op het lichaam voor erotisch of sensueel spel."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Applicering av flytande vax på kroppen som en del av erotisk eller sensuell lek."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003054"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000606"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003055"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003056"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000404"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000607","dc:identifier":"homoit0000607","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Halloween (LGBTQ+ culture)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Halloween (Cultura LGBTQ+)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Halloween (LGBTQ+-Kultur)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Halloween (LHBTQ+-cultuur)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Halloween (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Christmas"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Halloween"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Navidad gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Halloween gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gay Christmas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Weihnachten"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Halloween"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gay Halloween"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"\"\r\nThe celebration of Halloween in LGBTQ+ communities, which can include dressing in drag or elaborate costumes as a form of gender play, using Halloween as a pretext for exploring gender safely and/or with plausible deniability, and attending large parties in LGBTQ+ neighborhoods or establishments.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"La celebración de Halloween, a menudo llamada Navidad Gay, por personas LGBTQ+. Por lo general, implica vestirse en drag o disfraces elaborados como forma de jugar con el género y asistir a grandes fiestas en vecindarios o establecimientos LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Das Feiern von Halloween, das von LGBTQ+-Personen in den USA manchmal als „Gay Christmas“ bezeichnet wird. Typischerweise kleidet man sich dabei in Drag oder aufwendigen Kostümen als eine Form des Spielens mit Geschlechterrollen und besucht große Partys in queeren Vierteln oder Einrichtungen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De viering van Halloween, vaak Gay Christmas genoemd, door LHBTQ+-personen. Meestal gaat het om het kleden in drag of ingewikkelde kostuums als een vorm van genderspel en het bijwonen van grote feesten in LHBTQ+-buurten of etablissementen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Firandet av halloween – ofta kallad ”Gay Christmas” – inom amerikanska hbtq+-gemenskaper. Innefattar ofta drag eller fantasifulla kostymer som leker med könsuttryck samt deltagande i stora fester i hbtq+-områden eller lokaler."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001808"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85058475"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/halloween"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000608","dc:identifier":"homoit0000608","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Handcuffs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Handschellen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Esposas (objeto)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Handboeien"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handklovar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Handcuff restraints"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marrocas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chachas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A restraint device designed to secure an individual’s wrists."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Haltesystem, das dazu dient, die Handgelenke einer Person zu fesseln."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Dispositivo de inmovilización diseñado para sujetar las muñecas de una persona."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een middel om de polsen van een persoon samen te binden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett fysiskt begränsningsredskap avsett att fixera en persons handleder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003117"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85058662"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/handcuffs"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002192","dc:identifier":"homoit0002192","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer coding"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Codificación queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer codering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queerkoda"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queercoding"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Queercoding"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Purposeful subtextual coding of a character or relationship in a piece of media as queer. Queer coding is distinct from the practice of queerbaiting in that the queer codes are intentionally present rather than falsely implied and are not typically used as a marketing tactic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Codificación subtextual intencionada de un personaje o de una relación en una pieza mediática como queer. La codificación queer se diferencia de la práctica del queerbaiting en que los códigos queer están presentes intencionalmente en lugar de implícitos falsamente y no suelen utilizarse como táctica de marketing."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Doelgerichte subtekstuele codering van een personage of relatie in media als queer. Queer-codering verschilt van de praktijk van queerbaiting doordat de queer-codes opzettelijk aanwezig zijn in plaats van ten onrechte geïmpliceerd en niet typisch worden gebruikt als marketingtactiek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avsiktlig undertextuell kodning av en karaktär eller relation i ett verk som queer. Queerkodning skiljer sig från queerbaiting genom att den är medvetet inlagd snarare än falskt antydd, och används vanligtvis inte som en marknadsföringsstrategi."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000609"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000972"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001233"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001900"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002191"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002192"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001121","dc:identifier":"homoit0001121","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police harassment"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acoso policial"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-intimidatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polistrakasserier"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Harrassment by police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Misconduct by police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Mistreatment by police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police misconduct"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police mistreatment"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hostigamiento policial"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de las diversas formas de conducta inapropiada, acciones ilegales o abusos de poder cometidos por agentes de las fuerzas de seguridad o agentes del Estado contra miembros del público. Esto incluye, entre otros, la elaboración de perfiles raciales, étnicos y de otro tipo; la vigilancia, el registro y la incautación injustificados; la aplicación selectiva de la ley; el uso excesivo de la fuerza; la conducta sexual indebida; la intimidación y la manipulación de testigos; la falsificación de pruebas; las confesiones forzadas; las detenciones y encarcelamientos falsos; y el soborno o el cabildeo."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Olämpligt uppförande, olagliga handlingar eller maktmissbruk från polis gentemot allmänheten. Det kan inkludera rasprofilering, övervakning utan grund, olagliga husrannsakningar och beslag, selektiv rättstillämpning, övervåld, sexuella övergrepp, hot, bevisförfalskning, tvingade erkännanden, felaktiga gripanden eller fängslanden samt mutor eller otillbörlig påverkan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001120"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001122"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002375"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh95010616"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/policeHarassment"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000792","dc:identifier":"homoit0000792","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas lesbianas de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Lesbiennes victimes de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische slachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska hatbrottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas lésbicas de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska offer för hatbrott"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que han sufrido crímenes de odio y que pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Lesbiennes qui ont été victimes de crimes haineux et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die haatmisdrijven hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska i åldern 12–18 år som har upplevt hatbrott och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000613"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000782"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianVictimsOfHateCrimes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001221","dc:identifier":"homoit0001221","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas queer de crímenes odio"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes queers victimes de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer slachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera hatbrottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som är offer för hatbrott"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que han sufrido crímenes de odio y pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes queers qui ont été victimes de crimes haineux et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die haatmisdrijven hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som har upplevt hatbrott och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000613"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001211"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerVictimsOfHateCrimes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001456","dc:identifier":"homoit0001456","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas transgénero de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes trans victimes de crimes haineux"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender slachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som är hatbrottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas trans de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som är offer för hatbrott"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender people who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero que han sufrido crímenes de odio y pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes trans qui ont été victimes de crimes haineux et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen die haatmisdrijven hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som har upplevt hatbrott och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000613"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001448"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderVictimsOfHateCrimes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002895","dc:identifier":"homoit0002895","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas asexuales de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Opfer von Hasskriminalität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele slachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella hatbrottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Opfer von Hasskriminalität"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Opfer von Hassdelikten"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Opfer von Hassverbrechen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella offer för hatbrott"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que han sufrido crímenes de odio y pueden haber sobrevivido o no; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Personen, die Opfer von Hassverbrechen geworden sind und überlebt haben oder nicht; wenn möglich die Präferenz der Person für „Opfer“ oder „Überlebende“ beachten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die haatmisdrijven hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som har upplevt hatbrott och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000613"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002948","dc:identifier":"homoit0002948","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas intersexuales de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse slachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som är hatbrottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas intersex de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som är offer för hatbrott"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex que han sufrido crímenes de odio y que pueden haber sobrevivido o no; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen die haatmisdrijven hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som har upplevt hatbrott och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000613"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-09-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002732","dc:identifier":"homoit0002732","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas dos espíritus de crímenes de odio"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit slachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som är hatbrottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited victims of hate crimes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirited slachtoffers van haatmisdrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som är offer för hatbrott"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who have experienced hate crimes and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas dos espíritus que han sufrido crímenes de odio y pueden haber sobrevivido o no; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit-people die slachtoffer zijn geworden van haatmisdrijven en die het misschien wel of niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor 'slachtoffers' of 'overlevenden'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som har upplevt hatbrott och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003748"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000613"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001113","dc:identifier":"homoit0001113","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Physical health care for LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Asistencia médica física para personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lichamelijke gezondheidszorg voor LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Somatisk vård (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Physical health care for LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Asistencia médica física para personas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado de la salud física para personas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atención médica física para personas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fysisk vård (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroppslig vård (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized measures taken for the maintenance, treatment, or improvement of physical health or conditions of the body; use in reference to physical health care addressing the particular needs of LGBTQ+ individuals or communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Medidas organizadas tomadas para el mantenimiento, el tratamiento o la mejora de la salud física o las condiciones del cuerpo; utilícese en referencia a la atención de la salud física que aborda las necesidades particulares de personas o comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde maatregelen genomen voor het in stand houden, behandelen of verbeteren van de lichamelijke gezondheid of conditie van het lichaam; gebruik met betrekking tot fysieke gezondheidszorg die inspeelt op de specifieke behoeften van LHBTQ+-personen of -gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade insatser för att upprätthålla, behandla eller förbättra fysisk hälsa eller kroppsliga tillstånd. Används i sammanhang som rör hbtq+-personers särskilda behov av kroppslig hälso- och sjukvård."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/physicalHealthCareForLGBTQPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001360","dc:identifier":"homoit0001360","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Terminal care (AIDS)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidados terminales (SIDA)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Stervensbegeleiding (AIDS)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vård i livets slutskede (aids)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Palliation (aids)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Palliativ vård (aids)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vård av döende (aids)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"End-of-life care for those with AIDS and their families; aimed at optimizing quality of life and mitigating suffering."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidados al final de la vida para personas con SIDA y sus familias; destinados a optimizar la calidad de vida y mitigar el sufrimiento."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zorg bij het levenseinde voor personen met AIDS en hun families; gericht op het optimaliseren van de kwaliteit van leven en het verlichten van lijden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vård i livets slutskede för personer med aids och deras anhöriga, med syfte att optimera livskvalitet och lindra lidande."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002258"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85134007"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/terminalCareAIDS"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003361","dc:identifier":"homoit0003361","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Reproductive health care for LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Salud reproductiva para personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Reproductieve gezondheidszorg voor LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Reproduktiv hälsovård för hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ reproductive health care"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Reproductive health care (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Reproductive healthcare for LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atención médica reproductiva para personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado médico reproductivo para personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Reproductieve gezondheidszorg (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Access to and experiences with reproductive health care for LGBTQ+ people. Reproductive health care includes birth control, abortion, assisted reproduction, and prenatal and obstetric care."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acceso y experiencias de las personas LGBTQ+ en materia de salud reproductiva. La atención médica reproductiva incluye el control de la natalidad, el aborto, la reproducción asistida y la atención prenatal y obstétrica."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Toegang tot en ervaringen met reproductieve gezondheidszorg voor LHBTQ+-personen. Reproductieve gezondheidszorg omvat geboortebeperking, abortus, geassisteerde reproductie en prenatale en verloskundige zorg."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillgång till och erfarenheter av reproduktiv hälsovård för hbtq+-personer. Reproduktiv hälsovård omfattar preventivmedel, abort, assisterad befruktning samt mödra- och förlossningsvård."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003362"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003363"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003365"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003366"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003844"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004413"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004428"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003366"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003368"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003369"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003593"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004429"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003514","dc:identifier":"homoit0003514","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Health care for transgender children and youth"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Gesundheitsversorgung für trans Kinder und Jugendliche"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atención médica para niños y jóvenes transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gezondheidszorg voor transgender kinderen en jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hälso- och sjukvård för transbarn och unga transpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Health care for trans children and youth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans health care for children and youth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender health care for children and youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado médico para niños y jóvenes transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado médico para niñxs y jóvenes transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atención médica para niñxs y jóvenes transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado médico para niños y jóvenes trans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuidado médico para niñxs y jóvenes trans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atención médica para niñxs y jóvenes trans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atención médica para niños y jóvenes trans"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trans gezondheidszorg voor kinderen en jongeren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender gezondheidszorg voor kinderen en jongeren"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Organized measures taken for the maintenance or improvement of health via the prevention, diagnosis, and/or treatment of physical and mental health issues faced by transgender children and youth. This includes but is not limited to access to safe, legal therapy and counseling, hormone treatment, and gender-affirming surgery."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Organisierte Maßnahmen zur Erhaltung oder Verbesserung der Gesundheit durch Prävention, Diagnose und/oder Behandlung körperlicher und psychischer Gesundheitsprobleme, mit denen trans Kinder und Jugendliche konfrontiert sind. Dazu gehören unter anderem der Zugang zu sicherer, legaler Therapie und Beratung, Hormonbehandlungen sowie geschlechtsangleichende Operationen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Medidas organizadas tomadas para el mantenimiento o mejora de la salud a través de la prevención, diagnóstico y/o tratamiento de problemas de salud física y mental que enfrentan los niños y jóvenes transgénero. Esto incluye, entre otros, el acceso a terapia y asesoramiento legal y seguro, tratamiento hormonal y cirugía de afirmación de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Georganiseerde maatregelen die worden genomen voor het behoud of de verbetering van de gezondheid via de preventie, diagnose en/of behandeling van fysieke en mentale gezondheidsproblemen waarmee transgenderkinderen en -jongeren worden geconfronteerd. Dit omvat, maar is niet beperkt tot, toegang tot veilige, legale therapie en counseling, hormoonbehandeling en genderbevestigende chirurgie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Organiserade insatser för att bevara eller förbättra den fysiska och psykiska hälsan hos transbarn och transungdomar. Inkluderar bland annat tillgång till trygg, laglig terapi och samtalsstöd, hormonbehandling och könsbekräftande kirurgi."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001400"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001452"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003502"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004347","dc:identifier":"homoit0004347","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Barriers to gender-affirming care"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Belemmeringen voor genderbevestigende zorg"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Barriärer till könsbekräftande vård"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutional and personal issues that prevent a person from seeking and/or receiving gender-affirming care, which may include finances, legislative prohibitions, and family, social, and/or religious pressures."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Institutionele en persoonlijke factoren die iemand ervan weerhouden genderbevestigende zorg te zoeken en/of te ontvangen, waaronder financiële problemen, wettelijke verboden en druk vanuit familie, de maatschappij en/of religie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutionella och personliga hinder för att söka och/eller få könsbekräftande vård. Dessa kan inkludera finansiella hinder, juridiska hinder och förbud samt tryck från familj, samhälle och religion."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003657"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003504"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000876","dc:identifier":"homoit0000876","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"LGBTQ+ health care centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de salud LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-gezondheidscentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hälso- och sjukvårdsmottagningar (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"LGBTQ+ health care centres"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-hälso- och sjukvårdsmottagningar"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions providing health services for LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan servicios de salud para personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die gezondheidsdiensten verlenen aan LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som erbjuder hälso- och sjukvård för hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQHealthCareCentres"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003694","dc:identifier":"homoit0003694","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Impact of COVID-19 pandemic on LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Impact van COVID-19 pandemie op LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer och covid-19-pandemins påverkan"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"COVID-19 pandemic impact on LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Impact of pandemic on LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Pandemic impact on LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"COVID-19 pandemic and LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"COVID-19 and LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"COVID-19 pandemie en LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"COVID-19 pandemie impact op LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Impact van de pandemie op LHBTQ+-personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The particular impact of the COVID-19 pandemic on LGBTQ+ people and communities, including changes in access to health care, intimate relationship dynamics and safer sex practices, financial stability, social connectedness, and mental health."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De specifieke impact van de COVID-19-pandemie op LHBTQ+-personen en -gemeenschappen, waaronder veranderingen in de toegang tot gezondheidszorg, de dynamiek van intieme relaties en veilige sekspraktijken, financiële stabiliteit, sociale verbondenheid en geestelijke gezondheid."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den särskilda påverkan som covid-19-pandemin haft på hbtq+-personer och gemenskaper, inklusive förändringar i tillgång till hälso- och sjukvård, intima relationer och säkrare sexpraktiker, ekonomisk stabilitet, social samhörighet och psykisk hälsa."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003694"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000617","dc:identifier":"homoit0000617","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Herbal treatments"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tratamientos de hierbas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pflanzliche Behandlungen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kruidenbehandelingen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Örtmedicin"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Tratamientos herbales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Tratamientos con hierbas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pflanzliche Heilmittel"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The use of plants to improve health, prevent disease, and/or treat illness."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El uso de plantas para mejorar la salud, prevenir enfermedades y/o tratar enfermedades."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Verwendung von Pflanzen zur Förderung der Gesundheit, zur Vorbeugung von Krankheiten und/oder zur Behandlung von Erkrankungen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het gebruik van planten om de gezondheid te verbeteren, ziekte te voorkomen of te behandelen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Användningen av växter för att förbättra hälsan, förebygga sjukdom och/eller behandla sjukdomstillstånd."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001366"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001047"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001049"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85060354"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/herbalTreatments"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000674","dc:identifier":"homoit0000674","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud intersexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex teens"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes intersexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse teenagers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse tieners"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people between the age of childhood and adulthood."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex entre la edad de la niñez y la edad adulta."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen tussen kinderjaren en volwassenheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner mellan barndom och vuxen ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000668"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intersexYouth"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002825","dc:identifier":"homoit0002825","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chimeras"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Quimeras"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chimäre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chimeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Chimär"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Human chimeras"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Quimeras humanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschliche Chimäre"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chimeras, or people with chimerism, have two different sets of DNA. This happens when a person is pregnant with fraternal twins, but the embryos combine into one fetus."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Quimeras, o personas con quimerismo, tienen dos tipos de ADN. Esto ocurre cuando una persona está embarazada con gemelos fraternos, pero los embriones se combinan en un solo feto."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chimären oder Menschen mit Chimärismus haben zwei verschiedene DNA-Sätze. Dies geschieht, wenn eine Person mit zweieiigen Zwillingen schwanger ist, sich die Embryonen jedoch zu einem Fötus verbinden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chimeren, of mensen met chimerisme, hebben twee verschillende sets DNA. Dit gebeurt wanneer iemand zwanger is van een tweeling, maar de embryo's samensmelten tot één foetus."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Chimärer, eller personer med chimärism, har två olika uppsättningar genetiskt material (DNA). Det innebär att en person kan bära både könskromosomerna XX och XY. Detta sker när en person är gravid med tvåäggstvillingar och embryona smälter samman till ett foster."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003039","dc:identifier":"homoit0003039","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex college students"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Hochschulstudierende"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudiantes universitarios intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse studenten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som är collegestudenter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Universitarios intersexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Universitarios intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estudiantes universitarios intersexuales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people who are attending college."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Personen, die eine Hochschule besuchen. Achtung: Das US-amerikanische College entspricht nicht exakt der Hochschule im deutschen Sprachraum, wird aber häufig als Hochschule übersetzt."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex que asisten a la universidad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen die naar de universiteit gaan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som studerar vid college."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003041"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003032"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-05"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003225","dc:identifier":"homoit0003225","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pregnant intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales embarazadas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zwangere intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gravida intersexpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pregnant people who are intersex."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas embarazadas que son intersexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zwangere personen die intersekse zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gravida personer som är intersex."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003364"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004638","dc:identifier":"homoit0004638","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex women"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Women who are intersex. Only use to describe people who identify both as women and intersex."},"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004643","dc:identifier":"homoit0004643","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex men"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Men who are intersex. Only use to describe people who identify both as men and intersex."},"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001008"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001763","dc:identifier":"homoit0001763","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres y padres intersex"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Eltern"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse ouders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexföräldrar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres intersex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Parents who are intersex."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres y/o madres que son intersex."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eltern, die inter* sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ouders die intersekse zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som är föräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001075"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002916"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001759"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001767"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002741"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-11-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002744","dc:identifier":"homoit0002744","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Persecution of intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Persecución de personas intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vervolging van intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förföljelse av intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Persecución de personas intersex"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Systematic mistreatment of intersex people on the basis of their sex or gender identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maltrato sistemático a personas intersexuales por razón de su sexo o identidad de género."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Systematische mishandeling van intersekse personen op basis van hun geslacht of genderidentiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Systematisk förföljelse av intersexpersoner på grund av deras kön eller könsidentitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000618"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001108"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000631","dc:identifier":"homoit0000631","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Heterosexualidad"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexualität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Hétérosexualité"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexualitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Romantic and sexual attraction to members of the opposite sex or gender, typically in a culture that understands sex and gender through the binary opposition of male/female or man/woman."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atracción romántica y sexual hacia miembros del sexo o género opuesto, típicamente en una cultura que entiende el sexo y el género a través de la oposición binaria de masculino/femenino u hombre/mujer."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Romantische und sexuelle Anziehung gegenüber Personen des anderen biologischen oder sozialen Geschlechts, typischerweise in einer Kultur, die biologisches und soziales Geschlecht als binären Gegensatz von männlich/weiblich bzw. Mann/Frau versteht."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Attirance romantique et sexuelle pour des personnes de sexe opposé ou de genre opposé, généralement dans une culture qui comprend le sexe et le genre à travers l'opposition binaire masculin/féminin ou homme/femme."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Romantische en seksuele aantrekking tot leden van het andere geslacht of gender, meestal in een cultuur die seks en gender ziet als binaire oppositie van man/vrouw of mannelijk/vrouwelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romantisk och sexuell attraktion till personer av motsatt kön eller motsatt könsidentitet, vanligtvis i kulturer som förstår kön och könsidentitet genom en binär uppdelning mellan man och kvinna."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001556"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000619"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000647"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003445"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh93008585"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003989","dc:identifier":"homoit0003989","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Compulsory heterosexuality"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dwangmatige heteroseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Obligatorisk heterosexualitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Comphet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Compulsory heterosexuality"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tvångsheterosexualitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term coined by Adrienne Rich in 1980 to describe the idea that heterosexuality is assumed of and enforced upon people in patriarchal societies to ensure the continued subjugation of women. Thus, heterosexuality and, particularly, women's sexual interest in men, is not always natural but instead is ingrained as a social requirement from an early age."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term bedacht door Adrienne Rich in 1980 om het idee te beschrijven dat heteroseksualiteit wordt verondersteld en opgelegd aan mensen in patriarchale samenlevingen om de voortdurende onderdrukking van vrouwen te verzekeren. Heteroseksualiteit, en met name de seksuele interesse van vrouwen in mannen, is dus niet altijd vanzelfsprekend, maar wordt al van jongs af aan als een sociale vereiste ingebakken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term myntad av Adrienne Rich 1980 för att beskriva idén att heterosexualitet antas och påtvingas människor i patriarkala samhällen för att säkerställa kvinnors fortsatta underkuvande. Således är heterosexualitet, och särskilt kvinnors sexuella intresse för män, inte alltid naturligt utan är istället inrotat som ett socialt krav från tidig ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000619"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000620"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001323"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000630","dc:identifier":"homoit0000630","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud heterosexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heteroseuxelle Jugendliche"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heterojongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga heterosexuella"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight youth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual teens"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Straight teens"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes heterosexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes heterosexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud hétero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes hétero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hetero teenagers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hetero tieners"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksuele adolescenten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksuele jongeren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksuele teenagers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksuele tieners"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella ungdomar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual people between the ages of childhood and adulthood."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas heterosexuales entre las edades de la infancia y la edad adulta."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexuelle Personen im Alter zwischen Kindheit und Erwachsensein."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksuelen in de leeftijd van kindertijd tot volwassenheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella personer mellan barndom och vuxen ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000621"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000623"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002285"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexualYouth"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000624","dc:identifier":"homoit0000624","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual identity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identidad heterosexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexuelle Identität"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Identité hétérosexuelle"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heteroseksuele identiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuell identitet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Hetero-Identität"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the sexual identity of individuals who are romantically and/or sexually attracted to people assigned the “opposite” sex at birth."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la identidad sexual de las personas que se sienten atraídas romántica y/o sexualmente por personas asignadas al sexo “opuesto” al nacer."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bezeichnung für die sexuelle Identität von Personen, die sich romantisch und/oder sexuell zu Menschen hingezogen fühlen, denen bei der Geburt das „andere“ Geschlecht zugewiesen wurde."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om de seksuele identiteit te beschrijven van personen die zich romantisch en/of seksueel aangetrokken voelen tot mensen die bij de geboorte het 'tegenovergestelde' geslacht hebben gekregen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som beskriver sexuell identitet hos personer som är romantiskt och/eller sexuellt attraherade av personer som tilldelats ett ”motsatt” kön vid födseln."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexualIdentity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000625","dc:identifier":"homoit0000625","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual marriage"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexuelle Ehe"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Matrimonio heterosexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heterohuwelijk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosexuella äktenskap"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Hetero-Ehe"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Casamiento heterosexual"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The legally and formally recognized union of a heterosexual man and woman as partners in a personal relationship."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die rechtlich und formal anerkannte Verbindung zwischen einem heterosexuellen Mann und einer heterosexuellen Frau als Partner in einer persönlichen Beziehung."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La unión legal y formalmente reconocida de un hombre y una mujer heterosexuales como pareja en una relación personal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De wettelijk en formeel erkende verbintenis van een heteroseksuele man en vrouw als partners in een persoonlijke relatie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En juridiskt erkänd och formellt reglerad parrelation mellan en heterosexuell man och en kvinna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000990"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosexualMarriage"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001915","dc:identifier":"homoit0001915","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Monosexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas monosexuales"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes monosexuelles"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Monoseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Monosexuella personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Monosexuals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Monosexuales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who are attracted to only one gender; includes gay people and straight people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que se sienten atraídas por un solo género; incluye a personas homosexuales y heterosexuales."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui sont attirées par un seul genre; cela inclut les personnes homosexuelles et hétérosexuelles."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zich aangetrokken voelen tot één gender; omvat homo's en hetero's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som endast attraheras av ett kön. Inkluderar homosexuella och heterosexuella personer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000627"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000648"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001555"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001556"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000628","dc:identifier":"homoit0000628","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosociality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Heterosocialidad"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosozialität"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Heterosociale relaties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Heterosocialitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosexual social relationships"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Heterosocial bonds"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Relaciones sociales heterosexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vínculos heterosociales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosexuelle soziale Beziehungen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosoziale Beziehungen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Heterosozial Bindungen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"In sociology, this term is used to describe social relations and bonds between members of the opposite sex or gender in a given culture. Typically excludes romantic and sexual relationships."},{"@language":"es","@value":"En la sociología, este término se utiliza para describir las relaciones sociales y los vínculos entre miembros del sexo o género opuesto en una cultura determinada. Normalmente excluye las relaciones románticas y sexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"In der Soziologie wird dieser Begriff verwendet, um soziale Beziehungen und Bindungen zwischen Angehörigen des anderen biologischen oder sozialen Geschlechts in einer bestimmten Kultur zu beschreiben. Romantische und sexuelle Beziehungen sind dabei in der Regel ausgeschlossen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In de sociologie een concept dat wordt gebruikt om sociale relaties en banden tussen leden van het andere geslacht of gender in een bepaalde cultuur te beschrijven. Sluit meestal romantische en seksuele relaties uit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inom sociologin används termen för att beskriva sociala relationer och band mellan personer av motsatt kön inom en viss kultur. Inbegriper vanligtvis inte romantiska eller sexuella relationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000649"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/heterosociality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001556","dc:identifier":"homoit0001556","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Monosexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Monosexualidad"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Monosexualité"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Monoseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Monosexualitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A sexuality that involves attraction to only one gender; includes homosexuality and heterosexuality."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una sexualidad que implica la atracción hacia un solo género; incluye la homosexualidad y la heterosexualidad."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Sexualité qui implique une attirance pour un seul genre; comprend l'homosexualité et l'hétérosexualité."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een seksuele voorkeur waarbij personen zich aangetrokken voelen tot slechts één geslacht, zoals homoseksualiteit en heteroseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En sexuell läggning som innebär attraktion till endast ett kön. Inkluderar homosexualitet och heterosexualitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000631"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000647"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001290"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001555"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001915"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/monosexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000633","dc:identifier":"homoit0000633","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Hindus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hindúes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のヒンドゥー教徒"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-hindustanen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hinduer (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hindus (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ Hindus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are Hindu."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son hindúes."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"ヒンドゥー教徒のLGBTQ+の人々。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die hindoe zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är hinduer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000928"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQHindus"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000638","dc:identifier":"homoit0000638","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Serodiscordant couples"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parejas serodiscordantes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Serodiscordante paren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Par med olika hivstatus"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"HIV-serodiscordant couples"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parejas serodiscordantes-VIH"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Serodiskordanta par"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Partnerships in which one person has HIV and the other does not."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parejas en las que una persona tiene VIH y la otra no."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"paren waarbij één van de partners hiv-positief is ende andere hiv-negatief is"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Parrelationer där en av personerna lever med hiv och den andra inte gör det."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000636"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000638"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/serodiscordantCouples"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001117","dc:identifier":"homoit0001117","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pinkwashing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pinkwashing"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Pinkwashing"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pinkwashing"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pinkwashing"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Lavado rosa"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lavado de imagen rosa"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Blanchiment rose"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A variety of marketing and political strategies aimed at promoting products, countries, people, or entities to LGBTQ+ people; using LGBTQ+-related symbols in order to be perceived as progressive, modern, and tolerant; and/or utilizing concern for LGBTQ+ people and rights to justify or deviate attention from settler-colonialism, genocide, invasion, and intervention in other countries."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una variedad de estrategias políticas y de marketing destinada a promover productos, países, personas o entidades entre personas LGBTQ+ o utilizar símbolos LGBTQ+ para ser percibidos como progresistas, modernos y tolerantes."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Activités marketing ou politiques utilisées par un État, une organisation, un parti politique ou une entreprise dans le but de se donner une image progressiste, tolérante ou engagée pour les droits des personnes LGBTQ+. Cet intérêt pour les droits LGBTQ+ peut servir à détourner l'attention ou justifier la colonisation, l'invasion, le génocide ou d'autres interventions dans d'autres pays."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verschillende marketing- en politieke strategieën die gericht zijn op het promoten van producten, landen, mensen of entiteiten bij LHBTQ+-personen; het gebruiken van LHBTQ+-gerelateerde symbolen om als progressief, modern en tolerant over te komen; en/of het gebruiken van zorg voor LHBTQ+-personen en rechten om de aandacht af te leiden van kolonialisme, genocide, invasie en interventie in andere landen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marknadsförings- och politiska strategier som syftar till att marknadsföra produkter, länder, personer eller organisationer till hbtq+-personer genom användning av hbtq+-relaterade symboler för att framstå som progressiva, moderna och toleranta och/eller genom att åberopa omsorg om hbtq+-personer och deras rättigheter för att rättfärdiga eller avleda uppmärksamhet från bosättarkolonialism, folkmord, invasioner och interventioner i andra länder."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000643"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000873"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000899"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001117"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/pinkwashing"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000645","dc:identifier":"homoit0000645","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Homophiles"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homófilos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homophile"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homofielen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homofiler"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdated term for lesbians and gay men. The use of the word began to disappear with the emergence of the gay liberation movement of the late 1960s and early 1970s."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término obsoleto para lesbianas y hombres gay. El uso de la palabra comenzó a desaparecer con el surgimiento del movimiento de liberación gay a finales de la década de los sesenta y principios de los setenta."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Veraltete Bezeichnung für Lesben und schwule Männer. Mit dem Aufkommen der Homosexuellenbewegung Ende der 1960er- und Anfang der 1970er-Jahre verschwand dieser Begriff zunehmend aus dem Sprachgebrauch."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verouderde term voor lesbische vrouwen en homomannen. Het gebruik van het woord begon te verdwijnen met de opkomst van de homobevrijdingsbeweging aan het eind van de jaren zestig en het begin van de jaren zeventig"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Föråldrad term för lesbiska och bögar. Användningen av ordet började avta i samband med framväxten av gayrörelsen i slutet av 1960-talet och början av 1970-talet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004427"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/homophiles"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002174","dc:identifier":"homoit0002174","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Homophobia in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homofobia en el fandom"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homophobie im Fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homofobie in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homofobi inom fandom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Issues and discussions about the presence of homophobia in fan spaces and works."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuestiones y discusiones sobre la presencia de la homofobia en espacios y obras de fans."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Themen und Diskussionen über das Vorkommen von Homophobie in Fan-Kreisen und -Werken."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kwesties en discussies over de aanwezigheid van homofobie in fanruimtes en werken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frågor och diskussioner om förekomsten av homofobi i fangemenskaper och fanverk."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000646"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002171"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002181"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002194"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001240","dc:identifier":"homoit0001240","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ritual homosexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homosexualidad ritual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rituele homoseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rituell homosexualitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-reciprocal genital contact, typically fellatio, between younger and older men that takes place during initiation rituals practiced by the Sambari people of Papua New Guinea. This term was developed by Western outsiders and has been strongly criticized by the affected community."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Contacto genital no recíproco, típicamente felación, entre hombres jóvenes y mayores que ocurre durante los rituales de iniciación practicados por el pueblo simbari de Papúa Nueva Guinea. Este término fue desarrollado por extranjeros occidentales y ha sido fuertemente criticado por la comunidad afectada."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Niet-wederzijds genitaal contact, vaak fellatio, tussen jongere en oudere mannen dat plaatsvindt tijdens initiatierituelen die worden beoefend door de Sambari-bevolking van Papoea-Nieuw-Guinea. Deze term is ontwikkeld door westerse buitenstaanders en is sterk bekritiseerd door de betreffende gemeenschap."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Icke ömsesidig genital kontakt, vanligtvis fellatio, mellan unga och äldre män som förekommer under initieringsriter bland Sambari-folket i Papua Nya Guinea. Begreppet är myntat av västerländska antropologer och har starkt kritiserats av berörda samhällen."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000647"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001298"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ritualHomosexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000648","dc:identifier":"homoit0000648","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Homosexuals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Homosexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoseksuelen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Homos"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdated term for lesbians and gay men."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término obsoleto para lesbianas y hombres gay."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term för lesbiska och bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001531"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001915"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85061795"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/homosexuals"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000981","dc:identifier":"homoit0000981","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Male bonding"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vinculación masculina"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannenbonden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Manlig gemenskap"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Vínculos masculinos"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Manlig kamratskap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Manlig vänskap"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Friendship and connection between two or more male-identified people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amistad y conexión entre dos o más personas que se autoidentifican como masculinas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vriendschap en verbinding tussen mannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vänskap och samhörighet mellan två eller flera maskulint identifierade personer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000649"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000982"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000981"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/maleBonding"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001138","dc:identifier":"homoit0001138","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Puberty blockers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bloqueadores de la pubertad"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Inhibiteurs de puberté"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Puberteitsremmers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pubertetsblockerare"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Inhibiteurs d'hormones"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Bloqueurs d'hormones"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Inhibiteurs de puberté"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Bloqueurs hormonaux"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Group of medications used to inhibit puberty."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupo de medicamentos utilizados para inhibir la pubertad."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Groupe de médicaments utilisés pour bloquer la puberté."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Groep medicijnen die worden gebruikt om de puberteit af te remmen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läkemedelsgrupp som används för att bromsa eller skjuta upp puberteten."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000650"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001007"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001400"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001004"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/pubertyBlockers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002876","dc:identifier":"homoit0002876","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Steroidogenic factor 1 protein"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Factor esteroidogénico 1"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Steroïdogeen factor 1-eiwit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Steroidogenic factor 1 protein"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"SF-1 protein"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Proteína SF-1"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The steroidogenic factor 1 (SF-1) protein is a transcription factor involved in sex determination. The SF-1 protein controls the activity of genes related to the gonads and adrenal glands."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La proteína del factor esteroidogénico 1 (SF-1) es un factor de transcripción implicado en la determinación del sexo. La proteína SF-1 controla la actividad de genes relacionados con los gónadas y las glándulas suprarrenales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het steroïdogene factor 1 (SF-1) eiwit is een transcriptiefactor die betrokken is bij geslachtsbepaling. Het SF-1-eiwit regelt de activiteit van genen die verband houden met de geslachtsklieren en de bijnieren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Proteinet steroidogenic factor 1 (SF-1) är en transkriptionsfaktor som spelar en roll i könsbestämning. SF-1 styr aktiviteten hos gener relaterade till könskörtlarna och binjurarna."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000651"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002876"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001377","dc:identifier":"homoit0001377","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Toxic masculinity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Masculinidad tóxica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Giftige mannelijkheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Toxisk maskulinitet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Set of attitudes, behaviors, and cultural norms stereotypically associated with or expected of men and which are regarded as having a negative impact on men and society at large."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Conjunto de actitudes, comportamientos y normas culturales asociadas o esperadas de forma estereotípica de los hombres y que se considera que tienen un impacto negativo en los hombres y la sociedad en general."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geheel van attituden, gedragingen en culturele normen die stereotiep geassocieerd worden met of verwacht worden van mannen en waarvan wordt aangenomen dat ze een negatieve invloed hebben op mannen en de samenleving als geheel."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En uppsättning attityder, beteenden och kulturella normer som stereotypiskt förknippas med eller förväntas av män och som anses ha negativ påverkan på både män och samhället i stort."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000995"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000655"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/toxicMasculinity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000656","dc:identifier":"homoit0000656","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hypersexuality"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hipersexualidad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperseksualiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hypersexualitet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nymphomania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Satyriasis"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Andromania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Clitoromania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Don Juan syndrome"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Don Juanism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Estromania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Excessive sex drive"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Furor amatorius"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Furor uterinus"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hyper-sexuality"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hyperactive sexual desire disorder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hyperaesthesia"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hypereroticism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hyperlibido"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hyperphilia"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hypersensuality"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hypersexual disorder"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Messalina syndrome"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Œstromania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Oversexuality"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Satyrism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Satyromania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual hyperesthesia"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual hyperversion"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Clitoromanie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Don Juan complex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Don Juan syndroom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Don Juanisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Estromania"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Furor amatorius"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Furor uterinus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperactieve stoornis in seksueel verlangen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hypererotiek"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperfilie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperlibido"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperseksualisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperseksualiteit stoornis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperseksueel gedrag"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperseksueel patroon"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperseksuele stoornis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hypersensualiteit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Messalina complex"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Messalina syndroom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nymfomanie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overmatige seksuele drang"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overmatige zin in seks"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Overseksualiteit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Satyriasis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Satyrisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Satyromania"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele hyperesthesie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele hyperversie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe a level or frequency of sexual desire that is perceived as excessive within a given culture. Though the medical community has not reached a consensus as to whether hypersexuality should be included as a clinical diagnosis, doctors and psychologists have historically diagnosed LGBTQ+ people with hypersexuality (or other related labels) in order to wrongly treat their identities and desires as medical disorders. Should only be used in a historical context or if an individual self-identifies with the term."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir un nivel o una frecuencia de deseo sexual que se percibe como excesiva dentro de una cultura determinada. Aunque la comunidad médica no ha llegado a un consenso sobre si la hipersexualidad debe incluirse como diagnóstico clínico, históricamente los médicos y psicólogos han diagnosticado a personas LGBTQ+ con hipersexualidad (u otras etiquetas relacionadas) para tratar erróneamente sus identidades y deseos como trastornos médicos. Utilícese únicamente en un contexto histórico o si una persona se identifica con el término."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om een niveau of frequentie van seksueel verlangen te beschrijven dat binnen een bepaalde cultuur als buitensporig wordt ervaren. Hoewel de medische gemeenschap geen consensus heeft bereikt over de vraag of hyperseksualiteit moet worden opgenomen als een klinische diagnose, hebben doktoren en psychologen in het verleden LHBTQ+-personen gediagnosticeerd met hyperseksualiteit (of andere gerelateerde labels) om hun identiteit en verlangens ten onrechte als medische aandoeningen te behandelen. Mag alleen worden gebruikt in een historische context of als een persoon zichzelf identificeert met de term."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva en nivå eller frekvens av sexuell lust som uppfattas som överdriven inom en viss kultur. Även om det inte råder enighet inom vården om huruvida hypersexualitet ska klassas som en diagnos, har läkare och psykologer historiskt använt termen (eller liknande) för att felaktigt patologisera hbtq+-personers identitet och begär. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang eller om en individ själv identifierar sig med termen."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001284"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001283"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001538"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000656"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hypersexuality"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001538","dc:identifier":"homoit0001538","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotomania"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erotomanía"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erotomanie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Erotomanie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erotomani"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Clinical erotomania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"De Clérambault syndrome"},{"@language":"en","@value":"De Clérambault's syndrome"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Obsessional erotomania"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Primary erotomania"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erotomanía clínica"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de De Clérambault"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erotomanía obsesiva"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Erotomanía primaria"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Liebeswahn"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hypersexualität"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Sexsucht"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Condition characterized by an individual's persistent and often mistaken belief that another person is infatuated or in love with them. Can also be used to describe a level or frequency of sexual desire perceived as excessive within a given culture. Medical doctors and psychologists have historically diagnosed LGBTQ+ people with erotomania in order to wrongly treat their identities and desires as medical disorders. Should only be used in a historical context or if an individual self-identifies with the term."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Condición caracterizada por la creencia persistente y a menudo errónea de una persona de que otra persona está encaprichada o enamorada de él. También se puede utilizar para describir un nivel o una frecuencia de deseo sexual percibida como excesiva dentro de una cultura determinada. Históricamente, los médicos y psicólogos han diagnosticado a las personas LGBTQ+ con erotomanía para erróneamente tratar sus identidades y deseos como trastornos médicos. Utilícese únicamente en un contexto histórico o si una persona se identifica con el término."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zustand, der durch die anhaltende und oft irrtümliche Überzeugung einer Person gekennzeichnet ist, dass eine andere Person in sie verliebt oder von ihr fasziniert ist. Kann auch verwendet werden, um ein Maß oder eine Häufigkeit sexuellen Verlangens zu beschreiben, das innerhalb einer bestimmten Kultur als übermäßig empfunden wird. Ärzt:innen und Psycholog:innen haben LGBTQ+-Personen in der Vergangenheit mit Erotomanie diagnostiziert, um ihre Identität und ihre Wünsche fälschlicherweise als medizinische Störungen zu behandeln. Sollte nur in einem historischen Kontext oder wenn sich eine Person selbst mit diesem Begriff identifiziert, verwendet werden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aandoening die wordt gekenmerkt door de aanhoudende en vaak verkeerde overtuiging van een persoon dat een andere persoon verliefd of verliefd op hem is. Kan ook worden gebruikt om een niveau of frequentie van seksueel verlangen te beschrijven die binnen een bepaalde cultuur als buitensporig wordt beschouwd. Artsen en psychologen hebben in het verleden LHBTQ+-personen met erotomanie gediagnosticeerd om hun identiteit en verlangens ten onrechte als medische aandoeningen te behandelen. Mag alleen worden gebruikt in een historische context of als een persoon zichzelf identificeert met de term."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillstånd som kännetecknas av en individs ihållande och ofta felaktiga tro att en annan person är förälskad i eller attraherad av dem. Kan också användas för att beskriva en nivå eller frekvens av sexuellt begär som uppfattas som överdriven inom en viss kultur. Läkare och psykologer har historiskt diagnostiserat hbtq+-personer med erotomani i syfte att felaktigt behandla deras identiteter och begär som medicinska störningar. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang eller om en individ själv identifierar sig med termen."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000656"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001283"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh97003456"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001538"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/erotomania"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000657","dc:identifier":"homoit0000657","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hypospadias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hipospadias"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hypospadie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hypospadi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with hypospadias are born with their urinary opening located somewhere other than the tip of the penis. In \"distal hypospadias,\" the urinary opening is elsewhere on the glans (head) of the penis, whereas in \"proximal hypospadias,\" it is on the underside of the penis and sometimes further back near the scrotum. Hypospadias is one of the most common and visible genital variations. People with hypospadias often have additional variations like chordee (a bend in the penis) or cryptorchidism (undescended testicles)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con hipospadias nacen con la apertura urinaria ubicada en algún lugar distinto a la punta del pene. En el \"hipospadias distal\", la apertura urinaria está en otra parte del glande (cabeza) del pene, mientras que en el \"hipospadias proximal\", está en la parte inferior del pene y, a veces, más atrás, cerca del escroto. El hipospadias es una de las variaciones genitales más comunes y visibles. Las personas con hipospadias suelen tener variaciones adicionales como cordee (una curvatura en el pene) o criptorquidia (testículos no descendidos)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Variatie die optreedt tijdens de ontwikkeling van de foetus waarbij de urethra opengaat vanaf een andere plaats dan de kop van de penis."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med hypospadi är födda med urinrörets öppning placerad någon annanstans än på toppen av penis. Vid distal hypospadi sitter öppningen på ollonet, medan den vid proximal hypospadi är placerad på undersidan av penis eller längre bak, nära pungen. Hypospadi är en av de vanligaste och synligaste genitala variationerna. Personer med hypospadi har ofta även andra variationer som chordee (böjning i penis) eller kryptorkism (testiklar som inte vandrat ned)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85063812"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hypospadias"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000659","dc:identifier":"homoit0000659","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"In vitro fertilization"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fertilización in vitro"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In vitro fertilisatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"IVF"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"In vitro fertilisation"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"IVF"},{"@language":"es","@value":"FIV"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Reageerbuisbevruchting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"In vitro-fertilisering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Provrörsbefruktning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Medical practice of achieving fertilization by combining sperm and eggs in laboratory settings to induce pregnancy."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Práctica médica para lograr la fertilización mediante la combinación de espermatozoides y óvulos en entornos de laboratorio para inducir el embarazo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Medische praktijk van het bereiken van bevruchting door het combineren van sperma en ei (eren) in laboratoriumomgevingen om zwangerschap te veroorzaken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinsk metod för fertilisering där kroppen stimuleras med hormoninjektioner för att producera fler ägg än normalt. Dessa plockas sedan ut och befruktas av spermier på ett naturligt sätt genom könscellerna sammanförs i en petriskål. Den befruktade cellen får sedan dela sig upprepade gånger under kontrollerade förhållande som ska efterlikna de kroppsliga. Embryot studeras i mikroskop för att bedöma dess livsduglighet och planteras sedan i livmodern där det fäster i livmoderslemhinnan och en typisk graviditet får fortlöpa."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000843"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002618"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001234"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002629"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85047905"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/inVitroFertilisation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001234","dc:identifier":"homoit0001234","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Reciprocal in vitro fertilization"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fertilización in vitro recíproca"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wederzijdse in-vitrofertilisatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Reciprok ivf"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Reciprocal in vitro fertilisation"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Shared motherhood"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maternidad compartida"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Reciprocal in vitro fertilization"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ömsesidig IVF"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A medical procedure in which the egg of one partner is fertilized with donor sperm and then transferred to the uterus of the other partner to bring to term."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un procedimiento médico en el que el óvulo de una pareja se fertiliza con esperma de un donante y luego se transfiere al útero de la otra pareja para llevarlo a término."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een medische procedure waarbij de eicel van een partner wordt bevrucht met donorsperma en vervolgens wordt overgebracht naar de baarmoeder van de andere partner om te voldragen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinsk procedur där ett av partnernas ägg befruktas med donatorsperma och förs över till den andra partnerns livmoder för att fullfölja graviditeten."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000659"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000864"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/reciprocalInVitroFertilisation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000737","dc:identifier":"homoit0000737","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Lesbian information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información para lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska informationscentrum"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Lesbian information centres"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för lesbiska"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions providing education, support, and information about lesbian identity and lesbian communities to lesbians."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan educación, apoyo e información sobre la identidad lésbica y las comunidades lésbicas a las lesbianas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die educatie, ondersteuning en informatie verstrekken over lesbische identiteit en lesbische gemeenschappen aan lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som erbjuder utbildning, stöd och information om lesbisk identitet och lesbiska gemenskaper till lesbiska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000753"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianInformationCentres"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001179","dc:identifier":"homoit0001179","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Queer information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera informationscentrum"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Queer information centres"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för queera personer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions that provide education, support, and information about queerness and queer communities to queer people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan educación, apoyo e información sobre lo queer y comunidades queer a personas queer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die educatie, ondersteuning en informatie verstrekken over queerheid en queergemeenschappen aan queer personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som erbjuder utbildning, stöd och information om queerhet och queer gemenskap för queera personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001187"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerInformationCentres"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001409","dc:identifier":"homoit0001409","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Transgender information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans-informationscentrum"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Transgender information centres"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"Transgender documentation centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de documentación transgénero"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för transpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions providing education, support, and information about transgender issues and transgender communities to transgender people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan educación, apoyo e información sobre asuntos transgénero y comunidades transgénero a personas transgénero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die educatie, ondersteuning en informatie verstrekken over transgender issues en transgender-gemeenschappen aan transgender personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som erbjuder utbildning, stöd och information om transfrågor och transgemenskaper till transpersoner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001423"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001463"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderInformationCentres"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002747","dc:identifier":"homoit0002747","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex information centres"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información intersex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions providing education, support, and information about intersex issues and intersex communities to intersex people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan educación, apoyo e información sobre cuestiones intersex y comunidades intersex a personas intersex."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die onderwijs, ondersteuning en informatie bieden over interseksekwesties en intersekse gemeenschappen aan intersekse personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som erbjuder utbildning, stöd och information om intersexfrågor och intersexgemenskaper till intersexpersoner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002793","dc:identifier":"homoit0002793","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información asexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Informationszentren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella informationscentrum"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual information centres"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros asexuales de información"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Informationszentren für Asexuelle"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Anlaufstellen für Asexuelle"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Infocenter"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Informationszentren für Asexualität"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Anlaufstellen für Asexualität"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Infocenter für Asexualität"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för asexuella"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions providing education, support, and information about asexual issues and asexual communities to asexual people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan educación, apoyo e información sobre temas asexuales y comunidades asexuales a personas asexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Einrichtungen, die asexuellen Menschen Bildung, Unterstützung und Informationen über asexuelle Themen und asexuelle Gemeinschaften bieten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die voorlichting, ondersteuning en informatie verstrekken over aseksualiteit en aseksuele gemeenschappen aan aseksuele mensen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som tillhandahåller utbildning, stöd och information om asexuella frågor och asexuella gemenskaper för asexuella personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000830"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002696","dc:identifier":"homoit0002696","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros de información dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit informatiecentra"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-informationscentrum"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S information centers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit information centers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited information centers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit information centres"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited information centers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Centros dos espíritus de información"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationscentrum för Two-spirit-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Institutions providing education, support, and information about Two-Spirit issues and Two-Spirit communities to Two-Spirit people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instituciones que brindan educación, apoyo e información sobre temas dos espíritus y comunidades dos espíritus a personas dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instellingen die voorlichting, ondersteuning en informatie verstrekken over Two-Spirit thema's en Two-Spirit gemeenschappen aan Two-Spirit people"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner som erbjuder utbildning, stöd och information om Two-spirit-frågor och Two-spirit-gemenskaper till Two-spirit-personer."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000660"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002696"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-26"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000877","dc:identifier":"homoit0000877","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ health education"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Educación sanitaria LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-gezondheidsvoorlichting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hälsoupplysning (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ health education"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Educación sanitaria (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Instruction about health for LGBTQ+ people, including topics such as gender-affirming healthcare and safer sex practices. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Instrucción sobre la salud para personas LGBTQ+, incluidos temas como la atención médica de afirmación de género y prácticas sexuales más seguras."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Instructie over gezondheid voor LHBTQ+-personen, inclusief onderwerpen als genderbevestigende gezondheidszorg en veilig vrijen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Undervisning om hälsa för hbtq+-personer, inklusive ämnen som könsbekräftande vård och säkrare sexpraktiker."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000661"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000661"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQHealthEducation"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003617","dc:identifier":"homoit0003617","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ information professionals"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-informatieprofessionals"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Informationsspecialister (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Information professionals (LGBTQ+)"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people whose profession involves managing information by collecting, organizing, storing and disseminating it. This can include but is not limited to librarians, archivists, metadata and IT workers, web developers, and chief information officers. Use more specific terms when possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen wiens beroep het beheren van informatie omvat door het verzamelen, organiseren, opslaan en verspreiden ervan. Dit kan omvatten, maar is niet beperkt tot bibliothecarissen, archivarissen, metadata- en IT-medewerkers, webontwikkelaars en chief information officers. Gebruik specifiekere termen wanneer mogelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer vars yrke innefattar informationshantering, inklusive insamling, organisering, lagring och spridning. Detta kan omfatta, men är inte begränsat till, bibliotekarier, arkivarier, metadata- och IT-specialister, webbutvecklare och informationschefer. Använd mer specifika termer där det är möjligt."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003547"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003618"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000661"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000825"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003619"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003617"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000664","dc:identifier":"homoit0000664","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ online dating"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Citas online"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-online dating"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nätdejting"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Online dating (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ internet dating"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Internet dating (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ligar por internet"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Salir en citas online"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Salir en citas por interner"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Citas en línea"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Citas por internet"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Salir por interent"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-internet dating"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Online dating (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the practice of LGBTQ+ people utilizing online websites, applications, or forums to meet romantic or sexual partners."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Utilizar sitios web, aplicaciones o foros en línea para conocer parejas románticas o sexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om de praktijk te beschrijven waarbij LHBTQ+-personen online websites, -applicaties of -forums gebruiken om romantische of seksuele partners te vinden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Att använda webbplatser, appar eller forum online för att träffa romantiska eller sexuella partners."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003821"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000847"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/onlineDating"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003821","dc:identifier":"homoit0003821","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ dating"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ のデート"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-dating"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-dejting"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dating (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"デート (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dating (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dejting (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe people spending regular time together due to mutual romantic interest. Use to refer to dating between and/or as experienced by LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"相互に恋愛感情を抱いているため、定期的に一緒に時間を過ごす人々を表す用語。LGBTQ+の人々の間での交際、またはLGBTQ+の人々が経験する交際を指す際に用いられる。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt om personen te beschrijven die regelmatig tijd met elkaar doorbrengen vanwege wederzijdse romantische interesse. Gebruik om te verwijzen naar daten tussen en/of zoals ervaren door LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva personer som umgås regelbundet utifrån ömsesidigt romantiskt intresse. Används för dejting mellan hbtq+-personer eller hur det upplevs av hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000664"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000847"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000846","dc:identifier":"homoit0000846","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ dating applications"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+向け出会い系アプリ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aplicaciones de citas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-dating apps"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-dejtingappar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ dating applications"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ向け出会い系アプリ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aplicaciones de citas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-dejtingapplikationer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Software applications designed to generate connections between LGBTQ+ people interested in romantic or sexual relationships."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"恋愛関係や性的関係に関心のあるLGBTQ+の人々同士のつながりを築くために設計されたソフトウェアアプリケーション。"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aplicaciones de software diseñadas para generar conexiones entre personas LGBTQ+ interesadas en relaciones románticas o sexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Software applicaties die zijn ontworpen om verbindingen tot stand te brengen tussen LHBTQ+-personen die geïnteresseerd zijn in romantische of seksuele relaties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Programvara utformad för att skapa kontakt mellan hbtq+-personer som söker romantiska eller sexuella relationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000946"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000847"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000900"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002393"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003821"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000664"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000946"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQDatingApplications"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000847","dc:identifier":"homoit0000847","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ dating websites"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sitios web de citas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+向け出会い系サイト"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-datingsites"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-dejtingsidor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ dating websites"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sitios web de citas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ向け出会い系サイト"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Websites designed to generate connections between LGBTQ+ people interested in romantic or sexual relationships."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sitios web diseñados para generar conexiones entre personas LGBTQ+ interesadas en relaciones románticas o sexuales."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"恋愛関係や性的関係に関心のあるLGBTQ+の人々同士のつながりを築くことを目的としたウェブサイト。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Websites die zijn ontworpen om contacten tot stand te brengen tussen LHBTQ+-personen die geïnteresseerd zijn in romantische of seksuele relaties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Webbplatser utformade för att skapa kontakt mellan hbtq+-personer som söker romantiska eller sexuella relationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000962"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000900"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002393"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003821"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000664"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000962"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQDatingWebsites"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002595","dc:identifier":"homoit0002595","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Internalized intersexphobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intersexfobia internalizada"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geïnternaliseerde interseksefobie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Internaliserad intersexfobi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Internalized interphobia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Interfobia internalizada"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The phenomenon in which intersex people internalize or adopt intersexphobic beliefs (i.e., negative perceptions of and intolerance toward intersex people and intersex variations) as a result of being raised or socialized within a intersexphobic environment or culture."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El fenómeno a través del cual las personas intersexuales internalizan o adoptan creencias intersexfóbicas (es decir, percepciones negativas e intolerancia hacia las personas intersex y variaciones intersex) como resultado de haber sido criadas o socializadas dentro de un entorno o una cultura intersexfóbica."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het fenomeen waarbij intersekse personen interseksefobe overtuigingen internaliseren of overnemen (d.w.z. negatieve percepties van en intolerantie jegens intersekse personen en intersekse variaties) als gevolg van het feit dat ze zijn opgegroeid of gesocialiseerd in een interseksefobe omgeving of cultuur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Företeelsen att intersexpersoner internaliserar eller anammar intersexfobiska föreställningar – det vill säga negativa uppfattningar om och intolerans mot intersexpersoner och intersexvariationer – till följd av att ha vuxit upp eller socialiserats i en intersexfobisk miljö eller kultur."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000666"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002590"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003097"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000920"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002272","dc:identifier":"homoit0002272","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Womanism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujerismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Womanisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Womanism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Womanist theory"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Teoria mujerista"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A social theory based on the history and everyday experiences of Black women. Womanism grew out of the perceived indifference of the feminist movement towards the needs of Black women, who are often excluded from the categories of \"female\" and \"femininity\" as understood by white feminists. At the core of womanism is the idea that mainstream feminism is a movement led by white women to serve white women's goals, which can be indifferent or even oppositional to the needs of Black women."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una teoría social basada en la historia y las experiencias cotidianas de las mujeres negras. El mujerismo surgió de la indiferencia percibida del movimiento feminista hacia las necesidades de las mujeres negras, que a menudo están excluidas de las categorías de \"femenino\" y \"feminidad\" tal como las entienden las feministas blancas. Al centro del mujerismo está la idea de que el feminismo dominante es un movimiento liderado por mujeres blancas para servir a los objetivos de las mujeres blancas, que pueden ser indiferentes o incluso opuestos a las necesidades de las mujeres negras."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een sociale theorie gebaseerd op de geschiedenis en alledaagse ervaringen van zwarte vrouwen. Womanisme is voortgekomen uit de waargenomen onverschilligheid van de feministische beweging ten opzichte van de behoeften van zwarte vrouwen, die vaak worden uitgesloten van de categorieën 'vrouw' en 'vrouwelijkheid' zoals begrepen door witte feministen. De kern van het womanisme is het idee dat het reguliere feminisme een beweging is die wordt geleid door witte vrouwen om de doelen van witte vrouwen te dienen, die onverschillig of zelfs in strijd kunnen zijn met de behoeften van zwarte vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En samhällsteori som bygger på svarta kvinnors historia och levda erfarenheter. Womanism uppstod ur upplevelsen att den feministiska rörelsen var likgiltig inför svarta kvinnors behov, då dessa ofta utesluts från kategorierna ”kvinna” och ”femininitet” såsom de definieras av vita feminister. Womanism bygger på tanken att mainstreamfeminism leds av vita kvinnor och tjänar deras syften, vilka kan vara likgiltiga eller till och med motverka svarta kvinnors behov."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000667"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002270"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002271"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003176"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006001576"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000692","dc:identifier":"homoit0000692","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Klinefelter syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Klinefelter"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Klinefelter syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Klinefelters syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"47XXY"},{"@language":"es","@value":"47XXY"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with Klinefelter syndrome develop with an extra copy of the X chromosome, resulting in a 47XXY pattern (instead of the typical 46XY). These individuals might have smaller-than-typical testes that produce lower amounts of testosterone and/or sperm, and they may start puberty later than typical (or may not go through puberty without hormone therapy). They may grow taller than usual, may develop breast tissue, and often experience infertility. This variation often does not cause obvious physical differences, and many people do not realize they have it."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con síndrome de Klinefelter se desarrollan con una copia adicional del cromosoma X, lo que da como resultado un patrón 47XXY (en lugar del típico 46XY). Estas personas pueden tener testículos más pequeños de lo típico que producen menores cantidades de testosterona y/o esperma, y ​​pueden comenzar la pubertad más tarde de lo normal (o pueden no atravesar la pubertad sin terapia hormonal). Pueden crecer más de lo habitual, desarrollar tejido mamario y, a menudo, experimentar infertilidad. Esta variación a menudo no causa diferencias físicas obvias y muchas personas no se dan cuenta de que la tienen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een genetische aandoening waarbij individuen met XY-chromosomen een extra X-chromosoom (XXY) hebben, wat resulteert in onvruchtbaarheid en de ontwikkeling van secundaire geslachtskenmerken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med Klinefelters syndrom har en extra X-kromosom (47XXY i stället för 46XY). De kan ha mindre testiklar, lägre testosteron- eller spermieproduktion och försenad eller utebliven pubertet utan hormonbehandling. De kan också vara längre än genomsnittet, utveckla bröstvävnad och ha nedsatt fertilitet. Många känner inte till att de har tillståndet då det ofta saknar tydliga fysiska kännetecken."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85072641"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/klinefelterSyndrome"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001014","dc:identifier":"homoit0001014","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Micropenis"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Micropene"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Micropenis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mikropenis"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Microphallus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Microfalo"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person born with a micropenis has a penis that is smaller than the typical size range for an infant. People may also develop a micropenis as a result of several different intersex variations. The size of a person’s penis does not generally affect its functionality."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que nace con un micropene tiene un pene que es más pequeño que el rango de tamaño usual para un bebé. Las personas también pueden desarrollar un micropene como resultado de diferentes variaciones intersex. Por lo general, el tamaño del pene de una persona no afecta su funcionalidad."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Medische term, meestal toegekend bij de geboorte, voor een penis die wordt beschouwd als onder de normale grootte voor een baby."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som är född med mikropenis har en penis som är mindre än det typiska storleksintervallet för nyfödda. Mikropenis kan också utvecklas till följd av olika intersexvariationer. Penisens storlek påverkar i regel inte dess funktionalitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/micropenis"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001020","dc:identifier":"homoit0001020","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mosaicism involving \"sex\" chromosomes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mozaïcisme met “geslachts”-chromosomen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Könskromosommosaicism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mosaicism avseende könskromosomer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with mosaic chromosomes have different chromosome patterns in some cells of their body than in others. Mosaicism results from random differences in how cells divide while an embryo is growing, resulting in different numbers of chromosomes in different cells (such as 45X/46XX or 45X/46XY, which are both variants of Turner syndrome, or 46XY/47XXY or 46XX/47XXY, which are both variants of Klinefelter syndrome). If someone specifically has 46XX chromosomes in some cells and 46XY in others, their variation is probably chimerism instead of mosaicism. Having mosaic chromosomes can cause someone to develop variations in their genitals, gonads, or hormone function. For example, if they have at least one Y chromosome, they may have both ovarian and testicular tissue, or genital differences like hypospadias, or they may develop some secondary sex characteristics at puberty that are not expected for the sex they were assigned. People who have mosaicism without a Y chromosome (e.g., 45X/46XX, or 46XX/47XXX) may have streak gonads or ovaries that stop functioning at an earlier age than typical, which can affect development during puberty and fertility. Other people may not have any noticeable signs of their mosaicism at all."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aandoening waarbij personen twee of meer sets genetisch verschillende chromosomen hebben (45/46 of X- en Y-chromosoom) voor seksuele ontwikkeling en secundaire geslachtskenmerken (bijv. 45 XY/XXY of XX/XXY)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med mosaic-kromosomer har olika kromosomuppsättningar i vissa av kroppens celler. Mosaicism uppstår genom slumpmässiga förändringar i celldelningen under fosterutvecklingen, vilket leder till olika kromosomantal i olika celler (t.ex. 45X/46XX eller 45X/46XY – varianter av Turners syndrom, eller 46XY/47XXY och 46XX/47XXY – varianter av Klinefelters syndrom). Om någon har både 46XX och 46XY är det troligen fråga om kimerism snarare än mosaicism. Mosaicism kan orsaka variationer i könsorgan, könskörtlar eller hormonnivåer. Personer med minst en Y-kromosom kan utveckla både äggstocks- och testikelvävnad eller ha genitala variationer som hypospadi, samt pubertetsutveckling som inte stämmer överens med det tilldelade könet. Mosaicism utan Y-kromosom (t.ex. 45X/46XX eller 46XX/47XXX) kan innebära strimgonader eller tidigt förlorad äggstocksfunktion, vilket kan påverka pubertet och fertilitet. Andra kan sakna synliga tecken helt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85087417"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/mosaicismInvolvingSexChromosomes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001066","dc:identifier":"homoit0001066","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ovo-testes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ovotestículo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ovo-testes"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ovotestis"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"True hermaphroditism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"\"Ovotesticular DSD \""}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with this variation are born with both ovarian and testicular tissue. A person can develop one testis and one ovary, or they may develop one or more ovo-testes, which means that a single gonad is made up of both ovarian and testicular cells. The levels of hormones they produce can vary and how their genitals and secondary sex characteristics develop will depend partially on the levels of estrogen and testosterone that their bodies make. In adolescence, people with ovo-testes may develop features associated with either a typical estrogen puberty or a typical testosterone puberty, or they may develop some of each. Sometimes a person with an ovary and a testis or with ovo-testes can produce viable sperm and viable eggs."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con esta variación nacen con tejido ovárico y testicular. Una persona puede desarrollar un testículo y un ovario, o puede desarrollar uno o más ovotestículos, lo que significa que una sola gónada está formada por células ováricas y testiculares. Los niveles de hormonas que producen pueden variar y la forma en que se desarrollan sus genitales y características sexuales secundarias dependerá en parte de los niveles de estrógeno y testosterona que produzca su cuerpo. En la adolescencia, las personas con ovotestículos pueden desarrollar características asociadas con una pubertad típica de estrógenos o una pubertad típica de testosterona, o pueden desarrollar algunas de cada una. A veces, una persona con un ovario y un testículo o con ovotestículos puede producir espermatozoides y óvulos viables."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geslachtsklieren, of klieren die gameten en geslachtshormonen produceren, die kenmerken hebben van zowel eierstokken als testikels."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med denna variation föds med både äggstocks- och testikelvävnad. En person kan ha en testikel och en äggstock, eller ett eller flera ovotestis – könskörtlar som innehåller både äggstocks- och testikelceller. Hormonnivåerna kan variera, vilket påverkar utvecklingen av könsorgan och sekundära könskarakteristika. I puberteten kan personen utveckla drag kopplade till östrogen-, testosteron- eller båda typernas pubertet. I vissa fall kan personen producera både spermier och ägg. Variationen förekommer hos personer med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY), två X-kromosomer (46XX) och personer med mosaicism (46XX, 46XY)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/ovoTestes"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001134","dc:identifier":"homoit0001134","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Progestin induced virilization"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Progesteron-geïnduceerde virilisatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Progestininducerad virilism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gestageninducerad virilism"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People born with progestin-induced virilization have XX chromosomes and may have visible genital variations at birth such as a larger-than-typical clitoris, sometimes also with fused or partially fused labia. They usually have a typical uterus, ovaries, and fallopian tubes, though their vagina may or may not have differences. This variation develops in utero as a result of the individual's parent taking progestin medication while pregnant. Being exposed to these additional hormones before birth can change how someone’s genitals develop, but it generally will not change how their own body will produce or respond to hormones later on. This means that someone born with progestin-induced virilization will usually develop features associated with a typical estrogen puberty."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het effect van prenatale blootstelling aan androgenen op vrouwelijke foetussen; kan vergroting van de clitoris en/of versmelting van de urethra en vagina omvatten. Personen die getroffen zijn door progestageen-geïnduceerde virilisatie worden vaak onderworpen aan intersekse genitale verminking om hun geslachtsdelen te \"normaliseren\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med progestininducerad virilism har två X-kromosomer (46XX) och kan födas med synliga variationer i sina könsorgan, såsom en ovanligt stor klitoris och ibland även sammansmälta eller delvis sammansmälta blygdläppar. De har vanligtvis livmoder, äggstockar och äggledare, men deras vagina kan skilja sig något i utformning. Variationen uppstår när fostret exponeras för progestinläkemedel under graviditeten. Den hormonella exponeringen har en androgen effekt vilket påverkar könsorganens utveckling, men påverkar sällan kroppens framtida hormonproduktion eller känslighet. Puberteten brukar därför följa ett typiskt östrogenmönster."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/progestinInducedVirilization"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001354","dc:identifier":"homoit0001354","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Swyer syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Swyer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Syndroom van Swyer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Swyer syndrome"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"XY Gonadal dysgenesis"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disgenesia gonadal 46XY pura"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Swyer syndrome occurs when a person is born with XY chromosomes, but their gonads have not developed into testes. It is a form of gonadal dysgenesis, meaning that a person with this variation will have streak gonads that do not produce hormones. Since they do not produce testosterone, their body does not develop a penis and usually develops a vulva and vagina instead. Since they do not produce another hormone known as anti-Müllerian hormone (AMH), people with Swyer syndrome often develop a uterus and fallopian tubes as well. They will not usually start puberty or begin menstruating, but some people with Swyer syndrome do menstruate (without ovulating) if they receive estrogen therapy."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El síndrome de Swyer ocurre cuando una persona nace con cromosomas XY, pero sus gónadas no se han convertido en testículos. Es una forma de disgenesia gonadal, lo que significa que una persona con esta variación tendrá gónadas en franjas que no producen hormonas. Como no producen testosterona, su cuerpo no desarrolla un pene y, por lo general, desarrolla una vulva y una vagina. Dado que no producen otra hormona conocida como hormona antimülleriana (AMH, por sus siglas en inglés), las personas con síndrome de Swyer a menudo también desarrollan útero y trompas de Falopio. Por lo general, no comienzan la pubertad ni comienzan a menstruar, pero algunas personas con síndrome de Swyer menstrúan (sin ovular) si reciben terapia con estrógenos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een genetische aandoening die de ontwikkeling van geslachtsorganen beïnvloedt, waarbij een persoon met één X- en één Y-chromosoom externe genitaliën heeft die geassocieerd zijn met vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Swyers syndrom innebär att en person föds med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) men att könskörtlarna inte utvecklas till testiklar. Det är en form av könskörteldysgenes, vilket innebär att personen har strimgonader som inte producerar hormoner. Eftersom de inte producerar testosteron utvecklas kroppen vanligtvis med vulva och vagina istället för penis. På grund av frånvaro av anti-Müllerskt hormon (AMH) utvecklas ofta livmoder och äggledare. Personer med Swyers syndrom inleder sällan puberteten eller får menstruation, men vissa börjar menstruera (utan ägglossning) med östrogenbehandling."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/swyerSyndrome"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001478","dc:identifier":"homoit0001478","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Turner syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Turner"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Turner syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Turners syndrom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Turner syndrome is a variation in which a person is born with a 45X chromosome pattern (sometimes called 45XO) rather than the typical 46XX. People with Turner syndrome often share specific physical features such as short stature, a webbed neck and broad chest, and heart issues. They can also develop variations in their other sex characteristics, such as smaller-than-typical ovaries that may stop producing hormones at a younger age than typical, and they might not menstruate or experience pubertal changes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El síndrome de Turner es una variación en la que una persona nace con un patrón cromosómico 45X (a veces llamado 45XO) en lugar del típico 46XX. Las personas con síndrome de Turner a menudo comparten características físicas específicas, como baja estatura, cuello palmeado y pecho ancho, y problemas cardíacos. También pueden desarrollar variaciones en sus otras características sexuales, como ovarios más pequeños de lo típico que pueden dejar de producir hormonas a una edad más temprana de lo normal, y es posible que no menstrúen ni experimenten cambios puberales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het syndroom van Turner is een variant waarbij een persoon wordt geboren met een 45X-chromosoompatroon (ook wel 45XO genoemd) in plaats van de typische 46XX. Mensen met het syndroom van Turner delen vaak specifieke fysieke kenmerken, zoals een kleine gestalte, een nek met zwemvliezen en een brede borst, en hartproblemen. Ze kunnen ook variaties in hun andere geslachtskenmerken ontwikkelen, zoals kleinere eierstokken die op jongere leeftijd dan normaal stoppen met het produceren van hormonen, en het kan zijn dat ze niet menstrueren of puberale veranderingen ervaren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Turners syndrom är en variation där en person föds med kromosommönstret 45X (ibland kallat 45XO) istället för det typiska 46XX. Personer med Turners syndrom delar ofta specifika fysiska drag, såsom kortväxthet, bred nacke, bred bröstkorg och hjärtproblem. De kan också ha variationer i sina könskarakteristika, till exempel mindre äggstockar som kan sluta producera hormoner i tidigare ålder än normalt. De kan sakna menstruation eller inte genomgå pubertetsutveckling."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85138930"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/turnerSyndrome"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002818","dc:identifier":"homoit0002818","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"17-beta hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase 3 deficiency"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deficiencia de 17-beta hidroxiesteroide deshidrogenasa 3"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Testosteron-17β-Dehydrogenase-Mangel"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"17-bèta-hydroxysteroïde dehydrogenase 3-deficiëntie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"17β-HSD-3-brist"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"17-beta"},{"@language":"es","@value":"17-beta"},{"@language":"de","@value":"17-Keto-Reduktase-Mangel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"17-Ketosteroid-Reduktase-Mangel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"17-beta-Hydroxysteroid-Dehydrogenase 3-Mangel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pseudohermaphroditismus, männlicher, durch 17-beta-Hydroxysteroid-Dehydrogenase 3-Mangel"},{"@language":"de","@value":"17-Beta"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"17-bèta-HSD-3-deficiëntie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"17-beta-HSD-3-brist"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with 17-beta hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase 3 deficiency, abbreviated as \"17-beta,\" have XY chromosomes and testes, but their bodies do not have one of the enzymes needed to synthesize testosterone. Most people with 17-beta are born with a vulva and vagina, and their testes are most often undescended. Some people with 17-beta will be born with genitals that do not clearly resemble a typical penis or a typical vulva. Some will have a penis that may be smaller than typical (known as a micropenis), and the urethra may open on the underside of the penis rather than at the tip (known as hypospadias). In adolescence, people with 17-beta will often develop some secondary sex characteristics associated with a typical testosterone puberty."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con deficiencia de 17-beta hidroxiesteroide deshidrogenasa 3, abreviada como \"17-beta\", tienen cromosomas XY y testículos, pero su sus cuerpos carecen de una de las enzimas necesarias para sintetizar la testosterona. La mayoría de las personas con 17-beta nacen con vulva y vagina, y sus testículos no suelen descender. Algunas personas con 17-beta nacen con genitales que no se parecen claramente a un pene típico o a una vulva típica. Algunas tendrán un pene más pequeño de lo normal (lo que se conoce como micropene) y la uretra puede abrirse en la parte inferior del pene en lugar de en la punta (lo que se conoce como hipospadias). En la adolescencia, las personas con 17-beta a menudo desarrollarán algunas características sexuales secundarias asociadas a una pubertad típica con testosterona."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit 17-Beta-Hydroxysteroid-Dehydrogenase-3-Mangel, hier abgekürzt „17-Beta“, haben XY-Chromosomen und Hoden, aber ihr Körper verfügt nicht über eines der Enzyme, die für die Synthese von Testosteron erforderlich sind. Die meisten Menschen mit 17-Beta werden mit einer Vulva und einer Vagina geboren, und ihre Hoden sind meist nicht herabgestiegen. Einige Menschen mit 17-Beta werden mit Genitalien geboren, die weder einem typischen Penis noch einer typischen Vulva ähneln. Manche haben einen Penis, der kleiner als typisch ist (Mikropenis), und die Harnröhre öffnet sich möglicherweise an der Unterseite des Penis und nicht an der Spitze (Hypospadie). In der Pubertät entwickeln Menschen mit 17-Beta häufig einige sekundäre Geschlechtsmerkmale, die mit einer typischen Testosteron-Pubertät einhergehen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met een tekort aan 17-bèta-hydroxysteroïd dehydrogenase 3, afgekort als '17-bèta', hebben XY-chromosomen en teelballen, maar hun lichaam beschikt niet over een van de enzymen die nodig zijn om testosteron te synthetiseren. De meeste mensen met 17-bèta worden geboren met een vulva en een vagina, en hun testikels zijn meestal niet ingedaald. Sommige mensen met 17-bèta worden geboren met geslachtsdelen die niet duidelijk op een typische penis of een typische vulva lijken. Sommigen zullen een penis hebben die kleiner kan zijn dan normaal (bekend als een micropenis), en de urethra kan zich aan de onderkant van de penis openen in plaats van aan de punt (bekend als hypospadie). In de adolescentie ontwikkelen mensen met 17-bèta vaak secundaire geslachtskenmerken die verband houden met een typische testosteron-puberteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Människor med 17β-HSD-3-brist, har en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) och testiklar, men deras kroppar saknar ett av de enzym som behövs för att syntetisera testosteron. De flesta personer med 17β-HSD-3-brist föds med vulva och vagina, och deras testiklar brukar vara kvar i bukhålan eller ljumskarna eftersom de oftast inte har vandrat ner i pungen. Vissa personer med 17β-HSD-3-brist föds med könsorgan som inte tydligt liknar en typisk penis eller en typisk vulva. Vissa kommer att ha en penis som kan vara mindre än vanligt (så kallad mikropenis), och urinröret kan öppna sig på undersidan av penis snarare än vid spetsen (så kallad hypospadi). Under tonåren utvecklar personer med 17β-HSD-3-brist ofta några sekundära könskarakteristika som är förknippade med en typisk testosteronpubertet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002819","dc:identifier":"homoit0002819","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ambiguous genitalia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Genitales ambiguos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"uneindeutige Geniltalien"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ambigue geslachtsorganen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Oklart kön"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"nicht eindeutige Genitalien"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Genital anomali"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Atypiska könsorgan"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term used to describe a birth variation in which the outer genitals do not have the typical appearance of those associated with either boys or girls. This is often the first sign many doctors and parents see that indicate their child has an intersex variation. Ambiguous genitalia can be caused by a variety of variations and rarely require immediate surgical intervention as long as the child is able to excrete and urinate without complications. Many intersex people find this term stigmatizing, so it should not be used unless the individual uses it to describe themselves."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir una variación del nacimiento en la que los genitales externos no tienen la apariencia típica de los asociados con niños o niñas. Esta es a menudo la primera señal que ven muchos médicos y padres que indica que su hijo tiene una variación intersex. Los genitales ambiguos pueden deberse a una variedad de variaciones y rara vez requieren una intervención quirúrgica inmediata, siempre que el niño pueda excretar y orinar sin complicaciones. Muchas personas intersex encuentran este término estigmatizante, por lo que no debe usarse a menos que la persona lo use para describirse a sí misma."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Begriff, der verwendet wird, um Genitalien zu beschreiben, bei denen die äußeren Genitalien nicht den medizinischen Normvorstellungen eines weiblichen oder männlichen Erscheinungsbilds entsprechen. Medizinisches Fachpersonal und Eltern deuten dies oft als erstes Anzeichen von Inter*. Selten erfordern die so eingeordneten Genitalien einen sofortigen chirurgischen Eingriff, vor allem dann nicht, wenn das Kind in der Lage ist, ohne Komplikationen auszuscheiden und zu urinieren. Viele inter* Menschen empfinden diesen Begriff als stigmatisierend, weil dahinter* die Vorstellung steht, dass es \"richtige\" und \"falsche\" Genitalien gäbe. Diese Annahme führt häufig zur fremdbestimmenden und folgenreichen medizinischen Praxis, die Genitalien von inter* Kindern operativ an ein normatives Erscheinungsbild anzugleichen. Inter Personen sprechen dabei häufig von genitalverstümmelnden Operationen. Der Begriff \"uneindeutige Genitalien\" sollte daher nicht verwendet werden, es sei denn, die betreffende Person hat ihre Einwilligung erteilt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die wordt gebruikt om een geboortevariatie te beschrijven waarbij de buitenste geslachtsorganen niet het typische uiterlijk hebben van die van jongens of meisjes. Dit is vaak het eerste teken dat veel artsen en ouders zien dat aangeeft dat hun kind een intersekse-variatie heeft. Ambigue geslachtsorganen kunnen worden veroorzaakt door een verscheidenheid aan variaties en vereisen zelden onmiddellijke chirurgische ingreep, zolang het kind zonder complicaties kan uitscheiden en urineren. Veel intersekse personen vinden deze term stigmatiserend, dus deze mag niet worden gebruikt, tenzij het individu hem gebruikt om zichzelf te beschrijven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En medicinsk term som används för att beskriva en medfödd variation där de yttre könsorganen inte har det typiska utseendet för vare sig pojkar eller flickor. Detta är ofta det första tecknet som läkare och föräldrar ser på att ett barn har en intersexvariation. Detta kan ha olika orsaker och kräver sällan omedelbar kirurgisk intervention, så länge barnet kan kissa och bajsa utan komplikationer. Många intersexpersoner upplever denna term som stigmatiserande och den bör därför inte användas om inte individen själv använder den för att beskriva sig själv."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002821","dc:identifier":"homoit0002821","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anorchia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Anorquia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Anorchie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anorchie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Anorki"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Anorchidie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Testikelagenesi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person with anorchia has 46 XY chromosomes and is born without testes. As a result, they do not produce typical levels of testosterone. Someone with anorchia will usually have a typical-appearing penis and scrotum because these organs are already formed by the stage of fetal development when the testes disappear."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona con anorquia tiene 46 cromosomas XY y nace sin testículos. Como resultado, no producen niveles típicos de testosterona. Alguien con anorquia generalmente tiene un pene y un escroto de apariencia típica porque estos órganos ya están formados en la etapa de desarrollo fetal en la que desaparecen los testículos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Mensch mit Anorchie hat 46 XY-Chromosomen und wird ohne Hoden geboren. Infolgedessen produzieren sie keine typischen Mengen an Testosteron. Jemand mit Anorchie hat in der Regel einen typisch aussehenden Penis und Hodensack, da diese Organe bereits in der Phase der fötalen Entwicklung gebildet werden, wenn die Hoden verschwinden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon met anorchie heeft 46 XY-chromosomen en wordt geboren zonder testikels. Als gevolg hiervan produceren ze geen typische testosteronniveaus. Iemand met anorchia heeft meestal een penis en scrotum die er normaal uitzien, omdat deze organen al worden gevormd in het stadium van de ontwikkeling van de foetus, wanneer de teelballen verdwijnen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person med anorki har en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) men föds utan testiklar. Som ett resultat producerar de inte typiska nivåer av testosteron. En person med anorki har oftast ett förväntat utseende på penis och pung, eftersom dessa organ redan har bildats vid det fosterutvecklingsstadium då testiklarna försvinner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002822","dc:identifier":"homoit0002822","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromatase deficiency"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deficiencia de aromatasa"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromatase-Mangel"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromatase deficiëntie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromatasbrist"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with aromatase deficiency do not have the enzyme responsible for converting androgens into estrogen. At birth, someone with aromatase deficiency and XX chromosomes may have a larger-than-typical clitoris and partially or completely fused labia (resembling the appearance of a scrotum). At puberty, they may not develop breasts, may not begin menstruating, and may develop some secondary sex characteristics associated with a typical testosterone puberty. They may also develop multiple cysts on their ovaries. People with XY chromosomes can also have aromatase deficiency, but they do not typically experience variations in their sex characteristics, though they may grow taller than is typical because estrogen is usually responsible for closing the bone growth plates."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con deficiencia de aromatasa no tienen la enzima responsable de convertir los andrógenos en estrógeno. Al nacer, una persona con deficiencia de aromatasa y cromosomas XX puede tener un clítoris más grande de lo típico y labios vaginales parcial o completamente fusionados (que se asemejan a la apariencia de un escroto). En la pubertad, es posible que no desarrollen senos, que no comiencen a menstruar y que desarrollen algunas características sexuales secundarias asociadas con una pubertad típica de testosterona. También pueden desarrollar múltiples quistes en los ovarios. Las personas con cromosomas XY también pueden tener deficiencia de aromatasa, pero normalmente no experimentan variaciones en sus características sexuales, aunque pueden crecer más de lo normal porque el estrógeno suele ser responsable de cerrar las placas de crecimiento óseo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit Aromatase-Mangel verfügen nicht über das Enzym, das für die Umwandlung von Androgenen in Östrogen verantwortlich ist. Bei der Geburt können Menschen mit Aromatase-Mangel und XX-Chromosomen eine größere Klitoris als üblich und teilweise oder vollständig verwachsene Schamlippen haben (was dem Aussehen eines Hodensacks ähnelt). In der Pubertät entwickeln sie möglicherweise keine Brüste, beginnen nicht zu menstruieren und können einige sekundäre Geschlechtsmerkmale entwickeln, die mit einer typischen Testosteron-Pubertät einhergehen. Sie können auch mehrere Zysten an ihren Eierstöcken entwickeln. Menschen mit XY-Chromosomen können ebenfalls einen Aromatase-Mangel haben, doch treten bei ihnen in der Regel keine Veränderungen der Geschlechtsmerkmale auf, obwohl sie größer werden können als typisch ist, da Östrogen normalerweise für das Schließen der Knochenwachstumsplatten verantwortlich ist."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met aromatase deficiëntie beschikken niet over het enzym dat androgenen omzet in oestrogeen. Bij de geboorte kan iemand met aromatase deficiëntie en XX-chromosomen een clitoris hebben die groter is dan normaal, en gedeeltelijk of volledig vergroeide schaamlippen (die lijken op een scrotum). In de puberteit ontwikkelen ze mogelijk geen borsten, beginnen ze mogelijk niet met menstrueren en kunnen ze enkele secundaire geslachtskenmerken ontwikkelen die horen bij een typische testosteronpuberteit. Ze kunnen ook meerdere cysten op hun eierstokken ontwikkelen. Mensen met XY-chromosomen kunnen ook een aromatase-deficiëntie hebben, maar zij ervaren meestal geen variaties in hun geslachtskenmerken, hoewel ze langer kunnen worden dan normaal omdat oestrogeen meestal verantwoordelijk is voor het sluiten van de botgroeiplaten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med aromatasbrist saknar enzymet som omvandlar androgener till östrogen. Vid födseln kan en person med aromatasbrist och två X-kromosomer (46XX) ha en större klitoris än vanligt och delvis eller helt sammanvuxna blygdläppar (vilket kan likna en pung). Under puberteten kan de få utebliven bröstutveckling, avsaknad av menstruation och utveckla vissa sekundära könskarakteristika som vanligtvis hör ihop med en testosteronstyrd pubertet. De kan också utveckla flera cystor på äggstockarna. Personer med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) kan också ha aromatasbrist, men de upplever oftast inga variationer i sina könskarakteristika. Däremot kan de bli längre än genomsnittet, eftersom östrogen vanligtvis är ansvarigt för att stänga benens tillväxtplattor. Aromatasbrist kan vara partiell eller komplett, enzymet kan saknas eller produceras i en icke funktionell variant, eller så är produktionen nedsatt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002823","dc:identifier":"homoit0002823","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromatase excess syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de exceso de la aromatasa"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromatase-Exzess-Syndrom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Syndroom van overmaat aan aromatase"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromatase excess syndrome"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Familial gynecomastia"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hyperestrogenism "},{"@language":"de","@value":"AEXS"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hyperöstrogenismus"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Präpubertäre Gynäkomastie, hereditäre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperestrogenie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromatasöverskottssyndrom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"AES"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with aromatase excess have increased production of aromatase, which converts androgens (like testosterone) into estrogen. People with XY chromosomes and aromatase excess syndrome will therefore have more active estrogen in their bodies than is typical. As a result, they will often stop growing at a shorter height and/or develop breasts in adolescence along with features associated with a typical testosterone puberty. People with XX chromosomes can also have aromatase excess, but it doesn't usually cause their sex characteristics to vary from what is considered typical for those assigned female at birth, though they may also experience breast enlargement and short stature, along with menstrual irregularities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con exceso de aromatasa tienen una mayor producción de aromatasa, que convierte los andrógenos (como la testosterona) en estrógeno. Por lo tanto, las personas con cromosomas XY y síndrome de exceso de aromatasa tendrán estrógenos más activos en sus cuerpos de lo habitual. Como resultado, a menudo dejarán de crecer a una altura baja y/o desarrollarán senos en la adolescencia junto con características asociadas con una pubertad típica de testosterona. Las personas con cromosomas XX también pueden tener un exceso de aromatasa, pero esto no suele hacer que sus características sexuales varíen de lo que se considera típico para las personas asignadas al sexo femenino al nacer, aunque también pueden experimentar agrandamiento de los senos y baja estatura, junto con irregularidades menstruales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit Aromatase-Exzess-Syndrom haben eine erhöhte Produktion von Aromatase, die Androgene (wie Testosteron) in Östrogen umwandelt. Menschen mit XY-Chromosomen und Aromatase-Exzess-Syndrom haben daher mehr aktives Östrogen in ihrem Körper als typisch ist. Infolgedessen hören sie oft früher auf zu wachsen, und/oder entwickeln in der Jugend Brüste, zusammen mit Merkmalen, die mit einer typischen Testosteronpubertät verbunden sind. Menschen mit XX-Chromosomen können ebenfalls an einem Aromatase-Exzess-Syndrom leiden, doch führt dies in der Regel nicht dazu, dass ihre Geschlechtsmerkmale von dem abweichen, was für Menschen, die bei der Geburt als weiblich eingestuft wurden, als typisch gilt, obwohl auch bei ihnen Brustvergrößerung und Kleinwuchs sowie Menstruationsunregelmäßigkeiten auftreten können."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met aromatase overmaat hebben een verhoogde productie van aromatase, het hormoon dat androgenen (zoals testosteron) omzet in oestrogeen. Personen met XY-chromosomen en het Syndroom van overmaat aan aromatase hebben daarom meer actief oestrogeen in hun lichaam dan normaal. Als gevolg hiervan zullen ze vaak stoppen met groeien op een kortere lengte en/of borsten ontwikkelen in de puberteit samen met kenmerken die geassocieerd worden met een typische testosteron puberteit. Mensen met XX-chromosomen kunnen ook een aromatase overmaat hebben, maar dit heeft meestal niet tot gevolg dat hun geslachtskenmerken afwijken van wat als typisch wordt beschouwd voor mensen die bij de geboorte als vrouw worden toegewezen, hoewel ze ook last kunnen hebben van borstvergroting en een kort postuur, samen met menstruele onregelmatigheden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med aromatase excess syndrome (AES) har en ökad produktion av enzymet aromatas, vilket omvandlar androgener (som testosteron) till östrogen. Personer med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) och AES har därför mer aktivt östrogen i kroppen än vad som är typiskt. Som ett resultat slutar de ofta växa vid en kortare längd och/eller utvecklar bröst under tonåren, samtidigt som de får andra drag som associeras med en testosteronstyrd pubertet. Personer med två X-kromosomer (46XX) kan också ha aromatasöverskott, men det orsakar vanligtvis inte några avvikelser i deras könskarakteristika. Däremot kan de uppleva bröstförstoring, kortare längd samt oregelbundna menstruationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002824","dc:identifier":"homoit0002824","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bladder exstrophy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Extrofia vesical"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Blasenextrophie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Blaasextrofie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Blåsexstrofi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with bladder exstrophy are born with their urinary bladder exposed (through an open abdominal wall) or outside of the body. They may also have an open pelvis (resulting from the pubic bones not joining together), which causes genital differences. People with bladder exstrophy and XY chromosomes often have a shorter-than-typical penis with epispadias (meaning the urethra opens on the top surface of the penis instead of at the tip) and undescended testes. People with XX chromosomes and bladder exstrophy often have a urethra that is placed higher than usual, widely spaced labia (due to the wide spacing of their pubic bones), and a clitoris formed in two halves with a split in the middle."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con extrofia vesical nacen con la vejiga urinaria expuesta (a través de una pared abdominal abierta) o fuera del cuerpo. También pueden tener la pelvis abierta (como resultado de que los huesos del pubis no se unieran), lo que provoca diferencias genitales. Las personas con extrofia vesical y cromosomas XY suelen tener un pene más corto de lo normal con epispadias (lo que significa que la uretra se abre en la superficie superior del pene en lugar de en la punta) y testículos no descendidos. Las personas con cromosomas XX y extrofia vesical a menudo tienen una uretra posicionada más alta de lo usual, labios vaginales muy espaciados (debido al gran espacio entre los huesos púbicos) y un clítoris formado en dos mitades con una división en el medio."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit Blasenekstrophie werden mit einer freiliegenden Harnblase (durch eine offene Bauchdecke) oder außerhalb des Körpers geboren. Sie können auch ein offenes Becken haben (das dadurch entsteht, dass die Schambeine nicht zusammenwachsen), was zu genitalen Unterschieden führt. Menschen mit Blasenekstrophie und XY-Chromosomen haben oft einen kürzeren Penis als normal, mit Epispadie (d. h. die Harnröhre mündet an der Oberseite des Penis statt an der Spitze) und Hodenhochstand. Menschen mit XX-Chromosomen und Blasenekstrophie haben oft eine höher als normal gelegene Harnröhre, weit auseinanderstehende Schamlippen (aufgrund des großen Abstands ihrer Schambeine) und eine Klitoris, die aus zwei Hälften mit einer Spalte in der Mitte besteht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen met blaasexstrofie worden geboren met hun urineblaas open (door een open buikwand) of buiten het lichaam. Ze kunnen ook een open bekken hebben (doordat de schaambeenderen niet aan elkaar vastzitten), wat genitale verschillen veroorzaakt. Mensen met blaasexstrofie en XY-chromosomen hebben vaak een penis die korter is dan normaal, met epispadias (wat betekent dat de urinebuis aan de bovenkant van de penis opengaat in plaats van aan de eikel) en ongegroeide testikels. Mensen met XX-chromosomen en blaasexstrofie hebben vaak een urinebuis die hoger ligt dan normaal, wijd uit elkaar staande schaamlippen (door de grote afstand tussen hun schaambeenderen) en een clitoris die uit twee helften bestaat met een split in het midden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med blåsexstrofi föds med urinblåsan exponerad (genom en öppen bukvägg) eller placerad utanför kroppen. De kan också ha en öppen bäckenstruktur (eftersom pubisbenen inte är sammanfogade), vilket leder till genitala variationer. Personer med blåsexstrofi och en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) har ofta en kortare än genomsnittlig penis med epispadi (vilket innebär att urinrörsöppningen är placerad på ovansidan av penis istället för vid spetsen) och testiklar som inte har vandrat ner. Personer med två X-kromosomer (46XX) och blåsexstrofi har ofta en urinrörsöppning placerad ovanför klitoris, brett isärsittande blygdläppar (på grund av det breda avståndet mellan pubisbenen) och en klitoris som är uppdelad i två halvor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85014741"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002826","dc:identifier":"homoit0002826","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chimerism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Quimerismo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chimärismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chimerisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Chimärism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the variation in which a person is born with two or more different sets of DNA. This can occur when multiple zygotes (such as fraternal twins) combine and develop into one fetus. Sex-chromosome discordant chimerism occurs when at least one embryo with XX chromosomes fuses with at least one embryo with XY chromosomes. A person who develops this way would have sets of both XX and XY chromosomes, or a chromosome pattern of 46XX/46XY, and could have a wide variety of different possible sex characteristics. Many people with chimerism and XX/XY chromosomes have both ovarian and testicular tissue, while others have only testes or only ovaries, and still others have gonadal dysgenesis. Some have noticeable genital differences and others do not."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la variación en la que una persona nace con dos o más tipos de ADN. Esto puede ocurrir cuando varios cigotos (como los gemelos fraternos) se combinan y forman un solo feto. El quimerismo discordante de cromosomas sexuales ocurre cuando al menos un embrión con cromosomas XX se fusiona con al menos un embrión con cromosomas XY. Una persona que se desarrolla de esta manera tendría conjuntos de cromosomas XX y XY, o un patrón cromosómico de 46XX/46XY, y podría tener una amplia variedad de posibles características sexuales diferentes. Muchas personas con quimerismo y cromosomas XX/XY tienen tejido ovárico y testicular, mientras que otras solo tienen testículos o solo ovarios, y otras tienen disgenesia gonadal. Algunos tienen diferencias genitales notables y otros no."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Begriff, der verwendet wird, um die Variante zu beschreiben, bei der eine Person mit zwei oder mehreren unterschiedlichen DNA-Sätzen geboren wird. Dies kann auftreten, wenn sich mehrere Zygoten (z. B. zweieiige Zwillinge) verbinden und zu einem Fötus entwickeln. Geschlechtschromosomen-diskordanter Chimärismus tritt auf, wenn mindestens ein Embryo mit XX-Chromosomen mit mindestens einem Embryo mit XY-Chromosomen zusammenwächst. Eine Person, die sich auf diese Weise entwickelt, kann sowohl XX- als auch XY-Chromosomensätze oder ein Chromosomenmuster von 46XX/46XY haben und eine Vielzahl unterschiedlicher Geschlechtsmerkmale aufweisen. Viele Menschen mit Chimärismus und XX/XY-Chromosomen haben sowohl Eierstock- als auch Hodengewebe, während andere nur Hoden oder nur Eierstöcke haben und wieder andere eine Gonadendysgenesie aufweisen. Einige haben auffällige genitale Unterschiede, andere nicht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die gebruikt wordt om de variatie te beschrijven waarbij iemand geboren wordt met twee of meer verschillende sets DNA. Dit kan voorkomen wanneer meerdere zygoten (zoals bij tweelingen) samensmelten en zich ontwikkelen tot één foetus. Discordant chimerisme op basis van geslachtschromosomen treedt op wanneer ten minste één embryo met XX-chromosomen samensmelt met ten minste één embryo met XY-chromosomen. Een persoon die zich op deze manier ontwikkelt zou sets van zowel XX als XY chromosomen hebben, of een chromosomenpatroon van 46XX/46XY, en zou een grote verscheidenheid aan mogelijke geslachtskenmerken kunnen hebben. Veel mensen met chimerisme en XX/XY chromosomen hebben zowel eierstok- als testisweefsel, terwijl anderen alleen testikels of alleen eierstokken hebben en weer anderen gonadale dysgenese hebben. Sommigen hebben merkbare genitale verschillen en anderen niet."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva en variation där en person föds med två eller flera olika uppsättningar genetiskt material (DNA). Detta kan ske när flera zygoter (såsom tvåäggstvillingar) smälter samman och utvecklas till ett foster. Kromosomvariationer mellan könskromosomer (XX/XY-chimärism) uppstår när minst ett embryo med två X-kromosomer (46XX) smälter samman med minst ett embryo med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY). En person som utvecklas på detta sätt skulle ha både två X- och en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY), eller ett kromosommönster av 46XX/46XY, och kan ha en mängd olika möjliga könskarakteristika. Många personer med chimärism och XX/XY-kromosomer har både ovarievävnad och testikelvävnad, medan andra enbart har testiklar eller enbart äggstockar, och vissa har gonaddysgenes (avsaknad av gonader/könskörtlar). Vissa har synliga genitala variationer, medan andra inte har det."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2011001809"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002828","dc:identifier":"homoit0002828","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cloacal exstrophy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Extrofia cloacal"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kloakenekstrophie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Cloacale extrofie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kloakekstrofi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de OEIS"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cloacal exstrophy"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People born with cloacal exstrophy are born with an open abdominal wall exposing their colon, bladder, and sometimes other abdominal organs. Their organs may also be positioned outside of the body at birth. The bladder is often split into two halves, and the colon and bladder may be connected. The anal opening may be blocked or not have been formed. The pubic bones do not join together, resulting in an open pelvis with noticeable genital differences. People with XY chromosomes and cloacal exstrophy may have a smaller-than-typical penis that is flat or split into two halves with an epispadic urethra (opening on the top of the penis rather than at the tip) and undescended testes. Someone with XX chromosomes and cloacal exstrophy usually has a clitoris that is split into two halves, and they may have two vaginal openings."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas que nacen con extrofia cloacal nacen con la pared abdominal abierta, exponiendo el colon, la vejiga y, a veces, otros órganos abdominales. Sus órganos también pueden estar ubicados fuera del cuerpo al nacer. La vejiga suele estar dividida en dos mitades, y el colon y la vejiga pueden estar conectados. La apertura anal puede estar bloqueada o no haberse formado. Los huesos púbicos no se unen, lo que resulta en una pelvis abierta con diferencias genitales notables. Las personas con cromosomas XY y extrofia cloacal pueden tener un pene más pequeño de lo usual, plano o dividido en dos mitades con una uretra epispádica (que se abre en la parte superior del pene en lugar de la punta) y testículos no descendidos. Alguien con cromosomas XX y extrofia cloacal suele tener un clítoris dividido en dos mitades y puede tener dos aperturas vaginales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen, die mit einer Kloakenekstrophie geboren werden, haben eine offene Bauchdecke, durch die ihr Dickdarm, ihre Blase und manchmal auch andere Bauchorgane sichtbar sind. Ihre Organe können bei der Geburt auch außerhalb des Körpers liegen. Die Blase ist oft in zwei Hälften geteilt, und Dickdarm und Blase können miteinander verbunden sein. Die Afteröffnung kann blockiert sein oder nicht ausgebildet sein. Die Schambeine sind nicht miteinander verbunden, was zu einem offenen Becken mit auffälligen genitalen Unterschieden führt. Menschen mit XY-Chromosomen und Kloakenekstrophie haben möglicherweise einen kleiner als gewöhnlich ausgeprägten Penis, der flach oder in zwei Hälften geteilt ist, mit einer Epispadie (Öffnung an der Oberseite des Penis statt an der Spitze) und Hodenhochstand. Menschen mit XX-Chromosomen und Kloakenekstrophie haben in der Regel eine in zwei Hälften geteilte Klitoris und möglicherweise zwei Vaginalöffnungen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met cloacale exstrofie worden geboren met een open buikwand die hun dikke darm, blaas en soms andere buikorganen blootlegt. Hun organen kunnen zich bij de geboorte ook buiten het lichaam bevinden. De blaas is vaak in twee helften gesplitst en de dikke darm en blaas kunnen met elkaar verbonden zijn. De anale opening kan geblokkeerd of niet aanwezig zijn. De schaambeenderen sluiten niet op elkaar aan, wat resulteert in een open bekken met merkbare genitale verschillen. Mensen met XY-chromosomen en cloacale exstrofie kunnen een kleinere penis hebben dan normaal, die plat is of in twee helften is gesplitst met een epispadische urethra (opening aan de bovenkant van de penis in plaats van aan de eikel) en ongegroeide testikels. Iemand met XX-chromosomen en cloacale exstrofie heeft meestal een clitoris die in twee helften is gesplitst en kan twee vaginale openingen hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med kloakekstrofi föds med en öppen bukvägg orsakat av att bukväggen inte slutits normalt under fosterstadiet. Bukorganen kan vara synliga eller placerade utanför kroppen vid födseln. Urinblåsan är ofta delad i två halvor, och tjocktarmen och urinblåsan kan vara sammanlänkade. Analöppningen kan vara blockerad eller saknas helt. Blygdbenen växer inte samman, vilket leder till en öppen bäckenstruktur med tydliga genitala variationer. Personer med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) och kloakekstrofi kan ha en mindre än genomsnittlig penis som är platt eller delad i två halvor med en epispadisk urinrörsöppning (belägen på ovansidan av penisen i stället för vid spetsen) och testiklar som inte har vandrat ner. En person med två X-kromosomer (46XX) och kloakekstrofi har oftast en klitoris som är delad i två halvor och kan ha två vaginalöppningar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh90003339"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002829","dc:identifier":"homoit0002829","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Complete androgen insensitivity syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de insensibilidad androgénica completa"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Komplettes Androgeninsensitivitätssyndrom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Volledig androgeen ongevoeligheidssyndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständig androgenokänslighetssyndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"CAIS"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Komplette Androgenresistenz"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Goldberg-Maxwell-Morris-Syndrom"},{"@language":"de","@value":"CAIS"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Compleet androgeen ongevoeligheidssyndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständig androgen insensitivitets syndrom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with complete androgen insensitivity syndrome (CAIS) have no response to androgens and are born with a vulva and clitoris, as well as a shorter-than-typical vagina and undescended testes. In adolescence, they will develop breasts and other features associated with a typical estrogen puberty due to the body’s natural conversion of testosterone to estrogen. However, people with CAIS do not menstruate because they do not have a uterus or ovaries."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con síndrome de insensibilidad androgénica completa (CAIS) no responden a los andrógenos y nacen con vulva y clítoris, así como con una vagina más corta de lo usual y testículos no descendidos. En la adolescencia, desarrollarán senos y otras características asociadas con una pubertad típica de estrógeno debido a la conversión natural de testosterona en estrógeno por parte del cuerpo. Sin embargo, las personas con CAIS no menstrúan porque no tienen útero ni ovarios."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit vollständigem Androgeninsensitivitätssyndrom (CAIS) reagieren nicht auf Androgene und werden mit einer Vulva und Klitoris sowie einer kürzeren als der typischen Vagina und nicht heruntergewanderten Hoden geboren. In der Pubertät entwickeln sie aufgrund der natürlichen Umwandlung von Testosteron in Östrogen durch den Körper Brüste und andere Merkmale, die mit einer typischen Östrogen-Pubertät verbunden sind. Menschen mit CAIS haben jedoch keine Menstruation, da sie keine Gebärmutter und keine Eierstöcke haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen met het compleet androgeenongevoeligheidssyndroom (CAOS) reageren niet op androgenen en worden geboren met een vulva en clitoris, een vagina die korter is dan normaal en niet ingedaalde testikels. Tijdens de adolescentie ontwikkelen ze borsten en andere kenmerken die horen bij een typische oestrogeenpuberteit door de natuurlijke omzetting van testosteron in oestrogeen door het lichaam. Mensen met CAOS menstrueren echter niet omdat ze geen baarmoeder of eierstokken hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med fullständig androgenokänslighetssyndrom (CAIS) har ingen respons på androgener och föds med en vulva och klitoris, samt en kortare än genomsnittlig vagina och inre testiklar. Under tonåren utvecklar de bröst och andra drag som typiskt förknippas med en östrogendominant pubertet på grund av kroppens naturliga omvandling av testosteron till östrogen. Personer med CAIS menstruerar dock inte, eftersom de saknar livmoder och äggstockar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002831","dc:identifier":"homoit0002831","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Congenital chordee"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chordee peneano"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Penisverkrümmung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aangeboren kromstand van de penis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kongenital chordee"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Encordamiento peneano"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuerda congénita"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Curvatura peniana ventral"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Peniskurvatur"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Penisdeviation"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Korda"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People born with congenital chordee have a penis that curves upward or downward or bends to one side, usually due to bands of fibrous tissue that pull the penis in a particular direction. People with congenital chordee often have hypospadias, meaning that their urethral opening is not at the tip of the penis."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas que nacen con cuerda congénita tienen un pene que se curva hacia arriba o hacia abajo o se dobla hacia un lado, generalmente debido a bandas de tejido fibroso que tiran del pene en una dirección particular. Las personas con cuerda congénita suelen tener hipospadias, lo que significa que la apertura uretral no está en la punta del pene."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen, die mit einer angeborenen Penisverkrümmung geboren werden, haben einen Penis, der nach oben oder unten gekrümmt ist oder sich zu einer Seite neigt, was in der Regel auf Bänder aus fibrösem Gewebe zurückzuführen ist, die den Penis in eine bestimmte Richtung ziehen. Menschen mit einer angeborenen Penisverkrümmung leiden häufig unter Hypospadie, was bedeutet, dass sich ihre Harnröhrenöffnung nicht an der Spitze des Penis befindet."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die geboren worden met congenitale kromstand hebben een penis die naar boven of naar beneden buigt of naar één kant buigt, meestal als gevolg van banden van fibreus weefsel die de penis in een bepaalde richting trekken. Mensen met congenitale kromstand hebben vaak hypospadias, wat betekent dat hun plasbuisopening zich niet aan het uiteinde van de penis bevindt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som föds med kongenital chordee har en penis som är krökt uppåt, nedåt eller åt sidan, oftast på grund av bindvävsband som drar penisen i en viss riktning. Personer med kongenital chordee har ofta hypospadi, vilket innebär att urinrörsöppningen inte är placerad vid spetsen av penisen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002832","dc:identifier":"homoit0002832","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cryptorchidism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Criptorquidia"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kryptorchismus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Cryptorchisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kryptorkism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Undescended testes"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Undescended testicles"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Testículos no descendidos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hodenhochstand"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hodendystopie"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lageanomalie der Hoden"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Niet ingedaalde testikels"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Niet ingedaalde zaadballen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Testikelretention"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"An intersex variation in which one or both of the testes do not descend from the abdomen into the scrotum. If both testes are undescended, this is known as \"bilateral cryptorchidism,\" whereas \"unilateral cryptorchidism\" occurs when only one the testes does not descend."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una variación intersex en la que uno o ambos testículos no descienden del abdomen al escroto. Si ambos testículos no descienden, esto se conoce como \"criptorquidia bilateral\", mientras que la \"criptorquidia unilateral\" ocurre cuando solo uno de los testículos no desciende."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Variante, bei der einer oder beide Hoden nicht aus dem Bauchraum in den Hodensack wandern. Sind beide Hoden nicht gewandert, spricht man von „beidseitigem Kryptorchismus“, während „einseitiger Kryptorchismus“ vorliegt, wenn nur ein Hoden nicht gewandert ist."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een interseksevariatie waarbij een of beide testikels niet van de buik naar het scrotum afdalen. Als beide testikels niet zijn ingedaald, staat dit bekend als 'bilateraal cryptorchisme', terwijl 'unilateraal cryptorchisme' optreedt wanneer slechts één van de testikels niet indaalt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En intersexvariation där en eller båda testiklarna inte vandrar ner från bukhålan till pungen. Om ingen av testiklarna ävandrat ner kallas det ”bilateral kryptorkism”, medan ”unilateral kryptorkism” används när endast en testikel inte har vandrat ner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85034467"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002833","dc:identifier":"homoit0002833","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"De la Chapelle syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de De la Chapelle"},{"@language":"de","@value":"De-la-Chapelle-Syndrom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De la Chapelle syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"de la Chapelles syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"XX male syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome del varón XX"},{"@language":"de","@value":"XX-Mann-Syndrom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"XX mannelijk syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"XX-male type"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"XX-male syndrom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"De la Chapelle syndrome causes people with XX chromosomes to be born with a penis and testes. This usually happens because a particular gene typically seen on Y chromosomes (known as the SRY gene) ends up on one of their X chromosomes and causes their genitals and internal reproductive organs to develop as they typically would in someone with XY chromosomes. People with de la Chapelle might have testes that are smaller than typical or that are undescended, and they are often infertile. In adolescence, they may experience breast growth, and they might not develop the characteristics that are usually associated with a typical testosterone puberty."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El síndrome de De la Chapelle provoca que las personas con cromosomas XX nazcan con pene y testículos. Esto suele suceder porque un gen particular que normalmente se ve en los cromosomas Y (conocido como el gen SRY) termina en uno de los cromosomas X y provoca que sus genitales y órganos reproductivos internos se desarrollen como lo harían normalmente en alguien con cromosomas XY. Las personas con De la Chapelle pueden tener testículos más pequeños de lo usual o que no han descendido y, a menudo, son infértiles. En la adolescencia, pueden experimentar crecimiento de los senos y es posible que no desarrollen las características que generalmente se asocian con una pubertad típica de testosterona."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Das De‑la‑Chapelle‑Syndrom führt dazu, dass Menschen mit einem XX-Chromosomenpaar mit Penis und Hoden geboren werden. Ursache ist in der Regel, dass ein bestimmtes Gen, das normalerweise auf dem Y-Chromosom liegt (bekannt als SRY-Gen), auf eines der X-Chromosomen übertragen wird. Dies bewirkt, dass sich Genitalien und innere Fortpflanzungsorgane so entwickeln, wie es typischerweise bei Menschen mit XY-Chromosomen der Fall ist. Menschen mit De-la-Chapelle-Syndrom haben möglicherweise kleinere Hoden als normal oder Hodenhochstand und sind oft unfruchtbar. In der Pubertät kann es zu einem Brustwachstum kommen, und typische Merkmale einer Testosteron-Pubertät entwickeln sich möglicherweise nicht vollständig."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het De la Chapelle syndroom zorgt ervoor dat personen met XX-chromosomen geboren worden met een penis en teelballen. Dit gebeurt meestal omdat een bepaald gen dat doorgaans op de Y-chromosomen wordt aangetroffen (bekend als het SRY-gen) op een van hun X-chromosomen terechtkomt en ervoor zorgt dat hun geslachtsdelen en interne voortplantingsorganen zich ontwikkelen zoals ze normaal gesproken zouden doen bij iemand met XY-chromosomen. Personen met de la Chapelle hebben mogelijk teelballen die kleiner zijn dan normaal of niet-ingedaald zijn, en ze zijn vaak onvruchtbaar. In de adolescentie kunnen ze borstgroei ervaren en ontwikkelen ze mogelijk niet de kenmerken die gewoonlijk worden geassocieerd met een typische testosteron-puberteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"De la Chapelle-syndrom gör att personer med två X-kromosomer (46XX) föds med penis och testiklar. Detta sker vanligtvis eftersom en specifik gen som normalt finns på Y-kromosomen (känd som SRY-genen) hamnar på en av deras X-kromosomer och får deras könsorgan och inre reproduktiva organ att utvecklas på ett sätt som vanligtvis förknippas med personer med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY). Personer med de la Chapelle-syndrom kan ha mindre testiklar än genomsnittet eller testiklar som inte har vandrat ner, och de är ofta infertila. Under tonåren kan de utveckla bröst, och de utvecklar ibland inte de karakteristika som vanligtvis är förknippade med en typisk testosteronstyrd pubertet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002836","dc:identifier":"homoit0002836","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Epispadias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Epispadias"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Epispadie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Epispadie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Epispadi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anaspadias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Anaspadias"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Obere Harnröhrenspaltung"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with epispadias are born with a urinary opening located on the upper surface of their penis rather than at the tip (similar to the more common variation hypospadias). People with vulvas can also be born with epispadias, in which case the urethral opening is wider and located higher than typical. The clitoris may also be split into two halves. Epispadias is usually present whenever bladder exstrophy or cloacal exstrophy develop, but epispadias can also occur by itself."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con epispadias nacen con una apertura urinaria ubicada en la superficie superior del pene en lugar de en la punta (similar a la variación más común de hipospadias). Las personas con vulva también pueden nacer con epispadias, en cuyo caso la apertura uretral es más ancha y está situada más arriba de lo normal. El clítoris también puede dividirse en dos mitades. El epispadias suele estar presente cuando se desarrolla extrofia de la vejiga o extrofia cloacal, pero el epispadias también puede ocurrir por sí solo."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit Epispadie werden mit einer Harnröhrenöffnung geboren, die sich an der Oberseite ihres Penis und nicht an der Spitze befindet (ähnlich wie bei der häufigeren Variante Hypospadie). Auch Menschen mit Vulva können mit Epispadie geboren werden. In diesem Fall ist die Harnröhrenöffnung breiter und liegt höher als normal. Die Klitoris kann ebenfalls in zwei Hälften geteilt sein. Epispadie tritt in der Regel immer dann auf, wenn sich eine Blasenekstrophie oder kloakale Ekstrophie entwickelt, kann aber auch isoliert auftreten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met epispadie worden geboren met een urineopening op het bovenoppervlak van hun penis in plaats van aan de punt (vergelijkbaar met de meer voorkomende variant van hypospadie). Personen met vulva's kunnen ook geboren worden met epispadie, in welk geval de urethrale opening breder is en hoger ligt dan normaal. De clitoris kan ook in twee helften worden gesplitst. Epispadie is meestal aanwezig wanneer blaas-exstrofie of cloacale exstrofie ontstaat, maar epispadie kan ook op zichzelf voorkomen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med epispadi föds med urinrörets mynning på ovansidan av penis i stället för i spetsen (liknande men motsatt tillstånd som hypospadi). Personer med vulva kan också födas med epispadi, då är urinrörsöppningen vidare och placerad högre upp än vanligt. Klitoris kan också vara delad i två delar. Epispadi förekommer ofta tillsammans med blåsexstrofi eller kloakexstrofi, men kan också uppträda isolerat."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85044450"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002837","dc:identifier":"homoit0002837","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Estrogen insensitivity syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de insensibilidad a los estrógenos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Östrogen-Resistenz-Syndrom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Oestrogeen ongevoeligheidssyndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"E. I. S."}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"EIS"},{"@language":"es","@value":"SIA"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Estrogen insensitivity syndrome"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Östrogenokänslighetssyndrom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Östrogenresistens"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with estrogen insensitivity syndrome (EIS) have a genetic variation in which their bodies do not respond to estrogen. People with XX chromosomes and EIS are usually born with a vulva and vagina, may have a small uterus and enlarged ovaries that later develop multiple cysts, and may produce very high levels of estrogen that their bodies do not recognize. In adolescence, they will most likely not experience the changes associated with a typical estrogen puberty such as breast development or menstruation. They may instead develop pubic hair and acne due to the influence of androgens. People with XY chromosomes can also be born with EIS, and they may or may not experience variations in their other hormone production, testicular development, and development of secondary sex characteristics as a result."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con síndrome de insensibilidad al estrógeno (SIE) tienen una variación genética en la que sus cuerpos no responden al estrógeno. Las personas con cromosomas XX y SIE generalmente nacen con vulva y vagina, pueden tener un útero pequeño y ovarios agrandados que luego desarrollan múltiples quistes y pueden producir niveles muy altos de estrógeno que sus cuerpos no reconocen. En la adolescencia, lo más probable es que no experimenten los cambios asociados con una pubertad típica con estrógenos, como el desarrollo de los senos o la menstruación. En cambio, pueden desarrollar vello púbico y acné debido a la influencia de los andrógenos. Las personas con cromosomas XY también pueden nacer con SIE y, como resultado, pueden o no experimentar variaciones en la producción de otras hormonas, el desarrollo testicular y el desarrollo de características sexuales secundarias."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit Östrogen-Resistenz-Syndrom weisen eine genetische Variation auf, aufgrund derer ihr Körper nicht auf Östrogen reagiert. Menschen mit XX-Chromosomen und Östrogen-Resistenz-Syndrom werden in der Regel mit einer Vulva und einer Vagina geboren, haben möglicherweise eine kleine Gebärmutter und vergrößerte Eierstöcke, in denen sich später mehrere Zysten bilden, und produzieren unter Umständen sehr hohe Östrogenspiegel, die ihr Körper nicht erkennt. In der Pubertät werden sie höchstwahrscheinlich nicht die Veränderungen erleben, die mit einer typischen Östrogen-Pubertät verbunden sind, wie z. B. Brustentwicklung oder Menstruation. Stattdessen können sie aufgrund des Einflusses von Androgenen Schamhaare und Akne entwickeln. Menschen mit XY-Chromosomen können ebenfalls mit Östrogen-Resistenz-Syndrom geboren werden, und sie können infolgedessen Variationen in ihrer anderen Hormonproduktion, Hodenentwicklung und Entwicklung sekundärer Geschlechtsmerkmale aufweisen oder auch nicht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met het oestrogeen ongevoeligheidssyndroom (EIS) hebben een genetische variatie waarbij hun lichaam niet reageert op oestrogeen. Personen met XX-chromosomen en EIS worden meestal geboren met een vulva en een vagina, kunnen een kleine baarmoeder en vergrote eierstokken hebben die later meerdere cysten ontwikkelen, en kunnen zeer hoge niveaus van oestrogeen produceren die hun lichaam niet herkent. In de adolescentie zullen ze hoogstwaarschijnlijk niet de veranderingen ervaren die gepaard gaan met een typische oestrogeenpuberteit, zoals borstontwikkeling of menstruatie. In plaats daarvan kunnen ze schaamhaar en acne ontwikkelen onder invloed van androgenen. Personen met XY-chromosomen kunnen ook met EIS worden geboren, en als gevolg daarvan kunnen ze al dan niet variaties ervaren in hun andere hormoonproductie, testiculaire ontwikkeling en de ontwikkeling van secundaire geslachtskenmerken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med EIS (Estrogen insensitivity syndrome) har en genetisk variation som gör att kroppen inte reagerar på östrogen. Personer med två X-kromosomer (46XX) och EIS föds vanligtvis med vulva och vagina, kan ha en liten livmoder och förstorade äggstockar som senare utvecklar många cystor, och kan producera mycket höga nivåer av östrogen som kroppen inte uppfattar. Under puberteten upplever de flesta inte typiska östrogenrelaterade förändringar som bröstutveckling eller menstruation, utan kan istället utveckla pubeshår och akne på grund av androgener. Personer med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) kan också födas med EIS och kan ha varierande hormonproduktion, testikelutveckling och utveckling av sekundära könskarakteristika."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002838","dc:identifier":"homoit0002838","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Follicle-stimulating hormone insensitivity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Insensibilidad a la hormona foliculoestimulante"},{"@language":"de","@value":"FSH-Rezeptor-Defizienz"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ongevoeligheid voor follikelstimulerend hormoon"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FSH-resistens"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"FSH "},{"@language":"en","@value":"FSH insensitivity"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"FSH ongevoeligheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"FSH-okänslighet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with follicle-stimulating hormone (FSH) insensitivity have a genetic variation where their bodies do not respond to FSH. People with XX chromosomes and FSH insensitivity will usually be born with a vulva, vagina, and ovaries. Their ovaries may produce lower amounts of estrogen than is considered typical, and they may not produce fertile follicles (eggs). In adolescence, they may not develop secondary sex characteristics associated with a typical estrogen puberty and may not menstruate. People with XY chromosomes and FSH insensitivity may develop smaller-than-typical testes, may produce fewer sperm than usual, and may not be fertile."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con insensibilidad a la hormona foliculoestimulante (FSH) tienen una variación genética por lo que su cuerpo no responde a la FSH. Las personas con cromosomas XX e insensibilidad a la FSH suelen nacer con vulva, vagina y ovarios. Sus ovarios pueden producir menores cantidades de estrógeno a las consideradas típicas y es posible que no produzcan folículos fértiles (óvulos). En la adolescencia, es posible que no desarrollen las características sexuales secundarias asociadas a una pubertad típica con estrógenos y que no menstrúen. Las personas con cromosomas XY e insensibilidad a la FSH pueden desarrollar testículos más pequeños de lo usual, producir menos espermatozoides de lo habitual y no ser fértiles."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit einer Resistenz gegen das follikelstimulierende Hormon (FSH) weisen eine genetische Variation auf, aufgrund derer ihr Körper nicht auf FSH reagiert. Menschen mit XX-Chromosomen und einer FSH-Resistenz werden in der Regel mit einer Vulva, einer Vagina und Eierstöcken geboren. Ihre Eierstöcke produzieren möglicherweise weniger Östrogen als üblich und bilden möglicherweise keine fruchtbaren Follikel (Eizellen). In der Pubertät entwickeln sie eventuell keine sekundären Geschlechtsmerkmale, die mit einer typischen Östrogen-Pubertät verbunden sind, und haben möglicherweise keine Menstruation. Menschen mit XY-Chromosomen und FSH-Unempfindlichkeit entwickeln möglicherweise kleinere Hoden als normal, produzieren weniger Spermien als üblich und sind eventuell unfruchtbar."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met een ongevoeligheid voor het follikelstimulerend hormoon (FSH) hebben een genetische variatie waarbij hun lichaam niet reageert op FSH. Personen met XX-chromosomen en FSH-ongevoeligheid worden meestal geboren met een vulva, vagina en eierstokken. Hun eierstokken produceren mogelijk lagere hoeveelheden oestrogeen dan normaal wordt geacht, en het is mogelijk dat ze geen vruchtbare follikels (eieren) produceren. In de adolescentie ontwikkelen ze mogelijk geen secundaire geslachtskenmerken die verband houden met een typische oestrogeenpuberteit en kunnen ze niet menstrueren. Personen met XY-chromosomen en FSH-ongevoeligheid kunnen kleiner dan normale testikels ontwikkelen, minder sperma produceren dan normaal en mogelijk niet vruchtbaar zijn. ​"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med resistens eller okänslighet mot follikelstimulerande hormon (FSH) har en genetisk variation som gör att gonaderna/könskörtlarna inte reagerar på FSH, beroende på en defekt i FSH-receptorn på de gonadala cellerna. Personer med två X-kromosomer (46XX) och FSH-resistens/okänslighet föds vanligtvis med vulva, vagina och äggstockar. Deras äggstockar kan producera lägre mängder östrogen än vad som anses typiskt och de producerar eventuellt inte fertila folliklar (ägg). Under puberteten kan de sakna sekundära könskarakteristika som normalt förknippas med östrogenstyrd pubertet och menstruation kan utebli. Personer med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) och FSH-resistens/okänslighet kan utveckla mindre testiklar än vanligt, producera färre spermier och vara infertila."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002839","dc:identifier":"homoit0002839","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fraser syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Fraser"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fraser-Syndrom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fraser syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frasers syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"de","@value":"Fraser Syndrom"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with Fraser syndrome are usually born with differences in the development of their eyelids, fingers, and toes. They may also have variations in their sex characteristics, such as a larger-than-typical clitoris or undescended testes. They may develop without one or both kidneys, and other parts of the urinary system can additionally be affected."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con síndrome de Fraser suelen nacer con diferencias en el desarrollo de los párpados, los dedos de las manos y de los pies. También pueden tener variaciones en sus características sexuales, como un clítoris más grande de lo típico o testículos no descendidos. Pueden desarrollarse sin uno o ambos riñones, y otras partes del sistema urinario también pueden verse afectadas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen mit Fraser-Syndrom werden in der Regel mit Abweichungen in der Entwicklung ihrer Augenlider, Finger und Zehen geboren. Sie können auch Abweichungen in ihren Geschlechtsmerkmalen aufweisen, wie beispielsweise eine überdurchschnittlich große Klitoris oder Hodenhochstand. Sie können ohne eine oder beide Nieren entwickelt sein, auch andere Teile des Harnsystems können zusätzlich betroffen sein."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met het Fraser syndroom worden meestal geboren met verschillen in de ontwikkeling van hun oogleden, vingers en tenen. Ze kunnen ook variaties in hun geslachtskenmerken hebben, zoals een groter dan typische clitoris of niet-ingedaalde testikels. Ze kunnen zich ontwikkelen zonder een of beide nieren, en andere delen van het urinestelsel kunnen bovendien worden aangetast."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med Fraser syndrom föds vanligtvis med avvikelser i utvecklingen av ögonlock, fingrar och tår. De kan också ha variationer i sina könskarakteristika, såsom en större än typisk klitoris eller testiklar som inte har vandrat ner. De kan kan ha gonaddysgenesi eller strimgonader, sakna en eller båda njurarna, och andra delar av urinvägarna kan också vara påverkade. De har en typisk genetik och avvikelserna är strukturella, inte hormonella."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002842","dc:identifier":"homoit0002842","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hyperandrogenism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hiperandrogenismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hyperandrogenisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hyperandrogenism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with hyperandrogenism have higher-than-typical levels of testosterone and/or other androgens. In people with XX chromosomes, hyperandrogenism can result in the development of secondary sex characteristics that are associated with the influence of testosterone (such as facial and body hair) to varying degrees. Hyperandrogenism may or may not be the result of an underlying intersex variation, but it is common in several variations (including CAH and PCOS). People with hyperandrogenism who aren’t intersex will nonetheless often have many experiences in common with intersex people, such as encountering exclusion and discrimination in sex-segregated contexts like sports."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con hiperandrogenismo tienen niveles de testosterona y/u otros andrógenos más altos de lo normal. En personas con cromosomas XX, el hiperandrogenismo puede resultar en el desarrollo de características sexuales secundarias que están asociadas con la influencia de la testosterona (como el vello facial y corporal) en diversos grados. El hiperandrogenismo puede o no ser el resultado de una variación intersex subyacente, pero es común en varias variaciones (incluidas CAH y SOP). Sin embargo, las personas con hiperandrogenismo que no son intersex suelen tener muchas experiencias en común con las personas intersex, como enfrentarse a la exclusión y la discriminación en contextos segregados por sexo, como los deportes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met hyperandrogenisme hebben hogere niveaus van testosteron en/of andere androgenen dan normaal. Bij personen met XX-chromosomen kan hyperandrogenisme in verschillende mate resulteren in de ontwikkeling van secundaire geslachtskenmerken die verband houden met de invloed van testosteron (zoals gezichts- en lichaamshaar). Hyperandrogenisme kan al dan niet het gevolg zijn van een onderliggende interseksevariatie, maar komt in verschillende varianten vaak voor (waaronder CAH en PCOS). Personen met hyperandrogenisme die niet intersekse zijn, zullen niettemin vaak veel ervaringen gemeen hebben met intersekse personen, zoals het tegenkomen van uitsluiting en discriminatie in sekse-gesegregeerde contexten zoals sport."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med hyperandrogenism har högre nivåer av testosteron och/eller andra androgener än vad som är typiskt. Hos personer med två X-kromosomer (46XX) kan det leda till att sekundära könskarakteristika som förknippas med testosteron (som kropps- och ansiktsbehåring) utvecklas i varierande grad. Hyperandrogenism kan bero på en intersexvariation, men inte alltid. Det är vanligt vid tillstånd som medfödd binjurebarkshyperplasi (CAH) och polycystiskt ovarialsyndrom (PCOS). Personer med hyperandrogenism som inte är intersex kan ändå ha liknande erfarenheter, särskilt i könssegregerade sammanhang som sport."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh97002310"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002843","dc:identifier":"homoit0002843","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hypogonadism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hipogonadismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hypogonadisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hypogonadism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with hypogonadism produce lower-than-typical levels of hormones like testosterone and estrogen, or none at all. This can affect how a person’s secondary sex characteristics develop as well as their fertility. Hypogonadism can be a result of a difference in how someone’s brain signals for their gonads to produce (or not produce) hormones, or it can be a feature of their gonads directly. Hypogonadism is not always caused by an intersex variation, but can be related to Klinefelter syndrome, Turner syndrome, and several other variations."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con hipogonadismo producen niveles de hormonas como testosterona y estrógeno más bajos de lo normal, o ninguno en absoluto. Esto puede afectar el desarrollo de las características sexuales secundarias de una persona, así como su fertilidad. El hipogonadismo puede ser el resultado de una diferencia en la forma en que el cerebro de una persona envía señales a sus gónadas para que produzcan (o no produzcan) hormonas, o puede ser una característica de sus gónadas directamente. El hipogonadismo no siempre es causado por una variación intersex, pero puede estar relacionado con el síndrome de Klinefelter, el síndrome de Turner y varias otras variaciones."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met hypogonadisme produceren lagere dan normale niveaus van hormonen zoals testosteron en oestrogeen, of helemaal geen. Dit kan van invloed zijn op de manier waarop de secundaire geslachtskenmerken van een persoon zich ontwikkelen, evenals op zijn vruchtbaarheid. Hypogonadisme kan het resultaat zijn van een verschil in de manier waarop iemands hersenen signalen doorgeven aan zijn geslachtsklieren om hormonen te produceren (of niet te produceren), of het kan rechtstreeks een kenmerk van zijn geslachtsklieren zijn. Hypogonadisme wordt niet altijd veroorzaakt door een interseksevariatie, maar kan verband houden met het Klinefelter-syndroom, het Turner-syndroom en verschillende andere variaties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med hypogonadism har hormonproduktion av testosteron och östrogen. Det kan påverka utvecklingen av sekundära könskarakteristika och fertilitet. Hypogonadism kan bero på att hjärnan inte signalerar till könskörtlarna att producera hormoner, eller på att könskörtlarna själva inte fungerar som väntat. Hypogonadism är inte alltid kopplat till intersexvariationer men förekommer vid till exempel Klinefelters syndrom, Turners syndrom och flera andra variationer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85063790"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002848","dc:identifier":"homoit0002848","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Isolated 17,20-lyase deficiency"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deficiencia aislada de 17,20-liasa"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geïsoleerde 17,20-lyasedeficiëntie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Isolerad 17,20lyasbrist"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"ILD"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with isolated 17,20-lyase deficiency (ILD) have one of several specific variations in their genes that cause their bodies to make lower-than-typical amounts of testosterone. They may be born with genitals that do not appear quite like a typical penis, and their testes may be descended or undescended. In adolescence, they may not experience all of the changes related to a typical testosterone puberty because their variation impacts their hormone production."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con deficiencia aislada de 17,20-liasa tienen una de las diversas variaciones específicas en sus genes que hacen que sus cuerpos produzcan cantidades de testosterona inferiores a las típicas. Pueden nacer con genitales que no se parecen a un pene típico y sus testículos pueden ser descendidos o no descendidos. En la adolescencia, es posible que no experimenten todos los cambios relacionados con una pubertad típica de testosterona porque su variación afecta a su producción hormonal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met geïsoleerde 17,20-lyasedeficiëntie (ILD) hebben één van de vele specifieke variaties in hun genen die ervoor zorgen dat hun lichaam lagere hoeveelheden testosteron aanmaakt dan normaal. Ze kunnen geboren worden met geslachtsdelen die niet helemaal op een typische penis lijken, en hun testikels kunnen ingedaald of niet-ingedaald zijn. In de adolescentie ervaren ze mogelijk niet alle veranderingen die verband houden met een typische testosteron-puberteit, omdat hun variatie hun hormoonproductie beïnvloedt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med isolerad 17,20-lyasbrist (ILD) har en av flera specifika variationer i sina gener som gör att kroppen producerar lägre nivåer av testosteron än vad som är typiskt. De kan födas med könsorgan som inte helt överensstämmer med en typisk penis, och testiklarna kan vara nedstigna eller icke nedstigna. Under puberteten kan de sakna vissa av de förändringar som vanligtvis är förknippade med en testosterondominerad pubertet, eftersom variationen påverkar hormonproduktionen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002861","dc:identifier":"homoit0002861","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Jacobs syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Jakob"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Jacobs syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"XYY-syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"47XYY"},{"@language":"en","@value":"XYY syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome XYY"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome del supermacho"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"XYY syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Jacobs syndrom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with Jacobs syndrome develop with an extra Y chromosome. They might not have any obvious physical variations as a result, or they may be taller than usual or have other identifiable differences that do not relate to sex characteristics. Some people with Jacobs syndrome may also have a smaller-than-typical penis or scrotum, hypospadias, and/or undescended testicles."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con síndrome de Jakob se desarrollan con un cromosoma Y adicional. Como resultado, es posible que no tengan variaciones físicas obvias, o puede que sean más altas de lo habitual o tener otras diferencias identificables que no se relacionan con las características sexuales. Algunas personas con síndrome de Jakob también pueden tener un pene o escroto más pequeño de lo normal, hipospadias y/o testículos no descendidos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met het Jacobssyndroom ontwikkelen zich met een extra Y-chromosoom. Het kan zijn dat ze daardoor geen duidelijke fysieke verschillen vertonen, of dat ze groter zijn dan normaal, of andere identificeerbare verschillen hebben die geen verband houden met geslachtskenmerken. Sommige personen met het Jacobs-syndroom kunnen ook een kleiner dan typische penis of scrotum, hypospadie en/of niet-ingedaalde testikels hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med XYY-syndrom har en extra Y-kromosom (47,XYY). De flesta med XYY-syndrom är fertila och har en typisk testosteronproduktion, saknar tydliga fysiska variationer, men kan vara längre än genomsnittet eller ha andra synliga skillnader som inte rör könskarakteristika."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002862","dc:identifier":"homoit0002862","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kallmann syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Kallmann"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kallmann syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kallmanns syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Hypogonadotropic hypogonadism"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kallmann syndrome can occur in people with XX or XY chromosomes and is a form of hypogonadism. People with Kallmann syndrome and XY chromosomes are often born with a smaller-than-typical penis and undescended testes. In adolescence, most people with Kallmann syndrome will either start puberty later than usual or not experience typical pubertal changes (such as developing facial hair and a deeper voice for people with XY chromosomes or developing breasts and starting to menstruate for people with XX chromosomes) unless they receive hormone therapy. Kallmann syndrome also affects someone’s sense of smell."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El síndrome de Kallmann puede ocurrir en personas con cromosomas XX o XY y es una forma de hipogonadismo. Las personas con síndrome de Kallmann y cromosomas XY suelen nacer con un pene más pequeño de lo normal y testículos no descendidos. En la adolescencia, la mayoría de las personas con síndrome de Kallmann comenzarán la pubertad más tarde de lo habitual o no experimentarán los cambios puberales típicos (como desarrollar vello facial y una voz más grave en las personas con cromosomas XY o desarrollar senos y comenzar a menstruar en las personas con cromosomas XX) a menos que reciben terapia hormonal. El síndrome de Kallmann también afecta el sentido del olfato."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het Kallmann-syndroom kan voorkomen bij personen met XX- of XY-chromosomen en is een vorm van hypogonadisme. Personen met het Kallmann-syndroom en XY-chromosomen worden vaak geboren met een kleiner dan typische penis en niet-ingedaalde teelballen. In de adolescentie zullen de meeste personen met het Kallmann-syndroom later in de puberteit beginnen dan normaal, of geen typische puberale veranderingen ervaren (zoals het ontwikkelen van gezichtsbeharing en een diepere stem bij personen met XY-chromosomen of het ontwikkelen van borsten en beginnen te menstrueren bij personen met XX-chromosomen), tenzij ze hormoontherapie krijgen. Het Kallmann-syndroom heeft ook invloed op iemands reukvermogen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kallmanns syndrom kan förekomma hos personer med två X-kromosomer (46XX ) eller en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) och är en form av hypogonadism där hjärnan inte kan signalera önskad hormonproduktion av luteiniserande hormon (LH) och follikelstimulerande hormon (FSH) till hypofysen. Personer med Kallmanns syndrom och en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) föds ofta med en mindre penis än genomsnittet och med testiklar som inte vandrat ned. Under puberteten kan de sakna vissa förändringar om de inte får hormonbehandling, t.ex. skäggväxt eller röstförändring (XY) eller bröstutveckling och menstruation (XX). Hormonbehandling kan resultera i viss fertilitet. Tillståndet påverkar även luktsinnet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002863","dc:identifier":"homoit0002863","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Leydig cell hypoplasia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hipoplasia de células de Leydig"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Leydigcelhypoplasie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Leydigcellshypoplasi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LCH"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"LCH"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with Leydig cell hypoplasia (LCH) have XY chromosomes and a genetic insensitivity to luteinizing hormone. LCH can be either complete (known as LCH Type 1) or partial (known as LCH Type 2). Luteinizing hormone is typically responsible for the development of Leydig cells in the testicles and for signaling for those cells to produce androgens like testosterone. Someone with LCH will develop few or no Leydig cells and therefore will produce less testosterone than is typical."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con hipoplasia de células de Leydig (HCL) tienen cromosomas XY y una insensibilidad genética a la hormona luteinizante. La HCL puede ser completa (conocida como HCL tipo 1) o parcial (conocida como HCL tipo 2). La hormona luteinizante suele ser responsable del desarrollo de las células de Leydig en los testículos y de indicarles a esas células que produzcan andrógenos como la testosterona. Alguien con HCL desarrollará pocas o ninguna célula de Leydig y, por lo tanto, producirá menos testosterona de lo normal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met Leydig-celhypoplasie (LCH) hebben XY-chromosomen en een genetische ongevoeligheid voor luteïniserend hormoon. LCH kan compleet zijn (bekend als LCH Type 1) of gedeeltelijk (bekend als LCH Type 2). Luteïniserend hormoon is doorgaans verantwoordelijk voor de ontwikkeling van Leydig-cellen in de testikels en voor de signalering aan die cellen om androgenen zoals testosteron te produceren. Iemand met LCH zal weinig of geen Leydig-cellen ontwikkelen en daarom minder testosteron produceren dan normaal."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med Leydigcellshypoplasi (LCH) har en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) och genetisk okänslighet för luteiniserande hormon. LCH kan vara komplett om receptorerna för luteiniserande hormon på Leydigcellerna i testiklarna helt saknas (LCH typ 1) eller partiell om receptorerna inte fungerar (LCH typ 2). Luteiniserande hormon ansvarar normalt för utvecklingen av leydigceller i testiklarna och signalerar till dessa celler att producera androgener som testosteron. En person med LCH utvecklar få eller inga leydigceller och producerar därför mindre testosteron än normalt. Personer med LCH kan ha mikroppenis, hypospadi och/eller kryptorkism."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002879"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002881"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002864","dc:identifier":"homoit0002864","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Luteinizing hormone insensitivity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Insensibilidad a la hormona luteinizante"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ongevoeligheid voor luteïniserende hormonen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Luteinizing hormone insensitivity"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"LH-resistens"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nedsatt känslighet för luteiniserande hormon"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with XY chromosomes and luteinizing hormone insensitivity develop the variation Leydig cell hypoplasiae. Because people with XX chromosomes do not typically produce Leydig cells to begin with, someone with XX chromosomes who has a genetic insensitivity to luteinizing hormone will not be affected in the same way. A person with XX chromosomes whose body does not respond to luteinizing hormone will not usually have any noticeable differences at birth, but their ovaries may not produce fertile follicles (eggs), and they may not menstruate."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con cromosomas XY e insensibilidad a la hormona luteinizante desarrollan la variante hipoplasia de células de Leydig. Dado que las personas con cromosomas XX no suelen producir células de Leydig para empezar, alguien con cromosomas XX que tenga una insensibilidad genética a la hormona luteinizante no se verá afectado de la misma forma. Una persona con cromosomas XX cuyo organismo no responda a la hormona luteinizante no suele presentar diferencias perceptibles al nacer, pero es posible que sus ovarios no produzcan folículos fértiles (óvulos) y que no menstrúe."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met XY-chromosomen en ongevoeligheid voor luteïniserend hormoon ontwikkelen de variatie Leydig-celhypoplasie. Omdat mensen met XX-chromosomen in het begin doorgaans geen Leydig-cellen produceren, zal iemand met XX-chromosomen die een genetische ongevoeligheid voor het luteïniserend hormoon heeft, niet op dezelfde manier worden beïnvloed. Een persoon met XX-chromosomen wiens lichaam niet reageert op het luteïniserend hormoon zal bij de geboorte gewoonlijk geen merkbare verschillen vertonen, maar het kan zijn dat de eierstokken geen vruchtbare follikels (eieren) produceren en dat ze niet menstrueren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med XY-kromosomer och genetisk okänslighet för luteiniserande hormon utvecklar variationen Leydigcellshypoplasi. Personer med XX-kromosomer producerar normalt inte Leydigceller och påverkas därför inte på samma sätt. En person med XX-kromosomer vars kropp inte svarar på luteiniserande hormon föds oftast utan synliga skillnader, men hos viss producerar inte äggstockarna fertila ägg och menstruation kan utebli."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002865","dc:identifier":"homoit0002865","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser-syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"MRKH syndrome "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Müllerian agenesis"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Müllerian duct anomalies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Müllerian duct variations"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser (MRKH) syndrome occurs when a person's Müllerian ducts, which typically become the uterus and upper portion of the vagina during fetal development, do not develop in the typical way. People with MRKH have XX chromosomes and are usually born with a vulva and either a vagina that is shorter than typical or no vagina. They usually do not have a cervix and may have a partial uterus (uterine remnant) or no uterus. They often do not mensturate but may experience cyclic pain if they have a uterine remnant with endometrial lining, and they can develop menstruation-related conditions like endometriosis."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El síndrome de Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser (MRKH, por sus siglas en inglés) ocurre cuando los conductos müllerianos de una persona, que normalmente se convierten en el útero y la parte superior de la vagina durante el desarrollo fetal, no se desarrollan de la manera típica. Las personas con MRKH tienen cromosomas XX y generalmente nacen con una vulva y una vagina más corta de lo normal o sin vagina. Por lo general, no tienen cuello uterino y pueden tener un útero parcial (restos uterinos) o ningún útero. A menudo no menstrúan, pero pueden experimentar dolor cíclico si tienen un remanente uterino con tejido endometrial y pueden desarrollar condiciones relacionadas con la menstruación, como la endometriosis."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser (MRKH)-syndroom treedt op wanneer de Mülleriaanse kanalen van een persoon, die tijdens de ontwikkeling van de foetus doorgaans de baarmoeder en het bovenste gedeelte van de vagina worden, zich niet op de typische manier ontwikkelen. Personen met MRKH hebben XX chromosomen en worden meestal geboren met een vulva en een vagina die korter is dan normaal, of zonder vagina. Ze hebben meestal geen baarmoederhals en kunnen een gedeeltelijke baarmoeder (baarmoederrest) of geen baarmoeder hebben. Ze menstureren vaak niet, maar kunnen cyclische pijn ervaren als ze een baarmoederrest met endometriumslijmvlies hebben, en ze kunnen menstruatiegerelateerde aandoeningen ontwikkelen, zoals endometriose."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mayer-Rokitansky-Küster-Hauser-syndrom (MRKH) uppstår när en persons Müllerska gångar – som normalt utvecklas till livmoder och övre delen av slidan under fosterutvecklingen – inte utvecklas på ett typiskt sätt. Personer med MRKH har två X-kromosomer (46XX) och föds vanligtvis med vulva och en kort eller helt frånvarande vagina. De saknar ofta livmoderhals och har en ofullständig livmoder (livmoderstump) eller ingen livmoder alls. De menstruerar vanligtvis inte men kan ha cyklisk smärta om de har livmoderstump med livmoderslemhinna, och kan utveckla menstruationsrelaterade tillstånd som endometrios."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002880"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002882"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002870","dc:identifier":"homoit0002870","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Penoscrotal transposition"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transposición penoscrotal"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Penoscrotale transpositie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Penoscrotal transposition"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with penoscrotal transposition are born with a different genital configuration than typical, with their penis located below or in the middle of their scrotum instead of above it. Their scrotum might be bifid (split into two halves), and they may also have hypospadias and/or chordee."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con transposición penoescrotal nacen con una configuración genital diferente a la típica, con el pene ubicado debajo o en el medio del escroto en lugar de encima. Su escroto puede ser bífido (dividido en dos mitades) y también pueden tener hipospadias y/o cordee."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met penoscrotale transpositie worden geboren met een andere genitale configuratie dan normaal, met hun penis onder of in het midden van hun scrotum in plaats van erboven. Hun scrotum kan gespleten zijn (opgedeeld in twee helften), en ze kunnen ook hypospadie en/of akkoorden hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med penoscrotal transposition föds med en ovanlig könskonfiguration där penis är placerad under eller mitt i pungen istället för ovanför. Pungen kan vara kluven i två delar, och andra variationer som hypospadi eller chordee kan också förekomma. Kan ingå i syndrom som PAIS elled DSD och är ofta associerat med kryptorkism, mikropenis, hypospadi eller chordee."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002871","dc:identifier":"homoit0002871","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Persistent Müllerian duct syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de persistencia de los conductos müllerianos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Persisterend Müller-kanaalsyndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Persisterande Müllerian Duct Syndrome"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"PMDS"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Persisterande Müllerian duct syndrom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"PMDS"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with Persistent Müllerian duct syndrome (PMDS) have XY chromosomes, male-typical reproductive organs and external genitalia, and some component(s) of a female-typical reproductive tract, such as a uterus, fallopian tubes, and/or upper vaginal canal. PMDS occurs when the Müllerian ducts—internal structures that ordinarily break down in an XY fetus—remain and develop as they would in an XX fetus. PMDS is ordinarily not diagnosed at birth, and individuals with this variation often have a male gender identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con síndrome de conducto mülleriano persistente (PMDS, por sus siglas en inglés) tienen cromosomas XY, órganos reproductores y genitales externos típicos masculinos y algunos componentes de un aparato reproductor típico femenino, como útero, trompas de Falopio y/o canal vaginal superior. El SDMP se produce cuando los conductos müllerianos -estructuras internas que normalmente se rompen en un feto XY- permanecen y se desarrollan como lo harían en un feto XX. El SDMP no suele diagnosticarse al nacer, y las personas con esta variante suelen tener una identidad de género masculina."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met het Persisterend Müller-kanaalsyndroom (PMDS) hebben XY-chromosomen, mannelijke voortplantingsorganen en uitwendige genitaliën, en sommige componenten van een vrouwelijk voortplantingsstelsel, zoals een baarmoeder, eileiders en/of het bovenste vaginale kanaal. . PMDS treedt op wanneer de Mülleriaanse kanalen – interne structuren die normaal gesproken bij een XY-foetus afbreken – blijven en zich ontwikkelen zoals bij een XX-foetus. PMDS wordt normaal gesproken niet bij de geboorte gediagnosticeerd, en individuen met deze variatie hebben vaak een mannelijke geslachtsidentiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med Persisterande Müllerian Duct Syndrome (PMDS) har en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY), typisk manlig reproduktiv anatomi och yttre könsorgan, men också komponenter av typisk kvinnlig inre fortplantningsanatomi såsom livmoder, äggledare och/eller övre delen av slidan. PMDS uppstår när Mülleriska gångarna inte bryts ned under fosterutvecklingen, vilket normalt sker hos XY-foster. Tillståndet upptäcks ofta inte vid födseln utan oftare i samband med kirurgi (t.ex. för kryptorkism som är vanligt förekommande), och personer med PMDS identifierar sig ofta som män."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002872","dc:identifier":"homoit0002872","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Polycystic ovary syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de ovario poliquístico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Polycysteus ovarium syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polycystiskt ovariesyndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"PCOD"},{"@language":"en","@value":"PCOS"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Polycystic ovarian disease"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Polycystic ovarian syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"SOP"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"polycysteus ovariumsyndroom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with this variation have XX chromosomes and are generally born with a vulva and vagina, a uterus, and ovaries. Later in life, their ovaries often produce higher-than-typical levels of androgens like testosterone. Polycystic ovary syndrome (PCOS) can also result in the development of characteristics such as facial and body hair, and it can interfere with the process of ovulation. This in turn can cause irregular periods or no periods, and people with PCOS may struggle to become pregnant. Some people with PCOS have small cysts (fluid-filled sacs) on their ovaries, but some do not. Signs of PCOS generally will not show up until a person starts menstruating, or later in life."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con esta variación tienen cromosomas XX y generalmente nacen con vulva y vagina, útero y ovarios. Más adelante en la vida, sus ovarios a menudo producen niveles de andrógenos, como la testosterona, más altos de lo normal. El síndrome de ovario poliquístico (SOP) también puede provocar el desarrollo de características como vello facial y corporal, y puede interferir con el proceso de ovulación. Esto, a su vez, puede provocar períodos irregulares o ausencia de períodos, y las personas con síndrome de ovario poliquístico pueden tener dificultades para quedar embarazadas. Algunas personas con síndrome de ovario poliquístico tienen pequeños quistes (sacos llenos de líquido) en los ovarios, pero otras no. Los signos del síndrome de ovario poliquístico generalmente no aparecen hasta que una persona comienza a menstruar, o más adelante en la vida."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met deze variatie hebben XX chromosomen en worden over het algemeen geboren met een vulva en vagina, een baarmoeder en eierstokken. Later in het leven produceren hun eierstokken vaak hogere niveaus van androgenen zoals testosteron. Polycysteus ovariumsyndroom (PCOS) kan ook resulteren in de ontwikkeling van kenmerken zoals gezichts- en lichaamshaar, en kan het ovulatieproces verstoren. Dit kan op zijn beurt onregelmatige menstruaties of geen menstruaties veroorzaken, en personen met PCOS kunnen moeite hebben om zwanger te worden. Sommige personen met PCOS hebben kleine cysten (met vocht gevulde zakjes) op hun eierstokken, maar andere niet. Tekenen van PCOS verschijnen doorgaans pas als iemand begint te menstrueren, of later in het leven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med denna variation har två X-kromosomer (46XX) och föds vanligtvis med vulva och vagina, en livmoder och äggstockar. Senare i livet producerar deras äggstockar ofta högre än normala nivåer av androgener som testosteron. Polycystiskt ovariesyndrom (PCOS) kan också leda till utveckling av exempelvis ansikts- och kroppshår samt påverka ägglossningen, vilket kan leda till oregelbunden eller utebliven menstruation och nedsatt fertilitet. Vissa personer med PCOS har små cystor (vätskefyllda blåsor) på äggstockarna, men inte alla. Symtomen visar sig vanligtvis först efter att personen börjat menstruera eller ännu senare i livet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002873","dc:identifier":"homoit0002873","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pseudohermaphroditism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pseudohermafroditismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pseudohermafroditisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pseudohermafroditism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female pseudohermaphroditism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Male pseudohermaphroditism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Seudohermafroditismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijk pseudohermafroditisme"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term previously used in medical contexts to refer to different groups of intersex variations, usually divided into categories of “male pseudohermaphroditism” and “female pseudohermaphroditism” on the basis of the person’s chromosomes. People may still find these terms used in their medical records or in medical journal articles when researching their variation, but they are often considered highly stigmatizing in addition to being vague and inaccurate. Do not use this term to describe a person's variation unless they do so themselves."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término utilizado anteriormente en contextos médicos para referirse a diferentes grupos de variaciones intersex, generalmente divididos en categorías de “pseudohermafroditismo masculino” y “pseudohermafroditismo femenino” según los cromosomas de la persona. Es posible que las personas todavía encuentren estos términos utilizados en sus registros médicos o en artículos de revistas médicas cuando investigan su variación, pero a menudo se les considera altamente estigmatizantes, además de vagos e inexactos. No debe utilizarse este término para describir la variación de una persona a menos que lo haga ella misma."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die eerder in medische context werd gebruikt om te verwijzen naar verschillende groepen interseksevariaties, meestal onderverdeeld in categorieën van ‘mannelijk pseudohermafroditisme’ en ‘vrouwelijk pseudohermafroditisme’ op basis van de chromosomen van de persoon. Personen kunnen deze termen nog steeds tegenkomen in hun medische dossiers of in medische tijdschriftartikelen wanneer ze de variatie ervan onderzoeken, maar ze worden vaak als zeer stigmatiserend beschouwd en zijn bovendien vaag en onnauwkeurig. Gebruik deze term niet om de variatie van een persoon te beschrijven, tenzij deze persoon dit zelf doet."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinsk term som tidigare användes för att beskriva olika intersexvariationer. Variationerna delades då ofta upp i ”manlig pseudohermafroditism” och ”kvinnlig pseudohermafroditism” beroende på personens kromosomer. Begreppen kan fortfarande förekomma i medicinska journaler eller äldre vetenskapliga texter, men anses idag vara starkt stigmatiserande samt vaga och missvisande. Använd inte termen för att beskriva en variation om inte individen själv gör det."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002875","dc:identifier":"homoit0002875","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex reversal syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome de inversión de sexo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geslachtsomkeer syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gonaddysgenesi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term sometimes used in medical contexts to refer to different variations in which a person is born with XY chromosomes and a vulva and vagina or XX chromosomes and a penis."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término que a veces se utiliza en contextos médicos para referirse a diferentes variaciones en las que una persona nace con cromosomas XY y vulva y vagina o cromosomas XX y pene."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die soms in medische context wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar verschillende varianten waarbij een persoon wordt geboren met XY-chromosomen en een vulva en vagina of XX-chromosomen en een penis."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En term som ibland används i medicinska sammanhang för att beskriva olika varianter där en person föds med en X- och en Y-kromosom (46XY) och en vulva och vagina eller två X-kromosomer (46XX) och en penis."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002878","dc:identifier":"homoit0002878","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trisomy X"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trisomía X"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trisomie X"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trisomi X"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Triple XXX syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome triple XXX"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trisomy X"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with Trisomy X are born with 47XXX chromosomes rather than the typical 46XX. If they receive the additional X chromosome from their parent's original sperm or egg cell, they will have 47XXX chromosomes in all their cells. If the additional chromosome appears during the embryo's development process, however, only some cells will have 47XXX chromosomes and the person will be born with a mosaic chromosome pattern. Most people with 47XXX chromosomes do not develop any variations in their other sex characteristics but some may have ovaries that stop producing hormones at an earlier-than-typical age and some may not menstruate."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con trisomía X nacen con los cromosomas 47XXX en lugar del típico 46XX. Si reciben el cromosoma X adicional del espermatozoide o del óvulo original de sus padres, tendrán 47XXX cromosomas en todas sus células. Sin embargo, si el cromosoma adicional aparece durante el proceso de desarrollo del embrión, sólo algunas células tendrán cromosomas 47XXX y la persona nacerá con un patrón cromosómico en mosaico. La mayoría de las personas con cromosomas 47XXX no desarrollan ninguna variación en sus otras características sexuales, pero algunas pueden tener ovarios que dejan de producir hormonas a una edad más temprana de lo normal y algunas pueden no menstruar."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met Trisomie X worden geboren met 47XXX-chromosomen in plaats van de typische 46XX. Als ze het extra X-chromosoom uit de oorspronkelijke sperma- of eicel van hun ouders ontvangen, hebben ze in al hun cellen 47XXX chromosomen. Als het extra chromosoom echter verschijnt tijdens het ontwikkelingsproces van het embryo, zullen slechts enkele cellen 47XXX-chromosomen hebben en zal de persoon geboren worden met een mozaïekchromosoompatroon. De meeste personen met 47XXX-chromosomen ontwikkelen geen variaties in hun andere geslachtskenmerken, maar sommigen hebben mogelijk eierstokken die op een eerder dan normale leeftijd stoppen met het produceren van hormonen en sommigen menstrueren mogelijk niet."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med trisomi X är födda med en extra könskromosom och har kromosomuppsättningen 47XXX istället för de vanliga 46XX. Om den extra X-kromosomen överförs från förälderns ursprungliga spermie eller äggcell kommer personen att ha 47XXX i alla sina celler. Om kromosomen tillkommer under embryots utveckling får personen en mosaik av celler med 47XXX. De flesta personer med 47XXX-kromosomer utvecklar inga variationer i andra könskarakteristika men vissa kan få äggstockar som slutar producera hormoner tidigare än förväntat och vissa får ingen menstruation."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002883","dc:identifier":"homoit0002883","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Vaginal atresia"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atresia vaginal"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaginale atresie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vaginal atresi"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vaginal agenesi"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with this variation may be born without a vaginal opening, a shallow “dimple” where an opening would typically be, or a vaginal opening that is fused or blocked by fibrous tissue. People with vaginal atresia often have a typical upper vaginal canal (along with a typical uterus, cervix, fallopian tubes, and ovaries) with differences in the lower portion of the vagina only."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con esta variación pueden nacer sin una abertura vaginal, un \"hoyuelo\" poco profundo donde normalmente estaría una abertura, o una abertura vaginal fusionada o bloqueada por tejido fibroso. Las personas con atresia vaginal a menudo tienen un canal vaginal superior típico (junto con un útero, cuello uterino, trompas de Falopio y ovarios típicos) con diferencias solo en la porción inferior de la vagina."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met deze variant kunnen geboren worden zonder een vaginale opening, een ondiep ‘kuiltje’ waar normaal gesproken een opening zou zijn, of een vaginale opening die is versmolten of geblokkeerd door vezelig weefsel. Personen met vaginale atresie hebben vaak een typisch bovenste vaginale kanaal (samen met een typische baarmoeder, baarmoederhals, eileiders en eierstokken) met verschillen alleen in het onderste gedeelte van de vagina."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med denna variation kan vara födda utan slidöppning, med en grund fördjupning där en öppning normalt finns, eller med en slidöppning som är tillsluten eller blockerad av bindväv. Personer med vaginal atresi har ofta en typiskt utvecklad övre del av slidan (tillsammans med livmoder, livmodertapp, äggledare och äggstockar) men med variationer i den nedre delen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002885","dc:identifier":"homoit0002885","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"XXYY syndrome"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome XXYY"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"XXYY syndroom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"XXYY-syndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Síndrome 48 XXYY"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People with XXYY syndrome are born with an extra copy of both an X and Y chromosome, resulting in an 48XXYY chromosome pattern instead of the typical 46XY. People with XXYY chromosomes may have undescended testes and produce lower-than-typical amounts of testosterone, which can cause them to start puberty at a later age than typical and develop less pronounced secondary sex characteristics like muscle tone and facial hair. They may also experience breast growth. People with XXYY syndrome often have other physical features that are similar to those developed by people with Klinefelter syndrome (47XXY)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Las personas con síndrome XXYY nacen con una copia adicional de un cromosoma X y uno Y, lo que resulta en un patrón cromosómico 48XXYY, en lugar del típico 46XY. Las personas con cromosomas XXYY pueden tener testículos no descendidos y producir cantidades de testosterona inferiores a las habituales, lo que puede provocar que comiencen la pubertad a una edad más tardía de lo habitual y que desarrollen características sexuales secundarias menos pronunciadas, como el tono muscular y el vello facial. También pueden experimentar crecimiento de los senos. Las personas con síndrome XXYY suelen tener otras características físicas similares a las que desarrollan las personas con síndrome de Klinefelter (47XXY)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met het XXYY-syndroom worden geboren met een extra kopie van zowel een X- als een Y-chromosoom, wat resulteert in een 48XXYY-chromosoompatroon in plaats van de typische 46XY. Personen met XXYY-chromosomen kunnen niet-ingedaalde teelballen hebben en lagere hoeveelheden testosteron produceren, waardoor ze op een latere leeftijd dan normaal in de puberteit kunnen komen en minder uitgesproken secundaire geslachtskenmerken kunnen ontwikkelen, zoals spiertonus en gezichtsbeharing. Ze kunnen ook borstgroei ervaren. Personen met het XXYY-syndroom hebben vaak andere fysieke kenmerken die vergelijkbaar zijn met die ontwikkeld door personen met het Klinefelter-syndroom (47XXY)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer med XXYY-syndrom föds med en extra kopia av både X- och Y-kromosomen, vilket ger kromosommönstret 48XXYY istället för det typiska 46XY. Personer med XXYY-kromosomer kan ha testiklar som inte har vandrat ner och producera mindre testosteron än genomsnittet, vilket kan göra att puberteten startar senare och att sekundära könskarakteristika som muskelmassa och skäggväxt blir mindre framträdande. De kan också uppleva bröstutveckling. Personer med XXYY-syndrom har ofta fysiska drag som liknar dem hos personer med Klinefelters syndrom (47XXY)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001646","dc:identifier":"homoit0001646","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Assigned X at birth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Asignado X al nacer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kein zugewiesenes Geschlecht bei der Geburt"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Assigné X à la naissance"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Toegewezen X bij geboorte"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tilldelat X vid födseln"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AXAB"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Designated X at birth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"DXAB"},{"@language":"en","@value":"X assigned at birth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"XAAB"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Asignadx X al nacer"},{"@language":"es","@value":"AXAN"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The assignment of an \"X\" gender marker or \"X\" sex designation shortly after birth. It is uncommon for intersex people to be assigned intersex or X at birth.\r\n"},{"@language":"es","@value":"La asignación de un marcador de género \"X\" o una designación de sexo \"X\" poco después del nacimiento. Es poco común que a las personas intersexuales se les asigne intersex o X al nacer."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Zuweisung eines Geschlechtsmerkmals „X“ oder einer Geschlechtsbezeichnung „X“ kurz nach der Geburt. Es ist ungewöhnlich, dass inter* Menschen bei der Geburt „intersexuell“ oder „X“ zugewiesen wird."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Genre ou sexe X assigné à une personne à la naissance. Les personnes intersexes se voient rarement attribuer la mention intersexe ou X à la naissance."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een toewijzing van een \"X\" gender-aanduiding of een mannelijke geslachtsaanduiding kort na de geboorte."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tilldelningen av en ”X”-könsmarkör eller ”X”-könsbeteckning strax efter födseln för nyfödda med ej definierbar könstillhörighet. Det är ovanligt att intersexpersoner tilldelas intersex eller X vid födseln. Att tilldela X vid födseln förekommer inte i Sverige."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001268"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000669"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001646"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002884"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001269"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/assignedXAtBirth"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003938","dc:identifier":"homoit0003938","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex demonstrations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexdemonstrationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex protests"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse protestmarsen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against intersex people and advocate for intersex visibility, rights, and issues."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Protestmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten om te protesteren tegen discriminatie van intersekse personen en om te pleiten voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. van intersekse personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher, demonstrationer och andra stora, offentliga sammankomster organiserade för att protestera mot diskriminering av intersexpersoner och förespråka intersexpersoners synlighet, intersexpersoners rättigheter och frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000672"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000675","dc:identifier":"homoit0000675","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intimate partner violence"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Violencia doméstica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Partnermishandeling"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Våld i nära relationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intimate partner abuse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Violencia de pareja"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Acts of violence or abuse directed against an individual by their current or former partner in a romantic, sexual, or play relationship."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actos de violencia o abuso dirigidos contra una persona por su pareja actual o anterior en una relación romántica, sexual o de juego."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Daden van geweld of misbruik gericht tegen een persoon door hun huidige of voormalige partner in een romantische, seksuele of spelrelatie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handlingar av våld eller övergrepp riktade mot en individ av deras nuvarande eller tidigare partner i en romantisk, sexuell eller kinkrelaterad relation."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000855"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000918"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001133"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001293"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001311"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2009000032"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000059"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/intimatePartnerViolence"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000676","dc:identifier":"homoit0000676","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inuit LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ inuit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inuit LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inuitiska hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inuit (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Inuit people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Inuit"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Inuit people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inuit (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas inuit (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas inuit LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inuit personen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Inuit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Inuit personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are Inuit, or part of several Indigenous peoples inhabiting the Inuit homeland in the Arctic and subarctic regions of Greenland, Canada, and Alaska. Only use for people who identify as Inuit."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son inuit o que son parte de varios pueblos indígenas que habitan los territorios ancestrales inuit en las regiones árticas o subárticas de Groenlandia, Canadá y Alaska. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se identifiquen como inuit. "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die Inuit zijn, of deel uitmaken van verschillende inheemse volkeren die het thuisland van de Inuit bewonen in de Arctische en subarctische gebieden van Groenland, Canada en Alaska. Alleen gebruiken voor mensen die zich identificeren als Inuit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är inuiter eller tillhör något av de urfolk som lever i inuiternas hemland i de arktiska och subarktiska regionerna på Grönland, i Kanada och i Alaska. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som inuiter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001962"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001963"