uit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som är inuiter eller tillhör något av de urfolk som lever i inuiternas hemland i de arktiska och subarktiska regionerna på Grönland, i Kanada och i Alaska. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som inuiter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000676"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002923","dc:identifier":"homoit0002923","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inuit asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales inuit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inuit aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella inuiter"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas inuit asexuales"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who are Inuit, or part of several Indigenous peoples inhabiting the Inuit homeland in the Arctic and subarctic regions of Greenland, Canada, and Alaska. Only use for people who identify as Inuit."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que son inuit o que son parte de varios pueblos indígenas que habitan los territorios ancestrales inuit en las regiones árticas o subárticas de Groenlandia, Canadá y Alaska. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se identifiquen como inuit."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die Inuit zijn, of deel uitmaken van verschillende inheemse volkeren die het Inuit-thuisland in de Arctische en subarctische gebieden van Groenland, Canada en Alaska bewonen. Alleen te gebruiken voor personen die zich identificeren als Inuit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som är inuiter eller tillhör något av de urfolk som lever i inuiternas hemland i de arktiska och subarktiska regionerna på Grönland, i Kanada och i Alaska. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som inuiter."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000676"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002922"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003410","dc:identifier":"homoit0003410","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inuit non-binary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarixs inuit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inuit non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära inuiter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inuit nonbinary people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Inuit people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Inuit"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Inuit people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Inuit"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas inuit no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inuit no binarixs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No binarixs inuit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire Inuit"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Inuit"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are Inuit, or part of several Indigenous peoples inhabiting the Inuit homeland in the Arctic and subarctic regions of Greenland, Canada, and Alaska. Only use for people who identify as Inuit."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarixs que son inuit o que son parte de varios pueblos indígenas que habitan los territorios ancestrales inuit en las regiones árticas o subárticas de Groenlandia, Canadá y Alaska. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se identifiquen como inuit."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die Inuit zijn, of deel uitmaken van verschillende inheemse volkeren die het Inuit-thuisland bewonen in de Arctische en subarctische gebieden van Groenland, Canada en Alaska. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zich identificeren als Inuit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som är inuiter eller tillhör något av de urfolk som lever i inuiternas hemland i de arktiska och subarktiska regionerna på Grönland, i Kanada och i Alaska. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som inuiter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000676"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000677","dc:identifier":"homoit0000677","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Inverts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Invertidos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geïnverteerden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inverterade"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual inverts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Invertida"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Invertido sexual"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdated, historical term used for LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término anticuado e histórico utilizado para las personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Föråldrad historisk term som användes för att beskriva hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001296"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001564"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/inverts"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001564","dc:identifier":"homoit0001564","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Uranism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uranismo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Uranisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uranism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Uranismus"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Congenital sexual inversion"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Urningism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Uraniadism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Uranianism"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uraniadism"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uranianism"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uranismus"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Urningism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Historical term originating from the German \"Uranismus\" coined by Karl Heinrich Ulrichs as an umbrella term for what are now referred to as gender and sexual minorities; use only in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término histórico que se origina en el \"uranismo\" alemán acuñado por Karl Heinrich Ulrichs como término general para lo que ahora se conoce como minorías sexuales y de género; utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historisk term med ursprung i det tyska ordet ”Uranismus” som myntades av Karl Heinrich Ulrichs som ett paraplybegrepp för det vi idag kallar köns- och sexualitetsminoriteter. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000677"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001296"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001484"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/uranism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000681","dc:identifier":"homoit0000681","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Jerking off"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pajearse"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rukken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Runka"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Jacking off"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Jerking it"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Echar una paja"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hacerse una puñeta"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Correrse"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang term for masturbation; typically refers to manual stimulation of the penis."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga para la masturbación; usualmente se refiere a la estimulación manual del pene."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Argot-term voor masturbatie; verwijst meestal naar handmatige stimulatie van de penis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slangterm för onani, vanligtvis genom manuell stimulans av penis."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001000"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/jerkingOff"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000745","dc:identifier":"homoit0000745","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Jewish lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas judías"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Joodse lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Judiska lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Jews"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas judías"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska judar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@v