die zich bezighouden met onderzoek, onderwijs, beleidswerk en belangenbehartiging met betrekking tot menselijke seksualiteit en seksueel gedrag, met name om taboes te doorbreken en een meer open discussie over seks en seksualiteit in de samenleving aan te moedigen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Institutioner eller grupper som arbetar med forskning, utbildning, policyfrågor och opinionsbildning om sexualitet och sexuellt beteende. Syftet är ofta att utmana tabun och uppmuntra till mer öppen diskussion om sex i samhället."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000836"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/organisationsForSexualResearchAndSex"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003843","dc:identifier":"homoit0003843","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit organizations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit organisaties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-organisationer"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Two-Spirit organisations"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited organizations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit organizations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited organizations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S organizations"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Groups or clubs of Two-Spirit people dedicated to a particular interest or activity."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Groepen of