oner eller hbtq+-tematik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000841"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002144"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002172"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQMangas"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001587","dc:identifier":"homoit0001587","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian comics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cómics lésbicos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische stripverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska tecknade serier"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Works consisting of sequential images often accompanied by text; use in reference to comics focusing on lesbian characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras que consisten en imágenes secuenciales, a menudo acompañadas de texto; utilícese en referencia a cómics que se centran en personajes o temas lésbicos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Werken bestaande uit opeenvolgende afbeeldingen, vaak vergezeld van tekst; gebruiken met betrekking tot strips die zich richten op lesbische personages of thema's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verk som består av bilder i följd, ofta tillsammans med text. Används för serier som skildrar lesbiska karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000841"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianComics"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.