 stripverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuella tecknade serier"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Historietas demisexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuellen-Comics"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Works consisting of sequential images often accompanied by text; use in reference to comics focusing on demisexual characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras que consisten en imágenes secuenciales, a menudo acompañadas de texto; utilícese en referencia a cómics que se centran en personajes o temas demisexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Werke, die aus sequentiellen Bildern bestehen, die oft von Text begleitet werden; Verwendung in Bezug auf Comics, die sich auf demisexuelle Charaktere oder Themen konzentrieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Werken bestaande uit opeenvolgende afbeeldingen, vaak vergezeld van tekst; gebruik om te verwijzen naar stripverhalen die zich richten op demiseksuele personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verk som består av bilder i följd, ofta tillsammans med text. Används för serier med demisexuella karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000841"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-17"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002503","dc:identifier":"homoit0002503","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Megasexual comics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cómics megasexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Megaseksuele stripverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Megasexuella tecknade serier"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Historietas megasexuales"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Works consisting of sequential images often accompanied by text; use in r