 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002631","dc:identifier":"homoit0002631","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Māhū comics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cómics māhū"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Māhū stripverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Māhū-tecknade serier"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"haw","@value":"Mahu comics"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Works consisting of sequential images often accompanied by text; use in reference to comics focusing on Māhū characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras que consisten de imágenes secuenciales, a menudo acompañadas de texto; utilícese en referencia a cómics que se centran en personajes o temas māhū."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Publicaties bestaande uit opeenvolgende afbeeldingen, vaak vergezeld van tekst; gebruikt met betrekking tot strips die zich richten op Mahu personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verk som består av bilder i följd, ofta tillsammans med text. Används för serier med māhū-karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000841"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002631"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002643","dc:identifier":"homoit0002643","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit comics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cómics dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit stripverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tecknade serier om Two-spirit-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S comics "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit comics "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited comics "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited comics "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Historietas dos espíritus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Works consisting of sequential images often accompanied by text; use in reference to comics focusing on Two-Spirit characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras que consisten de imágenes secuenciales, a menudo acompañadas de texto; utilícese en referencia a los cómics centrados en personajes o temas dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Publicaties bestaande uit opeenvolgende afbeeldingen, vaak vergezeld van tekst; gebruikt met betrekking tot strips die zich richten op Two-Spirit personages of thema's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verk som består av bilder i följd, ofta tillsammans med text. Används för serier som skildrar Two-spirit-karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000841"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002643"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000845","dc:identifier":"homoit0000845","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ cruises"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cruceros LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+向けクルーズ"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-cruises"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-kryssningar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ cruises"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cruceros LGBTQ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ向けクルーズ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Voyages on a ship taken for pleasure or as a vacation; use in reference to cruises catered toward LGBTQ+ clientele."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Viajes en un barco realizados por placer o como vacaciones; utilícese en referencia a cruceros dirigidos a clientes LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"レジャーや休暇を目的とした船旅。特にLGBTQ+の顧客層を対象としたクルーズを指す。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Reizen op een schip voor plezier of als vakantie; gebruik voor cruises gericht op LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kryssningar för nöje eller semester som riktar sig till hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQCruises"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956","dc:identifier":"homoit0000956","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ tourism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Turismo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-toerisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-turism"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ tourism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Turismo LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Industry centered around LGBTQ+ people traveling to and staying in various locations for recreation or leisure. "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Industria centrada en personas LGBTQ+ que viajan y se alojan en diversos lugares por motivos de recreación u ocio."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bedrijvigheid gericht op LHBTQ+-personen die reizen naar en verblijven op verschillende locaties voor recreatie of vrije tijd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bransch som fokuserar på resor och vistelser för hbtq+-personer i rekreationellt eller fritidsrelaterat syfte."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000845"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003262"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003279"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000881"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000930"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQTourism"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002393","dc:identifier":"homoit0002393","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Digital identification of LGBTQ+ people by police"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identificación digital de personas LGBTQ+ por parte de la policía"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Digitale Identifizierung von LGBTQ+-Personen durch die Polizei"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Digitale identificatie van LHBTQ+-personen door de politie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Digital identifiering av hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Digital stop and search to identify LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Identification of LGBTQ+ people by police using phone data"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police use of digital tools to identify LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Detenciones y registros digitales para identificar a personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identificación de personas LGBTQ+ por la policía mediante datos telefónicos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uso policial de herramientas digitales para identificar a personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Digiale polizeiliche Identifizierung von LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politiegebruik van digitale hulpmiddelen om LHBTQ+-personen te identificeren"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Identification of LGBTQ+ people, or people believed to be LGBTQ+, by police using digital tools, such as phone records, mobile applications, facial identification algorithms, and artificial intelligence technologies. Such data is then used to entrap and prosecute LGBTQ+ persons, especially in areas where being LGBTQ+ is criminalized."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Identificación de personas LGBTQ+, o personas que se cree que son LGBTQ+, por parte de la policía utilizando herramientas digitales, como registros telefónicos, aplicaciones móviles, algoritmos de identificación facial y tecnologías de inteligencia artificial. Luego, esos datos se utilizan para atrapar y procesar a personas LGBTQ+, especialmente en áreas donde ser LGBTQ+ aún está criminalizado."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Polizeiliche Identifizierung von LGBTQ+-Personen oder Personen, die verdächtigt werden, zur LGBTQ+-Gemeinschaft zu gehören, mithilfe digitaler Tools wie Telefonaufzeichnungen, mobilen Anwendungen, Gesichtserkennungsalgorithmen und Technologien der künstlichen Intelligenz. Diese Daten werden verwendet, um LGBTQ+-Personen zu überführen und strafrechtlich zu verfolgen, insbesondere in Gebieten, in denen die Zugehörigkeit zur LGBTQ+-Gemeinschaft noch immer unter Strafe steht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Identificatie van LHBTQ+-mensen, of mensen waarvan wordt aangenomen dat ze LHBTQ+ zijn, door de politie met behulp van digitale hulpmiddelen, zoals telefoongegevens, mobiele applicaties, algoritmen voor gezichtsidentificatie en kunstmatige intelligentie-technologieën. Dergelijke gegevens worden vervolgens gebruikt om LHBTQ+-personen in de val te lokken en te vervolgen, vooral in gebieden waar LHBTQ+-zijn strafbaar is."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Identifiering av hbtq+-personer, eller personer som antas vara hbtq+, av polis med hjälp av digitala verktyg såsom telefonuppgifter, mobilapplikationer, ansiktsigenkänningsalgoritmer och artificiell intelligens. Uppgifterna används därefter för att locka, gripa och lagföra hbtq+-personer, särskilt i områden där det fortfarande är kriminaliserat att vara hbtq+."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002392"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000846"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000847"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000962","dc:identifier":"homoit0000962","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ websites"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sitios web LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-websites"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-webbsidor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ websites"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sitios web LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public web pages that primarily address LGBTQ+ communities and issues, as well as web pages intended for use by LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Páginas web públicas que abordan principalmente comunidades y cuestiones LGBTQ+, así como páginas web destinadas a personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Openbare webpagina's die zich voornamelijk richten op LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen en -kwesties, evenals webpagina's die bedoeld zijn voor gebruik door LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Webbsidor som främst handlar om hbtq+-gemenskaper och frågor, samt webbsidor som är avsedda att användas av hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000847"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003210"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003211"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003212"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003213"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003214"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003215"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003216"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003217"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003218"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003219"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003220"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003221"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000888"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000946"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003222"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000962"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQWebsites"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848","dc:identifier":"homoit0000848","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ death and dying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Morir y la muerte LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の死と死去"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-dood en sterven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döden och döende (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ death and dying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"El proceso de morir y la muerte LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQの死と死去"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Experiences related to LGBTQ+ people approaching or having reached the end of their lives."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Experiencias relacionadas con personas LGBTQ+ que se acercan o han llegado al final de sus vidas."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"人生の終わりに近づいている、あるいは既に終わりを迎えたLGBTQ+の人々に関する体験。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ervaringen met betrekking tot LHBTQ+-personen die het einde van hun leven naderen of hebben bereikt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erfarenheter relaterade till hbtq+-personer som närmar sig eller har nått livets slut."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000952"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000849"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000911"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001360"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002258"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQDeathAndDying"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000952","dc:identifier":"homoit0000952","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ suicide"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Suicidio LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-zelfdoding"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Suicid (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ suicide"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Suicidio LGBTQ"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zelfmoord"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självmord (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Deaths of LGBTQ+ people as a result of intentional, self-inflicted harm or injury."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Muertes de personas LGBTQ+ como resultado de daños o lesiones intencionales y autoinfligidos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sterfgevallen van LHBTQ+-personen als gevolg van opzettelijke, zelf toegebrachte schade of letsel."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personers död till följd av avsiktligt självorsakad skada eller självmord."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001012"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSuicide"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000849","dc:identifier":"homoit0000849","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ death notices"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の死亡記事"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Avisos de defunción LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-overlijdensadvertenties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dödsannonser (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ death announcements"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ death notices"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ関連の訃報"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQの死亡記事"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Avisos de muerte LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Avisos de defunción LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public announcements in periodicals, online information centers, or social media about the death of an LGBTQ+ person, typically including details about funerals and memorial services."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人の死亡に関する、定期刊行物、オンライン情報サイト、またはソーシャルメディアでの告知。通常、葬儀や追悼式（告別式）の詳細が含まれる。"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Anuncios públicos en publicaciones periódicas, centros de información en línea o redes sociales sobre la muerte de una persona LGBTQ+, que generalmente incluyen detalles sobre funerales y servicios conmemorativos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Openbare aankondigingen in tijdschriften, online informatiecentra of sociale media over de dood van een LHBTQ+-persoon, meestal inclusief details over begrafenissen en herdenkingsdiensten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dödsannonser och andra offentliga tillkännagivanden i tidskrifter, digitala informationskanaler eller sociala medier om en hbtq+-persons död, ofta med information om begravning och minnesstund."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000911"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002258"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000849"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQDeathNotices"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000911","dc:identifier":"homoit0000911","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ obituaries"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obituarios LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-in memoriams"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nekrologer (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ obituaries"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Minnesrunor (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public notices published shortly after an LGBTQ+ person's death to inform others of their passing and celebrate their life."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Avisos públicos publicados poco después de la muerte de una persona LGBTQ+ para informar a otras personas sobre su fallecimiento y celebrar su vida."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Openbare mededelingen die kort na het overlijden van een LHBTQ+-persoon worden gepubliceerd om anderen te informeren over hun overlijden en hun leven te vieren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentliga meddelanden efter en hbtq+-persons död, för att informera om bortgången och hylla deras liv."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001042"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000849"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002258"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQObituaries"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002258","dc:identifier":"homoit0002258","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"AIDS death and dying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Morir y la muerte por SIDA"},{"@language":"de","@value":"AIDS-Tod und -Sterben"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"AIDS dood en sterven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aids - döden och döende"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Tod durch AIDS"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Sterben durch AIDS"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Experiences related to people with AIDS approaching or having reached the end of their lives."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Experiencias relacionadas a personas con SIDA que se acercan o han llegado al final de sus vidas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Erfahrungen im Zusammenhang mit Menschen, die an AIDS erkrankt sind und sich dem Ende ihres Lebens nähern oder dieses erreicht haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ervaringen van personen met AIDS die het einde van hun leven naderen of hebben bereikt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Erfarenheter relaterade till personer med aids som närmar sig eller har nått slutet av sina liv."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000848"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000849"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000911"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001360"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002258"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001379","dc:identifier":"homoit0001379","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender demonstrations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marchas trans"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans march"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender protests"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans protests"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans demonstrations"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marchas transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trans protesten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Trans protestmarsen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender protesten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender protestmarsen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans marcher"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans marsch"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans marscher"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans parader"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans-march"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans-marcher"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans-marsch"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans-marscher"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trans-parader"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmarch"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmarcher"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmarsch"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transmarscher"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transparader"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against trans people and advocate for trans visibility, rights, and issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marchas y encuentros centrados en cuestiones y derechos trans."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Prorstmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten, georganiseerd om te protesteren tegen discriminatie van transgender personen en om op te komen voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. van transgender personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher och sammankomster med fokus på transfrågor och transpersoners rättigheter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001423"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transMarches"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003937","dc:identifier":"homoit0003937","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer demonstrations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queer-demonstrationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer protests"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer protestmarsen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera demonstrationer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against queer people and advocate for queer visibility, rights, and issues."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Protestmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten om te protesteren tegen discriminatie van queer personen en om op te komen voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. van queer personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher, demonstrationer och andra stora, offentliga sammankomster organiserade för att protestera mot diskriminering av queera personer och förespråka queera personers synlighet, queera personer rättigheter och frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001187"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000932","dc:identifier":"homoit0000932","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ riots"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disturbios LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-rellen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kravaller (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ riots"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disturbios (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Motines (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Motines LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Upplopp (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uppror (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gatustrider (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Civil disorder directed against authorities, property, and other individuals, typically in response to grievances, conflicts, or injustice; use in reference to riots involving LGBTQ+ people or in response to LGBTQ+ issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Desorden civil dirigido contra autoridades, propiedades y otras personas, generalmente en respuesta a agravios, conflictos o injusticias; utilícese en referencia a disturbios que involucran a personas LGBTQ+ o en respuesta a asuntos LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Maatschappelijke onrust gericht tegen autoriteiten, eigendommen en andere personen, meestal als reactie op grieven, conflicten of onrechtvaardigheid; gebruik in verwijzing naar rellen waarbij LHBTQ+-personen betrokken zijn of als reactie op LHBTQ+-kwesties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Upplopp riktade mot myndigheter, egendom eller andra personer, vanligtvis som svar på orättvisor eller konflikter. Används för upplopp där hbtq+-personer är involverade eller där hbtq+-frågor står i fokus."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001341"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000932"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQRiots"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003652","dc:identifier":"homoit0003652","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pride parades"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pride parades"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pride-parader"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ pride parades"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Processions of LGBTQ+ people and allies, usually organized along a public street, that recognize and celebrate LGBTQ+ people and culture. For political marches and rallies, use the term \"LGBTQ+ demonstrations.\""},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Processies van LHBTQ+-personen en bondgenoten, meestal georganiseerd langs een openbare weg, die LHBTQ+-personen en -cultuur erkennen en vieren. Voor politieke marsen en bijeenkomsten gebruik de term \"LHBTQ+-demonstraties\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentliga parader som uppmärksammar och firar hbtq+-personer och hbtq+-kultur, och som bekräftar hbtq+-gemenskapernas synlighet, värdighet och mångfald."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003651"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006020042"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000861"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003939","dc:identifier":"homoit0003939","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit demonstrations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit demonstraties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-demonstrationer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit marches"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit rallies"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit protests"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited demonstrations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit demonstrations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited demonstrations"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S demonstrations"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit protestmarsen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marches, rallies, and other large, public gatherings organized to protest discrimination against Two-Spirit people and advocate for Two-Spirit visibility, rights, and issues."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Protestmarsen, demonstraties en andere grote, openbare bijeenkomsten om te protesteren tegen discriminatie tegen Two-Spirit people en om te pleiten voor de zichtbaarheid, rechten, etc. van Two-Spirit people."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marscher, demonstrationer och andra stora, offentliga sammankomster organiserade för att protestera mot diskriminering av two-spirit-personer och förespråka two-spirit-personers synlighet, two-spirit-personers rättigheter och frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002656"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002713"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000851"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002656"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001578","dc:identifier":"homoit0001578","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender mystery and detective fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción transgénero de misterio y de detectives"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender detectiveverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transdeckare"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans mystery and detective fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Deckare om transpersoner och transteman"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts the investigation of crime or the work of detectives. Use for mystery and detective fiction focusing on transgender characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre la investigación de crímenes o el trabajo de detectives; utilícese en referencia a la ficción de misterio y de detectives centrada en personajes y temas transgénero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken over misdaadonderzoek of het werk van rechercheurs; gebruik in verwijzing naar mysterie en detective fictie gericht op transgender personages en thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk om brottsutredningar eller detektivarbete. Används för deckare och mysterielitteratur med transkaraktärer eller transfokuserade teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000852"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001414"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderMysteryAndDetectiveFiction"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001579","dc:identifier":"homoit0001579","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer mystery and detective fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción queer de misterio y de detectives"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer detectiveverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera deckare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts the investigation of crime or the work of detectives. Use for mystery and detective fiction focusing on queer characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre la investigación de crímenes o el trabajo de detectives; utilícese en referencia a la ficción de misterio y de detectives centrada en personajes y temas queer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken over misdaadonderzoek of het werk van rechercheurs; gebruik in verwijzing naar mysterie en detective fictie gericht op queer personages en thema's."},{"@la