ective fiction "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited mystery and detective fiction "}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts the investigation of crime or the work of detectives. Use for mystery and detective fiction focusing on Two-Spirit characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre la investigación de crímenes o el trabajo de detectives; utilícese en referencia a la ficción de misterio y de detectives centrada en personajes y temas dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken over misdaadonderzoek of het werk van rechercheurs; gebruik in verwijzing naar mysterie en detective fictie gericht op Two-Spirit personages en thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk om brottsutredningar eller detektivarbete. Används för deckare och mysterielitteratur med Two-spirit-karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001751"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000852"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002710"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-26"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000910","dc:identifier":"homoit0000910","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ nonviolent resistance"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Resistencia no violenta LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-geweldloos verzet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickevåldsmotstånd (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ nonviolent resistance"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Resistencia no violenta (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickevål (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Actions taken to promote social change for LGBTQ+ people and communities through non-violent means, including protests, boycotts, and organized non-cooperation."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acciones tomadas para promover el cambio social para las personas y comunidades LGBTQ+ a través de medios no violentos, incluidas las protestas, los boicots y la no-cooperación organizada."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Acties die zijn ondernomen om sociale verandering voor LHBTQ+-personen en -gemeenschappen te bevorderen met niet-gewelddadige middelen, waaronder protesten, boycots en georganiseerde niet-samenwerking."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handlingar som syftar till att främja social förändring för hbtq+-personer och hbtq+-gemenskaper genom ickevåldsliga metoder, inklusive protester, bojkotter och organiserad vägran att samarbeta."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQNonviolentResistance"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000919","dc:identifier":"homoit0000919","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ petitions"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Peticiones LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-petities"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-upprop"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ petitions"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Peticiones LGBTQ"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-namninsamlingar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-petitioner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Written requests for political or social action that are addressed to government officials or public entities and signed by numerous people; use in reference to petitions created by or addressing LGBTQ+ organizations, communities, and/or concerns."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solicitudes escritas para acción política o social dirigidas a funcionarios gubernamentales o entidades públicas, y firmadas por numerosas personas; utilícese en referencia a peticiones creadas o dirigidas a organizaciones, comunidades y/o inquietudes LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Schriftelijke verzoeken om politieke of sociale actie die zijn gericht aan overheidsfunctionarissen of openbare entiteiten en die door tal van mensen zijn ondertekend; gebruik in verwijzing naar petities die zijn opgesteld door of gericht zijn tot LHBTQ+-organisaties, -gemeenschappen en/of -zorgen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skriftliga upprop som riktas till politiska beslutsfattare eller offentliga institutioner och undertecknas av många personer i syfte att kräva politisk eller social förändring. Används för petitioner som har skapats av eller riktar sig till hbtq+-organisationer, hbtq+-gemenskaper och/eller hbtq+-relaterade frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPetitions"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000935","dc:identifier":"homoit0000935","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en-us","@value":"LGBTQ+ self-defense"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Autodefensa LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-zelfverdediging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självförsvar (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"LGBTQ+ self-defence"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Countermeasures taken by an LGBTQ+ person to protect their own health or well being from harm."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Contramedidas tomadas por una persona LGBTQ+ para proteger su propia salud o bienestar de daños."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tegenmaatregelen genomen door een LHBTQ+-persoon om de eigen gezondheid of welzijn te beschermen tegen onheil."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Motåtgärder som hbtq+-personer vidtar för att skydda sin egen hälsa eller sitt välbefinnande."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000853"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000006"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSelfDefence"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001255","dc:identifier":"homoit0001255","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Same-sex divorce"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Divorcio entre personas del mismo sexo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homoscheiding"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samkönade skilsmässor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A legal proceeding undertaken to dissolve a marriage between two individuals of the same sex."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Procedimiento legal emprendido para disolver un matrimonio entre dos personas del mismo sexo."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een gerechtelijke procedure om een huwelijk tussen twee personen van hetzelfde geslacht te ontbinden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En rättsprocess för att upplösa ett äktenskap mellan två personer av samma kön."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000854"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2005000375"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000973"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sameSexDivorce"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001285","dc:identifier":"homoit0001285","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual assault"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Agresión sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aanranding"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuella övergrepp"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual behavior or contact targeting an individual who has not consented; includes nonconsensual sex acts that may not be illegal or punishable by law in the given location or time period."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Comportamiento o contacto sexual dirigido a una persona que no ha dado su consentimiento; incluye actos sexuales no consensuales que pueden no ser ilegales o punibles por la ley en un lugar o período de tiempo determinados."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksueel gedrag of contact gericht op een persoon die geen toestemming heeft gegeven; omvat seksuele handelingen zonder wederzijds goedvinden die mogelijk niet illegaal of strafbaar zijn in de gegeven locatie of periode"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuellt beteende eller sexuell kontakt riktad mot en individ som inte har samtyckt. Inkluderar sexuella handlingar utan samtycke som inte nödvändigtvis är olagliga eller straffbara enligt lag vid den aktuella tidpunkten eller platsen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001305"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000855"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003444"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85111402"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001305"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualAssault"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001597","dc:identifier":"homoit0001597","skos:prefLabel":[