ents; use in reference to erotic literature focusing on non-binary characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias que tengan elementos eróticos o sexuales; utilícese en referencia a la literatura erótica que se centra en personajes o temas no binarios."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literaire publicaties met erotische of seksuele elementen; gebruik om te verwijzen naar erotische literatuur met non-binaire personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk med erotiska eller sexuella inslag. Används för erotisk litteratur med ickebinära karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000859"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000403"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002205","dc:identifier":"homoit0002205","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slash fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción slash"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Slash fictie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slash-fiktion"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slash fan fics"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Slash fan fiction"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Slash fanfiction"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Slash fic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fan ficción slash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fan fic slash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Slash fic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fanfiction slash"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fanfic slash"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Slash fanfictie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Slash fic"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Slash fiction"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fanfiction focusing on sexual or romantic relationships between characters of the same sex or gender that is typically erotic or pornographic in nature. Historically used for male-male couples only, but is now used more broadly; includes femslash fiction."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fanficción que se centra en relaciones sexuales o románticas entre personajes del mismo sexo o género y que suele ser de naturaleza erótica o pornográfica. Históricamente se utilizaba únicamente para parejas de hombres, pero ahora se utiliza de forma más amplia; incluye ficción femslash."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Fanfictie gericht op seksuele of romantische relaties tussen personages van hetzelfde geslacht of gender die typisch erotisch of pornografisch van aard zijn. Van oudsher alleen gebruikt voor man-man koppels, maar wordt nu breder gebruikt; bevat femslash-fictie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fanfiction som fokuserar på sexuella eller romantiska relationer mellan karaktärer av samma kön eller könsidentitet. Verken är vanligtvis erotiska eller pornografiska. Termen användes ursprungligen för man/man-par men inkluderar numera även femslash-fiktion."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002159"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002203"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002204"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002188"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002196"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000859"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002635","dc:identifier":"homoit0002635","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Māhū erotic literature"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura erótica māhū"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Māhū erotische literatuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Māhū erotisk litteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"haw","@value":"Mahu erotic literature"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary works that have erotic or sexual elements; use in reference to erotic literature focusing on Māhū characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias con elementos eróticos o sexuales; utilícese en referencia a la literatura erótica centrada en personajes o temas māhū."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literaire werken met erotische of seksuele elementen; gebruik in verwijzing naar erotische literatuur gericht op Mahu personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk med erotiska eller sexuella inslag. Används för erotisk litteratur med māhū-karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000859"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002635"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002644","dc:identifier":"homoit0002644","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit erotic literature"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura erótica dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit erotische literatuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-erotisk litteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S erotic literature"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit erotic literature"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited erotic literature"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited erotic literature"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary works that have erotic or sexual elements; use in reference to erotic literature focusing on Two-Spirit characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias que tienen elementos eróticos o sexuales; utilícese en referencia a la literatura erótica centrada en personajes o temas dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literaire werken met erotische of seksuele elementen; gebruik in verwijzing naar erotische literatuur gericht op Two-Spirit personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk med erotiska eller sexuella inslag. Används för erotisk litteratur med Two-spirit-karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000859"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002644"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-25"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000875","dc:identifier":"homoit0000875","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Romani LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ romaníes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Roma LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romer (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Roma (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Romani people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Roma"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Romani people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas romaníes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Roma"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Roma (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romska hbtq+-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are Romani or descend from this traditionally nomadic Indo-European people; only use to refer to people who self-identify as Romani."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son romaníes o parte del pueblo indoeuropeo tradicionalmente nómada."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die Roma zijn, of deel uitmaken van dit traditioneel nomadische Indo-Europese volk; gebruik dit alleen om te verwijzen naar mensen die zichzelf als Roma identificeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är romer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"htt