 traditioneel nomadische Indo-Europese volk; gebruik dit alleen om te verwijzen naar mensen die zichzelf als Roma identificeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som är romer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000875"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003425","dc:identifier":"homoit0003425","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Romani non-binary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias romaníes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Roma non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Romska ickebinära personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Roma"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Roma"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Romani nonbinary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas romaníes no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Romaníes no binarixs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No binarixs romaníes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Roma"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Roma nonbinaire personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are Romani or descend from this traditionally nomadic Indo-European people; only use to refer to people who self-identify as Romani."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias que son romaníes o parte del pueblo indoeuropeo tradicionalmente nómada."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die Roma zijn, of deel uitmaken van dit traditioneel nomadische Indo-Europese volk; gebruik dit alleen om te verwijzen naar mensen die zichzelf als Roma identificeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som är romer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000875"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001094","dc:identifier":"homoit0001094","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pederasts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pederastas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pederasten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pederaster"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Adult men who have sexual and mentor/protégé relationships with adolescent boys. This term has historically been used to describe gay men. Only use in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres adultos que tienen relaciones sexuales y de mentoría/protección con adolescentes hombres. Este término se ha utilizado históricamente para describir a los hombres gay. Utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vuxna män som har sexuella och mentor-/skyddslingrelationer med tonårspojkar. Termen har historiskt använts för att beskriva bögar. Använd endast i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001095"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/pederasts"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001095","dc:identifier":"homoit0001095","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pederasty"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pederastia"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pederastie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pederasti"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the practices of adult men who engage in sexual and mentor/protégé relationships with adolescent boys. This term has historically been used to describe the practices of gay men. Only use in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir las prácticas de hombres adultos que mantienen relaciones sexuales y de mentor/pupilo con niños adolescentes. Este término se ha utilizado históricamente para describir las prácticas de los hombres gay. Utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"erotische relaties tussen een volwassen man en eenopgroeiende jongen, een adolescent; alleen gebruiken in historische context"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Begrepp som använts för att beskriva vuxna mäns sexuella och mentor-/skyddslingrelationer med tonårspojkar. Har historiskt använts för att beskriva bögar. Använd endast i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001094"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001325"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/pederasty"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001484","dc:identifier":"homoit0001484","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Uranians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Uranistas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Uraniërs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Urningar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Urnings"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uranier"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"19th century term used to refer to gender and sexual minorities; use only in historical contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término del siglo XIX utilizado para referirse a minorías sexuales y de género; utilícese únicamente en contextos históricos."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"1800-talsterm som användes för att beskriva köns- och sexualitetsminoriteter. Bör endast användas i historiska sammanhang."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001564"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/uranians"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003817","dc:identifier":"homoit0003817","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Male impersonation shows"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannelijke impersonator shows"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Herrimitatörsföreställningar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Male impersonator shows"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Male impersonators' shows"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannelijke impersonatie shows"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Theater or stage shows featuring male impersonators, a historical term used to describe performers, often female-identified people, who enact male personas for the purpose of entertainment, typically for straight audiences. Only use in historical contexts."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Theater- of toneelshows met mannelijke imitators, een historische term die wordt gebruikt om artiesten te beschrijven, vaak vrouwen die zich identificeren als vrouwen, die mannelijke persona's spelen voor entertainmentdoeleinden, meestal voor heteropubliek. Alleen gebruiken in historische context."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Teater- eller scenföreställningar med herrimitatörer. Historisk term som avsåg artister, ofta kvinnor, som framförde manliga roller i underhållningssyfte, vanligtvis för heterosexuell publik. Används endast i historisk kontext."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000983"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003359"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-11-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002260","dc:identifier":"homoit0002260","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ history"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Historia LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-geschiedenis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-historia"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"History (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ history"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Historia (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Historia LGBTQ"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ-geschiedenis"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Past events or accounts of the past concerning LGBTQ+ people, or people who might be perceived as LGBTQ+ if they were alive today."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Eventos pasados ​​o relatos del pasado relacionados con personas LGBTQ+, o personas que podrían ser percibidas como LGBTQ+ si estuvieran vivas hoy."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gebeurtenissen of verslagen uit het verleden over LHBTQ+-personen, of personen die als LHBTQ+ zouden kunnen worden beschouwd als ze vandaag zouden leven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historiska händelser eller uppgifter som rör hbtq+-personer, eller personer som i dag skulle kunna uppfattas som hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002261"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002262"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002263"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002264"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002265"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002266"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002268"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002332"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002462"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002488"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002504"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002525"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000878"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000901"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001614"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001729"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001755"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003656"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004390"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002260"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000879","dc:identifier":"homoit0000879","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ unhoused people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ sin hogar"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-thuislozen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hemlösa hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Unhoused people (LGBT)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ homeless people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ houseless people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ unsheltered people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sin hogar LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bostadslösa hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uteliggare (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who do not have access to stable, safe, and adequate housing; includes people living in emergency shelters; transitional housing, and on the street."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que no tienen acceso a una vivienda estable, segura y adecuada; incluye a personas que viven en refugios de emergencia, viviendas de transición y en la calle."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die geen toegang hebben tot stabiele, veilige en adequate huisvesting; omvat mensen die in noodopvangcentra wonen; tijdelijke huisvesting, en op straat"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som saknar tillgång till stabilt, tryggt och tillräckligt boende. Inkluderar personer som bor i akutboenden, genomgångsbostad eller som lever i akut hemlöshet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000880"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQHomelessPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000880","dc:identifier":"homoit0000880","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ unhoused youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes LGBTQ+ sin hogar"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-thuisloze jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hemlösa hbtq+-ungdomar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ homeless youth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ unhoused adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ unhoused teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ unsheltered youth"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-thuisloze adolescenten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-thuisloze teenagers"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people between the ages of childhood and adulthood who do not have access to stable, safe, and adequate housing; includes youth living in emergency shelters, transitional housing, and on the street."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ entre las edades de la niñez y la edad adulta que no tienen acceso a una vivienda estable, segura y adecuada; incluye a jóvenes que viven en refugios de emergencia, viviendas de transición y en la calle."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen tussen de kinderjaren en de volwassenheid die geen toegang hebben tot stabiele, veilige en adequate huisvesting; omvat jongeren die in noodopvangcentra, tijdelijke huisvesting en op straat leven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-ungdomar som saknar tillgång till stabilt, tryggt och tillräckligt boende. Inkluderar ungdomar i akutboenden, genomgångsbostad eller som lever i akut hemlöshet."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000879"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002460"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQHomelessYouth"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002460","dc:identifier":"homoit0002460","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic youth "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Jugendliche"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud arromántica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga aromantiker"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Teenager:innen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes arrománticos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes aro"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes arrománticos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes aro"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic people who are between the ages of childhood and adulthood.\r\n"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromatische Menschen im Alter zwischen Kindheit und Erwachsensein."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas arrománticas que se encuentran entre la infancia y la edad adulta."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische personen in de leeftijd tussen kinderjaren en volwassenheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantiska personer i åldern mellan barndom och vuxenliv."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000880"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002461"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-03-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000881","dc:identifier":"homoit0000881","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ hotels"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hoteles LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-hotels"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-hotell"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ hotels"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hoteles LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Establishments providing accommodations, meals, and other services for travelers; use in reference to hotels catering to LGBTQ+ people or commonly used by LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Establecimientos que brindan alojamiento, comidas y otros servicios a viajeros; utilícese en referencia a hoteles que atienden a personas LGBTQ+ o que son comúnmente utilizados por personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vestigingen die accommodatie, maaltijden en andere diensten voor reizigers bieden; gebruik in verwijzing naar hotels die zich richten op LHBTQ+-personen of vaak gebruikt door LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Etablissemang som erbjuder boende, mat och andra tjänster för resenärer. Används för hotell som vänder sig till hbtq+-personer eller ofta används av hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000929"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000881"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQHotels"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000929","dc:identifier":"homoit0000929","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ resorts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Resorts LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-resorts"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Semesteranläggningar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ resorts"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Resorts (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Resorter (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Commercial establishments providing lodging, entertainment, food, drinks, sporting, and shopping; use in reference to resorts that cater primarily to LGBTQ+ people or are known to be frequented by LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Establecimientos comerciales que brindan alojamiento, entretenimiento, alimentos, bebidas, deportes y lugares de compras; utilícese en referencia a resorts que principalmente atienden a personas LGBTQ+ o que son conocidos por ser frecuentados por personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Commerciële etablissementen die logies, amusement, eten, drinken, sport en winkelen bieden; gebruik met betrekking tot resorts die zich voornamelijk richten op LHBTQ+-personen of waarvan bekend is dat ze veelal worden bezocht door LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kommersiella anläggningar som erbjuder boende, nöjen, mat och dryck, sport- och fritidsaktiviteter samt shopping. Används för semesteranläggningar som i första hand riktar sig till hbtq+-personer eller som är kända för att frekventeras av hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000881"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000881"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQResorts"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001815","dc:identifier":"homoit0001815","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ immigrants"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inmigrantes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-immigranten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-immigranter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Immigrants (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inmigrantes (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have moved to another country."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que se han mudado a otro país."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LGBTQ+-personen die naar een ander land zijn verhuisd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har flyttat till ett annat land."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000883"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000902"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000927"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001053"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001092"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001482"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001853"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2020001167"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-01-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001853","dc:identifier":"homoit0001853","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ asylum seekers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solicitantes de asilo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の難民申請者"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-asielzoekers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asylsökande hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asylum seekers (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Solicitantes de asilo (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"難民申請者 (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asylsökande (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have left their home countries and are seeking protection from persecution and/or human rights violations in other countries but have not yet been legally recognized as refugees."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que han abandonado sus países de origen y buscan protección en otros países contra la persecución y/o violaciones de derechos humanos, pero que aún no han sido reconocidas legalmente como refugiadas."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"母国を離れ、他国において迫害や人権侵害からの保護を求めているものの、まだ法的に難民として認定されていないLGBTQ+の人々。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LGBTQ+-personen die hun thuisland hebben verlaten en bescherming zoeken tegen vervolging en/of mensenrechtenschendingen in andere landen, maar nog niet wettelijk erkend zijn als vluchteling"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har lämnat sina hemländer och söker skydd från förföljelse och/eller kränkningar av mänskliga rättigheter i andra länder, men som ännu inte erkänts juridiskt som flyktingar."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004520"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000883"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000902"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000927"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001053"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001092"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001482"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001815"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000885","dc:identifier":"homoit0000885","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ incest victims"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas LGBTQ+ de incesto"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-slachtoffers van incest"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offer för incest (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ victims of incest"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ incest victims"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Incestoffer (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have experienced incest and may or may not have survived; follow individuals' preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que han sufrido el incesto y que pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die incest hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; waar mogelijk de voorkeur van individuen voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\" volgen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har upplevt incest och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens eget språkbruk om de föredrar ”offer” eller ”överlevare”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000959"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002062"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQIncestVictims"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002062","dc:identifier":"homoit0002062","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ incest survivors"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes LGBTQ+ de incesto"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-overlevenden van incest"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Incestöverlevare (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Incest survivors (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ survivors of incest"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Survivors of incest (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have experienced and survived incest; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que han sufrido y sobrevivido al incesto; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die incest hebben meegemaakt en overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har upplevt och överlevt incest. Följ individens eget språkbruk om de föredrar ”offer” eller ”överlevare”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000885"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000913","dc:identifier":"homoit0000913","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Papuan LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ papúes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Papoea LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Papuanska hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Papuans (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Papuan people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Papuan people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Papuans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas papúes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Papoea's (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are Papuan, or part of the Indigenous peoples of new Guinea; only use for people who identify as Papuan."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son papúes o parte de los pueblos indígenas de Nueva Guinea. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como papúes."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är papuanska eller tillhör något av Nya Guineas ursprungsfolk. Använd endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som papuanska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001943"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001944"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001945"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001946"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001947"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001948"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002927"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003424"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001809"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001810"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPapuans"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001955","dc:identifier":"homoit0001955","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kānaka Maoli LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ kānaka maoli"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kānaka Maoli LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kānaka Maoli (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous Hawaiian LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous Hawaiians (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Kānaka Maoli (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Kānaka Maoli people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Indigenous Hawaiians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Kānaka Maoli"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Kānaka ʻŌiwi"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Native Hawaiians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Native Hawaiian LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Native Hawaiians (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas kānaka maoli LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse Hawaiianen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kānaka Maoli (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kānaka Maoli personen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Inheemse Hawaiianen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Kānaka Maoli"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are part of the Indigenous people of Mokupuni o Hawai‘i, or the Hawaiian Islands; only use to refer to people who identify as Kanaka Maoli."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que pertenecen al pueblo indígena mokupuni o hawai‘i, o a las islas hawaianas. Utilícese únicamente para describir a las personas que se identifiquen como kānaka maoli."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die deel uitmaken van de inheemse bevolking van Mokupuni o Hawai'i of de Hawaiiaanse eilanden; alleen gebruiken om te verwijzen naar mensen die zich identificeren als Kānaka Maoli"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som tillhör det ursprungliga folket på Hawai‘i (Mokupuni o Hawai‘i). Används endast för personer som identifierar sig som Kānaka Maoli."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001956"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001957"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001958"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001959"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001960"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001961"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002924"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003413"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000979"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001968","dc:identifier":"homoit0001968","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas lesbianas indígenas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de ese pueblo. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel verschillende etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio en tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die mensen behouden. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001969","dc:identifier":"homoit0001969","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Indigenous men"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous gays"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres indígenas gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar från ursprungsbefolkningar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män från urfolk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o de un grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de ese pueblo. Utilicé únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; Utilice términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel verschillende etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio en tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die mensen behouden. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001970","dc:identifier":"homoit0001970","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous bisexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse biseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas bisexuales"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual people who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de ese pueblo. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele personen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel verschillende etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio en tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die mensen behouden. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001971","dc:identifier":"homoit0001971","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous transgender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse transgender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas transgénero"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender people who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de esas personas. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel verschillende etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio en tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die mensen behouden. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001972","dc:identifier":"homoit0001972","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous queer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse queer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas queer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o de un grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de ese pueblo. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel verschillende etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio en tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die mensen behouden. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001973","dc:identifier":"homoit0001973","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex indígenas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de ese pueblo. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel verschillende etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio en tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die mensen behouden. Alleen gebruiken om mensen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001942"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001961"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002964"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002922","dc:identifier":"homoit0002922","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas asexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Asexual Indigenous people"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de ese pueblo. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel aparte etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende inwoners van een bepaalde regio, en die tot op zekere hoogte de taal en cultuur van die personen in stand houden. Alleen gebruiken om personen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik waar mogelijk specifiekere termen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002923"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002924"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002925"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002926"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002927"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003232","dc:identifier":"homoit0003232","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Palestinian LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ palestinas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Palestijnse LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Palestinska hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Palestinian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Palestinians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Palestinian people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Palestinians (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palestinos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas palestinas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palestinas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palestinas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palestinos (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Palestijnse personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Palestijnen (LHBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Palestijnse personen (LHBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who were born in, reside in, and/or are descended from those indigenous to the country of Palestine."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que nacieron, residen y/o descienden de los pueblos indígenas del país de Palestina."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die geboren zijn, woonachtig zijn en/of afstammen van personen die inheems zijn in het land Palestina."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är födda i, bor i och/eller har ursprung i Palestina. Använd endast för personer som identifierar sig som både hbtq+ och som har ursprung i Palestina."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002009"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003233"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003234"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003235"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003236"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003237"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003238"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003239"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003240"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003280","dc:identifier":"homoit0003280","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Central American Indigenous LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Indigene LGBTQ+-Personen Zentralamerikas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas LGBTQ+ centroamericanas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Midden-Amerikaanse inheemse LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer från centralamerikanska urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Central American Indigenous people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Central American Native LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Central American Native people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous Central American LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Central American Indigenous people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Central American Native people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zentralamerikanische indigene LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zentralamerikanisch-indigene LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas centroamericanas indígenas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ centroamericanas indígenas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ indígenas centroamericanas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Midden-Amerikaanse inheemse personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Midden-Amerikaanse inheemse personen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer från centralamerikanska ursprungsfolk"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are part of the Native peoples of Central America and self-identify as LGBTQ. Use more specific terms when available."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Menschen, die zu den indigenen Völkern Mittelamerikas gehören und sich selbst als LGBTQ+ identifizieren. Wenn möglich spezifischere Begriffe verwenden"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que forman parte de los pueblos originarios de Centroamérica y se autoidentifican como LGBTQ. Utilice términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die deel uitmaken van de inheemse bevolking van Midden-Amerika en zichzelf identificeren als LHBTQ. Gebruik specifiekere termen wanneer beschikbaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som tillhör Centralamerikas ursprungsfolk och identifierar sig som hbtq+. Använd mer specifika termer när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003281"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003282"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003283"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003284"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003285"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003286"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003287"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003288"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003289"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003290"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003291"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003292"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003293","dc:identifier":"homoit0003293","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South American Indigenous LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ indígenas sudamericanas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Amerikaanse inheemse LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydamerikanska urfolk (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous South American LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ South American Indigenous people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ South American Native people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"South American Indigenous people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"South American Native LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"South American Native people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas sudamericanas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas nativas LGBTQ+sudamericanas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sudamericanas indígenas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sudamericanas nativas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Zuid-Amerikaanse inheemse personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Amerikaanse inheemse personen (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are part of the Native peoples of South America and self-identify as LGBTQ. Use more specific terms when available."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que forman parte de los pueblos indígenas de Sudamérica y se autoidentifican como LGBTQ+. Utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die deel uitmaken van de inheemse bevolking van Zuid-Amerika en zichzelf identificeren als LHBTQ. Gebruik specifiekere termen wanneer beschikbaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som tillhör urfolk i Sydamerika och identifierar sig som hbtq+. Använd mer specifika termer när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003294"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003295"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003296"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003298"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003299"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003300"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003301"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003302"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003303"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003304"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003305"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003974"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003333","dc:identifier":"homoit0003333","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous non-binary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Inheemse non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indigenous nonbinary people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Indigenous people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Indigenous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indígenas no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Indígenas no binarixs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No binarixs indígenas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer från ursprungsbefolkningar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are part of an Indigenous people, or culturally distinct ethnic group whose members are directly descended from the earliest known inhabitants of a particular region and, to some extent, maintain the language and culture of those people. Only use to describe people who identify as Indigenous; use more specific terms whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarixs que forman parte de un pueblo indígena o grupo étnico culturalmente distinto cuyos miembros descienden directamente de los primeros habitantes conocidos de una región en particular y, hasta cierto punto, mantienen el idioma y la cultura de ese pueblo. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifican como indígenas; utilícese términos más específicos siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die deel uitmaken van een inheems volk, of een cultureel onderscheiden etnische groep waarvan de leden rechtstreeks afstammen van de vroegst bekende bewoners van een bepaalde regio en, tot op zekere hoogte, de taal en cultuur van die personen in stand houden. Alleen gebruiken om personen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als inheems; gebruik specifiekere termen waar mogelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som tillhör ett urfolk eller en kulturellt särskiljbar etnisk grupp vars medlemmar härstammar direkt från de tidigast kända invånarna i ett visst område, och som till viss del bevarar språk och kultur. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som urfolk. Använd mer specifika termer om möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004144","dc:identifier":"homoit0004144","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ainu LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"アイヌの LGBTQ+の人々"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Ainu LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ainu (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Ainu people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Ainu people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のアイヌの人々"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who belong to the Ainu, an Indigenous ethnic group that has historically resided in Ainu Mosir, or the land of the Ainu, in what is now known as Japan. Only use to refer to people who self-identify as Ainu."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"現在、日本の北海道、および樺太、千島列島の「アイヌ・モシリ」（アイヌの土地）に古くから居住してきた先住民族であるアイヌに属するLGBTQ+の人々。アイヌとして自己認識している人々にのみ使用する。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LGBTQ+-personen die behoren tot de Ainu, een inheemse etnische groep die van oudsher in Ainu Mosir woonde, oftewel het land van de Ainu, in wat nu Japan heet. De term alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf als Ainu identificeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som tillhör ainufolket, ett urfolk med historisk hemvist i Ainu Mosir, ainufolkets traditionella landområde, i det som nu kallas Japan. Används endast för personer som identifierar sig som ainu."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004145"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004146"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004147"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004148"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004149"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004150"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004151"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004152"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002377","dc:identifier":"homoit0002377","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police harassment of Indigenous LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acoso policial a personas LGBTQ+ indígenas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intimidatie door de politie van inheemse LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polistrakasserier mot hbtq+-personer från urfolk"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Maltrato hacia personas LGBTQ+ indígenas por la policía"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acoso de personas LGBTQ+ indígenas por la policía"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brutalidad policial hacia personas LGBTQ+ indígenas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mala conducta policial hacia personas LGBTQ+ indígenas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maltrato policial contra personas LGBTQ+ indígenas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hostigamiento policial a personas LGBTQ+ indígenas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against Indigenous LGBTQ+ members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de las diversas formas de conducta inapropiada, acciones ilegales o abusos de poder que violentan directa o indirectamente a las personas LGBTQ+ indígenas, incluidas, entre otras, confesiones forzadas, intimidación, arrestos y encarcelamientos falsos, falsificación de pruebas, perjurio policial, manipulación de testigos, brutalidad y corrupción policial, elaboración de caracterizaciones raciales, étnicos y de otro tipo, vigilancia injustificada, registros o incautación de propiedad, soborno o cabildeo para obtener poder o estatus excesivo o para evitar consecuencias, aplicación selectiva de la ley y conducta sexual inapropiada."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elke vorm van ongepast gedrag, illegale acties of machtsmisbruik die direct of indirect schade toebrengt aan inheemse LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Olämpligt uppförande, olagliga handlingar eller maktmissbruk från polis gentemot hbtq+-personer från urfolk. Det kan inkludera rasprofilering, övervakning utan grund, olagliga husrannsakningar och beslag, selektiv rättstillämpning, övervåld, sexuella övergrepp, hot, bevisförfalskning, tvingade erkännanden, felaktiga gripanden eller fängslanden samt mutor eller otillbörlig påverkan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002375"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000886"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002397"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004620"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000924","dc:identifier":"homoit0000924","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ prisoners of conscience"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prisioneros de conciencia LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-gewetensgevangenen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Samvetsfångar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Prisoners of conscience (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ prisoners of conscience"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prisioneros de conciencia (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-samvetsfångar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are incarcerated because of their gender identity or sexuality, or due to conscientiously held beliefs such as opposition to war or human rights violations."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que están encarceladas por su identidad sexual o de género; también puede utilizarse para describir a personas LGBTQ+ encarceladas debido a su raza, religión u opiniones políticas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die gevangen zitten vanwege hun genderidentiteit, seksualiteit of vanwege gewetensbezwaren, zoals verzet tegen oorlog of schendingen van mensenrechten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som fängslats på grund av sin könsidentitet, sexuella läggning eller som en följd av deras ras, religion eller politiska åsikter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000887"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPrisonersOfConscience"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000888","dc:identifier":"homoit0000888","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Internet forums"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Foros de internet LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のインターネット掲示板"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-internetfora"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-internetforum"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ Internet forums"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Internetforum (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Websites that facilitate online conversations between LGBTQ+ people, often about LGBQ+ issues."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sitios web que facilitan conversaciones en línea entre personas LGBTQ+, a menudo sobre temas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々の間で、主にLGBTQ+に関する話題についてオンライン上で交流できるウェブサイト。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Websites die online gesprekken tussen LHBTQ+-personen mogelijk maken, vaak over LHBTQ+-kwesties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Webbplatser som möjliggör samtal online mellan hbtq+-personer, ofta om hbtq+-relaterade frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000946"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000962"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000946"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQInternetForums"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000889","dc:identifier":"homoit0000889","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ intimacy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intimidad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-intimiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intimitet (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ intimacy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intimidad LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feelings of close familiarity or connection between two or more LGBTQ+ people that can be romantic, sexual, or platonic in nature. Can be used to describe the particularities of intimacy as experienced by LGBTQ+ people, as well as the ways intimacy is discussed and expressed within LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sentimientos de estrecha familiaridad o una conexión entre dos o más personas LGBTQ+ que pueden ser de naturaleza romántica, sexual o platónica. Puede utilizarse para describir las particularidades de la intimidad experimentada por las personas LGBTQ+, así como las formas en que se discute y expresa la intimidad dentro de las comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gevoelens van nauwe vertrouwdheid of verbondenheid tussen twee of meer LHBTQ+-personen die romantisch, seksueel of platonisch van aard kunnen zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Känslor av närhet eller samhörighet mellan två eller flera hbtq+-personer, som kan vara romantiska, sexuella eller platoniska. Används för att beskriva hur intimitet upplevs och uttrycks inom hbtq+-gemenskaper."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000889"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQIntimacy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000892","dc:identifier":"homoit0000892","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ literary salons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Salones literarios LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-literaire salons"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära salonger (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ literary salons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Salones literarios LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Social gatherings, typically hosted by a notable public figure, for discussing literature or other shared topics; use in reference to literary salons with primarily LGBTQ+ membership or literary salons focused on works featuring LGBTQ+ characters and themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Reuniones sociales, normalmente organizadas por una figura pública destacada, para discutir literatura u otros temas compartidos; utilícese en referencia a salones literarios con membresía principalmente LGBTQ+ o salones literarios centrados en obras con personajes y temas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sociale bijeenkomsten, meestal georganiseerd door een bekend publiek figuur, voor het bespreken van literatuur of andere gedeelde onderwerpen; gebruik om te verwijzen naar literaire salons met voornamelijk LHBTQ+-lidmaatschap of literaire salons gericht op werken met LHBTQ+-personages en -thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sociala sammankomster, ofta med en offentlig person som värd, för att diskutera litteratur eller andra gemensamma ämnen. Används för litterära salonger med huvudsakligen hbtq+-deltagare eller med fokus på litteratur med hbtq+-karaktärer och teman."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000909"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000972"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000892"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQLiterarySalons"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894","dc:identifier":"homoit0000894","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ love"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amor LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-liefde"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kärlek (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ love"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Love (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amor LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amor (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Strong feelings of affection arising out of kinship, personal ties, or intimate relationships between two or more LGBTQ+ people. Can be used to describe the particularities of love as experienced by LGBTQ+ people in a given culture, as well as the ways love is discussed and expressed within LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fuertes sentimientos de afecto que surgen del parentesco, los vínculos personales o las relaciones íntimas entre dos o más personas LGBTQ+. Puede utilizarse para describir las particularidades del amor experimentado por las personas LGBTQ+ en una cultura determinada, así como las formas en que se discute y expresa el amor dentro de las comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sterke gevoelens van genegenheid die voortkomen uit verwantschap, persoonlijke banden of intieme relaties tussen twee of meer LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Starka känslor av tillgivenhet som uppstår ur släktskap, personliga band eller intima relationer mellan två eller flera hbtq+-personer. Används för att beskriva kärlekens uttryck och betydelse inom hbtq+-gemenskaper."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000921"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000957"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001237"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003826"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQLove"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000921","dc:identifier":"homoit0000921","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ platonic love"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amor platónico LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-platonische liefde"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Platonisk kärlek (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ platonic love"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Queerplatonic"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amor platónico LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Deep feelings of affection between two or more LGBTQ+ people that is neither sexual nor romantic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sentimientos profundos de afecto entre dos o más personas LGBTQ+ que no son ni sexuales ni románticos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Diepe gevoelens van genegenheid, die niet seksueel of romantisch zijn, tussen twee of meer LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Djup känslomässig tillgivenhet mellan två eller flera hbtq+-personer som varken är romantisk eller sexuell."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003592"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQPlatonicLove"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000957","dc:identifier":"homoit0000957","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ unrequited love"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Amor LGBTQ+ no correspondido"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-onbeantwoorde liefde"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Obesvarad kärlek (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ unrequited love"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Attraction to another person that is not reciprocated, by LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atracción hacia otra persona que no es correspondida, por parte de personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aantrekking tot een andere persoon die niet wordt beantwoord, door LGBTQ+-mensen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Obesvarad attraktion riktad mot en annan person, så som den upplevs av hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQUnrequitedLove"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003826","dc:identifier":"homoit0003826","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer desire"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer verlangen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera begär"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Desire that resists definition by defying social norms such as heteronormativity, cisnormativity, and other forms of essentialism, regardless of the individual's identity."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een verlangen dat zich niet laat definiëren, omdat het sociale normen zoals heteronormativiteit, cisnormativiteit en andere vormen van essentialisme tart, ongeacht de identiteit van het individu."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Begär som inte låter sig definieras inom ramarna för heteronormativitet, cisnormativitet och andra essentialistiska normsystem, oavsett individens identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001219"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001205"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000894"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000896","dc:identifier":"homoit0000896","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ magazines"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Revistas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-tijdschriften"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-magasin"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ magazines"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Revistas LGBTQ"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Print or digital publications about LGBTQ+ people and LGBTQ+ issues (typically produced by LGBTQ+ people or LGBTQ+ organizations) that contain articles, photographs, and illustrations, and advertisements."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones impresas o digitales sobre personas LGBTQ+ y temas LGBTQ+ (normalmente producidas por personas LGBTQ+ u organizaciones LGBTQ+) que contienen artículos, fotografías, ilustraciones y anuncios."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukte of digitale publicaties over LHBTQ+-personen en LHBTQ+-kwesties (meestal geproduceerd door LHBTQ+-personen of LHBTQ+-organisaties) die artikelen, foto's, illustraties en advertenties bevatten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckta eller digitala publikationer om hbtq+-personer och hbtq+-frågor (vanligtvis producerade av hbtq+-personer eller hbtq+-organisationer) som innehåller artiklar, bilder, illustrationer och annonser."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001830"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQMagazines"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000899","dc:identifier":"homoit0000899","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ marketing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marketing LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-marketing"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marknadsföring (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ marketing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Marketing LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mercadeo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mercadotecnia LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marketing strategies and campaigns specifically targeting LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Estrategias y campañas de marketing dirigidas específicamente a personas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marknadsföringsstrategier och kampanjer som riktar sig specifikt till hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001117"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002191"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000899"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQMarketing"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002191","dc:identifier":"homoit0002191","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queerbaiting"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Queerbaiting"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queerbaiting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queerbaiting"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer baiting"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Queer baiting"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cebo queer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marketing tactic in which creators of a piece of media purposefully hint at but do not explicitly depict or follow through with queer relationships or queer representation. Queerbaiting is distinct from queer coding in that queer coding is not typically used as a marketing tactic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Táctica de marketing en la que los creadores de una pieza mediática insinúan intencionadamente, pero no representan ni dan seguimiento a relaciones o representaciones queer. El queerbaiting se diferencia de la codificación queer en que la codificación queer no suele utilizarse como táctica de marketing."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Marketingtactiek waarbij mediamakers doelbewust, op niet-expliciete wijze, verwijzen naar queer-relaties of queer-representatie. Queerbaiting verschilt van queercodering doordat queercodering doorgaans niet wordt gebruikt als marketingtactiek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Marknadsföringsstrategi där skapare av media medvetet antyder queera relationer eller representation för att locka en hbtq+-publik, utan att faktiskt visa eller fullfölja dem i innehållet. Queerbaiting skiljer sig från queerkodning, som vanligtvis inte används i marknadsföringssyfte."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000899"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002192"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002191"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001408","dc:identifier":"homoit0001408","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender Day of Remembrance"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Día Internacional de la Memoria Transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender Day of Remembrance"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transgender Day of Remembrance"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"TDOR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"TDoR"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans Day of Remembrance"},{"@language":"es","@value":"TDOR"},{"@language":"es","@value":"TDoR"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Trans Day of Remembrance"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transgender Day of Rememberance"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Día Internacional de la Remembranza Trans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Día Internacional de la Memoria Trans"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"TDoR"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"International day of observance recognized annually on November 20 to honor the memory and lives of trans people who were murdered in the previous 12 months and to draw attention to the continued violence against trans people. Transgender Day of Remembrance (abbreviated TDoR) was founded in 1999 by a small group of trans people, including Gwendolyn Ann Smith, to memorialize Rita Hester, a trans woman murdered in Allston, Massachusetts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Día internacional de conmemoración reconocido anualmente el 20 de noviembre para honrar la memoria y las vidas de las personas trans que fueron asesinadas en los 12 meses anteriores y para concientizar sobre la continua violencia contra las personas trans. El Día de la Memoria Transgénero (TDoR, por sus siglas en inglés) fue fundado en 1999 por un pequeño grupo de personas trans, incluida Gwendolyn Ann Smith, para conmemorar a Rita Hester, una mujer trans asesinada en Allston, Massachusetts."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Internationale dag die jaarlijks op 20 november wordt gehouden ter nagedachtenis van transgenderpersonen die in de afgelopen 12 maanden zijn vermoord en om de aandacht te vestigen op het aanhoudende geweld tegen transgenderpersonen. Transgender Day of Remembrance (afgekort TDoR) werd in 1999 voor het eerst gehouden door een kleine groep, waaronder Gwendolyn Ann Smith, om Rita Hester te herdenken, een transvrouw die werd vermoord in Allston, Massachusetts."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Internationell minnesdag som årligen uppmärksammas den 20 november för att hedra minnet av transpersoner som mördats under de senaste tolv månaderna och för att uppmärksamma det fortsatta våldet mot transpersoner. Transgender Day of Remembrance (TDoR) grundades 1999 av en liten grupp transpersoner, däribland Gwendolyn Ann Smith, för att hedra Rita Hester, en transkvinna som mördades i Allston, Massachusetts, USA."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000901"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2017004815"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000901"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderDayOfRemembrance"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000903","dc:identifier":"homoit0000903","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Multiracial LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ multirraciales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Multiraciale LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Multirasiala hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Multi-racial people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Multiracial people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ mixed-race people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ multi-racial people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ multiracial people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Mixed-race LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Multi-racial LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas multirraciales LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-multiraciale personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen van gemengd ras"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Multi-raciale LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Multi-raciale personen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Multiraciale personen (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who belong to more than one racial group."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que pertenecen a dos o más de un grupos raciales. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como multirraciales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die tot meer dan één raciale groep behoren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som tillhör mer än en rasliga grupp. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som multirasiala."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001101"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001801"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001802"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001803"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001804"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001805"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002903"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002963"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003421"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQMultiRacialPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001801","dc:identifier":"homoit0001801","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Multiracial lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas multirraciales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Multiraciale lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Multirasiala lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Multi-racial lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas multirraciales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Multi-raciale lesbische vrouwen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who belong to two or more racial groups."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que pertenecen a dos 