 son papúes o parte de los pueblos indígenas de Nueva Guinea. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como papúes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen die Papoea zijn, of deel uitmaken van de inheemse volkeren van Nieuw-Guinea; alleen gebruiken voor mensen die zich identificeren als Papoea"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som är papuanska eller tillhör något av Nya Guineas ursprungsfolk. Använd endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som papuanska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000913"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002927","dc:identifier":"homoit0002927","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Papuan asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales papúes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Papoea aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella papuaner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual Papuan people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual Papuans"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas papúes asexuales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who are Papuan, or part of the Indigenous peoples of new Guinea; only use for people who identify as Papuan."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que son papúes o parte de los pueblos indígenas de Nueva Guinea. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como papúes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele mensen die Papoea zijn, of deel uitmaken van de inheemse volkeren van Nieuw-Guinea; alleen gebruiken voor mensen die zich identificeren als Papoea."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som är papuanska eller tillhör något av Nya Guineas ursprungsfolk. Använd endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som papuanska."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000913"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002922"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003424","dc:identifier":"homoit0003424","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Papuan non-binary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias papúes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Papoea non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära papuaner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Papuans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Papuans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Papuan nonbinary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas papúes no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papúes no binarixs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No binarixs papúes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Papoea's"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Papoea nonbinaire personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are Papuan, or part of the Indigenous peoples of new Guinea; only use for people who identify as Papuan."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias que son papúes o parte de los pueblos indígenas de Nueva Guinea. Utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifican como papúes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die Papoea zijn of deel uitmaken van de inheemse bevolking van Nieuw-Guinea; alleen gebruiken voor personen die zich identificeren als Papoea."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som är papuanska eller tillhör något av Nya Guineas ursprungsfolk. Använd endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som papuanska."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000913"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001771","dc:identifier":"homoit0001771","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ chefs"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のシェフ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の料理長"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cocinerxs LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-chefkoks"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kökschefer (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chefs (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"シェフ (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"料理長 (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cocineros (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chefs LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chefs (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cocineros LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are trained, professional cooks, typically holding a leadership role in the kitchen in which they are employed."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の人々で、プロの料理人としての訓練を受け、通常、勤務先の厨房で指導的立場にある人々。"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son cocineros profesionales capacitados y que generalmente desempeñan un papel de liderazgo en la cocina en la que trabajan."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-ers die getrainde, professionele koks zijn, en doorgaans een leidende rol vervullen in de keuken waarin ze werken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är utbildade, professionella kockar och som oftast har en ledande roll i köket där de arbetar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001772"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001773"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001774"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001775"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001776"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001777"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002771"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001717"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001778"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-12-07"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001879","dc:identifier":"homoit0001879","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people with chronic illnesses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ con enfermedades crónicas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met chronische ziekten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer med kronisk sjukdom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chronically ill people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"People with chronic illnesses (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas con enfermedades crónicas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Enfermos crónicos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Enfermos crónicos (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen met chronische ziekten (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kroniskt sjuka hbtq+-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have long-term health conditions that require continued medical attention and/or significantly impact or limit daily life; some but not all people with chronic illnesses consider themselves disabled."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que tienen condiciones de salud a largo plazo que requieren atención médica continua y/o impactan o limitan significativamente la vida diaria; algunas, pero no todas, las personas con enfermedades crónicas se consideran discapacitadas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen met langdurige gezondheidsproblemen die voortdurende medische aandacht vereisen en/of het dagelijks leven aanzienlijk beïnvloeden of beperken; sommige, maar niet alle personen met chronische ziekten beschouwen zichzelf als gehandicapt"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer med långvariga hälsotillstånd som kräver kontinuerlig medicinsk behandling och/eller har en betydande påverkan på eller begränsar det dagliga livet. Vissa, men inte alla, personer med kroniska sjukdomar identifierar sig som personer med funktionsnedsättning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001880"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001881"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001882"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001883"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001884"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002786"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002928"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001854"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001891"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002229"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002577"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002694"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-02-17"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001929","dc:identifier":"homoit0001929","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ athletes"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atletas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のアスリート"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-sportbeoefenaars"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottare (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ sports players"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ sportspeople"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ sportspersons"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Atletas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deportistas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deportistas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deportistas LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jugadores deportivos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+のスポーツ選手"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottskvinnor (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottsmän (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrottspersoner (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Professional or amateur sports players who self-identify as LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Deportistas profesionales o aficionados que se autoidentifican como LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+であると自認するプロまたはアマチュアのスポーツ選手。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Professionele of amateur/recreatieve sporters die zichzelf identificeren als LHBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som ägnar sig åt professionell eller rekreationell idrott."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001930"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001931"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001932"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001933"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001934"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001935"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003443"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004467"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004509"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004531"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004541"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004551"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004571"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004581"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004591"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000949"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000950"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001936"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002181","dc:identifier":"homoit0002181","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ en fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer inom fandom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people in fan communities"},{"@language":"en","@value":"People in fandom (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen in fandom (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The participation and inclusion of LGBTQ+ people in fan communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La participación e inclusión de personas LGBTQ+ en las comunidades de fans."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De participatie en inclusie van LHBTQ+-personen in fan-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personers deltagande och inkludering i fangemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002156"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002145"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002146"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002150"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002170"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002175"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002178"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002185"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002193"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002211"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002174"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002176"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002212"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002213"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002227","dc:identifier":"homoit0002227","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people in recovery groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ en grupos de recuperación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen in herstelgroepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer i stödgrupper"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ people in recovery groups"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people in 12 step programs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"People in recovery groups (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are members of recovery groups, or voluntary associations of people in recovery from use disorders, conditions, or addictions."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son miembros de grupos de recuperación o asociaciones voluntarias de personas en recuperación de trastornos, condiciones o adicciones por consumo. "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die lid zijn van herstelgroepen, of vrijwillige verenigingen van mensen in herstel van gebruik stoornissen, aandoeningen of verslavingen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är medlemmar i stödgrupper, det vill säga frivilliga sammanslutningar av personer som befinner sig i återhämtning från substansbrukssyndrom, skadligt bruk eller beroendeproblematik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001551"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004233"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002228","dc:identifier":"homoit0002228","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people practicing sobriety"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que practican la sobriedad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die nuchterheid praktiseren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nyktra hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ sober people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sober LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sober people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sobriety (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nuchtere LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nuchtere personen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nuchterheid (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people intentionally refraining from substance use (typically drugs or alcohol). Follow the individual's preference for \"sobriety\" or \"recovery\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que se abstienen intencionalmente de consumir sustancias (usualmente drogas o alcohol). Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"sobriedad\" o  \"recuperación\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die bewust afzien van middelengebruik (meestal drugs of alcohol). Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"nuchterheid\" of \"herstel\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som medvetet avstår från att använda substanser (vanligtvis alkohol eller droger). Följ individens eget språkbruk om de föredrar ”nykterhet” eller ”återhämtning”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001551"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004231"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002277","dc:identifier":"homoit0002277","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sapphics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sáficas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sapphisten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sapfister"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sapphists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sáficas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women and, in some definitions, non-binary people of any sexual identity or sexuality who are attracted to women. Some but not all sapphics use the term \"sapphic\" to describe their sexual identity or sexuality. Only use to describe individuals who self-identify as sapphic."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres y, en algunas definiciones, personas no binarias de cualquier identidad sexual o sexualidad que se sientan atraídas por mujeres. Algunas pero no todas las personas sáficas utilizan el término \"sáfica\" para describir su identidad sexual o sexualidad. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se identifican como sáficas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwen en, in sommige definities, niet-binaire personen van welke seksuele identiteit of seksualiteit dan ook die zich aangetrokken voelen tot vrouwen. Sommige maar niet alle sapphisten gebruiken de term \"sapphisch\" om hun seksuele identiteit of seksualiteit te beschrijven. Alleen gebruiken om personen te beschrijven die zichzelf identificeren als sapphisch."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnor och, i vissa definitioner, ickebinära personer oavsett sexuell identitet eller läggning som är attraherade av kvinnor. Vissa, men inte alla, använder termen ”sapfisk” för att beskriva sin identitet. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som sapfiska."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002276"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85117455"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002279","dc:identifier":"homoit0002279","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"WLW (Women Loving Women)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"WLW (Mujeres que aman mujeres)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"WLW (Vrouwen die vrouwen liefhebben)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"WLW (Women Loving Women)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Woman loving woman"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Women loving women"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres amando mujeres"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres amando a mujeres"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Women loving women"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Woman loving woman"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Women Loving Women"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"WLW"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Slang term used to describe women who have romantic and/or sexual relationships with other women. Can be used to describe women who are exclusively or primarily interested in women, as well as women who are also interested in people of other or all genders. Only use to describe people who self-identify as WLW."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término de la jerga utilizado para describir a mujeres que tienen relaciones románticas y/o sexuales con otras mujeres; del ingles \"Women Loving Women\". Puede utilizarse para describir a mujeres que están exclusiva o principalmente interesadas en mujeres, así como a mujeres que también están interesadas en personas de otros o todos los géneros. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se identifiquen como WLW."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Jargonterm die wordt gebruikt om vrouwen te beschrijven die romantische en/of seksuele relaties hebben met andere vrouwen. Kan worden gebruikt om vrouwen te beschrijven die uitsluitend of voornamelijk geïnteresseerd zijn in vrouwen, evenals vrouwen die ook geïnteresseerd zijn in personen van andere of alle genders. Alleen gebruiken om personen te beschrijven die zichzelf identificeren als WLW."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Amerikansk slangterm som används för att beskriva kvinnor som har romantiska och/eller sexuella relationer med andra kvinnor. Kan användas för kvinnor som uteslutande eller främst är intresserade av kvinnor, såväl som kvinnor som även är intresserade av personer av andra eller alla kön. Bör endast användas för personer som själva identifierar sig som WLW."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001297"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001254"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003613"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002336","dc:identifier":"homoit0002336","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Adopted LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ adoptadas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Adoptierte LGBTQ+ Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geadopteerde LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adopterade hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Adopted people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ adopted people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas adoptadas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Adoptierte Personen (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+ adoptiere Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-geadopteerde personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adopterade (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who were adopted, whether or not by LGBTQ+ parents."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que fueron adoptadas, ya sea o no por padres LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+ Menschen, die adoptiert wurden, ob von LGBTQ+ Eltern oder nicht."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die zijn geadopteerd, al dan niet door LHBTQ+-ouders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som blivit adopterade, oavsett om de blivit adopterade av hbtq+-föräldrar eller inte."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002349","dc:identifier":"homoit0002349","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ siblings"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hermanos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-broers en zusters"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Syskon (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Siblings (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hermanos (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have siblings."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que tienen hermanos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die broers en zusters hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har syskon."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001310"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002623"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003247","dc:identifier":"homoit0003247","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ teachers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Docentes LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-leraren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lärare (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Teachers (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Profesores (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Profesoras LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Profesoras (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Docentes (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-lärare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Teachers who self-identify as LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Docentes o profesores que se autoidentifican como LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Leraren die zichzelf identificeren als LHBTQ+."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lärare som identifierar sig som hbtq+-personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003248"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003249"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003250"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003251"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003252"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003253"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003254"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003255"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003257"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003258"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003259"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003260"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003256"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003261"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003618"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2020010506"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003263","dc:identifier":"homoit0003263","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ academics"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の研究者"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Académicos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-academici"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-akademiker"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Academics (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ college teachers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ professors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ researchers"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"研究者（LGBTQ）"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+の大学教員"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Académicos (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Profesores de universidad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Investigadores LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Académicas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Académicas (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Profesoras de universidad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Investigadoras LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-onderzoekers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-professoren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-universiteitsdocenten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Akademiker (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ researchers and/or educators working in higher education."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"高等教育機関で働くLGBTQ+の研究者、教育者。"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Investigadores y/o educadores LGBTQ+ que trabajan en la enseñanza superior."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-onderzoekers en/of docenten die werkzaam zijn in het hoger onderwijs."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som arbetar som forskare och/eller lärare verksamma inom högre utbildning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003264"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003265"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003266"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003268"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003269"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003270"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003271"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003272"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003273"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003274"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003275"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003276"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003370","dc:identifier":"homoit0003370","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Rural LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ rurales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen in landelijke gebieden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer på landsbygden"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Rural LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rural people (LGBTQ+)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas rurales LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas rurales (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas (LGBTQ) rurales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen op het platteland"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ-personen in landelijke gebieden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer i glesbygden"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are currently living in or consider themselves to be from agricultural or forested areas with low population densities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que viven o se consideran originarias de zonas agrícolas o forestales con baja densidad de población."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die momenteel in landbouw- of bosgebieden met een lage bevolkingsdichtheid wonen of zichzelf hiertoe rekenen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som bor på landsbygden eller glesbygd, eller har anknytning till landsbygd eller glesbygd."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003371"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003372"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003373"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003374"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003375"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003376"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003377"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003379"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003380"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003533","dc:identifier":"homoit0003533","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ students"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-leerlingen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elever (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Students (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-elever"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Studenter (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are formally engaged in learning at an educational institution of some kind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die formeel een opleiding volgen aan een onderwijsinstelling."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som formellt deltar i lärande vid någon form av institution för utbildning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003041"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003534"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003535"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003536"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003537"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003538"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003539"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003540"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003541"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003542"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003543"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003544"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003545"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003561"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003574"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003587"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003546"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000951"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-09-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003637","dc:identifier":"homoit0003637","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ scientists"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-wetenschappers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Naturvetare (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Scientists (LGBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vetenskapare (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who either study or have expert knowledge in one of the fields of the physical and/or natural sciences, including but not limited to chemists, biologists, physicists, psychologists, and multidisciplinary researchers."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die een studie volgen of deskundige kennis hebben op één van de gebieden van de natuurwetenschappen, waaronder maar niet beperkt tot scheikundigen, biologen, natuurkundigen, psychologen en multidisciplinaire onderzoekers."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som studerar eller har expertkunskap inom naturvetenskapliga discipliner, inklusive men inte begränsat till kemi, biologi, fysik, psykologi och tvärvetenskaplig forskning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003638"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003639"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003640"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003641"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003642"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003643"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003644"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003645"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003647"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003648"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003649"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003650"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003646"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003677","dc:identifier":"homoit0003677","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ television personalities"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-televisiepersoonlijkheden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tv-profiler (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Television personalities (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ TV personalities"},{"@language":"en","@value":"TV personalities (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Televisiepersoonlijkheden (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"TV-persoonlijkheden (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are well-known to the public through their appearances on television shows, typically as themselves rather than in scripted roles."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die bij het grote publiek bekend zijn door hun optredens in televisieprogramma's, meestal als zichzelf en niet in een voorgeschreven rol."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är kända för allmänheten genom sina framträdanden i tv-program, vanligtvis som sig själva snarare än i manusbaserade roller."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003895"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003678"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003679"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003680"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003681"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003682"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003683"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003684"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003685"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003687"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003688"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003689"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003690"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003686"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003696","dc:identifier":"homoit0003696","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ philanthropists"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-filantropen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Filantroper (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Philanthropists (LGBTQ)"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who seek to improve the welfare of others, especially by the donation of money or resources to charitable causes."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die het welzijn van anderen willen verbeteren, vooral door geld of middelen te doneren aan goede doelen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som verkar för att förbättra andras välfärd, särskilt genom donationer av pengar eller resurser till välgörande ändamål."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003695"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003697","dc:identifier":"homoit0003697","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ punks"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-punkers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Punkare (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Punks (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Punkers (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Punks (LHBTQ+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people involved in the punk community, which originated in the 1970s with punk rock music and is now associated with various music subgenres, fashions, and ideologies."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die betrokken zijn bij de punkgemeenschap, die in de jaren 70 ontstond met punkrockmuziek en nu geassocieerd wordt met verschillende muzieksubgenres, modes en ideologieën."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är en del av punkgemenskapen, som uppstod på 1970-talet med punkrocken och i dag är kopplad till olika musikgenrer, stilar och ideologier."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003698"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003739","dc:identifier":"homoit0003739","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Uranic people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Uranische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uraniska personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Androsexual people"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uranic people"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are attracted to all genders except women, femmes, and feminine-aligned non-binary people, regardless of what gender they were assigned at birth."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zich aangetrokken voelen tot alle genders, behalve vrouwen, femmes en vrouwelijk georiënteerde non-binaire personen, ongeacht het gender dat ze bij hun geboorte hebben gekregen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som är attraherade av alla kön utom kvinnor, feminina personer och femininorienterade ickebinära personer, oavsett vilket kön de tilldelades vid födseln."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003740","dc:identifier":"homoit0003740","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Neptunic people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Neptunische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Neptuniska personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gynesexual people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gynosexual people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gynoseksuele personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are attracted to all genders except men, mascs, and masculine-aligned non-binary people, regardless of what gender they were assigned at birth. "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zich aangetrokken voelen tot alle genders, behalve mannen, masculiene personen en masculiene non-binaire personen, ongeacht welk gender ze bij hun geboorte hebben gekregen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som attraheras av alla kön utom män, maskulina personer och maskulint kodade ickebinära, oavsett vilket kön de tilldelats vid födseln."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003741","dc:identifier":"homoit0003741","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Saturnic people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Saturnische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Saturniska personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Skoliosexual people"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who are solely attracted to androgynous non-binary people, rather than monogender-aligned people, regardless of what gender they were assigned at birth."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die zich uitsluitend aangetrokken voelen tot androgyne, non-binaire personen, in plaats van tot monogender personen, ongeacht welk gender ze bij de geboorte hebben gekregen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som enbart är attraherade av androgyna ickebinära personer, snarare än av personer som är tydligt könskodade som man eller kvinna."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003895","dc:identifier":"homoit0003895","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ celebrities"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ の著名人"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-beroemdheden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-kändisar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Celebrities (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ celebs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Celebs (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ famous people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Famous LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Famous people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"著名人 (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ のセレブ"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"セレブ (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ の有名人"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"有名人 (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Beroemdheden (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kändisar (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kända personer (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who have achieved fame and broad public recognition due to the attention given to them by mass media."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"マスメディアの注目を浴び、名声と広く一般に認知されるようになったLGBTQ+の人々。"},{"@languag