-clinic abortion (also known as a surgical abortion) and medication abortion (also referred to as the abortion pill)."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"クリニックでの中絶（外科的中絶とも呼ばれる）および薬物中絶（中絶薬とも呼ばれる）を含む中絶サービスを求めるLGBTQ+の方々。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die een abortus willen ondergaan, zowel in een kliniek als met behulp van medicijnen (ook wel de abortuspil genoemd)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som vill göra abort, inklusive kirurgiska aborter och medicinska aborter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003366"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003361"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003368"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003365"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004486"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh92002018"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004431","dc:identifier":"homoit0004431","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ police officers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-politieagenten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Poliser (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ cops"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är poliser"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are members of a police force."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+ personen die lid zijn van een politiekorps."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är poliser."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004432"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004433"},{"@id":"