"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary science fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ciencia ficción no binaria"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nichtbinäre Science-Fiction"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär science fiction"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary science fiction"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nicht-binäre Science-Fiction"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Non-binäre Science-Fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär sci fi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär sf"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts imaginative or futuristic concepts incorporating science, technology, space, time travel, and other speculative elements. Use for science fiction focusing on non-binary characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre conceptos imaginativos o futuristas que incorporan la ciencia, la tecnología, el espacio, los viajes en el tiempo y otros elementos especulativos; utilícese en referencia a la ciencia ficción que se centra en personajes o temas no binarios."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Werk über phantasievolle oder futuristische Konzepte, die Wissenschaft, Technologie, Raumfahrt, Zeitreisen und andere spekulative Elemente beinhalten; Verwendung in Bezug auf Science Fiction mit einem Schwerpunkt auf nichtbinären Charakteren oder Themen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literair werk over imaginaire of futuristische concepten waarin wetenschap, technologie, ruimte, tijdreizen en andere speculatieve elementen zijn verwerkt; gebruik om te verwijzen naar science fiction die zich richt op non-binaire personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk om imaginära eller futuristiska koncept som involverar vetenskap, teknologi, rymden, tidsresor och andra spekulativa element. Används för science fiction med ickebinära karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000934"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002565"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002177","dc:identifier":"homoit0002177","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kirk/Spock"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Kirk/Spock"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kirk/Spock"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kirk/Spock"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kirk/Spock"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"K/S"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Spirk"},{"@language":"es","@value":"K/S"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Spirk"},{"@language":"de","@value":"K/S"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Spirk"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Spirk"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The homoerotic fan pairing of Kirk and Spock from Star Trek: The Original Series. The Kirk/Spock fandom originated much of the terminology and practices associated with fandom today--for example, the word \"slash\" comes from the forward slash in Kirk/Spock."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El emparejamiento homoerótico por fans de Kirk y Spock de \"Star Trek: The Original Series\". El fandom de Kirk/Spock originó gran parte de la terminología y las prácticas asociadas con el fandom actual; por ejemplo, la palabra \"slash\" proviene de la barra diagonal en Kirk/Spock."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Der homoerotische Fan-Pairing zwischen Kirk und Spock aus der Fernsehserie Raumschiff Enterprise (im Englischen: Star Trek: The Original Series). Der Großteil der Begriffe und Gepflogenheiten der modernen Fandom-Kultur hat seinen Ursprung mit dem Kirk/Spock-Fandom; zum Beispiel, das englische Wort „slash\" (bzw. das Fanfiction-Genre) stammt aus dem Schrägstrich in Kirk/Spock."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het homo-erotische fan-koppel Kirk en Spock uit Star Trek: The Original Series. De Kirk/Spock-fandom is veelal ontstaan uit de terminologie en praktijk die tegenwoordig met fandom wordt geassocieerd - het woord \"slash\" komt bijvoorbeeld van de schuine streep in Kirk/Spock"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den homoerotiska fanskapade parrelationen mellan Kirk och Spock från Star Trek: The Original Series. Kirk/Spock-fandomen gav upphov till mycket av den terminologi och de praktiker som präglar fandom i dag. Till exempel kommer ordet ”slash” från snedstrecket i beteckningen Kirk/Spock."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002198"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000934"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001806"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002187"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002637","dc:identifier":"homoit0002637","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Māhū science fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ciencia ficción māhū"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Māhū science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Māhū-science fiction"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mahu science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Māhū-sci fi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Māhū-sf"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts imaginative or futuristic concepts incorporating science, technology, space, time travel, and other speculative elements. Use for science fiction focusing on Māhū characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas sobre conceptos imaginativos o futuristas que incorporan la ciencia, la tecnología, el espacio, los viajes en el tiempo y otros elementos especulativos; utilícese en referencia a la ciencia ficción centrada en personajes o temas māhū."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literair werk over fantasierijke of futuristische concepten waarin wetenschap, technologie, ruimte, tijdreizen en andere speculatieve elementen zijn verwerkt; gebruik in verwijzing naar science fiction gericht op Mahu personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk om imaginära eller futuristiska koncept som involverar vetenskap, teknologi, rymden, tidsresor och andra spekulativa element. Används för science fiction med māhū-karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002632"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000934"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002632"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002647","dc:identifier":"homoit0002647","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit science fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ciencia ficción dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-science fiction"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S science fiction"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit science fiction"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited science fiction"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited science fiction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-sci fi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-sf"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that depicts imaginative or futuristic concepts incorporating science, technology, space, time travel, and other speculative elements. Use for science fiction focusing on Two-Spirit characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obra literaria escrita sobre conceptos imaginativos o futuristas que incorporan la ciencia, la tecnología, el espacio, los viajes en el tiempo y otros elementos especulativos; utilícese en referencia a la ciencia ficción que se centra en personajes o temas dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literair werk over fantasierijke of futuristische concepten waarin wetenschap, technologie, ruimte, tijdreizen en andere speculatieve elementen zijn verwerkt; gebruik in verwijzing naar science fiction gericht op Two-Spirit personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk om imaginära eller futuristiska koncept som involverar vetenskap, teknologi, rymden, tidsresor och andra spekulativa element. Används för science fiction med Two-spirit-personer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001751"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000934"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002710"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-26"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000941","dc:identifier":"homoit0000941","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ single fathers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres solteros LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-alleenstaande vaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ensamstående pappor (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ single fathers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás solteros LGBTQ"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ensamstående fäder (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are fathers but are not married or part of a long-term partnership."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son padres pero no están casados ni en una relación a largo plazo."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är pappor men som inte är gifta eller lever i en långvarig parrelation."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000944"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSingleFathers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000944","dc:identifier":"homoit0000944","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ single parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres y padres solteros LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-alleenstaande ouders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ensamstående föräldrar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ single parents"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres solteros LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres solteras LGBTQ+"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are parents but are not married or part of a long-term partnership."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son padres y/o madres pero no están casadas ni en una relación a largo plazo."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är föräldrar men som inte är gifta eller lever i en långvarig parrelation."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001075"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001312"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000941"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000942"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSingleParents"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000942","dc:identifier":"homoit0000942","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ single mothers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres solteras LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-alleenstaande moeders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ensamstående mammor (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ single mothers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres solteras LGBTQ"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mamás solteras LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ensamstående mödrar (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are mothers but are not married or part of a long-term partnership."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que son madres pero no están casadas ni en una relación a largo plazo."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är mödrar men som inte är gifta eller lever i en långvarig parrelation."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000944"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001021"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000420"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSingleMothers"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000943","dc:identifier":"homoit0000943","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ single-parent families"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias monoparentales LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-eenoudergezinnen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjer med ensamstående föräldrar (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Single-parent families (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Single parent families (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ single parent families"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Families headed by a single parent; use in reference to single parent families headed by or including LGBTQ+ people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Familias encabezadas por un solo progenitor; utilícese en referencia a familias monoparentales encabezadas por personas LGBTQ+ o que las incluyan."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gezinnen met een alleenstaande ouder aan het hoofd. Gebruik deze term in relatie tot eenoudergezinnen met LHBTQ+-personen aan het hoofd of met LHBTQ+-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Familjer med en ensam förälder. Används för familjer där en hbtq+-person är ensam förälder."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000943"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSingleParentFamilies"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000960","dc:identifier":"homoit0000960","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ visibility"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Visibilidad LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-zichtbaarheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Synlighet (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Visibility of LGBTQ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ visibility"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Visibility of LGBTQ+ people in society, meaning the extent to which LGBTQ+ people and identities are recognized by the general public."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Visibilidad de las personas LGBTQ+ en la sociedad, es decir, el grado en que las personas e identidades LGBTQ+ son reconocidas por el público en general."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zichtbaarheid van LHBTQ+-ers in de samenleving"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personers synlighet i samhället. Syftar på i vilken grad hbtq+-personer och identiteter erkänns och uppmärksammas offentligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQVisibility"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001273","dc:identifier":"homoit0001273","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex scandals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Escándalos sexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksschandalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexskandaler"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual scandals"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Escándalos de sexo"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public scandals surrounding sensational cases of sexual indecency or sex crimes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Escándalos públicos en torno a casos sensacionales de indecencia sexual o delitos sexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"schandaal over een verondersteld of echt aspect van iemands seksualiteit, eventueel uit het verleden; om tot schandaal uit te groeien moet het gewraakte gedrag als normoverschrijdend worden beschouwd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Allmänna skandaler kring uppmärksammade fall av upplevd sexuell oanständighet eller sexualbrott."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007003459"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001273"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexScandals"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001301","dc:identifier":"homoit0001301","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual reform"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Reforma sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele hervorming"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexualreform"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used to describe the European movements for sexual reform in the 20th century."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir los movimientos europeos por la reforma sexual en el siglo XX."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gebruik met betrekking tot Europese bewegingen voor seksuele hervorming in de 20e eeuw"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används för att beskriva de europeiska sexualreformrörelserna under 1900-talet."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001301"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualReform"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001303","dc:identifier":"homoit0001303","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual revolution"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Revolución sexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele revolutie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuell revolution"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuella frigörelsen"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Social perspective from the 1960s into the 1970s that challenged traditional codes of behavior related to sexuality and interpersonal relationships throughout the Western world."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Perspectiva social desde la década de 1960 hasta la de 1970 que desafió los códigos tradicionales de comportamiento relacionados con la sexualidad y las relaciones interpersonales en todo el mundo occidental."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sociaal perspectief van de jaren zestig tot de jaren zeventig dat traditionele gedragscodes met betrekking tot seksualiteit en interpersoonlijke relaties in de hele westerse wereld uitdaagde."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett samhällsperspektiv från 1960-talet till 1970-talet som utmanade traditionella normer kring sexualitet och mellanmänskliga relationer i västvärlden."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000947"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001303"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexualRevolution"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000953","dc:identifier":"homoit0000953","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ support groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de apoyo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-zelfhulpgroepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stödgrupper (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ support groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de apoyo LGBTQ"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Självhjälpsgrupper (hbtq+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Basgrupper (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Groups of LGBTQ+ people meeting to offer encouragement, comfort, and advice to one another, typically relating to common experiences and issues related to being LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de personas LGBTQ+ que se reúnen para ofrecerse aliento, consuelo y consejos, generalmente en relación con experiencias y asuntos comunes relacionados con ser LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Groepen LHBTQ+-personen die elkaar ontmoeten om elkaar aan te moedigen, te troosten en advies te geven, meestal met betrekking tot gemeenschappelijke ervaringen en problemen die verband houden met LHBTQ+ zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Grupper av hbtq+-personer som möts för att ge varandra stöd, tröst och råd, ofta utifrån gemensamma erfarenheter kopplade till att vara hbtq+."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001012"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001551"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQSupportGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001551","dc:identifier":"homoit0001551","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+-affirming recovery groups"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de recuperación que afirman las identidades LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-herstelgroepen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-inkluderande stödgrupper"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"12 step programs (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Recovery groups (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Step work (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+-affirming 12 step programs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+-affirming step work"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Programas de 12 pasos (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de recuperación (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Programas que afirman las identidades LGBTQ+ de 12 pasos"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Recovery groups, or voluntary associations of people in recovery from use disorders, conditions, or addictions, that are accepting and supportive of LGBTQ+ people and their identities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Grupos de recuperación, o asociaciones voluntarias de personas en recuperación de trastornos por consumo, condiciones o adicciones, que aceptan y apoyan a las personas LGBTQ+ y sus identidades."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Herstelgroepen, of vrijwillige organisaties van personen in herstel van gebruiksstoornissen, aandoeningen of verslavingen, die LHBTQ+-personen en hun identiteiten accepteren en ondersteunen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stödgrupper, det vill säga frivilliga sammanslutningar av personer i återhämtning från substansbrukssyndrom, skadligt bruk eller beroendeproblematik, som är inkluderande och bekräftande av hbtq+-personer och deras identiteter."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001012"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000953"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002227"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002228"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000614"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQRecoveryGroups"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001116","dc:identifier":"homoit0001116","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pink triangles"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Triángulos rosas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Roze driehoeken"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rosa trianglar"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Triángulos rosados"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"International symbol of gay pride and the gay rights movement that symbolizes the reclamation of the pink triangles used in Nazi Germany to identify gay men (and, later, bisexual men and transgender women) who were sent to concentration camps."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Símbolo internacional del orgullo gay y del movimiento por los derechos gay que simboliza la reclamación de los triángulos rosas utilizados en la Alemania nazi para identificar a los hombres gay (y, eventualmente, a los hombres bisexuales y las mujeres transgénero) que fueron enviados a campos de concentración."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Internationaal symbool van gay pride en de homobeweging; gebruikt in nazi-Duitsland om mannelijke gevangenen te identificeren die vanwege hun homoseksualiteit naar concentratiekampen werden gestuurd; in latere jaren omvatte deze categorie gevangenen ook biseksuele mannen en transgender vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Internationell symbol för gaystolthet och gayrörelsen. Symboliserar återtagandet av de rosa trianglar som användes i Nazityskland för att identifiera bögar (och senare även bisexuella män och transkvinnor) som skickades till koncentrationsläger."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000954"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000954"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/pinkTriangles"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003246","dc:identifier":"homoit0003246","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ pride flags"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Banderas del orgullo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-pridevlaggen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Prideflaggor (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pride flags"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Banderas del orgullo"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flaggor (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Flags that represent sexual identities, gender identities, and romantic orientations that fall under the LGBTQ+ umbrella, as well as flags representing LGBTQ+ subcultures and communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Banderas que representan identidades sexuales, identidades de género y orientaciones románticas que entran dentro del ámbito LGBTQ+, así como banderas que representan subculturas y comunidades LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vlaggen die seksuele identiteiten, genderidentiteiten en romantische oriëntaties representeren die onder de LHBTQ+-paraplu vallen, evenals vlaggen die LHBTQ+-subculturen en gemeenschappen representeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flaggor som representerar könsidentiteter, sexuella läggningar och romantiska orienteringar inom hbtq+-spektrumet, samt flaggor för olika subkulturer och grupper inom hbtq+-gemenskapen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000954"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001232"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2023001832"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000954"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003262","dc:identifier":"homoit0003262","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ sex tourism"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Turismo sexual LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-sekstoerisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexturism (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex tourism (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Turismo sexual (LGBTQ)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The practice of traveling with the intention of soliciting sex work, typically to allow LGBTQ+ or curious people to explore sexual encounters that are illegal or stigmatized in their home countries. Sex tourism often presents ethical concerns, such as the economic gap between tourists and residents, differences in age of consent laws globally, and the selective enforcement of anti-sex work laws by police."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La práctica de viajar con la intención de solicitar trabajo sexual, normalmente para permitir a personas LGBTQ+ o curiosas explorar encuentros sexuales que son ilegales o están estigmatizados en sus países de origen. El turismo sexual suele plantear problemas éticos, como la brecha económica entre turistas y residentes, las diferencias en las leyes sobre la edad de consentimiento en todo el mundo y la aplicación selectiva de las leyes contra el trabajo sexual por parte de la policía."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De praktijk van reizen met de intentie om sekswerk aan te bieden, meestal om LHBTQ+ of nieuwsgierige personen seksuele activiteiten te laten uitvoeren die illegaal of gestigmatiseerd zijn in hun thuisland. Sekstoerisme brengt vaak ethische problemen met zich mee, zoals de economische kloof tussen toeristen en inwoners, verschillen in wetten over meerderjarigheid en de selectieve handhaving van anti-sekswerkwetten door de politie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Praktiken att resa med avsikten att köpa sexuella handlingar, ofta för att hbtq+-personer eller personer som utforskar sin sexualitet ska kunna ha sexuella möten som är olagliga eller stigmatiserade i deras hemländer. Sexturism väcker ofta etiska frågor, såsom ekonomiska ojämlikheter mellan turister och lokalbefolkning, skillnader i lagstiftning kring samtyckesålder globalt samt selektiv tillämpning av lagar mot sexarbete från polisens sida."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001275"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001277"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003279","dc:identifier":"homoit0003279","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ travel guides"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Guías de viaje LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-reisgidsen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Reseguider (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Guide books (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ guide books"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ travel guide books"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Travel guide books (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Travel guides (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Guías de turismo LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Libros guías LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Libros de viaje LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Guías de viaje (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-reseguider"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Books or other resources of information about places designed for the use of LGBTQ+ visitors or tourists, typically to direct travelers to establishments or attractions that are owned by, open to, or frequented by LGBTQ+ people. LGBTQ+ travel guides may also direct travelers to safe houses or businesses in places where LGBTQ+ people are otherwise unsafe or criminalized, as well as locations commonly used for cruising, or picking up casual sex partners."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Libros u otros recursos de información sobre lugares diseñados para el uso de visitantes o turistas LGBTQ+, normalmente para dirigir a los viajeros a establecimientos o atracciones que son propiedad de, están abiertos a o son frecuentados por personas LGBTQ+. Las guías de viaje LGBTQ+ también pueden dirigir a los viajeros a lugares seguros o negocios en lugares donde las personas LGBTQ+ no están seguras o están criminalizadas, así como a lugares utilizados habitualmente para el cruising o para buscar parejas sexuales ocasionales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Boeken of andere informatiebronnen over plaatsen voor LHBTQ+-bezoekers of toeristen, doorgaans om reizigers te verwijzen naar etablissementen of attracties die eigendom zijn van, openstaan ​​voor of worden bezocht door LHBTQ+-personen. LHBTQ+-reisgidsen kunnen reizigers ook verwijzen naar safe houses of bedrijven op plaatsen waar LHBTQ+-personen onveilig of gecriminaliseerd zijn, evenals locaties die gewoonlijk worden gebruikt om te cruisen of om casual sekspartners op te pikken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Böcker eller andra informationskällor om platser som är utformade för hbtq+-besökare, ofta för att vägleda resenärer till verksamheter eller sevärdheter som ägs av, är öppna för eller ofta besöks av hbtq+-personer. Hbtq+-reseguider kan även inkludera tips om trygga platser eller företag i områden där hbtq+-personer annars riskerar utsatthet, samt platser som är kända för cruising."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003911"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000956"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001222","dc:identifier":"homoit0001222","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer victims of rape"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas queer de violación"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes queers victimes de viol"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer slachtoffers van verkrachting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera våldtäktsoffer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who have experienced rape and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que han sufrido una violación y pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes queers qui ont été victimes de viol et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die verkrachting hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som har upplevt våldtäkt och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000958"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001212"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerVictimsOfRape"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001457","dc:identifier":"homoit0001457","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender victims of rape"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas transgénero de violación"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes trans victimes de viol"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender slachtoffers van verkrachting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som är våldtäktsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas trans de violación"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender people who have experienced rape and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero que han sufrido una violación y pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes trans qui ont été victimes de viol et qui peuvent ou non avoir survécu; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes « victimes » ou « survivantes » dans la mesure du possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen die verkrachting hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som har utsatts för våldtäkt och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000958"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001449"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderVictimsOfRape"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002855","dc:identifier":"homoit0002855","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual victims of rape"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas asexuales de violación"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Vergewaltigungsopfer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele slachtoffers van verkrachting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella våldtäktsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Vergewaltigungsopfer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Opfer von Vergewaltigungen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who have experienced rape and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que han sufrido una violación y pueden haber sobrevivido o no; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Personen, die Vergewaltigungen erlebt und überlebt haben oder nicht; wenn möglich die Präferenz der Person für „Opfer“ oder „Überlebende“ beachten."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die verkrachting hebben meegemaakt en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som har upplevt våldtäkt och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000958"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002733","dc:identifier":"homoit0002733","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit victims of rape"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas dos espíritus de violación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit slachtoffers van verkrachting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som är våldtäktsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S victims of rape"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit victims of rape"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited victims of rape"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited victims of rape"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who have experienced rape and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas dos espíritus que han sufrido una violación y pueden haber sobrevivido o no; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people die verkrachting hebben meegemaakt en misschien wel of niet hebben overleefd. Volg de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\" waar mogelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som har utsatts för våldtäkt och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003748"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000958"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001223","dc:identifier":"homoit0001223","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer victims of sexual abuse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas queer de abuso sexual"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes queers victimes d'abus sexuels"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer slachtoffers van seksueel misbruik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera offer för sexuella övergrepp"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes queers victimes de violences sexuelles"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes queers victimes d'agressions sexuelles"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som utsatts för sexuella övergrepp"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who have experienced sexual abuse and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que han sufrido abuso sexual y pueden o no haber sobrevivido; siga la