ekkingen te beschrijven waarbij beide partners aseksueel."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vigselcermonier och därtill hörande festligheter. Används för bröllop där båda parter är asexuella."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000963"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004373"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004372"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000963"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004341","dc:identifier":"homoit0004341","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit weddings"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit huwelijksvoltrekkingen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-bröllop"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit weddings"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited weddings"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited weddings"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S weddings"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Marriage ceremonies and the accompanying festivities; use to describe weddings in which both partners are Two-Spirit."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Huwelijksceremonies en de bijbehorende festiviteiten; gebruik om bruiloften te beschrijven waarbij beide partners Two-Spirit zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vigselcermonier och därtill hörande festligheter. Används för bröllop där båda parter är two-spirit-personer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000963"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004368"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004369"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004341"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004262","dc:identifier":"homoit0004262","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Social work with LGBTQ+ youth"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Maatschappelijk werk met LHBTQ+-jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Socialt arbete med unga hbtq+-personer"},{"@language":"en","@value":"eng"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ youth social work"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Social work for LGBTQ+ youth"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Maatschappelijk werk voor LHBTQ+-jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Socialt arbete med hbtq+-ungdomar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Work carried out between trained professionals and LGBTQ+ youth,  involving providing affirming, supportive, and culturally competent services to address their unique needs and experiences. This includes supporting their emotional, mental, and physical well-being, as well as advocating for their rights and needs within various systems, including schools, families, and communities. "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Werk uitgevoerd door getrainde professionals en LHBTQ+-jongeren, waarbij bevestigende, ondersteunende en cultureel competente diensten aangeboden wordt, dat aansluit bij hun unieke behoeften en ervaringen. Dit omvat het ondersteunen van hun emotionele, mentale en fysieke welzijn, en het opkomen voor hun rechten en behoeften binnen verschillende systemen, waaronder scholen, gezinnen en gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arbete där utbildade yrkesverksamma personer strävar efter att tillgodose hbtq+-ungdomars unika behov och upplevelser, till exempel genom bekräftande, stödjande och hbtq+-kulturellt kompetenta insatser. Detta inkluderar att stödja deras känslomässiga, psykiska och fysiska välbefinnande, samt att förespråka deras rättigheter och behov inom olika system, som skolor, familjer och gemenskaper."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000964"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003460"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003474"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004262"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000965","dc:identifier":"homoit0000965","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ zines"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Zines LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-zines"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-fanzines"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ zines"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Zines LGBTQ"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-fansin"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-zines"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Independent, small-circulation publications usually reproduced via photocopier; use for zines created by LGBTQ+ people and/or focusing on LGBTQ+ identities, issues, or cultures."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones independientes de pequeña tirada generalmente reproducidas mediante fotocopiadora; utilícese para revistas creadas por personas LGBTQ+ y/o centradas en identidades, asuntos o culturas LGBTQ+."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een publicatie in kleine oplage, meestal gereproduceerd via fotokopieerapparaat"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Små, självpublicerade tidskrifter med begränsad upplaga, ofta kopierade med kopiator. Används för fanzines skapade av hbtq+-personer och/eller med fokus på hbtq+-identiteter, frågor eller kultur."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003148"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003149"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003150"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit