das sobre personas o temas dos espíritus (y normalmente producidas por personas dos espíritus  u organizaciones dos espíritus) que contienen noticias, artículos, columnas, correspondencia y anuncios."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Periodieke gedrukte of digitale publicaties over Two-Spirit people en Two-Spirit kwesties (meestal geproduceerd door Two-Spirit people of Two-Spirit organisaties) die nieuws, artikelen, columns, correspondentie en advertenties bevatten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Seriella tryckta eller digitala publikationer om Two-spirit-personer eller Two-spirit-frågor (vanligtvis producerade av Two-spirit-personer eller organisationer) som innehåller nyheter, artiklar, krönikor, korrespondens och annonser."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002719"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001042"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002719"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001045","dc:identifier":"homoit0001045","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nipple clamps"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pinzas para pezones"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tepelklemmen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bröstvårtsklämmor"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nipple clamps"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex toys consisting of clamps, usually connected by a chain, that are attached to the nipples to cause pain and erotic pleasure."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juguetes sexuales que consisten de pinzas, generalmente conectadas por una cadena, que se sujetan a los pezones para provocar dolor y placer erótico."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksspeeltjes bestaande uit klemmen, meestal verbonden door een ketting, die aan de tepels zijn bevestigd om pijn en erotisch plezier te veroorzaken door het knijpen en de druk die wordt uitgeoefend."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexleksaker som består av klämmor, vanligtvis sammanlänkade med kedja, som fästs på bröstvårtorna för att ge smärta och erotisk njutning."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003143"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001984"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/nippleClamps"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003143","dc:identifier":"homoit0003143","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Clamps (Erotic)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pinzas (Erótico)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Klammern (erotisch)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Klemmen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Klämmor (erotiskt)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Clamp devices"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Pinzas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Klemmen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Clamps (erotiskt)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A device designed to hold something firmly together or to otherwise fasten down on something (such as the nipples) for the purposes of gratification."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un dispositivo diseñado para mantener algo firmemente unido o para sujetar algo (como los pezones) con fines de gratificación."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Instrument, das dazu bestimmt ist, etwas fest zusammenzuhalten oder anderweitig an etwas (beispielsweise den Brustwarzen) zu befestigen, um sexuelle Befriedigung zu erlangen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een instrument dat is ontworpen om iets stevig aan elkaar vast te klemmen of om iets op een andere manier vast te zetten (zoals de tepels) voor het genot."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En anordning utformad för att hålla något stadigt på plats eller för att fixera något (till exempel bröstvårtor) i syfte att ge sexuell njutning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001045"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003144"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001266"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001046","dc:identifier":"homoit0001046","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nipple play"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juego de pezones"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Tepelspel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nipple play"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nipple sex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sexo de pezones"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bröstvårtssex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexual acts involving stimulation of the nipples."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actos sexuales que implican la estimulación de los pezones."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksuele handelingen waarbij de tepels worden gestimuleerd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexuella handlingar som involverar stimulering av bröstvårtorna."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001299"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003132"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003133"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003131"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001621"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001984"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003130"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/nipplePlay"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002223","dc:identifier":"homoit0002223","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Zines no binarios"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga ickebinära"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary teens"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Zines no binarios"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire teenagers"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are between the ages of childhood and adulthood."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Publicaciones independientes de pequeña tirada generalmente reproducidas mediante fotocopiadora; utilícese para revistas creadas por personas no binarias y/o que se centran en identidades, cuestiones o culturas no binarias."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen tussen de kinderjaren en volwassenheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer mellan barndom och vuxen ålder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001048"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002222"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-19"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002387","dc:identifier":"homoi