in Versen geschrieben, das sich mit asexuellen Charakteren, Themen oder asexueller Identität beschäftigt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literair werk, meestal in verzen geschreven, dat zich richt op aseksuele personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på asexuella karaktärer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001747"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002467"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-17"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002408","dc:identifier":"homoit0002408","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual poetry"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poesía demisexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Dichtung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele poëzie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuell poesi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Poesie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuell lyrik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary work, typically written in verse, that focuses on demisexual characters, themes, or identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias, típicamente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o identidades demisexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Literarisches Werk, in der Regel in Versen geschrieben, das sich mit demisexuellen Charakteren, Themen oder demisexueller Identität beschäftigt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literair werk, meestal geschreven in verzen, dat zich richt op demiseksuele personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på demisexuella karaktärer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002484"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002487"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-17"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002508","dc:identifier":"homoit0002508","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Megasexual poetry"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poesía megasexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Megaseksuele poëzie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Megasexuell poesi"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Megasexuell lyrik"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary works, typically written in verse, that focus on megasexual characters, themes, or identity.\t\t\t\t"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias, normalmente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o identidades megasexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literaire werken, meestal geschreven in verzen, die zich richten op megaseksuele personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på megasexuella karaktärer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002505"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002506"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002507"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002536","dc:identifier":"homoit0002536","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Greyromantic poetry"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poesía grisromántica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Grijsromantische poëzie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gråromantisk poesi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Greyromatic-poesi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gråromantisk lyrik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Greyromantic-lyrik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary works, typically written in verse, that focus on greyromantic characters, themes, or identity.\t\t\t\t"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias, normalmente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o identidades grisrománticos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literaire werken, meestal geschreven in verzen, die zich richten op grijsromantische personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på gråromantiska karaktärer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002534"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002537"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002576","dc:identifier":"homoit0002576","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary poetry"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poesía no binaria"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire poëzie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär poesi"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär lyrik"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary work, typically written in verse, that focuses on non-binary characters, themes, or identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias, normalmente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o identidades no binarias."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literair werk, meestal geschreven in verzen, dat zich richt op non-binaire personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på ickebinära karaktärer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002630","dc:identifier":"homoit0002630","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Māhū poetry"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poesía māhū"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Māhū poëzie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Māhū-poesi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"haw","@value":"Mahu poetry"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Māhū-lyrik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary work, typically written in verse, that focuses on Māhū characters, themes, or identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias, normalmente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o identidades māhū."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literair werk, meestal in verzen geschreven, dat zich richt op Mahu personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på māhū-karaktärer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002630"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002642","dc:identifier":"homoit0002642","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit poetry"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poesía dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit poëzie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-poesi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S poetry "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit poetry "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited poetry "},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited poetry "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-lyrik"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Literary work, typically written in verse, that focuses on Two-Spirit characters, themes, or identity."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias, normalmente escritas en verso, que se centran en personajes, temas o en la identidad dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Literair werk, meestal geschreven in verzen, dat zich richt op Two-Spirit personages, thema's of identiteit."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lyriska verk med fokus på Two-spirit-personer, teman eller identitet."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001118"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002642"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119","dc:identifier":"homoit0001119","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Policía"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisen"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Cops"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A civil force empowered by the state to enforce the law and maintain public order."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fuerza civil facultada por el Estado para hacer cumplir la ley y mantener el orden público."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een overheidsinstitutie die door de staat is gemachtigd om de wet te handhaven en de openbare orde te handhaven."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En civil statlig instans med uppdrag att upprätthålla lag och ordning."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001120"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001122"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002390"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002391"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002397"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004431"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002394"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002393"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002386"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002396"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85104183"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/police"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001122","dc:identifier":"homoit0001122","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police raids"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-invallen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisräder"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Dawn raids"},{"@language":"en","@value":"No-knock raids"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisrazzior"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Razzior"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of residences or establishments by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Entradas y registros inesperados y sin previo aviso en residencias o establecimientos por parte de agentes de las fuerzas policiales con el objetivo de utilizar la sorpresa para incautar pruebas o detener a sospechosos. Las redadas policiales pueden realizarse legalmente mediante una orden de registro o por circunstancias apremiantes, como la causa probable, aunque esta última es muy subjetiva y los civiles suelen tener pocos recursos para apelar a las redadas ilegales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Onverwachte en onaangekondigde binnenkomst en doorzoeking van woningen of instellingen door wetshandhavers met als doel verrassing te gebruiken om bewijsmateriaal in beslag te nemen of verdachten te arresteren. Politie-invallen kunnen legaal worden uitgevoerd met behulp van een huiszoekingsbevel of door urgente omstandigheden, zoals waarschijnlijke oorzaak, hoewel het laatste zeer subjectief is en burgers vaak weinig middelen hebben om in beroep te gaan tegen illegale invallen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Oannonserade och oväntade intrång i och genomsökningar av bostäder eller lokaler som genomförs av poliser i syfte att överraska för att beslagta bevis eller gripa misstänkta. Polisräder kan genomföras lagligt med stöd av husrannsakan eller genom påstådda brådskande omständigheter, till exempel sannolika skäl, vilket är subjektivt och ofta ger begränsade möjligheter för civila att överklaga olagliga räder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001121"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002381"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/policeRaids"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002390","dc:identifier":"homoit0002390","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Defund the police movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento para desfinanciar a la policía"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Defund the police beweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Defund the police-rörelsen"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Defund the Police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Movement to defund police"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Desfinanciación de la policía"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento para desfinanciar la policía"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Primarily a U.S. American and Canadian movement which supports divesting funds from, or abolition of, police departments (and often police structures generally) and reallocating them to non-policing forms of public safety and community support, such as social services, youth services, housing, education, healthcare and other community resources."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Principalmente, un movimiento estadounidense y canadiense que apoya la desinversión de fondos, o la abolición, de los departamentos de policía (y a menudo de las estructuras policiales en general) y su reasignación a formas no policiales de seguridad pública y apoyo comunitario, como los servicios sociales, los servicios para la juventud, la vivienda, la educación, los servicios médicos y otros recursos comunitarios."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een voornamelijk Amerikaanse en Canadese beweging die het afstoten van middelen voor de politie en politie-afdelingen (en vaak politiestructuren in het algemeen) ondersteunt en deze middelen wil toewijzen aan niet-politiële vormen van openbare veiligheid en gemeenschapsondersteuning, zoals sociale diensten, jeugdzorg, huisvesting , onderwijs, gezondheidszorg en andere gemeenschapsmiddelen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Främst en amerikansk och kanadensisk rörelse som förespråkar att minska eller avskaffa finansieringen av polismyndigheter (och ofta även polisiära strukturer generellt) och omfördela resurserna till andra former av offentlig verksamhet och samhällsstöd, såsom socialtjänst, ungdomsverksamhet, bostäder, utbildning, sjukvård och andra samhällsresurser."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002391"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002391","dc:identifier":"homoit0002391","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police abolitionist movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento por la abolición de la policía"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-abolitionistische beweging"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisavskaffningsrörelsen"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Abolishing the police movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Abolición de la policía"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Police abolitionist movement"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A primarily U.S. American and Canadian political movement that advocates replacing policing with other systems of public safety. Police abolitionists believe that policing, as a system, is inherently flawed and cannot be reformed—a view that rejects the ideology of police reformists. While reformists seek to address the ways in which policing occurs, abolitionists seek to transform policing altogether through a process of disbanding, disempowering, and disarming the police. Abolitionists argue that the institution of policing is deeply rooted in a history of white supremacy and settler colonialism and that it is inseparable from a pre-existing racial capitalist order, and thus believe a reformist approach to policing will always fail."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un movimiento político principalmente estadounidense y canadiense que aboga por reemplazar la vigilancia policial con otros sistemas de seguridad pública. Los abolicionistas policiales creen que la vigilancia policial, como sistema, es inherentemente defectuosa y no puede reformarse, una visión que rechaza la ideología de los reformistas policiales. Mientras los reformistas buscan abordar las formas en que se realiza la actividad policial, los abolicionistas buscan transformarla por completo a través de un proceso de disolución, desempoderamiento y desarme de la policía. Los abolicionistas argumentan que la institución policial está profundamente arraigada en una historia de supremacía blanca y asentamiento colonial y que es inseparable de un orden capitalista racial preexistente y, por lo tanto, creen que un enfoque reformista de la policía siempre fracasará."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een voornamelijk US-Amerikaanse en Canadese politieke beweging die pleit voor vervanging van de politie door andere systemen van openbare veiligheid. Politie-abolitionisten zijn van mening dat de politie als systeem inherent gebrekkig is en niet kan worden hervormd – een visie die de ideologie van politiehervormers verwerpt. Terwijl reformisten proberen de manieren aan te pakken waarop politiewerk plaatsvindt, proberen abolitionisten het politiewerk volledig te transformeren door middel van een proces van ontbinding, ontwapening en ontmachting van de politie. Abolitionisten beweren dat het instituut van politie diep geworteld is in een geschiedenis van blanke suprematie en kolonialisme en dat het onlosmakelijk verbonden is met een reeds bestaande raciale kapitalistische orde, en geloven daarom dat een reformistische benadering van politie altijd zal mislukken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En huvudsakligen amerikansk och kanadensisk politisk rörelse som verkar för att ersätta polisverksamhet med andra system för allmän säkerhet. Förespråkare menar att polisväsendet som system är i grunden bristfälligt och inte kan reformeras. I stället eftersträvas en genomgripande omvandling genom att frånta polisen makt, avveckla och avväpna polisen. Rörelsen utgår från en förståelse av polisens rötter i vit överhöghet och bosättarkolonialism samt dess koppling till en rasistisk kapitalistisk samhällsordning, och menar därför att reforminriktade lösningar alltid kommer att misslyckas."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002390"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001322"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002397","dc:identifier":"homoit0002397","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"White supremacy in policing "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Supremacía blanca en la policía"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Witte suprematie bij de politie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vit makt inom polisväsendet"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Far-right presence in police forces"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Infiltration of police by white supremacists"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Law enforcement and white supremacy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police and right-wing extremism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police officer ties with white supremacists"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police with far-right ties"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Presencia de la extrema derecha en las fuerzas policiales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Infiltración de supremacistas blancos en la policía"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Fuerzas del orden y supremacía blanca"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Policía y extremismo de derecha"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vínculos de policías con supremacistas blancos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Policía vinculada a la extrema derecha||"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Banden van politieagenten met witte supremacisten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Extreemrechtse aanwezigheid bij de politie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Infiltratie van de politie door witte supremacisten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie en rechtsextremisme"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rechtshandhaving en witte suprematie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vit dominans inom polisväsendet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vit överhöghet inom polisväsendet"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Historical and contemporary linkages between white supremacist ideologies and modern policing institutions, primarily discussed within the context of the countries of Canada and the United States."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Vínculos históricos y contemporáneos entre las ideologías supremacistas blancas y las instituciones policiales modernas, discutidos principalmente en el contexto de los países de Canadá y Estados Unidos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Historische en hedendaagse verbanden tussen witte supremacistische ideologieën en huidige politie-instituties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Historiska och nutida kopplingar mellan vit makt-ideologier och moderna polisinstitutioner, främst diskuterade i Kanada och USA."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002376"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002377"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004620"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002397"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002394","dc:identifier":"homoit0002394","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Attitudes of LGBTQ+ people toward police "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Posturas de las personas LGBTQ+ sobre la policía"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Haltungen von LGBTQ+-Personen zur Polizei"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Attituden van LHBTQ+-personen tegenover de politie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personers attityd till polisen"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ viewpoints on police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ views of police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Perceptions of police by LGBTQ+ communities"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Perceptions of police by LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Opiniones de las personas LGBTQ+ hacia la policía"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Meinungen von LGBTQ+-Personen zur Polizei"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ansichten von LGBTQ+-Personen zur Polizei"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Perceptie van de politie door LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Perceptie van de politie door LHBTQ+-personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Attitudes and assessments of feelings, relationships, and interactions between LGBTQ+ people and police."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Actitudes y evaluaciones de los sentimientos, relaciones e interacciones entre las personas LGBTQ+ y la policía."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Meinungen und Beurteilungen von Gefühlen, Beziehungen und Interaktionen zwischen LGBTQ+-Personen und der Polizei."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Attituden en inschattingen van gevoelens, relaties en interacties tussen LGBTQ+ mensen en de politie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Attityder till och erfarenheter från kontakter, relationer och interaktioner mellan hbtq+-personer och polisen."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002386","dc:identifier":"homoit0002386","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"No Police at Pride"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No Police at Pride"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"No Police at Pride"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"No Police at Pride"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"No Cops at Pride movement"},{"@language":"en","@value":"No Cops at Pride"},{"@language":"en","@value":"No Police at Pride movement"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento No Cops at Pride"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No Cops at Pride"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Moviento No Police at Pride"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Primarily Canadian and U.S. American movement wherein police officers were banned from LGBTQ+ pride events in some locations, due to historical and contemporary mistreatment of LGBTQ+ persons, especially Black and Indigenous LGBTQ+ persons. In recent years acted as a response to the 2010-2017 Toronto serial homicides and the mishandling of the investigation by the Toronto Police Service."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Movimiento principalmente canadiense y estadounidense en el que se le prohibió a agentes de policía participar en eventos del orgullo LGBTQ+ en algunos lugares, debido al maltrato histórico y contemporáneo hacia las personas LGBTQ+, especialmente las personas LGBTQ+ negras e indígenas. En los últimos años, fungió como respuesta a los homicidios en serie de Toronto de 2010-2017 y al mal manejo de la investigación por parte del Servicio Policial de Toronto."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Voornamelijk Canadese en US-Amerikaanse beweging waarbij politieagenten op sommige locaties werden uitgesloten van LHBTQ+-pride evenementen vanwege historische en hedendaagse mishandeling van met name zwarte en inheemse LHBTQ+-personen. De afgelopen jaren fungeerde het als reactie op de seriemoorden in Toronto in 2010-2017 en de verkeerde behandeling van het onderzoek door de politie van Toronto."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En främst kanadensisk och amerikansk rörelse där poliser förbjöds från att delta i hbtq+-prideevenemang i vissa städer, som en reaktion på historisk och pågående diskriminering av hbtq+-personer, särskilt svarta och urfolk. I nutid har detta varit ett svar på seriemorden i Toronto 2010–2017 och det kritiserade sätt som Toronto-polisen hanterade utredningen."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003651"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003653"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001119"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002386"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002374","dc:identifier":"homoit0002374","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police entrapment of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Aprisionamiento policial de personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In de val lokken door de politie van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Brottsprovokationer mot hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Atrapamiento policial de personas LGBTQ+"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A practice in which law enforcement agents or agents of the state coerce an LGBTQ+ person to commit a \"crime\" they would have otherwise been unlikely or unwilling to commit. Legal definitions of entrapment vary widely depending on the jurisdiction, but the term is often used colloquially to refer to police acting dishonestly or in bad faith, as well as policing focused on anticipating and inducing crime, rather than responding to reports of crime."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Práctica mediante la cual la policía induce a personas LGBTQ+ a cometer acciones consideradas delitos que de otro modo no se habrían cometido o que era poco probable que se hubieran cometido."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Praktijk waarbij de politie LHBTQ+-personen ertoe aanzet acties te ondernemen die als misdrijven kunnen worden beschouwd en die anders niet zouden zijn gepleegd, of waarvan het onwaarschijnlijk is dat ze zouden worden gepleegd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En metod där polisen eller andra statliga aktörer förmår en hbtq+-person att begå ett brott som hen annars inte skulle ha begått. Juridiska definitioner av ”provokation” varierar mellan jurisdiktioner, men i vardagsspråk används termen ofta för att beskriva situationer där polis agerar oärligt, i ond tro eller med syfte att framkalla snarare än att reagera på anmälda brott."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001120"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002375","dc:identifier":"homoit0002375","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police harassment of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acoso policial a personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intimidatie door de politie van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polistrakasserier mot hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":" Mistreatment of LGBTQ+ people by police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Harassment of LGBTQ+ people by police"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police brutality toward LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police misconduct toward LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police mistreatment of LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maltrato hacia personas LGBTQ+ por la policía"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acoso de personas LGBTQ+ por la policía"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Brutalidad policial hacia personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mala conducta policial hacia personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Maltrato policial contra personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hostigamiento policial a personas LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mishandeling door de politie van LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mishandeling van LHBTQ+-personen door de politie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Wangedrag van de politie jegens LHBTQ+-personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Any of various forms of inappropriate conduct, illegal actions, or abuses of power undertaken by law enforcement agents or agents of the state against LGBTQ+ members of the public. This includes but is not limited to racial, ethnic, and other forms of profiling; unwarranted surveillance, searches, and seizure; selective enforcement; excessive use of force; sexual misconduct; intimidation and witness tampering; falsification of evidence; coerced confessions; false arrests and imprisonment; and bribing or lobbying."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cualquiera de las diversas formas de conducta inapropiada, acciones ilegales o abusos de poder que violentan directa o indirectamente a las personas LGBTQ+, incluidas, entre otras, confesiones forzadas, intimidación, arrestos y encarcelamientos falsos, falsificación de pruebas, perjurio policial, manipulación de testigos, brutalidad y corrupción policial, elaboración de caracterizaciones raciales, étnicos y de otro tipo, vigilancia injustificada, registros o incautación de propiedad, soborno o cabildeo para obtener poder o estatus excesivo o para evitar consecuencias, aplicación selectiva de la ley y conducta sexual inapropiada."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Elke vorm van ongepast gedrag, illegale acties of machtsmisbruik die LHBTQ+-personen direct of indirect schade berokkenen, inclusief maar niet beperkt tot gedwongen bekentenissen, intimidatie, valse arrestaties en gevangenisstraffen, vervalsing van bewijsmateriaal, meineed door de politie, geknoei met getuigen, politiegeweld en corruptie, raciale, etnische en andere vormen van profilering, ongerechtvaardigde surveillance, huiszoekingen of inbeslagname van eigendommen, omkoping of lobbywerk om buitensporige macht of status te verkrijgen of om consequenties te vermijden, selectieve handhaving en seksueel wangedrag."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Olämpligt uppförande, olagliga handlingar eller maktmissbruk från polis gentemot hbtq+-personer. Det kan inkludera rasprofilering, övervakning utan grund, olagliga husrannsakningar och beslag, selektiv rättstillämpning, övervåld, sexuella övergrepp, hot, bevisförfalskning, tvingade erkännanden, felaktiga gripanden eller fängslanden samt mutor eller otillbörlig påverkan."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001121"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002373"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002376"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002377"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002381","dc:identifier":"homoit0002381","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Police raids on LGBTQ+-related establishments"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en establecimientos relacionados con comunidades LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-invallen in LHBTQ+-gerelateerde etablissementen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisräder mot hbtq+-relaterade verksamheter"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-LGBTQ+ police raids"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police raids on LGBTQ+ establishments"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police raids on LGBTQ+ venues"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Police raids to LGBTQ+ venues"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales anti-LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en establecimientos LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en lugares LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Redadas policiales en establecimientos relacionados con identidades LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-invallen in LHBTQ+-etablissementen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Politie-invallen op LHBTQ+-locaties"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polisrazzior mot hbtq+-relaterade verksamheter"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of establishments owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un registro no anunciado y sin orden judicial de una residencia o un establecimiento principalmente afiliado o relacionado con comunidades o identidades LGBTQ+ por parte de la policía. Estos ataques suelen ser traumáticos y caóticos y pueden eludir los procedimientos penales típicos y las libertades civiles."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een onaangekondigde huiszoeking zonder huiszoekingsbevel door de politie in een voornamelijk LHBTQ+-gelieerde of -gerelateerde woning of etablissement. Dergelijke aanvallen zijn vaak traumatisch en chaotisch en kunnen de typische strafprocedures en burgerlijke vrijheden omzeilen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Oannonserade och oväntade intrång i och genomsökningar av lokaler som ägs av eller frekventeras av hbtq+-personer, genomförda av poliser i syfte att överraska för att beslagta bevis eller gripa misstänkta. Polisräder kan genomföras lagligt med stöd av husrannsakan eller genom påstådda brådskande omständigheter, till exempel sannolika skäl, vilket är subjektivt och ofta ger begränsade möjligheter för civila att överklaga olagliga räder."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001122"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002378"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002382"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002383"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002384"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002385"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001735"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001741"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000611"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001651","dc:identifier":"homoit0001651","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Consensual non-monogamy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No monogamia consensual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Einvernehmliche Nicht-Monogamie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Consensuele non-monogamie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Etisk ickemonogami"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ethical Non-monogamy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No monogamia ética"},{"@language":"es","@value":"NMC"},{"@language":"es","@value":"NME"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Konsensuelle Nicht-Monogamie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"ENM"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Practice of romantic or sexual relationships with more than one person simultaneously and with all the consent of all partners involved."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Práctica de relaciones románticas o sexuales con más de una persona simultáneamente y con el consentimiento de todas las parejas involucradas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Praxis romantischer oder sexueller Beziehungen mit mehr als einer Person gleichzeitig und mit dem Einverständnis aller beteiligten Partner:innen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Praktijk van romantische of seksuele relaties met meer dan één persoon tegelijk, met toestemming van alle betrokken partners."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utövandet av romantiska eller sexuella relationer med mer än en person samtidigt, med alla inblandade parters samtycke."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001659"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001625"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001641"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001665"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001666"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003278"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001554"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001649"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001662"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/consensualNonMonogamy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001554","dc:identifier":"homoit0001554","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Metamours"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Metamours"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Metamours"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Metamourer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"In polyamory or open relationships, metamours are the partners of an individual's partner, with whom the individual does not have a direct sexual or romantic relationship."},{"@language":"es","@value":"En el poliamor o las relaciones abiertas, los metamours son las parejas de la pareja de una persona, con quien la persona no tiene una relación sexual o romántica directa."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In polyamory of open relaties, de partner van de partner, met wie men geen directe seksuele relatie heeft"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inom polyrelationer eller öppna relationer avser metamour partnern till en persons partner, där man själv inte har en romantisk eller sexuell relation med den personen."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001660"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001638"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001651"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001662"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/metamours"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-03"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001629","dc:identifier":"homoit0001629","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hierarchical non-monogamy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No monogamia jerárquica"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hierarchische Nicht-Monogamie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hierarchische non-monogamie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hierarkisk icke-monogami"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hierarchical polyamory"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hierarchical nonmonogamy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Poliamor jerárquico"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hierarchische Polyamorie"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hierarchische Non-Monogamie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-mono"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of consensual non-monogamy in which a person has multiple partners who are not \"equal\" to one another in terms of time, emotional intensity, financial, or scheduling matters."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una forma de no monogamia consensuada en la que una persona tiene múltiples parejas que no son \"iguales\" entre sí en términos de tiempo, intensidad emocional, cuestiones financieras o de calendarización."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Form der einvernehmlichen Nicht-Monogamie, bei der eine Person mehrere Partner hat, die in Bezug auf Zeitaufwand, emotionale Intensität, finanzielle Aspekte oder Terminplanung nicht „gleichberechtigt“ sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een vorm van consensuele non-monogamie waarbij een persoon meerdere partners heeft die niet 'gelijk' aan elkaar zijn in termen van tijd, emotionele intensiteit, financiële of planningskwesties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En form av samtyckande icke-monogami där en person har flera partner som inte är jämlika i fråga om tidsmässigt utrymme, emotionell intensitet, ekonomiska villkor eller planering och tillgänglighet."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001659"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001641"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001656"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001625"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001638"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001645"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001657"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001664"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002255"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/hierarchicalNonmonogamy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001662","dc:identifier":"homoit0001662","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Paramours"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Paramours"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Paramours"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Paramourer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"In polyamory contexts, paramours are the partners of an individual's partner, typically as part of a relationship the primary partner is unaware of. In other contexts, this term is used broadly as a synonym for lovers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"En contextos polyamoros, los paramours son lo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In de context van polyamory verwijst dit naar iemands (niet-consensuele) partner van de partner. In andere contexten, meer in het algemeen gebruikt om te verwijzen naar een minnaar."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"I polyamorösa sammanhang används paramour för att beskriva partnern till ens partner, vanligtvis i relationer där huvudpartnern inte känner till den andra relationen. I andra sammanhang används termen mer generellt som synonym till ”älskare”."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001660"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001554"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001638"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001651"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2006001642"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/paramours"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004441","dc:identifier":"homoit0004441","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Throuple "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Throuple"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Throuple"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A committed polyamorous relationship in which a couple adds a third partner to their relationship. Often, this relationship dynamic does not have a flat hierarchy and the third is seen as dating the couple as a unit or joining the couple's pre-existing relationship rather than individually dating both other members of the throuple."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een polyamoreuze relatie waarbij een stel een derde partner aan hun relatie toevoegt. Vaak is er in deze relatievorm geen sprake van een platte hiërarchie en wordt de derde persoon gezien als iemand die met het stel als geheel date of zich aansluit bij de reeds bestaande relatie van het stel, in plaats van dat diegene afzonderlijk met de andere twee leden van de throuple date."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett uttalat polyamoröst förhållande där ett par lägger till en tredje partner i sin relation. Ofta har denna relationsdynamik inte en platt hierarki och den tredje partnern anses vara i relation med paret som en enhet eller att gå med i parets befintliga relation snarare än att vara i en relation med de andra medlemmarna i paret individuellt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001558"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001645","dc:identifier":"homoit0001645","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anchor partners"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parejas anclas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ankerpartner:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anchor partners"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ankarpartners"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Vínculos ancla"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term used in non-monogamous communities to refer to a long-term partner with multiple commitments. Often used in place of language that is seen as hierarchical (e.g., primary/secondary partner)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado en comunidades no monógamas para referirse a una pareja a largo plazo con múltiples compromisos. A menudo se utiliza en lugar de un lenguaje que se considera jerárquico (por ejemplo, pareja principal/secundaria)."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Begriff, der in nicht-monogamen Gemeinschaften verwendet wird, um eine:n langfristige:n Partner:in mit mehreren Verpflichtungen zu bezeichnen. Wird oft anstelle von Begriffen verwendet, die als hierarchisch angesehen werden (z. B. primäre:r/sekundäre:r Partner:in)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die in niet-monogame gemeenschappen wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar een langdurige partner met meerdere verplichtingen. Vaak gebruikt in plaats van termen die als hiërarchisch worden gezien (bijv. primaire/secundaire partner)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En term som används i icke-monogama gemenskaper för att beskriva en långvarig partner med flera relationella åtaganden, som ska ses som ett relationellt ankare och är en trygg och \"fast\" punkt. Används ofta istället för termer som uppfattas som hierarkiska, till exempel primär eller sekundär partner."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001660"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002365"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001629"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001657"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001663"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001637"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/anchorPartners"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001649","dc:identifier":"homoit0001649","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Compersion"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Compersión"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Mitfreude"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Compersie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medglädje"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Resonanzfreude"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Compersion"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Compersion"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The positive emotion an individual may experience in regards to their partner's relationship with another partner. Often defined as the opposite of jealousy."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La emoción positiva que una persona puede experimentar con respecto a la relación de su pareja con otra pareja. A menudo se define como lo opuesto a los celos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die positive Emotion, die eine Person in Bezug auf die Beziehung ihres:ihrer Partner:in zu einem:einer anderen Partner:in empfinden kann. Wird oft als das Gegenteil von Eifersucht definiert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De positieve emotie die een individu kan ervaren met betrekking tot de relatie van zijn of haar partner met een andere partner. Vaak gedefinieerd als het tegenovergestelde van jaloezie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den positiva känsla en individ kan uppleva i förhållande till sin partners relation med en annan partner. Ofta definierad som motsatsen till svartsjuka."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001651"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001649"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/compersion"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001657","dc:identifier":"homoit0001657","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nesting partners"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Compañeros de anidación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nestpartners"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nesting partners"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term used in non-monogamous communities to refer to partners an individual lives with. Often used in place of language that is seen as hierarchical (e.g., primary partner, secondary partner)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado en comunidades no monógamas para referirse a las parejas con las que vive una persona. A menudo, se utiliza en lugar de un lenguaje que se considera jerárquico (por ejemplo, \"pareja principal\", \"pareja secundaria\")."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die in niet-monogame gemeenschappen wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar een partner waarmee men samenleeft. Vaak gebruikt in plaats van termen die als hiërarchisch wordt gezien (bijv. primaire/secundaire partner)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används i icke-monogama gemenskaper för att beskriva partners som man lever tillsammans med. Används ofta i stället för hierarkiska termer som ”primär partner” eller ”sekundär partner”."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001660"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002365"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001629"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001645"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001663"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001637"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/nestingPartners"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001661","dc:identifier":"homoit0001661","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"NRE (New Relationship Energy)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Energía de la Nueva Relación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"NRE (Nieuwe relatie-energie)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nyrelationsenergi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"New relationship energy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"NRE"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Energía de relación nueva"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ny relationsenergi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A strong, almost giddy feeling of excitement and infatuation common in the beginning of a new romantic relationship. Often used in polyamory contexts."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un sentimiento fuerte, casi vertiginoso, de emoción y enamoramiento, común al comienzo de una nueva relación romántica. A menudo, se utiliza en contextos de poliamor."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een sterk, bijna duizelig gevoel van opwinding en verliefdheid die vaak voorkomt bij het begin van een nieuwe romantische relatie. Vaak gebruikt in de context van polyamory."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En stark, ofta euforisk känsla av förälskelse som är vanlig i början av en ny romantisk relation. Används ofta i polyamorösa sammanhang."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001655"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001663"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001661"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/nre"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001663","dc:identifier":"homoit0001663","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Polyamorous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas poliamorosas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Polyamoure personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polyamorösa personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who engage in romantic, sexual, or play relationships with more than one person simultaneously, with the knowledge and consent of all parties involved."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que mantienen relaciones románticas, sexuales o de juego con más de una persona simultáneamente, con el conocimiento y consentimiento de todas las partes involucradas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die relaties onderhouden met meer dan één persoon, tegelijkertijd, met medeweten en toestemming van alle partijen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har och/eller är öppna för romantiska, sexuella eller kinkrelaterade relationer med flera personer samtidigt, med samtycke från alla inblandade."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001637"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001660"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001645"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001657"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001661"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003229"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003920"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001637"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/polyamorousPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001664","dc:identifier":"homoit0001664","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Polyfidelity"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Polifidelidad"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Polytrouwheid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Polytrohet"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Poliexclusividad"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"In polyamory circles, this term refers to the practice of engaging in multiple-partner relationships that are \"closed off\" to new participants per the agreement of those involved."},{"@language":"es","@value":"En los círculos de poliamor, este término se refiere a la práctica de entablar relaciones con múltiples parejas que están \"cerradas\" a nuevos participantes según el acuerdo de las partes involucradas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"In polyamory, een relatie met meerdere partners die is 'gesloten' voor nieuwe deelnemers met instemming van de betrokkenen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inom polyamorösa sammanhang avser denna term praktiken att ha relationer med flera partners som, enligt de inblandades överenskommelse, är stängda för nya personer."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001123"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001629"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001664"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/polyfidelity"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001281","dc:identifier":"homoit0001281","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sexting"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sextear"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sexting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sextning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexchatta"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Act of sending sexually explicit messages or photographs, primarily between mobile phones."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Acto de enviar mensajes o fotografías sexualmente explícitas, principalmente entre teléfonos móviles."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"verspreiden of delen van seksueel getinte foto's of berichten via mobiele telefoons of andere mobiele media"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Handlingen att skicka sexuellt explicita meddelanden eller fotografier, främst mellan mobiltelefoner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001128"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001306"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2012000622"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/sexting"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001130","dc:identifier":"homoit0001130","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"PrEP"},{"@language":"es","@value":"PrEP"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"PrEP"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"PrEP"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pre-exposure prophylaxis"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Profilaxis preexposición"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pre-exposure prophylaxis"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Preexpositionsprofylax"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Medication taken regularly to reduce the risk of contracting HIV."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Medicamentos tomados para prevenir la contracción del VIH."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Medicatie die regelmatig ingenomen moet worden om het risico op besmetting met HIV te verminderen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Läkemedel som tas i förebyggande syfte för att förhindra att hiv överförs. Detta sker genom att blockera enzymet som krävs för att hiv ska etablera infektion i kroppen."}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2017003696"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001130"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/prep"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001200","dc:identifier":"homoit0001200","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer press"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer pers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queer press"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at queer audiences and/or operated by queer people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos, revistas u otros medios editoriales dirigidos a audiencias queer y/o operados por personas queer."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kranten, tijdschriften of andere publicaties die gericht zijn op queer personen en/of worden gerund door queer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar, tidskrifter eller andra publikationer riktade till en queer målgrupp och/eller drivna av queera personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003154"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004627"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/queerPress"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001436","dc:identifier":"homoit0001436","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender press"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa transgénero"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender pers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpress"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Diarios transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa trans"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at transgender audiences and/or operated by transgender people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos, revistas u otros medios editoriales dirigidos a audiencias transgénero y/o operados por personas transgénero."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kranten, tijdschriften of andere publicaties die gericht zijn op transgender personen en/of worden gerund door transgender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar, tidskrifter eller andra publikationer riktade till transpersoner och/eller drivna av transpersoner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001427"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001428"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003149"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001423"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004624"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/transgenderPress"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002804","dc:identifier":"homoit0002804","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual press"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Presse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa asexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele pers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuell press"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Medien"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Medien"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Presse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diarios asexuales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at asexual audiences and/or operated by asexual people."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zeitungen, Zeitschriften oder andere Publikationsorgane, die sich an ein asexuelles Publikum richten und/oder von asexuellen Personen betrieben werden."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos, revistas u otros medios editoriales dirigidos a audiencias asexuales y/o operados por personas asexuales."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kranten, tijdschriften of andere publicaties gericht op een aseksueel publiek en/of gerund door aseksuele personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar, magasin eller andra publikationer riktade till asexuella och/eller drivna av asexuella personer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003151"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002797"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002798"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004626"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002936","dc:identifier":"homoit0002936","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex press"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Presse"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa intersexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse pers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpress"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Medien"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa intersex"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at intersex audiences and/or operated by intersex people."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zeitungen, Zeitschriften oder andere Publikationsorgane, die sich an ein inter* Publikum richten und/oder von inter* Personen betrieben werden."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos, revistas u otros medios editoriales dirigidos a audiencias intersexuales y/o operados por personas intersex."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kranten, tijdschriften of andere publicaties die gericht zijn op intersekse personen en/of worden gerund door intersekse personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar, tidskrifter eller andra publikationer riktade till intersexpersoner och/eller drivna av intersexpersoner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003148"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004629"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-09-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003933","dc:identifier":"homoit0003933","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ journalism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-journalistiek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Journalism (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Journalism (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-journalism"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The collection and editing of news for presentation through mass media, including interviewing subjects, writing and publishing articles, recording and broadcasting news, etc. Use to refer to journalism created by or focusing on LGBTQ+ communities."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het verzamelen en bewerken van nieuws voor presentatie via massamedia, inclusief het interviewen van personen, het schrijven en publiceren van artikelen, het opnemen en uitzenden van nieuws, etc. Wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar journalistiek die is gemaakt door of zich richt op LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Insamling och redigering av nyheter för presentation via massmedia. Termen inkluderar att intervjua personer, skriva och publicera artiklar, genomföra inspelning och sändning av nyheter etc. Används för journalistik skapad av eller med fokus på hbtq+-grupper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003864"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-03-26"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004632","dc:identifier":"homoit0004632","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary press"},"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary press"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at non-binary audiences and/or operated by non-binary people."},"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003152"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004628"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-09"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-09"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002719","dc:identifier":"homoit0002719","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit press"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Prensa dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit pers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-press"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S press"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit press"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited press"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited press"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Diarios dos espíritus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Newspapers, magazines, or other publishing outlets aimed at Two-Spirit audiences and/or operated by Two-Spirit people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Periódicos, revistas u otros medios editoriales dirigidos a audiencias dos espíritus y/o operados por personas dos espíritus."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kranten, tijdschriften of andersoortige publicaties gericht voor en/of door Two-Spirit-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tidningar, tidskrifter eller andra publikationer riktade till en Two-spirit-personer och/eller drivna av Two-spirit-personer."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002714"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002715"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003153"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004630"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002719"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004621","dc:identifier":"homoit0004621","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ personals"},"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Personals (LGBTQ+)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ personal ads"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ personal advertisements"}],"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"A form of classified advertising for LGBTQ+ people interested in seeking connections around sex, romance, and/or community. The content of these ads focus largely on the type of arrangement sought and details or criteria about the writer and the type of person they are looking for (e.g. personality traits, physical looks, etc.). While LGBTQ+ personals are most commonly thought of as existing in print media, they also have existed online in spaces such as Craigslist."},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004622"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004623"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004624"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004625"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004626"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004627"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004628"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004629"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001132"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004630"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004621"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-08"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-09"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001673","dc:identifier":"homoit0001673","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ae/Aer/Aerself (Pronouns)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ae/Aer/Aerself (Pronomen)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ae/Aer/Aerself (pronomen)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ae (Pronouns)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Ae/Aer/Aerself"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ae (Pronomen)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ae/Aer/Aerself"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A set of pronouns. Used in this manner: Ae went to the Homosaurus website. I watched aer browse the Homosaurus. Ae uses the Homosaurus aerself."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Gruppe von Pronomen. Wird auf diese Weise verwendet: Ae besuchte die Homosaurus-Website. Ich beobachtete Aer beim Stöbern auf der Homosaurus-Website. Ae benutzt den Homosaurus aerself."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En uppsättning amerikanska pronomen. Används på detta sätt: Ae gick till Homosaurus webbplats. Jag såg aer bläddra i Homosaurus. Ae använder Homosaurus aerself."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001135"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001672"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001135"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/aePronouns"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-07-01"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001674","dc:identifier":"homoit0001674","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Co/Co/Coself (Pronouns)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Co (Pronomen)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Co/Co/Coself (pronomen)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Co (Pronouns)"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A set of pronouns. Used in this manner: Co went to the Homosaurus website. I watched co browse the Homosaurus. Co uses the Homosaurus coself."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Reihe von Pronomen aus dem Englischen. Verwendung: Co hat die Homosaurus-Website besucht. Ich habe beobachtet, wie Co im Homosaurus recherchiert hat. Co nutzt den Homosaurus selbst."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Engelskspråkiga neopronomen som används som alternativ till traditionella personliga pronomen. Används på detta sätt: Co gick till Homosaurus webbplats. Jag såg co bläddra i Homosaurus. Co använder Homosaurus coself."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001135"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001672"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001135"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/coPronouns"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-07-01"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001675","dc:identifier":"homoit0001675","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cy/Cyb/Cyberself (Pronouns)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Cy/Cyb/Cyberself"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cy/Cyb/Cyberself (pronomen)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cy (Pronouns)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cy/Cyb/Cyberself"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A set of pronouns. Used in this manner: Cy went to the Homosaurus website. I watched cyb browse the Homosaurus. Cy uses the Homosaurus cyberself."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Pronomen aus dem englischen Sprachgebrauch, die wie folgt verwendet werden: Cy besuchte die Homosaurus-Website. Ich beobachtete cyb beim Durchstöbern der Homosaurus-Seite. Cy verwendet Homosaurus cyberself."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En uppsättning pronomen. Används på följande sätt: Cy gick till Homosaurus-webbplatsen. Jag såg cyb bläddra i Homosaurus. Cy använder Homosaurus cyberself."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001135"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001672"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001135"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/cyPronouns"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-07-01"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001676","dc:identifier":"homoit0001676","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"E/Em/Emself (Pronouns)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"E/Em/Emself (Pronomen)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"E/Em/Emself (pronomen)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"E (Pronouns)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"E/Em/Emself"},{"@language":"de","@value":"E (Pronomen)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"E/Em/Emself"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A set of pronouns. Used in this manner: E went to the Homosaurus website. I watched