:"sv","@value":"Scenkonstverk som fokuserar på intersex-karaktärer, gemenskaper eller frågor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-09-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002731","dc:identifier":"homoit0002731","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit theater"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Teatro dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit theater"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-teater"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S theatre"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited theatre"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit theatre"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited theatre"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S theater"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit theater"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited theater"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited theater"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Works in the performance arts that focus on Two-Spirit characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras de artes escénicas que se centran en personajes, comunidades o cuestiones dos espíritus. "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Uitvoeringen in de podiumkunsten die zich richten op LHBTQ+-personages, gemeenschappen of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Scenkonstverk som fokuserar på Two-spirit-karaktärer, gemenskaper eller frågor."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001363"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002731"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001902","dc:identifier":"homoit0001902","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Critical race theory"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Teoría crítica de la raza"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Critical Race Theory"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kritische rassentheorie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kritisk rasteori"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"CRT"},{"@language":"es","@value":"CRT"},{"@language":"de","@value":"CRT"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Kritische \"Rassen\"-Theorie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"CRT"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Critical race theory"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A multidiscplinary field of study and intellectual framework used by scholars and activists to examine the intersections of race, class, and law in the United States, as well as to challenge mainstream U.S. liberal approaches to racial justice. Key concepts of CRT include the argument that race is a social construct with no biological basis and that racism and disparate racial outcomes are the result of complex, changing, and often subtle social and institutional dynamics, rather than individuals' explicit and intentional prejudices."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un campo de estudio multidisciplinario y un marco teórico intelectual utilizado por académicos y activistas para examinar las intersecciones de la raza, la clase y el derecho en los Estados Unidos, así como para desafiar los principales enfoques liberales estadounidenses sobre la justicia racial. Los conceptos claves del CRT incluyen el argumento de que la raza es una construcción social sin base biológica y que el racismo y los resultados raciales dispares son el resultado de dinámicas sociales e institucionales complejas, cambiantes y a menudo sutiles, en lugar de prejuicios explícitos e intencionales de los individuos."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein multidisziplinäres Forschungsgebiet und intellektueller Rahmen, der von Wissenschaftler:innen und Aktivist:innen genutzt wird, um die Schnittstellen von \"Rasse\", Klasse und Recht in den Vereinigten Staaten zu untersuchen und die gängigen liberalen Ansätze der USA zur Rassengerechtigkeit infrage zu stellen. Zu den Schlüsselkonzepten der CRT gehört die These, dass Rasse ein soziales Konstrukt ohne biologische Grundlage ist und dass Rassismus und ungleiche Ergebnisse aufgrund von \"Rasse\" das Ergebnis komplexer, sich verändernder und oft subtiler sozialer und institutioneller Dynamiken sind und nicht das Ergebnis expliziter und absichtlicher Vorurteile einzelner Personen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een multidisciplinair studiegebied en intellectueel kader dat door wetenschappers en activisten wordt gebruikt om de intersecties van ras, klasse en recht in de Verenigde Staten te onderzoeken, en om de reguliere Amerikaanse liberale benaderingen van raciale rechtvaardigheid uit te dagen. Kernbegrip van CRT is dat ras een sociale constructie is zonder biologische basis en dat racisme en ongelijksoortige raciale uitkomsten het resultaat zijn van complexe, veranderende en vaak subtiele sociale en institutionele dynamieken, in plaats van de expliciete en opzettelijke vooroordelen van individuen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ett tvärvetenskapligt forskningsfält och intellektuellt ramverk som används av forskare och aktivister för att analysera hur ras, klass och rättssystem samverkar i USA samt för att kritisera etablerade liberala synsätt på rasrättvisa i USA. Centrala begrepp innefattar att ras förstås som en social konstruktion utan biologisk grund och att rasism och ojämlika utfall mellan olika grupper förklaras av komplexa, föränderliga och ofta subtila sociala och institutionella processer snarare än av enskilda individers uttalade och avsiktliga fördomar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001903"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002257"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002269"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003988"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2020008165"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-03-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003616","dc:identifier":"homoit0003616","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Decolonial theory"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dekoloniale theorie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Dekolonial teori"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Decoloniality"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Decolonizing theory"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Postcolonial theory"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Postcolonialism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dekolonizeringstheorie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Postkoloniale theorie"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A school of thought that rejects Eurocentric knowledge hierarchies and ways of being, including the presumed superiority of white Western culture."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een stroming die eurocentrische kennishiërarchieën en manieren van zijn verwerpt, inclusief de veronderstelde superioriteit van de blanke westerse cultuur."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En tankeskola som förkastar eurocentriska kunskapshierarkier och sätt att vara, inklusive den förmodade överlägsenheten hos vit västerländsk kultur."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh97007835"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001369","dc:identifier":"homoit0001369","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Third gender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas del tercer género"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes de troisième genre"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen van een derde geslacht"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tredje kön-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"3:e kön-personer"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Individuals who are categorized (by their will or by social consensus) as neither man nor woman."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que no están categorizadas (por su voluntad o por consenso social) ni como hombre ni como mujer."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes qui sont catégorisées, par elles-mêmes ou par consensus social, comme n'étant ni homme ni femme."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Individuen die zijn gecategoriseerd (door eigen wil of door sociale consensus) als man noch vrouw"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Individer som kategoriseras (efter egen vilja eller genom socialt samförstånd) som varken män eller kvinnor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001368"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/thirdGenderPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-05-14"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002197","dc:identifier":"homoit0002197","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"ja","@value":"Seme (Yaoi)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Seme (Yaoi)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seme (Yaoi)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Seme (Yaoi)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term used in yaoi or yaoi fan communities to describe the giving or dominant partner in a fictional male-male relationship."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado en las comunidades yaoi o de fans del yaoi para describir a la pareja dadivosa o dominante en una relación ficticia entre dos personas masculinas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die wordt gebruikt in yaoi- of yaoi-fangemeenschappen om de dominante partner in een fictieve man-man-relatie te beschrijven"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som används inom yaoi och yaoi-fandom för att beskriva den givande eller dominanta parten i en fiktiv relation mellan två män."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002217"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001376"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002151"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002152"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001413","dc:identifier":"homoit0001413","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender fathers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres transgénero"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Pères trans"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender vaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpappor"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transfäder"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender people who are fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero que son padres."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes trans qui sont pères."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen die vader zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som är pappor."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001378"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001430"},{"@id":"h