 som är two-spirit-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medicinsk personal som är two-spirit-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hälso- och sjukvårdspersonal som är two-spirit-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who are trained and licensed to provide healthcare services, such as diagnosing, treating, and preventing physical or mental illness. "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people die zijn opgeleid en bevoegd om gezondheidszorg te verlenen, zoals het diagnosticeren, behandelen en voorkomen van lichamelijke of geestelijke ziekten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som är utbildade och i vissa fall legitimerade för att tillhandahålla hälso- och sjukvård, såsom att diagnostisera, behandla och förebygga fysisk eller psykisk sjukdom."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001480"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004483"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004504"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004455"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004483","dc:identifier":"homoit0004483","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit medical doctors"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit artsen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som är läkare"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Two-Spirit medical practitioners"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit medical doctors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited medical doctors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited medical doctors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S medical doctors"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit physicians"},{"@language":"en","