os de las víctimas dos espiritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Slachtofferrechten voor Two-Spirit people"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personers rättigheter som brottsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S victims' rights"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit victims' rights"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited victims' rights"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited victims' rights"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people’s legal rights to be informed, present, and heard within the criminal justice system after having been harmed or injured as the result of of a crime, accident, or other event."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Los derechos legales de las personas dos espíritus a estar informadas, estar presentes y ser escuchadas dentro del sistema de justicia penal después de haber sido perjudicadas o lesionadas como resultado de un delito, una accidente u otro evento."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De wettelijke rechten van Two-Spirit people om te worden geïnformeerd, aanwezig te zijn en gehoord te worden binnen het strafrechtsysteem nadat ze zijn geschaad of gewond zijn geraakt als gevolg van een misdrijf, ongeval of andere gebeurtenis."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personers juridiska rättigheter som brottsoffer att få information, närvara och komma till tals inom rättsväsendet efter att ha utsatts för brott, olycka eller annan händelse som orsakat skada."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001492"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002736"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003224","dc:identifier":"homoit0003224","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pregnant women"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres embarazadas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zwangere vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gravida kvinnor"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Embarazadas"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pregnant people who are women."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas embarazadas que son mujeres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zwangere personen die vrouwen zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gravida personer som är kvinnor."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003364"}],"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85106300"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-05-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004636","dc:identifier":"homoit0004636","skos:prefLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay women"},"rdfs:comment":{"@language":"en","@value":"Women who self-identify as gay. (Please note that the term \"gay\" is typically used in this vocabulary to refer to gay men. Unless the individual(s) in question specifically identify their sexuality as gay, use \"Lesbians\" instead)."},"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-10"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002216","dc:identifier":"homoit0002216","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Women in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mujeres en fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwen in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnor inom fandom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The participation and inclusion of women in fan communities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La participación e inclusión de las mujeres en las comunidades de fans."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De participatie en inclusie van vrouwen in fan-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kvinnors deltagande i och inkludering i fangemenskaper."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002171"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001509"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002711","dc:identifier":"homoit0002711","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga Two-spirit-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S teens"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S youth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit teens"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit youth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited teens"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited youth"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited adolescents"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited teenagers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited teens"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud dos espíritus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes dos espíritus"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes dos espíritus"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who are between the ages of childhood and adulthood."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas dos espíritus que se encuentran entre la infancia y la adultez."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit-people tussen kindertijd en volwassenheid."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer i åldern mellan barndom och vuxenliv."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003473"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003487"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002712"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002151","dc:identifier":"homoit0002151","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"ja","@value":"Bishounen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bishounen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bishōnen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Bishounen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bishounen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Japanese word that means \"beautiful boy\" and is used to describe a particular aesthetic of androgynous male beauty. While in Japanese \"bishounen\" refers specifically to youths under the age of twenty and \"biseinen\" is used to describe beautiful adult men, English-speaking anime and manga fan communities often use \"bishounen\" in reference to any good-looking male character, regardless of age."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Palabra japonesa que significa “niño hermoso” y que se utiliza para describir una estética particular de belleza masculina andrógina. Mientras que en japonés \"bishounen\" se refiere específicamente a jóvenes menores de veinte años y \"biseinen\" se usa para describir hombres adultos hermosos, las comunidades de fanáticos del anime y manga de habla inglesa a menudo usan \"bishounen\" en referencia a cualquier personaje masculino atractivo, independientemente de la edad."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"「美少年」とは、「美しい少年」を意味する日本語の単語であり、中性的な美を持つ男性という特定の美的な意味を表す際に用いられる。日本語では「美少年」は特に20歳未満の若者を指し、「美青年」は美しい成人男性を表すのに対し、英語圏のアニメやマンガのファンコミュニティでは、年齢に関係なく、見た目の良い男性キャラクター全般を指して「美少年」という表現がよく使われる。"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Japanisches Wort, das „schöner Junge“ bedeutet und verwendet wird, um eine bestimmte Ästhetik androgyner männlicher Schönheit zu beschreiben. Während sich „bishōnen“ im Japanischen speziell auf Jugendliche unter zwanzig Jahren bezieht und ‚biseinen‘ zur Beschreibung schöner erwachsener Männer verwendet wird, verwenden englischsprachige Anime- und Manga-Fangemeinden „bishōnen“ häufig in Bezug auf jeden gut aussehenden männlichen Charakter, unabhängig vom Alter."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Japanskt ord som betyder ”vacker pojke” och används för att beskriva en specifik estetik av androgyn manlig skönhet. I japanska används bishounen specifikt för unga män under 20 år, medan biseinen används för att beskriva vackra vuxna män. I engelsktalande anime- och mangagemenskaper används dock bishounen ofta för att referera till vilken snygg manlig karaktär som helst, oavsett ålder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002144"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002152"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002197"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002214"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002489","dc:identifier":"homoit0002489","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual youth "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud demisexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Jugendliche"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga Demisexuella"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes demisexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Teenager:innen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual people between the ages of childhood and adulthood.\r\n"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas demisexuales entre las edades de infancia y la adultez."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Personen im Alter zwischen Kindheit und Erwachsensein."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele personen tussen kindertijd en volwassenheid."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuella personer i åldern mellan barndom och vuxenliv."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002490"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-03-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002509","dc:identifier":"homoit0002509","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Megasexual youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud megasexual"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Megaseksuele jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga Megasexuella"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes megasexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud megasexual"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Megasexual people between the ages of childhood and adulthood.\r\n"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas megasexuales entre las edades de la niñez y la edad adulta."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Megaseksuele personen tussen kindertijd en volwassenheid."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Megasexuella personer mellan barndom och vuxen ålder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002510"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002538","dc:identifier":"homoit0002538","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Greyromantic youth"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juventud grisromántica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Grijsromantische jongeren"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga gråromantiker"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Adolescentes grisrománticos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes grisrománticos"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga greyromantic-personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Greyromantic people between the ages of childhood and adulthood.\r\n"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas grisrománticas entre las edades de la infancia y la edad adulta."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Grijsromantische personen tussen kindertijd en volwassenheid."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gråromantiska personer mellan barndom och vuxen ålder."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002539"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003460","dc:identifier":"homoit0003460","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ youth survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes jóvenes LGBTQ+ de bullying"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-jeugdige overlevenden van pesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga hbtq+-personer som överlevt mobbning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Survivors of bullying (LGBTQ+)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes jóvenes (LGBTQ) de bullying"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga hbtq+-personer som är mobbningsöverlevare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ youth between the ages of 12-18 who have experienced and survived bullying due to their gender or sexual identity. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes LGBTQ+ de entre 12 y 18 años que han sufrido y sobrevivido al acoso debido a su identidad sexual. Siga la preferencia de la persona por \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-jongeren tussen de 12 en 18 jaar die te maken hebben gehad met pesten vanwege hun gender of seksuele identiteit en dit hebben overleefd. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van de persoon voor 'slachtoffers' of 'overlevenden'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-ungdomar mellan 12 och 18 år som har upplevt och överlevt mobbning på grund av sin könsidentitet eller sexuella identitet. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001998"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003461"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003462"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003463"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003464"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003465"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003466"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003467"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003468"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003469"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003470"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003473"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004262"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003474","dc:identifier":"homoit0003474","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ youth victims of bullying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas jóvenes LGBTQ+ de bullying"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-jeugdige slachtoffers van pesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga hbtq+-personer som är mobbningsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas jóvenes (LGBTQ) de bullying"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga hbtq+-personer som överlevt mobbning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ youth between the ages of 12-18 who have experienced bullying due to their gender or sexual identity and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes LGBTQ+ de entre 12 y 18 años que han sufrido acoso debido a su identidad de género o sexual y pueden o no haber sobrevivido. Siga la preferencia de la persona por \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-jongeren tussen de 12 en 18 jaar die te maken hebben gehad met pesten vanwege hun gender of seksuele identiteit en dit al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van de persoon voor 'slachtoffers' of 'overlevenden'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-ungdomar mellan 12 och 18 år som har upplevt mobbning på grund av sin sexuella identitet och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001521"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001989"}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001995"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003475"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003476"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003477"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003478"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003479"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003480"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003481"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003482"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003483"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003484"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003487"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004262"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001520"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002461","dc:identifier":"homoit0002461","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic youth literature "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Jugendliteratur"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes jóvenes arrománticos de bullying"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische jeugdliteratuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantisk ungdomslitteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes arrománticos jóvenes de bullying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes arrománticas jóvenes de bullying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes jóvenes arrománticas de bullying"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantisk YA"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Written literary works for an audience of readers from 12-18 years of age, also known as young adult literature or YA; use in reference to youth literature focusing on aromantic characters or themes.\t\t\t\t"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Literarische Werke, die für eine Leserschaft im Alter von 12 bis 18 Jahren geschrieben werden, auch bekannt als YA (Young Adult); verwenden in Bezug auf Jugendliteratur, die sich auf aromantische Charakteren oder Themen konzentriert."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes arrománticos de entre 12 y 18 años que han sufrido y sobrevivido al acoso debido a su identidad sexual. Siga la preferencia de la persona por \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken voor een lezerspubliek van 12-18 jaar, ook wel young adult literatuur of YA genoemd; gebruik in verwijzing naar jeugdliteratuur gericht op aromantische personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk för läsare mellan 12 och 18 år, även kallat YA. Används för ungdomslitteratur med aromantiska karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001522"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002460"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-03-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002478","dc:identifier":"homoit0002478","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual youth literature"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura juvenil asexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Jugendliteratur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele jeugdliteratuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuell ungdomslitteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Jugendliteratur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuell YA"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Written literary works for an audience of readers from 12-18 years of age, also known as young adult literature or YA; use in reference to youth literature focusing on asexual characters or themes.\t\t\t\t"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas para una audiencia de lectores de 12 a 18 años de edad, también conocida como literatura para adultos jóvenes o YA; utilícese en referencia a la literatura juvenil que se centra en personajes o temas asexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Literarische Werke, die für eine Leserschaft im Alter von 12 bis 18 Jahren geschrieben werden, auch bekannt als YA (Young Adult); verwenden in Bezug auf Jugendliteratur, die sich auf asexuelle Charakteren oder Themen konzentriert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken voor een lezerspubliek van 12-18 jaar, ook wel jong volwassenen literatuur genoemd; gebruik met verwijzing naar jeugdliteratuur gericht op aseksuele personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk för läsare mellan 12 och 18 år, även kallat YA. Används för ungdomslitteratur med fokus på asexuella karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001522"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002292"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-03-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002490","dc:identifier":"homoit0002490","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual youth literature "},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura juvenil demisexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Jugendliteratur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele jeugdliteratuur"},{"@language":"sv","@val