escritas para una audiencia de lectores de 12 a 18 años de edad, también conocidas como literatura para adultos jóvenes o YA (por sus siglas en inglés); utilícese en referencia a la literatura juvenil que se centra en personajes o temas intersex."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken voor een lezerspubliek van 12-18 jaar, ook wel young adult literatuur of YA genoemd; gebruik in verwijzing naar jeugdliteratuur gericht op intersekse personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk för läsare mellan 12 och 18 år, även kallat YA. Används för ungdomslitteratur med fokus på intersexkaraktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001522"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002750"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-09-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002712","dc:identifier":"homoit0002712","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit youth literature"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Literatura juvenil dos espíritus"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit jeugdliteratuur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-ungdomslitteratur"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S youth literature"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit youth literature"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited youth literature"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited youth literature"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two Spirit jeugdliteratuur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two Spirited jeugdliteratuur"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirited jeugdliteratuur"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Written literary works for an audience of readers from 12-18 years of age, also known as young adult literature or YA; use in reference to youth literature focusing on Two-Spirit characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras literarias escritas para una audiencia de lectores de 12 a 18 años de edad, también conocida como literatura para adultos jóvenes o YA; utilícese en referencia a la literatura juvenil que se centra en personajes o temas dos espíritus "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven literaire werken voor een lezerspubliek van 12 tot 18 jaar, ook bekend als young adult-literatuur of YA; gebruik met betrekking tot jeugdliteratuur die zich richt op Two-Spirit-personages of -thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Litterära verk för läsare mellan 12 och 18 år, även kallat YA. Används för ungdomslitteratur med fokus på Two-spirit-personer eller Two-spirit-teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002710"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001522"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002711"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002710"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001650","dc:identifier":"homoit0001650","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Compulsory monogamy"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Monogamia obligatoria"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zwangsmonogamie"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dwangmatige monogamie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tvingande monogami"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The assumption that all people share a desire for monogamous relationships and that this is a preferential life goal."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La suposición de que todas las personas comparten el deseo de tener relaciones monógamas y que este es un objetivo preferencial en la vida."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Annahme, dass alle Menschen den Wunsch nach monogamen Beziehungen teilen und dass dies ein bevorzugtes Lebensziel ist."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De veronderstelling dat alle mensen een verlangen naar monogame relaties delen en dat dit een voorkeursdoel in het leven is."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antagandet att alla människor har en önskan om monogama relationer och att detta är ett föredraget livsmål."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001532"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001535"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001636"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001916"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001650"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/compulsoryMonogamy"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004229","dc:identifier":"homoit0004229","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people with alcohol use disorders"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people met een stoornis in alcoholgebruik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer med alkoholbrukssyndrom"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit alcoholics"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people with alcoholism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit people with alcohol use disorders"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited people with alcohol use disorders"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited people with alcohol use disorders"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S people with alcohol use disorders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkoholberoende hos Two-spirit-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkoholmissbruk hos Two-spirit-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Alkoholmissbrukande Two-spirit-personer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer med alkoholberoende"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer med alkoholmissbruk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som lever i alkoholberoende"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som lever i alkoholmissbruk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som missbrukar alkohol"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som är beroende av alkohol"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who have been diagnosed with or regard themselves as having an alcohol use disorder, a medical condition that involves a pattern of alcohol use that is difficult to control, negatively impacts the individual's life, and results in withdrawal symptoms upon cessation. Only use to refer to individuals who describe themselves as having an alcohol use disorder. Follow the individual's preference for \"use disorder\" or \"addiction\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people bij wie de diagnose stoornis in het gebruik van alcohol is vastgesteld of die zichzelf als zodanig beschouwen; een medische aandoening die gepaard gaat met een moeilijk te beheersen patroon van alcoholgebruik, een negatieve invloed heeft op het leven van de persoon en leidt tot ontwenningsverschijnselen bij het stoppen. Alleen gebruiken om te verwijzen naar personen die zichzelf beschrijven als iemand met een alcoholverslaving. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"gebruiksstoornis\" of \"verslaving\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som har diagnostiserats med eller själva uppfattar sig ha ett alkoholbrukssyndrom, ett medicinskt tillstånd som innebär ett alkoholanvändande som är svårt att kontrollera, påverkar individens liv negativt och kan leda till abstinenssymtom vid avbrott. Används endast för personer som själva beskriver sig som att de har ett alkoholbrukssyndrom. Följ individens eget språkbruk när det gäller om de föredrar att använda termen alkoholbrukssyndrom eller beroende."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004225"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004228"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001540"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001660","dc:identifier":"homoit0001660","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-monogamous people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no monógamas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-monogame personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickemonogama personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who practice romantic or sexual relationships with more than one person simultaneously."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que practican relaciones románticas o sexuales con más de una persona simultáneamente."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mensen die romantische of seksuele relaties aangaan met meer dan één persoon tegelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har och/eller är öppna för romantiska eller sexuella relationer med flera personer samtidigt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001637"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001554"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001645"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001657"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001662"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001663"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001665"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003229"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001637"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/nonMonogamousPeople"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-06-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001638","dc:identifier":"homoit0001638","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Secondary partners"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Parejas secundarias"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Secundaire partners"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sekundärpartner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term used in hierarchical polyamory to refer to partners whose interests and desires come second to those of the primary partner(s)."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un término utilizado en el poliamor jerárquico para referirse a parejas cuyos intereses y deseos son secundarios a los de la(s) pareja(s) principal(es)."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die in hiërarchische polyamorie wordt gebruikt om te verwijzen naar de partner wiens interesses en verlangens ondergeschikt zijn aan die van de primaire partner(s)."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En term som används inom hierarkiska polyamorösa sammanhang för att beskriva en eller flera partners vars intressen och önskemål kommer i andra hand jämfört med en eller flera primära partners."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002365"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001554"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001629"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001635"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001662"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002365"},"dc:replaces":{"@id":"http://homosaurus.org/v2/secondaryPartners"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002426","dc:identifier":"homoit0002426","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Demisexual horror fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción de horror demisexual"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Demisexuelle Horror-Fiction"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Demiseksuele horrorverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Demisexuell skräck"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of written works that intend to frighten, scare, or disgust. Use for horror fiction focusing on demisexual characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Obras de ficción escritas con la intención de asustar, atemorizar o provocar disgusto; utilícese en referencia a la ficción de horror centrada en personajes o temas demisexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Fiktionale Werke, die erschrecken, ängstigen oder abstoßen sollen; Verwendung in Bezug auf fiktionale Werke, die sich auf demisexuelle Charaktere oder Themen konzentrieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Geschreven fictiewerken bedoeld om angst aan te jagen, bang te maken of walging te veroorzaken; gebruik om te verwijzen naar horrorfictie gericht op demiseksuele personages of thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skönlitterära verk skrivna för att skrämma, oroa eller äckla. Används för skräcklitteratur med demisexuella karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001580"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002407"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-01-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002427","dc:identifier":"homoit0002427","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic horror fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción de horror aromántica"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Horror-Fiction"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische horrorverhalen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantisk skräck"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Genre of writt