sonas; utilícese para autobiografías escritas por autores gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Berichte über das Leben schwuler Männer, die von diesen Personen geschrieben wurden. Für schriftliche Berichte über das Leben schwuler Männer, die nicht von der betreffenden Person verfasst wurden, wird „Schwule Biografien“ verwendet."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verslagen van het leven van homomannen, geschreven door die personen. Voor geschreven verslagen van het leven van homomannen die niet door het onderwerp zijn geschreven, gebruik \"Homo-biografieën.\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skildringar av bögars liv skrivna av dem själva. För skildringar av bögars liv som inte är skrivna av personen själv, använd termen ”Biografier om bögar”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001729"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001616"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001725"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001729"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-11-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001732","dc:identifier":"homoit0001732","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual autobiographies"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Autobiografías bisexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Autobiografien"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele autobiografieën"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella självbiografier"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual autobios"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual memoirs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Memoiren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele memoires"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Accounts of bisexual peoples' lives written by those people. For written accounts of bisexual people's lives that were not written by the sub