ividu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som har upplevt mobbning på grund av sin könsidentitet eller sexuella identitet och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001989"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0004424","dc:identifier":"homoit0004424","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary victims of bullying"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire slachtoffers van pesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära mobbningsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary victims of bullying"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära som utsatts för mobbning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who have experienced bullying due to their gender identity and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die pesten hebben meegemaakt vanwege hun gender of seksuele identiteit en het al dan niet hebben overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som har upplevt mobbning på grund av sin könsidentitet eller sexuella identitet och som kan ha överlevt eller inte. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001989"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-02-24"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003487","dc:identifier":"homoit0003487","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit youth victims of bullying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Víctimas jóvenes dos espíritus de bullying"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit jeugdige slachtoffers van pesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga Two-spirit-personer som är mobbningsoffer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S youth victims of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited youth victims of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit youth victims of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited youth victims of bullying"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga Two-spirit-personer som utsatts för mobbning"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit youth between the ages of 12-18 who have experienced bullying due to their gender or sexual identity and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes transgénero de entre 12 y 18 años que han sufrido acoso debido a su identidad sexual y que pueden o no haber sobrevivido. Siga la preferencia de la persona por \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit jongeren in de leeftijd van 12 tot 18 jaar die te maken hebben gehad met pesten vanwege hun gender of seksuele identiteit en dit mogelijk hebben overleefd. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van de persoon voor 'slachtoffers' of 'overlevenden'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-ungdomar mellan 12 och 18 år som har upplevt och överlevt mobbning på grund av sin könsidentitet eller sexuella identitet. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001997"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002711"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001989"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003474"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002006","dc:identifier":"homoit0002006","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes dos espíritus de acoso"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes bispirituelles survivantes d'intimidation"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit overlevenden van pesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som överlevt mobbning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som är mobbningsöverlevare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who have experienced and survived bullying due to their gender or sexual identity; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas dos espíritus que han sufrido y sobrevivido al acoso por su identidad sexual; siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"víctimas\" o \"supervivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Personnes bispirituelles qui ont subi et survécu à de l'intimidation parce qu'elles sont bispirituelles; respecter la préférence de la personne concernée entre les termes 