teit; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"slachtoffers\" of \"overlevenden\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som har upplevt och överlevt mobbning på grund av sin könsidentitet eller sexuella identitet. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001998"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003473","dc:identifier":"homoit0003473","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit youth survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sobrevivientes jóvenes dos espíritus de bullying"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit jeugdige overlevenden van pesten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga Two-spirit-personer som överlevt mobbning"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S youth survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited youth survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit youth survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited youth survivors of bullying"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Unga Two-spirit-personer som mobbningsöverlevare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit youth between the ages of 12-18 who have experienced and survived bullying due to their gender or sexual identity; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Jóvenes dos espíritus de entre 12 y 18 años que han sufrido y sobrevivido al acoso debido a su identidad sexual. Siga la preferencia de la persona por \"víctimas\" o \"sobrevivientes\" siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit-jongeren tussen de 12 en 18 jaar die te maken hebben gehad met pesten vanwege hun gender of seksuele identiteit en dit hebben overleefd. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van de persoon voor 'slachtoffers' of 'overlevenden'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-ungdomar mellan 12 och 18 år som har upplevt och överlevt mobbning på grund av sin könsidentitet eller sexuella identitet. Följ individens preferens för att använda ”offer” eller ”överlevare” när det är möjligt."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002006"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002711"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003460"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-31"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002008","dc:identifier":"homoit0002008","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chicano/a/x lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas chicanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chicanx-Lesben"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chicano/a/x lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska chicano/a/x-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chicana lesbians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Chicano lesbians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Chicanx lesbians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Chicanas"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Chicanos"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Chicanx people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Chicanxs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Chicanas lesbianas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chicanx lesbische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbische Chicanxs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Chicana-Lesben"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbische Chicanas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chicano lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Chica