uit Arabische landen komen, Arabisch spreken en/of afstammen van Arabische volkeren. Niet verwarren met moslimidentiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som kommer från arabvärlden och/eller har arabiskt ursprung. Ska inte förväxlas med muslimer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002009"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002016","dc:identifier":"homoit0002016","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arab intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales árabes"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Arabische inter* Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Arabische intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arabiska intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex Arab people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex Arabs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas árabes intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Árabes intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex árabes"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* arabische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Araber:innen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse Arabische personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people who are from Arab countries and/or are descended from Arab peoples. Do not conflate with Muslim people."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales que son de países árabes, hablan árabe y/o son descendientes de pueblos árabes. No se debe confundir con personas musulmanas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Personen, die aus arabischen Ländern kommen und/oder von arabischen Völkern abstammen. Nicht mit muslimischen Menschen gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen die uit Arabische landen komen, Arabisch spreken en/of afstammen van Arabische volkeren. Niet verwarren met moslimidentiteit"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som kommer från arabvärlden och/eller har arabiskt ursprung. Ska inte förväxlas med muslimer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002009"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003277","dc:identifier":"homoit0003277","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arab non-binary people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Arabische nichtbinäre Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarixs árabes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Arabische non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära araber"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arab nonbinary people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Arab people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Arabs"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Arab people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Arabs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Nicht-binäre arabische Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas árabes no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Árabes no binarixs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire Arabieren"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Arabieren"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are from Arab countries and/or are descended from Arab peoples. Do not conflate with Muslim people."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Arabische nichtbinäre Personen, die aus arabischen Ländern kommen und/oder von arabischen Völkern abstammen. Nicht mit muslimischen Menschen gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias que son de países árabes, hablan árabe y/o son descendientes de pueblos árabes. No se debe confundir con personas musulmanas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die afkomstig zijn uit Arabische landen en/of afstammen van Arabische volkeren. Niet verwarren met moslims."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som kommer från arabvärlden och/eller har arabiskt ursprung. Ska inte förväxlas med muslimer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002009"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-06-10"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003382","dc:identifier":"homoit0003382","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arab American LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Arabisch-amerikanische LGBTQ+-Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ árabes estadounidenses"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Arabisch-Amerikaanse LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arabamerikanska hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arab American people (LGBTQ"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Arab Americans (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Arab Americans"},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+-arabisch-amerikanische Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas árabes estadounidenses LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Árabes estadounidenses LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas (LGBTQ) árabes estadounidenses"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas árabes estadounidenses (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Árabes estadounidenses (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+ Arabisch-Amerikanen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who are descended from Arab peoples and were born in the United States, or LGBTQ+ people born in Arab countries who live in or have a strong connection to the United States. Do not conflate with Muslim people."},{"@language":"de","@value":"LGBTQ+-Personen, die von arabischen Völkern abstammen und in den Vereinigten Staaten geboren wurden, oder LGBTQ+-Personen, die in arabischen Ländern geboren wurden und in den Vereinigten Staaten leben oder eine starke Verbindung zu diesen haben. Nicht zu verwechseln mit muslimischen Menschen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que descienden de pueblos árabes y nacieron en los Estados Unidos, o personas LGBTQ+ nacidas en países árabes que viven o tienen una fuerte conexión con los Estados Unidos. No se debe confundir con personas musulmanas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die afstammen van Arabische volkeren en geboren zijn in de Verenigde Staten, of LHBTQ+-personen die geboren zijn in Arabische landen en die in de Verenigde Staten wonen of er een sterke band mee hebben. Niet te verwarren met moslims."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som har arabiskt ursprung och är födda i USA, eller hbtq+-personer födda i arabvärlden som bor i eller har en stark koppling till USA. Ska inte förväxlas med muslimer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002009"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003383"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003384"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003385"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003386"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003387"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003388"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003389"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003390"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003391"}],"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2014002555"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003392","dc:identifier":"homoit0003392","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Arab aromantic people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Arabische aromantische Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas arrománticas árabes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Arabische aromantische personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arabiska aromantiker"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic Arab people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic Arabs"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische arabische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Araber:innen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas árabes arrománticas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Árabes arrománticos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Árabes arrománticas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aromantic people who are from Arab countries and/or are descended from Arab peoples. Do not conflate with Muslim people."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aromantische Personen, die aus arabischen Ländern kommen und/oder von arabischen Völkern abstammen. Nicht mit muslimischen Menschen gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas arrománticas que son de países árabes, hablan árabe y/o son descendientes de pueblos árabes. No se debe confundir con personas musulmanas."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aromantische personen die uit Arabische landen komen en/of afstammen van Arabische volkeren. Niet verwarren met moslims."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aromantiska personer som kommer från arabvärlden och/eller har arabiskt ursprung. Ska inte förväxlas med muslimer."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002009"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002023","dc:identifier":"homoit0002023","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas hispanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische Lesben"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Hispanics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hispanas lesbianas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesbische hispanische Frauen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que hablan español, son de países de habla hispana y/o descienden de culturas de habla hispana; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como hispanas. No debe combinarse con Latino/a/x o Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Lesben, die aus Spanien oder ehemals von Spanien kolonisierten, überwiegend spanischsprachigen Regionen kommen oder von dort abstammen. Nur für Personen verwenden, die sich selbst als „hispanisch» bezeichnen; nicht mit „Latino/a/x“ oder „Chicano/a/x“ gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002024","dc:identifier":"homoit0002024","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay hispanos"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische schwule Männer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Hispanic men"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Hispanics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres hispanos gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hispanos gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule hispanische Männer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische Schwul"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que hablan español, son de países de habla hispana y/o descienden de culturas de habla hispana; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como hispanas. No debe combinarse con Latino/a/x o Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die aus Spanien oder ehemals von Spanien kolonisierten, überwiegend spanischsprachigen Regionen kommen oder von dort abstammen. Nur für Personen verwenden, die sich selbst als „hispanisch» bezeichnen; nicht mit „Latino/a/x“ oder „Chicano/a/x“ gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002025","dc:identifier":"homoit0002025","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic bisexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales hispanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische bisexuelle Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic biseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual Hispanic people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual Hispanics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Bisexuales hispanos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas hispanas bisexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle hispanische Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische Bisexuelle"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic biseksuelen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual people who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales que hablan español, son de países de habla hispana y/o descienden de culturas de habla hispana; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como hispanas. No debe combinarse con Latino/a/x o Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Personen, die aus Spanien oder ehemals von Spanien kolonisierten, überwiegend spanischsprachigen Regionen kommen oder von dort abstammen. Nur für Personen verwenden, die sich selbst als „hispanisch» bezeichnen; nicht mit „Latino/a/x“ oder „Chicano/a/x“ gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002026","dc:identifier":"homoit0002026","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic transgender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero hispanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische trans Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic transgender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som är hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender Hispanic people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender Hispanics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas hispanas transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hispanos transgénero"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans people who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero que hablan español, son de países de habla hispana y/o descienden de culturas de habla hispana; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como hispanas. No debe combinarse con Latino/a/x o Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Trans Personen, die aus Spanien oder ehemals von Spanien kolonisierten, überwiegend spanischsprachigen Regionen kommen oder von dort abstammen. Nur für Personen verwenden, die sich selbst als „hispanisch» bezeichnen; nicht mit „Latino/a/x“ oder „Chicano/a/x“ gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002027","dc:identifier":"homoit0002027","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic queer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer hispanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische queere Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic queer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer Hispanic people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer Hispanics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer hispanas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hispanos queer"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische Queers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Queere hispanische Personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que hablan español, son de países de habla hispana y/o descienden de culturas de habla hispana; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como hispanas. No debe combinarse con Latino/a/x o Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Queere Personen, die aus Spanien oder ehemals von Spanien kolonisierten, überwiegend spanischsprachigen Regionen kommen oder von dort abstammen. Nur für Personen verwenden, die sich selbst als „hispanisch» bezeichnen; nicht mit „Latino/a/x“ oder „Chicano/a/x“ gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002028","dc:identifier":"homoit0002028","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales hispanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Hispanische inter* Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som är hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex Hispanic people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex Hispanics"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Intersex hispanas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas hispanas intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex hispanas"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* hispanische Personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales que hablan español, son de países de habla hispana y/o descienden de culturas de habla hispana; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como hispanas. No debe combinarse con Latino/a/x o Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Personen, die aus Spanien oder ehemals von Spanien kolonisierten, überwiegend spanischsprachigen Regionen kommen oder von dort abstammen. Nur für Personen verwenden, die sich selbst als „hispanisch» bezeichnen; nicht mit „Latino/a/x“ oder „Chicano/a/x“ gleichsetzen."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-16"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003818","dc:identifier":"homoit0003818","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic non-binary people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic nonbinary people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Hispanic people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Hispanic people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Hispanics"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Hispanics"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire Hispanics"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Hispanics"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-11-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003819","dc:identifier":"homoit0003819","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic asexual people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella hispanic"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual Hispanic people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual Hispanics"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who are from or descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje werden gekoloniseerd en die voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som kommer från eller härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanic och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-11-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003827","dc:identifier":"homoit0003827","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic American LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic-Amerikaanse LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-person som är hispanoamerikaner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic Americans (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic American people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Hispanic Americans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Hispanic American people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic-Amerikanen (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-Hispanic-Amerikanen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who were born in or currently reside in the United States and are descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic American; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LGBTQ+-personen die geboren zijn in of momenteel wonen in de Verenigde Staten en afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje gekoloniseerd werden en voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic American; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är födda i eller bosatta i USA och som härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanoamerikaner och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002022"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003828"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003829"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003830"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003831"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003832"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003833"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003834"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003835"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002036","dc:identifier":"homoit0002036","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people in the workplace"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Personen am Arbeitsplatz"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales en el lugar trabajo"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen op de werkvloer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arbetslivsvillkor för intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Inter* Menschen am Arbeitsplatz"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex en el lugar trabajo"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The presence of intersex people in the workplace, including acceptance of and issues faced by intersex workers."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Präsenz von inter* Menschen am Arbeitsplatz, einschließlich der Akzeptanz von und der Probleme mit inter* Arbeitnehmenden."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La presencia de personas intersex en el lugar de trabajo, incluida la aceptación de los trabajadores intersex y los problemas a los que se enfrentan."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De aanwezigheid van intersekse personen op de werkplek, inclusief acceptatie van en problemen waarmee intersekse werknemers worden geconfronteerd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoners situation på arbetsplatsen, inklusive acceptans, bemötande och villkor i arbetslivet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002029"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001717"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002037","dc:identifier":"homoit0002037","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people in the workplace"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales en el lugar de trabajo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Personen am Arbeitsplatz"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen op de werkvloer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Arbetslivsvillkor för asexuella"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Personen am Arbeitsplatz"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Aces am Arbeisplatz"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The presence of asexual people in the workplace, including acceptance of and issues faced by asexual workers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La presencia de personas asexuales en el lugar de trabajo, incluida la aceptación de los trabajadores asexuales y los problemas a los que se enfrentan."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Präsenz asexueller Menschen am Arbeitsplatz, einschließlich der Akzeptanz von und der Probleme mit asexuellen Arbeitnehmenden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De aanwezigheid van aseksuele personen op de werkplek, inclusief acceptatie van en problemen waarmee aseksuele werknemers worden geconfronteerd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personers situation på arbetsplatsen, inklusive acceptans, bemötande och villkor i arbetslivet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002029"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001717"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002194","dc:identifier":"homoit0002194","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Racism in fandom"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Racismo en fandom"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Racisme in fandom"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rasism inom fandom"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Issues and discussions about the presence of racism in fan spaces and works."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cuestiones y discusiones sobre la presencia del racismo en espacios y obras de fans."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kwesties en discussies over de aanwezigheid van racisme in fan-ruimtes en uitingen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Frågor och diskussioner om förekomst av rasism i fangemenskaper och fanverk."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002156"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002174"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002183"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002212"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-07-04"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003692","dc:identifier":"homoit0003692","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Redlining"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Redlining"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Redlining"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Red lining"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Credit card redlining"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Roodlijnen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A discriminatory practice in which financial services are withheld from neighborhoods that have significant numbers of racial and ethnic minorities. Redlining includes but is not limited to denial of credit, insurance, and healthcare; inflated mortgage and interest rates; and the development of food deserts. The term has its roots in the New Deal when color-coded maps were made of metropolitan areas in the United States to indicate where it was considered safe to insure mortgages. Black neighborhoods and surrounding areas were colored red to indicate mortgages should not be insured there."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een discriminerende praktijk waarbij financiële diensten worden onthouden aan buurten met een groot aantal raciale en etnische minderheden. Redlining omvat, maar is niet beperkt tot, het weigeren van krediet, verzekeringen en gezondheidszorg; hogere hypotheek- en rentetarieven; en de ontwikkeling van voedselwoestijnen. De term vindt zijn oorsprong in de New Deal toen er kleurgecodeerde kaarten werden gemaakt van grootstedelijke gebieden in de Verenigde Staten om aan te geven waar het veilig werd geacht om hypotheken te verzekeren. Zwarte buurten en omliggende gebieden werden rood gekleurd om aan te geven dat hypotheken daar niet verzekerd mochten worden."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En diskriminerande praktik där finansiella tjänster nekas områden med många invånare från rasifierade eller etniska minoriteter. Redlining omfattar bland annat nekad kredit, försäkring och sjukvård, höga räntor samt skapande av områden utan tillgång till matbutiker. Termen kommer från New Deal-eran, då kartor färgkodades för att visa var det var ”säkert” att försäkra bostadslån. Svarta områden markerades i rött för att indikera att lån inte borde beviljas där."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002257"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002038"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003691"}],"skos:closeMatch":[{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85038399"},{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85038383"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003692"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-22"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002040","dc:identifier":"homoit0002040","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Female gaze"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Female Gaze"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mirada femenina"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vrouwelijke blik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den kvinnliga blicken"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"de","@value":"Weiblicher Blick"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Female gaze"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Perspectiva femenina"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term used to describe the depiction of women in media and the arts as subjects with agency and whose perspective a text may be presented from. Often used in contrast to the male gaze."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Begriff, der die Darstellung von Frauen in Medien und Kunst als handlungsfähige Subjekte beschreibt, aus deren Perspektive ein Werk erzählt oder dargestellt werden kann. Wird oft im Gegensatz zum „Male Gaze“ verwendet."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la representación de las mujeres en los medios y las artes como sujetos con agencia y desde cuya perspectiva se puede presentar un texto. A menudo, se utiliza en contraste a la mirada masculina."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die wordt gebruikt om de afbeelding van vrouwen in de media en de kunsten te beschrijven als subjecten met keuzevrijheid en vanuit wiens perspectief de tekst wordt gepresenteerd. Vaak gebruikt in tegenstelling tot de mannelijke blik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En term som används för att beskriva hur kvinnor porträtteras i medier och konst som subjekt med egen vilja och perspektiv. Används ofta i kontrast till den manliga blicken."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002039"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002042"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002041","dc:identifier":"homoit0002041","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Male gaze"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mirada masculina"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Regard masculin"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Mannelijke blik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den manliga blicken"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Male gaze"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Perspectiva masculina"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Vision masculine"},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Male gaze"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A term used to describe the sexualized and objectified depiction of women in media and the arts from the perspective of and for the pleasure of the heterosexual man/male viewer. Originally used solely to describe the heterosexual, cisgender gaze but has since been expanded."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término utilizado para describir la representación sexualizada y cosificada de las mujeres en los medios y las artes desde la perspectiva y para el placer hombre heterosexual/espectador masculino. Originalmente se utilizaba únicamente para describir la mirada heterosexual y cisgénero, pero desde entonces se ha ampliado."},{"@language":"fr","@value":"Concept postulant que les représentations des femmes dans les médias et les arts sont objectifiées et sexualisées du point de vue et pour le plaisir de l'homme hétérosexuel. À l'origine, ce terme était uniquement utilisé pour décrire le regard hétérosexuel et cisgenre, mais il a été élargi depuis."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een term die wordt gebruikt om de geseksualiseerde en geobjectiveerde weergave van vrouwen in de media en de kunsten te beschrijven vanuit het perspectief van en voor het plezier van de heteroseksuele man/mannelijke kijker. Oorspronkelijk alleen gebruikt om de heteroseksuele, cisgender-blik te beschrijven, maar is sindsdien uitgebreid"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En term som används för att beskriva sexualiserade och objektifierande framställningar av kvinnor i medier och konst, ur ett manligt, heterosexuellt perspektiv och till för den manliga betraktaren. Termen användes ursprungligen enbart för den heterosexuella, ciskönade blicken men har sedan dess breddats."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002039"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002042"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001365"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002045","dc:identifier":"homoit0002045","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas sudasiáticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska lesbiska"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian South Asian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian South Asians"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que pertenecen a o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbiennes die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002046","dc:identifier":"homoit0002046","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay sudasiáticos"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay South Asian men"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay South Asians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres sudasiáticos gay"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que a pertenecen o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002047","dc:identifier":"homoit0002047","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian bisexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales sudasiáticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische biseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska bisexuella personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual South Asian men"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual South Asians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sudasiáticas bisexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische biseksuelen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual people who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales que a pertenecen o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele personen die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002048","dc:identifier":"homoit0002048","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian queer people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer sudasiáticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische queer personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska queera personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer South Asian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer South Asians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sudasiáticos queer"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sudasiáticas queer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que pertenecen a o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002049","dc:identifier":"homoit0002049","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales sudasiáticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex South Asian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex South Asians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersex sudasiáticas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex people who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas intersexuales que pertenecen a o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse personen die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpersoner som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002050","dc:identifier":"homoit0002050","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian transgender people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero sudasiáticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische transgender personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska transpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender South Asian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender South Asians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sudasiáticos transgénero"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sudasiáticas transgénero"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender people who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero que pertenecen a o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002051","dc:identifier":"homoit0002051","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales sudasiáticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska asexuella personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual South Asian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual South Asians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sudasiáticas asexuales"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que pertenecen a o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002052","dc:identifier":"homoit0002052","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indian LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ indias"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Indiase LHBTQ+-personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Indiska hbtq+-personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indian LGBTQ+ people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Indian people (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Indians (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ Indians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ de la India"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas indias LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+ Indiërs"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people who were born in India or are of Indian descent. Do not conflate with the Indigenous peoples of the United States."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ que nacieron en la India o son de ascendencia india. No se debe confundir con los pueblos indígenas de los Estados Unidos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen die in India zijn geboren of van Indiase afkomst zijn. Niet verwarren met inheemse volkeren op het Amerikaanse continent"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer som är födda i Indien eller har indisk bakgrund."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002053"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002054"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002055"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002056"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002057"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002058"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002059"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003426","dc:identifier":"homoit0003426","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian non-binary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarixs sudasiáticxs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sydasiatiska ickebinära personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary South Asian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary South Asians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary South Asian people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary South Asians"},{"@language":"en","@value":"South Asian nonbinary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas sudasiáticas no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias sudasiáticas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire Zuid-Aziatische personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Zuid-Aziaten"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Zuid-Aziatische personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zuid-Aziatische nonbinaire personen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who belong to or are descended from the ethnolinguistic groups of South Asia."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias que pertenecen a o descienden de los grupos etnolingüísticos del sur de Asia."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die behoren tot of afstammen van de etnolinguïstische groepen van Zuid-Azië."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som tillhör eller härstammar från Sydasiens etnolingvistiska grupper (etnisk och språklig grupp)."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002044"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002053","dc:identifier":"homoit0002053","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indian lesbians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas indias"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Indiase lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska indier"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Indians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas de India"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Indias lesbianas"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who were born in India or are of Indian descent. Do not conflate with the Indigenous peoples of the United States."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que nacieron en la India o son de ascendencia india. No se debe confundir con los pueblos indígenas de los Estados Unidos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die in India zijn geboren of van Indiase afkomst zijn. Niet te verwarren met de inheemse volkeren op het Amerikaanse continent"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som är födda i Indien eller har indisk bakgrund."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002052"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-06-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002054","dc:identifier":"homoit0002054","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Indian gay men"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay indios"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Indiase homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Indiska bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Indian men"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Indians"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay de India"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Indios gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Indiska homosexuella män"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who were born in India or are of Indian descent. Do not conflate with the Indigenous peoples of the United States."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que nacieron en la India o son de ascendencia india. No se debe confundir con los pueblos indígenas de los Estados Unidos."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die in India zijn geboren of van