"@value":"Transpersoner som är kutchi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender Kutchi people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas kutchi transgénero"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender people who are from or are descended from those native to the  the Kutch district of the Indian state of Gujarat and the Sindh region of Pakistan."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas transgénero que pertenecen a o son descendientes de las personas nativas del distrito Konkan del estado indio de Guyarat y la región Sind de Pakistán."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van de oorspronkelijke bewoners in het Kutch-district van de Indiase deelstaat Gujarat en de Sindh-regio van Pakistan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transpersoner som kommer från eller härstammar från Kutchdistriktet i indiska Gujarat och Sindhregionen i Pakistan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002319"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002326","dc:identifier":"homoit0002326","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kutchi asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales kutchi"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kutchi aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella kutchi"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual Kutchi people"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who are from or are descended from those native to the  Kutch district of the Indian state of Gujarat and the Sindh region of Pakistan."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que pertenecen a o son descendientes de las personas nativas del distrito Konkan del estado indio de Guyarat y la región Sind de Pakistán."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die afkomstig zijn uit of afstammen van de oorspronkelijke bewoners in het Kutch-district van de Indiase deelstaat Gujarat en de Sindh-regio van Pakistan."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som kommer från eller härstammar från Kutchdistriktet i indiska Gujarat och Sindhregionen i Pakistan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002319"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003418","dc:identifier":"homoit0003418","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kutchi non-binary people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias kutchis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Kutchi non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära kutchi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Kutchi nonbinary people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary Kutchi people"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary Kutchi people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas kutchis no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Kutchis no binarixs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"No binarixs kutchis"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire Kutchi's"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Nonbinaire Kutchi's"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary people who are from or are descended from those native to the Kutch district of the Indian state of Gujarat and the Sindh region of Pakistan."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas no binarias que pertenecen a o son descendientes de las personas nativas del distrito Konkan del estado indio de Guyarat y la región Sind de Pakistán."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire personen die afkomstig zijn uit het district Kutch in de Indiase deelstaat Gujarat en de regio Sindh in Pakistan, of daarvan afstammen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinära personer som kommer från eller härstammar från Kutchdistriktet i indiska Gujarat och Sindhregionen i Pakistan."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002319"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002328","dc:identifier":"homoit0002328","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian cinema"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cine lésbico"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische cinema"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk film"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian film"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term that encompasses lesbian filmmaking, the lesbian film industry, and film as an art form within lesbian culture. For specific movies created by or representing lesbians, use the term \"Lesbian films.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término que abarca el cine lésbico, la industria cinematográfica lésbica y el cine como forma de arte dentro de la cultura lésbica. Para películas específicas creadas por lesbianas o que las representen, utilícese el término \"películas de lesbianas\"."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die het maken van lesbische films, de lesbische filmindustrie en film als kunstvorm binnen de lesbische cultuur omvat. Gebruik de term 'lesbische films' voor specifieke films gemaakt door of die lesbische vrouwen representeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som omfattar lesbiskas filmskapande, filmindustrin och filmen som konstform inom lesbisk kultur. För specifika filmer skapade av eller som representerar lesbiska, använd termen ”Filmer om lesbiska”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002327"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002329"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002330","dc:identifier":"homoit0002330","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay cinema"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cine gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwules Kino"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-cinema"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögfilm"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay film"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Filmes gay"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Películas gay"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayfilm"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Term that encompasses gay filmmaking, the gay film industry, and film as an art form within gay culture. For specific movies created by or representing gay men, use the term \"Gay films.\""},{"@language":"es","@value":"Término que abarca el cine gay, la industria cinematográfica gay y el cine como forma de arte dentro de la cultura gay. Para películas específicas creadas por o que representan a hombres gay, utilice el término \"películas gay\"."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Begriff, der schwules Filmschaffen, die schwule Filmindustrie und Film als Kunstform innerhalb der schwulen Kultur umfasst. Für spezifische Filme, die von oder über schwule Männer geschaffen wurden, ist der Begriff „Schwule Filme\" zu verwenden."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Term die het maken van homofilms, de homofilmindustrie en film als kunstvorm binnen de homocultuur omvat. Gebruik de term 'homofilms' voor specifieke films die zijn gemaakt door of die homomannen representeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term som omfattar bögars filmskapande, filmindustrin och filmen som konstform inom bögkultur. För specifika filmer skapade av eller som representerar bögar, använd termen ”Bögfilmer”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002327"},"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002331"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002333","dc:identifier":"homoit0002333","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people of the African diaspora"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ de la diáspora africana"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen uit de Afrikaanse diaspora"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer inom den afrikanska diasporan"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer från den afrikanska diasporan"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ people of native African ancestry living outside of the continent of Africa. While this term is commonly used to describe descendants of Africans who were enslaved and forcibly transported to the Americas via the transatlantic slave trade between the 16th and 19th centuries, it can also be used to refer to descendants of Africans who voluntarily immigrated to other parts of the world. Do not conflate with Black LGBTQ+ people or African American LGBTQ+ people. Follow the individual's preference whenever possible."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas LGBTQ+ de ascendencia africana nativa que viven fuera del continente africano. Si bien este término se utiliza comúnmente para describir a quienes descienden de personas africanas que fueron esclavizadas y forzosamente transportadas a América a través de la trata transatlántica de esclavos entre los siglos XVI y XIX, también se puede utilizar para referirse quienes descienden de personas africanas que emigraron voluntariamente a otras partes del mundo. No lo combine ni confunda con personas negras LGBTQ+ o personas afroamericanas LGBTQ+. Siga las preferencias de la persona siempre que sea posible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-personen van oorspronkelijk Afrikaanse afkomst die buiten het Afrikaanse continent wonen. Hoewel deze term vaak wordt gebruikt om nazaten te beschrijven van Afrikanen die tot slaaf werden gemaakt en gedwongen naar het Amerikaanse continent werden vervoerd via de transatlantische slavenhandel tussen de 16e en 19e eeuw, kan het ook worden gebruikt om te verwijzen naar nazaten van Afrikanen die vrijwillig naar andere delen van de wereld emigreerden. Niet verwarren met zwarte LHBTQ+-personen of Afrikaans-........ LHBTQ+-personen. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hbtq+-personer av ursprung från den afrikanska kontinenten som lever utanför Afrika. Termen används ofta för att beskriva ättlingar till afrikaner som förslavades och fördes till Amerika under den transatlantiska slavhandeln (1500–1800-talet), men kan också avse ättlingar till personer som frivilligt utvandrade. Blanda inte ihop med svarta hbtq+-personer eller afroamerikanska hbtq+-personer. Följ individens egen preferens när det är möjligt."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002333"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-11-15"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002338","dc:identifier":"homoit0002338","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual fathers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Väter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres bisexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele vaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella pappor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual dads"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bi-Väter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás bisexuales"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella fäder"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual people who are fathers."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Personen, die Väter sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales que son padres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele personen die vader zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer som är pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002337"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002339","dc:identifier":"homoit0002339","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay fathers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Väter"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homovaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögpappor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay dads"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Papas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögfäder"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gaypappor"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gayfäder"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella män som är pappor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Männer, die Väter sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die vader zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002337"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002340","dc:identifier":"homoit0002340","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian fathers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska pappor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian dads"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás lesbianos"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres lesbiana"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres lesbianxs"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás lesbianxs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska fäder"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who are fathers. This includes non-binary people who have children and identify as fathers, as well as trans women who had children before transitioning and still identify as fathers to those children. Do not use to describe lesbian parents unless they self-identify as fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que son padres. Esto incluye a las personas no binarias que tienen hijos y se autoidentifican como padres, así como a las mujeres trans que tuvieron hijos antes de transicionar y aún se autoidentifican como padres de esos niños. No debe utilizarse para describir a padres lesbianos a menos que se autoidentifiquen como padres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die vader zijn. Dit omvat non-binaire personen die kinderen hebben en zich identificeren als vaders, evenals transvrouwen die kinderen hadden voor de transitie en zich nog steeds identificeren als vaders voor die kinderen. Niet gebruiken om lesbische ouders te beschrijven, tenzij ze zichzelf identificeren als vaders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som är pappor. Detta inkluderar ickebinära personer och transkvinnor som har barn och som själva identifierar sig som pappor. Används endast för föräldrar som själva identifierar sig så."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002337"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002341","dc:identifier":"homoit0002341","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer fathers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer vaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera pappor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer dads"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás queer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera fäder"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who are fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que son padres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die vader zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som är pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002337"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002792","dc:identifier":"homoit0002792","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual fathers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres asexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Väter"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele vaders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella pappor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás asexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ace Väter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella fäder"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Asexual people who are fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas asexuales que son padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Asexuelle Personen, die Väter sind."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Aseksuele personen die vader zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Asexuella personer som är pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002337"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-28"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002766","dc:identifier":"homoit0002766","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fathers of intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de personas intersexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von inter* Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaders van intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pappor till intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de personas intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás de personas intersexuales"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás de personas intersex"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fäder till intersexpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who assume the role of father to intersex people. Only use to describe individuals who identify as fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que asumen el rol de padre de personas intersexuales. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine Vaterrolle für inter* Personen einnehmen. Zur Verwendung nur für Personen, die sich als Vater identifizieren."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die de rol van vader op zich nemen voor intersekse personen. Alleen gebruiken om personen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als vader."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har rollen som pappa till intersexpersoner. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002907","dc:identifier":"homoit0002907","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fathers of asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de personas asexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von asexuellen Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaders van aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pappor till asexuella personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás de personas asexuales"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fäder till asexuella personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who assume the role of father to asexual people. Only use to describe individuals who identify as fathers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que asumen el rol de padre de personas asexuales. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifiquen como padres."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine Vaterrolle für asexuelle Personen einnehmen. Zur Verwendung nur für Personen, die sich als Vater identifizieren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har rollen som pappa till asexuella personer. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003406","dc:identifier":"homoit0003406","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fathers of non-binary people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von nichtbinären Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de personas no binarixs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vaders van non-binaire personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pappor till ickebinära"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fathers of nonbinary people"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von nichtbinären Personen"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Väter von non-binären Personen"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Papás de personas no binarias"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Padres de personas no binarias"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fäder till ickebinära"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who assume the role of father to non-binary people. Only use to describe individuals who identify as fathers."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Personen, die eine Vaterrolle für nichtbinäre Personen einnehmen. Zur Verwendung nur für Personen, die sich als Vater identifizieren."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas que asumen el rol de padre de personas no binarias. Utilícese únicamente para describir a personas que se autoidentifican como padres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die de rol van vader op zich nemen voor non-binaire personen. Wordt alleen gebruikt om personen te beschrijven die zich identificeren als vaders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som har rollen som pappa till ickebinära personer. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som pappor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002342"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-07-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002344","dc:identifier":"homoit0002344","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual mothers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Mütter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres bisexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele moeders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella mammor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual moms"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bi-Mütter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mamás bisexuales"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella mödrar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual people who are mothers."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Bisexuelle Personen, die Mütter sind."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas bisexuales que son madres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele personen die moeder zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer som är mammor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002343"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002345","dc:identifier":"homoit0002345","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay mothers"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Mütter"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomoeders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögmammor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay moms"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Mamas"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mamás gay"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomama's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögmödrar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga mammor"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuella manliga mödrar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who are mothers. This includes trans men who had children before transitioning and still identify as mothers to those children. Do not use to describe gay parents unless they self-identify as mothers."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Homosexuelle Männer, die Mütter sind. Dazu gehören auch Transmänner, die vor ihrer Transition Kinder hatten und sich gegenüber diesen Kindern weiterhin als Mütter identifizieren. Nicht zur Beschreibung homosexueller Eltern zu verwenden, es sei denn, diese identifizieren sich selbst als Mütter."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hombres gay que son madres. Esto incluye a hombres trans que tuvieron hijos antes de su transición y aún se identifican como madres de esos niños. No se debe utilizar para describir a padres gay a menos que se autoidentifiquen como madres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die moeder zijn. Dit geldt ook voor transmannen die kinderen hadden voor de transitie en die zich nog steeds identificeren als moeders voor die kinderen. Niet gebruiken om homo-ouders te beschrijven, tenzij ze zichzelf identificeren als moeders."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är mammor. Detta inkluderar transmän som fick barn innan de påbörjade sin transition och som fortfarande identifierar sig som mammor till sina barn. Använd inte för att beskriva homosexuella manliga föräldrar om de inte själva identifierar sig som mammor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002343"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002346","dc:identifier":"homoit0002346","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian mothers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres lesbianas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische moeders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska mammor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian moms"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mamás lesbianas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska mödrar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who are mothers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Lesbianas que son madres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die moeder zijn."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som är mammor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002343"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002347","dc:identifier":"homoit0002347","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer mothers"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres queer"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer moeders"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera mammor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer moms"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Mamás queer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera mödrar"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer people who are mothers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Personas queer que son madres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer personen die moeder zijn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queera personer som är mammor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002343"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-13"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002909","dc:identifier":"homoit0002909","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mothers of asexual people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres de personas asexuals"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Moeders van aseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mammor till asexuella personer"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Mamás de personas asexuales"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mödrar till asexuella personer"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who assumes the role of mother to an asexual person; use only for individuals who self-identify as mothers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que asume el rol de madre de una persona asexual; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como madres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die de rol van moeder op zich neemt voor een aseksueel persoon; alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als moeder."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som intar en modersroll i relation till en asexuell person. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som mammor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002348"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002962","dc:identifier":"homoit0002962","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mothers of intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres de personas intersexuales"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Moeders van intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mammor till intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"es","@value":"Mamás de personas intersex"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Madres de personas intersex"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mödrar till intersexpersoner"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who assumes the role of mother to an intersex person; use only for individuals who self-identify as mothers."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que asume el rol de madre de una persona intersexual; utilícese únicamente para personas que se autoidentifiquen como madres."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die de rol van moeder op zich neemt voor een intersekse persoon; alleen te gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf als moeder identificeren."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som intar en modersroll i relation till en intersexperson. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som mammor."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002348"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-09-29"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002765","dc:identifier":"homoit0002765","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters of intersex people"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de personas intersexuales"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter von inter* Personen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters van intersekse personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar till intersexpersoner"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas de personas intersex"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Daughters who have one or more intersex parent."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Hijas que tienen uno o más padres intersexuales."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Töchter, die mindestens einen intergeschlechtlichen Elternteil haben."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Dochters die één of meer intersekse ouders hebben."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Döttrar som har en eller flera intersexföräldrar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0002352"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000421"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-06-27"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"}