@language":"en","@value":"Cosmetics (LGBTQ)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Cosmetica en LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-cosmetica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-make-up"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Make-up (LHBTQ+)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Makeup och hbtq+-gemenskaper"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Smink och hbtq+-gemenskaper"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Makeup (hbtq+)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The relationship between LGBTQ+ communities and makeup artistry, brands, and industry. Includes discussions of makeup techniques that emerged in LGBTQ+ subcultures, the role of makeup in gender and sexual expression, and the inclusion and representation of LGBTQ+ people in the cosmetics industry."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De relatie tussen LHBTQ+-gemeenschappen en make-up kunstenaarschap, merken en industrie. Inclusief discussies over make-uptechnieken die ontstonden in LHBTQ+-subculturen, de rol van make-up in gender- en seksuele expressie, en de inclusie en representatie van LHBTQ+-personen in de cosmetica-industrie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förhållandet mellan hbtq+-grupper och makeupkonst, -varumärken och -industri. Inkluderar diskussioner om sminktekniker som uppstått i hbtq+-subkulturer, sminkets roll i köns- och sexuella uttryck, samt inkludering och representation av hbtq+-personer i kosmetikaindustrin."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003955"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003066"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003964"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-04-23"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003069","dc:identifier":"homoit0003069","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Humiliation (Erotic)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Humillación"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Vernedering (Erotisch)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förnedring (erotik)"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Erotic humiliation"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Humillación erótica"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Psychological or physical humiliation performed in order to produce erotic excitement or sexual arousal."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Humillación psicológica o física realizada con el fin de producir excitación erótica o sexual."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Psychologische of fysieke vernedering uitgevoerd om erotische opwinding of seksuele opwinding te veroorzaken."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Psykisk eller fysisk förödmjukelse som utförs i syfte att väcka erotisk upphetsning."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003069"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-18"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003081","dc:identifier":"homoit0003081","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pony play"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juego de pony"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pony spel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ponyplay"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Pony play"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The act of roleplaying as an equine, sometimes with someone acting as a trainer, handler or pet owner, for fun or erotic enjoyment."},{"@language":"es","@value":"El acto de representar un rol como un equino, a veces con una persona que actúa como entrenadora, cuidadora o dueña de una mascota, por diversión o disfrute erótico."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het spelen van een rollenspel als paard/pony, soms met iemand die optreedt als trainer, begeleider of eigenaar van het dier, voor de lol of erotisch genot."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rollspel där en person imiterar en häst, ibland med en partner som agerar tränare, ledare eller djurägare – kan utföras för nöje eller erotisk njutning."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003082"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001267"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-18"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003108","dc:identifier":"homoit0003108","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Spitting (Erotic)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Escupir (sexo)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Spugen (Erotisch)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Spott (sex)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Spitting (sex)"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Expelling spit, usually onto a person’s body or into their mouth."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Expulsar saliva, generalmente sobre el cuerpo de una persona o dentro de su boca."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het uitstoten van speeksel, meestal op het lichaam of in de mond van een persoon."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Att spotta, vanligtvis på någons kropp eller i någons mun."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003108"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003109","dc:identifier":"homoit0003109","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sounding (Erotic)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Sondeo uretral (Sexo)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sounding (Erotisch)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sounding (sex)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Juego uretral"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Insertion of rods into the urethra, usually for erotic stimulation."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Inserción de varillas en la uretra, generalmente para estimulación erótica."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het inbrengen van staven in de plasbuis, meestal voor erotische stimulatie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Införande av stavar i urinröret, vanligtvis för erotisk stimulans."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003109"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003121","dc:identifier":"homoit0003121","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Feminist sex wars"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Guerras del Sexo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Feminist Sex Wars"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Feministische seksoorlogen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexkrig"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Porn wars"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex wars"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Guerras del porno"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Guerra del sexo"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Porn wars"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Sex wars"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seksoorlogen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"De feministiska sexkrigen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Feminist Sex Wars"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A period of debates beginning in the 1970s between different schools and factions of feminist thought concerning sexual freedom, sex work, pornography, kink and sadomasochism, sex toys, butch/femme, and trans identities."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un período de debates que comenzó en la década de 1970 entre diferentes escuelas y facciones del pensamiento feminista sobre la libertad sexual, el trabajo sexual, la pornografía, el vicio y el sadomasoquismo, los juguetes sexuales, las identidades butch/femme y trans."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Debattenphase, die in den 1970er-Jahren zwischen verschiedenen Schulen und Fraktionen des feministischen Denkens begann und sich mit sexueller Freiheit, Sexarbeit, Pornografie, Kink und Sadomasochismus, Sexspielzeug, Butch/Femme und Transidentitäten befasste."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een periode van debatten die begon in de jaren 1970 tussen verschillende scholen en facties van feministisch denken over seksuele vrijheid, sekswerk, pornografie, kink en sadomasochisme, seksspeeltjes, butch/femme en transidentiteiten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En period av debatter som inleddes på 1970-talet mellan olika feministiska inriktningar kring sexuell frihet, sexarbete, pornografi, kink och sadomasochism, sexleksaker, butch/femme och transidentiteter."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003121"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003127","dc:identifier":"homoit0003127","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cum shots"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Cum Shot"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Corrida (pornografía)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Cum shots"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cum shot"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cash shots"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Money shots"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Money shot"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Cum shot"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Money shot"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Depictions of ejaculation, especially onto another person and especially in the context of pornography."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Die Darstellung einer Ejakulation, insbesondere auf eine andere Person, vor allem im Kontext von Pornografie."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La representación de la eyaculación, especialmente sobre otra persona, especialmente en el contexto de la pornografía."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afbeeldingen van ejaculatie, vooral op een andere persoon, voornamelijk in de context van pornografie."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skildring av ejakulation, särskilt när den riktas mot en annan person, ofta i pornografiska sammanhang."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003127"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003135","dc:identifier":"homoit0003135","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ashing (Erotic)"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ashing"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Juego con cenizas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Verassen (Erotisch)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ashing"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Ash play"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ashplay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ash-Play"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ash play"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ashing"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mänsklig askkopp"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Applying cigar or cigarette ash to someone's mouth or body. "},{"@language":"de","@value":"Zigarren- oder Zigarettenasche auf den Mund oder Körper einer Person auftragen."},{"@language":"es","@value":"La aplicación de ceniza de cigarro o cigarrillo en la boca o el cuerpo de alguien."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"As van een sigaar of sigaret op iemands mond of lichaam aanbrengen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Att applicera cigarr- eller cigarettaska på någons mun eller kropp."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003135"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-12-20"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003147","dc:identifier":"homoit0003147","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Discipline (Erotic)"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Disciplina"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Disziplinierung"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Discipline (Erotisch)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Disciplin (erotik)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A variety of practices where someone in a dominant role sets rules for someone in a submissive role that they are expected to obey and the dominant administers punishments, corrections, or rewards."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una variedad de prácticas en las que alguien en un rol dominante establece reglas para alguien en un rol sumiso que se espera que obedezca y la persona en el rol dominante administra castigos, correcciones o recompensas."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Eine Vielzahl von Praktiken, bei denen eine Person in einer dominanten Rolle Regeln für eine Person in einer unterwürfigen Rolle festlegt, die diese zu befolgen hat, und die dominante Person Strafen, Korrekturen oder Belohnungen verhängt."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Diverse praktijken waarbij iemand in een dominante rol regels opstelt voor iemand in een onderdanige rol die deze moet gehoorzamen en waarbij de dominante straffen, correcties of beloningen uitdeelt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En rad praktiker där en person i en dominant roll fastställer regler för en person i en undergiven roll som förväntas följa dem, och där den dominanta personen utdelar bestraffningar, tillrättavisningar eller belöningar."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003147"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-02"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003159","dc:identifier":"homoit0003159","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"LGBTQ+ country music"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Música country LGBTQ+"},{"@language":"ja","@value":"LGBTQ+ のカントリー・ミュージック"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"LHBTQ+-countrymuziek"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Countrymusik (hbtq+)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"es","@value":"Música campirana LGBTQ+"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Music expressing a LGBTQ+ sensibility, produced within the larger country genre since the 1930s."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Música que expresa una sensibilidad LGBTQ+, producida dentro del género musical del más amplio del country desde la década de 1930."},{"@language":"ja","@value":"1930年代以降、カントリーという広範なジャンルの中で制作されてきた、LGBTQ+の感性を表現した音楽。"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Muziek die een LHBTQ+-sensibiliteit uitdrukt, geproduceerd binnen het grotere countrygenre sinds de jaren dertig."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Musik inom countrygenren som uttrycker hbtq+-erfarenheter och perspektiv och som har producerats sedan 1930-talet."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003610"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-09"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003175","dc:identifier":"homoit0003175","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transfeminists"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Transfeministas"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transfeministen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transfeminister"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A person who is part of or subscribes to beliefs developed as part of a movement by and for trans women who view the liberation of trans women as essential to the liberation of all women. Use when resources are about transfeminists or when an individual identifies as such."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Una persona que forma parte de o se suscribe a creencias desarrolladas como parte de un movimiento por y para las mujeres trans, que ven la liberación de las mujeres trans como esencial para la liberación de todas las mujeres. Utilícese cuando los recursos sean sobre transfeministas o cuando una persona se identifique como tal."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een persoon die deel uitmaakt van of aanhanger is van overtuigingen die zijn ontwikkeld als onderdeel van een beweging door en voor transvrouwen die de bevrijding van transvrouwen zien als essentieel voor de bevrijding van alle vrouwen. Gebruik wanneer bronnen over transfeministen gaan of wanneer een persoon zich als zodanig identificeert."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En person som tillhör eller identifierar sig med idéer från en rörelse av och för transkvinnor som ser transkvinnors frigörelse som avgörande för alla kvinnors frigörelse. Används när material handlar om transfeminister eller när en individ identifierar sig som sådan."}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003175"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-11"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003766","dc:identifier":"homoit0003766","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"SWERFs"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"SWERF's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"SWERF"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work exclusionary radical feminists"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex worker exclusionary radical feminists"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerkers-uitsluitende radicale feministen"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"SWERFs"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"An acronym for \"sex work-exclusionary radical feminists,\" this term refers to people who subscribe to a subset of radical feminism that rejects sex worker rights and solidarity with sex workers under the belief that sex work is antithetical to their ideology and inherently perpetuates oppression against women."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De term is een afkorting voor 'sex work-exclusionary radical feminists' (radicale feministen die sekswerk uitsluiten). Deze term verwijst naar mensen die zich aansluiten bij een subgroep van radicaal feminisme die de rechten van sekswerkers en solidariteit met sekswerkers verwerpt, omdat ze ervan overtuigd zijn dat sekswerk rechtstreeks in strijd is met feministische waarden en inherent de onderdrukking van vrouwen in stand houdt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En akronym för ”sex work-exclusionary radical feminists”, en benämning på personer som tillhör en gren av radikalfeminism som avvisar sexarbetares rättigheter och solidaritet med sexarbetare, utifrån övertygelsen att sexarbete strider mot deras ideologi och i grunden upprätthåller kvinnoförtryck."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003177"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003765"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000439"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003180","dc:identifier":"homoit0003180","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay urban fantasy fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción fantástica urbana gay"},{"@language":"de","@value":"Schwule Urban Fantasy"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homo-urban fantasy"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Urban fantasy om bögar"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Urban fantasy om homosexuella män"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Subgenre of fantasy fiction, written works that depicts magical, fantastical, and/or supernatural elements in contemporary urban settings. Use for urban fantasy fiction focusing on gay characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un subgénero de ficción fantástica que presenta a criaturas mágicas y sobrenaturales en entornos urbanos contemporáneos; utilícese para la fantasía urbana centrada en temas o personajes masculinos gay."},{"@language":"de","@value":"Ein Subgenre der Fantasy, in dem Magie und übernatürliche Kreaturen in zeitgenössischen urbanen Umgebungen vorkommen; für Urban Fantasy verwenden, die sich auf schwule Charaktere oder Themen konzentriert."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een subgenre van fantasy met magische en bovennatuurlijke wezens in een hedendaagse stedelijke omgeving; te gebruiken voor urban fantasy gericht op homopersonages of -thema's."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En subgenre inom fantasy med magi och övernaturliga varelser i nutida urbana miljöer. Används för urban fantasy med bögar som karaktärer eller teman."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003179"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0001345"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-01-18"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003181","dc:identifier":"homoit0003181","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian urban fantasy fiction"},{"@language":"es","@value":"Ficción fantástica urbana lésbica"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische urban fantasy"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk urban fantasy"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Subgenre of fantasy fiction, written works that depicts magical, fantastical, and/or supernatural elements in contemporary urban settings. Use for urban fantasy fiction focusing on lesbian characters or themes."},{"@language":"es","@value":"Un subgénero de la ficción fantástica que presenta criaturas mágicas y sobrenaturales en entornos urbanos contemporáneos; utilícese para la fantasía urbana centrada en personajes o temas lésbicos."},{"@langu