skohandel för tvångsarbete"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Two-Spirit survivors of labour trafficking"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit survivors of labor trafficking"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited survivors of labor trafficking"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited survivors of labor trafficking"},{"@language":"en","@value":"2S survivors of labor trafficking"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit labor trafficking survivors"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit people who have experienced and survived labor trafficking. Follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit people die arbeidshandel hebben meegemaakt en overleefd; volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor 'slachtoffers' of 'overlevenden'."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-personer som har upplevt och överlevt människohandel i form av arbetskraftsexploatering. Följ individens eget språkbruk om de föredrar ”offer” eller ”överlevare”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003756"},"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003755"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000560"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003769","dc:identifier":"homoit0003769","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cam models"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Cam models"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cam-modeller"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Webcam models"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cammodels"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Webcam models"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Webcam-modellen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Short for \"webcam models,\" this term refers to sex workers who exchange sexual services, performances, or companionship via online video calls and livestreams. "},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afkorting voor 'webcammodellen', sekswerkers die seksuele diensten, optredens of gezelschap uitwisselen via online videogesprekken en livestreams."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förkortning för ”webcam-modeller”, en term som refererar till sexarbetare som erbjuder sexuella handlingar, framträdanden eller sällskap via onlinevideosamtal och livestreaming."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003770"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003771"}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003768"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2022006806"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003793","dc:identifier":"homoit0003793","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sugar babies"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Suikerbaby's"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sugarbabies"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who provide companionship and sexual services to sugar mamas or daddies in exchange for money, gifts, and other material benefits."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die gezelschap en seksuele diensten verlenen aan sugar mama's of sugar daddy's in ruil voor geld, cadeaus en andere materiële voordelen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som erbjuder sällskap och sexuella handlingar till sugarmamas eller sugardaddies i utbyte mot pengar, gåvor och andra materiella förmåner."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003792"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003794"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003795"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003777","dc:identifier":"homoit0003777","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work abolition"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afschaffing van sekswerk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avskaffande av sexarbete och prostitution"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Abolition movement (Sex work)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work abolitionism"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work abolition movement"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Abolitiebeweging (Sekswerk)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerk abolitiebeweging"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerk abolitionisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avskaffande av sexarbete"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avskaffande av prostitution"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A movement to abolish sex work through a variety of different means, including supporting \"end demand\" laws, the Nordic model, or the broader criminalization of sex work; organizing and speaking vocally against sex work as inherently exploitative; and rejecting efforts to recognize sex work as labor."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een beweging om sekswerk af te schaffen door middel van verschillende middelen, waaronder het steunen van 'end demand'-wetten, het Scandinavische model of de bredere criminalisering van sekswerk; het organiseren en uitspreken tegen sekswerk als inherent uitbuitend; en het verwerpen van pogingen om sekswerk te erkennen als arbeid."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En rörelse som vill avskaffa sexarbete och/eller prostitution genom olika medel, inklusive att stödja lagar för att minska efterfrågan, de nordiska sexköpslagarna eller mer långtgående kriminalisering av sexarbete och/eller prostitution. Den organiserar sig kring och uttrycker motstånd mot sexarbete och/eller prostitution som något i grunden exploaterande och avvisar synen på sexarbete som arbete."}],"skos:narrower":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003776"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003773"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003774"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003765"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003775"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003777"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003770","dc:identifier":"homoit0003770","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Camboys"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Camboys"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Camboys"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cam boys"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Webcam boys"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Webcam boys"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Short for \"webcam boys,\" this term refers to men sex workers who exchange sexual services, performances, or companionship via online video calls and livestreams. Use only for individuals who self-identify as camboys; otherwise, use \"Cam models.\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förkortning för ”webcam boys”, en term som syftar på manliga sexarbetare som erbjuder sexuella handlingar, framträdanden eller sällskap via onlinevideosamtal och livestreaming. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som camboys, annars används ”cam-modeller”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003769"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003771","dc:identifier":"homoit0003771","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Camgirls"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Camgirls"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Camgirls"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Cam girls"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Webcam girls"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Webcam girls"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Short for \"webcam girls,\" this term refers to women sex workers who exchange sexual services, performances, or companionship via online video calls and livestreams. Use only for individuals who self-identify as camgirls; otherwise, use \"Cam models.\""},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Afkorting voor \"webcam girls\", deze term verwijst naar vrouwelijke sekswerkers die seksuele diensten, optredens of gezelschap uitwisselen via online videogesprekken en livestreams. Gebruik alleen voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als camgirls; gebruik anders \"Cam models.\""},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Förkortning för ”webcam girls”, en term som syftar på kvinnliga sexarbetare som erbjuder sexuella handlingar, framträdanden eller sällskap via onlinevideosamtal och livestreaming. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som camgirls, annars används ”cam-modeller”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003769"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003758"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003775","dc:identifier":"homoit0003775","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Legalization of sex work"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Legalisering van sekswerk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Legalisering av prostitution"},{"@language":"en-gb","@value":"Legalisation of sex work"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work legalization"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Legalization of prostitution"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Prostitution legalization"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Prostitutie legalisering"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerk legalisering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Legalisering av sexarbete"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The creation of a set of laws and regulations intended to legalize the practice and solicitation of sex work, particularly street sex work and other forms of \"direct,\" visible sex work, within certain parameters. This may variously include legalizing the actions of sex workers, their clients, third parties, and/or other individuals who work in proximity to or seek to aid sex workers. Individuals operating outside of these laws and regulations remain subject to penalties."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Het creëren van een reeks wetten en regels die bedoeld zijn om de praktijk en werving van sekswerk te legaliseren, met name straatsekswerk en andere vormen van \"direct\", zichtbaar sekswerk, binnen bepaalde parameters. Dit kan op verschillende manieren het legaliseren van de acties van sekswerkers, hun cliënten, derden en/of andere personen die in de nabijheid van sekswerkers werken of sekswerkers willen helpen, omvatten. Personen die buiten deze wetten en regels opereren, blijven onderhevig aan sancties."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skapandet av en uppsättning lagar och regler som syftar till att legalisera utövandet och erbjudandet av sexuella handlingar mot ersättning – särskilt gatubaserat och annan synlig prostitution – inom vissa ramar. Det kan inkludera att legalisera sexarbetare/prostituerade, kunder, tredje parter och andra som arbetar nära eller stödjer sexarbetare och/eller prostituerade. Personer som agerar utanför regelverket kan fortfarande straffas."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003772"},"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003774"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003773"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003777"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003776","dc:identifier":"homoit0003776","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Nordic model (Sex work)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Scandinavisch model (Sekswerk)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexköpslagen"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"End demand (Sex work)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Equality model (Sex work)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Neo-abolition movement (Sex work)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nordic and Swedish model (Sex work)"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Swedish model (Sex work)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Noords en Zweeds model (Sekswerk)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Noords model (Sekswerk)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Zweeds model (Sekswerk)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A legislative approach to sex work first instituted in Sweden in 1999 and then in Norway in 2009 that centers on the criminalization of clients, third parties, and many of the ways sex workers operate. The Nordic model is a form of sex work abolition predicated on the idea that no person can consent to engage in commercial sexual services and that sex workers must therefore be educated and reformed. Sex workers and activists have heavily criticized and opposed the Nordic model."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een wetgevende benadering van sekswerk die voor het eerst in 1999 in Zweden en vervolgens in 2009 in Noorwegen werd ingesteld en die zich richt op de criminalisering van cliënten, derden en veel van de manieren waarop sekswerkers opereren. Het Noordse model is een vorm van afschaffing van sekswerk die is gebaseerd op het idee dat niemand toestemming kan geven om deel te nemen aan commerciële seksuele diensten en dat sekswerkers daarom moeten worden opgeleid en hervormd. Sekswerkers en activisten hebben het Noordse model zwaar bekritiseerd en zich ertegen verzet."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En lagstiftningsmodell för sexarbete som först infördes i Sverige 1999 och därefter i Norge 2009. Modellen fokuserar på att kriminalisera sexköpare."}],"skos:broader":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003772"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003777"}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003773"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003774"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000702"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782","dc:identifier":"homoit0003782","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Third parties (Sex work)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Derde partijen (Sekswerk)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tredjeparter (sexarbete)"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mellanled (sexarbete)"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A legal term for individuals who supervise, coordinate, assist, or facilitate sex work, either on behalf of sex workers or their clients. Third parties include managers, brothel-keepers, concierges, drivers etc."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een juridische term voor personen die toezicht houden op sekswerk, dit coördineren, assisteren of faciliteren, namens sekswerkers of hun cliënten. Derden zijn onder andere managers, bordeelhouders, conciërges, chauffeurs etc."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Term för personer som organiserar, samordnar eller på annat sätt möjliggör sexarbete. I Sverige är många sådana handlingar kriminaliserade och kan utgöra koppleri eller liknande brott."}],"skos:narrower":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003783"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003784"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003785"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003783","dc:identifier":"homoit0003783","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Madams (Sex work)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Madams (Sekswerk)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bordellmammor"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Procuresses"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hoerenwaardinnen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kopplerskor"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who mediate between sex workers and clients. This term has historically been used to describe women but can be used for individuals of any gender based on their preference. Follow the individual's preference for \"Madams,\" \"Pimps,\" or \"Sex work concierges\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die bemiddelen tussen sekswerkers en klanten. Deze term is historisch gezien gebruikt om vrouwen te beschrijven, maar kan worden gebruikt voor individuen van elk gender op basis van hun voorkeur. Volg de voorkeur van het individu voor \"Madams\", \"Pooiers\" of \"Sekswerk bemiddelaars\" waar mogelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som förmedlar kontakt mellan sexarbetare och kunder. Termen har historiskt använts för kvinnor, men kan användas för personer av alla kön baserat på deras egen benämning. Följ individens preferens för ”bordellmammor”, ”hallick” eller ”sexarbetesconcierge”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85107177"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003784","dc:identifier":"homoit0003784","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Pimps"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Pooiers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hallickar"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Procurers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kopplare"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who mediate between sex workers and clients. Since the 20th century, this term has been used as a derogatory way of describing urban, working-class Black American men, regardless of their involvement in the facilitation of sex work. While some Black Americans--including women--have embraced an evolved version of the word \"pimp,\" often stripped of its association with sex work facilitation, it still carries racist and classist connotations and should be used with caution. Follow the individual's preference for \"Pimps,\" \"Madams,\" or \"Sex work concierges\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die bemiddelen tussen sekswerkers en klanten. Volg waar mogelijk de voorkeur van het individu voor \"Pooiers\", \"Madams\" of \"Sekswerk bemiddelaars\"."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som förmedlar kontakt mellan sexarbetare och kunder. Termen har historiskt använts för män, men kan användas för personer av alla kön baserat på deras egen benämning. Följ individens preferens för ”bordellmammor”, ”hallick” eller ”sexarbetesconcierge”."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85102185"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003785","dc:identifier":"homoit0003785","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work concierges"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerk-bemiddelaars"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexarbetesconcierge"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"People who mediate between sex workers and clients. Follow the individual's preference for \"Sex work concierges,\" \"Pimps,\" or \"Madams\" whenever possible."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Personen die bemiddelen tussen sekswerkers en klanten. Volg de voorkeur van het individu voor \"Sekswerker bemiddelaars\", \"Pooiers\" of \"Madams\" waar mogelijk."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Personer som agerar mellanhand mellan sexarbetare och/eller personer i prostitution och klienter. Följ individens eget språkbruk om de föredrar termen sexarbetesconcierge, hallick eller bordellmamma. Sexarbetesconcierge används inte i en svensk kontext."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003782"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003786","dc:identifier":"homoit0003786","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-sex worker discrimination"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anti-sekswerker discriminatie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Diskriminering av sexarbetare"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Discrimination against sex workers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti sex worker discrimination"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti-prostitute discrimination"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Anti prostitute discrimination"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Discrimination against prostitutes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Discriminatie van sekswerkers"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Anti-semitisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Diskriminering av prostituerade"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The unjust or prejudicial treatment of sex workers due to their work or identity as a sex worker; may include the denial of legal rights, employment, and housing."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"De onrechtvaardige of bevooroordeelde behandeling van sekswerkers vanwege hun werk of identiteit als sekswerker; kan inhouden dat hen wettelijke rechten, werkgelegenheid en huisvesting worden ontzegd."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Systematiskt orättvist eller fördomsfull behandling av sexarbetare och/eller personer i prostitution på grund av att de säljer sexuella handlingar eller att de identifierat sig som sexarbetare. Diskrimineringen kan ta sig uttryck i begränsad tillgång till arbete, bostad eller rättsligt erkännande. Inkluderar diskriminering av personer i prostitution."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003787"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003788"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003786"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003789","dc:identifier":"homoit0003789","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Harm reduction (Sex work)"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Schadebeperking (Sekswerk)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skademinimering (sexarbete)"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A set of practical strategies and ideas aimed at reducing the negative impacts of sex work on sex workers, as well as a social justice movement advocating for the rights of sex workers."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Een reeks praktische strategieën en ideeën gericht op het verminderen van de negatieve gevolgen van sekswerk voor sekswerkers, evenals een sociale rechtvaardigheidsbeweging die opkomt voor de rechten van sekswerkers."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En uppsättning praktiska strategier och idéer för att minska de negativa konsekvenserna av sexarbete för sexarbetare samt en social rättviserörelse som förespråkar sexarbetares rättigheter."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003790"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003791"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003789"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003790","dc:identifier":"homoit0003790","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex worker rights"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rechten van sekswerkers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rättigheter för sexarbetare och personer i prostitution"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex workers' rights"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rights of sex workers"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Prostitute rights"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Prostitutes' rights"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Rights of prostitutes"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Rechten van prostitué(e)s"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerkersrechten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rättigheter för sexarbetare"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rättigheter för personer i prostitution"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Legal, social, or ethical principles of freedom or entitlement held by or pursued by sex workers. This includes, but is not limited to, human rights, health rights, freedom from discrimination and prejudice, and labor rights."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Juridische, sociale of ethische principes van vrijheid of recht die sekswerkers hebben of nastreven. Dit omvat, maar is niet beperkt tot, mensenrechten, gezondheidsrechten, vrijheid van discriminatie en vooroordelen en arbeidsrechten."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Juridiska, sociala eller etiska principer om frihet eller rättigheter för sexarbetare och/eller personer i prostitution. Det inkluderar bland annat mänskliga rättigheter, rätt till sjukvård, skydd mot diskriminering och fördomar samt arbetsrätt."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003789"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003791"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003790"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003791","dc:identifier":"homoit0003791","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex work activism"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Sekswerk activisme"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sexarbetesaktivism"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Prostitution activism"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Direct action and organizing to achieve political or social change and acceptance for sex workers."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Directe actie en organisatie om politieke of sociale verandering en acceptatie voor sekswerkers te bewerkstelligen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Direktaktion och organisering i syfte att uppnå politisk eller social förändring och acceptans för sexarbetare."}],"skos:related":[{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003790"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003789"}],"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003791"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003800","dc:identifier":"homoit0003800","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex drive-ins"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Seks drive-ins"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sex-drive-ins"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Sex boxes"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Partitioned car garages found in a few countries in Europe that are designed to allow and facilitate sex work in cars. Sex drive-ins are often created by local authorities to help regulate where sex work occurs."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedeelde autogarages die in een paar landen in Europa te vinden zijn en die zijn ontworpen om sekswerk in auto's toe te staan ​​en te faciliteren. Sex drive-ins worden vaak door lokale autoriteiten gecreëerd om te helpen reguleren waar sekswerk plaatsvindt."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Avgränsade bilgarage som finns i vissa europeiska länder, t.ex. Tyskland och Schweiz, och är utformade för att möjliggöra och underlätta sexarbete i bilar. Dessa sex-drive-ins skapas ofta av lokala myndigheter för att reglera var sexarbete får förekomma."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003799"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003803","dc:identifier":"homoit0003803","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische pornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk pornografi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbisk porr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flatporr"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring lesbian performers and/or made for lesbians."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal waarop expliciet seksuele handelingen worden afgebeeld. Te gebruiken in verwijzing naar pornografie met lesbische performers en/of gemaakt voor lesbische vrouwen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med lesbiska medverkande och/eller producerad för en lesbisk publik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2019103063"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003804","dc:identifier":"homoit0003804","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homopornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögpornografi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögporr"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Homosexuell manlig pornografi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring gay performers and/or made for gay men."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal waarop expliciet seksuele handelingen worden afgebeeld. Te gebruiken in verwijzing naar pornografie met homo-performers en/of gemaakt voor homomannen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med bögar som medverkande och/eller producerad för bögar."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2011000434"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003805","dc:identifier":"homoit0003805","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele pornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuell pornografi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring bisexual performers and/or made for bisexual people."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal waarop expliciet seksuele handelingen worden afgebeeld. Te gebruiken in verwijzing naar pornografie met biseksuele artiesten en/of gemaakt voor biseksuele personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med bisexuella medverkande och/eller producerad för en bisexuell publik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003806","dc:identifier":"homoit0003806","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Transgender pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Transgender pornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transporrnografi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Trans pornography"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Transporr"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring transgender performers and/or made for transgender people."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal dat expliciet seksuele handelingen afbeeldt. Gebruik in verwijzing naar pornografie met transgender performers en/of gemaakt voor transgender personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med medverkande transpersoner och/eller producerad för en transpublik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003807","dc:identifier":"homoit0003807","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Queer pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Queer pornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Queer pornografi"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring queer performers and/or made for queer people."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal waarop expliciet seksuele handelingen worden afgebeeld. Te gebruiken in verwijzing naar pornografie met queer artiesten en/of gemaakt voor queer personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med queera medverkande och/eller producerad för en queer publik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003808","dc:identifier":"homoit0003808","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Intersex pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Intersekse pornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexpornografi"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Intersexporr"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring intersex performers and/or made for intersex people."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal waarop expliciet seksuele handelingen worden afgebeeld. Te gebruiken in verwijzing naar pornografie met intersekse performers en/of gemaakt voor intersekse personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med intersexpersoner som medverkande och/eller producerad för en intersexpublik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003809","dc:identifier":"homoit0003809","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Non-binary pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Non-binaire pornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ickebinär pornografi"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Nonbinary pornography"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring non-binary performers and/or made for non-binary people."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal waarop expliciet seksuele handelingen worden afgebeeld. Te gebruiken in verwijzing naar pornografie met non-binaire performers en/of gemaakt voor non-binaire-personen."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med medverkande ickebinära personer och/eller producerad för en ickebinär publik."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000011"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003810","dc:identifier":"homoit0003810","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirit pornography"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Two-Spirit pornografie"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Two-spirit-pornografi"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"2S pornography"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two-Spirited pornography"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirited pornography"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Two Spirit pornography"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Printed or visual materials that explicitly depict sexual acts. Use in reference to pornography featuring Two-Spirit performers and/or made for Two-Spirit people."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Gedrukt of visueel materiaal dat expliciet seksuele handelingen afbeeldt of beschrijft. Gebruik om te verwijzen naar pornografie met Two-Spirit people en/of gemaakt voor Two-Spirit people."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tryckt eller visuellt material som explicit skildrar sexuella handlingar. Används för att referera till pornografi med medverkande Two-spirit-personer och/eller producerad för en Two-spirit-publik."}],"skos:related":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003802"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003810"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-10-30"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003828","dc:identifier":"homoit0003828","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic American lesbians"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic-Amerikaanse lesbische vrouwen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska hispanoamerikaner"}],"skos:altLabel":{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbian Hispanic Americans"},"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Lesbians who were born in or currently reside in the United States and are descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic American; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Lesbische vrouwen die geboren zijn in of momenteel wonen in de Verenigde Staten en afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger gekoloniseerd werden door Spanje en voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic American; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lesbiska som är födda i eller bosatta i USA och som härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanoamerikaner och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003827"},"skos:exactMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh91001711"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003829","dc:identifier":"homoit0003829","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic American gay men"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic-Amerikaanse homomannen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är hispanoamerikaner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Hispanic Americans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay Hispanic American men"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gay men who were born in or currently reside in the United States and are descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic American; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Homomannen die geboren zijn in of momenteel wonen in de Verenigde Staten en afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje gekoloniseerd werden en voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic American; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bögar som är födda i eller bosatta i USA och som härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanoamerikaner och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003827"},"skos:closeMatch":{"@id":"http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh91001710"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2024-12-12"},"dc:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-30"},"@type":"skos:Concept","skos:inScheme":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5"},"skos:changeNote":"Version 5.0.0"},{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003830","dc:identifier":"homoit0003830","skos:prefLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Hispanic American bisexual people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic-Amerikaanse biseksuele personen"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella hispanoamerikaner"}],"skos:altLabel":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual Hispanic Americans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual Hispanic American people"},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Hispanic-Amerikaanse biseksuelen"}],"rdfs:comment":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bisexual people who were born in or currently reside in the United States and are descended from Spain or other regions formerly colonized by Spain that are primarily Spanish-speaking. Only use for individuals who self-identify as Hispanic American; do not conflate with Latino/a/x or Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"nl","@value":"Biseksuele personen die geboren zijn in of momenteel wonen in de Verenigde Staten en afstammen van Spanje of andere regio's die vroeger door Spanje gekoloniseerd werden en voornamelijk Spaanstalig zijn. Alleen gebruiken voor personen die zichzelf identificeren als Hispanic American; niet verwarren met Latino/a/x of Chicano/a/x."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bisexuella personer som är födda i eller bosatta i USA och som härstammar från Spanien eller andra regioner som tidigare varit under spanskt kolonialt styre och där spanska är det dominerande språket. Används endast för personer som själva identifierar sig som hispanoamerikaner och ska inte sammanblandas med latino/a/x eller chicano/a/x."}],"skos:broader":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0003827"},"skos:hasTopConcept":{"@id":"https://homosaurus.org/v5/homoit0000915"},"dc:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dat